  ('725062484364896090', 'Mexico 2000', 1983, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Rogelio A. González, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Jesús Salinas, Adolfo Torres Portillo, Héctor Lechuga', 'Jesús Salinas, Héctor Lechuga, Rojo Grau, Elizabeth Aguilar, Miguel Gurza, Humberto Gurza, Dora Elsa Olea, Arturo Adonay', null, 'In Olympus the Gods decide to exterminate humanity, after deliberating one of the gods advocates not to exterminate those who live in Mexico, which in the year 2000 is a paradise where all calamities have been extinguished.', 'In Olympus the Gods decide to exterminate humanity, after deliberating one of the gods advocates not to exterminate those who live in Mexico, which in the year 2000 is a paradise where all calamities have been extinguished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDCI5rqzJqifbDBWLdRmfAFu69R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322322'),
