  ('928982233590802609', 'Mezzo Forte', 2000, 'Animation, Action, Thriller', 'Yasuomi Umetsu, Yasuomi Umetsu, Keizo Kusakawa', 'Yasuomi Umetsu', 'Tomoko Kotani, Taichiro Hirokawa, Takumi Yamazaki, Rie Ishizuka, Shozo Iizuka, Norio Wakamoto', 'NR', 'The target of hitgirl Mikura is a wealthy baseball team owner, but he turns out to be a powerful underworld boss. Mikura and her team are beset by countless heavily armed bodyguards and the boss'' vicious daughter.', 'The target of hitgirl Mikura is a wealthy baseball team owner, but he turns out to be a powerful underworld boss. Mikura and her team are beset by countless heavily armed bodyguards and the boss'' vicious daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8VfbivexOy6ZUZTrqZsHz2vRPU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55892'),
  ('27708269962853169', 'MFKZ', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Action, Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Shojiro Nishimi, Guillaume Renard, Takuma Sakamoto', 'Guillaume Renard, Bennett Abara', 'Orelsan, Gringe, Redouanne Harjane, Féodor Atkine, Kelly Marot, Julien Kramer, Emmanuel Karsen, Gilbert Lévy', 'R', 'Angelino is just one of thousands of deadbeats living in Dark Meat City. But an otherwise unremarkable scooter accident caused by a beautiful, mysterious stranger is about to transform his life... into a waking nightmare! He starts seeing monstrous forms prowling around all over the city... Is Angelino losing his mind, or could an alien invasion really be happening this quietly...?', 'Angelino is just one of thousands of deadbeats living in Dark Meat City. But an otherwise unremarkable scooter accident caused by a beautiful, mysterious stranger is about to transform his life... into a waking nightmare! He starts seeing monstrous forms prowling around all over the city... Is Angelino losing his mind, or could an alien invasion really be happening this quietly...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSMIKsznGYzGfdl611kgEJF889.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461615'),
