  ('1049718171969647276', 'Mi fido di te', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Venier', 'Claudio Corbucci, Ale, Mauro Spinelli', 'Ale, Franz, Maddalena Maggi, Lucia Ocone, Roberto Citran, Ernesto Mahieux, Alessandro Betti, Paolo Pierobon', null, 'Two different men living in Milan lose their job at the same time. They will become a funny couple of thieves thanks to the poorest of them that was already a thief.', 'Two different men living in Milan lose their job at the same time. They will become a funny couple of thieves thanks to the poorest of them that was already a thief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kf680Nax0ZfvmgkeTBIl8LXZjUH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56972'),
  ('1010613771707694293', 'Mi Iubita, Mon Amour', 2022, 'Drama', 'Noémie Merlant, Evgenia Alexandrova', 'Noémie Merlant, Gimi-Nicolae Covaci', 'Noémie Merlant, Gimi-Nicolae Covaci, Clara Lama-Schmit, Sanda Codreanu, Alexia Lefaix, Kita Covaci, Jean Covaci, Giani Covaci', null, 'Jeanne is traveling to Romania to celebrate her bachelorette party with her friends when she meets Nino and his family. They are worlds away from one another, yet for the two of them it is the beginning of a passionate and timeless summer.', 'Jeanne is traveling to Romania to celebrate her bachelorette party with her friends when she meets Nino and his family. They are worlds away from one another, yet for the two of them it is the beginning of a passionate and timeless summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oER6ywa42pEx102TgGJynYEfRXd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835970'),
  ('2558963371486185', 'Mi Maestra se comió a mi amigo', 2023, 'Adventure, Horror, Comedy, Family', 'Jose Sierra, Erwin Jaquez', 'Ricardo Avilés', 'Ilse Salas, José María Nieto, Ana Paula del Moral, Santiago Aray, Sophie Alexander-Katz, Eugenio Bartilotti, Juan Carlos Colombo, Claudia Álvarez', null, 'Tomás, an 11-year-old boy living in his own fantasy world, must use his vast monster knowledge to fight against his new English teacher: a wicked woman who is, in fact, a child-eating monster.', 'Tomás, an 11-year-old boy living in his own fantasy world, must use his vast monster knowledge to fight against his new English teacher: a wicked woman who is, in fact, a child-eating monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/te3xEhB257GXTaDk2UsqA3HDtvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1105283'),
  ('614500173443888833', 'Mi mejor enemigo', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alex Bowen, José María Hermo, Carolina Fuentes', 'Julio Rojas, Paula del Fierro', 'Nicolás Saavedra, Erto Pantoja, Miguel Dedovich, Jorge Román, Felipe Braun, Fernanda Urrejola, Pablo Valledor, Víctor Montero', null, 'After losing their bearings, a group of Chilean soldiers learns some lessons about their enemy''s humanity in this dark comedy set during the 1970s war between Chile and Argentina. Digging in where they are, the troop soon discovers a nearby Argentinean platoon. Unsure how to handle the situation, the two groups start passing notes via a stray dog, and eventually achieve a wary camaraderie.', 'After losing their bearings, a group of Chilean soldiers learns some lessons about their enemy''s humanity in this dark comedy set during the 1970s war between Chile and Argentina. Digging in where they are, the troop soon discovers a nearby Argentinean platoon. Unsure how to handle the situation, the two groups start passing notes via a stray dog, and eventually achieve a wary camaraderie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhOtApHWPE197cTGOkRcCdSMxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37006'),
  ('271857171650601301', 'Mi Mujer no es mi señora', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Víctor Hugo Caula, Hugo Moser', 'José P. Dominiani', 'Alberto Olmedo, Nadiuska, Joe Rígoli, Olga Zubarry, Adriana Parets, Pata Villanueva, José Calvo, Luis Corradi', null, 'Juan Carlos, a businessman, falls in love with a woman much younger than him, and ends up marrying her. Juan Carlos'' mother-in-law, following an incident with him, tells him a fabricated story: that the father of her daughter is a stranger, with whom she had sex in the car of a train. Coincidentally, this situation had happened to Juan Carlos many years ago, and now, with the doubts that his wife is his daughter, he does not even want to approach her on his wedding night.', 'Juan Carlos, a businessman, falls in love with a woman much younger than him, and ends up marrying her. Juan Carlos'' mother-in-law, following an incident with him, tells him a fabricated story: that the father of her daughter is a stranger, with whom she had sex in the car of a train. Coincidentally, this situation had happened to Juan Carlos many years ago, and now, with the doubts that his wife is his daughter, he does not even want to approach her on his wedding night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIbGibQJN8rTlCuYF14iI5hGPaN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548182'),
  ('887757484056620986', 'Mi niño Tizoc', 1972, 'Drama', 'Ismael Rodríguez', 'Ismael Rodríguez', 'Cuitláhuac Rodríguez, Noé Murayama, Aurora Clavel, Alberto Vázquez, Macaria, Sonia Amelio, Félix González, Julio Aldama', null, 'Tizoc wishes to eat a chicken by himself and have his own piñata. At Christmas his father Carmelo grants his wish.', 'Tizoc wishes to eat a chicken by himself and have his own piñata. At Christmas his father Carmelo grants his wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1EHXWveIdgvIVeROB9hb4Y5CMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286009'),
