  ('426643120742462921', 'Mi permette babbo!', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Mario Bonnard, Tino Santoni, Sergio Leone', 'Ruggero Maccari, Giovanni Grimaldi, Ettore Scola', 'Alberto Sordi, Aldo Fabrizi, Marisa de Leza, Franco Silva, Rita Giannuzzi, Sergio Raimondi, Turi Pandolfini, Achille Majeroni', null, 'While Rodolfo tries to become a lyric singer, his lifestyle deeply annoys his father-in-law.', 'While Rodolfo tries to become a lyric singer, his lifestyle deeply annoys his father-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWrTZ9oV2UzjUcipIxQxyOgjGCI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58548'),
  ('1011017757585453432', 'Mi Querido Viejo', 1991, 'Drama', 'Rafael Villaseñor Kuri, Antonio Ruiz', 'Ramón Obón', 'Vicente Fernández, Alejandro Fernández, Julieta Rossen, Manuel Ojeda, Stephanie Salas, Irma Dorantes, César Castro, Inés Murillo', null, 'Luis Fuentes, a singer of Mexican music, comes to know a journalist by the name of Maria Luisa Cortéz and fall madly in love with each other. In time, the couple gets married and come to have a son, Rafael. However, they soon divorce because of Luis''s many commitments as a singer. This strains the relationship between Luis and Maria, so much so that Maria, stung by bitterness, teaches her son to despise his father and manages to move from Mexico to the United States to keep Luis from contacting his son. Luis wants nothing more than to regain his lost relationship and affection with his beloved son. Therefore, time after time he visits Maria in hope of winning over his son''s affection with little success. Over time, Rafael, now a young man, comes to have a passion for music just like his father despite having a hatred for him.', 'Luis Fuentes, a singer of Mexican music, comes to know a journalist by the name of Maria Luisa Cortéz and fall madly in love with each other. In time, the couple gets married and come to have a son, Rafael. However, they soon divorce because of Luis''s many commitments as a singer. This strains the relationship between Luis and Maria, so much so that Maria, stung by bitterness, teaches her son to despise his father and manages to move from Mexico to the United States to keep Luis from contacting his son. Luis wants nothing more than to regain his lost relationship and affection with his beloved son. Therefore, time after time he visits Maria in hope of winning over his son''s affection with little success. Over time, Rafael, now a young man, comes to have a passion for music just like his father despite having a hatred for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZyircfxqWhyRFo9X8pd4PVCMvz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445558'),
  ('1040434423698302606', 'Mi Rifaccio Il Trullo', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Vito Cea, Blasco Giurato, Mimmo Cavallo', 'Silvio Donà, Antonio De Santis', 'Uccio De Santis, Lorena Cacciatore, Gianni Ciardo, Pietro Genuardi, Roberta Garzia, Giustina Buonomo, Giuseppe Convertini, Antonella Genga', null, 'Michele Modugno, a bricklayer from Puglia with a passion for music, lives in a large trullo with his elderly mother, his sister Melania, and his brother-in-law Sebastiano, also a bricklayer and his business partner. To pay off a bank debt, Michele rents a small seaside trullo he owns for the summer. The day before hosting tourist Giada, he receives a nasty surprise: someone has stolen the stones that form the cone from the trullo. Michele looks for other accommodations for the tourist, but ultimately is forced to take her into his own home. Living with Giada, a beautiful Milanese manager, wreaks havoc on the poor bricklayer''s life. The two, with their different personalities and lifestyles, initially clash and argue about everything. But then, slowly, they discover their attraction to each other, and a beautiful yet unlikely love story begins.', 'Michele Modugno, a bricklayer from Puglia with a passion for music, lives in a large trullo with his elderly mother, his sister Melania, and his brother-in-law Sebastiano, also a bricklayer and his business partner. To pay off a bank debt, Michele rents a small seaside trullo he owns for the summer. The day before hosting tourist Giada, he receives a nasty surprise: someone has stolen the stones that form the cone from the trullo. Michele looks for other accommodations for the tourist, but ultimately is forced to take her into his own home. Living with Giada, a beautiful Milanese manager, wreaks havoc on the poor bricklayer''s life. The two, with their different personalities and lifestyles, initially clash and argue about everything. But then, slowly, they discover their attraction to each other, and a beautiful yet unlikely love story begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WvWmXMJyZ56WipMv9mlzUO0toE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:386709'),
  ('747939919137980746', 'Mi rifaccio vivo', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Fabio Cianchetti, Sergio Rubini', 'Sergio Rubini, Carla Cavalluzzi, Umberto Marino', 'Emilio Solfrizzi, Neri Marcorè, Lillo Petrolo, Vanessa Incontrada, Sergio Rubini, Bob Messini, Enzo Iacchetti, Gianmarco Tognazzi', null, 'After spending most of his life being defeated by his rival Ottone, meek Biagio tries to commit suicide – but in the hereafter he''s offered a chance to come back to life for a week as Dennis, Ottone''s trusted business partner.', 'After spending most of his life being defeated by his rival Ottone, meek Biagio tries to commit suicide – but in the hereafter he''s offered a chance to come back to life for a week as Dennis, Ottone''s trusted business partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3PSR5b5bKL73t30KxgqOe2msCL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190627'),
  ('44504460005317749', 'Mi Vida Loca', 1994, 'Crime, Drama', 'Allison Anders, Rodrigo García', 'Allison Anders', 'Angel Aviles, Seidy López, Jacob Vargas, Devine, Monica Lutton, Marlo Marron, Nelida Lopez, Salma Hayek Pinault', 'R', 'Mousie and Sad Girl are childhood best friends in a contemporary Los Angeles poor Hispanic neighborhood. But when Sad Girl becomes pregnant by Mousie''s boyfriend, a drug dealer named Ernesto, the two become bitter enemies. While their dispute escalates towards violence, the violence of the world around them soon also impacts their lives.', 'Mousie and Sad Girl are childhood best friends in a contemporary Los Angeles poor Hispanic neighborhood. But when Sad Girl becomes pregnant by Mousie''s boyfriend, a drug dealer named Ernesto, the two become bitter enemies. While their dispute escalates towards violence, the violence of the world around them soon also impacts their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtKIaHUqkNqdgVnMFosyVJXvKMC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32325'),
  ('1012653734158989125', 'Mia', 2017, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Oriol Colomar, Albert Grabuleda, Oriol Colomar', 'Oriol Colomar, Aya Wolf', 'Aya Wolf, Oriol Colomar', null, 'Mia recounts her most intimate confessions, uncensored, in her first approach to a totally new world of domination and submission.', 'Mia recounts her most intimate confessions, uncensored, in her first approach to a totally new world of domination and submission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEmw1fZOQp2qFGdrak3ipCbe31G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537971'),
