  ('1041370254529451368', 'Mia moglie è una bestia', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Castellano, Pipolo, Alessandro Metz', 'Castellano, Pipolo', 'Massimo Boldi, Eva Grimaldi, Valeria D''Obici, Gianni Bonagura, Gianni Franco, Valerio Isidori, Mattia Sbragia, Silvia Annichiarico', null, 'Gianni (Boldi) is an ad agent from Milan vacationing in the mountains. Inside a cave he stumbles upon a cavewoman (Grimaldi) frozen intact. Of course she retained all of her young beauty and immediately Gianni is attracted to her, but after he begins thinking she is best left behind she follows him around creating havoc in his normal life. Gianni believes he can transform her into a beautiful modern day woman.', 'Gianni (Boldi) is an ad agent from Milan vacationing in the mountains. Inside a cave he stumbles upon a cavewoman (Grimaldi) frozen intact. Of course she retained all of her young beauty and immediately Gianni is attracted to her, but after he begins thinking she is best left behind she follows him around creating havoc in his normal life. Gianni believes he can transform her into a beautiful modern day woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRIYsrPKaXh9GU5op3c8lGLARo2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167509'),
  ('19408014168928564', 'Miami Beach', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Lucidi, Giorgio Melidoni', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Ricky Memphis, Max Tortora, Paola Minaccioni, Vittorio Emanuele Propizio, Giampaolo Morelli, Neva Leoni, Filippo Laganà, Alessio Del Mastro', null, 'Miami is one of the most sought by young Italians. It is there, in fact, is going to study at university Luca, a Roman, the son of John and Valentina, Milan, daughter Olivia. During the plane trip from Rome to Miami, Olivia and John argue furiously.', 'Miami is one of the most sought by young Italians. It is there, in fact, is going to study at university Luca, a Roman, the son of John and Valentina, Milan, daughter Olivia. During the plane trip from Rome to Miami, Olivia and John argue furiously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dh1Fz8JZDaGGJjzPsv3wbuoLyV4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400123'),
  ('1023385761722599800', 'Miami Bici', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Jesús del Cerro', null, 'Ada Condeescu, Matei Dima, Codin Maticiuc, Florin Piersic Jr., Letiția Vlădescu, Amanda Tavarez, Jesús del Cerro, Shuang Hu', null, 'Miami Bici is the story of Ion and Ilie, two young people from a small dark city in Romania who go to Miami in the middle of winter, to live both the "American Dream" and the Romanian dream of "getting rich quick". Once there, they find themselves in the middle of the Machiavellian plan of Mișu, a Romanian of the lowest species, established in Florida.', 'Miami Bici is the story of Ion and Ilie, two young people from a small dark city in Romania who go to Miami in the middle of winter, to live both the "American Dream" and the Romanian dream of "getting rich quick". Once there, they find themselves in the middle of the Machiavellian plan of Mișu, a Romanian of the lowest species, established in Florida.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebbFi9j56KryfLJ3NXLwWd8mMJ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:677640'),
  ('462223824686055028', 'Miami Blues', 1990, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller, Comedy', 'George Armitage, Tak Fujimoto, Ron Bozman', 'George Armitage', 'Fred Ward, Alec Baldwin, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Nora Dunn, Charles Napier, Shirley Stoler, Bobo Lewis, Obba Babatundé', 'R', 'After Junior is released from prison, he plans on starting a new life in Miami. But when he kills a man in the airport, he flees the scene and finds Susie, a mild-mannered prostitute searching for stability. The two opposites become romantically involved, and Junior steals a badge and gun from a veteran detective. Using the officer''s identity, Junior embarks on a crime spree and convinces Susie that he is the perfect man.', 'After Junior is released from prison, he plans on starting a new life in Miami. But when he kills a man in the airport, he flees the scene and finds Susie, a mild-mannered prostitute searching for stability. The two opposites become romantically involved, and Junior steals a badge and gun from a veteran detective. Using the officer''s identity, Junior embarks on a crime spree and convinces Susie that he is the perfect man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOqOf2qG0sjsfhFdYp6SbZuorSF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14931'),
  ('1143378788641323288', 'Miami Connection', 1987, 'Action, Crime, Music', 'Y.K. Kim, Richard Park Wu-sang, Maximo Munzi', 'Joseph Diamand', 'Y.K. Kim, Vincent Hirsch, Joseph Diamand, Maurice Smith, Angelo Janotti, Kathy Collier, William Ergle, Si Y Jo', 'NR', 'In a world where ninjas dream of being rock stars and rock stars dream of being ninjas, a martial arts rock band goes up against a band of motorcycle ninjas who have tightened their grip on Florida''s narcotics trade.', 'In a world where ninjas dream of being rock stars and rock stars dream of being ninjas, a martial arts rock band goes up against a band of motorcycle ninjas who have tightened their grip on Florida''s narcotics trade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfysfJ8f1JcVVOeGQ5EZSxeSka8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59558'),
  ('155598487239076525', 'Miami Magma', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Action, TV Movie', 'Todor Chapkanov, Sarah Larson, Matthew L. Henderson', 'Declan O''Brien', 'Rachel Hunter, Brad Dourif, Stacey Asaro, Griff Furst, J.D. Evermore, Crystal Rivers, Mayra Leal, Melissa Ordway', null, 'Antoinette Vitrini, a volcanologist, confirms her theory of a long-dormant underground volcano after an offshore-drilling rig bursts into flames. Now, she must stop catastrophic amounts of magma from pumping out right under Miami, Florida.', 'Antoinette Vitrini, a volcanologist, confirms her theory of a long-dormant underground volcano after an offshore-drilling rig bursts into flames. Now, she must stop catastrophic amounts of magma from pumping out right under Miami, Florida.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNc3FLV28bGCWXxuLIFCrwcncz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86971'),
  ('833056784344995671', 'Miami Rhapsody', 1995, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Frankel, Jack Wallner', 'David Frankel', 'Sarah Jessica Parker, Gil Bellows, Antonio Banderas, Mia Farrow, Paul Mazursky, Kevin Pollak, Barbara Garrick, Carla Gugino', 'PG-13', 'Even though Gwyn Marcus is engaged to her boyfriend, Matt, she is still afraid of commitment. While she admires her parents'' loving relationship, she discovers that her family has not always been faithful in marriage, making it harder than ever to settle down. As her mother pressures her to get married, and plenty of attractive men appear in her life, Gwyn learns that she must balance her career, relationships and marriage to be truly happy.', 'Even though Gwyn Marcus is engaged to her boyfriend, Matt, she is still afraid of commitment. While she admires her parents'' loving relationship, she discovers that her family has not always been faithful in marriage, making it harder than ever to settle down. As her mother pressures her to get married, and plenty of attractive men appear in her life, Gwyn learns that she must balance her career, relationships and marriage to be truly happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joturqaJfAJ8XHPadT8kibgSpS4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17402'),
  ('769157305752772615', 'Miami Supercops', 1985, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Bruno Corbucci, Peter Gold, Silvano Ippoliti', 'Bruno Corbucci, Luciano Vincenzoni', 'Terence Hill, Bud Spencer, C.B. Seay, William ''Bo'' Jim, Ken Ceresne, Jackie Castellano, C.V. Wood Jr., Rhonda S. Lundstead', 'PG', 'In 1978, $20 million was stolen from a Detroit bank. One of the robbers was caught, one was found dead, and the third disappeared. The money was never found. Seven years later, the robber who was caught was released from jail. He immediately went to Miami, only to be found dead the next day. Now FBI agents Doug Bennet and Steve Forest have been called in to investigate the case while posing as Miami police officers. Somewhere in Miami the third robber is hiding with his $20 million, and he has a seven-year head start on the authorities.', 'In 1978, $20 million was stolen from a Detroit bank. One of the robbers was caught, one was found dead, and the third disappeared. The money was never found. Seven years later, the robber who was caught was released from jail. He immediately went to Miami, only to be found dead the next day. Now FBI agents Doug Bennet and Steve Forest have been called in to investigate the case while posing as Miami police officers. Somewhere in Miami the third robber is hiding with his $20 million, and he has a seven-year head start on the authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0zfJkOfQr4DfcxjjeCVFjirKpu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10295'),
  ('612252551445326806', 'Miami Vice', 2006, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Dion Beebe, Michael Mann, Seth Reed', 'Michael Mann', 'Colin Farrell, Jamie Foxx, Naomie Harris, Gong Li, John Ortiz, Ciarán Hinds, Justin Theroux, Barry Shabaka Henley', 'R', 'A case involving drug lords and murder in South Florida takes a personal turn for undercover detectives Sonny Crockett and Ricardo Tubbs. Unorthodox Crockett gets involved romantically with the Chinese-Cuban wife of a trafficker of arms and drugs, while Tubbs deals with an assault on those he loves.', 'A case involving drug lords and murder in South Florida takes a personal turn for undercover detectives Sonny Crockett and Ricardo Tubbs. Unorthodox Crockett gets involved romantically with the Chinese-Cuban wife of a trafficker of arms and drugs, while Tubbs deals with an assault on those he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KGD2g0wOc7WBfHc5G19reLHQxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82'),
  ('936017688075044098', 'Miami Vice: Brother''s Keeper', 1984, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Thomas Carter, Robert E. Collins, Herb Gains', 'Anthony Yerkovich', 'Don Johnson, Philip Michael Thomas, Saundra Santiago, Michael Talbott, John Diehl, Gregory Sierra, Bill Smitrovich, Belinda Montgomery', null, 'Miami detective Sonny Crockett reluctantly teams with New York City cop Rico Tubbs when both of them end up pursuing a drug dealer who killed their respective partners.', 'Miami detective Sonny Crockett reluctantly teams with New York City cop Rico Tubbs when both of them end up pursuing a drug dealer who killed their respective partners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iK5MXD5pefmg46ZY52SE97iurjn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126341'),
  ('336641715177526809', 'Miao Miao', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Cheng Hsiao-Tse, Kwan Pung-Leung, Hao Fang-wei', 'Cheng Hsiao-Tse, Yi-Fen Tsai, Jimmy Ngai Shiu-Yan', 'Sandrine Pinna, Fan Wing, Ko Chia-Yen, Wu Kang-ren, Chu Chung-heng, Michael Chang, Toyoharu Kitamura, Lee Yung-Feng', null, '18-year-old Ai loves baking, even if she''s not that good at it. She dreams of some day baking the perfect pastry, until she meets Miao Miao, a shy exchange student from Japan, who happens to be sort of a pastry expert.', '18-year-old Ai loves baking, even if she''s not that good at it. She dreams of some day baking the perfect pastry, until she meets Miao Miao, a shy exchange student from Japan, who happens to be sort of a pastry expert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMpaCG3Xal21qiPfkGmLKDMy9ix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35452'),
  ('255366852022165620', 'Mice Follies', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, null, 'NR', 'Jerry and his diapered little mouse friend flood the kitchen, then use the freezer to turn it into a skating rink. Even though Tom finds a pair of ice skates, the mice have no problem outmaneuvering him.', 'Jerry and his diapered little mouse friend flood the kitchen, then use the freezer to turn it into a skating rink. Even though Tom finds a pair of ice skates, the mice have no problem outmaneuvering him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79wOHi5fw1MDAbhdVz0CHYvmMsa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73627'),
  ('767549150709799649', 'Micha denkt groß', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Lars Jessen, Jan Georg Schütte, Moritz Schultheiß', 'Lars Jessen, Charly Hübner, Jan Georg Schütte', 'Charly Hübner, Jördis Triebel, Ulrich Brandhoff, Peter Kurth, Natalia Rudziewicz, Annett Sawallisch, Jan Georg Schütte, Bärbel Schwarz', null, 'It''s a hot, dry summer in Klein-Schappleben. Micha, a pretentious video game designer, wants to turn his late parents'' dilapidated guesthouse into a luxury hotel with a wellness oasis. The villagers are skeptical, even though Micha loudly promises new jobs and prosperity. But his plans start to falter when the groundwater in the village dries up.', 'It''s a hot, dry summer in Klein-Schappleben. Micha, a pretentious video game designer, wants to turn his late parents'' dilapidated guesthouse into a luxury hotel with a wellness oasis. The villagers are skeptical, even though Micha loudly promises new jobs and prosperity. But his plans start to falter when the groundwater in the village dries up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZArVcrdSkd024VQKDbllbPauNK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1311071'),
  ('714583879854528565', 'Michael', 1924, 'Drama, Romance', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer, Rudolph Maté, Karl Freund', 'Thea von Harbou, Carl Theodor Dreyer', 'Walter Slezak, Max Auzinger, Nora Gregor, Robert Garrison, Benjamin Christensen, Didier Aslan, Alexander Murski, Grete Mosheim', null, 'A mature and visually elegant period romance that remains one of the earliest and most compassionate overtly gay-themed films in movie history. Based upon Herman Bang''s 1902 novel, Dreyer''s Michael refashions the classical Greek myth of Jupiter and Ganymede into a love triangle between an aging artist, Zoret, his protagonist Michael, and Princess Zamikoff, an aristocratic femme fatale as entranced by Michael’s youthful beauty as Zoret is.', 'A mature and visually elegant period romance that remains one of the earliest and most compassionate overtly gay-themed films in movie history. Based upon Herman Bang''s 1902 novel, Dreyer''s Michael refashions the classical Greek myth of Jupiter and Ganymede into a love triangle between an aging artist, Zoret, his protagonist Michael, and Princess Zamikoff, an aristocratic femme fatale as entranced by Michael’s youthful beauty as Zoret is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wGClFQM5LmbGSZb7yTa1qP9oW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55587'),
  ('546660879325581787', 'Michael', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Nora Ephron, John Lindley, Keith Neely', 'Jim Quinlan, Delia Ephron, Nora Ephron', 'John Travolta, Andie MacDowell, William Hurt, Bob Hoskins, Robert Pastorelli, Jean Stapleton, Teri Garr, Wallace Langham', 'PG', 'Tabloid reporters are sent by their editor to investigate after the paper recieves a letter from a woman claiming an angel is living with her.', 'Tabloid reporters are sent by their editor to investigate after the paper recieves a letter from a woman claiming an angel is living with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oprNZ2BvJG9ZV2g3JYeWQgsOZHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2928'),
  ('1031631428597546056', 'Michael', 2011, 'Drama', 'Markus Schleinzer, Gerald Kerkletz, Kathrin Resetarits', 'Markus Schleinzer', 'Michael Fuith, David Rauchenberger, Christine Kain, Ursula Strauss, Victor Tremmel, Xaver Winkler, Thomas Pfalzmann, Markus Hochholdinger', null, 'Although to the outside world he seems like a perfectly normal insurance broker, Michael secretly keeps a 10-year-old boy locked in a room in his soundproof basement.', 'Although to the outside world he seems like a perfectly normal insurance broker, Michael secretly keeps a 10-year-old boy locked in a room in his soundproof basement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRNbBiC4aCTrjHNtIdd3MKt8B00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78604'),
  ('164616822831012396', 'Michael', 2026, 'Music, Drama, History', 'Dion Beebe, Antoine Fuqua, Dylan Goss', 'John Logan', 'Jaafar Jackson, Colman Domingo, Nia Long, Kendrick Sampson, Miles Teller, Juliano Krue Valdi, Joseph David-Jones, Jamal Henderson', 'PG-13', 'Discover the story of Michael Jackson, one of the most influential artists the world has ever known, and his life beyond the music, tracing his journey from the discovery of his extraordinary talent as the lead of the Jackson Five, to the visionary artist whose creative ambition fueled a relentless pursuit to become the biggest entertainer in the world, highlighting both his life off-stage and some of the most iconic performances from his early solo career.', 'Discover the story of Michael Jackson, one of the most influential artists the world has ever known, and his life beyond the music, tracing his journey from the discovery of his extraordinary talent as the lead of the Jackson Five, to the visionary artist whose creative ambition fueled a relentless pursuit to become the biggest entertainer in the world, highlighting both his life off-stage and some of the most iconic performances from his early solo career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Qud19bBUrrJAzy0Ilm8gRJlJXP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936075'),
  ('659921323180891792', 'Michael Bolton''s Big, Sexy Valentine''s Day Special', 2017, 'Comedy, Music', 'Akiva Schaffer, Scott Aukerman', 'Scott Aukerman, Zach Kanin, Mike Hanford', 'Michael Bolton, Adam Scott, Sarah Shahi, Matthew Kimbrough, Sarah Silverman, Jorma Taccone, Maya Rudolph, Fred Armisen', null, 'After Santa tells Michael Bolton that he needs 75,000 new babies by Christmas to meet toy supply, he hosts a sexy telethon to get the world to start making love.', 'After Santa tells Michael Bolton that he needs 75,000 new babies by Christmas to meet toy supply, he hosts a sexy telethon to get the world to start making love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCdFD5u8Tvwk32un1dMgidxY1oB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430780'),
  ('471178352504260203', 'Michael Che Matters', 2016, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Oz Rodríguez', 'Michael Che', 'Michael Che', null, '"SNL" star Michael Che takes on hot-button topics like inequality, homophobia and gentrification in this stand-up set filmed live in Brooklyn.', '"SNL" star Michael Che takes on hot-button topics like inequality, homophobia and gentrification in this stand-up set filmed live in Brooklyn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pr60Hn5pu5HMiHrj6xxC3ok1DY7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425498'),
  ('681245482308171874', 'Michael Che: Shame the Devil', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Kristian Mercado Figueroa', 'Michael Che', 'Michael Che', null, 'Michael Che returns to the stage in Oakland and tackles American patriotism, Black leadership, jealous exes, loose bears, mental health and more.', 'Michael Che returns to the stage in Oakland and tackles American patriotism, Black leadership, jealous exes, loose bears, mental health and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HcbmWNNMME9pwWcxVH15zzJhOv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:898269'),
  ('620323594695961369', 'Michael Cimino, God Bless America', 2022, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Jean-Baptiste Thoret', null, 'Quentin Tarantino, James Toback, John F. Buchmelter III, Tommy Fitzgerald, Jim Freiling, John Savage, Oliver Stone, Gary Mc Leish', null, 'A road-movie narrated by Michael Cimino (recorded by the documentary''s director during their journey together across the United States), and with the exceptional participation of Quentin Tarantino and Oliver Stone. From Thunderbolt and Lightfoot to Year of the Dragon, not to mention The Deer Hunter and Heaven''s Gate, discover a unique portrait of an uncompromising director.', 'A road-movie narrated by Michael Cimino (recorded by the documentary''s director during their journey together across the United States), and with the exceptional participation of Quentin Tarantino and Oliver Stone. From Thunderbolt and Lightfoot to Year of the Dragon, not to mention The Deer Hunter and Heaven''s Gate, discover a unique portrait of an uncompromising director.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdPQam9v6SXH7YfVTNMeKWGESQE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833916'),
  ('1016212339996809456', 'Michael Clayton', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Robert Elswit, Tony Gilroy, Steve Apicella', 'Tony Gilroy', 'George Clooney, Tom Wilkinson, Tilda Swinton, Sydney Pollack, Michael O''Keefe, Ken Howard, Sean Cullen, Merritt Wever', 'R', 'A law firm brings in its "fixer" to remedy the situation after a lawyer has a breakdown while representing a chemical company that he knows is guilty in a multi-billion dollar class action suit.', 'A law firm brings in its "fixer" to remedy the situation after a lawyer has a breakdown while representing a chemical company that he knows is guilty in a multi-billion dollar class action suit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhkW4yVIGo8Bee3UITKvqOvhNMG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4566'),
  ('166842232826681986', 'Michael Collins', 1996, 'War, Drama, Thriller, History', 'Neil Jordan, Chris Menges, Malcolm Middleton', 'Neil Jordan', 'Liam Neeson, Aidan Quinn, Stephen Rea, Alan Rickman, Julia Roberts, Ian Hart, Brendan Gleeson, Stuart Graham', 'R', 'Michael Collins plays a crucial role in the establishment of the Irish Free State in the 1920s, but becomes vilified by those hoping to create a completely independent Irish republic.', 'Michael Collins plays a crucial role in the establishment of the Irish Free State in the 1920s, but becomes vilified by those hoping to create a completely independent Irish republic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brIBbU6t9glEGAKRTJ4PMj9OiDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1770'),
  ('698879641991562104', 'Michael H. – Profession: Director', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Yves Montmayeur', null, 'Michael Haneke, Isabelle Huppert, Juliette Binoche, Emmanuelle Riva, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Susanne Lothar, Béatrice Dalle', null, 'Over the past twenty-five years, director Michael Haneke has established himself as a towering figure in modern cinema whose rigorous focus on the craft of filmmaking has produced works of profound artistry. This career-spanning documentary gives unprecedented access and covers the body of Haneke’s work, offering insight into his creative process through on-set footage and interviews with the man himself and collaborators including Emmanuelle Riva, Isabelle Huppert and Juliette Binoche.', 'Over the past twenty-five years, director Michael Haneke has established himself as a towering figure in modern cinema whose rigorous focus on the craft of filmmaking has produced works of profound artistry. This career-spanning documentary gives unprecedented access and covers the body of Haneke’s work, offering insight into his creative process through on-set footage and interviews with the man himself and collaborators including Emmanuelle Riva, Isabelle Huppert and Juliette Binoche.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOW3KgfOdHV4Jh0yDxofLxNx7dw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174353'),
  ('1072140865305967015', 'Michael Jackson Memorial', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Gregg Gelfand, Kenny Ortega', null, 'Michael Jackson, Janet Jackson, Jermaine Jackson, Jesse Jackson, Joe Jackson, Katherine Jackson, Elizabeth Berkley, Kobe Bryant', null, 'A live telecast of the public memorial service for the king of pop, Michael Jackson.', 'A live telecast of the public memorial service for the king of pop, Michael Jackson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzcsTkgQjt7DDYqHf7PQcaw21z1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52900'),
  ('16317098340731200', 'Michael Jackson: 30th Anniversary Celebration', 2001, 'Music, Documentary', 'Bruce Gowers', 'Anthony DeCurtis', 'Michael Jackson, Muhammad Ali, Marc Anthony, Monica, Marlon Brando, Cyd Charisse, Usher, Whitney Houston', null, 'The Michael Jackson: 30th Anniversary Special was a 2001 New York City revue show by Michael Jackson. It took place on September 7, 2001 and September 10, 2001. In late November 2001, the CBS television network aired the concerts as a two-hour special in honour of Michael Jackson''s thirtieth year as a solo entertainer (his first solo single, "Got to Be There", was recorded in 1971). The show was edited from footage of two separate concerts Michael had orchestrated in New York City''s Madison Square Garden on September 7 and September 10 of 2001. The shows sold out in five hours. Ticket prices were pop''s most expensive ever; the best seats cost $5,000 and included a dinner with Michael Jackson and a signed poster.', 'The Michael Jackson: 30th Anniversary Special was a 2001 New York City revue show by Michael Jackson. It took place on September 7, 2001 and September 10, 2001. In late November 2001, the CBS television network aired the concerts as a two-hour special in honour of Michael Jackson''s thirtieth year as a solo entertainer (his first solo single, "Got to Be There", was recorded in 1971). The show was edited from footage of two separate concerts Michael had orchestrated in New York City''s Madison Square Garden on September 7 and September 10 of 2001. The shows sold out in five hours. Ticket prices were pop''s most expensive ever; the best seats cost $5,000 and included a dinner with Michael Jackson and a signed poster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aH567GSmYPVomidFIkkOnzLvgJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202491'),
  ('606345563635598571', 'Michael Jackson: HIStory World Tour - Live in Auckland 1996', 1996, 'Music', null, null, 'Michael Jackson', null, 'Television Broadcast of Michael Jackson''s HIStory Tour Live at the Ericsson Stadium, Auckland, New Zealand 1996', 'Television Broadcast of Michael Jackson''s HIStory Tour Live at the Ericsson Stadium, Auckland, New Zealand 1996', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dH9C59NQzSRgIEzN9QzYArFE9T4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401331'),
  ('209683550735496487', 'Michael Jackson: Live in Bucharest - The Dangerous Tour', 1992, 'Music', 'Andrew Morahan, Sam Emerson, David Coleman', null, 'Michael Jackson, Siedah Garrett, David Williams, Jennifer Batten, Don Boyette, Ricky Lawson, Darryl Phinnessee, Dorian Holley', null, 'Michael Jackson''s "Dangerous Tour" still sets the bar high for every touring artist today. Outdoing himself with the "Bad Tour", which was already considered the ultimate, the gigantic stage setting consisting of 20 trucks and a lavish arsenal of personnel took almost three days to set up - that alone is a logistical superlative for a worldwide tour with 69 concert stops and 3.5 million fans. The highlights of the show included pyrotechnic effects, several stage illusions and a stuntman. True to his aim of spreading love around the world, Jackson donated the proceeds from the tour (over $100 million) to charity. On October 1, 1992, the image and sound recordings that are hotly sought after by Jackson fans around the world were also made. The concert recording, which was broadcast on the HBO channel, picked up in 60 countries and also transmitted by countless radio stations, still inspires people around the globe.', 'Michael Jackson''s "Dangerous Tour" still sets the bar high for every touring artist today. Outdoing himself with the "Bad Tour", which was already considered the ultimate, the gigantic stage setting consisting of 20 trucks and a lavish arsenal of personnel took almost three days to set up - that alone is a logistical superlative for a worldwide tour with 69 concert stops and 3.5 million fans. The highlights of the show included pyrotechnic effects, several stage illusions and a stuntman. True to his aim of spreading love around the world, Jackson donated the proceeds from the tour (over $100 million) to charity. On October 1, 1992, the image and sound recordings that are hotly sought after by Jackson fans around the world were also made. The concert recording, which was broadcast on the HBO channel, picked up in 60 countries and also transmitted by countless radio stations, still inspires people around the globe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BieRMMCQP9v2kR0JI1grmhVmr5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20227'),
  ('751561267817530177', 'Michael Jackson: Searching for Neverland', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Dianne Houston', 'Elizabeth Hunter', 'Navi, Chad L. Coleman, Sam Adegoke, Aidan Hanlon Smith, Taegen Burns, Michael Mourra, Ken Colquitt, A. Russell Andrews', null, 'Based on the best-selling book, Remember the Time: Protecting Michael Jackson in His Final Days, and told through the eyes of Jackson''s trusted bodyguards, Bill Whitfield and Javon Beard. The movie will reveal firsthand the devotion Michael Jackson had to his children, and the hidden drama that took place during the last two years of his life.', 'Based on the best-selling book, Remember the Time: Protecting Michael Jackson in His Final Days, and told through the eyes of Jackson''s trusted bodyguards, Bill Whitfield and Javon Beard. The movie will reveal firsthand the devotion Michael Jackson had to his children, and the hidden drama that took place during the last two years of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRZIiG4vJiCgJh4v2EPUVVTznC8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458293'),
  ('982020402468921672', 'Michael Jackson: The Life of an Icon', 2011, 'Documentary, Music', 'Andrew Eastel', null, 'Michael Jackson, David Gest, Tito Jackson, Rebbie Jackson, Katherine Jackson, Frank DiLeo, J. Randy Taraborrelli, Whitney Houston', 'PG', 'See Michael Jackson, one of the most recognizable and popular entertainers of all time, like never before in the feature-length tribute Michael Jackson: The Life of an Icon. Known to millions of fans worldwide for his record-breaking albums, groundbreaking music videos, mesmerizing dance moves and humanitarian efforts, his true story has never really been told...until now. This unprecedented look into the King of Pop''s fascinating life includes all-new interviews with his mother Katherine Jackson as well as siblings Tito and Rebbie Jackson, family, friends and music legends such as Smokey Robinson, Dionne Warwick and many more.', 'See Michael Jackson, one of the most recognizable and popular entertainers of all time, like never before in the feature-length tribute Michael Jackson: The Life of an Icon. Known to millions of fans worldwide for his record-breaking albums, groundbreaking music videos, mesmerizing dance moves and humanitarian efforts, his true story has never really been told...until now. This unprecedented look into the King of Pop''s fascinating life includes all-new interviews with his mother Katherine Jackson as well as siblings Tito and Rebbie Jackson, family, friends and music legends such as Smokey Robinson, Dionne Warwick and many more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOCYV9JCXXFtb7YehKXJBMKI4aD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78192'),
  ('219777430167813970', 'Michael Jackson''s Journey from Motown to Off the Wall', 2016, 'Music, Documentary', 'Kerwin DeVonish, Spike Lee', null, 'Quincy Jones, Rosie Perez, Pharrell Williams, Mark Ronson, Esperanza Spalding, Kobe Bryant, David Byrne, Misty Copeland', null, 'Director Spike Lee chronicles Michael Jackson''s early rise to fame.', 'Director Spike Lee chronicles Michael Jackson''s early rise to fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJuuKMTG73WR2O14QBo4VgbW4Ei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373451'),
  ('192715381445177398', 'Michael Jordan to the Max', 2000, 'Documentary', 'James D. Stern, Don Kempf, John Bailey', 'Jonathan Hock', 'Michael Jordan, Laurence Fishburne, Phil Jackson, Bob Costas, Bill Murray, Ken Griffey Jr., Spike Lee, Steve Kerr', 'NR', 'This documentary showcases basketball player Michael Jordan''s awe-inspiring moves, providing behind-the-scenes and on-the-court action, including footage of Jordan and the Chicago Bulls going head-to-head against the Utah Jazz in the 1997 NBA Finals. Phil Jackson and Bob Costas are interviewed (among others), and the awesome soundtrack includes songs by Earth, Wind and Fire, Fatboy Slim and Freddie King.', 'This documentary showcases basketball player Michael Jordan''s awe-inspiring moves, providing behind-the-scenes and on-the-court action, including footage of Jordan and the Chicago Bulls going head-to-head against the Utah Jazz in the 1997 NBA Finals. Phil Jackson and Bob Costas are interviewed (among others), and the awesome soundtrack includes songs by Earth, Wind and Fire, Fatboy Slim and Freddie King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z20ChkIl7zq7yOAIIJkDuUBV3x0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24977'),
  ('403879308940698502', 'Michael Jordan: Air Time', 1993, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Magic Johnson, Charles Barkley, Mark Giangreco, Michael Jordan', 'NR', '"Michael Jordan: Air Time" documents Jordan and the Chicago Bulls'' 1991-92 season, including Jordan dealing with his friend and rival Magic Johnson''s retirement announcement, gambling allegations, talk of the team possibly breaking the long-in-place season win record with 70 victories, filming a music video with Michael Jackson, and other obstacles throughout the course of the year. The video follows this with the "Dream Team" (Jordan and his fellow NBA stars) gaining worldwide attention as they partake and dominate in the 1992 Summer Olympics in Barcelona, and concludes with the Bulls'' championship ring ceremony in the fall of ''92', '"Michael Jordan: Air Time" documents Jordan and the Chicago Bulls'' 1991-92 season, including Jordan dealing with his friend and rival Magic Johnson''s retirement announcement, gambling allegations, talk of the team possibly breaking the long-in-place season win record with 70 victories, filming a music video with Michael Jackson, and other obstacles throughout the course of the year. The video follows this with the "Dream Team" (Jordan and his fellow NBA stars) gaining worldwide attention as they partake and dominate in the 1992 Summer Olympics in Barcelona, and concludes with the Bulls'' championship ring ceremony in the fall of ''92', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVFlLZbH3FOdKDJSkAYMcoAWX7m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69049'),
  ('1121220611444464771', 'Michael Jordan: Come Fly with Me', 1989, 'Documentary', 'David Gavant', null, 'Michael Jordan, Jay Thomas', 'NR', 'Get an inside look at Michael at home, on the golf course and in the air. Features rare footage from his days at the University of North Carolina. Relive spectacular highlights from his NBA career and All-Star games. Enjoy slam dunks, gravity defying shots and more!', 'Get an inside look at Michael at home, on the golf course and in the air. Features rare footage from his days at the University of North Carolina. Relive spectacular highlights from his NBA career and All-Star games. Enjoy slam dunks, gravity defying shots and more!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnEpUvHIhXtNHmpQ38i44RfQ1LY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51954'),
  ('1088754397384633946', 'Michael Jordan: His Airness', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Larry Weitzman', 'Bill Rubens', 'Will Lyman, Michael Jordan, Charles Barkley, Larry Bird, Clyde Drexler, Nelson George, Phil Jackson, Magic Johnson', 'NR', 'From his days as a child in North Carolina to his retirement from the Chicago Bulls in 1999, His Airness takes you on a journey through Michael Jordan''s entire career. Complete with spectacular highlights along with interviews from teammates, coaches, and writers, plus Michael''s own insight, this video captures the spirit, determination and championship drive of this global icon.', 'From his days as a child in North Carolina to his retirement from the Chicago Bulls in 1999, His Airness takes you on a journey through Michael Jordan''s entire career. Complete with spectacular highlights along with interviews from teammates, coaches, and writers, plus Michael''s own insight, this video captures the spirit, determination and championship drive of this global icon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bY9DLPRW1wxOVBHVupqdb55UDYz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52370'),
  ('938185741004417029', 'Michael Jordan''s Playground', 1990, 'Documentary', 'Zack Snyder, Stephen Hellmuth, Daniel Pearl', 'Larry Weitzman, Rudy Bloom', 'Michael Jordan, Tyrin Turner, Christopher Reid, Christopher Martin, Doc Ice', 'NR', 'This made-for-video production mixes highlights of Michael Jordan from the ''80s with a fantasy storyline of a high school teen named Walt, who has been cut from his basketball team. Doubting his abilities, Walt gets some lessons from Michael Jordan himself, on the magical Playground known as Michael Jordan''s Playground.', 'This made-for-video production mixes highlights of Michael Jordan from the ''80s with a fantasy storyline of a high school teen named Walt, who has been cut from his basketball team. Doubting his abilities, Walt gets some lessons from Michael Jordan himself, on the magical Playground known as Michael Jordan''s Playground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1D8CPm7m5ZETY5IHF527yZCJ4D2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69050'),
  ('300481822010199484', 'Michael Madana Kama Rajan', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Singeetam Srinivasa Rao, B. C. Gowrishankar', 'Kamal Haasan, Kader Kashmiri', 'Kamal Haasan, Khushboo, Urvashi, Santhana Bharathi, Delhi Ganesh, Manorama, S. N. Lakshmi, Crazy Mohan', null, 'A wicked man separates a set of quadruplets after their birth and one of them ends up with their biological father, while the other three find new homes. Things take a turn after they meet each other.', 'A wicked man separates a set of quadruplets after their birth and one of them ends up with their biological father, while the other three find new homes. Things take a turn after they meet each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TzfpFmdTuwRczVmJzB3P9xsHGD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14445'),
  ('1109357903952725220', 'Michael McIntyre: Hello Wembley', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Tom Poole', 'Michael McIntyre', 'Michael McIntyre', null, 'Michael McIntyre, the comedy sensation of 2009, is back. Michael McIntyre’s meteoric rise to fame took the comedy world by storm last year. He sold out over 100 tour dates around the UK and his first DVD release Michael McIntyre Live & Laughing became the fastest selling debut stand up DVD of all time. Michael sets off on his biggest tour to date taking his new show to arenas around the UK.', 'Michael McIntyre, the comedy sensation of 2009, is back. Michael McIntyre’s meteoric rise to fame took the comedy world by storm last year. He sold out over 100 tour dates around the UK and his first DVD release Michael McIntyre Live & Laughing became the fastest selling debut stand up DVD of all time. Michael sets off on his biggest tour to date taking his new show to arenas around the UK.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xD2br5eAOxktKWBfLKfGPYmIyjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25484'),
  ('579875636770808311', 'Michael McIntyre: Live & Laughing', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Paul Wheeler', null, 'Michael McIntyre', null, 'Acclaimed stand-up comedian Michael McIntyre delivers a hilarious performance to a receptive crowd at London''s Hammersmith Apollo.', 'Acclaimed stand-up comedian Michael McIntyre delivers a hilarious performance to a receptive crowd at London''s Hammersmith Apollo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vA5EXxK7hLGGVy8HdguYOG6akqL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14790'),
  ('454205774774777625', 'Michael McIntyre: Showman', 2020, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Michael McIntyre', null, 'Charming comic Michael McIntyre talks family, technology, sharks, accents and the time he confused himself for a world leader in this stand-up special.', 'Charming comic Michael McIntyre talks family, technology, sharks, accents and the time he confused himself for a world leader in this stand-up special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbw1UhjNyfQR9DGdXfDC81E6WAN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743059'),
  ('261603360167927858', 'Michael Moore in TrumpLand', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Michael Moore', 'Michael Moore', 'Hillary Clinton, Bill Clinton, Michael Moore, Donald Trump', null, 'Oscar-winner Michael Moore dives right into hostile territory with his daring and hilarious one-man show, deep in the heart of TrumpLand in the weeks before the 2016 election.', 'Oscar-winner Michael Moore dives right into hostile territory with his daring and hilarious one-man show, deep in the heart of TrumpLand in the weeks before the 2016 election.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34SMkpy0NcLnlbcDsUlIHS0Puad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421851'),
  ('980770550226603926', 'Michael Shayne: Private Detective', 1940, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Eugene Forde, George Schneiderman, William Eckhardt', 'Manning O''Connor, Stanley Rauh', 'Lloyd Nolan, Marjorie Weaver, Joan Valerie, Walter Abel, Elizabeth Patterson, Donald MacBride, Douglass Dumbrille, Clarence Kolb', null, 'Millionaire sportsman Hiram Brighton hires gumshoe Michael Shayne to keep his spoiled daughter Phyllis away from racetrack betting windows and roulette wheels. After Phyllis slips away and continues her compulsive gambling, Shayne fakes the murder of her gambler boyfriend, who is also romancing the daughter of casino owner Benny Gordon, in order to frighten her. When the tout really ends up murdered, Shayne and Phyllis'' Aunt Olivia, an avid reader of murder mysteries, both try to find the identity of the killer.', 'Millionaire sportsman Hiram Brighton hires gumshoe Michael Shayne to keep his spoiled daughter Phyllis away from racetrack betting windows and roulette wheels. After Phyllis slips away and continues her compulsive gambling, Shayne fakes the murder of her gambler boyfriend, who is also romancing the daughter of casino owner Benny Gordon, in order to frighten her. When the tout really ends up murdered, Shayne and Phyllis'' Aunt Olivia, an avid reader of murder mysteries, both try to find the identity of the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpPAEO8NzQv1tumQyondRDRxPB2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121992'),
  ('1147425185618627065', 'Michael Strogoff', 1956, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Carmine Gallone, Robert Lefebvre, Louis Wipf', 'Marc-Gilbert Sauvajon', 'Curd Jürgens, Geneviève Page, Jacques Dacqmine, Sylva Koscina, Gérard Buhr, Louis Arbessier, Fernand Fabre, Michel Etcheverry', null, 'When Emir Feofar Khan, leader of the Tartar hordes, takes up arms and invades the steppes of Eastern Siberia, Czar Alexander II of Russia entrusts the brave officer Michael Strogoff with a dangerous mission.', 'When Emir Feofar Khan, leader of the Tartar hordes, takes up arms and invades the steppes of Eastern Siberia, Czar Alexander II of Russia entrusts the brave officer Michael Strogoff with a dangerous mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88PdFuBXAH9DtqpLigL3bPfOleg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77418'),
  ('291455192651856537', 'Michael the Brave', 1971, 'War, Drama, History', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu, George Cornea', 'Titus Popovici', 'Amza Pellea, Ion Besoiu, Olga Tudorache, Irina Gărdescu, György Kovács, Sergiu Nicolaescu, Nicolae Secăreanu, Ilarion Ciobanu', null, 'An epic fresco depicting the reign (1593-1601) of Mihai Pătrașcu (better known as "Mihai Viteazul" / "Michael the Brave"), the famous prince who united the three provinces: Transalpine Vallachia, Transylvania and Moldavia, into the country of Romania, at the end of the 16th century (1599-1601) against the opposition of the Ottoman and Austrian Empires, this movie features large scale battle scenes mixed with political intrigues, murderous treachery, and family drama.', 'An epic fresco depicting the reign (1593-1601) of Mihai Pătrașcu (better known as "Mihai Viteazul" / "Michael the Brave"), the famous prince who united the three provinces: Transalpine Vallachia, Transylvania and Moldavia, into the country of Romania, at the end of the 16th century (1599-1601) against the opposition of the Ottoman and Austrian Empires, this movie features large scale battle scenes mixed with political intrigues, murderous treachery, and family drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xbZPbDT09JKBBNqZAkRSn5aQ5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31398'),
  ('786941345572281115', 'Michel Vaillant', 2003, 'Action, Drama', 'Michel Abramowicz, Louis-Pascal Couvelaire', 'Gilles Malençon, Luc Besson', 'Sagamore Stévenin, Peter Youngblood Hills, Diane Kruger, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Béatrice Agenin, Philippe Bas, Lisa Barbuscia, Stefano Cassetti', null, 'Michel Vaillant is # 1 of pilots, undisputed champion in rallying in all circuits in the world. His success arouses admiration and envy. Ruth Wong, director of Team Leader, is determined to break his streak and avenge the memory of his father, founder of Leader. She is capable of anything to achieve her goal.', 'Michel Vaillant is # 1 of pilots, undisputed champion in rallying in all circuits in the world. His success arouses admiration and envy. Ruth Wong, director of Team Leader, is determined to break his streak and avenge the memory of his father, founder of Leader. She is capable of anything to achieve her goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jBneaCmyN8gvgtUUUMkoTmmzqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10572'),
  ('78652659720156603', 'Michela Giraud: The Truth, I Swear!', 2022, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Michela Giraud', null, 'From the stage of Vinile, in Rome, rigorously standing up alone in front of her audience, Michela Giraud tells her own truth through the strong and self-deprecating point of view that has always distinguished her.', 'From the stage of Vinile, in Rome, rigorously standing up alone in front of her audience, Michela Giraud tells her own truth through the strong and self-deprecating point of view that has always distinguished her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPrdpUiiGiBfWxUE6oBAgEsFxNp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:946251'),
  ('376715619936204384', 'Michelangelo Endless', 2018, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Emanuele Imbucci', 'Emanuele Imbucci', 'Enrico Lo Verso, Ivano Marescotti', null, 'A painter recounts the life of Michelangelo.', 'A painter recounts the life of Michelangelo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQMJdPOGx0Dhla29TZKH2olKeDM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526242'),
  ('939938643353711481', 'Michelangelo Eye to Eye', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Maurizio Dell''Orco, Nathalie Rossetti', 'Michelangelo Antonioni', 'Michelangelo Antonioni', 'G', 'In this short documentary, Michelangelo Antonioni enters the church of San Pietro in Vincoli in Rome to contemplate Michelangelo Buonarroti’s statue of Moses. The film consists of Antonioni’s silent observation of the sculpture and the surrounding space, recorded during a visit following the restoration of the monument.', 'In this short documentary, Michelangelo Antonioni enters the church of San Pietro in Vincoli in Rome to contemplate Michelangelo Buonarroti’s statue of Moses. The film consists of Antonioni’s silent observation of the sculpture and the surrounding space, recorded during a visit following the restoration of the monument.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ditH7qR9ZOwaGwxS2GsMCtrtTMf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48278'),
  ('734445670423813251', 'Michou d''Auber', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Thomas Gilou, Robert Alazraki', 'Jean Cosmos, Thomas Gilou, Massoud Hattou', 'Gérard Depardieu, Nathalie Baye, Mathieu Amalric, Samy Seghir, Catherine Hiegel, Philippe Nahon, Bernard Yerlès, Gérald Laroche', null, 'Set in France during the struggle for Algerian independence, Messaoud''s mother is terminally ill and his father, needing to work long hours in the factory, can''t look after him, so decides to put him and his older brother Abdel in foster care. Sent to the countryside, Abdel has to work on a farm, but Messaoud is taken in by a childless woman, who conceals his Arab origins from her fiercely Gaullist ex-army husband. Re-named Michel/Michou, and with his hair comically dyed blond, the young boy quickly steals the hearts of both foster-parents, and eventually is instrumental in saving their troubled marriage.', 'Set in France during the struggle for Algerian independence, Messaoud''s mother is terminally ill and his father, needing to work long hours in the factory, can''t look after him, so decides to put him and his older brother Abdel in foster care. Sent to the countryside, Abdel has to work on a farm, but Messaoud is taken in by a childless woman, who conceals his Arab origins from her fiercely Gaullist ex-army husband. Re-named Michel/Michou, and with his hair comically dyed blond, the young boy quickly steals the hearts of both foster-parents, and eventually is instrumental in saving their troubled marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsJf0DhTmfOVHJ9AMvhVPieG1yI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14650'),
  ('989343304454251677', 'Michurin', 1949, 'Drama', 'Oleksandr Dovzhenko, Yuli Kun, Leonid Kosmatov', 'Oleksandr Dovzhenko', 'Vladimir Solovyov, Grigori Belov, Nikolai Shamin, Fyodor Grigoryev, Mikhail Zharov, Konstantin Nassonov, Aleksei Zhiltsov, Ivan Nazarov', null, 'About the life of the Russian biologist Ivan Michurin. 1912 year. Having rejected American offers to work abroad, Michurin continues his research in the Russian Empire, despite the fact that his ideas are not perceived by the tsarist government, the church and idealistic science. Michurin is supported by prominent scientists of the country and he continues to work hard. After the October Revolution, a small Michurin garden in the city of Kozlov (the biologist''s homeland) becomes a large state nursery.', 'About the life of the Russian biologist Ivan Michurin. 1912 year. Having rejected American offers to work abroad, Michurin continues his research in the Russian Empire, despite the fact that his ideas are not perceived by the tsarist government, the church and idealistic science. Michurin is supported by prominent scientists of the country and he continues to work hard. After the October Revolution, a small Michurin garden in the city of Kozlov (the biologist''s homeland) becomes a large state nursery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSUPWtVa7onub2c9qEpjsBhaHjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233189'),
  ('27733601820569596', 'Mickey 17', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Adventure', 'Bong Joon Ho, Darius Khondji, Ben Howard', 'Bong Joon Ho', 'Robert Pattinson, Naomi Ackie, Steven Yeun, Mark Ruffalo, Toni Collette, Anamaria Vartolomei, Daniel Henshall, Patsy Ferran', 'R', 'Unlikely hero Mickey Barnes finds himself in the extraordinary circumstance of working for an employer who demands the ultimate commitment to the job… to die, for a living.', 'Unlikely hero Mickey Barnes finds himself in the extraordinary circumstance of working for an employer who demands the ultimate commitment to the job… to die, for a living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edKpE9B5qN3e559OuMCLZdW1iBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696506'),
  ('235002383025584990', 'Mickey and Friends: Trick or Treats', 2023, 'Animation, Family', 'David H. Brooks', 'Kim Duran', 'Bret Iwan, Tony Anselmo, Bill Farmer, Kaitlyn Robrock, Debra Wilson, Misty Lee, Kimmy Gatewood', 'PG', 'Mickey, Minnie, Goofy, Donald and Daisy are trick-or-treating when Donald spies the spookiest mansion he’s ever seen and assumes it has the best treats. After he convinces his friends to risk a visit, the owner, Witch Hazel, casts a spell that turns them into their costumes.', 'Mickey, Minnie, Goofy, Donald and Daisy are trick-or-treating when Donald spies the spookiest mansion he’s ever seen and assumes it has the best treats. After he convinces his friends to risk a visit, the owner, Witch Hazel, casts a spell that turns them into their costumes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Gz3k1TqeAxL5M47XZzjltxQrMb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1166714'),
  ('566355031837033215', 'Mickey and Minnie Wish Upon a Christmas', 2021, 'Animation, TV Movie, Comedy, Family', 'Broni Likomanov', null, 'Bret Iwan, Kaitlyn Robrock, Bill Farmer, Daniel Ross, Tress MacNeille, Jim Cummings, Nika Futterman, Brock Powell', 'G', 'After a series of mishaps, Mickey, Minnie and the gang are separated all over the world and must try to get back to Hot Dog Hills by Christmas Eve. A mysterious and jolly stranger shows up to tell them about The Wishing Star, which could be the secret to bringing everybody home in time to celebrate together.', 'After a series of mishaps, Mickey, Minnie and the gang are separated all over the world and must try to get back to Hot Dog Hills by Christmas Eve. A mysterious and jolly stranger shows up to tell them about The Wishing Star, which could be the secret to bringing everybody home in time to celebrate together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viZ3SvvQi7CRHJxnSKAG2lHU4AK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:864390'),
  ('284969889579450973', 'Mickey and the Beanstalk', 1947, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Bill Roberts, Hamilton Luske', 'Bill Peet, Homer Brightman, Joe Rinaldi', 'Walt Disney, Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig, Sterling Holloway, Paul Frees, Billy Gilbert, Anita Gordon', 'G', 'A mysterious thief has stolen the prosperous Happy Valley''s most prized possession: the musical Singing Harp. Can Mickey, Donald, and Goofy find the answer in the irritable Willie the Giant''s magnificent castle up in the blue sky?', 'A mysterious thief has stolen the prosperous Happy Valley''s most prized possession: the musical Singing Harp. Can Mickey, Donald, and Goofy find the answer in the irritable Willie the Giant''s magnificent castle up in the blue sky?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJ5vx5U4Dj8iU3IcyyLzonNnmJT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31135'),
  ('707000520872215560', 'Mickey and the Seal', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'James MacDonald, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Mickey accidentally takes a seal home, after it sneaks into his picnic basket. When Mickey takes a bath, the seal is discovered and Mickey returns him to the park. Later, however, Mickey and Pluto discover that the bathroom is filled with seals!', 'Mickey accidentally takes a seal home, after it sneaks into his picnic basket. When Mickey takes a bath, the seal is discovered and Mickey returns him to the park. Later, however, Mickey and Pluto discover that the bathroom is filled with seals!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77I5naRsWdziY5rQucMYfk6uKk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67001'),
  ('831146267424194683', 'Mickey Blue Eyes', 1999, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Donald E. Thorin, Kelly Makin', 'Adam Scheinman, Robert Kuhn, Marc Lawrence', 'Hugh Grant, James Caan, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Burt Young, James Fox, Joe Viterelli, Gerry Becker, Maddie Corman', 'PG-13', 'An English auctioneer proposes to the daughter of a mafia kingpin, only to realize that certain "favors" would be asked of him.', 'An English auctioneer proposes to the daughter of a mafia kingpin, only to realize that certain "favors" would be asked of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEnKsStQ27P0KCCIGtkYwvFQ0RX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10154'),
  ('153900968509084650', 'Mickey Cuts Up', 1931, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Marcellite Garner, Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig', null, 'Mickey and Minnie are next-door neighbors tending their yards. When Minnie is captured by a bird''s song, Mickey hides in his bird-house and pretends to be a bird himself, until a cat attacks and blows his cover. Then he does a dance while wearing the house; their song attracts more birds, and again the cat. Pluto chases, but he''s still pulling the lawnmower, and it causes much destruction.', 'Mickey and Minnie are next-door neighbors tending their yards. When Minnie is captured by a bird''s song, Mickey hides in his bird-house and pretends to be a bird himself, until a cat attacks and blows his cover. Then he does a dance while wearing the house; their song attracts more birds, and again the cat. Pluto chases, but he''s still pulling the lawnmower, and it causes much destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7UourOTTB9KZKnWBkzg7xHcjPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162577'),
  ('523823486612626948', 'Mickey Down Under', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'James MacDonald, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Mickey, in the Australian bush, throws a boomerang that gets caught in Pluto’s mouth. Mickey then discovers an egg of an emu. Unfortunately, the parent chases him, but Pluto and the boomerang zoom into his path, leaving the emu all tangled.', 'Mickey, in the Australian bush, throws a boomerang that gets caught in Pluto’s mouth. Mickey then discovers an egg of an emu. Unfortunately, the parent chases him, but Pluto and the boomerang zoom into his path, leaving the emu all tangled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEJfBiN2hFrk79jq6Bxplm36XEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67004'),
  ('937071057355335069', 'Mickey in Arabia', 1932, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Marcellite Garner, Walt Disney', null, 'Mickey and Minnie are touring Arabia when she catches the eye of sheik Pete.', 'Mickey and Minnie are touring Arabia when she catches the eye of sheik Pete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqnXzPxEL1EnHAohnGKUB1nQDcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156465'),
  ('382266275872671161', 'Mickey Mouse Disco', 1980, 'Music, Animation, Family', 'Jack King, Ben Sharpsteen, David Hand', null, null, null, 'A clip-show music video for the album of the same name and vintage. Includes 5 songs from the album ("Mousetrap", "Disco Mickey Mouse", "Watch Out For Goofy", "Macho Duck", "Welcome To Rio").', 'A clip-show music video for the album of the same name and vintage. Includes 5 songs from the album ("Mousetrap", "Disco Mickey Mouse", "Watch Out For Goofy", "Macho Duck", "Welcome To Rio").', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvIy8yUI6mmneeZaDR3Cr4lZcC0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282387'),
  ('125689881050533794', 'Mickey One', 1965, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ghislain Cloquet, Arthur Penn, William Crawford', 'Alan M. Surgal', 'Warren Beatty, Alexandra Stewart, Hurd Hatfield, Franchot Tone, Teddy Hart, Jeff Corey, Kamatari Fujiwara, Donna Michelle', 'NR', 'A former comic is on the run from the mob.', 'A former comic is on the run from the mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVEMfHv05WcBmDISv5Pp9TeWylh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32609'),
  ('314430433245012780', 'Mickey Plays Papa', 1934, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Walt Disney', 'NR', 'Mickey and Pluto are reading scary stories; they go to investigate a noise and find a foundling mouse that''s been left on the porch.', 'Mickey and Pluto are reading scary stories; they go to investigate a noise and find a foundling mouse that''s been left on the porch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHDyLHaTfs0ySpvl2qg8RXP8JPL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174508'),
  ('662299018587364401', 'Mickey Saves Christmas', 2022, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Comedy', 'David H. Brooks, Ethan Marak, Kristin Paiva', 'Kim Duran', 'Bret Iwan, Kaitlyn Robrock, Bill Farmer, Tony Anselmo, Debra Wilson, Brock Powell, Camryn Grimes, Natalie Coughlin', 'G', 'Mickey, Minnie and their pals attempt to celebrate the perfect Christmas at their snowy cabin. However, when Pluto causes Santa to lose all the presents on his sleigh, the friends travel to the North Pole on a quest to save Christmas.', 'Mickey, Minnie and their pals attempt to celebrate the perfect Christmas at their snowy cabin. However, when Pluto causes Santa to lose all the presents on his sleigh, the friends travel to the North Pole on a quest to save Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yroznFQnEjgzgHj0vBDm4Hnppv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1037929'),
  ('872853410810569895', 'Mickey Steps Out', 1931, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner, Pinto Colvig, Purv Pullen, Marion Darlington', null, 'Mickey heads over to see Minnie, but Pluto won''t leave him alone. He gets there and watches through the window, standing on Pluto, while Minnie plays piano. Pluto runs off to chase a cat and leaves Mickey stuck in the window. Minnie has him in, and he dances to her playing. Pluto chases the cat into the house and causes havoc. The chase leads into the piano, where Pluto picks up the player-piano roll as an extended tail, and the destruction continues.', 'Mickey heads over to see Minnie, but Pluto won''t leave him alone. He gets there and watches through the window, standing on Pluto, while Minnie plays piano. Pluto runs off to chase a cat and leaves Mickey stuck in the window. Minnie has him in, and he dances to her playing. Pluto chases the cat into the house and causes havoc. The chase leads into the piano, where Pluto picks up the player-piano roll as an extended tail, and the destruction continues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6w7lETuaYWdS7D91TQy1LY4fY6e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162707'),
  ('250080694126969299', 'Mickey Virus', 2013, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Saurabh Varma', null, 'Maniesh Paul, Elli Avram, Puja Gupta, Manish Chaudhary, Raghav Kakkar, Dean Alexandrou, Varun Badola', null, 'When Delhi Police comes across an unusual case revolving around hacking they seek help of an expert who thinks like them only to come across a lazy hacker Mickey Arora.', 'When Delhi Police comes across an unusual case revolving around hacking they seek help of an expert who thinks like them only to come across a lazy hacker Mickey Arora.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FKtKKCmprBQ2sGrCclmVQ1hjVl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228648'),
  ('308643534338233770', 'Mickey, Donald, Goofy: The Three Musketeers', 2004, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Donovan Cook, Paul Finn', 'David Mickey Evans, Evan Spiliotopoulos', 'Wayne Allwine, Tony Anselmo, Bill Farmer, Russi Taylor, Tress MacNeille, Jim Cummings, April Winchell, Jeff Bennett', 'G', 'In Disney''s take on the Alexander Dumas tale, Mickey Mouse, Donald Duck and Goofy want nothing more than to perform brave deeds on behalf of their queen (Minnie Mouse), but they''re stymied by the head Musketeer, Pete. Pete secretly wants to get rid of the queen, so he appoints Mickey and his bumbling friends as guardians to Minnie, thinking such a maneuver will ensure his scheme''s success. The score features songs based on familiar classical melodies.', 'In Disney''s take on the Alexander Dumas tale, Mickey Mouse, Donald Duck and Goofy want nothing more than to perform brave deeds on behalf of their queen (Minnie Mouse), but they''re stymied by the head Musketeer, Pete. Pete secretly wants to get rid of the queen, so he appoints Mickey and his bumbling friends as guardians to Minnie, thinking such a maneuver will ensure his scheme''s success. The score features songs based on familiar classical melodies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23bvOwfOS9fw347Yc68yPpkmd8i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21385'),
  ('817280324190856105', 'Mickey: The Story of a Mouse', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Antonio Cisneros, Nausheen Dadabhoy, Nelson Hume', null, 'Floyd Norman, Carmenita Higginbotham, Eric Goldberg, Mark Henn, Randy Haycock, Bob Iger, Walt Disney, John Lennon', 'PG', 'Mickey Mouse is one of the most enduring symbols in our history. Those three simple circles take on meaning for virtually everyone on the planet. So ubiquitous in our lives that he can seem invisible, Mickey is something we all share, with unique memories and feelings. Over the course of his nearly century-long history, Mickey functions like a mirror, reflecting our personal and cultural values back at us. "Mickey: The Story of a Mouse" explores Mickey''s significance, getting to the core of what Mickey''s cultural impact says about each of us and about our world.', 'Mickey Mouse is one of the most enduring symbols in our history. Those three simple circles take on meaning for virtually everyone on the planet. So ubiquitous in our lives that he can seem invisible, Mickey is something we all share, with unique memories and feelings. Over the course of his nearly century-long history, Mickey functions like a mirror, reflecting our personal and cultural values back at us. "Mickey: The Story of a Mouse" explores Mickey''s significance, getting to the core of what Mickey''s cultural impact says about each of us and about our world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYHE9FdgXBFUWvWaIKsDHODDOTS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934323'),
  ('985376021148513958', 'Mickey''s 60th Birthday', 1988, 'Family, Animation, TV Movie', 'Scott Garen, Robert Primes', 'Joie Albrecht, Scott Garen', 'Woody Harrelson, John Ritter, Burt Reynolds, Kirstie Alley, Cheech Marin, Jill Eikenberry, Phylicia Rashād, Carl Reiner', null, 'This film combines live action/original animation and library animation. Mickey steals a magic hat from a Sorcerer and is put under a spell by the angry magi so that no one will recognize him until he finds his own magic within. While Mickey is on his quest, network news teams around the country desperately try to find the famous, beloved mouse who has mysteriously disappeared. On his quest, Mickey pays a visit to the patrons of "Cheers", meets up with the Keatons from "Family Ties", and winds up on Disneyland''s Main Street the night before his Birthday celebration is to take place. It is there that he finds he has all the magic inside him that he will ever need. The spell is broken and the Birthday bash commences as the whole World celebrates the beloved Mickey Mouse.', 'This film combines live action/original animation and library animation. Mickey steals a magic hat from a Sorcerer and is put under a spell by the angry magi so that no one will recognize him until he finds his own magic within. While Mickey is on his quest, network news teams around the country desperately try to find the famous, beloved mouse who has mysteriously disappeared. On his quest, Mickey pays a visit to the patrons of "Cheers", meets up with the Keatons from "Family Ties", and winds up on Disneyland''s Main Street the night before his Birthday celebration is to take place. It is there that he finds he has all the magic inside him that he will ever need. The spell is broken and the Birthday bash commences as the whole World celebrates the beloved Mickey Mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ya6F4xEBjWZZHsBcbft7WtKSiY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427772'),
  ('37511813217819374', 'Mickey''s Amateurs', 1937, 'Animation', 'Pinto Colvig, Erdman Penner, Walt Pfeiffer', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig, Clarence Nash, Florence Gill, Elvia Allman', 'NR', 'Mickey hosts an amateur hour radio show.', 'Mickey hosts an amateur hour radio show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IXR2RivE4SjdF1QUwHmfYisOTW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67005'),
  ('326150977124448807', 'Mickey''s Birthday Party', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Riley Thomson, Ray DeVally', null, 'Walt Disney, Thelma Boardman, Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig, Florence Gill', 'NR', 'The gang throws Mickey a surprise birthday party; his present is an electric organ, which Minnie plays while Mickey does a jazzy dance. Goofy bakes the cake, but keeps having trouble with it falling. The gang does a conga line to a Latin tune.', 'The gang throws Mickey a surprise birthday party; his present is an electric organ, which Minnie plays while Mickey does a jazzy dance. Goofy bakes the cake, but keeps having trouble with it falling. The gang does a conga line to a Latin tune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ns0HtmYZE4jQyzgSGO4zrxQHZmo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67009'),
  ('212157077407787101', 'Mickey''s Choo-Choo', 1929, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'Mickey is a railroad engineer with an anthropomorphic locomotive. He feeds the train (coal), then feeds his dog, then makes lunch for himself. Minnie drops by and plays a tune on her fiddle while Mickey dances. After lunch, the train has trouble climbing a hill, and the last car with Minnie aboard detaches and runs away.', 'Mickey is a railroad engineer with an anthropomorphic locomotive. He feeds the train (coal), then feeds his dog, then makes lunch for himself. Minnie drops by and plays a tune on her fiddle while Mickey dances. After lunch, the train has trouble climbing a hill, and the last car with Minnie aboard detaches and runs away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/an1J5bDelYXxDUhGq5iZqP6zJSc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180089'),
  ('10342790253852482', 'Mickey''s Circus', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, 'Walt Disney, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Mickey is ringmaster of a circus for orphans. Donald has a trained sea lion act, and does a bit of juggling himself. Mostly, though, he fights with a baby sea lion who keeps stealing both the fish and the show. Donald then finds himself and Mickey in an unrehearsed high wire act, which kicks into high gear when one of the orphans electrifies the wire. They end by doing a high dive into the seals'' tank.', 'Mickey is ringmaster of a circus for orphans. Donald has a trained sea lion act, and does a bit of juggling himself. Mostly, though, he fights with a baby sea lion who keeps stealing both the fish and the show. Donald then finds himself and Mickey in an unrehearsed high wire act, which kicks into high gear when one of the orphans electrifies the wire. They end by doing a high dive into the seals'' tank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dF8pSLw1jW4XzfLoiaH6vLmONeb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67010'),
  ('863095312151994034', 'Mickey''s Delayed Date', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Walt Disney, Ruth Clifford, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Even though Mickey''s evening started slow and lazy, things get moving in a hurry when Minnie calls from outside the big dance, wondering why he''s late. Luckily his best pal Pluto is happy to help wrangle the uncooperative evening wear and help get him out the door...without the tickets', 'Even though Mickey''s evening started slow and lazy, things get moving in a hurry when Minnie calls from outside the big dance, wondering why he''s late. Luckily his best pal Pluto is happy to help wrangle the uncooperative evening wear and help get him out the door...without the tickets', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XyZ0kSaqGiULziefFEneDbHrCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67043'),
  ('487531191101467520', 'Mickey''s Elephant', 1936, 'Animation', 'Hamilton Luske, David Hand', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'A friend shipped Mickey a baby elephant named Bobo as a playmate for Pluto. Pluto''s first introduction is to Bobo''s trunk, through a fence. He''s not thrilled, and marches away. The playful Bobo grabs Pluto''s tail and follows. Pluto''s devil self tells him he''s being replaced, and tells him to attack with red pepper.', 'A friend shipped Mickey a baby elephant named Bobo as a playmate for Pluto. Pluto''s first introduction is to Bobo''s trunk, through a fence. He''s not thrilled, and marches away. The playful Bobo grabs Pluto''s tail and follows. Pluto''s devil self tells him he''s being replaced, and tells him to attack with red pepper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mceZtihnwHVVVWLgoMhIZvGRzmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67047'),
  ('180317715640284962', 'Mickey''s Fire Brigade', 1935, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, 'Walt Disney, Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig, Elvia Allman', 'NR', 'Mickey, Donald and Goofy are a fire department. As you might expect, their attempts at fighting a boardinghouse fire are not particularly effective. They hear Clarabelle singing in the bathtub and rescue her, tub and all, against her will (she won''t believe there''s a fire).', 'Mickey, Donald and Goofy are a fire department. As you might expect, their attempts at fighting a boardinghouse fire are not particularly effective. They hear Clarabelle singing in the bathtub and rescue her, tub and all, against her will (she won''t believe there''s a fire).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvIY78VuEefeIyKq3XBKD4KF4o2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67049'),
  ('916000133291663821', 'Mickey''s Follies', 1929, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Walt Disney', null, 'Mickey puts on a show in his barnyard. A short dramatic scene by a chicken and rooster; an operatic ode by Patricia Pig, and then the main attraction: Mickey sings and plays his theme song, then dances to it.', 'Mickey puts on a show in his barnyard. A short dramatic scene by a chicken and rooster; an operatic ode by Patricia Pig, and then the main attraction: Mickey sings and plays his theme song, then dances to it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vSfIkmw9whoVmv2lIxSVD3EYD6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190244'),
  ('984802452635340057', 'Mickey''s Gala Premiere', 1933, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Walt Disney, Jerry Lester, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Mickey''s film is having a premiere, and all the stars turn out at the Chinese Theatre. Among those shown: Laurel and Hardy, the Marx Brothers, Jimmy Durante, Clark Gable, Sid Grauman, Mae West. The picture, Galloping Romance (Pegleg Pete kidnaps Minnie, and Mickey gives chase on a variety of animals), starts, and everyone in the audience sways along to the music, then rolls in the aisles with laughter. After, everyone comes on stage to congratulate Mickey; Garbo smothers him with kisses.', 'Mickey''s film is having a premiere, and all the stars turn out at the Chinese Theatre. Among those shown: Laurel and Hardy, the Marx Brothers, Jimmy Durante, Clark Gable, Sid Grauman, Mae West. The picture, Galloping Romance (Pegleg Pete kidnaps Minnie, and Mickey gives chase on a variety of animals), starts, and everyone in the audience sways along to the music, then rolls in the aisles with laughter. After, everyone comes on stage to congratulate Mickey; Garbo smothers him with kisses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUIsmaIzzEeCqMxKWe6vyrZ5GwQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161833'),
  ('1087897966023108228', 'Mickey''s Garden', 1935, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'The insects have completely taken over Mickey''s garden. He spritzes them with insecticide, but runs out and they keep feasting. He mixes a new batch. Meanwhile, Pluto stalks a bug and gets his head stick in a pumpkin. He stumbles around and bumps into Mickey and the sprayer, giving Mickey a faceful of bug juice. He awakens to a warped reality, where the bugs and plants are giant sized, and the bugs get drunk on the insecticide and chase our heroes. Mickey recovers from his nightmare, discovering the giant worm he was wrestling was the hose.', 'The insects have completely taken over Mickey''s garden. He spritzes them with insecticide, but runs out and they keep feasting. He mixes a new batch. Meanwhile, Pluto stalks a bug and gets his head stick in a pumpkin. He stumbles around and bumps into Mickey and the sprayer, giving Mickey a faceful of bug juice. He awakens to a warped reality, where the bugs and plants are giant sized, and the bugs get drunk on the insecticide and chase our heroes. Mickey recovers from his nightmare, discovering the giant worm he was wrestling was the hose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1i00MhDbLJ4LHfBz6mX6QSSeHTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67110'),
  ('906776817011649118', 'Mickey''s Good Deed', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', 'Burt Gillett', 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Mickey is playing Christmas carols on a standup bass for change. Alas, all he gets is screws, rocks, and other useless stuff. He plays outside a rich man''s window, and the spoiled brat kid inside decides he wants Pluto. Mickey isn''t selling, but when his bass gets destroyed by a passing sleigh and he sees a house full of orphans with no presents, he changes his mind. Mickey plays Santa to the kids. Meanwhile, the brat has been torturing Pluto; his father finally has enough and throws Pluto out and spanks the child. Pluto and Mickey are reunited, and as a bonus, the kid has tied the Christmas turkey to Pluto''s tail. (Also included: Chip an'' Dale 1947, Lend a Paw 1941)', 'Mickey is playing Christmas carols on a standup bass for change. Alas, all he gets is screws, rocks, and other useless stuff. He plays outside a rich man''s window, and the spoiled brat kid inside decides he wants Pluto. Mickey isn''t selling, but when his bass gets destroyed by a passing sleigh and he sees a house full of orphans with no presents, he changes his mind. Mickey plays Santa to the kids. Meanwhile, the brat has been torturing Pluto; his father finally has enough and throws Pluto out and spanks the child. Pluto and Mickey are reunited, and as a bonus, the kid has tied the Christmas turkey to Pluto''s tail. (Also included: Chip an'' Dale 1947, Lend a Paw 1941)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNdvym03PSBBNZuylT7eY27DdmJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81338'),
  ('151147274964679568', 'Mickey''s Grand Opera', 1936, 'Animation, Music', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig, Clarence Nash, Florence Gill', 'NR', 'Mickey is preparing to conduct an opera when he chases Pluto away. Pluto crashes into a magician''s props backstage and spars with the hat, its rabbits, and its doves. The opera begins: Clarabelle plays flute, Clara and Donald are the leads in Romeo and Juliet. Pluto follows the magic hat onstage, to Mickey''s growing annoyance. The hat falls into a tuba, and soon the animals are filling the stage.', 'Mickey is preparing to conduct an opera when he chases Pluto away. Pluto crashes into a magician''s props backstage and spars with the hat, its rabbits, and its doves. The opera begins: Clarabelle plays flute, Clara and Donald are the leads in Romeo and Juliet. Pluto follows the magic hat onstage, to Mickey''s growing annoyance. The hat falls into a tuba, and soon the animals are filling the stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8N5ZIbNNWFO3CI12S7BQhLMgQlP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67111'),
  ('506692284487286532', 'Mickey''s Kangaroo', 1935, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Hand', null, 'Walt Disney, Lee Millar, Pinto Colvig, Don Brodie', 'NR', 'A friend in Australia has sent Mickey the kangaroo Hoppy, who with her pesky son drives Pluto completely to distraction. Mickey wants to train the kangaroos to be fighters, but they end up throwing him in his own hay-baling machine.', 'A friend in Australia has sent Mickey the kangaroo Hoppy, who with her pesky son drives Pluto completely to distraction. Mickey wants to train the kangaroos to be fighters, but they end up throwing him in his own hay-baling machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxTI2jnxmrjwOl7QYq0Hf8Jjqsz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184657'),
  ('298535887715997646', 'Mickey''s Magical Christmas: Snowed in at the House of Mouse', 2001, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Bobs Gannaway, Burny Mattinson, Tony Craig', 'Thomas Hart, Jess Winfield', 'Wayne Allwine, Tony Anselmo, Bill Farmer, Russi Taylor, Tress MacNeille, Corey Burton, Carlos Alazraqui, Jeff Bennett', 'G', 'When a huge snowstorm leaves everyone stranded, Mickey and all of his guests at the House of Mouse, including Pooh, Belle, Snow White, Cinderella, Ariel and many more of his old and new friends, break out the cookies and hot chocolate to help Donald mend his tattered Christmas spirit.', 'When a huge snowstorm leaves everyone stranded, Mickey and all of his guests at the House of Mouse, including Pooh, Belle, Snow White, Cinderella, Ariel and many more of his old and new friends, break out the cookies and hot chocolate to help Donald mend his tattered Christmas spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9T9KGsdnzIzPDFF0gvdGTtp8Mvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21448'),
  ('609501336033647599', 'Mickey''s Man Friday', 1935, 'Animation', 'David Hand', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Walt Disney', 'NR', 'Mickey is stranded on an island. He runs into some cannibals who are about to cook a fellow cannibal. Mickey scares them off and makes friends with the cannibal whom he calls Friday. Together, they build a fort to protect themselves from the cannibals when they come back, but end up fleeing for their lives on Mickey''s raft.', 'Mickey is stranded on an island. He runs into some cannibals who are about to cook a fellow cannibal. Mickey scares them off and makes friends with the cannibal whom he calls Friday. Together, they build a fort to protect themselves from the cannibals when they come back, but end up fleeing for their lives on Mickey''s raft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lPe2IEaZdQ9jhb5WgqIvJo9XQa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184673'),
  ('241452219186970142', 'Mickey''s Mechanical Man', 1933, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Mickey has built a robot to compete in the boxing ring against the giant gorilla, the Kongo Killer. Whenever it hears Minnie''s car horn, it goes crazy and starts punching any picture of Killer that it sees, even if it''s on a brick wall, thus hurting itself. Mickey manages to barely patch his robot together to take on Killer, but after some early success, it gets pummeled by the ape. Minnie fetches the car horn, which brings it back, and it trounces Killer, then flies apart.', 'Mickey has built a robot to compete in the boxing ring against the giant gorilla, the Kongo Killer. Whenever it hears Minnie''s car horn, it goes crazy and starts punching any picture of Killer that it sees, even if it''s on a brick wall, thus hurting itself. Mickey manages to barely patch his robot together to take on Killer, but after some early success, it gets pummeled by the ape. Minnie fetches the car horn, which brings it back, and it trounces Killer, then flies apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTQJWsXERcNe8AoPkoXx6yYMy8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161865'),
  ('139036477064241698', 'Mickey''s Mellerdrammer', 1933, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Elvia Allman, Pinto Colvig, Billy Bletcher, Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Mickey Mouse and his friends stage their own production of Harriet Beecher Stowe''s Uncle Tom''s Cabin.', 'Mickey Mouse and his friends stage their own production of Harriet Beecher Stowe''s Uncle Tom''s Cabin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b24BZGlG7jFrsDgTTOJ1Oia48VV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161841'),
  ('381130809937791532', 'Mickey''s Nightmare', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Mickey dreams of marrying Minnie and having about 20 children. For all the possible joys of children, a brood this size turns the dream into a nightmare, especially when they get into the open cans of paint strewn about the house.', 'Mickey dreams of marrying Minnie and having about 20 children. For all the possible joys of children, a brood this size turns the dream into a nightmare, especially when they get into the open cans of paint strewn about the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sStUkkRxA7JjvWEXLrHRhDeo2LC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156454'),
  ('183291081313313873', 'Mickey''s Once Upon a Christmas', 1999, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Bill Speers, Toby Shelton, Bradley Raymond', 'Ross Hastings', 'Kelsey Grammer, Wayne Allwine, Russi Taylor, Tony Anselmo, Diane Michelle, Tress MacNeille, Alan Young, Bill Farmer', 'G', 'Mickey, Minnie, and their famous friends Goofy, Donald, Daisy and Pluto gather together to reminisce about the love, magic and surprises in three wonder-filled stories of Christmas past.', 'Mickey, Minnie, and their famous friends Goofy, Donald, Daisy and Pluto gather together to reminisce about the love, magic and surprises in three wonder-filled stories of Christmas past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6h6HwucncSxn06sMNROJ9apLC5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15400'),
  ('589828591719902193', 'Mickey''s Orphans', 1931, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner, Pinto Colvig', null, 'At Christmas time, Mickey Mouse, Minnie and Pluto are beset by an enormous litter of bratty orphan cats.', 'At Christmas time, Mickey Mouse, Minnie and Pluto are beset by an enormous litter of bratty orphan cats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhjAVzvWg1sDOaJvIcYvue2KlMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134360'),
  ('876855226616866862', 'Mickey''s Pal Pluto', 1933, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Pluto rescues a bag of kittens from the river. He feels rejected, then, as Mickey ignores him and blames him for damage the kittens do. His angel and devil sides argue with him. Pluto gets thrown outside. The kittens also find their way outside, and fall into the well, where Pluto''s angel side wins out as he rescues them once again and is finally recognized as a hero.', 'Pluto rescues a bag of kittens from the river. He feels rejected, then, as Mickey ignores him and blames him for damage the kittens do. His angel and devil sides argue with him. Pluto gets thrown outside. The kittens also find their way outside, and fall into the well, where Pluto''s angel side wins out as he rescues them once again and is finally recognized as a hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRkPiJXePlLJWkdlzkjD9zD4NYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161884'),
  ('855308004745047910', 'Mickey''s Parrot', 1938, 'Animation', 'Bill Roberts', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'A parrot belonging to an escaped killer washes up in Mickey''s basement. Mickey hears it talking and thinks the parrot is the killer he''s just heard about on the radio. While Mickey is skulking about the basement, Pluto runs into the parrot, first hidden under the fish, and then inside a leftover turkey.', 'A parrot belonging to an escaped killer washes up in Mickey''s basement. Mickey hears it talking and thinks the parrot is the killer he''s just heard about on the radio. While Mickey is skulking about the basement, Pluto runs into the parrot, first hidden under the fish, and then inside a leftover turkey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7P1cIapdFgE9KeGgw9apvXw4p5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67112'),
  ('61158296072075261', 'Mickey''s Polo Team', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Hand', null, 'Walt Disney, Clarence Nash, Ned Norton', 'NR', 'Mickey Mouse and his friends face off against a team of celebrities in a polo match.', 'Mickey Mouse and his friends face off against a team of celebrities in a polo match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yI2e69EOLGg4wLUCXrQMOzRka7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67113'),
  ('922663676867115965', 'Mickey''s Revue', 1932, 'Animation, Music, Comedy', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', null, 'Mickey Mouse conducts an orchestra, while the rest of the Disney menagerie of the era provides a dance recital, with Horace Horsecollar as stage manager, and Pluto continually sneaking on stage.', 'Mickey Mouse conducts an orchestra, while the rest of the Disney menagerie of the era provides a dance recital, with Horace Horsecollar as stage manager, and Pluto continually sneaking on stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHy1i8omvfQGyzwG2v04146pL7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156462'),
  ('878138487178951460', 'Mickey''s Rival', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Wilfred Jackson, Graham Heid', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner, Sonny Dawson', 'NR', 'Minnie''s old friend, Mortimer Mouse, drops in on Mickey and Minnie''s picnic. His practical jokes and coming on to Minnie soon have Mickey stewing, and their car isn''t happy either. When Mortimer gets a nearby bull enraged and takes off, the car comes to the rescue after Mickey gets tangled up in a red blanket.', 'Minnie''s old friend, Mortimer Mouse, drops in on Mickey and Minnie''s picnic. His practical jokes and coming on to Minnie soon have Mickey stewing, and their car isn''t happy either. When Mortimer gets a nearby bull enraged and takes off, the car comes to the rescue after Mickey gets tangled up in a red blanket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6anOVTkMD44bjqvNTLkKsiQMxC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67115'),
  ('804097459755047165', 'Mickey''s Safety Club: Street Safe, Street Smart', 1989, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Music, TV Movie', 'Gino Ricotta', 'Michelle Baron', 'Casey Kasem, Leonardo DiCaprio, Frank Welker, Jack Angel', null, 'Mickey and his friends take a close look at important street safety situations and tips.', 'Mickey and his friends take a close look at important street safety situations and tips.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pfoP47sMClmkXwYYaUfb8gl08T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642488'),
  ('53534898916859947', 'Mickey''s Service Station', 1935, 'Animation', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Clarence Nash, Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Mickey, Goofy &amp; Donald have 10 minutes to fix Pete''s car. Or else!', 'Mickey, Goofy &amp; Donald have 10 minutes to fix Pete''s car. Or else!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvqz1Jafy7lTZZBdrM16YdL7Cta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180091'),
  ('545937721912873639', 'Mickey''s Steam Roller', 1934, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Hand', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner, Beatrice Hagen, Jayne Shadduck', 'NR', 'While streetworker Mickey romances Minnie, Mickey''s nephews Morty and Ferdie take control of his steamroller and it''s full speed ahead on a very destructive ride.', 'While streetworker Mickey romances Minnie, Mickey''s nephews Morty and Ferdie take control of his steamroller and it''s full speed ahead on a very destructive ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmQXEyLQsz5aGUm6tmQY9mCnItM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135908'),
  ('1102412533971469547', 'Mickey''s Surprise Party', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Hamilton Luske', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Minnie is baking cookies. When she leaves for a short while, her dog Fifi accidentally drops popcorn kernels in the dough. Mickey and Pluto come over and visit with Minnie and Fifi. When Mickey notices that something is burning, Minnie remembers the cookies, which are popping popcorn out of them. Minnie is upset and lies on her sofa crying. Mickey goes out and buys a large amount of cookies and crackers. He comes back and shows them to her and she is overjoyed. The short was originally a theatrical advertisement for the National Biscuit Company (now known as Nabisco), where all of the products seen are various Nabisco products (i.e. Ritz Crackers, Oreo Cookies, Fig Newtons, etc.). These would later be edited out and replaced with generic-brands in television broadcasts and home video releases.', 'Minnie is baking cookies. When she leaves for a short while, her dog Fifi accidentally drops popcorn kernels in the dough. Mickey and Pluto come over and visit with Minnie and Fifi. When Mickey notices that something is burning, Minnie remembers the cookies, which are popping popcorn out of them. Minnie is upset and lies on her sofa crying. Mickey goes out and buys a large amount of cookies and crackers. He comes back and shows them to her and she is overjoyed. The short was originally a theatrical advertisement for the National Biscuit Company (now known as Nabisco), where all of the products seen are various Nabisco products (i.e. Ritz Crackers, Oreo Cookies, Fig Newtons, etc.). These would later be edited out and replaced with generic-brands in television broadcasts and home video releases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDWhiGOZby17vHDGaYrhlx230Ne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117653'),
  ('314411556372508588', 'Mickey''s Tale of Two Witches', 2021, 'Animation, TV Movie, Family', 'Jeff Gordon', 'Thomas Hart', 'Bret Iwan, Bill Farmer, Tress MacNeille, Kaitlyn Robrock, April Winchell, Daniel Ross, Jim Cummings, Nika Futterman', 'G', 'On Halloween, Mickey tells a tale of two witches-in-training, Minnie and Daisy, who must pass four tests to graduate from the With Academy in Happy Haunt Hills.', 'On Halloween, Mickey tells a tale of two witches-in-training, Minnie and Daisy, who must pass four tests to graduate from the With Academy in Happy Haunt Hills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8j9iIwxFal1Nq8NY4MSLC6Y6bLE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:864388'),
  ('696911587757128763', 'Mickey''s Trailer', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, 'Walt Disney, Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Goofy''s in the driver''s seat, Mickey''s in the kitchen, and Donald''s in bed in Mickey''s high-tech house trailer. When Goofy comes back to eat breakfast, leaving the car on autopilot, it takes them onto a dangerous closed mountain road. When Goofy realizes this, he accidentally unhooks the trailer, sending it on a perilous route. They come very close to disaster several times, while the oblivious Goofy drives on and hooks back up to them.', 'Goofy''s in the driver''s seat, Mickey''s in the kitchen, and Donald''s in bed in Mickey''s high-tech house trailer. When Goofy comes back to eat breakfast, leaving the car on autopilot, it takes them onto a dangerous closed mountain road. When Goofy realizes this, he accidentally unhooks the trailer, sending it on a perilous route. They come very close to disaster several times, while the oblivious Goofy drives on and hooks back up to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbJLSZSrxp7Kw62XWAp0kG8hxhA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53219'),
  ('183296376469576933', 'Mickey''s Twice Upon a Christmas', 2004, 'Animation, Family', 'Matthew O''Callaghan, Peggy Holmes, Carole Holliday', 'Robin Kingsland', 'Wayne Allwine, Tony Anselmo, Bill Farmer, Jim Cummings, Tress MacNeille, Jeff Bennett, Jason Marsden, Chuck McCann', 'G', 'Santa Claus, Mickey Mouse and all his Disney pals star in an original movie about the importance of opening your heart to the true spirit of Christmas. Stubborn old Donald tries in vain to resist the joys of the season, and Mickey and Pluto learn a great lesson about the power of friendship.', 'Santa Claus, Mickey Mouse and all his Disney pals star in an original movie about the importance of opening your heart to the true spirit of Christmas. Stubborn old Donald tries in vain to resist the joys of the season, and Mickey and Pluto learn a great lesson about the power of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPtfdYkhOWf3TbO1BOnRCF2vtBt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13378'),
  ('228758363003112243', 'Micki & Maude', 1984, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Blake Edwards, Harry Stradling Jr., David Kelley', 'Jonathan Reynolds', 'Dudley Moore, Amy Irving, Ann Reinking, Richard Mulligan, George Gaynes, Wallace Shawn, John Pleshette, H.B. Haggerty', 'PG-13', 'TV reporter Rob Salinger longs for a baby. But his career-minded wife, Micki, is too busy for motherhood. A romantic fling with a seductive cellist, Maude, leads to her pregnancy. Rob receives another shock when Micki announces that she''s also expecting! In love with both women, he marries Maude and starts leading a double life full of complicated and riotous situations.', 'TV reporter Rob Salinger longs for a baby. But his career-minded wife, Micki, is too busy for motherhood. A romantic fling with a seductive cellist, Maude, leads to her pregnancy. Rob receives another shock when Micki announces that she''s also expecting! In love with both women, he marries Maude and starts leading a double life full of complicated and riotous situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMezOmpy8pIqYxX3fMPfmUXo1Al.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42094'),
  ('1143746652487345295', 'Mickybo and Me', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Terry Loane, Roman Osin', 'Owen McCafferty, Terry Loane', 'John Joe McNeill, Niall Wright, Adrian Dunbar, Ciarán Hinds, Gina McKee, Julie Walters, Susan Lynch, Owen O''Neill', null, 'The film tells the story of two boys who become friends at the start of the Troubles in 1970. The boys share an obsession with Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid, with the consequence that they run away to Australia.', 'The film tells the story of two boys who become friends at the start of the Troubles in 1970. The boys share an obsession with Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid, with the consequence that they run away to Australia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7gXH1z0Ul1Ei98dEVkZWSSJ9vM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55134'),
  ('671538458456025758', 'Micmacs', 2009, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Jean-Pierre Jeunet, Tetsuo Nagata', 'Jean-Pierre Jeunet, Guillaume Laurant', 'Dany Boon, Dominique Pinon, André Dussollier, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Julie Ferrier, Yolande Moreau, Michel Crémadès, Nicolas Marié', 'R', 'While standing in the doorway of the video shop where he works, Bazil is inadvertently shot in the head. Now homeless and jobless, he is taken in by a troupe of misfits who live in a giant mound of trash. There Bazil begins his quest for revenge against the people who produced the gun that shot him.', 'While standing in the doorway of the video shop where he works, Bazil is inadvertently shot in the head. Now homeless and jobless, he is taken in by a troupe of misfits who live in a giant mound of trash. There Bazil begins his quest for revenge against the people who produced the gun that shot him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiqooJWNDEVsp8lbdTrTBvLAk0m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27936'),
  ('479408496144805214', 'Micro Men', 2009, 'Drama', 'Saul Metzstein, Hubert Taczanowski', 'Tony Saint', 'Alexander Armstrong, Martin Freeman, Edward Baker-Duly, Sam Phillips, Peter Davison, Derek Riddell, James Fleet, Theo Barklem-Biggs', null, 'In 1979 Clive Sinclair, British inventor of the pocket calculator, frustrated by the lack of home investment in his project,the electric car, also opposes former assistant Chris Curry''s belief that he can successfully market a micro-chip for a home computer. A parting of the ways sees Curry, in partnership with the Austrian Hermann Hauser and using whizz kid Cambridge students, set up his own, rival firm to Sinclair Radionics, Acorn. Acorn beat Sinclair to a lucrative contract supplying the BBC with machines for a computer series. From here on it is a battle for supremacy to gain the upper hand in the domestic market.', 'In 1979 Clive Sinclair, British inventor of the pocket calculator, frustrated by the lack of home investment in his project,the electric car, also opposes former assistant Chris Curry''s belief that he can successfully market a micro-chip for a home computer. A parting of the ways sees Curry, in partnership with the Austrian Hermann Hauser and using whizz kid Cambridge students, set up his own, rival firm to Sinclair Radionics, Acorn. Acorn beat Sinclair to a lucrative contract supplying the BBC with machines for a computer series. From here on it is a battle for supremacy to gain the upper hand in the domestic market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n42Ngra1KKY4nU1pE08qeemHdl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50451'),
  ('506033931107369053', 'Micro-Phonies', 1945, 'Comedy', 'Edward Bernds', 'Edward Bernds', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Christine McIntyre, Symona Boniface, Gino Corrado', 'NR', 'The Stooges are working in a radio station where a pretty girl has just made a recording of "Voices of Spring" under an assumed name.', 'The Stooges are working in a radio station where a pretty girl has just made a recording of "Voices of Spring" under an assumed name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGQGSdW7oVJYQw80STdRUFZ6rPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116092'),
  ('293465561026380564', 'Microbe and Gasoline', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Michel Gondry, Laurent Brunet', 'Michel Gondry', 'Ange Dargent, Théophile Baquet, Audrey Tautou, Sacha Bourdo, Fabio Zenoni, Laurent Poitrenaux, Étienne Charry, Marc Delarue', null, 'Two young friends embark on a road trip across France in a vehicle they built themselves.', 'Two young friends embark on a road trip across France in a vehicle they built themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIzSVykCYzAmaniiT5ihanpaxmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337677'),
  ('489957442707183052', 'Microcosmos', 1996, 'Documentary', 'Claude Nuridsany, Marie Pérennou, Thierry Machado', 'Marie Pérennou, Claude Nuridsany', 'Jacques Perrin', 'G', 'A documentary of insect life in meadows and ponds, using incredible close-ups, slow motion, and time-lapse photography. It includes bees collecting nectar, ladybugs eating mites, snails mating, spiders wrapping their catch, a scarab beetle relentlessly pushing its ball of dung uphill, endless lines of caterpillars, an underwater spider creating an air bubble to live in, and a mosquito hatching.', 'A documentary of insect life in meadows and ponds, using incredible close-ups, slow motion, and time-lapse photography. It includes bees collecting nectar, ladybugs eating mites, snails mating, spiders wrapping their catch, a scarab beetle relentlessly pushing its ball of dung uphill, endless lines of caterpillars, an underwater spider creating an air bubble to live in, and a mosquito hatching.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OPoiGrzNr5FWoczXH5Gs1cReec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9305'),
  ('737388343703366882', 'Microhabitat', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Woo Moon-gi, Kwon O-kwang, Kim Tae-yang', 'Jeon Go-woon', 'Esom, Ahn Jae-hong, Kang Jin-ah, Kim Guk-hee, Lee Sung-wook, Choi Deok-moon, Kim Jae-hwa, Cho Soo-hyang', null, 'Miso lives from day to day by housekeeping. Cigarettes and whiskey are the two things that get her through the day. As cigarette prices and rent start to rise, Miso decides to give up her house for cigarettes and whiskey, leading her to couch surf with old friends while reconsidering her place in life.', 'Miso lives from day to day by housekeeping. Cigarettes and whiskey are the two things that get her through the day. As cigarette prices and rent start to rise, Miso decides to give up her house for cigarettes and whiskey, leading her to couch surf with old friends while reconsidering her place in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SR5gUh5Qwy0FnOEXwFdt0nnAgb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483297'),
  ('72862825754581702', 'Microwave Massacre', 1983, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Wayne Berwick, Karen Grossman', 'Thomas Singer', 'Jackie Vernon, Loren Schein, Al Troupe, Marla Simon, Claire Ginsberg, Lou Ann Webber, Anna Marlowe, Phil De Carlo', 'NR', 'Construction worker Donald is having a hard time getting anything good to eat since his wife has decided to only cook gourmet foods. That and her constant harping causes him to snap, so he whacks her. Somewhere in the confusion he comes up with a new use for the microwave oven, and begins to eat much better. Soon he''s experimenting with different recipes. And different meats.', 'Construction worker Donald is having a hard time getting anything good to eat since his wife has decided to only cook gourmet foods. That and her constant harping causes him to snap, so he whacks her. Somewhere in the confusion he comes up with a new use for the microwave oven, and begins to eat much better. Soon he''s experimenting with different recipes. And different meats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saPYOf3E92zNy6eM0aA738JN75X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87852'),
  ('474805480861050088', 'Mid Road Gang', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Somkiat Vituranich, Pantham Thongsang, Wattana Wanchooplao', 'Sonthaya Suchata, Wachara Pan-iam, Karun Komanuwong', 'Pichaya Nitipaisalkul, Suthep Pongam, Kiat Kitjaroen, Channarong Khuntee-tao, Maneerat Kam-Uan, Sakaojai Poonsawatd, Christopher Wright, Pirachaya Pinmuengngam', null, 'The life of Makham and his gang, once well-treated dogs, takes a turn for the worse when they are abandoned. Still, they believe in the existence of a blissful land, supposedly a heaven for dogs, and set out on a journey to find it.', 'The life of Makham and his gang, once well-treated dogs, takes a turn for the worse when they are abandoned. Still, they believe in the existence of a blissful land, supposedly a heaven for dogs, and set out on a journey to find it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8BbjkSiuFkx47r7XNcmDD1asPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317291'),
  ('308699780202571245', 'Mid-August Lunch', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Gianni Di Gregorio, Gian Enrico Bianchi, Ilaria De Martinis', 'Gianni Di Gregorio, Simone Riccardini', 'Gianni Di Gregorio, Valeria De Franciscis, Maria Calì, Grazia Cesarini Sforza, Marina Cacciotti, Luigi Marchetti, Alfonso Santagata, Marcello Ottolenghi', null, 'Gianni is a middle-aged man living in Rome with his imposing and demanding elderly mother. His only outlet from her and the increasing debt into which they are sinking, are the increasingly frequent quiet sessions at the local tavern. As an Oriental saying goes, ''Moments of crisis are moments of opportunities''. These appear during the celebration of the holiday of Ferragosto on 15 August. That''s when everybody leaves town to have fun. Opportunity knocks on Gianni''s door in the most unexpected way.', 'Gianni is a middle-aged man living in Rome with his imposing and demanding elderly mother. His only outlet from her and the increasing debt into which they are sinking, are the increasingly frequent quiet sessions at the local tavern. As an Oriental saying goes, ''Moments of crisis are moments of opportunities''. These appear during the celebration of the holiday of Ferragosto on 15 August. That''s when everybody leaves town to have fun. Opportunity knocks on Gianni''s door in the most unexpected way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqvur0NR5NcdOjRVvHBgpjXjubm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17631'),
  ('226758644257670416', 'Mid-Century', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Sonja O''Hara', 'Mike Stern', 'Shane West, Sarah Hay, Bruce Dern, Stephen Lang, Vanessa Williams, Annapurna Sriram, Ellen Toland, Bill Chott', 'R', 'A husband and wife''s weekend in a mid-century modern vacation rental turns deadly when the husband discovers the owner is a psychopath with a backyard of buried secrets and designs on his wife.', 'A husband and wife''s weekend in a mid-century modern vacation rental turns deadly when the husband discovers the owner is a psychopath with a backyard of buried secrets and designs on his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3twbN3ScvJAHPdvDPXemRU9sC3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916735'),
  ('181778900404409870', 'Mid-Century Loves', 1954, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marcello Caracciolo Di Laurino, Mauro Morassi, Gerardo Turilli', 'Giuseppe Mangione, Oreste Biancoli, Sandro Continenza', 'Franco Interlenghi, Leonora Ruffo, Paola Borboni, Carlo Ninchi, Luigi Tosi, Maria Pia Casilio, Lauro Gazzolo, Albino Cocco', null, 'Anthology of tragic love. A noblewoman falls for a commoner. A doctor keeps quiet about his patients'' infidelities. Expectant father is sent to fight in WWI. A 1920s fascist enjoys Rome''s nightlife. WWII airman falls for a girl in Naples.', 'Anthology of tragic love. A noblewoman falls for a commoner. A doctor keeps quiet about his patients'' infidelities. Expectant father is sent to fight in WWI. A 1920s fascist enjoys Rome''s nightlife. WWII airman falls for a girl in Naples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bUhOdcw2EyoIigpY4hCg9hZyRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58543'),
  ('752806338860225107', 'mid90s', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alicia Gerken, Andrew Stahl, Spencer Taylor', 'Jonah Hill', 'Sunny Suljic, Katherine Waterston, Lucas Hedges, Na-kel Smith, Olan Prenatt, Gio Galicia, Ryder McLaughlin, Alexa Demie', 'R', 'In 1990s Los Angeles, a 13-year-old spends his summer navigating between a troubled home life and a crew of new friends he meets at a skate shop.', 'In 1990s Los Angeles, a 13-year-old spends his summer navigating between a troubled home life and a crew of new friends he meets at a skate shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Tw0Y3DK5kGIU9X1yw3Q9gCkOlb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437586'),
  ('118890997630659306', 'Midaq Alley', 1995, 'Drama', 'Jorge Fons, Carlos Marcovich, Mario Zaragoza', 'Vicente Leñero', 'Ernesto Gómez Cruz, María Rojo, Salma Hayek Pinault, Bruno Bichir, Delia Casanova, Margarita Sanz, Claudio Obregón, Juan Manuel Bernal', 'NR', 'Heated tempers, frustrated desires and dashed hopes plague a diverse group of individuals whose lives cross paths in Mexico City. There is the bar-owner''s son, Chava, who yearns to emigrate to America. A poor barber, Abel, is madly in love with the gorgeous Alma, who eventually becomes a high-class prostitute. Finally, there is Susanita, the desperate spinster who pursues many love affairs in hopes of finding a husband.', 'Heated tempers, frustrated desires and dashed hopes plague a diverse group of individuals whose lives cross paths in Mexico City. There is the bar-owner''s son, Chava, who yearns to emigrate to America. A poor barber, Abel, is madly in love with the gorgeous Alma, who eventually becomes a high-class prostitute. Finally, there is Susanita, the desperate spinster who pursues many love affairs in hopes of finding a husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqBmwrAWuhfEiPwVdYYmC1VzNeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18205'),
  ('217248610889905360', 'Midas Man', 2024, 'Music, Drama, History', 'Joe Stephenson, Birgit Dierken, Simon Rooke', 'Jonathan Wakeham', 'Jacob Fortune-Lloyd, Eddie Marsan, Emily Watson, Blake Richardson, Jonah Lees, Leo Harvey-Elledge, Campbell Wallace, Jay Leno', null, 'When Brian Epstein set foot in the Cavern Club in November 1961 to watch The Beatles perform, he saw something no one else could – a glimmer of gold. Sharply dressed and well-spoken, Brian was hardly the most obvious radical – but being Jewish, closeted and having grown up as an outsider who had failed at pretty much everything, he was a 26-year old with something to prove and who wanted to tear up the rulebook.', 'When Brian Epstein set foot in the Cavern Club in November 1961 to watch The Beatles perform, he saw something no one else could – a glimmer of gold. Sharply dressed and well-spoken, Brian was hardly the most obvious radical – but being Jewish, closeted and having grown up as an outsider who had failed at pretty much everything, he was a 26-year old with something to prove and who wanted to tear up the rulebook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nAfF0Szcb72eRn9WwRFsdvZu5q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:819277'),
  ('672866711103590519', 'Middle Men', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'George Gallo, Lukas Ettlin', 'George Gallo, Andy Weiss', 'Luke Wilson, Giovanni Ribisi, Gabriel Macht, James Caan, Jacinda Barrett, Kevin Pollak, Laura Ramsey, Rade Šerbedžija', 'R', 'Chronicles Jack Harris, one of the pioneers of internet commerce, as he wrestles with his morals and struggles not to drown in a sea of conmen, mobsters, drug addicts, and pornstars.', 'Chronicles Jack Harris, one of the pioneers of internet commerce, as he wrestles with his morals and struggles not to drown in a sea of conmen, mobsters, drug addicts, and pornstars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l56cv8FczzEk4pe3W8BHiRNCC05.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38842'),
  ('49409456092887919', 'Middle of Nowhere', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Stockwell, Byron Shah', 'Michelle Morgan', 'Susan Sarandon, Eva Amurri, Anton Yelchin, Justin Chatwin, Brea Grant, Willa Holland, Kenny Bordes, Scott A. Martin', 'R', 'The film follows Grace, a young woman whose irresponsible mother blows her college fund on her younger sister''s beauty pageant campaign.', 'The film follows Grace, a young woman whose irresponsible mother blows her college fund on her younger sister''s beauty pageant campaign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uhy3iCEBnY2SyXDo4lUpuj5j8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19688'),
  ('977032361033977854', 'Middle of the Night', 1959, 'Drama, Romance', 'Delbert Mann, Charles H. Maguire, Leo Kerz', 'Paddy Chayefsky', 'Kim Novak, Glenda Farrell, Jan Norris, Lee Grant, Effie Afton, Lee Philips, Fredric March, Edith Meiser', null, 'Jerry Kingsley is a wealthy garment manufacturer left lonely in his 50s when his wife dies. Despite the difference in their ages, he strikes up a romance with divorced 24-year-old receptionist Betty. The relationship is dismissed by his daughter, Lillian, discouraged by his sister, Evelyn, and denounced by Betty''s mother. But when Jerry begins to mention marriage, even Betty is forced to confront her ambivalence.', 'Jerry Kingsley is a wealthy garment manufacturer left lonely in his 50s when his wife dies. Despite the difference in their ages, he strikes up a romance with divorced 24-year-old receptionist Betty. The relationship is dismissed by his daughter, Lillian, discouraged by his sister, Evelyn, and denounced by Betty''s mother. But when Jerry begins to mention marriage, even Betty is forced to confront her ambivalence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSlwgfum8DFIbayHKRMq0CH6TzS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120522'),
  ('334851346278193455', 'Middle School: The Worst Years of My Life', 2016, 'Family, Comedy', 'Marty Eli Schwartz, Kristina M. Peterson, Ben White', 'Kara Holden', 'Griffin Gluck, Lauren Graham, Alexa Nisenson, Andy Daly, Thomas Barbusca, Rob Riggle, Isabela Merced, Retta', 'PG', 'A quiet teenage artist Rafe Katchadorian has a wild imagination and is sick of middle school and the rules that have been put before him. Rafe and his best friend Leo have come up with a plan: break every rule in the school hand book and as you expect trouble follows.', 'A quiet teenage artist Rafe Katchadorian has a wild imagination and is sick of middle school and the rules that have been put before him. Rafe and his best friend Leo have come up with a plan: break every rule in the school hand book and as you expect trouble follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rlcvuGlLETfGCq0aaVD526Emlc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369883'),
  ('924547164850623628', 'Midhunam', 1993, 'Drama', 'Priyadarshan', 'Sreenivasan', 'Mohanlal, Urvashi, Sreenivasan, Thikkurissy Sukumaran Nair, Sukumari, Innocent, Jagathy Sreekumar, Janardhanan', null, 'Midhunam movie is all about Sethumadhavan (Mohanlal) who has plans to start a biscuit factory near his house. But the bureaucracy and the corruption of the officials are the hurdles in front of him. Along with that he has to solve the problems in his family, which his brother (Innocent) and brother-in-law (Jagathy Sreekumar) creates. he marries his long-term fiancée Sulochana (Urvashi) who always cribs that he doesn''t have love towards her, which he had shown before their marriage. How sethumadhavan succeeds in his life beating all the odds against him forms the rest of the story.', 'Midhunam movie is all about Sethumadhavan (Mohanlal) who has plans to start a biscuit factory near his house. But the bureaucracy and the corruption of the officials are the hurdles in front of him. Along with that he has to solve the problems in his family, which his brother (Innocent) and brother-in-law (Jagathy Sreekumar) creates. he marries his long-term fiancée Sulochana (Urvashi) who always cribs that he doesn''t have love towards her, which he had shown before their marriage. How sethumadhavan succeeds in his life beating all the odds against him forms the rest of the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEJjl28AMWME6Yazk5ZUkzXYz6U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280271'),
  ('121038973205563738', 'Midnight', 1934, 'Drama, Crime', 'Chester Erskine, William O. Steiner, George Webber', 'Chester Erskine', 'Humphrey Bogart, Sidney Fox, O. P. Heggie, Henry Hull, Margaret Wycherly, Lynne Overman, Cora Witherspoon, Richard Whorf', 'NR', 'Jury foreman Edward Weldon''s questioning leads to the death sentence for Ethel Saxon. His daughter Stella claims to have killed her lover, the gangster Garboni, just as Saxon was to sit in the electric chair.', 'Jury foreman Edward Weldon''s questioning leads to the death sentence for Ethel Saxon. His daughter Stella claims to have killed her lover, the gangster Garboni, just as Saxon was to sit in the electric chair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SRQPlAhyepVvf5V1andNVCVJke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42752'),
  ('1042394879038138576', 'Midnight', 1939, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mitchell Leisen, Hal Walker, Charles Lang', 'Charles Brackett, Billy Wilder', 'Claudette Colbert, Don Ameche, John Barrymore, Francis Lederer, Mary Astor, Elaine Barrie, Hedda Hopper, Rex O''Malley', 'NR', 'An unemployed American showgirl poses as Hungarian royalty to infiltrate Parisian high society.', 'An unemployed American showgirl poses as Hungarian royalty to infiltrate Parisian high society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tT7nhCDJ3ngJjATlJVehKMijwSG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31993'),
  ('206550010112596420', 'Midnight', 1982, 'Horror', 'John A. Russo, Paul McCollough', 'John A. Russo', 'Melanie Verlin, Lawrence Tierney, John Hall, Charles Jackson, Doris Hackney, John Amplas, Greg Besnak, Jackie Nicoll', 'R', 'While hitchhiking to escape an abusive home life, a teenage girl is picked up by a couple on a camping trip. The trip turns deadly when a group of Satanists, hellbent on resurrecting their dead mother, attack the campers.', 'While hitchhiking to escape an abusive home life, a teenage girl is picked up by a couple on a camping trip. The trip turns deadly when a group of Satanists, hellbent on resurrecting their dead mother, attack the campers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4Nmsv4fwlOUO2GMtE0N2MUpW3H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104729'),
