  ('241981141689146011', 'Midnight at the Magnolia', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Max McGuire, Jonathan Kischel', 'Carley Smale', 'Natalie Hall, Evan Williams, Alison Brooks, Steve Cumyn, Michael Gordin Shore, Victoria Maria, Susan Hamann, Olivier Renaud', null, 'Longtime friends and local radio hosts Maggie and Jack fake it as a couple for their families and listeners in hopes of getting their show syndicated.', 'Longtime friends and local radio hosts Maggie and Jack fake it as a couple for their families and listeners in hopes of getting their show syndicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOfLcgmRYQ04ihwkNKzM6Vn4CnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734280'),
  ('336977494532638283', 'Midnight Ballad for Ghost Theater', 2006, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jeon Gye-soo', 'Jeon Gye-soo', 'Kim Kkob-bi, Park Jun-myun, Cheon Ho-jin, Jo Hee-bong, Ahn Byeong-kyeong, Choi Woo-hyeok, Han Ae-Ri, Park Hwi-soon', null, 'One rainy night, Sodan''s grandmother disappears, only telling her she''s going to see a movie. In an effort to track her down Sodan gets a job as a box office attendant at the local theater. But there''s more to this run down cinema than meets the eye.', 'One rainy night, Sodan''s grandmother disappears, only telling her she''s going to see a movie. In an effort to track her down Sodan gets a job as a box office attendant at the local theater. But there''s more to this run down cinema than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nm4d059xD4G8toLkRz4u4287KC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72994'),
  ('792569712654222507', 'Midnight Blue', 1979, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Raimondo Del Balzo, Rosaria Cilento', 'Raimondo Del Balzo, Candido Simeone', 'Antonio Cantafora, Vincenzo Crocitti, Christiana Borghi, Elisabetta Valgiusti, Monica Como, Giancarlo Prete, Dirce Funari, Vittorio Sgorlon', null, 'Three beautiful female athletes take a weekend off from training to vacation at a relative''s villa complete with private beach. While relaxing, enjoying the water, and topless sunbathing the girls'' weekend alone is interrupted by three escaped criminals on the run. Led by Pierre Luigi, the three criminals take the girls hostage and submit them to torture and rape before the girls get their bloody revenge. Shot in Taranto (Italy), near Lido Azzurro.', 'Three beautiful female athletes take a weekend off from training to vacation at a relative''s villa complete with private beach. While relaxing, enjoying the water, and topless sunbathing the girls'' weekend alone is interrupted by three escaped criminals on the run. Led by Pierre Luigi, the three criminals take the girls hostage and submit them to torture and rape before the girls get their bloody revenge. Shot in Taranto (Italy), near Lido Azzurro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/old7QbSEA2hCz712RdbhVawl3d0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91890'),
  ('712050598491054195', 'Midnight Cop', 1988, 'Thriller, Action', 'Peter Patzak, Anna Georgiades, Alexander Urban', 'Paul Nicholas, Julia Kent, Peter Patzak', 'Armin Mueller-Stahl, Morgan Fairchild, Michael York, Frank Stallone Jr., Julia Kent, Monica Bleibtreu, Ludger Pistor', null, 'Police Commissioner Alex Glass has been twisted into a sarcastic cynic by the hard luck story that is his life and by his daily contact with the criminals of Berlin''s underground. His new assistant, Shirly Mai, is an attractive and conscientious woman who embodies a quality of virtue that her boss gave up a long time ago. They have both been assigned to solve a series of gruesome murders that have been taking place in Berlin''s drug and prostitution ganglands. The prime suspect is George Miskowski, a pusher who supplies Berlin''s brothels and hookers with cocaine and heroin.', 'Police Commissioner Alex Glass has been twisted into a sarcastic cynic by the hard luck story that is his life and by his daily contact with the criminals of Berlin''s underground. His new assistant, Shirly Mai, is an attractive and conscientious woman who embodies a quality of virtue that her boss gave up a long time ago. They have both been assigned to solve a series of gruesome murders that have been taking place in Berlin''s drug and prostitution ganglands. The prime suspect is George Miskowski, a pusher who supplies Berlin''s brothels and hookers with cocaine and heroin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zTbPAUy2klgyWGWraM07JMvU76.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92772'),
  ('1100174764575230230', 'Midnight Crossing', 1988, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Roger Holzberg, Henry Vargas', 'Roger Holzberg, Douglas Weiser', 'Faye Dunaway, Daniel J. Travanti, Kim Cattrall, John Laughlin, Ned Beatty, Pedro De Pool, Douglas Weiser', 'R', 'A blind woman, her husband and another couple sail off to find cash hidden on an island near Cuba.', 'A blind woman, her husband and another couple sail off to find cash hidden on an island near Cuba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2MXeGdF4sSIgkECw6Q9Budena.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45774'),
  ('435696323540677738', 'Midnight Diner', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jōji Matsuoka, Fumio Nomoto', 'Jōji Matsuoka, Kensaku Kojima, Katsuhiko Manabe', 'Kaoru Kobayashi, Saki Takaoka, Mikako Tabe, Michitaka Tsutsui, Tokio Emoto, Kimiko Yo, Akiko Kikuchi, Yuko Tanaka', null, 'A restaurant opens at midnight. Both the menu offerings and personality of the owner draw a series of flawed patrons including Tamako, whose boyfriend has passed away, live-in worker Michiru, and ruckus-raising Kenzo.', 'A restaurant opens at midnight. Both the menu offerings and personality of the owner draw a series of flawed patrons including Tamako, whose boyfriend has passed away, live-in worker Michiru, and ruckus-raising Kenzo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zL1YmKbB9bSSK4PXoHRVehbz8iQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309028'),
  ('741313124644525706', 'Midnight Diner', 2019, 'Drama', 'Tony Leung Ka-fai', 'Chris Chow', 'Tony Leung Ka-fai, Liu Tao, Tony Yang, Vision Wei, Jiao Junyan, Zhang Yibai, Elaine Jin Yan-Ling, Zhang Li', null, 'When people finish their day and hurry home, his day starts. His diner is open from midnight to seven in the morning. Patrons enjoy home cooking and delicious stories at a master chef''s small, overnight, counter-only restaurant.', 'When people finish their day and hurry home, his day starts. His diner is open from midnight to seven in the morning. Patrons enjoy home cooking and delicious stories at a master chef''s small, overnight, counter-only restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BPVEbnezgZjnMXPSRnfduvYQNU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522062'),
  ('122898846393473939', 'Midnight Diner 2', 2016, 'Drama, Family', 'Jōji Matsuoka, Fumio Nomoto, Kenji Maki', 'Katsuhiko Manabe, Kensaku Kojima, Jōji Matsuoka', 'Kaoru Kobayashi, Aoba Kawai, Koichi Sato, Sosuke Ikematsu, Midoriko Kimura, Hijiri Kojima, Misako Watanabe, Hisashi Igawa', null, 'The Master’s late-night diner welcomes a woman troubled by funeral fans, an elderly scam victim, and a noodle delivery man struggling with love.', 'The Master’s late-night diner welcomes a woman troubled by funeral fans, an elderly scam victim, and a noodle delivery man struggling with love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmyM5UYm79JPNeNXCh8tz3B0eSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429285'),
  ('955815037933686310', 'Midnight Express', 1978, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alan Parker, Michael Seresin', 'Oliver Stone', 'Brad Davis, Irene Miracle, Bo Hopkins, Paolo Bonacelli, Paul L. Smith, Randy Quaid, Norbert Weisser, John Hurt', 'R', 'Billy Hayes is caught attempting to smuggle drugs out of Turkey. The Turkish courts decide to make an example of him, sentencing him to more than 30 years in prison. Hayes has two opportunities for release: the appeals made by his lawyer, his family, and the American government, or the "Midnight Express".', 'Billy Hayes is caught attempting to smuggle drugs out of Turkey. The Turkish courts decide to make an example of him, sentencing him to more than 30 years in prison. Hayes has two opportunities for release: the appeals made by his lawyer, his family, and the American government, or the "Midnight Express".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIzGfVCSWmmYjLIIbA2BX3rlV56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11327'),
  ('994170343537168930', 'Midnight Family', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Luke Lorentzen, Luke Lorentzen', 'Luke Lorentzen', null, null, 'In Mexico City''s wealthiest neighborhoods, the Ochoa family runs a for-profit ambulance, competing with other unlicensed EMTs for patients in need of urgent care. In this cutthroat industry, they struggle to keep their financial needs from compromising the people in their care.', 'In Mexico City''s wealthiest neighborhoods, the Ochoa family runs a for-profit ambulance, competing with other unlicensed EMTs for patients in need of urgent care. In this cutthroat industry, they struggle to keep their financial needs from compromising the people in their care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmTEtmJ1Ps17Y9uP428IGbiQayA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566367'),
  ('1106238507034790115', 'Midnight FM', 2010, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Kim Sang-man, Hong Seung-chul, Kim Tae-kyeong', 'Kim Sang-man, Kim Hwi', 'Soo Ae, Yoo Ji-tae, Don Lee, Jeong Man-sik, Choi Song-hyun, Kim Min-gyu, Shin Da-eun, Lee Joon-Ha', null, 'Popular TV anchorwoman & late night DJ Ko Sun-young set to host her final radio program. During the show, she receives a startling text message instructing her to follow specific directions or endanger the lives of her family.', 'Popular TV anchorwoman & late night DJ Ko Sun-young set to host her final radio program. During the show, she receives a startling text message instructing her to follow specific directions or endanger the lives of her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WqtunxSTVFiyBAUYSXbTSh0Vc5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55758'),
