  ('88912127618267513', 'Midnight in Paris', 1942, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Georges Lacombe', null, 'Raimu, Aimé Clariond, Paul Amiot, Raymond Aimos, Charles Granval, René Bergeron, Pierre Jourdan, Marcel Melrac', null, 'On a rainy night, eccentric tramp Mr. La Souris finds a corpse. But the body soon vanishes in his car leaving only his wallet. While the police start investigating a missing person report, La Souris concocts a plan to secure his find.', 'On a rainy night, eccentric tramp Mr. La Souris finds a corpse. But the body soon vanishes in his car leaving only his wallet. While the police start investigating a missing person report, La Souris concocts a plan to secure his find.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzosEtGLrHjgH7yitawcxbX0JnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297171'),
  ('244671088683264280', 'Midnight in Paris', 2011, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Benoît Bechet, Johanne Debas, Delphine Bertrand', 'Woody Allen', 'Owen Wilson, Rachel McAdams, Kathy Bates, Kurt Fuller, Adrien Brody, Carla Bruni, Marion Cotillard, Michael Sheen', 'PG-13', 'While on a trip to Paris with his fiancée''s family, a nostalgic screenwriter finds himself mysteriously going back to the 1920s every day at midnight.', 'While on a trip to Paris with his fiancée''s family, a nostalgic screenwriter finds himself mysteriously going back to the 1920s every day at midnight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wBG5kbfagTQclETblPRRGihk0I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59436'),
  ('685558670188568326', 'Midnight in Saint Petersburg', 1996, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Douglas Jackson, Peter Benison', 'Harry Alan Towers', 'Michael Caine, Jason Connery, Michael Gambon, Michael Sarrazin, Lev Prygunov, Olga Anokhina, Anatoli Davydov, John Dunn-Hill', 'R', 'Harry Palmer heads a private investigation business based in Moscow. His associates are Nikolai "Nick" Petrov, ex-CIA agent Craig, and ex-KGB Colonel Gradsky. They take on the job of finding 1000 grams of weapons-grade plutonium stolen from the Russian government, though they do not know the identity of their client.', 'Harry Palmer heads a private investigation business based in Moscow. His associates are Nikolai "Nick" Petrov, ex-CIA agent Craig, and ex-KGB Colonel Gradsky. They take on the job of finding 1000 grams of weapons-grade plutonium stolen from the Russian government, though they do not know the identity of their client.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCW51ACVUu0rofvs6DL2P5EnvEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23608'),
  ('158551262235587041', 'Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil', 1997, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Clint Eastwood, Jack N. Green, Robert Lorenz', 'John Lee Hancock', 'John Cusack, Kevin Spacey, Jude Law, Alison Eastwood, Jack Thompson, Irma P. Hall, Paul Hipp, Lady Chablis', 'R', 'A visiting city reporter''s assignment suddenly revolves around the murder trial of a local millionaire, whom he befriends.', 'A visiting city reporter''s assignment suddenly revolves around the murder trial of a local millionaire, whom he befriends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXS5o6RIp8m1epBm5I7cX49bfFd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8197'),
  ('358894329213460918', 'Midnight in the Switchgrass', 2021, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Action', 'Duane ''DC'' Manwiller, Bradley Stonesifer, Cole S. McKay', 'Alan Horsnail', 'Megan Fox, Bruce Willis, Emile Hirsch, Lukas Haas, Caitlin Carmichael, Olive Abercrombie, Lydia Hull, Welker White', 'R', 'FBI Agent Karl Helter and his partner Rebecca Lombardo are very close to busting a sex-trafficking ring. When they realize their investigation has crossed the path of a brutal serial killer, they team up with a FDLE agent to put an end to the infamous ''Truck Stop Killer''.', 'FBI Agent Karl Helter and his partner Rebecca Lombardo are very close to busting a sex-trafficking ring. When they realize their investigation has crossed the path of a brutal serial killer, they team up with a FDLE agent to put an end to the infamous ''Truck Stop Killer''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OTSuh2HNcTRfme8caU8DjgJ39K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693113'),
  ('469003988357164717', 'Midnight Kiss', 1993, 'Horror', 'Alan Caso, Joel Bender', 'Ken Lamplugh, John Weidner', 'Michelle Owens, Michael McMillen, Gregory A. Greer, Robert Miano, Celeste Yarnall, B.J. Gates, Darla Grant, Deborah Thompson Duda', 'R', 'Disgraced ex-homicide detective Carrie Blass is enlisted to hunt down an elusive vampire who''s murdered 16 women in two months, but matters become complicated when she uses herself as bait for the killer.', 'Disgraced ex-homicide detective Carrie Blass is enlisted to hunt down an elusive vampire who''s murdered 16 women in two months, but matters become complicated when she uses herself as bait for the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZ7EduiCWiYg8MqL241FHwk1KzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450087'),
  ('143148978394235750', 'Midnight Kiss', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Carter Smith, Lyn Moncrief', 'Erlingur Thoroddsen', 'Augustus Prew, Ayden Mayeri, Scott Evans, Lukas Gage, Adam Faison, Crystal Lockhart, Will Westwater, Colin McCalla', 'NR', 'A group of gay friends head to Palm Springs to ring in the New Year. Things take a terrifying turn as the friends all search for someone to kiss at midnight, and invite a killer into their midst.', 'A group of gay friends head to Palm Springs to ring in the New Year. Things take a terrifying turn as the friends all search for someone to kiss at midnight, and invite a killer into their midst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exRHm4z9PZolr8NUdmiwM6sO1Go.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653218'),
