  ('141922059745112859', 'Midnight Madness', 1980, 'Comedy, Family', 'Michael Nankin, David Wechter, Frank V. Phillips', 'David Wechter, Michael Nankin', 'David Naughton, Debra Clinger, Eddie Deezen, Michael J. Fox, Stephen Furst, Maggie Roswell, David Damas, Patricia Alice Albrecht', 'PG', 'A genius grad student organizes an all-night treasure hunt in which five rival teams composed of colorful oddballs furiously match wits with one another while trying to locate and decipher various cryptic clues planted ingeniously around Los Angeles.', 'A genius grad student organizes an all-night treasure hunt in which five rival teams composed of colorful oddballs furiously match wits with one another while trying to locate and decipher various cryptic clues planted ingeniously around Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4WP23kmCYQ2VjcLgtgPRrQ7fxX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17971'),
  ('827539626653760611', 'Midnight Manhunt', 1945, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'William C. Thomas, Nat Merman, Fred Jackman Jr.', 'David Lang', 'William Gargan, Ann Savage, Leo Gorcey, George Zucco, Paul Hurst, Don Beddoe, Charles Halton, George E. Stone', 'NR', 'Two reporters search for a missing body in a wax museum.', 'Two reporters search for a missing body in a wax museum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8i9YazRD1d9pb2XK2kBOdWffX6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23126'),
  ('1034398490724482870', 'Midnight Mary', 1933, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'William A. Wellman, James Van Trees, Douglas Shearer', 'Kathryn Scola, Gene Markey', 'Loretta Young, Ricardo Cortez, Franchot Tone, Andy Devine, Una Merkel, Frank Conroy, Warren Hymer, Ivan F. Simpson', 'NR', 'While on trial for her life, a young woman recalls her tough upbringing and her involvement with the men who brought her to this current state of affairs.', 'While on trial for her life, a young woman recalls her tough upbringing and her involvement with the men who brought her to this current state of affairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gd3TAaPUKfnGEYXveQnmU6rAe8B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70738'),
  ('453513617598561357', 'Midnight Masquerade', 2014, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Graeme Campbell', null, 'Autumn Reeser, Christopher Russell, Richard Burgi, Damon Runyan, Helen Colliander, Chris Gillett, Kim Roberts, Shauna Macdonald', null, 'Young businesswoman Elyse Samford''s life takes a turn when she inherits Samford Candy, a multi-billion dollar corporation, from her retired father. A trademark infringement lawsuit against a rival company brings Elyse to Higgins Attorneys and Sons, where Rob Carelli, a young, too-nice-for-his-own-good lawyer, is bullied by his boss, firm founder Carter Higgins, and his two arrogant sons. Despite his workplace woes, Rob becomes instantly smitten with Elyse. With Halloween just around the corner, Elyse invites the Higgins law firm staff to an opulent masked Halloween costume ball. Rob obeys an order to remain in the office working that night, but has a change of heart when his spunky, 12-year old niece Ruby, convinces him to attend the ball wearing a prince costume. After a magnificent waltz and magical exchange with the handsome "prince," Elyse yearns to locate this mysterious man and hopefully find the romance her life has been missing.', 'Young businesswoman Elyse Samford''s life takes a turn when she inherits Samford Candy, a multi-billion dollar corporation, from her retired father. A trademark infringement lawsuit against a rival company brings Elyse to Higgins Attorneys and Sons, where Rob Carelli, a young, too-nice-for-his-own-good lawyer, is bullied by his boss, firm founder Carter Higgins, and his two arrogant sons. Despite his workplace woes, Rob becomes instantly smitten with Elyse. With Halloween just around the corner, Elyse invites the Higgins law firm staff to an opulent masked Halloween costume ball. Rob obeys an order to remain in the office working that night, but has a change of heart when his spunky, 12-year old niece Ruby, convinces him to attend the ball wearing a prince costume. After a magnificent waltz and magical exchange with the handsome "prince," Elyse yearns to locate this mysterious man and hopefully find the romance her life has been missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1FOZOfVWnUGOybxO016ODaRbVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289523'),
  ('619790022567876821', 'Midnight Matinee', 1988, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Richard Martin, Cyrus Block, Michael Rosati', 'Richard Martin', 'Ron White, Gillian Barber, Jeff Schultz, Beatrice Boepple, Timothy Webber, Don S. Davis, R. Nelson Brown, William B. Davis', null, 'Even though a devastating murder took place during a small town''s horror film festival two years earlier, townspeople want another festival.', 'Even though a devastating murder took place during a small town''s horror film festival two years earlier, townspeople want another festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czam6wq46B9UCZvq85vicElckFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137051'),
  ('499813600100949417', 'Midnight Movie', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Clyde W. Smith, Ruben Russ, Jack Messitt', 'Mark Garbett, Jack Messitt', 'Rebekah Brandes, Daniel Bonjour, Greg Cirulnick, Mandell Maughan, Stan Ellsworth, Melissa Steach, Jon Briddell, Brea Grant', 'NR', 'At a seedy theater in a sleepy suburban town, a group of friends get together for a midnight screening of an early 1970s horror film, unaware that the director has something more in store for them.', 'At a seedy theater in a sleepy suburban town, a group of friends get together for a midnight screening of an early 1970s horror film, unaware that the director has something more in store for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t04hiJUR5EiUjobsYdvQNgJkxbI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14686'),
  ('698982711105016815', 'Midnight Movies: From the Margin to the Mainstream', 2006, 'Documentary, Horror', 'Stuart Samuels, Richard Fox', 'Stuart Samuels', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, George A. Romero, Perry Henzell, John Waters, Richard O''Brien, David Lynch, Ben Barenholtz, Alan Douglas', null, 'From 1970-1977, six low budget films shown at midnight transformed the way we make and watch films.', 'From 1970-1977, six low budget films shown at midnight transformed the way we make and watch films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcJHdDK9r2R3ayB5yoNW2uygukP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36883'),
  ('1030166020442785370', 'Midnight My Love', 2005, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kongdej Jaturanrasmee, Sorada Nakata, Chai Topiyabut', 'Kongdej Jaturanrasmee', 'Petchtai Wongkamlao, Woranuch Bhirombhakdi, Siwa Traesang, Kuensit Suwanwatthakee, Puritat Chaiseth, Ratsant Srisiriyaporn, Kiradej Ketakinta, Bordin Duke', null, 'Sombat is a night taxi driver who has unique taste in things. He enjoys listening to AM radio channels for they reminds him of the good old days though other people find him outdated and call him dork.', 'Sombat is a night taxi driver who has unique taste in things. He enjoys listening to AM radio channels for they reminds him of the good old days though other people find him outdated and call him dork.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amYccD3Usj7nBGoWjyBPo5lWUmi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74982'),
  ('994381180697762486', 'Midnight Offerings', 1981, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Rod Holcomb, Héctor R. Figueroa', 'Juanita Bartlett', 'Melissa Sue Anderson, Mary Elizabeth McDonough, Patrick Cassidy, Marion Ross, Gordon Jump, Cathryn Damon, Ray Girardin, Peter MacLean', 'NR', 'Vivian has magic powers. She doesn''t hesitate to save her boyfriend David from failing in school by murdering teachers. However, David has gotten tired of her and is putting his charm on a new girl in school, Robin. Robin discovers that she also has magic powers, and before long the two girls clash violently.', 'Vivian has magic powers. She doesn''t hesitate to save her boyfriend David from failing in school by murdering teachers. However, David has gotten tired of her and is putting his charm on a new girl in school, Robin. Robin discovers that she also has magic powers, and before long the two girls clash violently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYaCoxuaQhBlAm07vcNPXTNBGE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71377'),
  ('693646618520015627', 'Midnight Party', 1976, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Jesús Franco, Julio Pérez Tabernero, Gérard Brisseau', 'Jesús Franco, Pierre-Claude Garnier, Marius Lesoeur', 'Lina Romay, Monica Swinn, Olivier Mathot, Evelyne Scott, Claude Boisson, Alain Petit, Jesús Franco, Raymond Hardy', null, 'Sylvia, a stripper, attends a party where the theme is a mock spy adventure. Unfortunately, she soon finds herself thrust in a real espionage adventure. There are these two playboys that invite her to their midnight orgy. Later, her communist rock star lover shows up in her dressing room and starts shouting anti-capitalist rhetoric. In the mean time, her hypochondriac husband keeps loosing money in poker games. And in between, she talks directly into the camera, trying to entertain us.', 'Sylvia, a stripper, attends a party where the theme is a mock spy adventure. Unfortunately, she soon finds herself thrust in a real espionage adventure. There are these two playboys that invite her to their midnight orgy. Later, her communist rock star lover shows up in her dressing room and starts shouting anti-capitalist rhetoric. In the mean time, her hypochondriac husband keeps loosing money in poker games. And in between, she talks directly into the camera, trying to entertain us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puKdpBuqVJx3bHBX2DFr4hITZdu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56659'),
  ('114424529488174069', 'Midnight Pleasures', 1975, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama', 'Pasqualino De Santis, Marcello Fondato, Rinaldo Ricci', 'Marcello Fondato, Francesco Scardamaglia', 'Claudia Cardinale, Vittorio Gassman, Monica Vitti, Giancarlo Giannini, Renato Pozzetto, Pino Locchi, Paola Maiolini, Silvio Spaccesi', 'NR', 'Tina is on trial for the murder of her lover, Gino. The violent nature of their relationship, revealed in the trial, seems to make obvious that she accidentally killed him during a fight. The lone female jury member compares her life to Tina''s and, believing her to be innocent, sets out on her own to find a missing witness that can prove Tina''s innocence.', 'Tina is on trial for the murder of her lover, Gino. The violent nature of their relationship, revealed in the trial, seems to make obvious that she accidentally killed him during a fight. The lone female jury member compares her life to Tina''s and, believing her to be innocent, sets out on her own to find a missing witness that can prove Tina''s innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKXfAoX3UpBX59L3KU1yJEEgUmr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121513'),
  ('354894503295621607', 'Midnight Ride', 1990, 'Thriller, Action, Horror', 'Bob Bralver, Roberto D''Ettorre Piazzoli', 'Russell V. Manzatt, Bob Bralver', 'Michael Dudikoff, Mark Hamill, Robert Mitchum, Savina Geršak, Pamela Ludwig, Timothy Brown, Lezlie Deane, Cynthia Szigeti', null, 'A house wife just left her cop husband, when she picks up Justin McKay she''ll wish she never did as she''s plunged into a nightmare and the grip of a psychotic killer.', 'A house wife just left her cop husband, when she picks up Justin McKay she''ll wish she never did as she''s plunged into a nightmare and the grip of a psychotic killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9RpMH0z5gILV9iAf6Z5ijtfv14.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31942'),
