  ('818415301522957638', 'Midnight University', 2016, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Kanin Koonsumitawong, Piyabutr Athisuk, Kritsada Kaniwichaphon', 'Kritsada Kaniwichaphon, Piyabutr Athisuk', 'Rasri Balenciaga, Theerachai Wimolchaireuk, Darvid Kreepolrerk, Marut Chuenchomboon, Pavinee Bulanacheevalai, Koravic Jandan, Pongsit Pisittakarn, Charada Imraporn', null, 'Every university has some mysterious tall tales of the past, where students die before graduating. Someone wants to create a class to help the spirits graduate college. What kind of terror and romp will they have to go through?', 'Every university has some mysterious tall tales of the past, where students die before graduating. Someone wants to create a class to help the spirits graduate college. What kind of terror and romp will they have to go through?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tug4ONxS3qApZOuMcDfeUu3xcnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413664'),
