  ('826115042361624927', 'Midori', 1992, 'Animation, Drama, Horror', 'Nobuyuki Sugaya, Hiroshi Harada', 'Hiroshi Harada', 'Minako Naka, Norihiko Morishita, Keinosuke Okamoto, Kazuyoshi Hayashi, Yoshihiko Matsui, Yoshifumi Nomura, Sanae Katô, Yumiko Takagi', null, 'After losing her parents, young flower selling Midori is put up by a fairground group. She is abused and forced to slavery, until the arrival of an enigmatic magician of short stature, who gives her hope for a better future.', 'After losing her parents, young flower selling Midori is put up by a fairground group. She is abused and forced to slavery, until the arrival of an enigmatic magician of short stature, who gives her hope for a better future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iv3TU7RAuWnMwhsYd7eaAIJ3NuO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53064'),
