  ('1025169466731979680', 'Midsummer', 2003, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Carsten Myllerup, Rasmus Videbæk', 'Rasmus Heisterberg', 'Kristian Leth, Laura Christensen, Jon Lange, Tuva Novotny, Nicolai Jandorf Klok, Julie R. Ølgaard, Lykke Sand Michelsen, Per Oscarsson', null, 'It is the last day of school for Christian and his younger sister Sophie. They are heading to a party at his friend Trina. High school graduation is just around the corner and after the freedom and future. But behind the idyllic facade lurks tragedy and secrets. That evening Sophie commits suicide.', 'It is the last day of school for Christian and his younger sister Sophie. They are heading to a party at his friend Trina. High school graduation is just around the corner and after the freedom and future. But behind the idyllic facade lurks tragedy and secrets. That evening Sophie commits suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnypzzV2WDbHQkteEnpF0SsLlbT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16032'),
  ('728648822389847652', 'Midsummer Dream', 2005, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Angel de la Cruz, Manolo Gómez', 'Beatriz Iso, Angel de la Cruz', 'Gabino Diego, Pedro Abrunhosa, Ben Bishop, Gemma Cuervo, Rui Oliveira, Carlos Vieira de Almeida', null, 'Legend says that on Saint John''s Eve, humans can enter the magical world of elves and fairies. Elena, a smart, dreamy little girl, doesn''t believe in legends, but her father, Duke Theseus, is very ill and she would do anything to restore his health, so she begins a search for Titania, Queen of the Fairies, accompanied by Banker Demetrio and Lisandro, who does everything possible to win her affection. Based on William Shakespeare''s play.', 'Legend says that on Saint John''s Eve, humans can enter the magical world of elves and fairies. Elena, a smart, dreamy little girl, doesn''t believe in legends, but her father, Duke Theseus, is very ill and she would do anything to restore his health, so she begins a search for Titania, Queen of the Fairies, accompanied by Banker Demetrio and Lisandro, who does everything possible to win her affection. Based on William Shakespeare''s play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u997CnhgS8o6ldcN0JLpxjdn9Vv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46031'),
  ('849106258578700664', 'Midsummer Madness', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alexander Hahn, Jerzy Palacz, Tim Lewiston', 'Alexander Hahn, Norman Hudis, Alexander Mahler', 'Orlando Wells, Gundars Āboliņš, Maria de Medeiros, Dominique Pinon, Chulpan Khamatova, Tobias Moretti, Victor McGuire, Detlev Buck', null, 'St. John’s Night is a traditional Latvian midsummer celebration where family and friends get together to build bonfires, drink and have a good time. According to a legend, on this night lovers and those who wish to fall in love can search the woods for the "magic fern".', 'St. John’s Night is a traditional Latvian midsummer celebration where family and friends get together to build bonfires, drink and have a good time. According to a legend, on this night lovers and those who wish to fall in love can search the woods for the "magic fern".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrsdElKoqLpOPJU3f6aBlQbLxdh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88830'),
  ('41119906639198610', 'Midsummer Night''s Murder', 2016, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Helmut Pirnat, Harald Sicheritz', 'Felix Mitterer', 'Gregor Bloéb, Katharina Straßer, Clemens Schick, Franziska Petri, Julia Gschnitzer, Peter Mitterrutzner, Martin Leutgeb, Roland Silbernagl', null, 'The dead body of a tourist is found in the mountains of Tyrol. The murder investigation focuses on the residents of a seemingly quiet village.', 'The dead body of a tourist is found in the mountains of Tyrol. The murder investigation focuses on the residents of a seemingly quiet village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnepTiRopd3anptXsQ30wZWsqsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429987'),
  ('514064163982566051', 'Midsummer''s Equation', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Hiroshi Nishitani, Katsumi Yanagijima, Masayuki Yamamoto', 'Yasushi Fukuda', 'Masaharu Fukuyama, Yuriko Yoshitaka, Kazuki Kitamura, Anne Watanabe, Jun Fubuki, Hakuryu, Gin Maeda, Naomi Nishida', null, 'Masaharu Fukuyama reprises his role from 2008''s "Suspect X," playing the physicist-cum-detective Manabu Yukawa. The scientist-sleuth arrives in an oceanside town to speak on a panel. But when a man turns up dead outside the inn where he''s staying, Yukawa begins to unravel the connections that tie the victim to the activist daughter of the innkeepers, and a precocious boy who first appears on a train—and keeps popping up. It''s a Sherlock Holmes mystery with an environmental twist, and one that should please fans of a classic whodunnit.', 'Masaharu Fukuyama reprises his role from 2008''s "Suspect X," playing the physicist-cum-detective Manabu Yukawa. The scientist-sleuth arrives in an oceanside town to speak on a panel. But when a man turns up dead outside the inn where he''s staying, Yukawa begins to unravel the connections that tie the victim to the activist daughter of the innkeepers, and a precocious boy who first appears on a train—and keeps popping up. It''s a Sherlock Holmes mystery with an environmental twist, and one that should please fans of a classic whodunnit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpaA8VfyUrUSUbTAaSjloapTnqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204702'),
