  ('143197816255094239', 'Midwinter Break', 2026, 'Drama', 'Polly Findlay, Laurie Rose, Job Castelijn', 'Nick Payne, Bernard MacLaverty', 'Lesley Manville, Ciarán Hinds, Niamh Cusack, Julie Lamberton, Ed Sayer, Leila Laaraj, Tim Licata, Marco Horta Lopes', 'PG-13', 'Longtime retired couple Stella and Gerry realise that their relationship has reached a crossroads while on holiday in Amsterdam. After so much time and so many memories, long-held promises and deeply concealed wounds threaten to come to light and force them to confront their future.', 'Longtime retired couple Stella and Gerry realise that their relationship has reached a crossroads while on holiday in Amsterdam. After so much time and so many memories, long-held promises and deeply concealed wounds threaten to come to light and force them to confront their future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkMOruokVnD05xSiwI2hWBzG7UD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1125701'),
  ('759456867855718261', 'Midwives', 2023, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Léa Fehner, Jacques Girault, Delphine Daull', 'Léa Fehner, Catherine Paillé', 'Khadija Kouyaté, Héloïse Janjaud, Myriem Akheddiou, Quentin Vernede, Tarik Kariouh, Lucie Mancipoz, Marine Gesbert, Fleur Fitoussi', null, 'After 5 years learning the profession of midwife, “the most beautiful job in the world”, Louise and Sofia are finally entering working life and taking on huge responsibilities in a world where, at a frenetic pace, they handle with birth, motherhood and sometimes death. Will their vocation resist such a storm?', 'After 5 years learning the profession of midwife, “the most beautiful job in the world”, Louise and Sofia are finally entering working life and taking on huge responsibilities in a world where, at a frenetic pace, they handle with birth, motherhood and sometimes death. Will their vocation resist such a storm?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMB5D1HWNcfBQBj35m094m7RGZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006810'),
  ('323263167855574209', 'Mientras Cupido no está', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Alejandro Aimetta, Enrique Silguero', 'Daniela Enet', 'Dolores Heredia, Vadhir Derbez, Antonia San Juan, Manuel Vega, Ana Lucía Domínguez, Andrea Duro, Thalí García, Martina Cariddi', null, 'Mirtha Del Cañon is the owner of a million-dollar company. Her only son, Bartolo, is a mess, and to straighten him out, she decides to look for a woman for him, to achieve that, she organizes a casting to find the perfect daughter-in-law.', 'Mirtha Del Cañon is the owner of a million-dollar company. Her only son, Bartolo, is a mess, and to straighten him out, she decides to look for a woman for him, to achieve that, she organizes a casting to find the perfect daughter-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/figjQxoiVMNuDJe5wl4nrgAJTDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1199840'),
  ('581729990691228228', 'Mies, joka ei osannut sanoa ei', 1975, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Risto Jarva, Antti Peippo', 'Kullervo Kukkasjärvi, Risto Jarva, Jussi Kylätasku', 'Antti Litja, Kirsti Wallasvaara, Matti Ruohola, Jukka Sipilä', null, 'Young priest returns from America to work in an old Helsinki neighbourhood with idyllic wooden houses. The shy but handsome bachelor is assigned the duty of marriage counseling but is soon overwhelmed by the ladies'' romantic interest directed at himself. Trying to please everybody, he also creates confusion by taking both sides in the issue of whether to preserve the neighbourhood or to go along with the modernisation plans offered by property developers.', 'Young priest returns from America to work in an old Helsinki neighbourhood with idyllic wooden houses. The shy but handsome bachelor is assigned the duty of marriage counseling but is soon overwhelmed by the ladies'' romantic interest directed at himself. Trying to please everybody, he also creates confusion by taking both sides in the issue of whether to preserve the neighbourhood or to go along with the modernisation plans offered by property developers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5QXiUg4MmllpUV3V8ivgd4T45O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290274'),
  ('539539807496111840', 'Miffo', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel Lind Lagerlöf, Olof Johnson, Daniel Malmén', 'Daniel Lind Lagerlöf, Malin Lind Lagerlöf', 'Jonas Karlsson, Livia Millhagen, Ingvar Hirdwall, Kajsa Ernst, Liv Mjönes, Fyr Thorvald Strömberg, Isa Aouifia, Carina Boberg', null, 'Tobias is the new, idealistic priest in a suburb but he soon learns that his flock is quite uninterested in Christianity. However, he befriends Carolina, a chain smoking woman his age, wheelchair-bound since birth. It is opposites attract although their backgrounds are different.', 'Tobias is the new, idealistic priest in a suburb but he soon learns that his flock is quite uninterested in Christianity. However, he befriends Carolina, a chain smoking woman his age, wheelchair-bound since birth. It is opposites attract although their backgrounds are different.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cC2GpeXogGyCNq9BaPXhg1w3SnH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5995'),
  ('792614771215512271', 'Mifune', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Anthony Dod Mantle, Søren Kragh-Jacobsen', 'Anders Thomas Jensen, Søren Kragh-Jacobsen', 'Anders W. Berthelsen, Iben Hjejle, Jesper Asholt, Sofie Gråbøl, Emil Tarding, Anders Hove, Paprika Steen, Mette Bratlann', null, 'Kresten, newly wed, is on the threshold of a great career success in his father-in-law’s company. But when the death of his own father takes him back to his poverty-stricken childhood home, far out in the country, his career plans fall apart. For one thing he has to deal with his loveable, backward brother, who is now all alone; for another, he meets a stunning woman who comes to the farm as a housekeeper, in disguise of her real profession as a call-girl.', 'Kresten, newly wed, is on the threshold of a great career success in his father-in-law’s company. But when the death of his own father takes him back to his poverty-stricken childhood home, far out in the country, his career plans fall apart. For one thing he has to deal with his loveable, backward brother, who is now all alone; for another, he meets a stunning woman who comes to the farm as a housekeeper, in disguise of her real profession as a call-girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEg7dmFcPqjF5kBYD0Bkz2CVyYB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139'),
  ('900085798489367852', 'Mifune: The Last Samurai', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Tohru Hina, Yasuyuki Ishikawa, Guy Mossman', 'Steven Okazaki, Stuart Galbraith IV', 'Keanu Reeves, Kyōko Kagawa, Yōko Tsukasa, Yoshio Tsuchiya, Takeshi Katō, Kaoru Yachigusa, Yōsuke Natsuki, Terumi Niki', null, 'An account of the life and work of legendary Japanese actor Toshirō Mifune (1920-97), the most prominent actor of the Golden Age of Japanese cinema.', 'An account of the life and work of legendary Japanese actor Toshirō Mifune (1920-97), the most prominent actor of the Golden Age of Japanese cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nklWhTBnbFw0NutlupxNbDB9TZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413782'),
  ('608372806840492454', 'Mighty Aphrodite', 1995, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Woody Allen, Carlo Di Palma, Thomas A. Reilly', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Mira Sorvino, Helena Bonham Carter, F. Murray Abraham, Donald Symington, Claire Bloom, Olympia Dukakis, Michael Rapaport', 'R', 'When Lenny and his wife, Amanda, adopt a baby, Lenny realizes that his son is a genius and becomes obsessed with finding the boy''s biological mother in hopes that she will be brilliant too. But when he learns that Max''s mother is Linda Ash, a kindhearted prostitute and porn star, Lenny is determined to reform her immoral lifestyle. A Greek chorus chimes in to relate the plot to Greek mythology in this quirky comedy.', 'When Lenny and his wife, Amanda, adopt a baby, Lenny realizes that his son is a genius and becomes obsessed with finding the boy''s biological mother in hopes that she will be brilliant too. But when he learns that Max''s mother is Linda Ash, a kindhearted prostitute and porn star, Lenny is determined to reform her immoral lifestyle. A Greek chorus chimes in to relate the plot to Greek mythology in this quirky comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ice135yQZp4iX2SgCmd90nKgS5j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11448'),
  ('523092328506519602', 'Mighty Ducks the Movie: The First Face-Off', 1997, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Joe Barruso, Doug Murphy, Blair Peters', 'Garfield Reeves-Stevens, Judith Reeves-Stevens, David Wise', 'Jim Belushi, Jeff Bennett, Clancy Brown, Townsend Coleman, Tim Curry, Roy Firestone, Dennis Franz, Brad Garrett', null, 'A direct-to-video feature film, Mighty Ducks the Movie: The First Face-Off, was released in 1997. It comprises three episodes of the animated series edited into one continuous movie: The First Face-Off parts I and II, and Duck Hard.', 'A direct-to-video feature film, Mighty Ducks the Movie: The First Face-Off, was released in 1997. It comprises three episodes of the animated series edited into one continuous movie: The First Face-Off parts I and II, and Duck Hard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1MDt22FV7BAuIa8XJsRb3OALbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59091'),
  ('116353129944743207', 'Mighty Flash', 2021, 'Drama', 'Fabiola Campaña Lozano, Willy Jáuregui, Ainhoa Rodríguez', 'Ainhoa Rodríguez', 'Guadalupe Gutiérrez, Carmen Valverde, Isabel Mendoza, Isabel Valverde', null, 'Isa uses a tape recorder to record messages to herself and then reads them out. She is hoping for change to come, which isn’t surprising. She lives in a small community in southwest Spain where nothing ever happens. All the young people have left. For those who stay behind, time seems to stand still.', 'Isa uses a tape recorder to record messages to herself and then reads them out. She is hoping for change to come, which isn’t surprising. She lives in a small community in southwest Spain where nothing ever happens. All the young people have left. For those who stay behind, time seems to stand still.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgWFiNqRMntJKi2PDbq7dig3qs1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778657'),
  ('700860758001322697', 'Mighty Jack', 1987, 'Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Kazuho Mitsuta, Yoshihiro Mori', 'Shinichi Sekizawa, Eizaburo Shiba', 'Hideaki Nitani, Naoko Kubo, Hiroshi Minami, Hideyo Amamoto, Masaya Nihei, Wakako Ikeda, Shunji Kasuga, Seigo Fukuoka', null, 'The organization Mighty Jack is formed to combat the criminal syndicate known as "Q", and are given a large array of advanced weapons, chief among them being a high-tech submarine. Harold Hatari is abducted by Q, and Mighty Jack is dispatched to rescue him. Hatari is interrogated and threatened with blinding lights, but the Mighty Jack crew rescue him in the nick of time. Later, Q is discovered to be using "hot ice" (water that remains solid at room temperature) to create weapons and a secret ocean base disguised as an iceberg (though it''s not precisely clear how hot ice could be a major world threat). Q then attempts to take over the Mighty Jack sub.', 'The organization Mighty Jack is formed to combat the criminal syndicate known as "Q", and are given a large array of advanced weapons, chief among them being a high-tech submarine. Harold Hatari is abducted by Q, and Mighty Jack is dispatched to rescue him. Hatari is interrogated and threatened with blinding lights, but the Mighty Jack crew rescue him in the nick of time. Later, Q is discovered to be using "hot ice" (water that remains solid at room temperature) to create weapons and a secret ocean base disguised as an iceberg (though it''s not precisely clear how hot ice could be a major world threat). Q then attempts to take over the Mighty Jack sub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svziVgTCDhpmR8M0glXahuUlvpi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264081'),
  ('588412672237335663', 'Mighty Joe Young', 1949, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama, Action', 'Ernest B. Schoedsack, J. Roy Hunt, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Ruth Rose', 'Terry Moore, Ben Johnson, Robert Armstrong, Frank McHugh, Douglas Fowley, Denis Greene, Paul Guilfoyle, Nestor Paiva', 'NR', 'A young woman, Jill Young, grew up on her father''s ranch in Africa, raising a large gorilla named Joe from an infant. Years later, she brings him to Hollywood to become a star.', 'A young woman, Jill Young, grew up on her father''s ranch in Africa, raising a large gorilla named Joe from an infant. Years later, she brings him to Hollywood to become a star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTTS9Bi7JReyGpCKyDuyZNSLTT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39314'),
  ('163207586481038964', 'Mighty Joe Young', 1998, 'Adventure, Family, Action, Fantasy', 'Ron Underwood, Oliver Wood, Dan Webster', 'Merian C. Cooper, Ruth Rose', 'Charlize Theron, Bill Paxton, Rade Šerbedžija, Peter Firth, David Paymer, Regina King, Robert Wisdom, Naveen Andrews', 'PG', 'As a child living in Africa, Jill Young saw her mother killed while protecting wild gorillas from poachers led by Andrei Strasser. Now an adult, Jill cares for an orphaned gorilla named Joe -- who, due to a genetic anomaly, is 15 feet tall. When Gregg O''Hara arrives from California and sees the animal, he convinces Jill that Joe would be safest at his wildlife refuge. But Strasser follows them to the U.S., intent on capturing Joe for himself.', 'As a child living in Africa, Jill Young saw her mother killed while protecting wild gorillas from poachers led by Andrei Strasser. Now an adult, Jill cares for an orphaned gorilla named Joe -- who, due to a genetic anomaly, is 15 feet tall. When Gregg O''Hara arrives from California and sees the animal, he convinces Jill that Joe would be safest at his wildlife refuge. But Strasser follows them to the U.S., intent on capturing Joe for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93oAWBl6UIEmeknmRKbUkVq4cKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9822'),
  ('253061497493933101', 'Mighty Like a Moose', 1926, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Leo McCarey', null, 'Charley Chase, Vivien Oakland, Ann Howe, Charles Clary, Gale Henry, Malcolm Denny, Harry Bowen, Charlie Hall', null, 'After a homely married couple separately undergo plastic surgery, they unwittingly plan an extramarital affair with each other.', 'After a homely married couple separately undergo plastic surgery, they unwittingly plan an extramarital affair with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDz50B4QwEILra5NeDyCasYWwcW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150936'),
  ('135694757925453899', 'Mighty Morphin Power Rangers: Alpha''s Magical Christmas', 1994, 'Family', 'John Stewart', 'Cheryl Saban', 'Richard Steven Horvitz, Louise E. Marino Sr., David Yost, Jason David Frank, Amy Jo Johnson, Steve Cardenas, Karan Ashley, Johnny Yong Bosch', null, 'Alpha 5, Zordon, and the kids from Angel Grove celebrate Christmas.', 'Alpha 5, Zordon, and the kids from Angel Grove celebrate Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Pmcs23fEC74JTAN5EyTS5ucYF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80615'),
  ('464148757100274972', 'Mighty Morphin Power Rangers: Once & Always', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Family', 'Charlie Haskell, Akihiro Noguchi, Ollie Jones', 'Becca Barnes, Alwyn Dale', 'David Yost, Walter Jones, Charlie Kersh, Steve Cardenas, Catherine Sutherland, Richard Steven Horvitz, Barbara Goodson, Daniel Watterson', 'G', 'After tragedy strikes, an unlikely young hero takes her rightful place among the Power Rangers to face off against the team''s oldest archnemesis.', 'After tragedy strikes, an unlikely young hero takes her rightful place among the Power Rangers to face off against the team''s oldest archnemesis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vc87upO8vcAGj9OmgH3AIz6ikKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1068141'),
  ('585129893087429955', 'Mighty Morphin Power Rangers: The Movie', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Paul Murphy, Bryan Spicer, Ian Jones', 'Arne Olsen', 'Karan Ashley, Johnny Yong Bosch, Steve Cardenas, Jason David Frank, Amy Jo Johnson, David Yost, Jason Narvy, Paul Schrier', 'PG', 'Six incredible teens out-maneuver and defeat evil everywhere as the Mighty Morphin Power Rangers, but this time the Power Rangers may have met their match when they face off with Ivan Ooze, the most sinister monster the galaxy has ever seen.', 'Six incredible teens out-maneuver and defeat evil everywhere as the Mighty Morphin Power Rangers, but this time the Power Rangers may have met their match when they face off with Ivan Ooze, the most sinister monster the galaxy has ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcLbHqs80dchv0byHivhdwHKEup.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9070'),
  ('1029744048554278421', 'Mighty Oak', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sean McNamara', 'Matt Allen', 'Janel Parrish, Alexa PenaVega, Carlos PenaVega, Tommy Ragen, Levi Dylan, Raven-Symoné, Ben Milliken, Nana Ghana', 'PG-13', 'Gina Jackson''s life is shattered when her brother and lead vocalist of the band Army of Love, Vaughn, is killed in a tragic accident. Ten years later, young guitar prodigy Oak Scoggins enters her orbit, and she becomes convinced that this young man is the reincarnation of Vaughn. But is he?', 'Gina Jackson''s life is shattered when her brother and lead vocalist of the band Army of Love, Vaughn, is killed in a tragic accident. Ten years later, young guitar prodigy Oak Scoggins enters her orbit, and she becomes convinced that this young man is the reincarnation of Vaughn. But is he?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/558uVM7dVqT35hNy1SKMRcpTdhi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:711696'),
  ('1114461714298617949', 'Mighty Victoria', 2021, 'Drama, Western', 'Raúl Ramón', 'Raúl Ramón', 'Damián Alcázar, Gerardo Oñate, Edgar Vivar, Luis Felipe Tovar, Eduardo España, Lorena de la Torre, Joaquín Cosío, Roberto Sosa', null, 'Feature film located at the beginning of the 20th-century which tells the story of the town "La Esperanza", whose dying mining boom receives a fatal blow.', 'Feature film located at the beginning of the 20th-century which tells the story of the town "La Esperanza", whose dying mining boom receives a fatal blow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65zJz7URhnBhVIYNqSVPJyMQCo8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:699998'),
  ('548466139572221468', 'Mignon Has Left', 1988, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Francesca Archibugi, Luigi Verga, Giorgio Gobbi', 'Claudia Sbarigia, Gloria Malatesta, Francesca Archibugi', 'Stefania Sandrelli, Jean-Pierre Duriez, Leonardo Ruta, Céline Beauvallet, Massimo Dapporto, Micheline Presle, Francesca Antonelli, Lorenzo De Pasqua', null, 'With her father on trial, 15-year-old Mignon leaves Paris to stay with her Italian relatives. The rather prim, snooty teen at first struggles to fit in with the more earthy Forbicioni family, each with their own problems. Eventually she bonds with her lovestruck little cousin Giorgio—who''ll learn important life lessons over the course of his summer with Mignon.', 'With her father on trial, 15-year-old Mignon leaves Paris to stay with her Italian relatives. The rather prim, snooty teen at first struggles to fit in with the more earthy Forbicioni family, each with their own problems. Eventually she bonds with her lovestruck little cousin Giorgio—who''ll learn important life lessons over the course of his summer with Mignon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYb54jhrbB2UHFwRALGimRX8vzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56850'),
  ('334098830617245574', 'Migration', 2023, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Benjamin Renner, Guylo Homsy, Gwénolé Oulc''hen', 'Mike White', 'Kumail Nanjiani, Elizabeth Banks, Caspar Jennings, Tresi Gazal, Awkwafina, Carol Kane, Keegan-Michael Key, Danny DeVito', 'PG', 'After a migrating duck family alights on their pond with thrilling tales of far-flung places, the Mallard family embarks on a family road trip, from New England, to New York City, to tropical Jamaica.', 'After a migrating duck family alights on their pond with thrilling tales of far-flung places, the Mallard family embarks on a family road trip, from New England, to New York City, to tropical Jamaica.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldfCF9RhR40mppkzmftxapaHeTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:940551'),
  ('699443040928751752', 'Mikado', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Pascal Morucci, Baya Kasmi, Romain Le Bonniec', 'Baya Kasmi, Olivier Adam, Magaly Richard-Serrano', 'Félix Moati, Vimala Pons, Ramzy Bedia, Patience Munchenbach, Saül Benchetrit, Louis Obry', null, 'Mikado and Laetitia lead an alternative lifestyle aboard a van with their homeschooled children Nuage and Zephir. One day, their van breaks down, forcing them to lead a somewhat ''normal'' life over summer.', 'Mikado and Laetitia lead an alternative lifestyle aboard a van with their homeschooled children Nuage and Zephir. One day, their van breaks down, forcing them to lead a somewhat ''normal'' life over summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziJZqVEFueNEbHyPXs3i4EwrWKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1099985'),
  ('800598660999290232', 'Mikaela', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Daniel Calparsoro, Tommie Ferreras', 'Arturo Ruiz Serrano', 'Antonio Resines, Natalia Azahara, Roger Casamajor, Adriana Torrebejano, Pavel Anton, Javier Albalá, Patricia Vico, Cristina Kovani', null, 'During the eve of the 6th of January, a record-breaking snowstorm sweeps across Spain. In the midst of its chaos, a group of robbers seizes the opportunity to hijack an armoured van. A few meters away is Leo, a finished policeman who has nothing to lose. With the unexpected aid of a young woman, he will try to stop the band from running away with their loot.', 'During the eve of the 6th of January, a record-breaking snowstorm sweeps across Spain. In the midst of its chaos, a group of robbers seizes the opportunity to hijack an armoured van. A few meters away is Leo, a finished policeman who has nothing to lose. With the unexpected aid of a young woman, he will try to stop the band from running away with their loot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jm6lNbpmKcxX6M0pieaKhP6hs3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1315988'),
  ('331350793570581149', 'Mike', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lars Blumers, Laurent Tangy', 'Lars Blumers, Laurent Tirard, Grégoire Vigneron', 'Marc-André Grondin, Christa Théret, Éric Elmosnino, Olivier Barthélémy, Mounir Ait Hamou, Dominique Thomas, Christophe Kourotchkine, Hugo Blumental', null, 'Kembs. 4284 inhabitants. Mike, Fred and J-C, twenty years old, have grown up this Alsace village at the borders of Germany and Switzerland. There''s not a lot to do here. The trio charges, head down, smiling admist general indifference. They keep themselves entertained with football matches, half-baked schemes cooked up in the back of the garage, and motorbike rides. But Mike has something a bit extra : for years now, he''s nursed a genuine passion for cars and has the unfortunate habit of stealing them before innocently putting the back where he found them. It''s his own very personal means of locomotion. More than anything else, he loves driving them and its behind the wheel of a Porsche that he seduces Sandy. He begins a genuine love affair with her. She seems like his best chance, the most luminous one. But Mike is at that uncertain age when choices and new rules impose themselves. Will he know to accept them ?', 'Kembs. 4284 inhabitants. Mike, Fred and J-C, twenty years old, have grown up this Alsace village at the borders of Germany and Switzerland. There''s not a lot to do here. The trio charges, head down, smiling admist general indifference. They keep themselves entertained with football matches, half-baked schemes cooked up in the back of the garage, and motorbike rides. But Mike has something a bit extra : for years now, he''s nursed a genuine passion for cars and has the unfortunate habit of stealing them before innocently putting the back where he found them. It''s his own very personal means of locomotion. More than anything else, he loves driving them and its behind the wheel of a Porsche that he seduces Sandy. He begins a genuine love affair with her. She seems like his best chance, the most luminous one. But Mike is at that uncertain age when choices and new rules impose themselves. Will he know to accept them ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHypYqGjwZ6SAb4A0iExdqugOAM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78112'),
  ('242635231276419126', 'Mike & Nick & Nick & Alice', 2026, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Crime', 'BenDavid Grabinski, Larry Fong, Justin Yu', 'BenDavid Grabinski', 'James Marsden, Vince Vaughn, Eiza González, Keith David, Jimmy Tatro, Stephen Root, Lewis Tan, Ben Schwartz', 'R', 'Two gangsters and the woman they love try to survive the most dangerous night of their lives. As if that wasn’t enough, there’s one wild ingredient added to the mix: a time machine.', 'Two gangsters and the woman they love try to survive the most dangerous night of their lives. As if that wasn’t enough, there’s one wild ingredient added to the mix: a time machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7F0jc75HrSkLVcvOXR2FXAIwuEv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1115544'),
  ('585884020148057875', 'Mike and Dave Need Wedding Dates', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Jake Szymanski, Matthew Clark, Caleb Mikler', 'Brendan O''Brien, Andrew J. Cohen', 'Zac Efron, Adam Devine, Anna Kendrick, Aubrey Plaza, Sam Richardson, Stephen Root, Sugar Lyn Beard, Branscombe Richmond', 'R', 'Mike and Dave are young, adventurous, fun-loving brothers who tend to get out of control at family gatherings. When their sister Jeanie reveals her Hawaiian wedding plans, the rest of the Stangles insist that the brothers bring respectable dates. After placing an ad on Craigslist, the siblings decide to pick Tatiana and Alice, two charming and seemingly normal women. Once they arrive on the island, however, Mike and Dave realize that their companions are ready to get wild and party.', 'Mike and Dave are young, adventurous, fun-loving brothers who tend to get out of control at family gatherings. When their sister Jeanie reveals her Hawaiian wedding plans, the rest of the Stangles insist that the brothers bring respectable dates. After placing an ad on Craigslist, the siblings decide to pick Tatiana and Alice, two charming and seemingly normal women. Once they arrive on the island, however, Mike and Dave realize that their companions are ready to get wild and party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alWBdyvXf1LSixnn1IfID5HMtLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316023'),
  ('968716127273606726', 'Mike Bassett: England Manager', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Steve Barron, Mike Eley, Daniel Flaksman', 'Johnny Smith, Rob Sprackling', 'Ricky Tomlinson, Amanda Redman, Philip Jackson, Bradley Walsh, Martin Bashir, Phill Jupitus, Dean Lennox Kelly, Robbie Gee', null, 'After England''s football (soccer) manager has a heart attack, Mike Bassett is hired as the new manager and promptly announces the team will win the World Cup.', 'After England''s football (soccer) manager has a heart attack, Mike Bassett is hired as the new manager and promptly announces the team will win the World Cup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfbWbgkF5jFOqytHIVnq2eH3Gy5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19962'),
  ('469622012129631000', 'Mike Birbiglia: My Girlfriend''s Boyfriend', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Seth Barrish, Benjamin Kasulke', 'Mike Birbiglia', 'Mike Birbiglia', null, 'Mike Birbiglia shares a lifetime of romantic blunders and misunderstandings. On this painfully honest but hilarious journey, Birbiglia struggles to find reason in an area where it may be impossible to find: love.', 'Mike Birbiglia shares a lifetime of romantic blunders and misunderstandings. On this painfully honest but hilarious journey, Birbiglia struggles to find reason in an area where it may be impossible to find: love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGLGbjB68fJ8Z0hhCUoCeWiwq1P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216652'),
  ('629063756120628350', 'Mike Birbiglia: Thank God for Jokes', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Seth Barrish, Benjamin Kasulke, Mike Birbiglia', 'Mike Birbiglia', 'Mike Birbiglia, Jimmy Kimmel', null, 'Mike Birbiglia declares that a joke should never end with "I’m joking." In his all-new comedy, Birbiglia tiptoes hilariously through the minefield that is modern-day joke-telling. Join Mike as he learns that the same jokes that elicit laughter have the power to produce tears, rage, and a whole lot of getting yelled at. Ultimately it''s a show that asks, “How far should we go for the laugh?”', 'Mike Birbiglia declares that a joke should never end with "I’m joking." In his all-new comedy, Birbiglia tiptoes hilariously through the minefield that is modern-day joke-telling. Join Mike as he learns that the same jokes that elicit laughter have the power to produce tears, rage, and a whole lot of getting yelled at. Ultimately it''s a show that asks, “How far should we go for the laugh?”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6U5qW82Cw2ugeoljgWAmB0MR8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442087'),
  ('751098014825304587', 'Mike Birbiglia: The Old Man and the Pool', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Seth Barrish', 'Mike Birbiglia', 'Mike Birbiglia', 'PG-13', 'Comedian Mike Birbiglia dives headlong into mortality, medical tests, nature''s pillows and an overchlorinated YMCA pool in this candid one-man show.', 'Comedian Mike Birbiglia dives headlong into mortality, medical tests, nature''s pillows and an overchlorinated YMCA pool in this candid one-man show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rq4c90wsRYIdWAIl0rMt3Ebzgp2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1199400'),
  ('639666162554733448', 'Mike Birbiglia: What I Should Have Said Was Nothing', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Cisco Henson', 'Joe Birbiglia, Mike Birbiglia', 'Mike Birbiglia', null, 'Mike says, "A few years ago my therapist suggested I keep a journal of all the crazy things that were going on in my life, so that I could keep things in perspective. Around the same time audiences were demanding more material, and I realized that other people might enjoy these stories-so I started sending them out to my mailing list. Now, my Secret Public Journal has become a Comedy Central special and DVD for all the world to see. Not sure this is what my therapist had in mind."', 'Mike says, "A few years ago my therapist suggested I keep a journal of all the crazy things that were going on in my life, so that I could keep things in perspective. Around the same time audiences were demanding more material, and I realized that other people might enjoy these stories-so I started sending them out to my mailing list. Now, my Secret Public Journal has become a Comedy Central special and DVD for all the world to see. Not sure this is what my therapist had in mind."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRPrSOkeR2KPsmBaskxDqeaDXW1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55804'),
  ('698994725125787183', 'Mike Hammer: Murder Takes All', 1989, 'Action, Crime, TV Movie', 'John Nicolella', 'Rudy Day, Mark Edward Edens', 'Stacy Keach, Lynda Carter, Lindsay Bloom, Don Stroud, Jim Carrey, Stacy Galina, Lyle Alzado, Royce D. Applegate', 'NR', 'Mike Hammer is kidnapped and led to believe it is the work of a Las Vegas entertainer, but soon realises somebody else is involved.', 'Mike Hammer is kidnapped and led to believe it is the work of a Las Vegas entertainer, but soon realises somebody else is involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wzrvCDvfA30nNIKM19RlX6k9ul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133110'),
  ('973393971872598284', 'Mike Tyson: Undisputed Truth', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Spike Lee, Matthew Libatique, Philip Marcus', 'Kiki Tyson', 'Mike Tyson', null, 'Mike Tyson''s one-man show is a fascinating journey into his storied life and career. MIKE TYSON: UNDISPUTED TRUTH is a rare, personal look inside the life and mind of one of the most feared men ever to wear the heavyweight crown. Directed by Academy Award® nominee Spike Lee, this riveting one-man show goes beyond the headlines, behind the scenes and between the lines to deliver a must-see theatrical knockout.', 'Mike Tyson''s one-man show is a fascinating journey into his storied life and career. MIKE TYSON: UNDISPUTED TRUTH is a rare, personal look inside the life and mind of one of the most feared men ever to wear the heavyweight crown. Directed by Academy Award® nominee Spike Lee, this riveting one-man show goes beyond the headlines, behind the scenes and between the lines to deliver a must-see theatrical knockout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVPuUYpAQTH01Hko5VUnZKkkcPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210041'),
  ('573042056487873439', 'Mike''s Murder', 1984, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'James Bridges, James Dillon, Victoria E. Rhodes', 'James Bridges', 'Debra Winger, Mark Keyloun, Darrell Larson, Brooke Alderson, Paul Winfield, Robert Crosson, Dan Shor, William Ostrander', 'R', 'Betty has a crush on her tennis instructor Mike. He promises to call her for a date, but never does – she doesn’t know he sells drugs on the side. After botching a deal on someone else’s turf, Mike has to disappear for a while. He contacts Betty – then he’s killed before they can meet. Betty tries to find out what happened, leading her straight into a hornet''s nest of vice.', 'Betty has a crush on her tennis instructor Mike. He promises to call her for a date, but never does – she doesn’t know he sells drugs on the side. After botching a deal on someone else’s turf, Mike has to disappear for a while. He contacts Betty – then he’s killed before they can meet. Betty tries to find out what happened, leading her straight into a hornet''s nest of vice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOL77kZUxKqYmvc17WRAAm4Nk7q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31043'),
  ('944880520988926553', 'Mike''s New Car', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Pete Docter, Roger Gould', null, 'Billy Crystal, John Goodman', 'G', 'Mike discovers that being the top-ranking laugh collector at Monsters, Inc. has its benefits – in particular, earning enough money to buy a six-wheel-drive car that''s loaded with gadgets. That new-car smell doesn''t last long enough, however, as Sulley jump-starts an ill-fated road test that teaches Mike the true meaning of buyer''s remorse.', 'Mike discovers that being the top-ranking laugh collector at Monsters, Inc. has its benefits – in particular, earning enough money to buy a six-wheel-drive car that''s loaded with gadgets. That new-car smell doesn''t last long enough, however, as Sulley jump-starts an ill-fated road test that teaches Mike the true meaning of buyer''s remorse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOnNx05XOPFeQhOqpbPI0lwEf4N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13931'),
  ('241126962340682709', 'Mikel''s Death', 1984, 'Drama, Crime', 'Imanol Uribe, Javier Aguirresarobe, Jesús Julián Fernández Urbina', 'José Ángel Rebolledo, Imanol Uribe', 'Imanol Arias, Montserrat Salvador, Fernando Telletxea, Xabier Elorriaga, Ramón Barea, Amaia Lasa, Juan María Segues, Daniel Dicenta', null, 'Opening at the funeral mass for Mikel, we flashback to those that played a part in Mikel''s life and death; his estranged wife, his traditional Basque mother, a female impersonator and friend to Mikel in his coming out, and even the local priest.', 'Opening at the funeral mass for Mikel, we flashback to those that played a part in Mikel''s life and death; his estranged wife, his traditional Basque mother, a female impersonator and friend to Mikel in his coming out, and even the local priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyWY9GyJP4qHX15iElvKvjO3e8z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187857'),
  ('71395486561492872', 'Mikey', 1992, 'Horror', 'Dennis Dimster, Robert L. Levy, Tom Jewett', 'Jonathan Glassner', 'Brian Bonsall, Josie Bissett, Ashley Laurence, Mimi Craven, Whit Hertford, John Diehl, Mark Venturini, Laura Robinson', 'R', 'Mikey just needs a good stable home. He''s bounced from foster home to foster home his whole life. He finally lands himself with a new loving family, but their perfect little child is not what he appears to be. His previous caretakers all died of mysterious "accidents" that weren''t really accidents at all. Mikey is a cold blooded killer, and it doesn''t take long for him to aim his sights on his new adoptive family and anyone else who stands in his way.', 'Mikey just needs a good stable home. He''s bounced from foster home to foster home his whole life. He finally lands himself with a new loving family, but their perfect little child is not what he appears to be. His previous caretakers all died of mysterious "accidents" that weren''t really accidents at all. Mikey is a cold blooded killer, and it doesn''t take long for him to aim his sights on his new adoptive family and anyone else who stands in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LRKZKU6DcC4d82ndUonCUtsyrV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87321'),
  ('478223188873079741', 'Mikey and Nicky', 1976, 'Crime, Drama', 'Elaine May, Michele Ader, Edward Folger', 'Elaine May', 'Peter Falk, John Cassavetes, Ned Beatty, Rose Arrick, Carol Grace, William Hickey, Sanford Meisner, Joyce Van Patten', 'R', 'Nick is desperate, holed up in a cheap hotel, suffering from an ulcer and convinced that a local mob boss wants him killed. Terrified, he calls Mikey, his friend since childhood and a fellow gangster. So begins a long night…', 'Nick is desperate, holed up in a cheap hotel, suffering from an ulcer and convinced that a local mob boss wants him killed. Terrified, he calls Mikey, his friend since childhood and a fellow gangster. So begins a long night…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnHC1OJ1EbdOX97nmXVYrXFgiQT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59143'),
