  ('911708280700746084', 'Milada', 2017, 'Drama, History', 'David Mrnka, Vlastimil Kadeřábek, Martin Štrba', 'David Mrnka, Robert Gant, Robert J. Conant', 'Ayelet Zurer, Robert Gant, Daniel Rchichev, Karina Rchichev, Taťjana Medvecká, Vica Kerekes, Igor Orozovič, Alena Mihulová', null, 'Pre-WWII Czech democratic politician Milada Horáková was one of the first victims of the communist regime in Czechoslovakia. Opposing the 1948 coup but not leaving the country, she was arrested and tried for treason on fabricated charges in a show trial broadcast on the radio.', 'Pre-WWII Czech democratic politician Milada Horáková was one of the first victims of the communist regime in Czechoslovakia. Opposing the 1948 coup but not leaving the country, she was arrested and tried for treason on fabricated charges in a show trial broadcast on the radio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zp6Cvp1VVaPz5Ort9liGtF8Z2dZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494282'),
  ('679100212870669404', 'Milagros: Una osa extraordinaria', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Eduardo Schuldt', null, 'Melany Segura, Nicole Valera, Ann Giraldo, Genaro Vásquez', null, 'Milagros is a bear who, after experiencing many adventures, decides to fulfil her destiny: preserving her species and telling her story to raise awareness about wildlife conservation.', 'Milagros is a bear who, after experiencing many adventures, decides to fulfil her destiny: preserving her species and telling her story to raise awareness about wildlife conservation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOsKJx4dvVopH5XI9IW97zWxZpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1133792'),
  ('194339348274837761', 'Milan – Palermo: The Return', 2007, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Claudio Fragasso, Giovanni Mammolotti', 'Rossella Drudi', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Raoul Bova, Ricky Memphis, Simone Corrente, Gabriella Pession, Enrico Lo Verso, Libero De Rienzo, Romina Mondello', null, 'Turi Leofonte is released from prison after eleven years and asks for the surviving members of his old security detail to escort him back in Sicily to get revenge on his former associates – something the authorities indulge to seize a large stash of Mafia money he claims to have access to.', 'Turi Leofonte is released from prison after eleven years and asks for the surviving members of his old security detail to escort him back in Sicily to get revenge on his former associates – something the authorities indulge to seize a large stash of Mafia money he claims to have access to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEBOf0MdbaaLwE3lnYZve9pS5dn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42423'),
