  ('498060978400878871', 'Mile 22', 2018, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ana María Cabrera, Eric Heffron, Craig Comstock', 'Lea Carpenter', 'Mark Wahlberg, Lauren Cohan, Iko Uwais, John Malkovich, Ronda Rousey, Terry Kinney, Carlo Alban, Emily Skeggs', 'R', 'An elite group of American operatives, aided by a top-secret tactical command team, must transport an asset who holds life-threatening information to an extraction point 22 miles away through the hostile streets of an Asian city.', 'An elite group of American operatives, aided by a top-secret tactical command team, must transport an asset who holds life-threatening information to an extraction point 22 miles away through the hostile streets of an Asian city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2L8ehd95eSW9x7KINYtZmRkAlrZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347375'),
  ('526656411157720624', 'Milea', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Deni Rachman, Nur Muhammad Taufik, Andi Setiawan', 'Pidi Baiq, Titien Wattimena', 'Iqbaal Ramadhan, Vanesha Prescilla, Ira Wibowo, Bucek Depp, Happy Salma, Muhammad Farhan, Maudy Koesnaedi, Jerome Kurnia', null, 'Years after his teen romance with Milea, a now-adult Dilan tells his version of their love story when a high school reunion brings them back together.', 'Years after his teen romance with Milea, a now-adult Dilan tells his version of their love story when a high school reunion brings them back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRs5EYnviBBn79lQwGW2JLZp93v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642657'),
