  ('613580791073794280', 'Miley Cyrus: Something Beautiful', 2025, 'Music, Fantasy', 'Miley Cyrus, Jacob Bixenman, Benoît Debie', 'Miley Cyrus, Brendan Walter, Jacob Bixenman', 'Miley Cyrus, Naomi Campbell, Maxx Morando, Brittany Howard, James Kaliardos, Jonathan Rado', 'NR', 'A one of a kind pop opera fueled by fantasy, featuring thirteen original new songs from the visual album Something Beautiful by Miley Cyrus.', 'A one of a kind pop opera fueled by fantasy, featuring thirteen original new songs from the visual album Something Beautiful by Miley Cyrus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wSAqnBgzbCleDEMlJVs1YOrlnZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1393017'),
  ('475266717348967680', 'Milf', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Scott D. Wheeler, Mark Atkins, Jack Jenkins', 'Jonathan Haug', 'Jack Cullison, Philip Marlatt, Joseph Booton, Ramon Camacho, Amy Lindsay, Molinee Green, Rachel Riley, Jamie Bernadette', 'R', 'A group of nerdy college guys who can''t seem to connect with girls their own age discover the excitement of hooking up with sexy older women.', 'A group of nerdy college guys who can''t seem to connect with girls their own age discover the excitement of hooking up with sexy older women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iciKTqt0ioOh6TFaXXVUqKPVj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47407'),
  ('353636168089296198', 'MILF', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Axelle Laffont, Pierre Aïm, Natalie Engelstein', 'Stéphane Kramer, Jérôme L''hotsky', 'Virginie Ledoyen, Marie-Josée Croze, Axelle Laffont, Matthias Dandois, Victor Meutelet, Waël Sersoub, Florence Thomassin, Rémi Pedevilla', null, 'Three childhood friends - Elise, Sonia and Cecile - leave for a summer in the South of France to help clear Cecile’s holiday house before it is put up for sale. There, they soon become the prime targets of three horny young men, for whom these single forty-year-old women are much more attractive than girls their age.', 'Three childhood friends - Elise, Sonia and Cecile - leave for a summer in the South of France to help clear Cecile’s holiday house before it is put up for sale. There, they soon become the prime targets of three horny young men, for whom these single forty-year-old women are much more attractive than girls their age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBU82NPKF1LOAD9D3jLUqypyEdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499726'),
  ('246860507082568696', 'Mili', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Mathukutty Xavier, Sunil Karthikeyan, Kapil Tanwar', 'Noble Babu Thomas, Alfred Kurian Joseph, Mathukutty Xavier', 'Janhvi Kapoor, Manoj Pahwa, Sunny Kaushal, Vikram Kochhar, Seema Pahwa, Rajesh Jais, Hasleen Kaur, Anuraag Arora', null, 'Mili Naudiyal, a nursing graduate is planning to move to Canada. She takes up a job at a food outlet for the time being but her sudden disappearance without a clue leaves her loved ones in a desperate search for her in this survival drama.', 'Mili Naudiyal, a nursing graduate is planning to move to Canada. She takes up a job at a food outlet for the time being but her sudden disappearance without a clue leaves her loved ones in a desperate search for her in this survival drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJ36QCd5SPRpivJkVgZMqKyfgCz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:908397'),
  ('289482479215052475', 'Military Academy', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Granz Henman, Gernot Roll', 'Carsten Funke, Robert Löhr, Oliver Philipp', 'Franz Dinda, Florian Lukas, Oona-Devi Liebich, Axel Stein, Jan Henrik Stahlberg, Christian Sengewald, Till Trenkel, Ronald Nitschke', null, 'The movie deals with a guy who gets to join the German Bundeswehr involuntarily because a colleague loses his denial papers in order to get the chance to get down on his girlfriend. When entering the Bundeswehr he acts like a giant idiot and of course gets in one room with some of the biggest losers around. The loser turns out to be a hero and leads his loser-colleagues to win a contest with the local US army squad.', 'The movie deals with a guy who gets to join the German Bundeswehr involuntarily because a colleague loses his denial papers in order to get the chance to get down on his girlfriend. When entering the Bundeswehr he acts like a giant idiot and of course gets in one room with some of the biggest losers around. The loser turns out to be a hero and leads his loser-colleagues to win a contest with the local US army squad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5v55XXxQjmFAaPKK3jrpyJxI3ZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4436'),
  ('1079689890220094612', 'Military Wives', 2020, 'Drama', 'Peter Cattaneo, Hubert Taczanowski, Barry Keil', 'Rachel Tunnard, Rosanne Flynn', 'Kristin Scott Thomas, Sharon Horgan, Amy James-Kelly, Lara Rossi, Gaby French, Emma Lowndes, India Ria Amarteifio, Laura Checkley', null, 'Inspired by global phenomenon of military wives choirs, the story celebrates a band of misfit women who form a choir on a military base. As unexpected bonds of friendship flourish, music and laughter transform their lives, helping each other to overcome their fears for loved ones in combat.', 'Inspired by global phenomenon of military wives choirs, the story celebrates a band of misfit women who form a choir on a military base. As unexpected bonds of friendship flourish, music and laughter transform their lives, helping each other to overcome their fears for loved ones in combat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzeS80jjMuPrOcymdL8RiwYaAWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617784'),
  ('1068564135534169811', 'Milius', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Zak Knutson, Joey Figueroa, Joey Figueroa', null, 'John Milius, Steven Spielberg, George Lucas, Francis Ford Coppola, Robert Zemeckis, Martin Scorsese, Bryan Singer, Richard Dreyfuss', null, 'The life story of ‘Zen Anarchist’ filmmaker John Milius, one of the most influential storytellers of his generation.', 'The life story of ‘Zen Anarchist’ filmmaker John Milius, one of the most influential storytellers of his generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCf2e0HvH2T42M4qxL25zu4dvU8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173467'),
  ('615781103882966419', 'Milk', 1998, 'Drama', 'Adrian Wild, Andrea Arnold', 'Andrea Arnold', 'Lynda Steadman, Stephen McGann, Lee Oakes', null, 'Andrea Arnold’s directorial debut consists of a woman named Hetty that has a unique way of dealing with the unexpected death of her child.', 'Andrea Arnold’s directorial debut consists of a woman named Hetty that has a unique way of dealing with the unexpected death of her child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vG9pb7R5RN43os5MoJQKh8SzaXh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168693'),
  ('273822696302883281', 'Milk', 2008, 'History, Drama', 'Gus Van Sant, Harris Savides, Susan Alegria', 'Dustin Lance Black', 'Sean Penn, Emile Hirsch, Josh Brolin, Diego Luna, James Franco, Alison Pill, Victor Garber, Denis O''Hare', 'R', 'The true story of Harvey Milk, the first openly gay man ever elected to public office. In San Francisco in the late 1970s, Harvey Milk becomes an activist for gay rights and inspires others to join him in his fight for equal rights that should be available to all Americans.', 'The true story of Harvey Milk, the first openly gay man ever elected to public office. In San Francisco in the late 1970s, Harvey Milk becomes an activist for gay rights and inspires others to join him in his fight for equal rights that should be available to all Americans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ot4ImF4b7QbS6XsTdMH3pWxNmX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10139'),
  ('1089349523130048725', 'Milk', 2009, 'Drama', 'Semih Kaplanoğlu, Marc Nouyrigat, Özgür Eken', 'Orçun Köksal, Semih Kaplanoğlu', 'Melih Selçuk, Rıza Akın, Saadet Işıl Aksoy, Başak Köklükaya, Tansu Biçer, Tülin Özen', null, 'A high school graduate, Yusuf could not pass the university entrance exam. Writing poetry is his greatest passion and some of his poems are being printed in various obscure literary journals. But neither these poems, nor the rapidly falling price of the milk they sell, are being of any benefit to Yusuf and Zehra''s lives. When Yusuf finds out about Zehra''s secret affair with the town''s stationmaster he gets disconcerted. Will he find the way to cope with his anxiety for the unknown future, the rapid change that he is going through and the pain of taking a step into adulthood and leaving his youth behind', 'A high school graduate, Yusuf could not pass the university entrance exam. Writing poetry is his greatest passion and some of his poems are being printed in various obscure literary journals. But neither these poems, nor the rapidly falling price of the milk they sell, are being of any benefit to Yusuf and Zehra''s lives. When Yusuf finds out about Zehra''s secret affair with the town''s stationmaster he gets disconcerted. Will he find the way to cope with his anxiety for the unknown future, the rapid change that he is going through and the pain of taking a step into adulthood and leaving his youth behind', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojeiS9uaD2E76LLWiPr8oOHeWLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12471'),
  ('221356214828443264', 'MiLK', 2010, 'Drama', 'Tōru Kamei', 'Takehiko Minato', 'Minori Hatsune, Taijirō Tamura, Ryuki Nishimoto, Takayuki Sakoi', null, 'A woman, born in a cowshed, grows up working a dairy farm. Suffering under the gaze of her male coworkers, she longs for the attention of the newspaper delivery boy.', 'A woman, born in a cowshed, grows up working a dairy farm. Suffering under the gaze of her male coworkers, she longs for the attention of the newspaper delivery boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geo6Wb7kyA0bxJh9r2fBd2AGSjZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734286'),
  ('232957921041574545', 'Milk and Money', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Joe Dougherty, Tedd Pierce', null, 'Porky''s father is going to lose his farm. Porky goes to town with his horse and works a milk route, with a warning that if he breaks a bottle he''s fired. As he''s delivering, cats follow along behind draining the bottles. Meanwhile, Hank Horsefly follows them into town. He stings Dobbin, who crashes and breaks many bottles. They happen upon a horse race and accidentally enter; the horse is merely plodding along until it gets stung again.', 'Porky''s father is going to lose his farm. Porky goes to town with his horse and works a milk route, with a warning that if he breaks a bottle he''s fired. As he''s delivering, cats follow along behind draining the bottles. Meanwhile, Hank Horsefly follows them into town. He stings Dobbin, who crashes and breaks many bottles. They happen upon a horse race and accidentally enter; the horse is merely plodding along until it gets stung again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6XlsZ0m4XnJYAez66Sl5LZQjKV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201966'),
  ('646617064711224686', 'Milk Money', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Richard Benjamin, David Watkin, Vincent Agostino', 'John Mattson', 'Melanie Griffith, Ed Harris, Michael Patrick Carter, Malcolm McDowell, Anne Heche, Casey Siemaszko, Philip Bosco, Adam LaVorgna', 'PG-13', 'Three young boys pool their money and pay V, a kindhearted prostitute, to strip for them. Afterward, she drives them home to the suburbs -- but then her car breaks down. It''s just as well, though, because a mobster named Waltzer is after her, and V realizes the suburbs are the perfect place to hide. But things get a lot more complicated when V falls in love with Tom, a single father who is unaware of her real profession.', 'Three young boys pool their money and pay V, a kindhearted prostitute, to strip for them. Afterward, she drives them home to the suburbs -- but then her car breaks down. It''s just as well, though, because a mobster named Waltzer is after her, and V realizes the suburbs are the perfect place to hide. But things get a lot more complicated when V falls in love with Tom, a single father who is unaware of her real profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/od8SCOMLDq4iRYaHNqihQVn1SNE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8986'),
  ('861937931154123446', 'Milk Teeth', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Sophia Bösch, Aleksandra Medianikova', 'Sophia Bösch, Roman Gielke', 'Mathilde Bundschuh, Susanne Wolff, Ulrich Matthes, Viola Hinz, Lola Dockhorn, Karin Neuhäuser, Andreas Lust, Vedat Erincin', null, 'Skalde lives in a small rural community, far from a world that may no longer exist. She is an interloper in her own home, having been born to an ‘outsider’ mother and therefore marked by a social stigma she cannot easily erase. Displaying a loyalty to the codes of the community, she has earned the respect of the village elder. However, when she encounters a mysterious girl in the local woods, Skalde risks everything by befriending her, eventually giving the girl a home.', 'Skalde lives in a small rural community, far from a world that may no longer exist. She is an interloper in her own home, having been born to an ‘outsider’ mother and therefore marked by a social stigma she cannot easily erase. Displaying a loyalty to the codes of the community, she has earned the respect of the village elder. However, when she encounters a mysterious girl in the local woods, Skalde risks everything by befriending her, eventually giving the girl a home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJv3gA9jMbqosPuWozUuD6EXIyw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027938'),
  ('55043345195949074', 'Milka: A Film About Taboos', 1980, 'Drama', 'Rauni Mollberg, Veikko Aaltonen, Esa Vuorinen', 'Seppo Heinonen, Jussi Niilekselä, Rauni Mollberg', 'Irma Huntus, Leena Suomu, Matti Turunen, Eikka Lehtonen, Esa Niemelä, Hellin Auvinen-Salmi, Voitto Harju, Sonja Joensuu', null, 'Based on a novel by the late Finnish writer Timo Mukka, this simple story focuses on what happens when Milka (Irma Huntus), a girl barely out of childhood, gets pregnant by Ojanen (Matti Turunen) a rustic fieldhand. Her own mother had been hoping to marry Ojanen, and her daughter''s pregnancy turns their lives around. Set in the Lapp country of northern Finland, the scenery is breathtaking, made even more so by the isolation of the region. A sense of natural solitude is underscored by a slow-moving dialogue interspersed with long silences, and the connection between nature and the dialogue is underscored as the young Milka recites poetry while out in the countryside. The fate of Milka and her mother, however, is connected to the decision that Ojanen makes at the end.', 'Based on a novel by the late Finnish writer Timo Mukka, this simple story focuses on what happens when Milka (Irma Huntus), a girl barely out of childhood, gets pregnant by Ojanen (Matti Turunen) a rustic fieldhand. Her own mother had been hoping to marry Ojanen, and her daughter''s pregnancy turns their lives around. Set in the Lapp country of northern Finland, the scenery is breathtaking, made even more so by the isolation of the region. A sense of natural solitude is underscored by a slow-moving dialogue interspersed with long silences, and the connection between nature and the dialogue is underscored as the young Milka recites poetry while out in the countryside. The fate of Milka and her mother, however, is connected to the decision that Ojanen makes at the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azb1stZS0pTtKeDIwEtebUOW0Nv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263579'),
  ('523834646895067731', 'Mill Horse', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Atıf Yılmaz, Salih Dikişçi', 'Suphi Tekniker, Atıf Yılmaz', 'İlyas Salman, Şener Şen, Yaprak Özdemiroğlu, Ayşen Gruda, Şevket Altuğ, Altan Erkekli, İhsan Yüce, Nuri Tuğ', null, 'Ali, an honest and honorable man, moves to Istanbul when he is transferred there. He moves in with his sister Hacer and brother-in-law Yakup. Yakup''s niece Ayşe also lives in the same house. From the day he starts his job as a civil servant, Ali reacts against the swindlers and bribe-takers around him. As a result, his boss and other civil servants become uncomfortable with the situation. When Yakup runs away with the money he collected to build a mosque, Ali and Ayşe are left alone. Not wanting to leave each other, the two get married. Ali is fired from his job for preventing the civil servants from taking bribes and goes to the village with Ayşe. Yakup, who has fled to Istanbul, calls Ali and Ayşe to join him at his insistence. Ali and his family, who go to Yakup''s side out of desperation, will never be able to escape their troubles.', 'Ali, an honest and honorable man, moves to Istanbul when he is transferred there. He moves in with his sister Hacer and brother-in-law Yakup. Yakup''s niece Ayşe also lives in the same house. From the day he starts his job as a civil servant, Ali reacts against the swindlers and bribe-takers around him. As a result, his boss and other civil servants become uncomfortable with the situation. When Yakup runs away with the money he collected to build a mosque, Ali and Ayşe are left alone. Not wanting to leave each other, the two get married. Ali is fired from his job for preventing the civil servants from taking bribes and goes to the village with Ayşe. Yakup, who has fled to Istanbul, calls Ali and Ayşe to join him at his insistence. Ali and his family, who go to Yakup''s side out of desperation, will never be able to escape their troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SSUxzwbyFcIaUoTWaHdr3arHfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205056'),
  ('238187951584239092', 'Mill of the Stone Women', 1960, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Giorgio Ferroni, Pier Ludovico Pavoni, Giuliano Betti', 'Remigio Del Grosso, Giorgio Ferroni, Ugo Liberatore', 'Pierre Brice, Scilla Gabel, Dany Carrel, Herbert A. E. Böhme, Wolfgang Preiss, Marco Guglielmi, Olga Solbelli, Liana Orfei', null, 'Hans von Arnam travels to a Flemish village to study a strange carousel located in an old windmill that displays famous murderesses and other notorious women from history. Professor Gregorius Wahl, owner of the windmill, warns Hans to stay away from his mysterious daughter Elfi, in order to keep Hans from discovering the horrible secret shared by the Professor and Elfi''s Doctor.', 'Hans von Arnam travels to a Flemish village to study a strange carousel located in an old windmill that displays famous murderesses and other notorious women from history. Professor Gregorius Wahl, owner of the windmill, warns Hans to stay away from his mysterious daughter Elfi, in order to keep Hans from discovering the horrible secret shared by the Professor and Elfi''s Doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUNBJPOr7J8qomqirXfcwtxN34i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43036'),
  ('1066266617233904869', 'Milla', 2018, 'Drama', 'Valérie Massadian, Mel Massadian, Robin Fresson', 'Valérie Massadian', 'Severine Jonckeere, Luc Chessel, Ethan Jonckeere, Élisabeth Cabart, Franck Williams, Valérie Massadian', 'NR', 'A young woman struggles to overcome lost love, unplanned motherhood and ghostly apparitions.', 'A young woman struggles to overcome lost love, unplanned motherhood and ghostly apparitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdp9rlZQamS3eenB6cejxilOOGz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465672'),
  ('775238607400287367', 'Millennium', 1989, 'Science Fiction', 'Michael Anderson, Rene Ohashi, John Harris', 'John Varley', 'Kris Kristofferson, Cheryl Ladd, Daniel J. Travanti, Robert Joy, Al Waxman, Lloyd Bochner, Brent Carver, David McIlwraith', 'PG-13', 'An investigator seeking the cause of an airline disaster discovers the involvement of an organisation of time travellers from a future Earth irreparably polluted who seek to rejuvenate the human race from those about to die in the past. Based on a novel by John Varley.', 'An investigator seeking the cause of an airline disaster discovers the involvement of an organisation of time travellers from a future Earth irreparably polluted who seek to rejuvenate the human race from those about to die in the past. Based on a novel by John Varley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFGCK7RnFnRXR6CweAhQw030Zv7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4296'),
  ('731888246120123300', 'Millennium Mambo', 2001, 'Drama', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Chu Tien-Wen', 'Shu Qi, Jack Kao, Duan Chun-hao, Doze Niu Cheng-Tse, Jun Takeuchi, Yi-Hsuan Chen, Ko Takeuchi, Hsu Hui-Ni', 'R', 'Vicky recalls her romances with her exes Hao Hao and Jack in the neon-lit clubs of Taipei.', 'Vicky recalls her romances with her exes Hao Hao and Jack in the neon-lit clubs of Taipei.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSc6tOp1yoAFbZqxG5XVGHcFvRN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11553'),
  ('406055041458959059', 'Miller''s Crossing', 1990, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Joel Coen, Barry Sonnenfeld, Gregory Jacobs', 'Ethan Coen, Joel Coen', 'Gabriel Byrne, Marcia Gay Harden, John Turturro, Jon Polito, J.E. Freeman, Albert Finney, Mike Starr, Al Mancini', 'R', 'Set in 1929, a political boss and his advisor have a parting of the ways when they both fall for the same woman.', 'Set in 1929, a political boss and his advisor have a parting of the ways when they both fall for the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i83gYdglRCjCRLSsmCk5nRWRmDM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379'),
  ('48567309283372417', 'Miller''s Girl', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Jade Halley Bartlett, Daniel Brothers, Michael A. Toscano', 'Jade Halley Bartlett', 'Jenna Ortega, Martin Freeman, Bashir Salahuddin, Gideon Adlon, Dagmara Dominczyk, Christine Adams, Augustine Hargrave, Elyssa Samsel', 'R', 'A talented young writer embarks on a creative odyssey when her teacher assigns a project that entangles them both.', 'A talented young writer embarks on a creative odyssey when her teacher assigns a project that entangles them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieU0zUj7WhE0GrgpgofRH0sNjbI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026436'),
  ('181485696053681590', 'Milli Vanilli', 2023, 'Music, Documentary', 'Luke Korem, Gabriel Patay', null, 'Fab Morvan, Rob Pilatus, Downtown Julie Brown, Timbaland, Diane Warren', null, 'The story of Robert Pilatus and Fabrice Morvan, who became fast friends during their youth in Germany. With Rob coming from a broken home and Fabrice having left an abusive household, they shared a similar upbringing, as well as a future goal: to become famous superstars. In a few short years, their dreams came true. Rob and Fab, better known as Milli Vanilli, became the world''s most popular pop duo in 1990 and won the GRAMMY for Best New Artist. However, their ascension to success came with a devastating price that ultimately led to their infamous undoing.', 'The story of Robert Pilatus and Fabrice Morvan, who became fast friends during their youth in Germany. With Rob coming from a broken home and Fabrice having left an abusive household, they shared a similar upbringing, as well as a future goal: to become famous superstars. In a few short years, their dreams came true. Rob and Fab, better known as Milli Vanilli, became the world''s most popular pop duo in 1990 and won the GRAMMY for Best New Artist. However, their ascension to success came with a devastating price that ultimately led to their infamous undoing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVC6z68GbLHqf4LCgJUGfArlzXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1123287'),
  ('179123343375550497', 'Millie', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Francis Dillon, Ernest Haller, Arthur Lange', null, 'Helen Twelvetrees, Lilyan Tashman, Robert Ames, James Hall, John Halliday, Joan Blondell, Anita Louise, Edmund Breese', 'NR', 'After a tumultuous first marriage, Millie Blake learns to love her newfound independence and drags her feet on the possibility of remarriage. The years pass, and now Millie''s daughter garners the attentions of men - men who once devoted their time to her mother.', 'After a tumultuous first marriage, Millie Blake learns to love her newfound independence and drags her feet on the possibility of remarriage. The years pass, and now Millie''s daughter garners the attentions of men - men who once devoted their time to her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t50S1hpkxW5uGh9Kl8xawIvnDIi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156360'),
  ('1043573838597445660', 'Million Dollar Arm', 2014, 'Drama', 'Craig Gillespie, Seher Aly Latif, Michael McCue', 'Tom McCarthy', 'Jon Hamm, Aasif Mandvi, Bill Paxton, Suraj Sharma, Madhur Mittal, Lake Bell, Pitobash, Alan Arkin', 'PG', 'In a last-ditch effort to save his career, sports agent JB Bernstein dreams up a wild game plan to find Major League Baseball’s next great pitcher from a pool of cricket players in India. He soon discovers two young men who can throw a fastball but know nothing about the game of baseball. Or America. It’s an incredible and touching journey that will change them all — especially JB, who learns valuable lessons about teamwork, commitment and family.', 'In a last-ditch effort to save his career, sports agent JB Bernstein dreams up a wild game plan to find Major League Baseball’s next great pitcher from a pool of cricket players in India. He soon discovers two young men who can throw a fastball but know nothing about the game of baseball. Or America. It’s an incredible and touching journey that will change them all — especially JB, who learns valuable lessons about teamwork, commitment and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nO5Hq7fJhxmhuycELyVX6FamOjl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198185'),
  ('335097951371819216', 'Million Dollar Baby', 2004, 'Drama', 'Clint Eastwood, Tom Stern, Robert Lorenz', 'Paul Haggis', 'Clint Eastwood, Hilary Swank, Morgan Freeman, Jay Baruchel, Mike Colter, Lucia Rijker, Brían F. O''Byrne, Anthony Mackie', 'PG-13', 'Despondent over a painful estrangement from his daughter, trainer Frankie Dunn isn''t prepared for boxer Maggie Fitzgerald to enter his life. But Maggie''s determined to go pro and to convince Dunn and his cohort to help her.', 'Despondent over a painful estrangement from his daughter, trainer Frankie Dunn isn''t prepared for boxer Maggie Fitzgerald to enter his life. But Maggie''s determined to go pro and to convince Dunn and his cohort to help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcfEqKdWF1zeyvECPqp3mkWLct2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70'),
  ('560021803526213069', 'Million Dollar Crocodile', 2012, 'Crime, Comedy, Horror', 'Lin Lisheng', 'Lin Lisheng, Ma Hua', 'Barbie Hsu, Guo Tao, Lam Suet, Shi Zhaoqi, Xiong Xinxin, Ding Jia-Li, Fang Qingzhuo', null, 'Xiao befriends Amao, a 36 foot crocodile, who lives on his fathers croc sanctuary. Soon his father is forced to sell the crocodiles to a gangster who plans to use them for high priced meals.', 'Xiao befriends Amao, a 36 foot crocodile, who lives on his fathers croc sanctuary. Soon his father is forced to sell the crocodiles to a gangster who plans to use them for high priced meals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9J55Xj2qUlRTyp2PjLL7MjAO37H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115738'),
  ('335553052442851247', 'Million Dollar Legs', 1932, 'Comedy', 'Edward F. Cline, Arthur L. Todd, Russell Mathews', 'Nicholas T. Barrows, Henry Myers, Ben Hecht', 'Jack Oakie, W.C. Fields, Andy Clyde, Lyda Roberti, Susan Fleming, Ben Turpin, Hugh Herbert, George Barbier', 'NR', 'A small country on the verge of bankruptcy is persuaded to enter the 1932 Los Angeles Olympics as a means of raising money.', 'A small country on the verge of bankruptcy is persuaded to enter the 1932 Los Angeles Olympics as a means of raising money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atqRmaEd22UZe78RWh0Sd00XoSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119564'),
  ('1051758483700998381', 'Million Dollar Madness', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Grégoire Vigneron, Maurice Hermet, Tatyana Umek', 'Julie Ponsonnet, Grégoire Vigneron, Isabelle Jacquet', 'Christian Clavier, Rayane Bensetti, Julie Ferrier, Claire Chust, Charlotte Gabris, Martin Verset, Gilles Cohen, Jean-Luc Couchard', null, 'Under immense pressure and amidst competition with a duplicitous colleague, Stan, the ambitious and very serious operations manager of a construction firm reaches breaking point when he learns that he’s been unfairly laid off by the company’s tyrannical CEO. He impulsively steals one million euros from the company’s vault, tosses away the key to the safe and hastily flees with his fiancée Marine… Before discovering that his termination was a mistake, and he is actually being promoted! Stan has until sunrise to return the money to the vault. But having thrown away his key, and with the only spare inside the CEO’s own apartment, he must reluctantly enlist the help of Hippolyte, Paris’s most unpredictable locksmith. The night promises to be full of twists and turns!', 'Under immense pressure and amidst competition with a duplicitous colleague, Stan, the ambitious and very serious operations manager of a construction firm reaches breaking point when he learns that he’s been unfairly laid off by the company’s tyrannical CEO. He impulsively steals one million euros from the company’s vault, tosses away the key to the safe and hastily flees with his fiancée Marine… Before discovering that his termination was a mistake, and he is actually being promoted! Stan has until sunrise to return the money to the vault. But having thrown away his key, and with the only spare inside the CEO’s own apartment, he must reluctantly enlist the help of Hippolyte, Paris’s most unpredictable locksmith. The night promises to be full of twists and turns!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMCBMmbyY6wRT0MD9xrCt3TeVFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1274837'),
  ('272069607082025944', 'Million Dollar Mermaid', 1952, 'Drama, Music', 'Mervyn LeRoy, George J. Folsey', 'Everett Freeman', 'Esther Williams, Victor Mature, Walter Pidgeon, David Brian, Donna Corcoran, Jesse White, Maria Tallchief, Howard Freeman', null, 'After overcoming polio, Annette Kellerman achieves fame and creates a scandal when her one-piece bathing suit is considered indecent.', 'After overcoming polio, Annette Kellerman achieves fame and creates a scandal when her one-piece bathing suit is considered indecent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/waLcgBcXbwKPWqyyIMjgE33BVIR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43189'),
  ('238862346245108408', 'Million Dollar Mystery', 1987, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Richard Fleischer, Jack Cardiff, Kuki López Rodero', 'Tim Metcalfe, Miguel Tejada-Flores, Rudy De Luca', 'Tom Bosley, Rick Overton, Eddie Deezen, Kevin Pollak, Penny Baker, Rich Hall, Jamie Alcroft, Tawny Fere', 'PG', 'A dying man in a roadside diner tells the other patrons about money he has hidden in four places. But instead of directions, he leaves them only with clues they must solve in order to claim the loot. Released with a promotional tie-in for Glad-Lock brand bags.', 'A dying man in a roadside diner tells the other patrons about money he has hidden in four places. But instead of directions, he leaves them only with clues they must solve in order to claim the loot. Released with a promotional tie-in for Glad-Lock brand bags.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqjG2pokxjuFsRLeZXFVBatBok2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84499'),
