  ('1139186604807333780', 'Mine', 2016, 'War, Thriller', 'Fabio Guaglione, Fabio Resinaro, Sergi Vilanova', 'Fabio Guaglione, Fabio Resinaro', 'Armie Hammer, Annabelle Wallis, Tom Cullen, Geoff Bell, Juliet Aubrey, Clint Dyer, Luka Peroš, David Kirk Traylor', 'NR', 'After a failed assassination attempt, a soldier finds himself stranded in the desert. Exposed to the elements, he must survive the dangers of the desert and battle the psychological and physical toll of the treacherous conditions.', 'After a failed assassination attempt, a soldier finds himself stranded in the desert. Exposed to the elements, he must survive the dangers of the desert and battle the psychological and physical toll of the treacherous conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYmkd3azwbamZ3wsIsMXQY5evjH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345009'),
  ('240644117074414238', 'Mine 9', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michel Monty, Eddie Mensore, Matthew Boyd', 'Eddie Mensore', 'Terry Serpico, Mark Ashworth, Kevin Sizemore, Clint James, Drew Starkey, Erin Elizabeth Burns, Alpha Trivette, Francine Locke', null, 'Two miles into the earth, nine Appalachian miners struggle to survive after a methane explosion leaves them with one hour of oxygen.', 'Two miles into the earth, nine Appalachian miners struggle to survive after a methane explosion leaves them with one hour of oxygen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hxM3HmO3vS8ZxPyFlXgI0tqXug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:564898'),
  ('756504628904051985', 'Mine de rien', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Mathias Mlekuz, Lucas Leconte', 'Mathias Mlekuz, Philippe Rebbot, Cécile Telerman', 'Arnaud Ducret, Philippe Rebbot, Hélène Vincent, Rufus, Mélanie Bernier, Cyril Aubin, Mohamed Makhtoumi, Sophie Bourdon', null, 'In a region that was once the flagship of the mining industry, two long-term unemployed men come up with the idea of building an "artisanal" amusement park on the site of a disused coal mine. By saving the mine and its memory, they will regain their strength and dignity.', 'In a region that was once the flagship of the mining industry, two long-term unemployed men come up with the idea of building an "artisanal" amusement park on the site of a disused coal mine. By saving the mine and its memory, they will regain their strength and dignity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Vz6qJXoekRMHiqXmsuO5VALnmg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613362'),
  ('776044537113008814', 'Mine Games', 2012, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Richard Gray, Greg De Marigny', 'Michele Davis-Gray, Richard Gray, Ross McQueen', 'Alex Meraz, Briana Evigan, Julianna Guill, Rafi Gavron, Ethan Peck, Joseph Cross, Rebecca Da Costa, Lindsay Lamb', null, 'A group of young friends make an incomprehensible discovery in an abandoned mine, but the more they try to change the future, the more they seal their fate.', 'A group of young friends make an incomprehensible discovery in an abandoned mine, but the more they try to change the future, the more they seal their fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EumAjlw1pIpqoz8m0fJr1Tj2fm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126323'),
