  ('89373952045300674', 'Minesweeper', 1943, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance, War', 'William Berke, Edward F. Mull', 'Maxwell Shane, Edward T. Lowe Jr.', 'Richard Arlen, Jean Parker, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams, Emma Dunn, Charles D. Brown, Frank Fenton, Chick Chandler, Douglas Fowley', 'NR', 'A naval officer who had deserted several years earlier is drawn back to the Navy when World War II begins. He re-enlists under an assumed name, and is assigned to a minesweeper, where he has to perform hazardous duties while at the same time keeping his real identity a secret.', 'A naval officer who had deserted several years earlier is drawn back to the Navy when World War II begins. He re-enlists under an assumed name, and is assigned to a minesweeper, where he has to perform hazardous duties while at the same time keeping his real identity a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWdFUFPaOZVzh6kAdsQgbKUqjoP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54877'),
  ('534346608047857932', 'Ming Green', 1966, null, 'Gregory J. Markopoulos', null, null, null, 'This portrait of the filmmaker''s apartment, painted in the color of the title, was made a few months before his departure from New York. It is dedicated to the filmmaker Stan Brakhage and was shot without a scenario and edited entirely in the camera.', 'This portrait of the filmmaker''s apartment, painted in the color of the title, was made a few months before his departure from New York. It is dedicated to the filmmaker Stan Brakhage and was shot without a scenario and edited entirely in the camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjOGTEpa3uUNAE0wmqajkakEnbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152299'),
  ('390700412956382378', 'Mingle All the Way', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Allan Harmon, Christopher Charles Kempinski', null, 'Jen Lilley, Brant Daugherty, Lindsay Wagner, Casey Manderson, Sandy Sidhu, April Telek, Serge Houde, Rebecca Staab', null, 'Molly is determined to prove to her family that her new networking app—designed to pair busy professionals together for upcoming events, without long-term romance—is a success. When Molly joins Mingle All the Way and is matched with Jeff, they are both horrified to realize they’ve already had not one, but two disastrous previous encounters.', 'Molly is determined to prove to her family that her new networking app—designed to pair busy professionals together for upcoming events, without long-term romance—is a success. When Molly joins Mingle All the Way and is matched with Jeff, they are both horrified to realize they’ve already had not one, but two disastrous previous encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUSeiqBWSiOA1mYRVPlaJjJRp5t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550022'),
  ('719293601016732230', 'Minha Fama de Mau', 2019, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Lui Farias, Guy Gonçalves, Gigi Soares', 'L.G. Bayão, Lui Farias, Letícia Mey', 'Chay Suede, Gabriel Leone, Malu Rodrigues, Bruno De Luca, Bianca Comparato, Isabela Garcia, Paula Toller, João Vitor Silva', null, 'An emotional dive into the music and life of Erasmo Carlos, from his years as a young rock-and-roller looking for gigs through his enduring musical partnership with Roberto Carlos.', 'An emotional dive into the music and life of Erasmo Carlos, from his years as a young rock-and-roller looking for gigs through his enduring musical partnership with Roberto Carlos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyoeEQKLhhypfmHmppIFk8wC6Xl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569071'),
  ('538767259266565675', 'Minha Irmã e Eu', 2023, 'Comedy', 'André Horta, Rossine A. Freitas, Monica Catalane', 'Fil Braz, Tatá Werneck', 'Ingrid Guimarães, Tatá Werneck, Arlete Salles, Taís Araújo, Lázaro Ramos, IZA, Chitãozinho, Xororó', null, 'Sisters Mirian and Mirelly were born in the interior of Goiás, but live in different cities. When their mother disappears, the two put aside their differences and come together to look for her, on a journey that could change their lives.', 'Sisters Mirian and Mirelly were born in the interior of Goiás, but live in different cities. When their mother disappears, the two put aside their differences and come together to look for her, on a journey that could change their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQ3aQAR2Wt4l4tsPeNftmgsrsSg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1061240'),
  ('982485713334477054', 'Minha Vida em Marte', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Susana Garcia, Leonardo Carvalho, Felipe Torres', 'Susana Garcia, Paulo Gustavo, Julia Lordello', 'Mônica Martelli, Paulo Gustavo, Marcos Palmeira, Marianna Santos, Lucas Capri, Anitta, Ricardo Pereira, Fiorella Mattheis', null, 'Fernanda is married to Tom, with whom she has a five-year-old daughter, Joana. The couple is in the midst of wear and tear caused by living together for many years, which generates constant friction. Who helps Fernanda to overcome the crisis is her partner Aníbal, inseparable partner during the arduous journey between saving the marriage or putting an end to it.', 'Fernanda is married to Tom, with whom she has a five-year-old daughter, Joana. The couple is in the midst of wear and tear caused by living together for many years, which generates constant friction. Who helps Fernanda to overcome the crisis is her partner Aníbal, inseparable partner during the arduous journey between saving the marriage or putting an end to it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJHWvQOdOj7G52wMKwq7heRUrkj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:564427'),
  ('516785937919982780', 'Mini''s First Time', 2006, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Nick Guthe, Dan Stoloff, Milos Milicevic', 'Nick Guthe', 'Alec Baldwin, Nikki Reed, Jeff Goldblum, Luke Wilson, Joe Egender, Carrie-Anne Moss, Svetlana Metkina, David Shatraw', 'R', 'Desperate to be free from her drunken, unloving mother Diane, the beautiful, scheming young Mini seduces her stepfather Martin and soon convinces him to join her in a sadistic scheme to have Diane declared insane. But their conspiracy soon escalates to murder and when John Garson, a young detective starts investigating, Martin and Mini begin to turn on each other.', 'Desperate to be free from her drunken, unloving mother Diane, the beautiful, scheming young Mini seduces her stepfather Martin and soon convinces him to join her in a sadistic scheme to have Diane declared insane. But their conspiracy soon escalates to murder and when John Garson, a young detective starts investigating, Martin and Mini begin to turn on each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LSbj1iwkxM7AZRTKxCxfdmE4Lt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15314'),
  ('412198193607507993', 'Miniature Theatre', 1909, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Segundo de Chomón', 'Ferdinand Zecca', null, null, 'Three young children set up a table, and on the table is placed a miniature stage. The stage curtain opens, a carpet appears, and then the carpet unrolls by itself. Two puppet figures then come out and begin to perform a series of routines.', 'Three young children set up a table, and on the table is placed a miniature stage. The stage curtain opens, a carpet appears, and then the carpet unrolls by itself. Two puppet figures then come out and begin to perform a series of routines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UYYiUz4oGloTLc4jElN5hk5m3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196384'),
