  ('652005480363254823', 'Minimalism: A Documentary About the Important Things', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Matt D''Avella, Matt D''Avella', null, 'Joshua Fields Millburn, Ryan Nicodemus, Dan Harris, Joshua Becker, Shannon Whitehead, Sam Harris, Rick Hanson, Jay Austin', 'NR', 'How might your life be better with less? The popular simple-living duo The Minimalists examines the many flavors of minimalism by taking the audience inside the lives of minimalists from various walks of life.', 'How might your life be better with less? The popular simple-living duo The Minimalists examines the many flavors of minimalism by taking the audience inside the lives of minimalists from various walks of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QXHf52RxGbw1PYrCtbD99iZdBV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392553'),
