  ('1135509553083003190', 'Minor Details', 2009, 'Adventure, Family, Mystery', 'John Lyde, John Lyde, John Lyde', 'Sally Meyer, Anne M. Edwards', 'Kelsey Edwards, Caitlin E.J. Meyer, Danielle Chuchran, Lauren Faber, Jennette McCurdy, Savannah Jayde, Emma Duke, Brady Edwards', null, 'Someone at the prestigious Danforth Academy is trying to make the students sick. Is it Mia or Riley, the rich girls? Or could it be Emily, the Principal''s daughter? Whoever it is, Abby, Paige, Claire and Taylor will have to put aside their differences and join together to solve the mystery!', 'Someone at the prestigious Danforth Academy is trying to make the students sick. Is it Mia or Riley, the rich girls? Or could it be Emily, the Principal''s daughter? Whoever it is, Abby, Paige, Claire and Taylor will have to put aside their differences and join together to solve the mystery!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9xkBqj0YjmG4FtV7psJBz8ehcl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24886'),
  ('580787882223533222', 'Minor Premise', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 'Eric Schultz, Justin Derry', 'Thomas Torrey, Justin Moretto, Eric Schultz', 'Sathya Sridharan, Paton Ashbrook, Dana Ashbrook, Nikolas Kontomanolis, Purva Bedi, Melanie Nicholls-King, E.J. Carroll, Karron Graves', null, 'Attempting to surpass his father''s legacy, a neuroscientist becomes entangled in his own experiment, pitting ten fragments of his consciousness against each other.', 'Attempting to surpass his father''s legacy, a neuroscientist becomes entangled in his own experiment, pitting ten fragments of his consciousness against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4H5aH4PxVomNxa5UIHa32bzrCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661137'),
