  ('695838174940450502', 'Minotaur', 2006, 'Horror, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Jonathan English, Nic Morris', 'Nick Green, Stephen McDool', 'Tom Hardy, Michelle Van Der Water, Tony Todd, Lex Shrapnel, Jonathan Readwin, Rutger Hauer, Maimie McCoy, Lucy Brown', 'R', 'Long ago in the Iron Age, a shadow loomed over a lonely village. For generations, the village youths are stolen from their families and delivered as sacrifice to a mythical beast - the Minotaur, that dwells beneath a great palace. Theo, haunted by the loss of his love in an earlier sacrifice is convinced that the beast isn''t real and that his girl still lives as a slave within the palace.', 'Long ago in the Iron Age, a shadow loomed over a lonely village. For generations, the village youths are stolen from their families and delivered as sacrifice to a mythical beast - the Minotaur, that dwells beneath a great palace. Theo, haunted by the loss of his love in an earlier sacrifice is convinced that the beast isn''t real and that his girl still lives as a slave within the palace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwSYtZNc42WaqOzkMpSuZ4NElJr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18870'),
  ('1150870184303044399', 'Minotaur, the Wild Beast of Crete', 1960, 'Fantasy', 'Silvio Amadio, Renato del Frate, Aldo Giordani', 'Sandro Continenza, Gian Paolo Callegari', 'Rosanna Schiaffino, Bob Mathias, Alberto Lupo, Rik Battaglia, Nerio Bernardi, Carlo Tamberlani, Emma Baron, Nico Pepe', null, 'King Minos sacrifices the ''required'' virgins to the Minotaur. As his wife lies dying, she confesses that her daughter has a twin she has secreted to avoid giving one of the girls to the Minotaur. The daughter raised by Minos tries to have her twin killed, but failing in her first attempt, continues to try to have her given to the Minotaur. Theseus, the Greek hero, tries to prevent it.', 'King Minos sacrifices the ''required'' virgins to the Minotaur. As his wife lies dying, she confesses that her daughter has a twin she has secreted to avoid giving one of the girls to the Minotaur. The daughter raised by Minos tries to have her twin killed, but failing in her first attempt, continues to try to have her given to the Minotaur. Theseus, the Greek hero, tries to prevent it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9pKlh0ujBmbhUVTs7qCcV7zqhI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142282'),
  ('828876668569261907', 'Minsara Kanavu', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Rajiv Menon, Venu, Ravi K. Chandran', 'Rajiv Menon, V. C. Guhanathan', 'Arvind Swamy, Prabhu Deva, Kajol, V. K. Ramasamy, Girish Karnad, Nassar, Arundathi Nag, S. P. Balasubramaniam', null, 'Priya decides that she wants to be a nun, much to the horror of her father and Thomas, the boy who is in love with her. Thomas decides to enlist the help of Deva to change her mind.', 'Priya decides that she wants to be a nun, much to the horror of her father and Thomas, the boy who is in love with her. Thomas decides to enlist the help of Deva to change her mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAet30jOD12zba47n5MsfeMSLWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79328'),
  ('138928474067579356', 'Minsk', 2022, 'Drama', 'Dariya Likhacheva, Boris Guts, Railya Karimova', 'Boris Guts', 'Aleksey Maslodudov, Anastasiya Shemyakina, Anastasiya Pronina, Danil Steklov, Maksim Stoyanov, Yuliya Aug, Oleg Gaas, Filipp Mogilnitskiy', null, 'Minsk, August 2020. Pasha and Yulia, a young married couple, leave the house at night and find themselves in the midst of peaceful protests. Everyday walk turns into a real hell, in which innocent people are victims of police brutality.', 'Minsk, August 2020. Pasha and Yulia, a young married couple, leave the house at night and find themselves in the midst of peaceful protests. Everyday walk turns into a real hell, in which innocent people are victims of police brutality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cit3DpLqOxXzpW6OIeC2KGdaJJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835561'),
  ('679418138082159317', 'Minuscule 2: Mandibles from Far Away', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Thomas Szabo, Hélène Giraud, Thomas Monti', 'Thomas Szabo, Hélène Giraud', 'Bruno Salomone, Thierry Frémont, Stéphane Coulon, Jean Nanga, Sarah Cohen-Hadria, Jean-Paul Guyon, Bô Gaultier de Kermoal, Franck Benezech', 'G', 'When the first snow falls in the valley, it is urgent to prepare its reserves for the winter. Alas, during the operation, a small ladybug is trapped in a box - to the Caribbean. One solution: reform the shock team.', 'When the first snow falls in the valley, it is urgent to prepare its reserves for the winter. Alas, during the operation, a small ladybug is trapped in a box - to the Caribbean. One solution: reform the shock team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QVglFM8WHuA5F07IMzFcKu6RXa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513302'),
  ('500494117264750175', 'Minuscule: Valley of the Lost Ants', 2013, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Hélène Giraud, Thomas Szabo, Thomas Monti', 'Thomas Szabo, Hélène Giraud', 'John DeCantis, Suzy Wilson', 'PG', 'In a peaceful little clearing, the remains of a hastily abandoned picnic sparks a battle between two tribes of ants. A bold young ladybug finds himself caught in the middle. He befriends the leader of the black ants, Mandible, and helps him save the anthill from the assault of the terrible red ant warriors, led by the fearful Butor. A fantastic journey at ground level.', 'In a peaceful little clearing, the remains of a hastily abandoned picnic sparks a battle between two tribes of ants. A bold young ladybug finds himself caught in the middle. He befriends the leader of the black ants, Mandible, and helps him save the anthill from the assault of the terrible red ant warriors, led by the fearful Butor. A fantastic journey at ground level.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tk4kHoeXx0i7TROwiOrcSEtHOEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140870'),
  ('82158992688881934', 'Minutemen', 2008, 'Family, TV Movie, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Lev L. Spiro, Bruce Douglas Johnson, Christopher Barnes', null, 'Jason Dolley, Nicholas Braun, Luke Benward, Chelsea Kane, Steven R. McQueen, J.P. Manoux, Kellie Cockrell, Molly Jepson', 'G', 'When three high-school friends invent a time-machine, they decide to use it to go back in time and prevent other youngsters from making humiliating mistakes.', 'When three high-school friends invent a time-machine, they decide to use it to go back in time and prevent other youngsters from making humiliating mistakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2y00QZiT3XUGwIxQxY5WLvvd1Y6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22371'),
