  ('389802181478305944', 'Mio in the Land of Faraway', 1987, 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Family, Mystery', 'Vladimir Grammatikov, Oleksandr Antypenko', 'William Aldridge', 'Nick Pickard, Christian Bale, Timothy Bottoms, Christopher Lee, Susannah York, Sverre Anker Ousdal, Gunilla Nyroos, Igor Yasulovich', 'PG', 'Under the watch of his unkind realtives, lonely Bosse''s luck is changed when he is sent to the land where his real father is the King. In that country, he sets out on a quest, together with his new friend, to destroy the evil Knight Kato.', 'Under the watch of his unkind realtives, lonely Bosse''s luck is changed when he is sent to the land where his real father is the King. In that country, he sets out on a quest, together with his new friend, to destroy the evil Knight Kato.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3C5JsV8Id21pVfOAmWBZjrMZ6GZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14499'),
  ('308463944280527744', 'Mio on the Shore', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sho Ishii, Takumi Kadoya, Keitaro Sakon', 'Takumi Kakuya', 'Honoka Matsumoto, Daichi Watanabe, Eri Tokunaga, Kaito Yoshimura, Shugo Oshinari, Ken Mitsuishi, Fumie Kashiyama, An Ogawa', null, 'Mio is 20 years old. Having lost her parents early, she and her grandmother run a traditional inn in Nagano. However, her grandmother gets sick. Mio moves to Tokyo and lives with her father’s best friend, Kyosuke. He runs a public bath. She begins to work at the public bath, but it is scheduled to be demolished to make way for redevelopment.', 'Mio is 20 years old. Having lost her parents early, she and her grandmother run a traditional inn in Nagano. However, her grandmother gets sick. Mio moves to Tokyo and lives with her father’s best friend, Kyosuke. He runs a public bath. She begins to work at the public bath, but it is scheduled to be demolished to make way for redevelopment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJWA9cfowpXfZFGbMchubKkOngj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594398'),
  ('125111111474060306', 'Mio papà', 2014, 'Drama', 'Giulio Base, Fabio Zamarion', 'Paolo Logli, Giorgio Pasotti, Riccardo Irrera', 'Giorgio Pasotti, Donatella Finocchiaro, Niccolò Calvagna, Fabio Troiano, Ninetto Davoli, Emanuela Rossi, Valerio Base, Federico Benvenuto', null, 'Lorenzo is a 35-year-old diver and an incurable Casanova. But one night, after having withdrawn with the beautiful Claudia, he comes across his little Matteo, the son of the woman. The presence of the child throws Lorenzo into a vortex of doubts and remorse that will lead the man to review his crushed sentimental conduct.', 'Lorenzo is a 35-year-old diver and an incurable Casanova. But one night, after having withdrawn with the beautiful Claudia, he comes across his little Matteo, the son of the woman. The presence of the child throws Lorenzo into a vortex of doubts and remorse that will lead the man to review his crushed sentimental conduct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXTegjQH98uX18BbPvRe0xqNewl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306555'),
  ('161403917216475628', 'Mio''s Cookbook', 2020, 'Drama', 'Haruki Kadokawa, Nobuyasu Kita', 'Kana Matsui, Haruki Kadokawa, Itaru Era', 'Honoka Matsumoto, Nao, Mayumi Wakamura, Atsuko Asano, Yosuke Kubozuka, Takashi Fujii, Yuta Koseki, Toshiyuki Nagashima', null, 'When Mio was young, she lost her parents in a great flood and also became separated from her best friend Noe. Afterwards, Mio found her talent in cooking and eventually became a cook. Meanwhile, Noe has become an oiran (high-ranking courtesan).', 'When Mio was young, she lost her parents in a great flood and also became separated from her best friend Noe. Afterwards, Mio found her talent in cooking and eventually became a cook. Meanwhile, Noe has become an oiran (high-ranking courtesan).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVe1LWLfmkYKacyiu4LRu8ikZIK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695187'),
  ('41973749177762605', 'Miquette', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot, Armand Thirard, Louis Née', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot', 'Louis Jouvet, Bourvil, Saturnin Fabre, Danièle Delorme, Mireille Perrey, Pauline Carton, Jeanne Fusier-Gir, Madeleine Suffel', null, 'A provincial ingenue leaves her mother’s tobacco shop with dreams of a life in the Parisian theater, only to become entangled in relationships with a lecherous aristocrat, his starry-eyed nephew, and an old ham actor.', 'A provincial ingenue leaves her mother’s tobacco shop with dreams of a life in the Parisian theater, only to become entangled in relationships with a lecherous aristocrat, his starry-eyed nephew, and an old ham actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VQHu6vWkW6JKbPOjv7n8rOyLTp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66140'),
  ('1040170871554989566', 'Mira', 1971, 'Drama', 'Fons Rademakers, Eduard van der Enden', 'Magda Reypens, Hugo Claus', 'Willeke van Ammelrooy, Jan Decleir, Carlos van Lanckere, Luc Ponette, Roger Bolders, Mart Gevers, Freek de Jonge, Charles Janssens', null, 'The story of a small and conservative West-Flemish village opposing the construction of a bridge over the Scheldt.', 'The story of a small and conservative West-Flemish village opposing the construction of a bridge over the Scheldt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJDYA1VjuZJDQP7ekrYkg0c7BJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90503'),
  ('784142985550688129', 'Mira', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Adventure, Family', 'Dmitry Kiselev, Vladimir Bashta, Aleksey Samodelko', 'Timofey Dekin, Ekaterina Mavromatis', 'Anatoliy Belyy, Darya Moroz, Veronika Ustimova, Maksim Lagashkin, Evgeny Egorov, Andrey Smolyakov, Vladimir Ilin, Tatyana Dogileva', null, 'Near future. Lera Arabova is a 15-year-old girl who lives with her family in Vladivostok. Lera''s father has been working at the orbiting space station "Mira" for many years and has long lost contact with his daughter, turning only into a voice on the phone. After a meteor shower hits the city, Lera has only one chance to save her loved ones and the city from a new disaster. Her father helps her in this - through satellite surveillance systems and the telephone, he uses every opportunity to send a message to his daughter, watching from above from the station her every step.', 'Near future. Lera Arabova is a 15-year-old girl who lives with her family in Vladivostok. Lera''s father has been working at the orbiting space station "Mira" for many years and has long lost contact with his daughter, turning only into a voice on the phone. After a meteor shower hits the city, Lera has only one chance to save her loved ones and the city from a new disaster. Her father helps her in this - through satellite surveillance systems and the telephone, he uses every opportunity to send a message to his daughter, watching from above from the station her every step.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mv2DFhsaLeNgFzNe2G5CJhzbrkt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:864101'),
  ('514615500740548802', 'Mira Mira', 2024, 'Horror', 'Roxy Shih', 'Truman Capps, Danielle McKechnie', 'Madeleine Coghlan, Catherine Davis, Christinna Chauncey, Lize Johnston, Isaac Akers, Aimee-Lynn Chadwick, Tatum Chiniquy, Andrew Roach', null, 'Estranged sisters, Lizzie and Jo, are reunited with their eccentric mother after having witnessed their father’s mysterious death. A traumatized Lizzie becomes entranced by a haunted mirror whose sinister role in tearing this family apart is just beginning.', 'Estranged sisters, Lizzie and Jo, are reunited with their eccentric mother after having witnessed their father’s mysterious death. A traumatized Lizzie becomes entranced by a haunted mirror whose sinister role in tearing this family apart is just beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ek7Rs8z8MofDUBrHo8Do5Q4ABGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1286218'),
  ('114635112776240594', 'Miracle', 1982, 'Drama', 'Ishmael Bernal, Sergio Lobo, Warlito Teodoro', 'Ricardo Lee', 'Nora Aunor, Spanky Manikan, Vangie Labalan, Gigi Dueñas, Laura Centeno, Pen Medina, Ama Quiambao, Joel Lamangan', null, 'When plain orphan Elsa begins having visions of the Virgin Mary, the rest of the residents of her isolated village find themselves questioning their own beliefs and values. Soon, Elsa is healing people with a variety of ailments. As word of this phenomenon spreads, tourists, pilgrims, patients and a documentary filmmaker all arrive on a quest to partake in the miracle.', 'When plain orphan Elsa begins having visions of the Virgin Mary, the rest of the residents of her isolated village find themselves questioning their own beliefs and values. Soon, Elsa is healing people with a variety of ailments. As word of this phenomenon spreads, tourists, pilgrims, patients and a documentary filmmaker all arrive on a quest to partake in the miracle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDRzVfiiwC5CYcmHG0pGmZe6fQ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197976'),
  ('729455877610491116', 'Miracle', 2004, 'Drama, History', 'Gavin O''Connor, Dan Stoloff', 'Eric Guggenheim', 'Kurt Russell, Patricia Clarkson, Noah Emmerich, Sean McCann, Kenneth Welsh, Eddie Cahill, Patrick O''Brien Demsey, Michael Mantenuto', 'PG', 'When college coach Herb Brooks is hired to helm the 1980 U.S. men''s Olympic hockey team, he brings a unique and brash style to the ice. After assembling a team of hot-headed college all-stars, who are humiliated in an early match, Brooks unites his squad against a common foe: the heavily-favored Soviet team.', 'When college coach Herb Brooks is hired to helm the 1980 U.S. men''s Olympic hockey team, he brings a unique and brash style to the ice. After assembling a team of hot-headed college all-stars, who are humiliated in an early match, Brooks unites his squad against a common foe: the heavily-favored Soviet team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxtej2th8t8x0ufVBTyhsO6Htxj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14292'),
  ('1054438633076008453', 'Miracle', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bogdan George Apetri, Oleg Mutu, Constantin Donici', 'Bogdan George Apetri', 'Ioana Bugarin, Emanuel Pârvu, Cezar Antal, Ovidiu Crișan, Valeriu Andriuță, Valentin Popescu, Marian Râlea, Nora Covali', null, 'A young novice sneaks out of her convent to deal with a matter that cannot be delayed.', 'A young novice sneaks out of her convent to deal with a matter that cannot be delayed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lldfzQ9cWsmVYSbBKVelNLeJscU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854323'),
  ('68647718894018793', 'Miracle at Midnight', 1998, 'Drama, TV Movie, Adventure, Comedy', 'Kenneth MacMillan, Ken Cameron', 'Monte Merrick, Chris Bryant', 'Sam Waterston, Mia Farrow, Justin Whalin, Patrick Malahide, Benedick Blythe, Barry McGovern, Daisy Beaumont, Nicola Mycroft', 'G', 'Gripping historical drama presents a triumphant celebration of the human spirit. The true-life story of how one Danish family risked their lives in a remarkable effort to save thousands of their Jewish countrymen from the horror of Nazi concentration camps. Hendrik and his doctor father undertake the dangerous task of deceiving the Nazis and hiding Jewish families. When the Koster men must themselves go into hiding, Henrik''s sister and mother are left to face capture by the suspicious Gestapo.', 'Gripping historical drama presents a triumphant celebration of the human spirit. The true-life story of how one Danish family risked their lives in a remarkable effort to save thousands of their Jewish countrymen from the horror of Nazi concentration camps. Hendrik and his doctor father undertake the dangerous task of deceiving the Nazis and hiding Jewish families. When the Koster men must themselves go into hiding, Henrik''s sister and mother are left to face capture by the suspicious Gestapo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMPiWA66gST1XONqLtceHfe6xpi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177212'),
  ('512857924110890050', 'Miracle at St. Anna', 2008, 'Drama, War', 'Spike Lee, Matthew Libatique, Kim Taylor-Coleman', 'James McBride', 'Derek Luke, Michael Ealy, Laz Alonso, Omar Benson Miller, Pierfrancesco Favino, Valentina Cervi, Matteo Sciabordi, John Turturro', 'R', 'Miracle at St. Anna chronicles the story of four American soldiers who are members of the all-black 92nd "Buffalo Soldier" Division stationed in Tuscany, Italy during World War II.', 'Miracle at St. Anna chronicles the story of four American soldiers who are members of the all-black 92nd "Buffalo Soldier" Division stationed in Tuscany, Italy during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PqmgaQBuD0Zp9pDIkkEjkhCJUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12412'),
  ('479236320009581343', 'Miracle Beach', 1992, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Skott Snider, Eddie Braun, Bernard Salzmann', 'Scott Bindley', 'Dean Cameron, Ami Dolenz, Felicity Waterman, Brian Perry, Alexis Arquette, Pat Morita, Allen Garfield, Martin Mull', 'R', 'Down on his luck, Scotty McKay becomes the master of a very lonely genie, who brings him wealth, power and true love. Miracles can happen!', 'Down on his luck, Scotty McKay becomes the master of a very lonely genie, who brings him wealth, power and true love. Miracles can happen!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1HFnge9U5Ucrv46McRI928gL3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55694'),
  ('998073099249365068', 'Miracle Healing', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Marcel Combes', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Jean-Claude Romer, Patrick Granier', 'Michel Serrault, Jean Poiret, Jeanne Moreau, Sylvie Joly, Jean Rougerie, Roland Blanche, Sophie Moyse, Marc Maury', null, 'Faking an injury for insurance money, a peddler seeks out a cure to support his claims while a suspicious investigator tries to expose the scam.', 'Faking an injury for insurance money, a peddler seeks out a cure to support his claims while a suspicious investigator tries to expose the scam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hlE9LoNM4RTEYnxYVdB2cYoLq1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64419'),
  ('1099112499208071621', 'Miracle in Cell No. 7', 2019, 'Drama', 'Ilker Çanga, Mehmet Ada Öztekin', 'Özge Efendioğlu, Lee Hwan-kyung, Kim Hwang-sung', 'Aras Bulut Iynemli, Nisa Sofiya Aksongur, İlker Aksum, Mesut Akusta, Yıldıray Şahinler, Yurdaer Okur, Sarp Akkaya, Deniz Baysal', null, 'Separated from his daughter, a father with an intellectual disability must prove his innocence when he is jailed for the death of a commander''s child.', 'Separated from his daughter, a father with an intellectual disability must prove his innocence when he is jailed for the death of a commander''s child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOth4QmNyEkalwahfPCfiXjNh1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637920'),
  ('705359264111022618', 'Miracle in Lane 2', 2000, 'TV Movie, Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Greg Beeman, William Wages', 'Donald C. Yost, Joel Kauffmann', 'Frankie Muniz, Rick Rossovich, Molly Hagan, Patrick Levis, Roger Aaron Brown, Tuc Watkins, Brittany Paige Bouck, Todd Hurst', 'G', 'Young tween Justin Yoder, who''s known for his outgoing demeanor and wit despite being confined to a wheelchair, dreams to be like his athletic older brother and propels himself into the world of soapbox derby racing. It''s a field he''s sure he has a chance in. Unfortunately, he finds that because of his condition, not everyone is eager to see him compete.', 'Young tween Justin Yoder, who''s known for his outgoing demeanor and wit despite being confined to a wheelchair, dreams to be like his athletic older brother and propels himself into the world of soapbox derby racing. It''s a field he''s sure he has a chance in. Unfortunately, he finds that because of his condition, not everyone is eager to see him compete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zLIdeSXvMp9gdWMpYmE7j1K1QD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77921'),
  ('899470286799203789', 'Miracle in Milan', 1951, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Drama', 'Vittorio De Sica, Luisa Alessandri, Umberto Scarpelli', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Mario Chiari, Adolfo Franci', 'Emma Gramatica, Francesco Golisano, Paolo Stoppa, Guglielmo Barnabò, Brunella Bovo, Anna Carena, Alba Arnova, Flora Cambi', null, 'Once upon a time a wise and kind old woman discovers a baby in her cabbage patch. She brings up the child and, when she dies, the boy, Totò, enters an orphanage. Totò leaves the orphanage a happy young man, and looks for work in post-war Milan. He ends up with the homeless and organizes them to build a shanty town in a vacant lot. But when greedy developers threaten the community’s land, Totò will need all the help he can get in order to find an impossible way out.', 'Once upon a time a wise and kind old woman discovers a baby in her cabbage patch. She brings up the child and, when she dies, the boy, Totò, enters an orphanage. Totò leaves the orphanage a happy young man, and looks for work in post-war Milan. He ends up with the homeless and organizes them to build a shanty town in a vacant lot. But when greedy developers threaten the community’s land, Totò will need all the help he can get in order to find an impossible way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9l47FSwRvu0IETKjDVpZ2INbqvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43379'),
  ('661390713667693132', 'Miracle in the Rain', 1956, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rudolph Maté, Lee White, Russell Metty', 'Ben Hecht', 'Jane Wyman, Van Johnson, Peggie Castle, Fred Clark, Eileen Heckart, Josephine Hutchinson, William Gargan, Barbara Nichols', 'NR', 'Wartime romance about a lonely man and woman who meet one rainy afternoon in New York.', 'Wartime romance about a lonely man and woman who meet one rainy afternoon in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDcOSQFFMo6qwr9fvOhQWefnxTX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79521'),
  ('1152327235991006018', 'Miracle in the Woods', 1997, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Arthur Allan Seidelman', null, 'Meredith Baxter, Della Reese, Patricia Heaton, Anna Chlumsky, David Hunt, Sanaa Lathan', null, 'Quarreled sisters; Sarah and Wanda inherit property from their mother. It has always belonged to the family. Sarah insists on selling it as soon as possible because she has many difficulties. She goes there with her daughter; Gina. Wanda, on the other hand, wants to keep the property in family. They soon discover that it''s not abandoned. Old lady, Lilly Cooper has been living there for many years and doesn''t want to leave the house, at least, not as long as she can meet her son.', 'Quarreled sisters; Sarah and Wanda inherit property from their mother. It has always belonged to the family. Sarah insists on selling it as soon as possible because she has many difficulties. She goes there with her daughter; Gina. Wanda, on the other hand, wants to keep the property in family. They soon discover that it''s not abandoned. Old lady, Lilly Cooper has been living there for many years and doesn''t want to leave the house, at least, not as long as she can meet her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHStW1AAacfEZNgWQBvagft0XZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282821'),
  ('140926534057505703', 'Miracle Landing', 1990, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Dick Lowry', 'Garner Simmons', 'Connie Sellecca, Wayne Rogers, Ana Alicia, Jane Daly, James Cromwell, Nancy Kwan, Jay Thomas, Armin Shimerman', null, 'Based on a real, in-flight incident in 1988, a passenger jet loses a portion of its fuselage in flight over Hawaii and is forced to make an emergency landing.', 'Based on a real, in-flight incident in 1988, a passenger jet loses a portion of its fuselage in flight over Hawaii and is forced to make an emergency landing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boAnu6M844wH9eEwmpBJl3D6OSZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265393'),
  ('34392848944643678', 'Miracle Mile', 1989, 'Romance, Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller, Comedy, Action', 'Steve De Jarnatt, Pamela Marcotte, Theo van de Sande', 'Steve De Jarnatt', 'Anthony Edwards, Mare Winningham, John Agar, Lou Hancock, Mykelti Williamson, Kurt Fuller, Denise Crosby, Robert DoQui', 'R', 'After 30 years of searching, Harry has finally met the girl of his dreams. Unfortunately, before they even have a chance to go on their first date, Harry intercepts some chilling news: WWIII has begun and nuclear missiles will destroy Los Angeles in less than an hour!', 'After 30 years of searching, Harry has finally met the girl of his dreams. Unfortunately, before they even have a chance to go on their first date, Harry intercepts some chilling news: WWIII has begun and nuclear missiles will destroy Los Angeles in less than an hour!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qRCVO9L3s3CsPnoUO9c3iZm6aB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24739'),
  ('789240444941879341', 'Miracle of Flight', 1974, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Terry Gilliam', 'Terry Gilliam', 'Terry Gilliam', null, 'We''re given the history of man seeking flight, however not by the channels of ''do-it-yourself'': men jump off of cliffs while trying to flap their arms, be them in armor or other outfits.', 'We''re given the history of man seeking flight, however not by the channels of ''do-it-yourself'': men jump off of cliffs while trying to flap their arms, be them in armor or other outfits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaMZB5AoQymr1HBr0NYIpOrMK27.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38844'),
  ('200095520254868512', 'Miracle of Marcellino', 1991, 'Drama', 'Luigi Comencini, Franco Di Giacomo, Giulio Manfredonia', 'Luigi Comencini, Ennio De Concini', 'Alberto Cracco, Didier Bénureau, Sergio Bini Bustric, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Ernesto Lama, Thierry Nenez, Lucio Romero, Francesco Scali', null, 'In the 15th century, in a poor Italian village, the monks of a modest convent take up an abandoned baby. Unfortunately, for all their efforts, they prove unable to trace his parents. So they set up providing tender loving care to the little boy. Marcellino lives a happy life among the men of God but, as he grows up, he misses his mother more and more.', 'In the 15th century, in a poor Italian village, the monks of a modest convent take up an abandoned baby. Unfortunately, for all their efforts, they prove unable to trace his parents. So they set up providing tender loving care to the little boy. Marcellino lives a happy life among the men of God but, as he grows up, he misses his mother more and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHOOF80L45iKJx4gV5dJ9OWThMZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103715'),
  ('289409514382373419', 'Miracle of the White Stallions', 1963, 'Drama, Family', 'Arthur Hiller, Günther Anders', 'Alois Podhajsky, AJ Carothers', 'Robert Taylor, Lilli Palmer, Curd Jürgens, Eddie Albert, James Franciscus, John Larch, Brigitte Horney, Charles Regnier', null, 'In WWII Austria, Col. Alois Podhajsky must protect his beloved Lipizzaner stallions and make sure that they are surrendered into the right hands. But Patton''s something of a horse fancier and can help...if he sees the stallions perform.', 'In WWII Austria, Col. Alois Podhajsky must protect his beloved Lipizzaner stallions and make sure that they are surrendered into the right hands. But Patton''s something of a horse fancier and can help...if he sees the stallions perform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0b9tPgyQLqs81zx6o3iJMpNTu9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58019'),
  ('314141251114582097', 'Miracle on 1st Street', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'JK Youn, Kim Yeong-cheol, Kim Seong-hun', 'Yu Seong-hyeob', 'Ha Ji-won, Im Chang-jung, Kang Ye-won, Joo Hyun, Jung Doo-hong, Park Yoo-Sun, Lee Hoon, Cho Jae-ryong', null, 'In the heart of the small shanty town known as Pine Village, lies 1st Street. The area has been earmarked by businessmen for redevelopment with lush parks and skyscraper apartments. Gangsters have been enlisted by the businessmen to persuade the residents to sell their homes for pennies on the dollar. It turns out that the towns only hope for a miracle may well come from Pil-je, the gangster sent to 1st street to bully the residents into submission.', 'In the heart of the small shanty town known as Pine Village, lies 1st Street. The area has been earmarked by businessmen for redevelopment with lush parks and skyscraper apartments. Gangsters have been enlisted by the businessmen to persuade the residents to sell their homes for pennies on the dollar. It turns out that the towns only hope for a miracle may well come from Pil-je, the gangster sent to 1st street to bully the residents into submission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzJ8uuBufMsgD9ZjB7AIzdPF45D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40228'),
  ('488356046279645743', 'Miracle on 34th Street', 1947, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'George Seaton, Lloyd Ahern Sr., Charles G. Clarke', 'George Seaton', 'Maureen O''Hara, John Payne, Edmund Gwenn, Gene Lockhart, Natalie Wood, Porter Hall, William Frawley, Jerome Cowan', 'NR', 'Kris Kringle, seemingly the embodiment of Santa Claus, is asked to portray the jolly old fellow at Macy''s following his performance in the Thanksgiving Day parade. His portrayal is so complete that many begin to question if he truly is Santa Claus, while others question his sanity.', 'Kris Kringle, seemingly the embodiment of Santa Claus, is asked to portray the jolly old fellow at Macy''s following his performance in the Thanksgiving Day parade. His portrayal is so complete that many begin to question if he truly is Santa Claus, while others question his sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vehuIm3y6BeMI7mYjxzaA1H8M0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11881'),
  ('938777267890674878', 'Miracle on 34th Street', 1973, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Fielder Cook', 'George Seaton, Jeb Rosebrook', 'Sebastian Cabot, Jane Alexander, David Hartman, Suzanne Davidson, Jim Backus, Roddy McDowall, Tom Bosley, David Doyle', 'NR', 'A department store Santa tries to convince a little girl who doesn''t believe in Santa Claus that he is Santa Claus, and winds up going on trial to prove who he is.', 'A department store Santa tries to convince a little girl who doesn''t believe in Santa Claus that he is Santa Claus, and winds up going on trial to prove who he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwY3cMyRadeCQVeNIDTQMJUjFYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252539'),
  ('53827993214058984', 'Miracle on 34th Street', 1994, 'Fantasy, Drama, Family', 'Les Mayfield, Julio Macat, Randy Suhr', 'George Seaton', 'Mara Wilson, Richard Attenborough, Dylan McDermott, Elizabeth Perkins, J.T. Walsh, James Remar, Robert Prosky, Jack McGee', 'PG', 'Six-year-old Susan Walker has doubts about childhood''s most enduring miracle—Santa Claus. Her mother told her the secret about Santa a long time ago, but, after meeting a special department store Santa who''s convinced he''s the real thing, Susan is given the most precious gift of all—something to believe in.', 'Six-year-old Susan Walker has doubts about childhood''s most enduring miracle—Santa Claus. Her mother told her the secret about Santa a long time ago, but, after meeting a special department store Santa who''s convinced he''s the real thing, Susan is given the most precious gift of all—something to believe in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUTPKkljdEjPlcPPYgbUz7APnHu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10510'),
  ('854610295837751671', 'Miracle on Everest', 2008, 'Adventure, Documentary', 'Jennifer Peedom', 'Chris Thorburn', 'Wayne Alexander, Lincoln Hall, Johno Carr, Daz Caulton, Nick Flyvberg, Daz Gaulton, Jeremy Little, Pedro Maher', null, '2006 was one of the deadliest Everest seasons on record. Experienced mountaineer Lincoln Hall was invited to join an expedition as a high altitude cameraman. It was his second attempt to summit the mountain, having turned back just short 22 years earlier. Shortly after reaching the summit, Hall began to behave irrationally, suffering from lack of oxygen. Aided by his loyal Sherpas for over 9 hours, he eventually collapsed and they declared him dead. His family were informed and the news hit headlines. But something happened that night that science cannot explain. The next morning Lincoln Hall was found alive by approaching climbers and his dramatic rescue began. Never before has a man been declared dead so high on Everest and survived. This is the remarkable true story of Lincoln Hall’s extraordinary journey back from beyond.', '2006 was one of the deadliest Everest seasons on record. Experienced mountaineer Lincoln Hall was invited to join an expedition as a high altitude cameraman. It was his second attempt to summit the mountain, having turned back just short 22 years earlier. Shortly after reaching the summit, Hall began to behave irrationally, suffering from lack of oxygen. Aided by his loyal Sherpas for over 9 hours, he eventually collapsed and they declared him dead. His family were informed and the news hit headlines. But something happened that night that science cannot explain. The next morning Lincoln Hall was found alive by approaching climbers and his dramatic rescue began. Never before has a man been declared dead so high on Everest and survived. This is the remarkable true story of Lincoln Hall’s extraordinary journey back from beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TWxWF8I75teVnXJn48XLLHlNBF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440381'),
  ('1053807857509074682', 'Miracle on Ice', 1981, 'Action, Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Steven Hilliard Stern, Howard Schwartz', 'Lionel Chetwynd', 'Karl Malden, Andrew Stevens, Steve Guttenberg, Jerry Houser, Allan Miller, Robert F. Lyons, Robert Pierce, Michael Cavanaugh', 'NR', 'The story of the 1980 United States Olympic hockey players, a group of amateurs from around the country who were whipped into a cohesive unit by controversial coach Herb Brooks to win a gold medal at Lake Placid during the winter games.', 'The story of the 1980 United States Olympic hockey players, a group of amateurs from around the country who were whipped into a cohesive unit by controversial coach Herb Brooks to win a gold medal at Lake Placid during the winter games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vEKNJ2SMsigGqwdFGL7PRHgC4F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6945'),
  ('4896057812742529', 'Miracle on Main Street', 1939, 'Drama', 'Steve Sekely, Charles Van Enger', 'Samuel Ornitz, Frederick J. Jackson, Boris Ingster', 'Margo, Walter Abel, William Collier Sr., Jane Darwell, Lyle Talbot, Wynne Gibson, Veda Ann Borg, Pat Flaherty', 'NR', 'On Christmas Eve in the Spanish quarter of L.A. police try to arrest a couple running a shady floor show. Hiding in a church, the young woman finds an abandoned baby and uses it as cover to escape capture.', 'On Christmas Eve in the Spanish quarter of L.A. police try to arrest a couple running a shady floor show. Hiding in a church, the young woman finds an abandoned baby and uses it as cover to escape capture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVodw8o0mBKVzexd3d3m5W3SuVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306770'),
  ('49118854275403062', 'Miracle Run', 2004, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Gregg Champion, Gordon Lonsdale', 'Mike Maples', 'Mary-Louise Parker, Aidan Quinn, Zac Efron, Bubba Lewis, Jake Cherry, Jeremy Shada, Alicia Morton, Michael Arata', 'PG', 'Corinne is a single mother of twin 5-year-old boys, Steven and Phillip, who are diagnosed with autism. Public school officials threaten to remove them from school due to their behavior, but through therapy, the boys are able to make major strides in their capabilities. A decade later, teens Steven and Phillip seek to prove they can handle high school while still struggling with their disorder.', 'Corinne is a single mother of twin 5-year-old boys, Steven and Phillip, who are diagnosed with autism. Public school officials threaten to remove them from school due to their behavior, but through therapy, the boys are able to make major strides in their capabilities. A decade later, teens Steven and Phillip seek to prove they can handle high school while still struggling with their disorder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aGx9NJAXynsDiLXch9NTXj5D3R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58591'),
  ('511928544026715000', 'Miracle: Letters to the President', 2021, 'Drama', 'Kim Tae-soo, Ryu Si-moon, Lee Jang-hoon', 'Shon Joo-yeon, Lee Jang-hoon', 'Park Jeong-min, Yoona, Lee Sung-min, Lee Soo-kyung, Jung Moon-sung, Park Cheol-min, Yoo Seung-mok, Kim Kang-hoon', null, 'Dreaming of making a way station for his sister and the villagers who have no choice but to commute along the dangerous train tracks every day, Joon-kyung sends many letters to the President, but with no reply. Ra-hee, who has a crush on Joon-kyung, does everything she can to help him meet the President.', 'Dreaming of making a way station for his sister and the villagers who have no choice but to commute along the dangerous train tracks every day, Joon-kyung sends many letters to the President, but with no reply. Ra-hee, who has a crush on Joon-kyung, does everything she can to help him meet the President.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIqK5raxC3dXKbJx5QHa5vCD86J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730823'),
  ('1014249663862182226', 'Miracle: The Boys of ''80', 2026, 'Documentary, History, Sport', 'Max Gershberg, Jacob Rogal', null, 'Herb Brooks, Mike Eruzione, Jim Craig, Steve Janaszak, John Harrington', 'PG-13', 'This is the story of the “Miracle on Ice,” when the 1980 US Hockey Team beat the USSR in the Olympic semi-finals at the height of the Cold War to bring home a gold medal. Their iconic underdog story is told with never-before-seen 16mm footage and firsthand reflections from the players who were brought back to the scene of their historic victory.', 'This is the story of the “Miracle on Ice,” when the 1980 US Hockey Team beat the USSR in the Olympic semi-finals at the height of the Cold War to bring home a gold medal. Their iconic underdog story is told with never-before-seen 16mm footage and firsthand reflections from the players who were brought back to the scene of their historic victory.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F7%2Fgracenote%2F70298fc158e16c65791045b32d316c42.jpg', 'plex:movie:miracle-the-boys-of-80-2026'),
  ('652814831914135338', 'Miracles', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Jim Kouf', 'Jim Kouf', 'Tom Conti, Teri Garr, Paul Rodríguez, Christopher Lloyd, Adalberto Martínez, Jorge Russek, Jorge Reynoso, Zaide Silvia Gutiérrez', null, 'Jean and Roger decide to divorce after 10 years, but 12 hours later, they''re together again by accident. Their cars collide, swerving to miss Juan, the jaywalking jewel thief who decides to cash in on the crash. The ex-couple are kidnapped, shot at, cast adrift, mistaken for smugglers and even survive a plane crash. But the toughest torture these two endure is being trapped together.', 'Jean and Roger decide to divorce after 10 years, but 12 hours later, they''re together again by accident. Their cars collide, swerving to miss Juan, the jaywalking jewel thief who decides to cash in on the crash. The ex-couple are kidnapped, shot at, cast adrift, mistaken for smugglers and even survive a plane crash. But the toughest torture these two endure is being trapped together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a24gEniuT6y0DLeNbEtKXcsdE2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169541'),
  ('1092194704785881354', 'Miracles for Sale', 1939, 'Mystery', 'Tod Browning, Charles Lawton Jr.', 'Harry Ruskin, Marion Parsonnet, James Edward Grant', 'Robert Young, Florence Rice, Frank Craven, Henry Hull, Lee Bowman, Cliff Clark, Astrid Allwyn, Walter Kingsford', 'NR', 'A maker of illusions for magicians protects an ingenue likely to be murdered.', 'A maker of illusions for magicians protects an ingenue likely to be murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6dqXrt3jPwDSyFr2dzd1G1xVpb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228647'),
  ('849650004405684247', 'Miracles from Heaven', 2016, 'Family, Drama', 'Garrett Warren, Patricia Riggen, Checco Varese', 'Randy Brown', 'Jennifer Garner, Kylie Rogers, Martin Henderson, Brighton Sharbino, Courtney Fansler, John Carroll Lynch, Eugenio Derbez, Queen Latifah', 'PG', 'When Christy discovers her 10-year-old daughter Anna has a rare, incurable disease, she becomes a ferocious advocate for her daughter’s healing as she searches for a solution. After Anna has a freak accident and falls three stories, a miracle unfolds in the wake of her dramatic rescue that leaves medical specialists mystified, her family restored and their community inspired.', 'When Christy discovers her 10-year-old daughter Anna has a rare, incurable disease, she becomes a ferocious advocate for her daughter’s healing as she searches for a solution. After Anna has a freak accident and falls three stories, a miracle unfolds in the wake of her dramatic rescue that leaves medical specialists mystified, her family restored and their community inspired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hz9VF1TfaM0D04pYneSXUkNeOZv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339984'),
  ('652361263894184276', 'Miracles Of Love', 2019, 'Drama', 'Mehmet İnan Ertek, Mahsun Kırmızıgül', 'Mahsun Kırmızıgül', 'Mert Turak, Fikret Kuşkan, Biran Damla Yılmaz, Erdal Özyağcılar, Şenay Gürler, Mahsun Kırmızıgül, Sinan Çalışkanoğlu, Melis Sezen', null, 'During the 1960s, a disabled man finds himself in an arranged marriage to the most beautiful girl in the village.', 'During the 1960s, a disabled man finds himself in an arranged marriage to the most beautiful girl in the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNN8SewPcEgdwb315ucH8znzjWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590096'),
