  ('1003580537084114864', 'Mirageman', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Ernesto Díaz Espinoza, Nicolás Ibieta, Eduardo Castro', 'Ernesto Díaz Espinoza', 'Marko Zaror, María Elena Swett, Ariel Mateluna, Mauricio Pesutic, Iván Jara, Jack Arama, Gina Aguad, Eduardo Castro', 'R', 'After being brutally assaulted, an incident which also saw the death of his parents and the rape of his younger brother (which mentally scarred him to the point of having to be institutionalized), Maco Gutierrez has devoted his life to fitness and practicing martial arts to ensure his safety in the future.', 'After being brutally assaulted, an incident which also saw the death of his parents and the rape of his younger brother (which mentally scarred him to the point of having to be institutionalized), Maco Gutierrez has devoted his life to fitness and practicing martial arts to ensure his safety in the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBVOz5z6kq3id0N34zM2bQScEfE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37709'),
