  ('191320916029614767', 'Miranda', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tinto Brass, Emanuela Lucidi, Alessandro Peticca', 'Tinto Brass', 'Serena Grandi, Andrea Occhipinti, Franco Interlenghi, Andy J. Forest, Franco Branciaroli, Malisa Longo, Osiride Pevarello, Isabelle Illiers', null, 'In 1950s Ferrara, a lonely innkeeper explores a series of relationships while awaiting her missing husband’s return from war.', 'In 1950s Ferrara, a lonely innkeeper explores a series of relationships while awaiting her missing husband’s return from war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBnzLwfRdHKJZS4dd2DMbiy6jLC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52212'),
  ('897996306726713713', 'Miranda', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Marc Munden, Ben Davis, Stephen Woolfenden', 'Rob Young', 'Christina Ricci, John Simm, Kyle MacLachlan, John Hurt, Julian Rhind-Tutt, Cavan Clerkin, Matthew Marsh, Pik-Sen Lim', null, 'A librarian begins a passionate affair with a mysterious woman who walks into his library. When she suddenly disappears he travels down to London to search for her only to discover that she has three identities - dancer, dominatrix and con-woman. But which one is the real Miranda?', 'A librarian begins a passionate affair with a mysterious woman who walks into his library. When she suddenly disappears he travels down to London to search for her only to discover that she has three identities - dancer, dominatrix and con-woman. But which one is the real Miranda?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGwsgiVBKgjNzwuhXELIAgDqdmN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50467'),
  ('49942237928048482', 'Miranda''s Victim', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Michelle Danner, Pierluigi Malavasi', 'George Kolber, J. Craig Stiles', 'Abigail Breslin, Emily VanCamp, Luke Wilson, Ryan Phillippe, Sebastian Quinn, Andy Garcia, Mireille Enos, Joshua Bowman', null, 'The true story of Trish Weir who in 1963 was kidnapped and brutally raped by Ernesto Miranda. Committed to putting her assailant in prison, Trish’s life is destroyed by America’s legal system as she triggers a law that transforms the nation.', 'The true story of Trish Weir who in 1963 was kidnapped and brutally raped by Ernesto Miranda. Committed to putting her assailant in prison, Trish’s life is destroyed by America’s legal system as she triggers a law that transforms the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82lu2Rb0MoBpfyUtoVwhLiVrDlF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:980816'),
