  ('285793772353300253', 'Mirch Masala', 1987, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jehangir Choudhary, Ketan Mehta', 'Ketan Mehta', 'Smita Patil, Naseeruddin Shah, Om Puri, Deepti Naval, Suresh Oberoi, Benjamin Gilani, Harish Patel, Paresh Rawal', null, 'Early-1940s, rural British India. When a woman decides to fight against the village''s despotic subedar and is supported by the guard of the local spice factory, more women join to defy the prevailing oppression.', 'Early-1940s, rural British India. When a woman decides to fight against the village''s despotic subedar and is supported by the guard of the local spice factory, more women join to defy the prevailing oppression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lY52bfpPrnwhZOctMZX8qDfPOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232791'),
  ('955344773898810565', 'Mirciulica', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Cristian Ilișuan, Adrian Nica, Alex Alexoiu', 'Mircea Popa, Cristian Ilișuan', 'Mircea Popa, Elena Ivanca, Elena Moldovan, Denisa Vlad, Dan Chiorean, Adrian Cucu, Catalin Herlo, Radu Largeanu', null, 'Mircea, a 30-year-old man from a small Transylvanian town fails the judicial admission exam in Bucharest. He has no choice but to return home and live with his parents. He is forced to get a job in a waste collector company owned by a rich local politician. But things get complicated when Mircea starts working for the boss''s wife.', 'Mircea, a 30-year-old man from a small Transylvanian town fails the judicial admission exam in Bucharest. He has no choice but to return home and live with his parents. He is forced to get a job in a waste collector company owned by a rich local politician. But things get complicated when Mircea starts working for the boss''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDjw0bwdMn11h9WLYp21bZ6cU72.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030908'),
  ('467499193974367951', 'Miroirs No. 3', 2025, 'Drama', 'Christian Petzold, Hans Fromm, Ires Jung', 'Christian Petzold', 'Paula Beer, Barbara Auer, Matthias Brandt, Enno Trebs, Philip Froissant, Victoire Laly, Marcel Heupermann, Christian Koerner', null, 'On a weekend trip to the countryside, Laura miraculously survives a car crash. Physically unhurt but deeply shaken, she is taken in by a local woman who witnessed the accident and now cares for Laura with motherly devotion. When her husband and adult son also give up their initial resistance to Laura''s presence, the four of them slowly build up some family-like routine. But soon they can no longer ignore their past...', 'On a weekend trip to the countryside, Laura miraculously survives a car crash. Physically unhurt but deeply shaken, she is taken in by a local woman who witnessed the accident and now cares for Laura with motherly devotion. When her husband and adult son also give up their initial resistance to Laura''s presence, the four of them slowly build up some family-like routine. But soon they can no longer ignore their past...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNzLDieAVlX3So2Qs2XSAOUmvxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1178602'),
  ('683309629089100091', 'Miroslava', 1993, 'Drama', 'Alejandro Pelayo, Emmanuel Lubezki', 'Vicente Leñero', 'Arielle Dombasle, Verónica Langer, Claudio Brook, Demián Bichir, Arleta Jeziorska, Rosa María Bianchi', null, 'The beautiful and popular movie star Miroslava is depressed tonight. As she prepares her suicide, her entire life is revealed on screen in a disturbing portrait of a lonely woman.', 'The beautiful and popular movie star Miroslava is depressed tonight. As she prepares her suicide, her entire life is revealed on screen in a disturbing portrait of a lonely woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xik4xrYYttnSJb2BsviD8bsihhc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161186'),
  ('878532081548782503', 'Mirreyes contra Godínez 2: El retiro', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Chava Cartas, Beto Casillas', 'Juan Carlos Garzón, Angélica Gudiño', 'Regina Blandón, Daniel Tovar, Diana Bovio, Christian Vazquez, Alejandro de Marino, Gloria Stalina, Roberto Aguire, Michelle Rodríguez', null, 'A divided team heads to a corporate retreat after receiving an enticing proposal. During their time away, they must overcome their differences and find a way to reunite.', 'A divided team heads to a corporate retreat after receiving an enticing proposal. During their time away, they must overcome their differences and find a way to reunite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzImbuC5tXAyrHxUIsk9TiIrtPv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002695'),
  ('380165440212855926', 'Mirreyes contra Godínez: Un Especial de Navidad', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Chava Cartas, Anilú Pardo', 'Juan Carlos Garzón, Angélica Gudiño, Yago Muñoz', 'Daniel Tovar, Regina Blandón, Diana Bovio, Christian Vazquez, Michelle Rodríguez, Alejandro de Marino, Gloria Stalina, Roberto Aguire', null, 'A deal must be closed, and if they fail, they''ll have brought their romeritos in vain. In the middle of the discussion, Genaro receives an unexpected visit: the ghost of Don Francisco, who will teach him the true meaning of Christmas.', 'A deal must be closed, and if they fail, they''ll have brought their romeritos in vain. In the middle of the discussion, Genaro receives an unexpected visit: the ghost of Don Francisco, who will teach him the true meaning of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsuS0Wuik77w3MFysqHBpdyButc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1588413'),
  ('760374592193502122', 'Mirreyes vs Godínez', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Beto Casillas, Chava Cartas', 'María Hinojos', 'Pablo Lyle, Daniel Tovar, Regina Blandón, Diana Bovio, Christian Vazquez, Roberto Aguire, Alejandro de Marino, Gloria Stalina', null, 'A group of yuppies fight over a group of office stooges for the control of a shoe factory.', 'A group of yuppies fight over a group of office stooges for the control of a shoe factory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwvgQmyALdiSmLtyxkB9KPG2zdE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554753'),
  ('783680500031625327', 'Mirreyes vs Godínez: Las Vegas', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Chava Cartas, Anilú Pardo', 'Juan Carlos Garzón, Angélica Gudiño, María Hinojos', 'Regina Blandón, Diana Bovio, Michelle Rodríguez, Daniel Tovar, Christian Vazquez, Alejandro de Marino, Roberto Aguire, Cassandra Sánchez Navarro', null, 'Genaro and Mich travel to Las Vegas with their colleagues to save the shoe store with a crucial contract. Between parties and crazy situations, they must maintain a balance between work, friendship, and love to achieve their goal.', 'Genaro and Mich travel to Las Vegas with their colleagues to save the shoe store with a crucial contract. Between parties and crazy situations, they must maintain a balance between work, friendship, and love to achieve their goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pblXp7qiRivl0gYUeIsaus8IcJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1441782'),
  ('353706314864721894', 'Mirror', 1975, 'Drama, History', 'Georgi Rerberg, Larisa Tarkovskaya, Valeriy Kharchenko', 'Aleksandr Misharin, Andrei Tarkovsky', 'Margarita Terekhova, Ignat Daniltsev, Larisa Tarkovskaya, Alla Demidova, Anatoliy Solonitsyn, Mykola Hrynko, Tamara Ogorodnikova, Yuriy Nazarov', 'NR', 'A dying man in his forties recalls his childhood, his mother, the war and personal moments that tell of and juxtapose pivotal moments in Soviet history with daily life.', 'A dying man in his forties recalls his childhood, his mother, the war and personal moments that tell of and juxtapose pivotal moments in Soviet history with daily life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AttDP5OEsMxtHPPN7Z92p2Ntnmd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1396'),
  ('300219642268346608', 'Mirror', 1994, 'History, Drama', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu, Nicu Gheorghe, Florina Petrescu', 'Ioan Grigorescu, Sergiu Nicolaescu', 'Ion Siminie, Adrian Vâlcu, Gheorghe Dinică, Ștefan Radoff, Şerban Ionescu, Sergiu Nicolaescu, Jürgen Lederer, Nicolas König', null, 'Depicts Romania during World War II, focusing on the Royal Coup that toppled Ion Antonescu, the Axis-allied Conducător and authoritarian Prime Minister. Focused around the August 23rd 1944 coup against Marshal Antonescu, the movie also tackles other topics from the same era such as the Iron Guard rebellion and the execution of political leaders by communists.', 'Depicts Romania during World War II, focusing on the Royal Coup that toppled Ion Antonescu, the Axis-allied Conducător and authoritarian Prime Minister. Focused around the August 23rd 1944 coup against Marshal Antonescu, the movie also tackles other topics from the same era such as the Iron Guard rebellion and the execution of political leaders by communists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xDNKpWJ3DatwKCSX1F0v3SbITR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360504'),
  ('19777631166227894', 'Mirror for a Hero', 1987, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Vladimir Khotinenko, Evgeniy Grebnev, Violetta Sedova', 'Nadezhda Kozhushanaya', 'Sergey Koltakov, Ivan Bortnik, Boris Galkin, Feliks Stepun, Natalya Akimova, Elena Golyanova, Yakov Stepanov, Viktor Smirnov', null, 'Sergei and Andrei are walking through a city park and see that a film shoot set just post World War II is taking place . They climb over the park fence to get a better view but hit some cable lying on the ground and find themselves in the past - on May 8, 1949, a day which they seem doomed to relive over and over again.', 'Sergei and Andrei are walking through a city park and see that a film shoot set just post World War II is taking place . They climb over the park fence to get a better view but hit some cable lying on the ground and find themselves in the past - on May 8, 1949, a day which they seem doomed to relive over and over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRQsE6krPfh159aZT7503Cqv5bI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83495'),
  ('764916950199024147', 'Mirror Game', 2016, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Amitabh Reza Chowdhury, Rashed Zaman', 'Gousul Alam Shaon, Anam Biswas, Amitabh Reza Chowdhury', 'Chanchal Chowdhury, Masuma Rahman Nabila, Partha Barua, Lutfur Rahman George, Gousul Alam Shaon, Brindaban Das, Khairul Basar, Shawkat Osman', null, 'Ayna is an actor and the prison is his stage. He slips into the characters of the powerful convicted in exchange of money and take their place in prison. This strange profession is borne out of a society that doesn''t give him a chance to follow his passion of acting, but forces him to act in the real life. Falling in love with the girl next door changes his life equation and he decides to end this career with one last performance. But this one takes him too deep in the rabbit hole. The story unfolds on how an underdog survives in a society that is merciless and struggles his way out from the clutch of crime game which he is a part too.', 'Ayna is an actor and the prison is his stage. He slips into the characters of the powerful convicted in exchange of money and take their place in prison. This strange profession is borne out of a society that doesn''t give him a chance to follow his passion of acting, but forces him to act in the real life. Falling in love with the girl next door changes his life equation and he decides to end this career with one last performance. But this one takes him too deep in the rabbit hole. The story unfolds on how an underdog survives in a society that is merciless and struggles his way out from the clutch of crime game which he is a part too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlcN8exK6HXn3rav6MOZyL90XYW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418325'),
  ('925252033372206585', 'Mirror Images', 1992, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Gregory Dark, Paul Desatoff, Lisa Demaine', 'Georges des Esseintes', 'Delia Sheppard, Jeff Conaway, Richard Arbolino, John O''Hurley, Korey Mall, Julie Strain, Nels Van Patten, Michael Meyer', 'R', 'When her identical twin sister goes out of town, a bored and sexually frustrated woman adopts her sibling''s promiscuous identity, but soon finds herself involved in a murder case.', 'When her identical twin sister goes out of town, a bored and sexually frustrated woman adopts her sibling''s promiscuous identity, but soon finds herself involved in a murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKkAKaaYvr3lBMjpb7OxNt2WthD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124076'),
  ('104222558995653387', 'Mirror Images II', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gregory Dark, Bob Kay, Wally Pfister', 'Daryl Haney', 'Shannon Whirry, Luca Bercovici, Tom Reilly, Eva LaRue, Ken Steadman, Kristine Kelly, Sara Suzanne Brown, Frank Pesce', null, 'Shannon Whirry stars as Carrie and Terrie, a pair of twins who were separated in youth when their father murdered their mother and was in turn killed by his own bad twin daughter. Now the sweet-natured "good" sister has grown up to marry an abusive louse. Trapped in a sexless relationship, she seeks solace with a therapist (Kristine Kelly), but her problems are about to be compounded when her wicked sister arrives in town, intent on avenging herself on her double for past wrongs. Even the help of a private detective on her side may not be enough when her sister becomes allied with her own husband.', 'Shannon Whirry stars as Carrie and Terrie, a pair of twins who were separated in youth when their father murdered their mother and was in turn killed by his own bad twin daughter. Now the sweet-natured "good" sister has grown up to marry an abusive louse. Trapped in a sexless relationship, she seeks solace with a therapist (Kristine Kelly), but her problems are about to be compounded when her wicked sister arrives in town, intent on avenging herself on her double for past wrongs. Even the help of a private detective on her side may not be enough when her sister becomes allied with her own husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxTkMSuvR1Wbd7G57HYB7VpCdKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118149'),
  ('963341152969915564', 'Mirror Mirror', 1990, 'Horror', 'Marina Sargenti, Robert Brinkmann', 'Yuri Zeltser, Marina Sargenti', 'Karen Black, Yvonne De Carlo, William Sanderson, Rainbow Harvest, Kristin Dattilo, Ricky Paull Goldin, Charlie Spradling, Tom Bresnahan', 'R', 'Shy teenager Megan moves to a new town with her widowed mother and quickly becomes the most unpopular girl in high school. But when she starts to communicate with a mysterious mirror, her tormentors begin to meet with a horrifying series of ''accidents''. Is the mirror a reflection of Megan''s own inner demons... or has she unwittingly opened the doorway of the damned?', 'Shy teenager Megan moves to a new town with her widowed mother and quickly becomes the most unpopular girl in high school. But when she starts to communicate with a mysterious mirror, her tormentors begin to meet with a horrifying series of ''accidents''. Is the mirror a reflection of Megan''s own inner demons... or has she unwittingly opened the doorway of the damned?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjRW3VQjhrXiC0oAfme6AQTJUdH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70351'),
  ('775956963765259147', 'Mirror Mirror', 2012, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Tarsem Singh, Brendan Galvin, Ramsey Avery', 'Jason Keller, Marc Klein', 'Julia Roberts, Lily Collins, Armie Hammer, Nathan Lane, Mare Winningham, Michael Lerner, Sean Bean, Joe Gnoffo', 'PG', 'After she spends all her money, an evil enchantress queen schemes to marry a handsome, wealthy prince. There''s just one problem - he''s in love with a beautiful princess, Snow White. Now, joined by seven rebellious dwarves, Snow White launches an epic battle of good vs. evil...', 'After she spends all her money, an evil enchantress queen schemes to marry a handsome, wealthy prince. There''s just one problem - he''s in love with a beautiful princess, Snow White. Now, joined by seven rebellious dwarves, Snow White launches an epic battle of good vs. evil...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pys6zIJN8Sxlk2Ss2GZuYuXPbtw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62764'),
  ('10061843010496814', 'Mirror Mirror 2: Raven Dance', 1994, 'Horror', 'Jimmy Lifton, Troy Cook', 'Jimmy Lifton, Virginia Perfili', 'Roddy McDowall, Sally Kellerman, Lois Nettleton, Veronica Cartwright, William Sanderson, Sarah Douglas, Mark Ruffalo, Tracy Wells', 'R', 'A mysterious mirror is found hidden in a church orphanage, yet few realize its legacy of evil. When an innocent teen discovers that she is being stalked by her evil stepsister, the mirror''s demonic power is again unleashed. As the mirror gains strength from the blood of the damned, the ultimate battle between good and evil begins. William Sanderson was the only actor from the first film to return for the second movie, albeit in a different role. The second film notably featured an early film appearance for Mark Ruffalo.', 'A mysterious mirror is found hidden in a church orphanage, yet few realize its legacy of evil. When an innocent teen discovers that she is being stalked by her evil stepsister, the mirror''s demonic power is again unleashed. As the mirror gains strength from the blood of the damned, the ultimate battle between good and evil begins. William Sanderson was the only actor from the first film to return for the second movie, albeit in a different role. The second film notably featured an early film appearance for Mark Ruffalo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4f3KWtOyYXAdkvkUKAW9lEwrOZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92706'),
  ('46413072711440728', 'Mirror of Holland', 1950, 'Documentary', 'Bert Haanstra', 'Bert Haanstra', null, null, 'In this short film Bert Haanstra gives his vision - from the water – of a tranquil Holland. During filming he held the camera upside down and afterwards put the images ‘up right’ again in the film. By doing this, we see the ‘usual’ waterfront, but transformed by the rippling of the water. In this way Mirror of Holland became a modern looking experimental film. However this did not devalue the Dutch sentiment regarding waterfronts that are so trusted to so many.', 'In this short film Bert Haanstra gives his vision - from the water – of a tranquil Holland. During filming he held the camera upside down and afterwards put the images ‘up right’ again in the film. By doing this, we see the ‘usual’ waterfront, but transformed by the rippling of the water. In this way Mirror of Holland became a modern looking experimental film. However this did not devalue the Dutch sentiment regarding waterfronts that are so trusted to so many.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xc3Gba7OvQ0sT8t4XLC0le6JXXW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193497'),
  ('956227042876616082', 'Mirror, Mirror', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Marc Crehuet', 'Marc Crehuet', 'Malena Alterio, Natalia de Molina, Santi Millán, Verónica Forqué, Carlos Areces, Carlos Bardem, Toni Acosta, Loles León', null, 'Employees at a cosmetics firm grapple with their respective desires by arguing with themselves in the mirror, ahead of their company’s anniversary party.', 'Employees at a cosmetics firm grapple with their respective desires by arguing with themselves in the mirror, ahead of their company’s anniversary party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FUfdBpl7VjC0ZWAbhLMcave9Ar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:929449'),
  ('494028693153697493', 'Mirror, Mirror III: The Voyeur', 1995, 'Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Virginia Perfili, Rachel Gordon, Andrea V. Rossotto', 'Steve Tymon', 'Billy Drago, Mark Ruffalo, Monique Parent, Elizabeth Baldwin, David Naughton, Richard Cansino, Rudolf Weber, Brandon Scott Peterson', 'R', 'A young man discovers a mysterious mirror and begins to have disturbing visions of forbidden passion and brutal murder. But when he also finds a beautiful woman back from the dead and a detective with a thirst for revenge, the real terror has only just begun. The mirror sees all...but what shocking secrets will it reveal?', 'A young man discovers a mysterious mirror and begins to have disturbing visions of forbidden passion and brutal murder. But when he also finds a beautiful woman back from the dead and a detective with a thirst for revenge, the real terror has only just begun. The mirror sees all...but what shocking secrets will it reveal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcHLm7jxhxvEJiykElhNNFuzZSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92707'),
  ('486354385122884906', 'Mirrored Mind', 2005, 'Drama', 'Gakuryu Ishii, Gakuryu Ishii, Daichi Ichihara', 'Gakuryu Ishii', 'Miwako Ichikawa, Yuki Inomata, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Kou Machida, Nagi Noriko', null, 'An actress suffering from an identity crisis finds herself spirited away from the bustle of Tokyo to a tropical paradise.', 'An actress suffering from an identity crisis finds herself spirited away from the bustle of Tokyo to a tropical paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKiQaP5c6ToyXo0C7zJTqaUwkhH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79860'),
  ('842813382351745612', 'MirrorMask', 2005, 'Fantasy', 'Dave McKean, Antony Shearn', 'Neil Gaiman, Dave McKean', 'Stephanie Leonidas, Jason Barry, Rob Brydon, Gina McKee, Dora Bryan, Stephen Fry, Robert Llewellyn, Lenny Henry', 'PG', 'In a fantasy world of opposing kingdoms, a 15-year old girl must find the fabled MirrorMask in order to save the kingdom and get home.', 'In a fantasy world of opposing kingdoms, a 15-year old girl must find the fabled MirrorMask in order to save the kingdom and get home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itIJU3NKbdgScA1WPIxXzOlm0Uj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14517'),
  ('579934486671475946', 'Mirrors', 2007, 'Drama', 'Étienne Desrosiers, France Boudreau, Stefan Ivanov', 'Étienne Desrosiers', 'Xavier Dolan, Stéphane Demers, Julie Beauchemin, Patrick Martin, André Nadeau, Maxime Allaire, Simon Guitard, Ericka Moore', null, 'Julian is a melancholic teenager on holiday at the family cottage. His holiday gets a twist when a mysterious neighbor confuses him. A summertime coming-of-age drama.', 'Julian is a melancholic teenager on holiday at the family cottage. His holiday gets a twist when a mysterious neighbor confuses him. A summertime coming-of-age drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMZUBItun5i9bRvfPUknSxTAP5l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230268'),
