  ('370013916157191553', 'Misbegotten', 1998, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Mark L. Lester, Lidia Stante, Mark Irwin', 'Larry Cohen', 'Kevin Dillon, Nick Mancuso, Lysette Anthony, Robert Lewis, Stefan Arngrim, Matthew Walker, Megan Leitch, Felicia Shulman', null, 'Impatient to have a child, an infertile couple seeks help at a sperm bank and are thrilled when the procedure works. But their joy is cut short after they discover the donor is a psychopath willing to kill anyone who stands between him and his baby.', 'Impatient to have a child, an infertile couple seeks help at a sperm bank and are thrilled when the procedure works. But their joy is cut short after they discover the donor is a psychopath willing to kill anyone who stands between him and his baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHgow2nTtgharWheIh5GD7AE8Wg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197649'),
  ('775865375087495732', 'Misbehavior', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kim Tae-yong, Kim Tae-soo', 'Kim Tae-yong', 'Kim Ha-neul, Yoo In-young, Lee Won-keun, Lee Hee-jun, Ki Joo-bong, Lee Ki-woo, Jeong Seok-yong, Hong Wan-pyo', null, 'Hyo-joo, a temporary teacher at a boys'' high school, witnesses Hae-yeong''s passionate embrace with a boy, causing her immense humiliation towards her.', 'Hyo-joo, a temporary teacher at a boys'' high school, witnesses Hae-yeong''s passionate embrace with a boy, causing her immense humiliation towards her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWt6c7PzAxV0PF9PI44J8AQrUhe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428395'),
  ('484308793992138918', 'Misbehaviour', 2020, 'Drama, History, Comedy', 'Philippa Lowthorpe, Zac Nicholson, Toni Staples', 'Gaby Chiappe, Rebecca Frayn', 'Keira Knightley, Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Jessie Buckley, Keeley Hawes, Phyllis Logan, Lesley Manville, Rhys Ifans, Greg Kinnear', null, 'A group of women involved in the Women''s Liberation Movement hatched a plan to invade the stage and disrupt the live broadcast at the 1970 Miss World competition in London, resulting in overnight fame for the newly-formed organization. When the show resumed, the results caused an uproar and turned the Western ideal of beauty on its head.', 'A group of women involved in the Women''s Liberation Movement hatched a plan to invade the stage and disrupt the live broadcast at the 1970 Miss World competition in London, resulting in overnight fame for the newly-formed organization. When the show resumed, the results caused an uproar and turned the Western ideal of beauty on its head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1SoYYvxG4bWTXp4wNWt5sKQf1E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567965'),
  ('375916722365488839', 'Mischief', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mel Damski, Donald E. Thorin', 'Noel Black', 'Doug McKeon, Catherine Mary Stewart, Kelly Preston, Chris Nash, D.W. Brown, Jami Gertz, Margaret Blye, Graham Jarvis', 'R', '1956: The shy Jonathan''s luck with girls changes when he wins the rebellious Gene as a friend in his last year of high school. Gene is adored by many girls and manages to teach Jonathan a few lessons. Gene himself would rather just be with one girl: his girlfriend Bunny. But since his father is poor, her parents don''t accept him.', '1956: The shy Jonathan''s luck with girls changes when he wins the rebellious Gene as a friend in his last year of high school. Gene is adored by many girls and manages to teach Jonathan a few lessons. Gene himself would rather just be with one girl: his girlfriend Bunny. But since his father is poor, her parents don''t accept him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejZ2AUQKnKiSoLegCQXT2Rdjm7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14750'),
  ('78738962286870662', 'Mischief Night', 2013, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Thomas E. Nicholson, Richard Schenkman', 'Richard Schenkman, Jesse Baget', 'Noell Coet, Ian Bamberg, Adam C. Edwards, Stephanie Erb, Daniel Hugh Kelly, Erica Leerhsen, Shannon Makhanian, Charlie O''Connell', 'R', 'Young Emily Walton, who has suffered from psychosomatic blindness ever since the car accident that took her mother''s life, must summon every instinct at her disposal to protect herself and her loved ones from a intruder.', 'Young Emily Walton, who has suffered from psychosomatic blindness ever since the car accident that took her mother''s life, must summon every instinct at her disposal to protect herself and her loved ones from a intruder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Rhwy4Wp79OzgOdUyhz5IHIDzto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228676'),
  ('1073316498281451810', 'Mischief Upon Mischief', 2026, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Ken Gamble', 'Ken Gamble', 'Jeffrey Decker, Jamie Gray Hyder, Geno Segers, Mindy Robinson, Randal Reeder', null, 'Quaid Branson is abducted by aliens on the night of his engagement celebration and abruptly sent off to the Darovingian Mines; an asteroid slave mining colony on the outer rim of the galaxy. After toiling away for 7 years, he finally meets Ezekiel Plymouth and manages to engineer their harrowing escape and return to earth with grave and dire consequences for the entire planet.', 'Quaid Branson is abducted by aliens on the night of his engagement celebration and abruptly sent off to the Darovingian Mines; an asteroid slave mining colony on the outer rim of the galaxy. After toiling away for 7 years, he finally meets Ezekiel Plymouth and manages to engineer their harrowing escape and return to earth with grave and dire consequences for the entire planet.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BOGE0OGQzMjMtNjRhMC00OWE2LTgzYjAtNDgzODZiNTEyMDQ1XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:mischief-upon-mischief'),
  ('953720632190524341', 'Mischievous Kiss the Movie Part 1: High School', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tetsuyuki Dômae, Minoru Mizoguchi', 'Minoru Mizoguchi', 'Reina Visa, Kanta Sato, Takanori Jinnai, Hidehiko Ishizuka, Hikari Ishida, Shimon Okura, Nonoka Yamaguchi, Atsuki Tomori', null, 'Based on a popular manga series of the same name, this Japanese romantic comedy follows the lives of two high school students, Kotoko, a bubbly girl who’s hopeless in school, and Naoki, her smart and handsome senior. Although Kotoko gathers up the courage to confess her love to him, he bluntly rejects her in public. But fate works in mysterious ways - when her house collapses, a childhood friend of her father’s, Mr. Irie, invites them to live with his family, and she learns that the son of Mr. Irie is none other than Naoki himself…', 'Based on a popular manga series of the same name, this Japanese romantic comedy follows the lives of two high school students, Kotoko, a bubbly girl who’s hopeless in school, and Naoki, her smart and handsome senior. Although Kotoko gathers up the courage to confess her love to him, he bluntly rejects her in public. But fate works in mysterious ways - when her house collapses, a childhood friend of her father’s, Mr. Irie, invites them to live with his family, and she learns that the son of Mr. Irie is none other than Naoki himself…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EUzo1U7IwtIgmwb0UIsNhZ8AyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416252'),
  ('1048164336629264305', 'Mischka', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pierre Aïm, Jean-François Stévenin', 'Jean-François Stévenin', 'Jean-Paul Roussillon, Jean-François Stévenin, Rona Hartner, Salomé Stévenin, Jean-Paul Bonnaire, Claire Stévenin, Pierre Stévenin, Yves Afonso', null, 'An old man in dressing gown and slippers is abandoned by his family on an area of highway while on vacation. He later finds himself in a hospital where a nurse, Gégène, calls him Mischka.', 'An old man in dressing gown and slippers is abandoned by his family on an area of highway while on vacation. He later finds himself in a hospital where a nurse, Gégène, calls him Mischka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSzvVC3V87H44CclvZ7qmr7fAwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82235'),
  ('166263006268943700', 'Misconduct', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Shintaro Shimosawa, Michael Fimognari', 'Simon Boyes, Adam Mason', 'Josh Duhamel, Anthony Hopkins, Al Pacino, Glen Powell, Alice Eve, Malin Åkerman, Lee Byung-hun, Julia Stiles', 'R', 'An ambitious lawyer finds himself caught in a power struggle between a corrupt pharmaceutical executive and his firm’s senior partner. When the case takes a deadly turn, he must race to uncover the truth before he loses everything.', 'An ambitious lawyer finds himself caught in a power struggle between a corrupt pharmaceutical executive and his firm’s senior partner. When the case takes a deadly turn, he must race to uncover the truth before he loses everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agQHIsW5nLbKS5exd79NhUw9uY8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373314'),
  ('1030171125464423257', 'Misdeal', 1928, 'Drama', 'Georges Lacombe, Jean Grémillon', 'Alexandre Arnoux', 'Charles Dullin, Marcelle Charles Dullin, Geymond Vital, André Bacqué, George Seroff, Annabella, Roger Karl, Mathilde Alberti', null, 'Maldone is a canal worker, happy with his life after running away from his family estate. He falls in love with Zita, a young gypsy girl, during a local fete. However, after his brother dies, Maldone is called back to manage the estate. There, he takes up the life of a landowner and marries a neighbor''s daughter. Years later Maldone is still restless on the estate, and becomes obsessed with Zita, after meeting her by chance one evening.', 'Maldone is a canal worker, happy with his life after running away from his family estate. He falls in love with Zita, a young gypsy girl, during a local fete. However, after his brother dies, Maldone is called back to manage the estate. There, he takes up the life of a landowner and marries a neighbor''s daughter. Years later Maldone is still restless on the estate, and becomes obsessed with Zita, after meeting her by chance one evening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vY57AsvXMnZxGkdcTrtJniVrW7g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161342'),
  ('537611558277488061', 'Misdirection', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kevin Lewis, Matti Eerikäinen', 'Lacy McClory', 'Olga Kurylenko, Frank Grillo, Oliver Trevena, Landa Morland, Vladislav Lapidus, Lacy McClory, Emilija Matić', null, 'A desperate couple have pulled off a string of high-end break-ins to pay off a mob debt. When they attempt to rob their latest victim, they find themselves caught in a deadly game of cat and mouse. The tables are turned and the hunters become the hunted.', 'A desperate couple have pulled off a string of high-end break-ins to pay off a mob debt. When they attempt to rob their latest victim, they find themselves caught in a deadly game of cat and mouse. The tables are turned and the hunters become the hunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7padnoIDHbmxPdqEHryhqlaVqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146344'),
  ('1139547794793632453', 'Miserere', 2013, 'Thriller', 'Sylvain White, Denis Rouden', 'Jean-Christophe Grangé, Laurent Turner, Sylvain White', 'Gérard Depardieu, JoeyStarr, Héléna Noguerra, Marthe Keller, Thierry Lhermitte, Corinne Masiero, Rüdiger Vogler, Mathieu Carrière', null, 'Paris, December. A conductor of a choir is found mysteriously murdered, with burst eardrums. Lionel Kasdan, a police inspertor the verge of retirement, and Frank Salek, an official of Interpol, embark together on a hunt for the killer, and also to a secret organization specializing in kidnapping children.', 'Paris, December. A conductor of a choir is found mysteriously murdered, with burst eardrums. Lionel Kasdan, a police inspertor the verge of retirement, and Frank Salek, an official of Interpol, embark together on a hunt for the killer, and also to a secret organization specializing in kidnapping children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LCEXCm3rZl785ZKelxMpJFuZcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201759'),
  ('984059213118440175', 'Miséricorde', 2016, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Fulvio Bernasconi', 'Antoine Jaccoud, Fulvio Bernasconi', 'Evelyne Brochu, Jonathan Zaccaï, Isabelle Caillat, Anthony Therrien, Marthe Keller, Charli Arcouette-Martineau, Daniel Gadouas, Daria Pisareva', null, 'Thomas, a European, has come to Québec for some recreational fishing on his own. He then embarks on the road leading to the north of Canada, chasing after a black truck that killed the son of a young Amerindian woman. This Swiss cop in exile wants justice to be done. He has, however, other reasons for wanting to do the right thing.', 'Thomas, a European, has come to Québec for some recreational fishing on his own. He then embarks on the road leading to the north of Canada, chasing after a black truck that killed the son of a young Amerindian woman. This Swiss cop in exile wants justice to be done. He has, however, other reasons for wanting to do the right thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zw2Ov0LWGqhNCzulCoZIndyDtw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417633'),
  ('1063984873945590935', 'Misericordia', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller, Comedy', 'Claire Mathon, Alain Guiraudie, Isabelle Tillou', 'Alain Guiraudie', 'Félix Kysyl, Catherine Frot, Jean-Baptiste Durand, Jacques Develay, David Ayala, Tatiana Spivakova, Sébastien Faglain, Serge Richard', 'NR', 'Jérémie returns to his hometown for the funeral of his former boss, the village baker. He decides to stay for a few days with Martine, the man''s widow. A mysterious disappearance, a threatening neighbor and a priest with strange intentions make Jérémie''s short stay in the village take an unexpected turn.', 'Jérémie returns to his hometown for the funeral of his former boss, the village baker. He decides to stay for a few days with Martine, the man''s widow. A mysterious disappearance, a threatening neighbor and a priest with strange intentions make Jérémie''s short stay in the village take an unexpected turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LVCXVdsGPPXRYGu5SRqgfVP96h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1063574'),
  ('931022195352203112', 'Misery', 1990, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Barry Sonnenfeld, Rob Reiner, Artist W. Robinson', 'William Goldman', 'Kathy Bates, James Caan, Richard Farnsworth, Lauren Bacall, Frances Sternhagen, Graham Jarvis, Jerry Potter, Thomas Brunelle', 'R', 'After an accident, acclaimed novelist Paul Sheldon is rescued by a nurse who claims to be his biggest fan. Her obsession takes a dark turn when she holds him captive in her remote Colorado home and forces him to write back to life the popular literary character he killed off.', 'After an accident, acclaimed novelist Paul Sheldon is rescued by a nurse who claims to be his biggest fan. Her obsession takes a dark turn when she holds him captive in her remote Colorado home and forces him to write back to life the popular literary character he killed off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klPO5oh1LOxiPpdDXZo1ADgpKcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1700'),
  ('710073570776268815', 'Misfit', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Erwin van den Eshof', null, 'Selina Mour, Sylvie Meis, Moritz Schirdewahn, Simon Will, Lisa-Marie Koroll', null, 'Moving back to her native country Germany after years of living in the United States, a teenage girl navigates the intricacies of German high school life.', 'Moving back to her native country Germany after years of living in the United States, a teenage girl navigates the intricacies of German high school life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1N6JNNxNKUKVHqSktWfEEFiA2Qf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593815'),
  ('1126976695767901354', 'Misfit', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Orlando Herrera, Alejo Chauvin, Christian Cádernas', 'Diana Sno, Ernst Gonlag, Karen van den Ende', 'Alicia Jaziz Zapién, Julián Cerati, Gimena Gómez, Javier Luna, Raysa Ortiz, Mica Suárez, Jorge Ulloa, Nataly Valencia', null, 'Julia, a teenager from Latin America, has lived in the U.S. most of her life. She is popular, a successful Youtuber and wants to become prom queen. Everything changes abruptly when her family has to return to Ecuador. What will she have to face? Getting used to a new culture and a catholic high school will not be easy. The "gringa" becomes the target of "La Reinas", three popular bullies who rule the school. Julia is now a misfit who will have to earn her new friends'' affection in order to survive.', 'Julia, a teenager from Latin America, has lived in the U.S. most of her life. She is popular, a successful Youtuber and wants to become prom queen. Everything changes abruptly when her family has to return to Ecuador. What will she have to face? Getting used to a new culture and a catholic high school will not be easy. The "gringa" becomes the target of "La Reinas", three popular bullies who rule the school. Julia is now a misfit who will have to earn her new friends'' affection in order to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDwDiovi6qLcluB4EI3bJp1zOwa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893941'),
  ('27470487803623525', 'Misfits to Yuppies', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Stefan Jarl, Henrik Georgson, Per Källberg', 'Stefan Jarl', 'Kenneth ''Kenta'' Gustafsson, Patric Gustafsson, Eva Blondin, Jan ''Jajje'' Klingryd, Stefan Jarl', null, 'Misfits to Yuppies is the last of three films (Dom kallar oss mods, Ett anständigt liv, Det sociala arvet) that shows conditions for addicts in Stockholm and try to find out how social legacy have been transferred to their children from previous films.', 'Misfits to Yuppies is the last of three films (Dom kallar oss mods, Ett anständigt liv, Det sociala arvet) that shows conditions for addicts in Stockholm and try to find out how social legacy have been transferred to their children from previous films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GY7GzOrprw4T0NTNvhAxoGaYze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56504'),
