  ('1019650422351100630', 'Misgivings', 2026, 'Drama', 'Duncan James', 'Duncan James', 'Joanne Connor, Mace Murray, Jeffery Richards, Julie-Anne Breen', 'Not Rated', 'an Australian independent drama directed by Duncan James, following a bored, suburban housewife named Suze who discovers shocking secrets about her husband during a solo road trip. The 1h 23m film explores themes of guilt, redemption, and complex family dynamics with a French-cinema-inspired style.', 'an Australian independent drama directed by Duncan James, following a bored, suburban housewife named Suze who discovers shocking secrets about her husband during a solo road trip. The 1h 23m film explores themes of guilt, redemption, and complex family dynamics with a French-cinema-inspired style.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYjZlNTVmMTAtNGFhMi00YWQ2LTg1OTgtMjUxYjBmMjNjYjc4XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:misgivings-2026'),
