  ('786461404438224231', 'Miss Americana', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', 'Lana Wilson, Emily Topper, Elyse Kelly', null, 'Taylor Swift, Todrick Hall, Brendon Urie, Jack Antonoff, Bobby Berk, Jonathan Van Ness, Karamo Brown, Antoni Porowski', 'R', 'A raw and emotionally revealing look at one of the most iconic artists of our time during a transformational period in her life as she learns to embrace her role not only as a songwriter and performer, but as a woman harnessing the full power of her voice.', 'A raw and emotionally revealing look at one of the most iconic artists of our time during a transformational period in her life as she learns to embrace her role not only as a songwriter and performer, but as a woman harnessing the full power of her voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1HiEB1UEfdA5fPkngekjQ2vlCC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653567'),
