  ('296633091710412498', 'Miss Austen Regrets', 2008, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Jeremy Lovering, David Katznelson', 'Gwyneth Hughes', 'Olivia Williams, Greta Scacchi, Imogen Poots, Phyllida Law, Pip Torrens, Tom Hiddleston, Hugh Bonneville, Tom Goodman-Hill', null, 'Jane Austen is about to turn 40, but she still hasn''t found her ideal man. When Jane is approached by her niece Fanny and asked to help select the perfect husband for the young girl, the aging spinster begins to wonder why it is that she never found a man to share her own life with.', 'Jane Austen is about to turn 40, but she still hasn''t found her ideal man. When Jane is approached by her niece Fanny and asked to help select the perfect husband for the young girl, the aging spinster begins to wonder why it is that she never found a man to share her own life with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5r5xDvKTFAlkmwjoghkgVozNR1Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18089'),
  ('702093149209421738', 'Miss Baek', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Lee Ji-won, Kang Gook-hyun, Jung Hae-ji', 'Lee Ji-won', 'Han Ji-min, Kim Si-a, Lee Hee-jun, Kwon So-hyun, Baek Soo-jang, Jang Young-nam, Kim Sun-young, Jun Suk-ho', null, 'A woman''s past as a convict follows her everywhere and because of this she doesn''t open up to others. But then she strikes up a friendship with a broken child who has suffered from domestic violence and decides to save the girl from the cruel world. A man who holds feelings for the woman, tries to protect her in his own way.', 'A woman''s past as a convict follows her everywhere and because of this she doesn''t open up to others. But then she strikes up a friendship with a broken child who has suffered from domestic violence and decides to save the girl from the cruel world. A man who holds feelings for the woman, tries to protect her in his own way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rw84wVoKDu9PcZ4e7G8mymAb9P4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544814'),
  ('1444851466023408', 'Miss Bala', 2011, 'Drama, Action', 'Gerardo Naranjo, Mátyás Erdély', 'Mauricio Katz, Gerardo Naranjo', 'Stephanie Sigman, Noé Hernández, Irene Azuela, Jose Yenque, James Russo, Miguel Couturier, Gabriel Heads, Juan Carlos Galván', 'R', 'The story of a young woman clinging on to her dream to become a beauty contest queen in a Mexico dominated by organized crime.', 'The story of a young woman clinging on to her dream to become a beauty contest queen in a Mexico dominated by organized crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YLdzzLfa95P1Rf7JkEZp9r1t8y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77635'),
  ('172747514212730527', 'Miss Bala', 2019, 'Action', 'Patrick Murguia, Fernando Altschul, Catherine Hardwicke', 'Gareth Dunnet-Alcocer', 'Gina Rodriguez, Ismael Cruz Cordova, Aislinn Derbez, Matt Lauria, Damián Alcázar, Ricardo Abarca, Cristina Rodlo, Anthony Mackie', 'PG-13', 'Gloria finds a power she never knew she had when she is drawn into a dangerous world of cross-border crime. Surviving will require all of her cunning, inventiveness, and strength.', 'Gloria finds a power she never knew she had when she is drawn into a dangerous world of cross-border crime. Surviving will require all of her cunning, inventiveness, and strength.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ae9yrSAS7nLZPbbkOm61pSuIqeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500852'),
  ('849955964003187008', 'Miss Butcher', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance, Thriller, Crime', 'Ji Kil-wong', null, 'Kim Min-jun, Seo Yeong, Son Jong-hak, Lim Seong-eon, Kim Hae-sook, Lee Jun-hyeok, Kong Jeong-hwan, Lee Tae-geom', null, 'Butcher Soon-ae runs popular shop with male clientele. Bodies of murdered men appear near shop. Detective Kim investigates, becomes suspicious of Soon-ae after meeting her.', 'Butcher Soon-ae runs popular shop with male clientele. Bodies of murdered men appear near shop. Detective Kim investigates, becomes suspicious of Soon-ae after meeting her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqw9DQ84iXo1ePUMLoHZjwVzEt6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438376'),
  ('365071058758010985', 'Miss Cast Away and the Island Girls', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Bryan Michael Stoller, Bryan England', 'Bryan Michael Stoller', 'Eric Roberts, Charlie Schlatter, Joyce Giraud, Michael Jackson, Stuart Pankin, Evan Marriott, Eugene Greytak, Stuart Rigby', null, 'A plane carrying beauty contestants crash lands on a deserted island. Captain Maximus Powers and co-pilot Mike Saunders have to take care of their passengers, while avoiding the dangers of Jurassic Pork (a giant prehistoric pig) and a group of apes busy trying to relaunch Noah''s Ark.', 'A plane carrying beauty contestants crash lands on a deserted island. Captain Maximus Powers and co-pilot Mike Saunders have to take care of their passengers, while avoiding the dangers of Jurassic Pork (a giant prehistoric pig) and a group of apes busy trying to relaunch Noah''s Ark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzjutZ0Zkg4LF0oozsOR1nzYY9V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31389'),
  ('707164798610411668', 'Miss Change', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Zeong Cho-sin', 'Kim Ju-Hyun', 'Song Sam-dong, Lee Su-jung, Jeong Eun-woo, Shin Yu-ju, You Il-han, Nam Moon-chul, Jin Yong-uk, Seo Ha-yoon', null, 'Je-Chil is a lawyer that does well financially, but he has never dated a woman in his life. He can''t even make eye contact with women. His severe shyness effects his job. In court, he can''t make eye contact with women and becomes brain frozen. Because of this, he loses case after case. Je-Chil has held a secret crush on Soo-Hyun for over 10 years. Je-Chil''s life then changes. On a rainy evening, Je-Chil finds a beautiful woman unconscious on the ground. He brings her home.', 'Je-Chil is a lawyer that does well financially, but he has never dated a woman in his life. He can''t even make eye contact with women. His severe shyness effects his job. In court, he can''t make eye contact with women and becomes brain frozen. Because of this, he loses case after case. Je-Chil has held a secret crush on Soo-Hyun for over 10 years. Je-Chil''s life then changes. On a rainy evening, Je-Chil finds a beautiful woman unconscious on the ground. He brings her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/el0uoS5eC7Q3BKzOgCnl0gzU8JK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254531'),
  ('851233168337949990', 'Miss Christmas', 2017, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Ryan McMaster, Mike Rohl', 'Joie Botkin', 'Brooke D''Orsay, Marc Blucas, Luke Roessler, Erin Boyes, Fiona Vroom, James Rha, Greg Rogers, Crystal Balint', null, 'Holly Khun, known to Chicago as “Miss Christmas,” always finds a beautiful tree for the plaza, but this year’s was damaged, and the lighting ceremony is in 10 days. Hoping for a miracle, she combs through fan mail, and finds Joey McNary of Klaus, Wisconsin, has the perfect tree. Off she goes to Klaus, where she meets Joey’s handsome dad Sam.', 'Holly Khun, known to Chicago as “Miss Christmas,” always finds a beautiful tree for the plaza, but this year’s was damaged, and the lighting ceremony is in 10 days. Hoping for a miracle, she combs through fan mail, and finds Joey McNary of Klaus, Wisconsin, has the perfect tree. Off she goes to Klaus, where she meets Joey’s handsome dad Sam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUDBk5ktuUJUCcCMF0G75VVo7v8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474974'),
  ('738200777033769372', 'Miss Conception', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Eric Styles, Ed Mash', 'Camilla Leslie', 'Heather Graham, Mia Kirshner, Tom Ellis, Will Mellor, Orlando Seale, Ruta Gedmintas, Nicholas Le Prevost, Debbie Javor', 'R', 'Georgina is an ambitious young London professional who learns she has only one month left in which to conceive a child. After exhausting all possibilities with her baby-phobic boyfriend, Georgina turns to her wildly optimistic friend Clem, with whom she sets out to identify and "land" the perfect father for her child.', 'Georgina is an ambitious young London professional who learns she has only one month left in which to conceive a child. After exhausting all possibilities with her baby-phobic boyfriend, Georgina turns to her wildly optimistic friend Clem, with whom she sets out to identify and "land" the perfect father for her child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0p4s1ds3UATUPrTymUZPWIhJoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14847'),
  ('1077729320134284693', 'Miss Congeniality', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Donald Petrie, László Kovács, Tommy Harper', 'Marc Lawrence, Katie Ford, Caryn Lucas', 'Sandra Bullock, Benjamin Bratt, Heather Burns, Michael Caine, Ernie Hudson, Candice Bergen, William Shatner, John DiResta', 'PG-13', 'When the local FBI office receives a letter from a terrorist known only as ''The Citizen'', it''s quickly determined that he''s planning his next act at the Miss America beauty pageant. Because tough-as-nails Gracie Hart is the only female Agent at the office, she''s chosen to go undercover as the contestant from New Jersey.', 'When the local FBI office receives a letter from a terrorist known only as ''The Citizen'', it''s quickly determined that he''s planning his next act at the Miss America beauty pageant. Because tough-as-nails Gracie Hart is the only female Agent at the office, she''s chosen to go undercover as the contestant from New Jersey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pat3vKaRlB70he4ghwTMydR4TvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1493'),
  ('787437744292516669', 'Miss Congeniality 2: Armed and Fabulous', 2005, 'Action, Comedy', 'John Pasquin, Peter Menzies Jr., Paula Case', 'Marc Lawrence', 'Sandra Bullock, Regina King, Enrique Murciano, Ernie Hudson, William Shatner, Heather Burns, Diedrich Bader, Treat Williams', 'PG-13', 'After her triumph at the Miss United States pageant, FBI agent Gracie Hart becomes an overnight sensation -- and the new "face of the FBI". But it''s time to spring into action again when the pageant''s winner, Cheryl, and emcee, Stan, are abducted.', 'After her triumph at the Miss United States pageant, FBI agent Gracie Hart becomes an overnight sensation -- and the new "face of the FBI". But it''s time to spring into action again when the pageant''s winner, Cheryl, and emcee, Stan, are abducted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcYoIHND3ugn2VH1cNHHNQasEyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10040'),
  ('721752718659673637', 'Miss Conspirator', 2012, 'Action, Comedy', 'Park Chul-kwan, Bae Il-hyuck', 'Jung Bum-shik, Jung Sik, Choi Moon-suk', 'Ko Hyun-jung, Yoo Hai-jin, Sung Dong-il, Lee Moon-sik, Ko Chang-seok, Kim Byong-chul, Park Shin-yang, Lee Won-jong', null, 'A woman with a severe anxiety disorder stumbles into a 44 million dollars drug deal gone wrong. Suddenly the mafia, as well as the police, wants to get hold of her.', 'A woman with a severe anxiety disorder stumbles into a 44 million dollars drug deal gone wrong. Suddenly the mafia, as well as the police, wants to get hold of her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NpCA5Bia4CA9HhSagaEoWwjLDJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134000'),
  ('642635037433236212', 'Miss Dundee and Her Performing Dogs', 1902, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A woman shows off her trained dogs.', 'A woman shows off her trained dogs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GxYLuzBYzIgolZe7JNIU3vLUef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119982'),
  ('606081540281747136', 'Miss Europe', 1930, 'Drama', 'Augusto Genina, Edmond T. Gréville', 'René Clair', 'Louise Brooks, Georges Charlia, Augusto Bandini, André Nicolle, Alex Bernard, Gaston Jacquet, Jean Bradin, Henri Crémieux', null, 'Lucienne, typist and gorgeous bathing beauty, decides to enter the ''Miss Europe'' pageant sponsored by the French newspaper she works for. She finds her jealous lover Andre violently disapproves of such events and tries to withdraw, but it''s too late; she''s even then being named Miss France. The night Andre planned to propose to her, she''s being whisked off to the Miss Europe finals in Spain, where admirers swarm around her. Win or lose, what will the harvest be?', 'Lucienne, typist and gorgeous bathing beauty, decides to enter the ''Miss Europe'' pageant sponsored by the French newspaper she works for. She finds her jealous lover Andre violently disapproves of such events and tries to withdraw, but it''s too late; she''s even then being named Miss France. The night Andre planned to propose to her, she''s being whisked off to the Miss Europe finals in Spain, where admirers swarm around her. Win or lose, what will the harvest be?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCKNgwP69GLQGch2tErOSQJSO4w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56178'),
  ('170053278027802913', 'Miss Evers'' Boys', 1997, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Joseph Sargent, Donald M. Morgan', 'Walter Bernstein', 'Alfre Woodard, Laurence Fishburne, Craig Sheffer, Joe Morton, Obba Babatundé, Ossie Davis, Peter Stelzer, Donzaleigh Abernathy', 'PG', 'The true story of the US Government''s 1932 Tuskeegee Syphilis Experiments, in which a group of black test subjects were allowed to die, despite a cure having been developed.', 'The true story of the US Government''s 1932 Tuskeegee Syphilis Experiments, in which a group of black test subjects were allowed to die, despite a cure having been developed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnC7xMbXGDEO7ETVOsTOOPYXTCM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133958'),
  ('326424644657804860', 'Miss Firecracker', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Thomas Schlamme, Arthur Albert', 'Beth Henley', 'Holly Hunter, Alfre Woodard, Mary Steenburgen, Tim Robbins, Scott Glenn, Trey Wilson, Ann Wedgeworth, Amy Wright', 'PG', 'Unhappy Carnelle Scott is desperate to escape her reputation as Yazoo City''s ''Miss Hot Tamale.'' She throws herself into a do-or-die effort to win the Mississippi town''s big talent contest, an honor won ten years ago by her older sister and unattainable role model Elain.', 'Unhappy Carnelle Scott is desperate to escape her reputation as Yazoo City''s ''Miss Hot Tamale.'' She throws herself into a do-or-die effort to win the Mississippi town''s big talent contest, an honor won ten years ago by her older sister and unattainable role model Elain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgCceswgp74CKtss7JmdtXDljiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39197'),
  ('394212498889320615', 'Miss Fisher and the Crypt of Tears', 2020, 'Drama, Adventure, Mystery', 'Tony Tilse, Dean Fay, Roger Lanser', 'Deb Cox', 'Essie Davis, Nathan Page, Izabella Yena, Rupert Penry-Jones, Daniel Lapaine, Jacqueline McKenzie, Miriam Margolyes, Khaled Abol Naga', null, 'After freeing a young Bedouin girl from her unjust imprisonment in Jerusalem, an Australian adventuress, together with her devoted police detective friend, begins to unravel a decade-old mystery concerning priceless emeralds, an ancient curse and the disappearance of the girl''s mother and massacre of her tribe.', 'After freeing a young Bedouin girl from her unjust imprisonment in Jerusalem, an Australian adventuress, together with her devoted police detective friend, begins to unravel a decade-old mystery concerning priceless emeralds, an ancient curse and the disappearance of the girl''s mother and massacre of her tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGhbw9hVsDIO70QhQAYG9quTqKF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518978'),
  ('369961740249120690', 'Miss Granny', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Hwang Dong-hyuk, Kim Ji-yong, Park Jung-bae', 'Hong Yoon-jeong, Dong Hee-sun, Shin Dong-ik', 'Shim Eun-kyung, Na Moon-hee, Lee Jin-uk, Jung Jin-young, Park In-hwan, Sung Dong-il, Hwang Jeong-min, Kim Hyun-sook', null, 'An unappreciated old granny magically turns 20 years old again and decides to make the most of her newfound youth.', 'An unappreciated old granny magically turns 20 years old again and decides to make the most of her newfound youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQcSCLOxqJlRyqAPnj4B0UTXIfF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253065'),
  ('1079703993443884459', 'Miss Hokusai', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, History', 'Keiichi Hara, Koji Tanaka, Masako Sato', 'Miho Maruo', 'Anne Watanabe, Kumiko Aso, Gaku Hamada, Kengo Kora, Yutaka Matsushige, Jun Miho, Shion Shimizu, Danshun Tatekawa', null, 'A daughter is constantly overshadowed by her famous father, but she is determined to make her own mark in the world.', 'A daughter is constantly overshadowed by her famous father, but she is determined to make her own mark in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21botnUdVFVeg2nb8j5SHfupWD9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267970'),
  ('1120479763603369588', 'Miss Impossible', 2017, 'Drama', 'Émilie Deleuze, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Marie Desplechin, Émilie Deleuze, Laurent Guyot', 'Léna Magnien, Patricia Mazuy, Philippe Duquesne, Catherine Hiegel, Alex Lutz, Nathan Melloul, Axel Auriant, Mehdi Messaoudi', null, 'They’re all nuts. Her parents, who want to send her off to boarding school. Her new teacher, who expects her to read impossibly old books. Her fellow band members, who make her sing ridiculous lyrics and dress her up in a frilly white dress for their first show. Everyone seems to know what she should do and how she should act. And it’s not like 13-year-old Aurore has any fundamental problem with changing herself either. Who would want to be like this: unhappy, ugly and emotionally withdrawn? But the others don’t seem all that much happier to her either. She definitely doesn’t ever want to be as old, rundown and lonely as her mother. And so she prefers to stay the way she is, to observe and make her biting comments on whatever comes her way.', 'They’re all nuts. Her parents, who want to send her off to boarding school. Her new teacher, who expects her to read impossibly old books. Her fellow band members, who make her sing ridiculous lyrics and dress her up in a frilly white dress for their first show. Everyone seems to know what she should do and how she should act. And it’s not like 13-year-old Aurore has any fundamental problem with changing herself either. Who would want to be like this: unhappy, ugly and emotionally withdrawn? But the others don’t seem all that much happier to her either. She definitely doesn’t ever want to be as old, rundown and lonely as her mother. And so she prefers to stay the way she is, to observe and make her biting comments on whatever comes her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mr4XCmVjNAKu26ZeUmbjf1HD2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384726'),
  ('259237789391022276', 'Miss Italia Mustn''t Die', 2025, 'Documentary', 'David Gallerano, Pietro Daviddi', 'David Gallerano, Pietro Daviddi, Gregorio Romeo', 'Patrizia Mirigliani', null, 'Behind the glitz of Miss Italia, director Patrizia Mirigliani fights to save the iconic pageant, now wavering amid scandals and changing beauty standards.', 'Behind the glitz of Miss Italia, director Patrizia Mirigliani fights to save the iconic pageant, now wavering amid scandals and changing beauty standards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mOX8qO3QHNlhcEIoIwTvu1SHpD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1422877'),
  ('125405886600743588', 'Miss Julie', 1951, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alf Sjöberg, Göran Strindberg, Kurt-Olof Sundström', 'Alf Sjöberg', 'Anita Björk, Ulf Palme, Märta Dorff, Lissi Alandh, Anders Henrikson, Inga Gill, Max von Sydow, Åke Fridell', null, 'Based on the play by August Strindberg, Miss Julie vividly depicts the battle of the sexes and classes that ensues when Julie, a wealthy businessman''s daughter, falls for Jean, her father''s bitter servant.', 'Based on the play by August Strindberg, Miss Julie vividly depicts the battle of the sexes and classes that ensues when Julie, a wealthy businessman''s daughter, falls for Jean, her father''s bitter servant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0FCrjopWvU6rm54WpioTLCUVZc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18650'),
  ('337363687245100057', 'Miss Julie', 1999, 'Drama', 'Mike Figgis, Benoît Delhomme', 'Helen Cooper, August Strindberg', 'Saffron Burrows, Peter Mullan, Maria Doyle Kennedy, Joanna Page, Eileen Walsh, Tam Dean Burn, Heathcote Williams', 'R', 'A footman seduces a count''s daughter. Adaptation of August Strindberg''s famous play.', 'A footman seduces a count''s daughter. Adaptation of August Strindberg''s famous play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eBM9T0CKZpy59dIsvAg4GArTg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125520'),
  ('1128746123291417671', 'Miss Julie', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Liv Ullmann, Peter Bækkel, Paul Kirby', 'Liv Ullmann', 'Jessica Chastain, Colin Farrell, Samantha Morton, Nora McMenamy', 'PG-13', 'Over the course of a midsummer night in 1890s Ireland, the unsettled daughter of the Anglo-Irish aristocracy encourages her father''s valet to seduce her.', 'Over the course of a midsummer night in 1890s Ireland, the unsettled daughter of the Anglo-Irish aristocracy encourages her father''s valet to seduce her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11X9DZGT3P7bJhWxfwFdCkWHILS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230266'),
  ('1075380399812432596', 'Miss Juneteenth', 2020, 'Drama', 'Joshua Moody, Channing Godfrey Peoples, Daniel Patterson', 'Channing Godfrey Peoples', 'Nicole Beharie, Kendrick Sampson, Alexis Chikaeze, Akron Watson, Liz Mikel, Marcus M. Mauldin, Mikayla Rivers, Jaime Matthis', 'R', 'Turquoise, a former beauty queen turned hardworking single mother, prepares her rebellious teenage daughter for the “Miss Juneteenth” pageant, hoping to keep her from repeating the same mistakes in life that she did.', 'Turquoise, a former beauty queen turned hardworking single mother, prepares her rebellious teenage daughter for the “Miss Juneteenth” pageant, hoping to keep her from repeating the same mistakes in life that she did.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aueUTOvA8Y6A4eteDwhgo8ReX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653668'),
  ('649371013064601917', 'Miss Kobayashi''s Dragon Maid: A lonely dragon wants to be loved', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Tatsuya Ishihara, Yasuhiro Takemoto, Miku Kadowaki', 'Yuka Yamada', 'Maria Naganawa, Mutsumi Tamura, Yuuki Kuwahara, Yuuki Takada, Minami Takahashi, Shiori Sugiura, Daisuke Ono, Yuichi Nakamura', 'PG-13', 'Miss Kobayashi, Tohru, Kanna, and Iruru''s peaceful lives are shattered when Kanna''s father, Kimun Kamui, leader of the Chaos Forces, arrives and forces her to return to the Dragon World to fix a past mistake. With a war brewing between Chaos and Harmony, Kanna must find a way to unite the two worlds but is torn between her loyalty to her friends and her father''s demands. Miss Kobayashi, however, refuses to let her go and tries to mend Kanna and Kamui''s broken bond. As dragons clash, Iruru uncovers a hidden force manipulating the war. Can they stop the war before it consumes both worlds?', 'Miss Kobayashi, Tohru, Kanna, and Iruru''s peaceful lives are shattered when Kanna''s father, Kimun Kamui, leader of the Chaos Forces, arrives and forces her to return to the Dragon World to fix a past mistake. With a war brewing between Chaos and Harmony, Kanna must find a way to unite the two worlds but is torn between her loyalty to her friends and her father''s demands. Miss Kobayashi, however, refuses to let her go and tries to mend Kanna and Kamui''s broken bond. As dragons clash, Iruru uncovers a hidden force manipulating the war. Can they stop the war before it consumes both worlds?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kN0V877loq6kkDybVbi3KcrjwgE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1359607'),
  ('900783252598786239', 'Miss Leslie''s Dolls', 1973, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Joseph G. Prieto, Gregory Sandor', 'Joseph G. Prieto, Ralph Remy Jr.', 'Salvador Ugarte, Terri Juston, Kitty Lewis, Charles Pitts, Marcelle Bichette', null, 'A young college professor and three of her students seek shelter during a storm in the rural farmhouse of a strange woman who collects lifelike mannequins.', 'A young college professor and three of her students seek shelter during a storm in the rural farmhouse of a strange woman who collects lifelike mannequins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHwJo6e6AmtrRY7ZNOHgJModOh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320180'),
  ('566661390440670935', 'Miss Lovely', 2014, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ashim Ahluwalia, K.U. Mohanan', 'Uttam Sirur', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Niharika Singh, Anil George, Zeena Bhatia, Menka Lalwani, Ragesh Asthana, Manoj Bakshi, Avinash Razdan', null, 'A Hindi feature film set in the lower depths of Bombay''s "C" grade film industry. Miss Lovely follows the devastating story of two brothers who produce sleazy horror films in the mid-1980s.', 'A Hindi feature film set in the lower depths of Bombay''s "C" grade film industry. Miss Lovely follows the devastating story of two brothers who produce sleazy horror films in the mid-1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjEvChpGn5Ylsesd84aiVc6okUW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126318'),
  ('726464044424390751', 'Miss Lulu Bett', 1921, 'Comedy, Drama', 'William C. deMille, L. Guy Wilky', 'Clara Beranger', 'Lois Wilson, Milton Sills, Theodore Roberts, Helen Ferguson, Mabel Van Buren, Mae Giraci, Clarence Burton, Ethel Wales', null, 'Lois Wilson (as Lulu) is the spinsterish member of the Deacon family: "The family beast of burden, whose timid soul has failed to break the bonds of family servitude." Her brother-in-law is patriarchal Theodore Roberts (as Dwight Deacon); running the house with an iron fist, he is both a dentist and a Justice of the Peace. As the latter, he accidentally marries Ms. Wilson to his visiting brother Clarence Burton (as Ninian Deacon) while they are out for dinner. Schoolteacher Milton Sills (as Neil Cornish) is also interested in Wilson...', 'Lois Wilson (as Lulu) is the spinsterish member of the Deacon family: "The family beast of burden, whose timid soul has failed to break the bonds of family servitude." Her brother-in-law is patriarchal Theodore Roberts (as Dwight Deacon); running the house with an iron fist, he is both a dentist and a Justice of the Peace. As the latter, he accidentally marries Ms. Wilson to his visiting brother Clarence Burton (as Ninian Deacon) while they are out for dinner. Schoolteacher Milton Sills (as Neil Cornish) is also interested in Wilson...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWUxh0FWMTClAFoGBPNe0vGL916.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130275'),
  ('1060241363913832349', 'Miss Manager', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Nikos Kavoukidis', 'Costas Pretederis, Asimakis Gialamas', 'Jenny Karezi, Alekos Alexandrakis, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Lili Papayanni, Eleni Zafeiriou, Dimitris Nikolaidis, Giannis Vogiatzis, Kostas Karras', null, 'The strict and formal director Lila Vassiliou has under her orders all the staff of the technical office of which she takes over the management, but at the same time, she is looking to find ways of charm to conquer the lively sub-engineer Alekos Samiotakis.', 'The strict and formal director Lila Vassiliou has under her orders all the staff of the technical office of which she takes over the management, but at the same time, she is looking to find ways of charm to conquer the lively sub-engineer Alekos Samiotakis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gCFgblC9q4N78FZjjBlCHqy3eU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57305'),
  ('463582346176696048', 'Miss March', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Trevor Moore, Zach Cregger, Anthony B. Richmond', 'Zach Cregger, Trevor Moore', 'Zach Cregger, Trevor Moore, Raquel Alessi, Molly Stanton, Craig Robinson, Hugh Hefner, Carla Jimenez, Cedric Yarbrough', 'R', 'A young man awakens from a four-year coma to hear that his once virginal high-school sweetheart has since become a centerfold in one of the world''s most famous men''s magazines. He and his sex-crazed best friend decide to take a cross-country road trip in order to crash a party at the magazine''s legendary mansion headquarters and win back the girl.', 'A young man awakens from a four-year coma to hear that his once virginal high-school sweetheart has since become a centerfold in one of the world''s most famous men''s magazines. He and his sex-crazed best friend decide to take a cross-country road trip in order to crash a party at the magazine''s legendary mansion headquarters and win back the girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJovsKIjVsSMuwURASoTZJB6jvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19556'),
  ('523070494901134995', 'Miss Marple: 4.50 from Paddington', 1987, 'Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'John Walker, Martyn Friend, John Altman', 'T.R. Bowen', 'Joan Hickson, Jill Meager, David Horovitch, Ian Brimble, Maurice Denham, Joanna David, Bernard Brown, Robert East', null, 'Travelling on the 4.50 from Paddington, Mrs McGillicuddy witnesses a murder on a passing train - but where is the body?', 'Travelling on the 4.50 from Paddington, Mrs McGillicuddy witnesses a murder on a passing train - but where is the body?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9injrauN55jBEmhNCLOw9Wxc6IV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499292'),
  ('335716247786010554', 'Miss Marple: A Caribbean Mystery', 1989, 'Mystery, Crime, TV Movie', 'Chris Petit, John Walker', 'T.R. Bowen', 'Joan Hickson, Donald Pleasence, Adrian Lukis, Sophie Ward, T. P. McKenna, Michael Feast, Sheila Ruskin, Frank Middlemass', null, 'While on vacation at a resort hotel in the West Indies, Miss Marple correctly suspects that the apparently natural death of a retired British major is actually the work of a murderer planning yet another killing.', 'While on vacation at a resort hotel in the West Indies, Miss Marple correctly suspects that the apparently natural death of a retired British major is actually the work of a murderer planning yet another killing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFN090M13cF2nnOq40F6fNz0HJN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:578561'),
  ('51896798511760568', 'Miss Marple: The Mirror Crack''d from Side to Side', 1992, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'John Walker, John Altman, Norman Stone', 'T.R. Bowen', 'Joan Hickson, Claire Bloom, Barry Newman, Norman Rodway, John Cassady, David Horovitch, John Castle, Ian Brimble', null, 'A town busybody is poisoned at a busy reception in the home of famous film star Marina Gregg. The poisoned drink seemed intended for Marina, but Miss Marple is not so sure. She sets out to discover the true identity of the killer before he or she can strike again.', 'A town busybody is poisoned at a busy reception in the home of famous film star Marina Gregg. The poisoned drink seemed intended for Marina, but Miss Marple is not so sure. She sets out to discover the true identity of the killer before he or she can strike again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmxqf5dDkTEq0YtRsY5Ti55352h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417161'),
  ('558807600731738046', 'Miss Marple: The Murder at the Vicarage', 1986, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'John Walker, Julian Amyes', 'T.R. Bowen', 'Joan Hickson, Polly Adams, Cheryl Campbell, Rosalie Crutchley, Paul Eddington, Rachael Weaver, David Horovitch, Tara MacGowran', null, 'Faced with two false confessions and numerous suspects after a despised civil magistrate is found shot in the local vicarage, Detective Inspector Slack reluctantly accepts help from Miss Marple.', 'Faced with two false confessions and numerous suspects after a despised civil magistrate is found shot in the local vicarage, Detective Inspector Slack reluctantly accepts help from Miss Marple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkJZURN8E8w7wBj4IzeGUUtsaC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293879'),
  ('22997243615138830', 'Miss Marple: They Do It with Mirrors', 1991, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'John Walker, Norman Stone', 'T.R. Bowen', 'Joan Hickson, Jean Simmons, Joss Ackland, Faith Brook, Holly Aird, Todd Boyce, Tom Kerridge, Gillian Barge', null, 'At the insistence of Ruth Van Rydock, an old schoolfriend who is convinced that there is something wrong, Miss Marple agrees to visit ''Stonygates'', the country house of Ruth''s sister.', 'At the insistence of Ruth Van Rydock, an old schoolfriend who is convinced that there is something wrong, Miss Marple agrees to visit ''Stonygates'', the country house of Ruth''s sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVsTv0I24Z3QHTCW6aXv9QzIyT0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416417'),
  ('80427461787774915', 'Miss Marx', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'Susanna Nicchiarelli, Crystel Fournier, Ciro Scognamiglio', 'Susanna Nicchiarelli', 'Romola Garai, Patrick Kennedy, John Gordon Sinclair, Felicity Montagu, Karina Fernandez, Emma Cunniffe, George Arrendell, Célestin Ryelandt', null, 'In her public persona, Eleanor “Tussy” Marx was a translator, actress, a children’s rights activist and a persuasive labour organizer, a tireless powerhouse determined to carry on her father’s work. She held her own with twentieth century gods, including both her father and his colleague Engels. In her privately life, however, she was vulnerable and her attraction to the self-indulgent and self-important Edward Aveling led her into misery and ultimately proved fatal.', 'In her public persona, Eleanor “Tussy” Marx was a translator, actress, a children’s rights activist and a persuasive labour organizer, a tireless powerhouse determined to carry on her father’s work. She held her own with twentieth century gods, including both her father and his colleague Engels. In her privately life, however, she was vulnerable and her attraction to the self-indulgent and self-important Edward Aveling led her into misery and ultimately proved fatal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfXx51cfTgvYWb8gp6nHZwPVjEm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714099'),
  ('723094034522169158', 'Miss Meadows', 2014, 'Drama', 'Karen Leigh Hopkins, Barry Markowitz', 'Karen Leigh Hopkins', 'Katie Holmes, James Badge Dale, Callan Mulvey, Mary Kay Place, Saidah Arrika Ekulona, James Landry Hébert, Kate Linder, Stephen Bishop', null, 'Miss Meadows is a school teacher with impeccable manners and grace. However, underneath the candy-sweet exterior hides a ruthless gun-toting vigilante who takes it upon herself to right the wrongs in the world by whatever means necessary. For Miss Meadows, bad behavior is simply unforgivable.', 'Miss Meadows is a school teacher with impeccable manners and grace. However, underneath the candy-sweet exterior hides a ruthless gun-toting vigilante who takes it upon herself to right the wrongs in the world by whatever means necessary. For Miss Meadows, bad behavior is simply unforgivable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpYXvWGKPwk51UTk8hqo0qE13qk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261037'),
  ('96604013441158083', 'Miss Mend', 1926, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Fyodor Otsep, Yevgeni Alekseyev, Lev Tumanov', 'Boris Barnet, Fyodor Otsep, Vasili Sakhnovsky', 'Natalya Glan, Boris Barnet, Vladimir Fogel, Igor Ilyinsky, Sergei Komarov, Ivan Koval-Samborskyi, Tatyana Mukhina, Mikhail Rozen-Sanin', null, 'Three reporters and an office girl are trying to stop a bacteriological strike by some powerful western business leaders against the USSR.', 'Three reporters and an office girl are trying to stop a bacteriological strike by some powerful western business leaders against the USSR.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAFHbtniAew8mJ84tS5J9iCuTDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250676'),
  ('641976908844008208', 'Miss Merkel - Mord auf dem Friedhof', 2024, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Torsten Wacker', 'David Safier, Anja Flade', 'Katharina Thalbach, Susanne Bredehöft, László Branko Breiding, Farina Flebbe, Kristin Alia Hunold, Tim Kalkhof, Paula Kroh, Lorenzo Fanni', null, 'Another murder takes place in tranquil Klein-Freudenstadt. And Angela Merkel is in the middle of it again.', 'Another murder takes place in tranquil Klein-Freudenstadt. And Angela Merkel is in the middle of it again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kA9Sn0KBiN6JOSw8CK6kwC7yHob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1248793'),
  ('678357842978509807', 'Miss Minoes', 2001, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Vincent Bal, Walther van den Ende', 'Burny Bos, Vincent Bal, Tamara Bos', 'Carice van Houten, Theo Maassen, Jack Wouterse, Pierre Bokma, Olga Zuiderhoek, Hans Kesting, Sarah Bannier, Marisa van Eyle', null, 'A cat who turns into a young woman helps a journalist protect their town from a factory boss with an evil plan.', 'A cat who turns into a young woman helps a journalist protect their town from a factory boss with an evil plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3g2sgWIekjXYAjGddA6I85NE6MJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25797'),
  ('1017372765041355422', 'Miss Nobody', 1996, 'Drama', 'Andrzej Wajda', 'Radosław Piwowarski', 'Anna Wielgucka, Anna Mucha, Anna Powierza, Stanisława Celińska', null, 'A devout Catholic peasant girl is corrupted by two new friends when her family moves to the city. An allegory of traditional Polish values under threat from materialism and decadence in the post-Communist era.', 'A devout Catholic peasant girl is corrupted by two new friends when her family moves to the city. An allegory of traditional Polish values under threat from materialism and decadence in the post-Communist era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiWjXIc7iMHAKxgmKh5GJ3FHtM1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80652'),
  ('526056283986793636', 'Miss Nobody', 2010, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Abram Cox, Mateo Londoño, Armando Salas', 'Doug Steinberg', 'Leslie Bibb, Kathy Baker, Missi Pyle, Vivica A. Fox, Paula Marshall, David Anthony Higgins, Adam Goldberg, Brandon Routh', 'R', 'A mild-mannered secretary discovers that she has a talent for murder as she ascends the corporate ladder.', 'A mild-mannered secretary discovers that she has a talent for murder as she ascends the corporate ladder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDrQ2rRdmlKAOeSUvSFZi0Rt5op.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51875'),
  ('952738126371942229', 'Miss Oyu', 1951, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Yoshikata Yoda', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Nobuko Otowa, Yūji Hori, Kiyoko Hirai, Reiko Kongō, Eijirō Yanagi, Eitarō Shindō, Kanae Kobayashi', null, 'Shinnosuke is introduced to Shizu as a prospective marriage partner, but he falls in love with her widowed sister Oyu. Convention forbids Oyu to marry because she has to raise her son as the head of her husband''s family. Oyu convinces Shinnosuke and Shizu to marry so that she can remain close to Shinnosuke.', 'Shinnosuke is introduced to Shizu as a prospective marriage partner, but he falls in love with her widowed sister Oyu. Convention forbids Oyu to marry because she has to raise her son as the head of her husband''s family. Oyu convinces Shinnosuke and Shizu to marry so that she can remain close to Shinnosuke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5h46GdEaK2IZsYWKiK4N9Oyz4Y0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46043'),
  ('807631728289215913', 'Miss Peregrine''s Home for Peculiar Children', 2016, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Tim Burton, Bruno Delbonnel, Gary Jopling', 'Jane Goldman', 'Eva Green, Asa Butterfield, Samuel L. Jackson, Judi Dench, Rupert Everett, Chris O''Dowd, Allison Janney, Ella Purnell', 'PG-13', 'A teenager finds himself transported to an island where he must help protect a group of orphans with special powers from creatures intent on destroying them.', 'A teenager finds himself transported to an island where he must help protect a group of orphans with special powers from creatures intent on destroying them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CIlbMFOfYDj0MP23hsIYhFGrL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283366'),
  ('233834020823101545', 'Miss Pettigrew Lives for a Day', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Bharat Nalluri, John de Borman, Guy Heeley', 'Simon Beaufoy, David Magee', 'Frances McDormand, Amy Adams, Lee Pace, Ciarán Hinds, Shirley Henderson, Mark Strong, Tom Payne, Christina Cole', 'PG-13', 'London, England, on the eve of World War II. Guinevere Pettigrew, a strict governess who is unable to keep a job, is fired again. Lost in the hostile city, a series of fortunate circumstances lead her to meet Delysia LaFosse, a glamorous and dazzling American jazz singer whose life is a chaos ruled by indecision, a continuous battle between love and fame.', 'London, England, on the eve of World War II. Guinevere Pettigrew, a strict governess who is unable to keep a job, is fired again. Lost in the hostile city, a series of fortunate circumstances lead her to meet Delysia LaFosse, a glamorous and dazzling American jazz singer whose life is a chaos ruled by indecision, a continuous battle between love and fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8ylf9VH21E9uxcl7vslJpPXnwQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12178'),
  ('1148259922276370231', 'Miss Pinkerton', 1932, 'Comedy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Lloyd Bacon, Barney McGill', 'Niven Busch, Lillie Hayward', 'Joan Blondell, George Brent, Ruth Hall, John Wray, Elizabeth Patterson, C. Henry Gordon, Holmes Herbert, Mary Doran', null, 'Scion of the once-rich Mitchell family, Herbert Wynn is found shot to death. Nurse Adams, bored by hospital routine, is recruited by the police to ferret out clues as she tends to Wynn''s elderly aunt Julia. Jokingly given the ''rank'' of Miss Pinkerton, after the famous detective agency, Adams probes into the mystery, but not before a second death.', 'Scion of the once-rich Mitchell family, Herbert Wynn is found shot to death. Nurse Adams, bored by hospital routine, is recruited by the police to ferret out clues as she tends to Wynn''s elderly aunt Julia. Jokingly given the ''rank'' of Miss Pinkerton, after the famous detective agency, Adams probes into the mystery, but not before a second death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYMs6fUW8nl3uV7yaNYzpigxuzk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188366'),
  ('1036443599637727298', 'Miss Potter', 2006, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Chris Noonan, Mark Raggett, Andrew Dunn', 'Richard Maltby, Jr.', 'Renée Zellweger, Ewan McGregor, Emily Watson, Barbara Flynn, Bill Paterson, Matyelok Gibbs, Lloyd Owen, Anton Lesser', 'PG', 'Beatrix Potter, the author of the beloved children''s book "The Tale of Peter Rabbit", struggles for love, happiness and success.', 'Beatrix Potter, the author of the beloved children''s book "The Tale of Peter Rabbit", struggles for love, happiness and success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fecGKwGABfZdMbiH1WQN9zMcOkS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13967'),
  ('1016881672180521837', 'Miss Representation', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Jennifer Siebel Newsom, Svetlana Cvetko, Nathan Levine-Heaney', 'Jennifer Siebel Newsom, Jessica Congdon, Claire Dietrich', 'Katie Couric, Jane Fonda, Geena Davis, Rosario Dawson, Catherine Hardwicke, Cory Booker, Margaret Cho, Paul Haggis', null, 'The film MISS REPRESENTATION exposes how American youth are being sold the concept that women and girls’ value lies in their youth, beauty and sexuality. Explores the under-representation of women in positions of power and influence in America, and challenges the media''s limited portrayal of what it means to be a powerful woman. It’s time to break that cycle of mistruths.', 'The film MISS REPRESENTATION exposes how American youth are being sold the concept that women and girls’ value lies in their youth, beauty and sexuality. Explores the under-representation of women in positions of power and influence in America, and challenges the media''s limited portrayal of what it means to be a powerful woman. It’s time to break that cycle of mistruths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98owJxMsoARozljBXpQXH93v2fF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77801'),
  ('1138315695051439444', 'Miss Sadie Thompson', 1953, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Curtis Bernhardt, Charles Lawton Jr.', 'Harry Kleiner', 'Rita Hayworth, José Ferrer, Aldo Ray, Russell Collins, Diosa Costello, Harry Bellaver, Wilton Graff, Peggy Converse', 'NR', 'Sadie Thompson winds up stranded on an island and while her boat is being quarantined, she manages to stir up the blood of every marine on the base.', 'Sadie Thompson winds up stranded on an island and while her boat is being quarantined, she manages to stir up the blood of every marine on the base.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bivpL0VSVuFTSDT7LAXQJ1xvQVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44140'),
  ('667943163842239985', 'Miss Shampoo', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Giddens Ko, Chou Yi-hsien, Lucy Chen', 'Giddens Ko', 'Vivian Sung, Hong Yu-hong, Kai Ko, Emerson Tsai, Ying Wei-min, Bai Jing-yi, Jin Mei-Man, Miao Ke-li', 'R', 'A hair salon apprentice accidentally saves a gangster''s life — an act that helps bring in new clientele and drops her into a world of chaos.', 'A hair salon apprentice accidentally saves a gangster''s life — an act that helps bring in new clientele and drops her into a world of chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNHvHwSrsDbA3jtUyxS2UZ34sqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1016392'),
  ('211600377136320054', 'Miss Sixty', 2014, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family', 'Sigrid Hoerner, Matthias Fleischer', 'Jane Ainscough', 'Iris Berben, Edgar Selge, Björn von der Wellen, Kirsten Block, Michael Gwisdek, Navid Navid, Nikolai Will, Götz Schubert', null, 'Now that we’re all living longer and “40 is the new 30,” why can’t 60 be the new 40? That’s what Louise and Frans think when they embark on bold new life adventures. Louise is a molecular biologist who decides to make a withdrawal from the sperm bank and have a baby. Meanwhile, gallery owner Frans decides to re-boot his career by finding the hottest new talent on the art scene. While attempting to recapture their lost youth and avoid total ridicule, Louise and Frans accidentally cross paths.', 'Now that we’re all living longer and “40 is the new 30,” why can’t 60 be the new 40? That’s what Louise and Frans think when they embark on bold new life adventures. Louise is a molecular biologist who decides to make a withdrawal from the sperm bank and have a baby. Meanwhile, gallery owner Frans decides to re-boot his career by finding the hottest new talent on the art scene. While attempting to recapture their lost youth and avoid total ridicule, Louise and Frans accidentally cross paths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYgNRgune5Z90IAZ8wG2NVf3nhW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262642'),
  ('314841590917814704', 'Miss Sloane', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'John Madden, Sebastian Blenkov, Natasha Peschlow', 'Jonathan Perera', 'Jessica Chastain, Mark Strong, Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Alison Pill, Michael Stuhlbarg, Jake Lacy, David Wilson Barnes, Dylan Baker', 'R', 'An ambitious lobbyist faces off against the powerful gun lobby in an attempt to pass gun control legislation.', 'An ambitious lobbyist faces off against the powerful gun lobby in an attempt to pass gun control legislation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptfvQlqe2xJiMSewSj52qAVq5z0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376290'),
  ('692894888919587883', 'Miss Staff Sergeant', 2010, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Cho Myeong-nam, Kim Yun-su', 'Yoon Hong-gi', 'Son Byung-ho, Im Won-hee, Lee Ah-i, Kim Min-ki, Park Choong-seon, Lee Shin-seong, Kim Su-hyun, Kim Won-Suk', null, 'Yu-mi applies to a marine outfit to become their first female member. Finding out about their NO woman-policy, she pushes herself to the extreme and fils a petition. After overcoming many obstacles, she is finally accepted for her outstanding performance. However, conflicts never cease between sergeants and Yu-mi, who’s new to the tradition and culture of the marines. Following the sudden death of a trainee, Sergeant HA, she is appointed to the head of the team. Highly motivated Yu-mi loses her troupe''s trust after losing IBS. The team is in danger of dissolution due to the loss of a magazine.', 'Yu-mi applies to a marine outfit to become their first female member. Finding out about their NO woman-policy, she pushes herself to the extreme and fils a petition. After overcoming many obstacles, she is finally accepted for her outstanding performance. However, conflicts never cease between sergeants and Yu-mi, who’s new to the tradition and culture of the marines. Following the sudden death of a trainee, Sergeant HA, she is appointed to the head of the team. Highly motivated Yu-mi loses her troupe''s trust after losing IBS. The team is in danger of dissolution due to the loss of a magazine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b68tt2bHU0ggQQfLyYZzpgDwaGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44262'),
  ('793467959273273248', 'Miss Stevens', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Julia Hart, Sebastian Winterø, Anthony Hanna', 'Julia Hart, Jordan Horowitz', 'Lily Rabe, Timothée Chalamet, Lili Reinhart, Anthony Quintal, Oscar Nuñez, Rob Huebel, Jammie Patton, Noah Gray-Cabey', null, 'Stuck at a crossroads in her personal life, it falls on high school English teacher Miss Stevens to chaperone three of her students — Billy, Margot and Sam — on a weekend trip to a drama competition.', 'Stuck at a crossroads in her personal life, it falls on high school English teacher Miss Stevens to chaperone three of her students — Billy, Margot and Sam — on a weekend trip to a drama competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgFkIPfFyV6NRn2hBmCdDWLfwGj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346134'),
  ('300066783258455941', 'Miss Sweden', 2004, 'Drama', 'Tova Magnusson, Anders Bohman', 'Sara Kadefors', 'Alexandra Dahlström, Sverrir Gudnason, Sissela Kyle, Magnus Roosmann, Sebastian Ylvenius, Leo Hallerstam, Oldoz Javidi, Evalotta Helmerson', null, 'Moa is in her early 20s, works at a factory and lives by herself in a cottage in the forest. She is a vegan and follows her friends and demonstrations, mostly to fit in. But at home, by herself, she listens to pop music and use make-up.', 'Moa is in her early 20s, works at a factory and lives by herself in a cottage in the forest. She is a vegan and follows her friends and demonstrations, mostly to fit in. But at home, by herself, she listens to pop music and use make-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dODo0hTSzYxu3Jx7HliLAMH6Skm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35304'),
  ('56569857364509693', 'Miss Violence', 2013, 'Drama', 'Alexandros Avranas, Olympia Mytilinaiou, Daphne Koutra', 'Kostas Peroulis, Alexandros Avranas', 'Themis Panou, Reni Pittaki, Eleni Roussinou, Sissy Toumasi, Kostas Antalopoulos, Constantinos Athanasiades, Chloe Bolota, Martha Bouziouri', null, 'On the day of her birthday, eleven-year-old Angeliki jumps off the balcony and falls to her death with a smile on her face. While the police and Social Services try to discover the reason for this apparent suicide, Angeliki''s family keep insisting that it was an accident. What is the secret that young Angeliki took with her? Why does her family persist in trying to "forget" her and to move on with its life?', 'On the day of her birthday, eleven-year-old Angeliki jumps off the balcony and falls to her death with a smile on her face. While the police and Social Services try to discover the reason for this apparent suicide, Angeliki''s family keep insisting that it was an accident. What is the secret that young Angeliki took with her? Why does her family persist in trying to "forget" her and to move on with its life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEGEVgqLwhDV8ZGG5DK7NHDIU3T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211052'),
  ('296819667664965584', 'Miss Violet', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'Robin Vergnes, David Bertrand, Éric Besnard', 'Éric Besnard', 'Alexandra Lamy, Grégory Gadebois, Jérôme Kircher, Jérémy Lopez, Patrick Pineau, Grégoire Tachnakian, Annie Mercier, Julie Moulier', null, 'France. End of the 19th century. Louise Violet 40, a Parisian teacher, is sent on a mission to the French countryside. But in a place where the daily life is linked to the seasons, land and crops, she must first convince parents to send their kids to school. With the help of the mayor, she is gradually accepted by the parents and their children. But soon, her past catches up with her. Despite the obstacles she faces, Miss Violet will give her heart and soul to her belief that education is the key to freedom.', 'France. End of the 19th century. Louise Violet 40, a Parisian teacher, is sent on a mission to the French countryside. But in a place where the daily life is linked to the seasons, land and crops, she must first convince parents to send their kids to school. With the help of the mayor, she is gradually accepted by the parents and their children. But soon, her past catches up with her. Despite the obstacles she faces, Miss Violet will give her heart and soul to her belief that education is the key to freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFTgCTDbWMEsxOGZnQq78XoUMyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1063875'),
  ('623247541072201031', 'Miss You Already', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Catherine Hardwicke, John Reid, Elliot Davis', 'Morwenna Banks', 'Drew Barrymore, Toni Collette, Dominic Cooper, Paddy Considine, Frances de la Tour, Jacqueline Bisset, Tyson Ritter, Kumud Pant', 'PG-13', 'The friendship between two life-long girlfriends is put to the test when one starts a family and the other falls ill.', 'The friendship between two life-long girlfriends is put to the test when one starts a family and the other falls ill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvA686C7O8MwXhFIaql4ui6eR0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290762'),
  ('951342297900156569', 'Miss ZOMBIE', 2013, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'SABU, Daisuke Soma', 'SABU', 'Ayaka Komatsu, Makoto Togashi, Toru Tezuka, Taro Suruga, Takaya Yamauchi, Okito Serizawa, Tateto Serizawa, Riku Onishi', null, 'A doctor and his family receive an unexpected delivery from an old friend at their remote country home - a large wooden crate containing a gun, a female zombie and an instruction sheet telling them not to feed her meat. The family is concerned, of course, but she seems harmless enough. Perhaps she can help clean up outside?', 'A doctor and his family receive an unexpected delivery from an old friend at their remote country home - a large wooden crate containing a gun, a female zombie and an instruction sheet telling them not to feed her meat. The family is concerned, of course, but she seems harmless enough. Perhaps she can help clean up outside?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qK3KGQoAqx7V38FGgNO8IMHUZDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221437'),
  ('277060489360351042', 'Miss. Shetty Mr. Polishetty', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Nirav Shah, Venu Palli, Mahesh Babu P', 'Mahesh Babu P', 'Anushka Shetty, Naveen Polishetty, Murali Sharma, Tulasi, Harsha Vardhan, Jayasudha, Bhadram, Keshav Deepak', 'NR', 'Miss Shetty is a feminist living in London and wants to be single forever. Mr. Polishetty from Hyderabad in Telangana, India, wants to be in a committed relationship. The two appear to be in different stages of life but somehow connect.', 'Miss Shetty is a feminist living in London and wants to be single forever. Mr. Polishetty from Hyderabad in Telangana, India, wants to be in a committed relationship. The two appear to be in different stages of life but somehow connect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6S4BRlZPfzrludhsPDPVe6fEoxV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1045385'),
  ('816500240474333232', 'Missile to the Moon', 1958, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Richard E. Cunha, Meredith M. Nicholson', 'H.E. Barrie, Vincent Fotre', 'Richard Travis, Cathy Downs, K.T. Stevens, Gary Clarke, Tommy Cook, Michael Whalen, Nina Bara, Leslie Parrish', null, 'Two escaped convicts are found hiding in a rocketship built by a renegade inventor, who forces them to become the crew for a trip to the Moon. Also on board, as inadvertent stowaways, are his assistant and his secretary; and none of them are aware that the inventor is actually a Lunarian explorer sent to Earth by the dying Lunar civilization and the only remaining male member of that civilization.', 'Two escaped convicts are found hiding in a rocketship built by a renegade inventor, who forces them to become the crew for a trip to the Moon. Also on board, as inadvertent stowaways, are his assistant and his secretary; and none of them are aware that the inventor is actually a Lunarian explorer sent to Earth by the dying Lunar civilization and the only remaining male member of that civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voOLnn1a1XFyfAAiOwbyuW0Ac8C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43120'),
  ('680725062834736923', 'Missing', 1982, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Costa-Gavras, Elie Cohn, Anna Roth', 'Costa-Gavras, Donald E. Stewart', 'Jack Lemmon, Sissy Spacek, Melanie Mayron, John Shea, Charles Cioffi, David Clennon, Richard Venture, Jerry Hardin', 'PG', 'Based on the real-life experiences of Ed Horman. A conservative American businessman travels to Chile to investigate the sudden disappearance of his son after a military takeover. Accompanied by his son''s wife he uncovers a trail of cover-ups that implicate the US State department which supports the dictatorship.', 'Based on the real-life experiences of Ed Horman. A conservative American businessman travels to Chile to investigate the sudden disappearance of his son after a military takeover. Accompanied by his son''s wife he uncovers a trail of cover-ups that implicate the US State department which supports the dictatorship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAAhC4RkpXu7SJgIESWQwVxcelo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15600'),
  ('103192933972967864', 'Missing', 2009, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Kim Sung-hong', 'Kim Young-ok', 'Choo Ja-hyun, Moon Sung-keun, Jeon Se-hyun, Oh Seong-soo, Nam Moon-chul, Hwang Eun-jeong, Baek Seol Ah, Ha Jin-soo', null, 'Hyeon-jeong''s sister is missing and she fears for the worst. Via her sister''s cellphone, Hyeon-jeong learns that her sister stayed in a countryside vaillage. She goes to the village to find her sister and stops at the local police station for help. Because of the little evidence she has, the police refuse to offer help.', 'Hyeon-jeong''s sister is missing and she fears for the worst. Via her sister''s cellphone, Hyeon-jeong learns that her sister stayed in a countryside vaillage. She goes to the village to find her sister and stops at the local police station for help. Because of the little evidence she has, the police refuse to offer help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEmPN5lhSywm24GyE6Pn25fIzrk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108513'),
  ('726159140147939384', 'Missing', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Lee Chol-o, E.oni, Kim Sung-an', 'E.oni, Hong Eun-mi', 'Uhm Ji-won, Gong Hyo-jin, Kim Hie-won, Park Hae-joon, Lee Sung-wook, Jeon Seok-chan, Go Joon, Kim Sun-young', null, 'A working single mother comes home one day to find that her daughter and the nanny have disappeared -- and this is just the beginning of her nightmare.', 'A working single mother comes home one day to find that her daughter and the nanny have disappeared -- and this is just the beginning of her nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ncaabk6vauhwXH0GmmPZkpfvhX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417199'),
  ('937083393910854672', 'Missing', 2018, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Mukul Abhyankar, Sudeep Chatterjee', 'Mukul Abhyankar', 'Manoj Bajpayee, Tabu, Annu Kapoor, Shruti Gupta', null, 'A couple checks into a beach resort in Mauritius late night with their three-year-old daughter Titli who in the next morning goes missing.', 'A couple checks into a beach resort in Mauritius late night with their three-year-old daughter Titli who in the next morning goes missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FRPUYld8D0dT0AMrGMJ4cjb94R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513540'),
  ('318291154511670839', 'Missing', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Naoya Ikeda, Shinzo Katayama, Kenichi Sagara', 'Kazuhisa Kotera, Ryo Takada', 'Jiro Sato, Aoi Ito, Hiroya Shimizu, Misato Morita, Izumi Matsuoka, Shotaro Ishii, Tôko Narushima, Tōru Shinagawa', null, 'Depressed and in debt, Santoshi tells his young daughter that he is going to find an infamous serial killer and collect a reward. However, when Santoshi disappears without a trace, she starts to fear the worst and begins searching for him.', 'Depressed and in debt, Santoshi tells his young daughter that he is going to find an infamous serial killer and collect a reward. However, when Santoshi disappears without a trace, she starts to fear the worst and begins searching for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eR26BRl4zu36xeIzWdYgtvRVH2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874476'),
  ('797597282380179975', 'Missing', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Steven Holleran, Congyu E, Allan Aguilar', 'Nicholas D. Johnson, Will Merrick', 'Storm Reid, Joaquim de Almeida, Ken Leung, Amy Landecker, Daniel Henney, Nia Long, Megan Suri, Tim Griffin', 'PG-13', 'When her mother disappears while on vacation in Colombia with her new boyfriend, June’s search for answers is hindered by international red tape. Stuck thousands of miles away in Los Angeles, June creatively uses all the latest technology at her fingertips to try and find her before it’s too late. But as she digs deeper, her digital sleuthing raises more questions than answers... and when June unravels secrets about her mom, she discovers that she never really knew her at all.', 'When her mother disappears while on vacation in Colombia with her new boyfriend, June’s search for answers is hindered by international red tape. Stuck thousands of miles away in Los Angeles, June creatively uses all the latest technology at her fingertips to try and find her before it’s too late. But as she digs deeper, her digital sleuthing raises more questions than answers... and when June unravels secrets about her mom, she discovers that she never really knew her at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEOUYSU5Uf8J7152PT6jdb5233Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768362'),
  ('1112898498121565991', 'Missing', 2024, 'Drama', 'Keisuke Yoshida, Takayuki Shida, Daika Matsukura', 'Keisuke Yoshida', 'Satomi Ishihara, Munetaka Aoki, Yusaku Mori, Tsugumi Arita, Karin Ono, Kazushige Komatsu, Gaku Hosokawa, Shinsuke Kato', null, 'A girl vanishes while walking, leaving her family devastated. As months pass without clues, rumors about her mother''s actions intensify online, straining her marriage.', 'A girl vanishes while walking, leaving her family devastated. As months pass without clues, rumors about her mother''s actions intensify online, straining her marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rb2L0hajCiVDyjbzjVsb0wlWnTp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1217328'),
