  ('973694467402875606', 'Missing in Action', 1984, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, War, Drama', 'João Fernandes, Joseph Zito, Gideon Amir', 'James Bruner', 'Chuck Norris, M. Emmet Walsh, David Tress, Lenore Kasdorf, James Hong, Pierrino Mascarino, Erich Anderson, Joseph Carberry', 'R', 'American servicemen are still being held captive in Vietnam and it''s up to one man to bring them home in this blistering, fast-paced action/adventure starring martial arts superstar Chuck Norris. Following a daring escape from a Vietnamese POW camp, Special Forces Colonel James Braddock (Norris) is on a mission to locate and save remaining MIAs.', 'American servicemen are still being held captive in Vietnam and it''s up to one man to bring them home in this blistering, fast-paced action/adventure starring martial arts superstar Chuck Norris. Following a daring escape from a Vietnamese POW camp, Special Forces Colonel James Braddock (Norris) is on a mission to locate and save remaining MIAs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBrDcnNQca88ed1gRwZ1Q5cjNxE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15379'),
  ('402391002118185362', 'Missing in America', 2005, 'Drama', 'Gordon MacDonald, Gabrielle Savage Dockterman, Victor Landrie', 'Nancy L. Babine, Gabrielle Savage Dockterman, Ken Miller', 'Danny Glover, Ron Perlman, Linda Hamilton, Zoe Weizenbaum, David Strathairn, Timothy Webber, Gabrielle Rose, Frank C. Turner', null, 'A haunted Vietnam veteran, living in exile in the forests of the Pacific Northwest, is faced with a life-changing decision after he is visited by a former platoon member and his young Amerasian daughter.', 'A haunted Vietnam veteran, living in exile in the forests of the Pacific Northwest, is faced with a life-changing decision after he is visited by a former platoon member and his young Amerasian daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6mktkzLF0dAK1tuoIJm0WNOltX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13834'),
