  ('331142651309097921', 'Missing Person', 1984, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mohamed Khan, Tarek El Tilmisany', 'Assem Tawfik', 'Yehia El Fakharany, Farid Shawqy, Layla Olwy, Aida Abdel Aziz, Tawfiq Al-Deqen, Maha Attia, Ibrahim Qadry, Ali Hassanein', null, 'Attia (Yehia al-Fakharani) works as a simple employee, after his mother-in-law threatens to break his engagement from her daughter because of his delay in getting an apartment. He travels to his hometown to sell his inheritance. There he falls in love with Kharyia (Leila Alawi) daughter of Kamal Bey (Farid Shawki) who bought his land.', 'Attia (Yehia al-Fakharani) works as a simple employee, after his mother-in-law threatens to break his engagement from her daughter because of his delay in getting an apartment. He travels to his hometown to sell his inheritance. There he falls in love with Kharyia (Leila Alawi) daughter of Kamal Bey (Farid Shawki) who bought his land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6CGP6sCCJHiG8xbxYO1i1UjADt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331824'),
