  ('391441416134536539', 'Mission Kathmandu: The Adventures of Nelly & Simon', 2017, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Pierre Greco, Nancy Florence Savard', 'Pierre Greco, André Morency', 'Sylvie Moreau, Rachid Badouri, Guillaume Lemay-Thivierge, Martin Boily, Lise Castonguay, Stéphane Crête, Edgar Fruitier, Sophie Faucher', null, 'Quebec, 1956. The impulsive and headstrong Nelly Maloye, a novice private eye, joins the methodical and pragmatic Simon Picard, a research scientist in a dubious quest to prove the existence of the elusive Yeti. The brave-hearted heroes come face-to-face with countless dangers during their trek through the heart of the Himalayas.', 'Quebec, 1956. The impulsive and headstrong Nelly Maloye, a novice private eye, joins the methodical and pragmatic Simon Picard, a research scientist in a dubious quest to prove the existence of the elusive Yeti. The brave-hearted heroes come face-to-face with countless dangers during their trek through the heart of the Himalayas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOkneb52OKjvNuPIJCJLUBNQtF5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490694'),
