  ('330052194362935706', 'Mistertao', 1988, 'Animation', 'Bruno Bozzetto', 'Bruno Bozzetto', null, null, 'The mountaintop is usually the object and purpose of the trip. But for the small and serene Mr. Tao is a step on his continuing quest, that perhaps will never end.', 'The mountaintop is usually the object and purpose of the trip. But for the small and serene Mr. Tao is a step on his continuing quest, that perhaps will never end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jE159h2Izv8DInNqOh2QHQJ6Wal.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360913'),
  ('369541709560252615', 'Mistress', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Barry Primus, Sven Kirsten', 'J.F. Lawton', 'Robert Wuhl, Martin Landau, Jace Alexander, Robert De Niro, Laurie Metcalf, Eli Wallach, Danny Aiello, Sheryl Lee Ralph', 'R', 'A comedy about a screenwriter (Wuhl) whose old movie script is read by a producer (Landau) and the search for financial backers begins. But it seems that each money source (Aiello, DeNiro, Wallach) has his own mistress that he wants put into the film. Gradually, the screenwriter is forced to make changes to his script to accommodate these backers until he finally sees no semblance of his original ideas in the writing.', 'A comedy about a screenwriter (Wuhl) whose old movie script is read by a producer (Landau) and the search for financial backers begins. But it seems that each money source (Aiello, DeNiro, Wallach) has his own mistress that he wants put into the film. Gradually, the screenwriter is forced to make changes to his script to accommodate these backers until he finally sees no semblance of his original ideas in the writing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNo9Tj7EPOkRyEJZu98RjAbQPrb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71825'),
  ('1043564952398995977', 'Mistress America', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Noah Baumbach, Sam Levy, Oscar Boyson', 'Greta Gerwig, Noah Baumbach', 'Greta Gerwig, Lola Kirke, Matthew Shear, Jasmine Cephas Jones, Heather Lind, Michael Chernus, Cindy Cheung, Kathryn Erbe', 'R', 'A college freshman cures her disappointment and loneliness by allowing herself to be pulled into the wacky schemes of her future stepsister.', 'A college freshman cures her disappointment and loneliness by allowing herself to be pulled into the wacky schemes of her future stepsister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0V4M9nY9bjsoTKdaAYzL9gRpWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309245'),
  ('924613115756461753', 'Mistress of the Apes', 1979, 'Adventure', 'Larry Buchanan, Nicholas Josef von Sternberg', 'Larry Buchanan', 'Jenny Neumann, Barbara Leigh, Garth Pillsbury, Walt Robin, Stuart Lancaster, Mark Rhudy, Marius Mazmanian, Barry Buchanan', 'R', 'Jenny Neumann takes a group of men into the jungles of Kenya to look for her husband, and instead finds a tribe of caveman-looking "Near-Men" who all seem terribly attracted to her beautiful blond hair.', 'Jenny Neumann takes a group of men into the jungles of Kenya to look for her husband, and instead finds a tribe of caveman-looking "Near-Men" who all seem terribly attracted to her beautiful blond hair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLENmY7Qt8p0JQyxBa85sn2pMFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101571'),
  ('1109300725797778434', 'Mistrial', 1996, 'Thriller, Drama, Action, TV Movie', 'Heywood Gould, Paul Sarossy, Jonnie Katz', 'Heywood Gould', 'Bill Pullman, Robert Loggia, Blair Underwood, Leo Burmester, Roma Maffia, James Rebhorn, Jon Seda, Josef Sommer', 'R', 'When a cop-killer goes free, a detective''s search for personal justice veers dangerously out of control. Declaring a mistrial, he takes the accused, the judge and the jury hostage...and begins a trial of his own.', 'When a cop-killer goes free, a detective''s search for personal justice veers dangerously out of control. Declaring a mistrial, he takes the accused, the judge and the jury hostage...and begins a trial of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mu0R7Dx6SePsGu4Jp3c2el80kUY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291613'),
