  ('364375590044500752', 'Misunderstood', 1967, 'Drama', 'Luigi Comencini, Marcello Pandolfi, Leopoldo Machina', 'Lucia Drudi Demby, Giuseppe Mangione', 'Anthony Quayle, Stefano Colagrande, Simone Giannozzi, John Sharp, Adriana Facchetti, Rino Benini, Giorgia Moll, Graziella Granata', null, 'The story of a widower and his two sons, focusing on their complex and sometimes difficult relationships.', 'The story of a widower and his two sons, focusing on their complex and sometimes difficult relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6z6jD1BLxRJe3pQRwC6ezYF1ft4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56978'),
  ('411905182214108305', 'Misunderstood', 1983, 'Drama', 'Jerry Schatzberg, Pasqualino De Santis', 'Barra Grant', 'Gene Hackman, Henry Thomas, Rip Torn, Huckleberry Fox, Maureen Kerwin, Susan Anspach, June Brown, Helen Ryan', 'PG', 'A workaholic father becomes sole parent to his two young sons, and finds it hard to relate to them, consumed as he is with his own grief.', 'A workaholic father becomes sole parent to his two young sons, and finds it hard to relate to them, consumed as he is with his own grief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yJpXxcKfOu9U4uBPowumi7gMrp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54658'),
  ('100068329375515956', 'Misunderstood', 2014, 'Drama', 'Asia Argento, Nicola Pecorini, Chiara Di Giorgi', 'Barbara Alberti, Asia Argento', 'Giulia Salerno, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Gabriel Garko, Carolina Poccioni, Anna Lou Castoldi, Alice Pea, Andrea Pittorino, Sofia Patron', null, 'Rome, 1984, Aria is nine-year-old girl. On the verge of divorce, Aria''s infantile and selfish parents are too preoccupied with their careers and extra-marital affairs to properly tend to any of Aria''s needs. While her two older sisters are pampered, Aria is treated with cold indifference. Yet she yearns to love and to be loved. At school, Aria excels academically but is considered a misfit by everyone. She is misunderstood. Aria finds comfort in her cat - Dac and in her best friend - Angelica. Thrown out of both parents'' homes, abandoned by all, even her best friend, Aria finally reaches the limit of what she can bear. She makes an unexpected decision in her life.', 'Rome, 1984, Aria is nine-year-old girl. On the verge of divorce, Aria''s infantile and selfish parents are too preoccupied with their careers and extra-marital affairs to properly tend to any of Aria''s needs. While her two older sisters are pampered, Aria is treated with cold indifference. Yet she yearns to love and to be loved. At school, Aria excels academically but is considered a misfit by everyone. She is misunderstood. Aria finds comfort in her cat - Dac and in her best friend - Angelica. Thrown out of both parents'' homes, abandoned by all, even her best friend, Aria finally reaches the limit of what she can bear. She makes an unexpected decision in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQTZkicfwDJnkDdcgh8sH2Dsvmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266036'),
  ('611562165922649168', 'Mitchell', 1975, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, Anthony Brand, Harry Stradling Jr.', 'Ian Kennedy Martin', 'Joe Don Baker, Martin Balsam, John Saxon, Linda Evans, Morgan Paull, Harold J. Stone, Merlin Olsen, Robert Phillips', 'R', 'A tough-guy cop pursues two drug runners across the city to bust a large syndicate. Very much an anti-hero, Mitchell often ignores the orders of his superiors and demonstrates disdain for by-the-book development work as well as normal social graces.', 'A tough-guy cop pursues two drug runners across the city to bust a large syndicate. Very much an anti-hero, Mitchell often ignores the orders of his superiors and demonstrates disdain for by-the-book development work as well as normal social graces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14Afu2In8RPbdhTacNJl5kRechp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32303'),
  ('176381603748983299', 'Mithya', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Rajat Kapoor, Rafey Mehmood', 'Saurabh Shukla, Rajat Kapoor', 'Ranvir Shorey, Neha Dhupia, Naseeruddin Shah, Saurabh Shukla, Vinay Pathak, Brijendra Kala, Iravati Harshe, Harsh Chhaya', null, 'A two-bit actor faces challenges after he is asked by Police to impersonate a look-alike gangster.', 'A two-bit actor faces challenges after he is asked by Police to impersonate a look-alike gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vISVPrVsNwXyYiUIb2gqV1asoXA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21571'),
  ('953452379344566026', 'Mitron', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy, Family', 'Nitin Kakkar, Manoj Kumar Khatoi', 'Sharib Hashmi', 'Jacky Bhagnani, Kritika Kamra, Prateik Smita Patil, Perlene Bhesania, Rishi Panchal, Neha Reddy, Chetan Daiya, Kumkum Das', null, 'Jai (Jackky Bhagnani), born and brought up with middle-class values, has a ‘take it easy’ approach to life. Since he doesn''t believe in herd mentality, he and his two best friends, Raunak (Pratik Gandhi) and Deepu (Shivam Parekh) start looking for unique ways to make it big in the world. During this trial and error phase, Jai realizes his dream. But his decision of choosing an unprofitable career path doesn’t go down too well with his father (Neeraj Sood), who has bigger aspirations for him. Therefore, in order to bring stability in his life, his father decides to get him married. Destiny, however, has something else in store for Jai, when he accidentally meets Avni (Kritika Kamra), an ambitious, MBA graduate, who wants to start her own business. Set in the backdrop of the Gujarati milieu, the film traces Jai and Avni’s personal journey, as they both find themselves and discover the true meaning of friendship in the bargain.', 'Jai (Jackky Bhagnani), born and brought up with middle-class values, has a ‘take it easy’ approach to life. Since he doesn''t believe in herd mentality, he and his two best friends, Raunak (Pratik Gandhi) and Deepu (Shivam Parekh) start looking for unique ways to make it big in the world. During this trial and error phase, Jai realizes his dream. But his decision of choosing an unprofitable career path doesn’t go down too well with his father (Neeraj Sood), who has bigger aspirations for him. Therefore, in order to bring stability in his life, his father decides to get him married. Destiny, however, has something else in store for Jai, when he accidentally meets Avni (Kritika Kamra), an ambitious, MBA graduate, who wants to start her own business. Set in the backdrop of the Gujarati milieu, the film traces Jai and Avni’s personal journey, as they both find themselves and discover the true meaning of friendship in the bargain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mk2MT5w15IeGHGwFrvUtozrjEU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547768'),
  ('969423995499149743', 'Mitt', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Greg Whiteley, Greg Whiteley', null, 'Mitt Romney, Candy Crowley, Eric Draper, Jim Lehrer, John McCain, Barack Obama, Rob Portmann, Ann Romney', null, 'A filmmaker is granted unprecedented access to a political candidate and his family as he runs for President.', 'A filmmaker is granted unprecedented access to a political candidate and his family as he runs for President.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1bfKOvTqQDseBAetUpNKn1Iq3q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250769'),
  ('94510539068918816', 'Mittagsstunde', 2022, 'Drama', 'Lars Jessen, Kristian Leschner', 'Catharina Junk', 'Charly Hübner, Lennard Conrad, Peter Franke, Rainer Bock, Hildegard Schmahl, Gabriela Maria Schmeide, Gro Swantje Kohlhof, Dieter Schaad', null, 'When his grandmother Ella becomes increasingly confused and his grandfather Sönke simply doesn''t want to part with his pub, the Dorfkrug, 47-year-old Ingwer Feddersen sees the time has come to return to his home village Brinkebüll. The village tavern isn''t what it used to be - but that''s also true for the whole village. Ingwer wonders when exactly was the point in time when the village of Brinkebüll went downhill? Was it in the 1970s when the hedges disappeared after the land consolidation and then the birds too? When larger and larger farms were built so that smaller ones had to give way? Is it perhaps his fault because he left his grandfather alone with gastronomy to study in Kiel? Based on Dörte Hansen''s 2018 novel of the same name.', 'When his grandmother Ella becomes increasingly confused and his grandfather Sönke simply doesn''t want to part with his pub, the Dorfkrug, 47-year-old Ingwer Feddersen sees the time has come to return to his home village Brinkebüll. The village tavern isn''t what it used to be - but that''s also true for the whole village. Ingwer wonders when exactly was the point in time when the village of Brinkebüll went downhill? Was it in the 1970s when the hedges disappeared after the land consolidation and then the birds too? When larger and larger farms were built so that smaller ones had to give way? Is it perhaps his fault because he left his grandfather alone with gastronomy to study in Kiel? Based on Dörte Hansen''s 2018 novel of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fS4pE4BzT0wyjJPR8bnD5KPMN2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950199'),
  ('846887008620717364', 'Mix Me a Person', 1962, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Leslie Norman, Ted Moore', 'Ian Dalrymple', 'Anne Baxter, Donald Sinden, Adam Faith, Walter Brown, Jack MacGowran, Topsy Jane, Carole Ann Ford, Anthony Booth', null, 'Eighteen-year-old Harry Jukes is literally holding a smoking gun in his hand. His lawyer thinks he did it, but his psychiatrist disagrees -- and sets out to prove she is right.', 'Eighteen-year-old Harry Jukes is literally holding a smoking gun in his hand. His lawyer thinks he did it, but his psychiatrist disagrees -- and sets out to prove she is right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qVluHy17TjEmUVkh5buplFzDZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426976'),
  ('742172762200027924', 'Mix Tape', 2014, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Tunç Sahin', 'Mert H. Atalay, Uygar Şirin', 'Sarp Apak, Özge Özpirinçci, Bülent Emin Yarar, Sevinç Erbulak, Öznur Serçeler, Fatih Dönmez, Hilmi Özçelik, Eslem Akar', null, 'Ulas, the son of a music-lover father tries to declare his love to Irem with a mix tape he''s put together. However, they fall apart and it takes him 10 years to complete this declaration. 10 years later, Ulas who has become a music critic meets Irem by coincidence and yet it will take them another decade to get together.', 'Ulas, the son of a music-lover father tries to declare his love to Irem with a mix tape he''s put together. However, they fall apart and it takes him 10 years to complete this declaration. 10 years later, Ulas who has become a music critic meets Irem by coincidence and yet it will take them another decade to get together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5djn6QbM2L9sjjWGfsJpwxYrlo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320035'),
  ('83173458138607345', 'Mix Up in the Mediterranean', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Jonathan Wright, Leif Bristow, Ben Lanning', 'Julie Kim, Kariné Marwood', 'Jeremy Jordan, Jessica Lowndes, Callum Blue, Michelle Martin, Edward De Gaetano, Stephen Oliver, Anthony Edridge, Nadia Sohawon', 'G', 'A small-town cook impersonates his big city chef twin to compete in a culinary contest and falls for the woman in charge of the event, who thinks he is the brother who is married.', 'A small-town cook impersonates his big city chef twin to compete in a culinary contest and falls for the woman in charge of the event, who thinks he is the brother who is married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/670nNzefrz80DAtKDxaDF1HbQu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784389'),
  ('1078726817930976894', 'Mixed Blood', 1984, 'Action', 'Paul Morrissey', 'Paul Morrissey', 'Marília Pêra, Rodney Harvey, Linda Kerridge, Geraldine Smith, Angel David, John Leguizamo, Christian Aaron Boulogne, Richard Ulacia', null, 'On the mean streets of New York City, a dog-eat-dog mentality reigns among the destitute citizens. In one of the many abandoned buildings in the neighborhood of Alphabet City lives the Brazilian Rita La Punta, along with her delinquent son, Thiago, and a gang of Hispanic teens charged with selling heroin and cocaine. When Rita and her young gang members get involved in a minor turf war, the violence escalates out of control, touching everyone and sparing no one.', 'On the mean streets of New York City, a dog-eat-dog mentality reigns among the destitute citizens. In one of the many abandoned buildings in the neighborhood of Alphabet City lives the Brazilian Rita La Punta, along with her delinquent son, Thiago, and a gang of Hispanic teens charged with selling heroin and cocaine. When Rita and her young gang members get involved in a minor turf war, the violence escalates out of control, touching everyone and sparing no one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WIt6TJevoFhP4AzOthL1f6C94i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86458'),
  ('263593136876988637', 'Mixed by Erry', 2023, 'Comedy, History, Music', 'Sydney Sibilia, Valerio Azzali, Francesca Borromeo', 'Armando Festa, Sydney Sibilia', 'Luigi D''Oriano, Giuseppe Arena, Francesco Di Leva, Cristiana Dell''Anna, Adriano Pantaleo, Chiara Celotto, Greta Esposito, Fabrizio Gifuni', 'R', 'The rise and fall of the pirate mixtape empire of three brothers from Naples, Italy, during the ''80s.', 'The rise and fall of the pirate mixtape empire of three brothers from Naples, Italy, during the ''80s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCTqW2YLxx6gqrPFTlMswvDunuQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:921785'),
  ('967967598666135899', 'Mixed Doubles', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Junichi Ishikawa, Akira Sako', 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Yui Aragaki, Eita Nagayama, Hirosue Ryoko, Koji Seto, Mei Nagano, Hayato Sano, Hiroyuki Morisaki, Yu Aoi', null, 'To get revenge on her ex-boyfriend and to help revive her late mother''s tennis table club, a table tennis prodigy decides to take part in a mixed doubles table tennis tournament.', 'To get revenge on her ex-boyfriend and to help revive her late mother''s tennis table club, a table tennis prodigy decides to take part in a mixed doubles table tennis tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9fnb7KzW2AFZxF0J9k62b3or8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472310'),
  ('697266233489594856', 'Mixed Kebab', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Guy Lee Thys, Björn Charpentier', 'Guy Lee Thys', 'Cem Akkanat, Simon Van Buyten, Gamze Tazim, Karlijn Sileghem, Lukas De Wolf, Mathias Vergels', null, 'Ibrahim chooses to fall for young and handsome Kevin over marrying his cute but expensive cousin Elif while kid brother Furkan converts to Islamic fundamentalism.', 'Ibrahim chooses to fall for young and handsome Kevin over marrying his cute but expensive cousin Elif while kid brother Furkan converts to Islamic fundamentalism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5h1d1fEOvKAMSMNv2FJOny2G8e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132561'),
  ('1063304594797519398', 'Mixed Marriage', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Alexandre Arcady, Maxime Alexandre, Suzette Pires', 'Pierre Aknine, Alexandre Arcady', 'Gérard Darmon, Antoine Duléry, Fanny Cottençon, Olivia Bonamy, Thomas Jouannet, Jean Benguigui, Patrick Chesnais, Olivier Sitruk', null, 'A woman seeks the blessing of her wealthy father when she becomes engaged.', 'A woman seeks the blessing of her wealthy father when she becomes engaged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hD4rved8gcWRO0jiunDd3TDQmJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65959'),
  ('509360710477086924', 'Mixed Nuts', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Nora Ephron, Sven Nykvist, James W. Skotchdopole', 'Nora Ephron, Delia Ephron', 'Steve Martin, Madeline Kahn, Rita Wilson, Juliette Lewis, Anthony LaPaglia, Adam Sandler, Liev Schreiber, Parker Posey', 'PG-13', 'The events of a crisis hotline business on one crazy night during the Christmas holidays.', 'The events of a crisis hotline business on one crazy night during the Christmas holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPdQMqxWnFwCKOIto8dBEorTtGR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24070'),
  ('956407063327295170', 'Mixtape', 2021, 'Comedy, Family', 'Valerie Weiss, Matthew Clark', 'Stacey Menear', 'Gemma Brooke Allen, Julie Bowen, Nick Thune, Audrey Hsieh, Olga Petsa, Jackson Rathbone, Diego Mercado, Anthony Timpano', null, 'On the eve of Y2K, orphaned 12-year-old Beverly discovers a broken mixtape crafted by her teen parents. Raised by her grandmother – who struggles talking about her late daughter – Beverly sees the mixtape as a chance to finally learn more about her parents.', 'On the eve of Y2K, orphaned 12-year-old Beverly discovers a broken mixtape crafted by her teen parents. Raised by her grandmother – who struggles talking about her late daughter – Beverly sees the mixtape as a chance to finally learn more about her parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fpG1PiHPHdLt8X2e7WAct7EVB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32471'),
  ('783388190676419776', 'Miyamoto Musashi', 1944, 'Drama, History', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Shigeto Miki', 'Kan Kikuchi, Matsutarō Kawaguchi', 'Chōjūrō Kawarasaki, Kan''emon Nakamura, Kigoro Ikushima, Kinuyo Tanaka', null, 'Shinobu and her brother Genichiro plead with famous swordsman Musashi Miyamoto to teach them to avenge their father''s death. The perpetrators of their father''s demise see the siblings practicing, and so enlist the help of another revered swordsman, Kojiro Sasaki, giving the latter an excuse to battle Miyamoto.', 'Shinobu and her brother Genichiro plead with famous swordsman Musashi Miyamoto to teach them to avenge their father''s death. The perpetrators of their father''s demise see the siblings practicing, and so enlist the help of another revered swordsman, Kojiro Sasaki, giving the latter an excuse to battle Miyamoto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzHCYG1uoRpawtGtIWxvmFztYS2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100466'),
  ('902569017773331451', 'Miyamoto Musashi', 1961, 'History, Action, Drama', 'Tomu Uchida, Makoto Tsuboi', 'Naoyuki Suzuki, Masashige Narusawa', 'Kinnosuke Nakamura, Akiko Kazami, Wakaba Irie, Isao Kimura, Chieko Naniwa, Kusuo Abe, Rentaro Mikuni, Tokubei Hanazawa', null, 'In this first episode, we are introduced to Takezo, what Musashi used to be before he became the man of legend. His beginning are not exactly auspicious. He sides with the Toyotomi at Sekigahara, and as a result finds himself on the losing side of the historic battle. He and his friend Matahachi manage to escape the slaughter although the latter is wounded in his leg. They stumble across the young Akemi who makes her living with her mother Oko by robbing corpses of their armor and anything else they can sell. Oko takes it into her head to seduce Matahachi, which she does first by skillfully sucking the gangrene from his blood, and then just by sucking.', 'In this first episode, we are introduced to Takezo, what Musashi used to be before he became the man of legend. His beginning are not exactly auspicious. He sides with the Toyotomi at Sekigahara, and as a result finds himself on the losing side of the historic battle. He and his friend Matahachi manage to escape the slaughter although the latter is wounded in his leg. They stumble across the young Akemi who makes her living with her mother Oko by robbing corpses of their armor and anything else they can sell. Oko takes it into her head to seduce Matahachi, which she does first by skillfully sucking the gangrene from his blood, and then just by sucking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwBtKTX2nuQe5Crx7d4JNGXkqME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154764'),
  ('510596612420401708', 'Miyamoto Musashi', 1973, 'Drama, Action', 'Tai Katō, Keiji Maruyama, Haruhiko Mimura', 'Yoshitarō Nomura', 'Hideki Takahashi, Jirō Tamiya, Mitsuko Baisho, Keiko Matsuzaka, Chishū Ryū, Toshiyuki Hosokawa, Makoto Satō, Junko Toda', null, 'In Part I we see the young would-be swordsman setting out to achieve greatness in war, achieving nothing because fighting on the losing side, & then beginning his long period of wandering & training, with the goal always in mind of his duel with Kojiro. Part II builds toward that great duel on Ganryu Island, with considerable focus on Musashi''s planning & forethought as to how to gain an advantage.', 'In Part I we see the young would-be swordsman setting out to achieve greatness in war, achieving nothing because fighting on the losing side, & then beginning his long period of wandering & training, with the goal always in mind of his duel with Kojiro. Part II builds toward that great duel on Ganryu Island, with considerable focus on Musashi''s planning & forethought as to how to gain an advantage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5z5EYDFyyMRAjwPEQ54HP4oML5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297002'),
  ('993927933061477735', 'Miyamoto Musashi III: Birth of Two Sword Style', 1963, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Tomu Uchida, Sadaji Yoshida', 'Tomu Uchida, Naoyuki Suzuki', 'Kinnosuke Nakamura, Wakaba Irie, Isao Kimura, Chieko Naniwa, Mitsuru Takeuchi, Kusuo Abe, Michiyo Kogure, Satomi Oka', null, 'In the third installment of Yoshikawa''s novel Musashi, things continue from the 2nd film at the end of battle, where Miyamoto continues on a mission of learning; with the introduction of his arch-rival Sasaki Kojiro; and lastly the large cast of characters rendezvouses for a fateful finale.', 'In the third installment of Yoshikawa''s novel Musashi, things continue from the 2nd film at the end of battle, where Miyamoto continues on a mission of learning; with the introduction of his arch-rival Sasaki Kojiro; and lastly the large cast of characters rendezvouses for a fateful finale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/369fX1W4nGXCAPDtIUHayKZYBSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144531'),
  ('723458473493107614', 'Miyamoto Musashi IV: The Duel at Ichijo-ji Temple', 1964, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Tomu Uchida, Sadaji Yoshida', null, 'Kinnosuke Nakamura, Wakaba Irie, Isao Kimura, Chieko Naniwa, Mitsuru Takeuchi, Satomi Oka, Shinjirō Ehara, Mikijiro Hira', null, 'In the fourth installment, Musashi''s potentially greatest opponent Kojiro jumps in and out of the story at the oddest and most coincidental moments. As his great love Otsu has succumbed to madness. Musashi then sets off to beat the functionaries of a treacherous clan in an arranged duel. 73 against one. Boastful Kojiro watches, secure in the knowledge that only he is a worthy opponent.', 'In the fourth installment, Musashi''s potentially greatest opponent Kojiro jumps in and out of the story at the oddest and most coincidental moments. As his great love Otsu has succumbed to madness. Musashi then sets off to beat the functionaries of a treacherous clan in an arranged duel. 73 against one. Boastful Kojiro watches, secure in the knowledge that only he is a worthy opponent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hH2yJKzGdEMhAatlBS9BRNE09qa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144534'),
  ('35633242123600186', 'Miyamoto Musashi V: Musashi vs Kojiro', 1965, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Tomu Uchida, Sadaji Yoshida', 'Naoyuki Suzuki, Tomu Uchida', 'Kinnosuke Nakamura, Ken Takakura, Wakaba Irie, Isao Kimura, Chieko Naniwa, Yoshinobu Kaneko, Michiyo Kogure, Satomi Oka', null, 'The fifth and final installment with the build up of the epic battle between Sasaki Kojiro and Miyamoto Musashi. With all the familiar characters making appearances: Otsu (Musashi''s great love), Akemi, Matahachi (his former fellow soldier), old lady Osugi (still doggedly trying to defeat Musashi), and even the return of Priest Takuan (the man responsible for his journey towards enlightenment). But most of all, the boastful, long-haired and long-sworded Sasaki Kojiro.', 'The fifth and final installment with the build up of the epic battle between Sasaki Kojiro and Miyamoto Musashi. With all the familiar characters making appearances: Otsu (Musashi''s great love), Akemi, Matahachi (his former fellow soldier), old lady Osugi (still doggedly trying to defeat Musashi), and even the return of Priest Takuan (the man responsible for his journey towards enlightenment). But most of all, the boastful, long-haired and long-sworded Sasaki Kojiro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2G8w8n5dWU7D5N5L4ihGETd9iVK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144535'),
  ('509737186396848036', 'Miyamoto Musashi: Showdown at Hannyazaka Heights', 1962, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Tomu Uchida, Makoto Tsudoi, Tetsuya Yamanouchi', null, 'Kinnosuke Nakamura, Wakaba Irie, Isao Kimura, Chieko Naniwa, Rentaro Mikuni, Kusuo Abe, Michiyo Kogure, Satomi Oka', null, 'The remake of Yoshikawa''s novel continues with the second installment in which Takezo, soon to be Miyamoto Musashi, emerges from the Himeji Castle after three years of intense contemplation and philosophical study and starting on his epic quest to complete his skill in the Way.', 'The remake of Yoshikawa''s novel continues with the second installment in which Takezo, soon to be Miyamoto Musashi, emerges from the Himeji Castle after three years of intense contemplation and philosophical study and starting on his epic quest to complete his skill in the Way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSo1GTiZnmlLxq0iNfPffRES8ku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144525'),
  ('191950838589327568', 'Miyori''s Forest', 2009, 'Animation, Fantasy, Drama', 'Nizou Yamamoto, Tetsuya Ishikawa, Hideki Ito', 'Satoko Okudera', 'Yu Aoi, Etsuko Ichihara, Hiroyuki Amano, Kyôko Sasaki, Midori Matsuo, Aya Takashima, Yusuke Numata, Chitose Hajime', null, 'After being deserted by her parents, 11-year old Miyori shuts her heart from the rest of the world and denies any form of human relationships. She was entrusted in the care of her grandmother who lives near a forest. Miyori will take a walk in the forest where she felt a strong sense of loneliness in the forest which seems to have nothing. However, she soon encounters unbelievable things...', 'After being deserted by her parents, 11-year old Miyori shuts her heart from the rest of the world and denies any form of human relationships. She was entrusted in the care of her grandmother who lives near a forest. Miyori will take a walk in the forest where she felt a strong sense of loneliness in the forest which seems to have nothing. However, she soon encounters unbelievable things...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8s19MXQUNyLnWvZ55wcAF0GS2VM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24154'),
  ('69419197962560251', 'MK Ultra', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Joseph Sorrentino, Diego Romero', 'Joseph Sorrentino', 'Anson Mount, Jason Patric, Jen Richards, Jaime Ray Newman, Alon Aboutboul, Josh Whites', 'NR', 'Set during the true and unconscionable Central Intelligence Agency MK ULTRA drug experimentations in the early 1960s. The journey of Ford Strauss, a brilliant psychiatrist, whose moral and scientific boundaries are pushed to the limit as he is recruited to run a subsect of the program in a rural Mississippi Mental Hospital.', 'Set during the true and unconscionable Central Intelligence Agency MK ULTRA drug experimentations in the early 1960s. The journey of Ford Strauss, a brilliant psychiatrist, whose moral and scientific boundaries are pushed to the limit as he is recruited to run a subsect of the program in a rural Mississippi Mental Hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3G3CCvLYy4EoLuhuUB9YlReFIN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018247'),
  ('1102031271393772116', 'MLK/FBI', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Robert Chappell, Sam Pollard', 'Benjamin Hedin, Laura Tomaselli', 'Martin Luther King Jr., J. Edgar Hoover, Beverly Gage, David Garrow, Andrew Young, Donna Murch, Clarence Jones, Charles Knox', null, 'Based on newly declassified files, the film explores the US government’s surveillance and harassment of Martin Luther King, Jr.', 'Based on newly declassified files, the film explores the US government’s surveillance and harassment of Martin Luther King, Jr.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYG0J3tKCTj8otQQ7buVs3YATBI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728868'),
  ('381595716664352672', 'Mlle. Desiree', 1942, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Sacha Guitry', null, 'Sacha Guitry, Jean-Louis Barrault, Aimé Clariond, Jacques Varennes, Geneviève Guitry, Gaby Morlay, Lise Delamare, Yvette Lebon', null, 'Julie and Désirée Clary are courted by the brothers Joseph and Napoleon Bonaparte. Joseph marries Julie and Napoleon is affianced to Désirée. When Napoleon breaks the engagement and marries Joséphine de Beauharnais, Désirée becomes involved with General Bernadotte.', 'Julie and Désirée Clary are courted by the brothers Joseph and Napoleon Bonaparte. Joseph marries Julie and Napoleon is affianced to Désirée. When Napoleon breaks the engagement and marries Joséphine de Beauharnais, Désirée becomes involved with General Bernadotte.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpEa01Nu7RfhknDeLhF49WjTXr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109053'),
  ('809048775012136447', 'Młode Wilki 1/2', 1998, 'Action, Crime', 'Jarosław Żamojda, Zuzanna Boczar, Anna Zaorska', 'Jarosław Żamojda', 'Anna Mucha, Krzysztof Antkowiak, Tamara Arciuch, Jarosław Jakimowicz, Paweł Deląg, Jan Nowicki, Tomasz Preniasz-Struś, Zbigniew Suszyński', null, 'The second part of a story about young people entering adulthood in the harsh reality of predatory capitalism. The action takes place in 1994, a few months before the events of the first part.', 'The second part of a story about young people entering adulthood in the harsh reality of predatory capitalism. The action takes place in 1994, a few months before the events of the first part.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyO8nnpW4f6KmKb2buPnbL1DusL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107148'),
  ('575420821670746087', 'Mme Mills, une voisine si parfaite', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Sophie Marceau, Myriam Vinocour', 'Sophie Marceau, Laure Duthilleul', 'Sophie Marceau, Pierre Richard, Nicolas Vaude, Bastien Ughetto, Léna Bréban, Gaël Zaks, Stéphane Bissot, Daniel Goldenberg', null, 'Hélène leads a sad life as editor of cheesy romance novels. But one day, when the old and delightfully eccentric American Mrs. Mills moves into the apartment next door, there is a sudden return to her everyday life. The two unequal women make friends in a hurry and Mrs. Mills is finally even the new face for Hélènes publishing - and that brings great success. But actually the old lady pursues a completely different plan. And is she even a lady?', 'Hélène leads a sad life as editor of cheesy romance novels. But one day, when the old and delightfully eccentric American Mrs. Mills moves into the apartment next door, there is a sudden return to her everyday life. The two unequal women make friends in a hurry and Mrs. Mills is finally even the new face for Hélènes publishing - and that brings great success. But actually the old lady pursues a completely different plan. And is she even a lady?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYqpw52dQknweVXSZqudqbkfn9v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490422'),
  ('872744590632219098', 'MN', 1954, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mar S. Torres', 'Pablo S. Gomez', 'Carmen Rosales, Alicia Vergel, Oscar Moreno, Cesar Ramirez, Aruray, Panchito, Herminia Carranza, Apolonia Aguilar', null, '"MN" stands for Marissa Navarro, a character played onscreen by screen legend Carmen Rosales. It tells of a story of Marissa, a strict, heartless, domineering and fiery heiress and daughter of a wealthy landowner, who instills and sows fear among its populace.', '"MN" stands for Marissa Navarro, a character played onscreen by screen legend Carmen Rosales. It tells of a story of Marissa, a strict, heartless, domineering and fiery heiress and daughter of a wealthy landowner, who instills and sows fear among its populace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFjyDDH7rceWhKcCtYPxuQzj6qC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27216'),
  ('818712087429445533', 'Mo Gilligan: In the Moment', 2026, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Chris Howe, Tristam Cones', 'Mo Gilligan', 'Jenny Ray, Stefan Richards, Joe Stabb, Ollie Nesham, Mark Crown', 'R', 'Follows British comedian Mo Gilligan as he dishes on fame, family and being British in America.', 'Follows British comedian Mo Gilligan as he dishes on fame, family and being British in America.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4Q1E0rQlYfxiWByxvespMMk8TJc.jpg', 'plex:movie:mo-gilligan-in-the-moment'),
  ('1009682226548971739', 'Mo'' Better Blues', 1990, 'Drama, Music', 'Spike Lee, Ernest R. Dickerson, H.H. Cooper', 'Spike Lee', 'Denzel Washington, Spike Lee, Wesley Snipes, Giancarlo Esposito, Robin Harris, Joie Lee, Bill Nunn, John Turturro', 'R', 'Talented but self-centered trumpeter Bleek Gilliam is obsessed with his music and indecisiveness about his girlfriends Indigo and Clarke. But when he is forced to come to the aid of his manager and childhood friend, Bleek finds his world more fragile than he ever imagined.', 'Talented but self-centered trumpeter Bleek Gilliam is obsessed with his music and indecisiveness about his girlfriends Indigo and Clarke. But when he is forced to come to the aid of his manager and childhood friend, Bleek finds his world more fragile than he ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEa6m5RjfrqfTzY1eHkC85shiUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41823'),
  ('313122945031869072', 'Mo'' Money', 1992, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Romance, Thriller, Drama', 'Peter MacDonald, Don Burgess', 'Damon Wayans', 'Damon Wayans, Stacey Dash, Joe Santos, John Diehl, Harry Lennix, Marlon Wayans, Mark Beltzman, Quincy Wong', 'R', 'Trying to get his act together, a con artist gets a job in a credit card company. He falls in love with a fellow employee, he steals a couple of cards, everything is going great. But soon, the chief of security drags him into the big leagues of criminals...', 'Trying to get his act together, a con artist gets a job in a credit card company. He falls in love with a fellow employee, he steals a couple of cards, everything is going great. But soon, the chief of security drags him into the big leagues of criminals...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLbKMopp46m5i3hukmFkQdCzfDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12251'),
  ('340792159304894861', 'Moana', 1926, 'Documentary', 'Robert Flaherty, Robert Flaherty, Bob Roberts', 'Julian Johnson', 'Ta''avale, Fa''amgase, Tama, T''ugaita, Pe''a, Leupenga', 'NR', 'Robert J. Flaherty’s follow-up to Nanook of the North shifts from the Arctic to the South Seas, portraying Samoan village life with a painterly eye. Blending ethnographic detail with a romanticized “Gauguin idyll,” the film celebrates daily rituals, communal traditions, and the passage into adulthood, suffused with what Flaherty called “pride of beauty, pride of strength.”', 'Robert J. Flaherty’s follow-up to Nanook of the North shifts from the Arctic to the South Seas, portraying Samoan village life with a painterly eye. Blending ethnographic detail with a romanticized “Gauguin idyll,” the film celebrates daily rituals, communal traditions, and the passage into adulthood, suffused with what Flaherty called “pride of beauty, pride of strength.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkSM2bfwYaqY0k6cEFwej1LRWAk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94727'),
  ('269960742973909672', 'Moana', 2016, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Animation', 'Amy Lawson Smeed, Ron Clements, Don Hall', 'Jared Bush', 'Auliʻi Cravalho, Dwayne Johnson, Rachel House, Temuera Morrison, Jemaine Clement, Nicole Scherzinger, Alan Tudyk, Louise Bush', 'PG', 'In Ancient Polynesia, when a terrible curse incurred by Maui reaches an impetuous Chieftain''s daughter''s island, she answers the Ocean''s call to seek out the demigod to set things right.', 'In Ancient Polynesia, when a terrible curse incurred by Maui reaches an impetuous Chieftain''s daughter''s island, she answers the Ocean''s call to seek out the demigod to set things right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tzN8sPbyod2dsa0lwuvrwBDWra.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277834'),
  ('599851410206463196', 'Moana', 2026, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Alan Hook, Thomas Kail, Óscar Faura', 'Jared Bush, Dana Ledoux Miller', 'Catherine Laga‘aia, Dwayne Johnson, Rena Owen, John Tui, Frankie Adams', null, 'Prompted by a summons from the ocean, Moana departs her home island of Motunui for the first time and travels past its barrier reef. Accompanied by the demigod Maui, she undertakes a voyage aimed at recovering the well-being of her community.', 'Prompted by a summons from the ocean, Moana departs her home island of Motunui for the first time and travels past its barrier reef. Accompanied by the demigod Maui, she undertakes a voyage aimed at recovering the well-being of her community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiOlBfrTDiI6dUl0WEkOr2oP6Zj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1108427'),
  ('997643159426040813', 'Moana 2', 2024, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'David G. Derrick Jr., Jason Hand, Dana Ledoux Miller', 'Bryson Chun', 'Auliʻi Cravalho, Dwayne Johnson, Hualālai Chung, Rose Matafeo, David Fane, Awhimai Fraser, Khaleesi Lambert-Tsuda, Temuera Morrison', 'PG', 'After receiving an unexpected call from her wayfinding ancestors, Moana journeys alongside Maui and a new crew to the far seas of Oceania and into dangerous, long-lost waters for an adventure unlike anything she''s ever faced.', 'After receiving an unexpected call from her wayfinding ancestors, Moana journeys alongside Maui and a new crew to the far seas of Oceania and into dangerous, long-lost waters for an adventure unlike anything she''s ever faced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLVkiINlIeCkcZIzb7XHzPYgO6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241982'),
  ('1120598780128470709', 'Mob Cops', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Danny A. Abeckaser, Barry Markowitz', 'Kosta Kondilopoulos', 'David Arquette, Jeremy Luke, Danny A. Abeckaser, Joseph Russo, Nathaniel Buzolic, Bo Dietl, Kevin Connolly, Rick Salomon', 'R', 'A retired NYPD detective writes a book about his family''s ties to the mob, igniting a firestorm between the corrupt cops working for the city''s brutal crime boss and the officers trying to bring them to justice.', 'A retired NYPD detective writes a book about his family''s ties to the mob, igniting a firestorm between the corrupt cops working for the city''s brutal crime boss and the officers trying to bring them to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nr5yEnMF1IshC1xKYLwrtZbbXD6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241934'),
  ('1047372527373986553', 'Mob Land', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Nicholas Maggio, Nick Remy Matthews', 'Nicholas Maggio', 'John Travolta, Shiloh Fernandez, Stephen Dorff, Ashley Benson, Kevin Dillon, Timothy V. Murphy, Emily Tremaine, Robert Miano', 'R', 'A sheriff tries to keep the peace when a desperate family man violently robs a pill mill with his brother-in-law, alerting an enforcer for the New Orleans mafia.', 'A sheriff tries to keep the peace when a desperate family man violently robs a pill mill with his brother-in-law, alerting an enforcer for the New Orleans mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcz8oi9oCgq1wkA3Wz2kluE94pE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:979275'),
  ('1104068912229412031', 'Mob Town', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hernán Toro, Danny A. Abeckaser', 'Joe Gilford, Jon Carlo', 'David Arquette, Danny A. Abeckaser, Jennifer Esposito, P.J. Byrne, Jamie-Lynn Sigler, Gino Cafarelli, Sasha Feldman, Anthony DeSando', 'R', 'Based on the true story of the notorious 1957 ‘mob summit’ in upstate New York. Spearheaded by Vito Genovese, more than 50 leaders of the organized crime syndicates from around the country converged on the sleepy town to discuss upcoming expansion plans. Their plans are foiled when local police trooper Ed Croswell discovers their activities and, consequently, exposes the mob to the American public. Croswell’s actions shed light on the massive web of corruption and changed the face of law enforcement forever.', 'Based on the true story of the notorious 1957 ‘mob summit’ in upstate New York. Spearheaded by Vito Genovese, more than 50 leaders of the organized crime syndicates from around the country converged on the sleepy town to discuss upcoming expansion plans. Their plans are foiled when local police trooper Ed Croswell discovers their activities and, consequently, exposes the mob to the American public. Croswell’s actions shed light on the massive web of corruption and changed the face of law enforcement forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BL0X6TKtKuYjd6CsZLzZvAYRlb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592128'),
  ('321426332249406475', 'Mobile', 2010, 'Animation, Family', 'Verena Fels', 'Verena Fels', 'Nina Göldner, Regina Welker, Falk Schellenberger, Falko Paeper, Jens Schmelzle, Christian Heck', null, 'At the edge of society, a cow tips the balance of destiny with quite some impact.', 'At the edge of society, a cow tips the balance of destiny with quite some impact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kIhUV5ndKKoK1P9oxzfPRvuTMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62359'),
  ('1151163045281832161', 'Mobile Home', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'François Pirot, Manuel Dacosse', 'Maarten Loix, François Pirot, Jean-Benoît Ugeux', 'Arthur Dupont, Guillaume Gouix, Jean-Paul Bonnaire, Claudine Pelletier, Anne-Pascale Clairembourg, Gilles Soeder, Eugenie Anselin, Arnaud Bronsart', null, 'After having broken up with his girlfriend and left his job, Simon has come back to his small hometown in the countryside, where he meets up again with his old friend Julien. The two thirty-year-old, unemployed and idle men decide to reinvest in an old dream from their teenage years: hitting the road for an adventurous journey. They buy a huge motor-home, but the trip is delayed by various troubles, and they decide to start their journey right where they are. Through this first motionless stage of their trip, Simon and Julien are confronted with themselves and what they wanted to run away from.', 'After having broken up with his girlfriend and left his job, Simon has come back to his small hometown in the countryside, where he meets up again with his old friend Julien. The two thirty-year-old, unemployed and idle men decide to reinvest in an old dream from their teenage years: hitting the road for an adventurous journey. They buy a huge motor-home, but the trip is delayed by various troubles, and they decide to start their journey right where they are. Through this first motionless stage of their trip, Simon and Julien are confronted with themselves and what they wanted to run away from.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhrvZlDy7HJtg4XJVPHphYo3vcS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130119'),
  ('1148898365693110468', 'Mobile Suit Gundam 00 Special Edition I: Celestial Being', 2009, 'Action, Drama, Adventure, Science Fiction, War, Animation', 'Seiji Mizushima', null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Shin-ichiro Miki, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Hiroshi Kamiya, Yasunori Matsumoto, Keiji Fujiwara, Yuji Ueda, Arise Sato', null, 'Like the Japanese Special Editions of other Gundam and Sunrise anime series, this is the first of three volumes that will condense the first 25-episode season of Gundam 00 into feature-length videos. They all feature some new animated sequences and some partially re-recorded dialogue.', 'Like the Japanese Special Editions of other Gundam and Sunrise anime series, this is the first of three volumes that will condense the first 25-episode season of Gundam 00 into feature-length videos. They all feature some new animated sequences and some partially re-recorded dialogue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OahMHyOOEnDYmxnDJHzyFvegZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25446'),
  ('130524454364971347', 'Mobile Suit Gundam 00 Special Edition III: Return The World', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction, War', 'Seiji Mizushima', null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Shin-ichiro Miki, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Hiroshi Kamiya, Miyu Irino, Hideyuki Umezu, Ayahi Takagaki, Hiroki Touchi', null, 'Like the Japanese Special Editions of other Gundam and Sunrise anime series, this is the last of three volumes, that will condense the second half of the second season of Gundam 00 into feature-length videos. They all feature some new animated sequences and some partially re-recorded dialogue.', 'Like the Japanese Special Editions of other Gundam and Sunrise anime series, this is the last of three volumes, that will condense the second half of the second season of Gundam 00 into feature-length videos. They all feature some new animated sequences and some partially re-recorded dialogue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIkcC7Plyrab5cPV8hmYsh5yVJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30807'),
  ('961600797529130866', 'Mobile Suit Gundam 00 The Movie: -A Wakening of the Trailblazer-', 2010, 'Action, Animation, Drama, Science Fiction, War', 'Masafumi Mima, Takeshi Katsurayama, Seiji Mizushima', 'Yosuke Kuroda', 'Mamoru Miyano, Shin-ichiro Miki, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Hiroshi Kamiya, Ryo Katsuji, Yoko Honna, Hiroki Touchi, Ayahi Takagaki', null, 'The year is 2314 AD, two years have passed since the defeat of the Innovades and the exposure of the A-Laws'' crimes against humanity. The A-Laws have been abolished and their infrastructure integrated into the Earth Sphere Federation Army. However, the world''s exposure to GN Particles has resulted in many people awakening as True Innovators. Celestial Being has returned to the shadows to rebuild and quietly observe the infantile peace. However, an abandoned probe from an expedition to Jupiter 130 years ago approaches Earth bringing a new crisis with it, one that threatens all of mankind. While Celestial Being begins their final mission to save humanity from an unimaginable threat, Gundam Meister Setsuna F. Seiei is about to discover the true purpose of his evolution as an Innovator. Aeolia Schenberg''s plan has moved into its final stage...', 'The year is 2314 AD, two years have passed since the defeat of the Innovades and the exposure of the A-Laws'' crimes against humanity. The A-Laws have been abolished and their infrastructure integrated into the Earth Sphere Federation Army. However, the world''s exposure to GN Particles has resulted in many people awakening as True Innovators. Celestial Being has returned to the shadows to rebuild and quietly observe the infantile peace. However, an abandoned probe from an expedition to Jupiter 130 years ago approaches Earth bringing a new crisis with it, one that threatens all of mankind. While Celestial Being begins their final mission to save humanity from an unimaginable threat, Gundam Meister Setsuna F. Seiei is about to discover the true purpose of his evolution as an Innovator. Aeolia Schenberg''s plan has moved into its final stage...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGfKtbinKYzsfwVVTF628nQtVL8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37048'),
  ('850513603950417659', 'Mobile Suit Gundam 0080: War in the Pocket', 1989, 'Action, Animation, Drama, Science Fiction, War', 'Fumihiko Takayama, Sadayoshi Fujino, Atsushi Okui', 'Hiroyuki Yamaga', 'Daisuke Namikawa, Koji Tsujitani, Megumi Hayashibara', null, 'In the final days of the One Year War, a Zeon special forces group infiltrates a colony to gather information on a new Gundam unit. Alfred Izuruha, a 10-year-old student, befriends Zeon rookie pilot Bernie Wiseman during a brief mobile suit combat. Meanwhile, Al meets up with Christina MacKenzie, his former neighbor and babysitter. Little does he know that not only is Christina a member of the Earth Federation, she''s the test pilot of the new Gundam NT-4 prototype.', 'In the final days of the One Year War, a Zeon special forces group infiltrates a colony to gather information on a new Gundam unit. Alfred Izuruha, a 10-year-old student, befriends Zeon rookie pilot Bernie Wiseman during a brief mobile suit combat. Meanwhile, Al meets up with Christina MacKenzie, his former neighbor and babysitter. Little does he know that not only is Christina a member of the Earth Federation, she''s the test pilot of the new Gundam NT-4 prototype.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14HWsqNfZQOy1i8fx1YYcDHF6C6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276957'),
  ('57337985571626432', 'Mobile Suit Gundam 0083: Afterglow of Zeon', 1992, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Toshihiro Kawamoto, Hiroshi Osaka, Hiroki Kanno', null, 'Ryo Horikawa, Akio Otsuka, Rei Sakuma, Chafurin, Chikao Ohtsuka, Kae Araki, Kazue Ikura, Kazuhiko Kishino', null, 'U.C. 0083 - Three years after the end of the catastrophic One Year War, peace on Earth and the colonies is shattered by the presence of the Delaz Fleet, a rogue Zeon military group loyal to the ideals of the late dictator Gihren Zabi. Delaz Fleet''s ace pilot Anavel Gato, once hailed as "The Nightmare of Solomon", infiltrates the Federation''s Torrington base in Australia and steals the nuclear-armed Gundam GP02A "Physalis" prototype. Rookie pilot Kou Uraki - with the aid of Anaheim Electronics engineer Nina Purpleton and the crew of the carrier Albion - pilots the Gundam GP01 "Zephyranthes" prototype in an attempt to recover the stolen Gundam unit and prevent another war from breaking out.', 'U.C. 0083 - Three years after the end of the catastrophic One Year War, peace on Earth and the colonies is shattered by the presence of the Delaz Fleet, a rogue Zeon military group loyal to the ideals of the late dictator Gihren Zabi. Delaz Fleet''s ace pilot Anavel Gato, once hailed as "The Nightmare of Solomon", infiltrates the Federation''s Torrington base in Australia and steals the nuclear-armed Gundam GP02A "Physalis" prototype. Rookie pilot Kou Uraki - with the aid of Anaheim Electronics engineer Nina Purpleton and the crew of the carrier Albion - pilots the Gundam GP01 "Zephyranthes" prototype in an attempt to recover the stolen Gundam unit and prevent another war from breaking out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kb93QXxb5asfbWlNOeOVyMopKom.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86161'),
  ('963922509047257411', 'Mobile Suit Gundam F91', 1991, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino, Toshimitsu Kobayashi, Shukou Murase', null, 'Koji Tsujitani, Yumi Touma, Miyoko Shoji, Takehito Koyasu, Tomohiro Nishimura, Yasuhiro Takato, Ai Orikasa, Kazue Ikura', 'PG-13', 'U.C. 0123. After a generation of peace, the Earth Federation has begun to build new space colonies to house humanity''s growing population. But a new force, the aristocratic Crossbone Vanguard, plans to seize the colonies of the newly constructed Frontier Side for itself. As their home becomes a battlefield, a handful of young civilians struggle to escape the conflict. To save his friends and family, the reluctant warrior Seabook Arno becomes the pilot of a new Gundam which bears the code name F91.', 'U.C. 0123. After a generation of peace, the Earth Federation has begun to build new space colonies to house humanity''s growing population. But a new force, the aristocratic Crossbone Vanguard, plans to seize the colonies of the newly constructed Frontier Side for itself. As their home becomes a battlefield, a handful of young civilians struggle to escape the conflict. To save his friends and family, the reluctant warrior Seabook Arno becomes the pilot of a new Gundam which bears the code name F91.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGwwFG9mMEXDEQ70bSSqAzCY3Dc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16308'),
  ('381054895420927754', 'Mobile Suit Gundam GQuuuuuuX -Beginning-', 2025, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Kazuya Tsurumaki, Kazuya Tsurumaki, Daizen Komatsuda', 'Hideaki Anno, Yoji Enokido', 'Tomoyo Kurosawa, Yui Ishikawa, Shimba Tsuchiya, Mariya Ise, Yukitoshi Tokumoto, Kosuke Echigoya, Shoya Chiba, Yuusuke Nagano', 'NR', 'High-school student Amate Yuzuriha lives peacefully in a space colony floating in outer space. But when she meets a war refugee named Nyaan, Amate is drawn into the illegal mobile suit dueling sport known as Clan Battle. Theatrical compilation of the first few episodes of Mobile Suit Gundam GQuuuuuuX.', 'High-school student Amate Yuzuriha lives peacefully in a space colony floating in outer space. But when she meets a war refugee named Nyaan, Amate is drawn into the illegal mobile suit dueling sport known as Clan Battle. Theatrical compilation of the first few episodes of Mobile Suit Gundam GQuuuuuuX.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FO1K6oKygac3j7LXLrIcG2Sz71.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1397163'),
  ('1114873663145812713', 'Mobile Suit Gundam Hathaway', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Shuhei Morita, Shinjiro Mogi, Toshimitsu Kobayashi', 'Yasuyuki Muto', 'Kensho Ono, Reina Ueda, Junichi Suwabe, Soma Saito, Atsumi Tanezaki, Kenjiro Tsuda, Toru Furuya, Shunpei Kusano', 'PG-13', 'Twelve years after Char''s rebellion, Hathaway Noa leads an insurgency against Earth Federation, but meeting an enemy officer and a mysterious woman alters his fate.', 'Twelve years after Char''s rebellion, Hathaway Noa leads an insurgency against Earth Federation, but meeting an enemy officer and a mysterious woman alters his fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gw8onh4FKsruBA7Oouv01EFxzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685274'),
  ('834056080655208000', 'MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM HATHAWAY The Sorcery of Nymph Circe', 2026, 'Animation, Science Fiction, War, Drama', 'Shukou Murase, Ryukow Masuo, Manabu Kadono', 'Yasuyuki Muto', 'Kensho Ono, Reina Ueda, Junichi Suwabe, Soma Saito, Kenjiro Tsuda, Yui Ishikawa, Fukushi Ochiai, Shunsuke Takeuchi', null, 'The year is U.C.0105, twelve years after Char''s Rebellion. "MAFTY" has begun resisting the Federation government''s tyrannical rule by assassinating its ministers. Its leader is actually Hathaway Noa, the son of Bright Noa, who fought in the One Year War alongside Amuro Ray. Haunted by past trauma, Hathaway is drawn to a mysterious girl named Gigi Andalucia, whose strange powers stir memories within him. While swayed by her cryptic words, he continues preparing for MAFTY''s mission -- the attack on the Adelaide Conference. Kenneth Sleg of the Earth Federation Forces prepares a defense operation for the Adelaide Conference and a plan to eliminate MAFTY and is approached by Handley Yoxon of the Criminal Police Organization with a secret proposal. As Hathaway and Kenneth pursue their respective goals, Gigi also sets off for Hong Kong to fulfill her own role.', 'The year is U.C.0105, twelve years after Char''s Rebellion. "MAFTY" has begun resisting the Federation government''s tyrannical rule by assassinating its ministers. Its leader is actually Hathaway Noa, the son of Bright Noa, who fought in the One Year War alongside Amuro Ray. Haunted by past trauma, Hathaway is drawn to a mysterious girl named Gigi Andalucia, whose strange powers stir memories within him. While swayed by her cryptic words, he continues preparing for MAFTY''s mission -- the attack on the Adelaide Conference. Kenneth Sleg of the Earth Federation Forces prepares a defense operation for the Adelaide Conference and a plan to eliminate MAFTY and is approached by Handley Yoxon of the Criminal Police Organization with a secret proposal. As Hathaway and Kenneth pursue their respective goals, Gigi also sets off for Hong Kong to fulfill her own role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YkVpc9Dn1L2FHNlLOybpSKeGc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:910850'),
  ('844800228010895107', 'Mobile Suit Gundam I', 1981, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino, Ryoji Fujiwara, Shinya Sadamitsu', 'Yoshihisa Araki, Hiroyuki Hoshiyama, Kenichi Matsuzaki', 'Toru Furuya, Shuichi Ikeda, Yo Inoue, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Fuyumi Shiraishi, Rumiko Ukai, Kiyonobu Suzuki, Toshio Furukawa', 'NR', 'In the year Universal Century 0079, humans have colonized the area of space lying in between the Earth and the moon. However, the ambitious Zabi family, rulers of the Duchy of Zeon, the grouping of colonies furthest from the earth, has sparked a war.', 'In the year Universal Century 0079, humans have colonized the area of space lying in between the Earth and the moon. However, the ambitious Zabi family, rulers of the Duchy of Zeon, the grouping of colonies furthest from the earth, has sparked a war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzyMAqagPK6wuvDzA5FeJU6n71Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39228'),
  ('927699526385472331', 'Mobile Suit Gundam II: Soldiers of Sorrow', 1981, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino, Ryoji Fujiwara, Yoshikazu Yasuhiko', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino, Yoshihisa Araki, Hiroyuki Hoshiyama', 'Toru Furuya, Shuichi Ikeda, Yo Inoue, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Fuyumi Shiraishi, Rumiko Ukai, Kiyonobu Suzuki, Toshio Furukawa', 'NR', 'After surviving attacks by Zeon''s Char Aznable and Garma Zabi, the crew of Federation warship White Base and its mobile suits must battle Zeon forces through Asia, Europe, and the Atlantic Ocean if they are to reach Earth Federation''s headquarters alive. During that process, many of its crewmembers must overcome their fears, losses, immaturities, and insecurities in order to persevere.', 'After surviving attacks by Zeon''s Char Aznable and Garma Zabi, the crew of Federation warship White Base and its mobile suits must battle Zeon forces through Asia, Europe, and the Atlantic Ocean if they are to reach Earth Federation''s headquarters alive. During that process, many of its crewmembers must overcome their fears, losses, immaturities, and insecurities in order to persevere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1J5u0bhbcCghFWnwmvsTi5RzQf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39229'),
  ('741335493852115831', 'Mobile Suit Gundam III: Encounters in Space', 1982, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino, Ryoji Fujiwara, Hiromichi Matano', 'Hiroyuki Hoshiyama, Yoshiyuki Tomino, Yoshihisa Araki', 'Toru Furuya, Shuichi Ikeda, Yo Inoue, Keiko Han, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Fuyumi Shiraishi, Makio Inoue, Rumiko Ukai', 'NR', 'Amuro Ray and the rest of the White Base crew, now denominated the 13th Autonomous Corps, return to outer space to support the rest of the Earth Federation forces for the decisive battle against the Principality of Zeon''s forces.', 'Amuro Ray and the rest of the White Base crew, now denominated the 13th Autonomous Corps, return to outer space to support the rest of the Earth Federation forces for the decisive battle against the Principality of Zeon''s forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXeLWEuUV5dVIhHmQt5z5RyawT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39230'),
  ('295227034019500470', 'Mobile Suit Gundam Narrative', 2018, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Kentaro Waki, Yoshihito Hishinuma, Atsutoshi Hashimoto', 'Harutoshi Fukui', 'Junya Enoki, Tomo Muranaka, Ayu Matsuura, Ayumi Fujimura, Tomoko Shiota, Yuuichirou Umehara, Takahiro Shimada, Kazuya Nakai', null, 'U.C. 0097, one year after the opening of "Laplace''s Box". Despite the revelation of the Universal Century Charter that acknowledges the existence and rights of Newtypes, the framework of the world has not been greatly altered. The conflict later dubbed the "Laplace Incident" is thought to have ended with the downfall of the Neo Zeon remnants known as the Sleeves. In its final battle, two full psycho-frame mobile suits displayed power beyond human understanding. The white unicorn and the black lion were sealed away to remove this danger from people''s consciousness, and they should now be completely forgotten. However, the RX-0 Unicorn Gundam 03, which disappeared two years earlier, is now about to show itself in the Earth Sphere once more. A golden phoenix… named Phenex.', 'U.C. 0097, one year after the opening of "Laplace''s Box". Despite the revelation of the Universal Century Charter that acknowledges the existence and rights of Newtypes, the framework of the world has not been greatly altered. The conflict later dubbed the "Laplace Incident" is thought to have ended with the downfall of the Neo Zeon remnants known as the Sleeves. In its final battle, two full psycho-frame mobile suits displayed power beyond human understanding. The white unicorn and the black lion were sealed away to remove this danger from people''s consciousness, and they should now be completely forgotten. However, the RX-0 Unicorn Gundam 03, which disappeared two years earlier, is now about to show itself in the Earth Sphere once more. A golden phoenix… named Phenex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rX0jSZIPbCRL1Qg7kM1gI88L9Hw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553610'),
  ('809874115733760372', 'Mobile Suit Gundam SEED FREEDOM', 2024, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Drama', 'Sadayoshi Fujino, Satoshi Shigeta, Mitsuo Fukuda', 'Mitsuo Fukuda, Chiaki Morosawa, Liu Goto', 'Soichiro Hoshi, Rie Tanaka, Akira Ishida, Nanako Mori, Kenichi Suzumura, Maaya Sakamoto, Houko Kuwashima, Fumiko Orikasa', 'NR', 'In C.E.75, the fighting still continues. There are independence movements, and aggression by Blue Cosmos... In order to calm the situation, a global peace monitoring agency called COMPASS is established, with Lacus as its first president. As members of COMPASS, Kira and his comrades intervene into various regional battles. Then a newly established nation called Foundation proposes a joint operation against a Blue Cosmos stronghold.', 'In C.E.75, the fighting still continues. There are independence movements, and aggression by Blue Cosmos... In order to calm the situation, a global peace monitoring agency called COMPASS is established, with Lacus as its first president. As members of COMPASS, Kira and his comrades intervene into various regional battles. Then a newly established nation called Foundation proposes a joint operation against a Blue Cosmos stronghold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EBnttleJaKnWWyyEqfiSn76ZjT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146972'),
  ('199649129881376915', 'Mobile Suit Gundam Thunderbolt: Bandit Flower', 2017, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, War', 'Ko Matsuo, Eriko Kimura, Kentaro Waki', 'Ko Matsuo', 'Yuichi Nakamura, Ryohei Kimura, Toa Yukinari, Sayaka Ohara, Yurina Furukawa, Tomokazu Sugita, Ryota Osaka', null, 'The second movie of the long-awaited fan favorite Thunderbolt Series. Earth, eight months after the end of the One Year War. Captain Monica launches a secret mission, "Operation Thunderbolt," and selects Io to pilot the Atlas Gundam. She leads the assault landing ship Spartan into a part of the ocean effectively controlled by the South Seas Alliance. Their objective is to secure or destroy the data of the Psycho Zaku, which the Alliance now possesses. Daryl, who took the upper hand in his battle with Io, has descended to Earth as part of the remnant forces of the Principality of Zeon. He has also been given the mission of obtaining information on the Psycho Zaku. Fighting alongside his new comrades, Io encounters Commander Peer, the South Seas Alliance''s border garrison commander. In the sea, on the ice field, and among the thick jungle, the mobile suits of Zeon, the Federation, and the South Seas Alliance battle each other. "The war is not over yet."', 'The second movie of the long-awaited fan favorite Thunderbolt Series. Earth, eight months after the end of the One Year War. Captain Monica launches a secret mission, "Operation Thunderbolt," and selects Io to pilot the Atlas Gundam. She leads the assault landing ship Spartan into a part of the ocean effectively controlled by the South Seas Alliance. Their objective is to secure or destroy the data of the Psycho Zaku, which the Alliance now possesses. Daryl, who took the upper hand in his battle with Io, has descended to Earth as part of the remnant forces of the Principality of Zeon. He has also been given the mission of obtaining information on the Psycho Zaku. Fighting alongside his new comrades, Io encounters Commander Peer, the South Seas Alliance''s border garrison commander. In the sea, on the ice field, and among the thick jungle, the mobile suits of Zeon, the Federation, and the South Seas Alliance battle each other. "The war is not over yet."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYqwIyGFBltNrUzM5QYyH4vbNxE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468690'),
  ('269977070540040550', 'Mobile Suit Gundam Thunderbolt: December Sky', 2016, 'Action, Animation, Drama, Science Fiction, War', 'Kentaro Waki, Ko Matsuo, Eriko Kimura', 'Ko Matsuo', 'Yuichi Nakamura, Ryohei Kimura, Toa Yukinari, Hiroshi Tsuchida, Daisuke Hirakawa, Shunsuke Sakuya, Sayaka Ohara, Mutsumi Sasaki', null, 'During the One Year War of U.C. 0079, the Earth Federation and Principality of Zeon engage in a fierce battle at the "Thunderbolt Sector", a shoal zone in the former Colony Side 4 "Moore". After successfully infiltrating Zeon''s sniper field, ace Federation pilot and jazz enthusiast Io Fleming is given control of the latest Gundam prototype.', 'During the One Year War of U.C. 0079, the Earth Federation and Principality of Zeon engage in a fierce battle at the "Thunderbolt Sector", a shoal zone in the former Colony Side 4 "Moore". After successfully infiltrating Zeon''s sniper field, ace Federation pilot and jazz enthusiast Io Fleming is given control of the latest Gundam prototype.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lkEs98koT3et0Csyb996apllOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404114'),
  ('569344695561178059', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: Char''s Counterattack', 1988, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino, Hiroyuki Kitazume, Hidetoshi Ōmori', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino', 'Toru Furuya, Shuichi Ikeda, Fuyumi Shiraishi, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Kazue Ikura, Koichi Yamadera, Maria Kawamura, Mayumi Shou', 'NR', 'In UC 0093, the Federation has recovered from its defeat and has created a new anti-colonial special forces unit to deal with rebel forces: Londo Bell. Elsewhere in space, Char Aznable reappears out of self-imposed hiding with a declaration that he now commands his own Neo-Zeon movement, and intends to force the emigration of Earth''s inhabitants to space by bringing about an apocalypse.', 'In UC 0093, the Federation has recovered from its defeat and has created a new anti-colonial special forces unit to deal with rebel forces: Londo Bell. Elsewhere in space, Char Aznable reappears out of self-imposed hiding with a declaration that he now commands his own Neo-Zeon movement, and intends to force the emigration of Earth''s inhabitants to space by bringing about an apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8I8gWpTtzMLt2lBlBoS7lM436nA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16157'),
  ('148661884421726865', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: Cucuruz Doan''s Island', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Science Fiction, Action', 'Shuhei Morita, Morihito Abe, Lim Ka-hee', 'Toshizo Nemoto', 'Toru Furuya, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Ken Narita, Toshio Furukawa, Megumi Han, Hideki Nakanishi, Tomofumi Ikezoe, Satomi Arai', 'NR', 'After a covert mission goes wrong, Mobile Suit pilot Amuro Ray and his comrades are stranded on a remote island. The battalion was sent to a land called the Island of No Return to clear off any enemy forces, only to find a group of children and an enemy mecha attack. Now Amuro must find a way for them all to escape this mysterious land, but not before meeting a strange man—Cucuruz Doan.', 'After a covert mission goes wrong, Mobile Suit pilot Amuro Ray and his comrades are stranded on a remote island. The battalion was sent to a land called the Island of No Return to clear off any enemy forces, only to find a group of children and an enemy mecha attack. Now Amuro must find a way for them all to escape this mysterious land, but not before meeting a strange man—Cucuruz Doan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h59l93jcYhMAgrZYVgCcuAEM7e9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:883768'),
  ('888196999880114273', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: The 08th MS Team - Miller''s Report', 1998, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, War', 'Kumiko Taniguchi, Tooru Yoshida, Katsutoshi Tsunoda', 'Akira Okeya, Hiroaki Kitajima', 'Kikuko Inoue, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Chinami Nishimura, Hiro Yuuki', 'PG-13', 'Universal Century 0079. The One Year War rages on, and Shiro Amada and his unit, the 08th MS team, continue their struggle against Zeon forces in the jungles of Southeast Asia. But recent events have put them under close scrutiny by Federation leaders. Alice Miller, an officer of the Federation Intelligence Division, has been dispatched to ascertain the truth behind a series of events leading to the capture of a new enemy mobile armor. As she begins her investigation, the lines between Federation and Zeon become blurred. Is there really a spy among the 08th MS team?', 'Universal Century 0079. The One Year War rages on, and Shiro Amada and his unit, the 08th MS team, continue their struggle against Zeon forces in the jungles of Southeast Asia. But recent events have put them under close scrutiny by Federation leaders. Alice Miller, an officer of the Federation Intelligence Division, has been dispatched to ascertain the truth behind a series of events leading to the capture of a new enemy mobile armor. As she begins her investigation, the lines between Federation and Zeon become blurred. Is there really a spy among the 08th MS team?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdFxuckun446PsbjhfeunhgKeLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464038'),
  ('636955091181339350', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: The Origin I - Blue-Eyed Casval', 2015, 'Action, Science Fiction, Animation', 'Yoshikazu Yasuhiko, Takashi Imanishi, Kiyoshi Egami', 'Katsuyuki Sumisawa', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Megumi Han, Ayumi Tsunematsu, Eizo Tsuda, Miyuki Ichijou, Jin Urayama, Banjo Ginga, Akeno Watanabe', null, 'Universal Century 0068, Side 3 - The Autonomous Republic of Munzo. Zeon Zum Deikun attempts to declare complete independence of Munzo from the Earth Federation Government, while he preaches the evolutionary potential of humans who have advanced into outer space. Deikun however suddenly falls to his death in the middle of his speech at parliament. Upon Deikun''s death, Jimba Ral spreads word of a House of Zabi conspiracy - but despite such efforts the power and sphere of influence of House of Zabi, led by Degwin Sodo Zabi, only seem to escalate. While we witness for the first time the untold convulsions of Universal Century history, Casval and Artesia, just bereaved of their father, must face destinies which will be just as tumultuous as the very era itself.', 'Universal Century 0068, Side 3 - The Autonomous Republic of Munzo. Zeon Zum Deikun attempts to declare complete independence of Munzo from the Earth Federation Government, while he preaches the evolutionary potential of humans who have advanced into outer space. Deikun however suddenly falls to his death in the middle of his speech at parliament. Upon Deikun''s death, Jimba Ral spreads word of a House of Zabi conspiracy - but despite such efforts the power and sphere of influence of House of Zabi, led by Degwin Sodo Zabi, only seem to escalate. While we witness for the first time the untold convulsions of Universal Century history, Casval and Artesia, just bereaved of their father, must face destinies which will be just as tumultuous as the very era itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQHoo8BRnu7NfznlI83zkSHLVdY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329365'),
  ('671984737233205044', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: The Origin II - Artesia''s Sorrow', 2015, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Yoshikazu Yasuhiko, Takashi Imanishi, Katsutoshi Nakamura', 'Katsuyuki Sumisawa', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Shuichi Ikeda, Akeno Watanabe, Ayumi Tsunematsu, Banjo Ginga, Chafurin, Hironori Kondoh, Jin Urayama', null, 'In the year UC 0071, three years after escaping the Zabi faction on an Ocean Cargo ship, Artesia and Casval are living happily in Andalusia, Spain, Earth under the identities of Sayla Mass and Éduoard Mass, respectively; masquerading as the children of Don Teabolo Mass, a long time friend of their father Zeon Zum Deikun.', 'In the year UC 0071, three years after escaping the Zabi faction on an Ocean Cargo ship, Artesia and Casval are living happily in Andalusia, Spain, Earth under the identities of Sayla Mass and Éduoard Mass, respectively; masquerading as the children of Don Teabolo Mass, a long time friend of their father Zeon Zum Deikun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBHEHrZ96SoR2N5bQCu5Y4ICuJR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368708'),
  ('592848927608567314', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: The Origin III - Dawn of Rebellion', 2016, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshikazu Yasuhiko, Takashi Imanishi, Kiichiro Inoue', 'Yoshikazu Yasuhiko', 'Shuichi Ikeda, Tetsuya Kakihara, Ai Kayano, Kenta Miyake, Tomoaki Maeno, Megumi Han, Banjo Ginga, Jin Urayama', null, 'Universal Century 0074. Since leaving Texas Colony, Édouard Mass has camouflaged his identity and enrolled in the Autonomous Republic of Zeon''s Space Defense Military Academy under the name of Char Aznable. He develops a friendship with his classmate Garma, a scion of the Zabi family. Gradually the two become admired by the other students. Then, in Universal Century 0077, the young at last rise up in arms and begin the fight for independence against the Earth Federation''s security forces. This rebellion, however, also marks the beginning of Char’s spectacular scenario of revenge… Now, the gears of history are turning!', 'Universal Century 0074. Since leaving Texas Colony, Édouard Mass has camouflaged his identity and enrolled in the Autonomous Republic of Zeon''s Space Defense Military Academy under the name of Char Aznable. He develops a friendship with his classmate Garma, a scion of the Zabi family. Gradually the two become admired by the other students. Then, in Universal Century 0077, the young at last rise up in arms and begin the fight for independence against the Earth Federation''s security forces. This rebellion, however, also marks the beginning of Char’s spectacular scenario of revenge… Now, the gears of history are turning!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1EBHjCVr1rZF0bH8HVTLrCnGfC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397366'),
  ('888935625659531948', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: The Origin IV – Eve of Destiny', 2016, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Yoshikazu Yasuhiko, Nana Harada, Shinjiro Mogi', 'Yoshikazu Yasuhiko', 'Shuichi Ikeda, Saori Hayami, Shigeo Kiyama, Kazuya Ichijo, Kenichirou Matsuda, Toshihide Tsuchiya, Jin Urayama, Akeno Watanabe', null, 'Following the success of the Dawn Rebellion, Degwin negotiates with Vice Admiral Revil to surrender all Federation assets and the complete withdrawal of Federation forces from Side 3 to prevent similar incidents from happening again. After bring reprimanded by Degwin for failure to look after Garma, Dozle sends Char - who motivated Garma into starting the rebellion - to Earth; in response, Char requests to become a mobile suit pilot when he returns. Feeling the burden of his responsibilities, Dozle proposes to cadet Zenna Mia. In the Earth city of Manaus, Char lands a job as a mobile worker pilot at a construction site. He meets a young Lalah Sune at a casino.', 'Following the success of the Dawn Rebellion, Degwin negotiates with Vice Admiral Revil to surrender all Federation assets and the complete withdrawal of Federation forces from Side 3 to prevent similar incidents from happening again. After bring reprimanded by Degwin for failure to look after Garma, Dozle sends Char - who motivated Garma into starting the rebellion - to Earth; in response, Char requests to become a mobile suit pilot when he returns. Feeling the burden of his responsibilities, Dozle proposes to cadet Zenna Mia. In the Earth city of Manaus, Char lands a job as a mobile worker pilot at a construction site. He meets a young Lalah Sune at a casino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKh2po4H6mOYGt31zE4uEHIOAB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403850'),
  ('1056939150471785073', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: The Origin V: Clash at Loum', 2017, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, War', 'Yoshikazu Yasuhiko, Kiyoshi Egami, Kiichiro Inoue', 'Yoshikazu Yasuhiko', 'Shuichi Ikeda, Megumi Han, Toru Furuya, Toshio Furukawa, Jin Urayama, Banjo Ginga, Akeno Watanabe, Tetsuya Kakihara', null, 'Universal Century 0079. Humanity has turned even space itself into a battlefield, and the Principality of Zeon forces advance after wiping out half the world''s population by carrying out the Operation British (colony drop). In response, the Earth Federation Forces mobilize their overwhelming fighting strength to regain the advantage. The complex intrigues of the Zabi family... Sayla Mass, as she contends with the whims of fate... Hamon and Ramba Ral, who is now a pilot in the Zeon forces... Amuro and Fraw, leading peaceful lives at Side 7... a dark shadow falls across them all. And the Zeon ace Char Aznable, driven by revenge, goes into action as the "Battle of Loum" finally begins.', 'Universal Century 0079. Humanity has turned even space itself into a battlefield, and the Principality of Zeon forces advance after wiping out half the world''s population by carrying out the Operation British (colony drop). In response, the Earth Federation Forces mobilize their overwhelming fighting strength to regain the advantage. The complex intrigues of the Zabi family... Sayla Mass, as she contends with the whims of fate... Hamon and Ramba Ral, who is now a pilot in the Zeon forces... Amuro and Fraw, leading peaceful lives at Side 7... a dark shadow falls across them all. And the Zeon ace Char Aznable, driven by revenge, goes into action as the "Battle of Loum" finally begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6S950lSSwN22NfgXVDeFne86C2j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428862'),
  ('91207779081322631', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: The Origin VI – Rise of the Red Comet', 2018, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, War', 'Yoshikazu Yasuhiko, Takashi Imanishi, Takuya Suzuki', 'Katsuyuki Sumisawa', 'Shuichi Ikeda, Megumi Han, Jin Urayama, Banjo Ginga, Kenta Miyake, Tetsuya Kakihara, Akeno Watanabe, Ai Kayano', null, 'On January 23, U.C. 0079, a decisive battle between Zeon and the Earth Federation begins at Side 5, or Loum. Though the Zeon forces are overwhelmingly outnumbered, their secret plan suddenly turns the tide of battle as they deploy a special assault regiment made up of humanoid mobile suit weapons, winning them a huge victory. Char Aznable of the Zeon forces produces particularly impressive results in his red mobile suit “Zaku II”, earning a promotion to Lieutenant Commander and the nickname "Red Comet." After the Battle of Loum, the Earth Federation Forces initiate Operation V to fight back against Zeon. At Side 7, young Amuro Ray is indirectly involved as he takes action to uncover the secret of the new weapon "Gundam." Meanwhile, as high officials of the Earth Federation and Zeon forces meet in Antarctica for early peace negotiations, a certain speech is broadcast from Luna II throughout the world...', 'On January 23, U.C. 0079, a decisive battle between Zeon and the Earth Federation begins at Side 5, or Loum. Though the Zeon forces are overwhelmingly outnumbered, their secret plan suddenly turns the tide of battle as they deploy a special assault regiment made up of humanoid mobile suit weapons, winning them a huge victory. Char Aznable of the Zeon forces produces particularly impressive results in his red mobile suit “Zaku II”, earning a promotion to Lieutenant Commander and the nickname "Red Comet." After the Battle of Loum, the Earth Federation Forces initiate Operation V to fight back against Zeon. At Side 7, young Amuro Ray is indirectly involved as he takes action to uncover the secret of the new weapon "Gundam." Meanwhile, as high officials of the Earth Federation and Zeon forces meet in Antarctica for early peace negotiations, a certain speech is broadcast from Luna II throughout the world...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icCuP3YTNYjJT9eeqBvAHSJmnXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475935'),
  ('197833623118833837', 'Mobile Suit SD Gundam Mk II', 1989, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Hideko Takahashi, Tetsuro Amino', 'Tetsuro Amino', 'Bin Shimada, Kazuki Yao, Nobuo Tobita, Shuichi Ikeda, Toru Furuya, Hidekatsu Shibata, Hideyuki Tanaka, Hirotaka Suzuoki', null, 'Mobile Suit SD Gundam Mk. II delivers with more tongue-in-cheek humor than the first series. In "The Rolling Colony Affair," a colony is hosting a cabaret show featuring the girls of Gundam. But the show turns disastrous when men and mobile suits go crazy over the girls, sending the colony rolling out of control. A parody of the videogame RPG genre, "Gundam Legend" has Amuro, Kamille and Judau sent on a perilous quest to rescue the princess of the Zeta Kingdom from Char Aznable and his vicious Zeon MS forces.', 'Mobile Suit SD Gundam Mk. II delivers with more tongue-in-cheek humor than the first series. In "The Rolling Colony Affair," a colony is hosting a cabaret show featuring the girls of Gundam. But the show turns disastrous when men and mobile suits go crazy over the girls, sending the colony rolling out of control. A parody of the videogame RPG genre, "Gundam Legend" has Amuro, Kamille and Judau sent on a perilous quest to rescue the princess of the Zeta Kingdom from Char Aznable and his vicious Zeon MS forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5daaVkv82GxoHQ18E7PLMMFHIvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508232'),
  ('1042949785449461553', 'Mobile Suit SD Gundam Mk III', 1990, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Gen Satou, Tetsuro Amino, Akitoshi Yokoyama', 'Tetsuro Amino', null, null, 'The third installment of SD Gundam shorts.', 'The third installment of SD Gundam shorts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryO4t2XmJQl28PljGv9X7rQ6S0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513567'),
  ('662288502023048764', 'Mobile Suit SD Gundam Mk IV', 1990, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Tetsuro Amino, Akitoshi Yokoyama, Koichi Chiba', 'Tetsuro Amino, Shinji Takamatsu', null, null, 'The SD Gundams are at it again: first with a race among all of the prior SD Gundam characters, then the SD Zeons run a space travel agency in the second episode.', 'The SD Gundams are at it again: first with a race among all of the prior SD Gundam characters, then the SD Zeons run a space travel agency in the second episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOPpoJ17afefYVjBHuey6j2R8AE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513573'),
  ('452511860083934315', 'Mobile Suit SD Gundam Mk V', 1990, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Tetsuro Amino, Shinji Takamatsu, Yasuhiro Oshima', 'Tetsuro Amino, Shinji Takamatsu', null, null, 'The Warring-States-Era SD Gundams are back to dispel evil spirits and an evil plot taking place in the ruins of Jaburo City.', 'The Warring-States-Era SD Gundams are back to dispel evil spirits and an evil plot taking place in the ruins of Jaburo City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfLwTHUmJmZD6ge60JoKS8jVaE8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513597'),
  ('481851810988750900', 'Mobile Suit SD Gundam''s Counterattack', 1989, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Gen Satou, Koichi Chiba, Atsushi Okui', 'Tetsuro Amino', 'Bin Shimada, Fuyumi Shiraishi, Hidekatsu Shibata, Hideyuki Tanaka, Hiroshi Takemura, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Ichiro Nagai, Kazuki Yao', null, 'The first theatrically release of the SD Gundam series. Contains two shorts, "The Storm-Calling School Festival" and "The Tale of the SD Warring States: The Chapter of the Violent Final Sky Castle".', 'The first theatrically release of the SD Gundam series. Contains two shorts, "The Storm-Calling School Festival" and "The Tale of the SD Warring States: The Chapter of the Violent Final Sky Castle".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gD1qQrn5z79tj7eZWiI275ovh5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513569'),
  ('255978553008891128', 'Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam - A New Translation I: Heirs to the Stars', 2005, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, War', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino, Shukou Murase, Saori Kibe', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino', 'Shuichi Ikeda, Nobuo Tobita, Toru Furuya, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Toshio Furukawa, Rumiko Ukai, Kazuhiko Inoue, Maya Okamoto', null, 'Universal Century 0087. The Titans, a bellicose faction among the Earth Federation Forces, grows powerful and tyrannical, even using poison gas to suppress a civil unrest. Dissident soldiers from the same military stand against them, forming a resistance group called the AEUG. Kamille Bidan, a civilian student, gets entangled in this conflict when he impulsively steals the Gundam Mark II and joins the AEUG, running away from his home space colony. Then he begins to fight along with Char Aznable, a former Zeon ace pilot who has infiltrated the Earth Sphere for reasons of his own. This is the first part of the feature trilogy derived from the anime series Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam, and features enhanced animation and theme songs by GACKT.', 'Universal Century 0087. The Titans, a bellicose faction among the Earth Federation Forces, grows powerful and tyrannical, even using poison gas to suppress a civil unrest. Dissident soldiers from the same military stand against them, forming a resistance group called the AEUG. Kamille Bidan, a civilian student, gets entangled in this conflict when he impulsively steals the Gundam Mark II and joins the AEUG, running away from his home space colony. Then he begins to fight along with Char Aznable, a former Zeon ace pilot who has infiltrated the Earth Sphere for reasons of his own. This is the first part of the feature trilogy derived from the anime series Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam, and features enhanced animation and theme songs by GACKT.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2z2XAfNNRyFYNMT1vSJ6k88X8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19256'),
  ('142651795296518871', 'Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam - A New Translation II: Lovers', 2005, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino, Seiichi Nakatani, Morifumi Naka', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino', 'Nobuo Tobita, Shuichi Ikeda, Toru Furuya, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Fuyumi Shiraishi, Keiko Han, Yukana, Chizuru Ikewaki', null, 'Universal Century 0087. As the civil war between the AEUG and the Titans continues, Kamille meets a mysterious girl named Four. But his encounter with Four, one of the Titans'' "cyber-Newtypes," fills his heart with anguish. The grief-stricken Kamille fights his way back to space to find the new mobile suit Zeta Gundam waiting for him. Meanwhile, Paptimus Scirocco, the man from Jupiter, has added his strength to that of the Titans. And a third power is finally making its move, in the form of the Zeon remnants of Axis... With enhanced animation and a theme song by GACKT, the tragic romance of Kamille and Four unfolds in this second part of the Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam feature trilogy.', 'Universal Century 0087. As the civil war between the AEUG and the Titans continues, Kamille meets a mysterious girl named Four. But his encounter with Four, one of the Titans'' "cyber-Newtypes," fills his heart with anguish. The grief-stricken Kamille fights his way back to space to find the new mobile suit Zeta Gundam waiting for him. Meanwhile, Paptimus Scirocco, the man from Jupiter, has added his strength to that of the Titans. And a third power is finally making its move, in the form of the Zeon remnants of Axis... With enhanced animation and a theme song by GACKT, the tragic romance of Kamille and Four unfolds in this second part of the Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam feature trilogy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpNtbZvUcQCxedLl42TDYmmn0PW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19257'),
  ('897484326222153748', 'Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam - A New Translation III: Love is the Pulse of the Stars', 2006, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, War', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino, Naoyuki Onda, Morifumi Naka', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino', 'Nobuo Tobita, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Bin Shimada, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Kazuhiko Inoue, Maya Okamoto, Masako Katsuki, Tomomichi Nishimura', null, 'Universal Century 0087, Char Aznable has now become the leader of the AEUG. Scirocco, the man from Jupiter, schemes to seize control of the Titans. Haman, the Axis leader, is attempting to restore the Zabi family. Through politics and strategy, these three powers struggle for dominion over the Earth Sphere. The war builds to a deadly endgame around the space colony Gryps 2, which has been converted into a giant laser cannon. What destiny awaits Kamille at the end of the conflict? This is the final part of the Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam feature trilogy, which features enhanced animation and theme songs by GACKT.', 'Universal Century 0087, Char Aznable has now become the leader of the AEUG. Scirocco, the man from Jupiter, schemes to seize control of the Titans. Haman, the Axis leader, is attempting to restore the Zabi family. Through politics and strategy, these three powers struggle for dominion over the Earth Sphere. The war builds to a deadly endgame around the space colony Gryps 2, which has been converted into a giant laser cannon. What destiny awaits Kamille at the end of the conflict? This is the final part of the Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam feature trilogy, which features enhanced animation and theme songs by GACKT.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iMoYO4Zit9wyZXIdqGskLeoT6V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30606'),
  ('1017534783381726442', 'Möbius', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Pierre Novion, Éric Rochant, Brieuc Vanderswalm', 'Éric Rochant', 'Jean Dujardin, Cécile de France, Tim Roth, Émilie Dequenne, Oleksiy Horbunov, John Lynch, Dean Constantin, Dmitri Nazarov', 'R', 'An FSB officer falls in love with his agent, an American woman who works as a trader in a Russian bank.', 'An FSB officer falls in love with his agent, an American woman who works as a trader in a Russian bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OA7xqy0mvq62DYVloqnRvmUkmM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170689'),
  ('1074055145592685519', 'Mobsters', 1991, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Karbelnikoff, Lajos Koltai', 'Michael Mahern', 'Christian Slater, Costas Mandylor, Richard Grieco, Patrick Dempsey, Lara Flynn Boyle, Michael Gambon, Anthony Quinn, Robert Z''Dar', 'R', 'The story of a group of friends in turn of the century New York, from their early days as street hoods to their rise in the world of organized crime...', 'The story of a group of friends in turn of the century New York, from their early days as street hoods to their rise in the world of organized crime...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7GfcGzH4UQzzP0Q3EfBiDbm5yu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21219'),
  ('730674356386291669', 'Moby Dick', 1930, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Lloyd Bacon, Robert Kurrle', 'J. Grubb Alexander', 'John Barrymore, Joan Bennett, Lloyd Hughes, Noble Johnson, Nigel De Brulier, Walter Long, May Boley, Tom O''Brien', null, 'Herman Melville''s mad Capt. Ahab (John Barrymore) spends years hunting the white whale that got his leg.', 'Herman Melville''s mad Capt. Ahab (John Barrymore) spends years hunting the white whale that got his leg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28l2oBnECLYV0uB6ArFNkKT0szu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177214'),
  ('1012687520518913040', 'Moby Dick', 1956, 'Adventure, Drama', 'John Huston, Oswald Morris, Kevin McClory', 'Ray Bradbury, John Huston', 'Gregory Peck, Richard Basehart, Leo Genn, James Robertson Justice, Harry Andrews, Bernard Miles, Noel Purcell, Edric Connor', null, 'In 1841, young Ishmael signs up for service aboard the Pequod, a whaler sailing out of New Bedford. The ship is under the command of Captain Ahab, a strict disciplinarian who exhorts his men to find Moby Dick, the great white whale. Ahab lost his leg to that creature and is desperate for revenge. As the crew soon learns, he will stop at nothing to gain satisfaction.', 'In 1841, young Ishmael signs up for service aboard the Pequod, a whaler sailing out of New Bedford. The ship is under the command of Captain Ahab, a strict disciplinarian who exhorts his men to find Moby Dick, the great white whale. Ahab lost his leg to that creature and is desperate for revenge. As the crew soon learns, he will stop at nothing to gain satisfaction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JXcm3RyWlGsRCZ0YlOliWr6TNv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10339'),
  ('65705876862616562', 'Moby Dick', 2011, 'Action', 'Park In-je, Kim Seung-gyu', 'Park Sin-gyu, Park In-je', 'Hwang Jung-min, Jin Goo, Kim Bo-yeon, Kim Sang-ho, Jeong Man-sik, Kim Min-jae, Bae Sung-woo, Kim Min-hee', null, 'A mysterious explosion occurs at the Balam Bridge in Seoul on November 20th, 1994. In front of hot-blooded local news reporter Lee Bang-Woo, Yoon Hyeok appears. Yoon Hyeok is from the same hometown as Lee Bang-Woo, but they haven''t seen each other in a long time. Yoon Hyeok hands over documents to Lee Bang-Woo and hints that the case of the Balam Bridge was fabricated.', 'A mysterious explosion occurs at the Balam Bridge in Seoul on November 20th, 1994. In front of hot-blooded local news reporter Lee Bang-Woo, Yoon Hyeok appears. Yoon Hyeok is from the same hometown as Lee Bang-Woo, but they haven''t seen each other in a long time. Yoon Hyeok hands over documents to Lee Bang-Woo and hints that the case of the Balam Bridge was fabricated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJe4je7T1BxrMjR9THpMY6QlJZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75006'),
  ('913019932274741240', 'Mockingbird', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bryan Bertino, Brandon Cox, Mark Carter', 'Bryan Bertino', 'Todd Stashwick, Alexandra Lydon, Audrey Marie Anderson, Barak Hardley, Colby French, Lee Garlington, Spencer List, Emily Alyn Lind', 'R', 'A couple are given a camera and a set of instructions which they must follow or else someone will die.', 'A couple are given a camera and a set of instructions which they must follow or else someone will die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7tzWmIOqMlXqakPV21DPCGSFKr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289712'),
  ('1150408519399078420', 'Mockingbird Don''t Sing', 2001, 'Drama', 'Harry Bromley Davenport, Jeff Baustert, Adeeb Hammoudi', 'Daryl Haney', 'Melissa Errico, Joe Regalbuto, Sean Young, Michael Lerner, Kim Darby, Tarra Steele, Laurie O''Brien, Ed Brigadier', null, 'The tragic true story of one of the worst cases of child abuse ever documented (in which a girl was locked in a room without social contact for nearly thirteen years) and what happened when she was finally rescued.', 'The tragic true story of one of the worst cases of child abuse ever documented (in which a girl was locked in a room without social contact for nearly thirteen years) and what happened when she was finally rescued.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x50tfqNxTRFtk4k70sWSvt4MEYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27967'),
  ('1069984071775038188', 'Mod Fuck Explosion', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Jon Moritsugu, Todd Verow', 'Jon Moritsugu', 'Amy Davis, Desi del Valle, Bonnie Steiger, Jacques Boyreau, Victor of Aquitaine, Alyssa Wendt, Bonnie Dickenson, Lane McClain', null, 'Teenage London is trying to find meaning in the world, or a leather jacket of her own. Unaccepted by neither the Mods or the Asian biker gang, she tries to find her own path. Meanwhile, the two gangs maintain a mutual vendetta sure to erupt in a smorgasbord of violence.', 'Teenage London is trying to find meaning in the world, or a leather jacket of her own. Unaccepted by neither the Mods or the Asian biker gang, she tries to find her own path. Meanwhile, the two gangs maintain a mutual vendetta sure to erupt in a smorgasbord of violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjLzdJmuOl5sXSAEcVKMW6XNKIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250586'),
  ('332029166313214715', 'Moda Tharindu', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Thisara Imbulana, Hasitha Warnasooriya, Dinesh Gamage', null, 'Soorya Dayaruwan, Kaushalaya Fernando, Danuka Dilshan, Shanudrie Priyasad, Shehani Kahandawala, Xavier Kanishka', null, 'A family loss leads a man on a life-altering journey in which he gains new perspectives on his family, friendships and relationships.', 'A family loss leads a man on a life-altering journey in which he gains new perspectives on his family, friendships and relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnB4pDZxD8cUsoTmbQBho9olDQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1527163'),
  ('61708866539480292', 'Modalità aereo', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Eliana Antia Conte, Chiara della Longa, Marcello Montarsi', 'Paolo Ruffini, Herbert Simone Paragnani, Fausto Brizzi', 'Lillo Petrolo, Paolo Ruffini, Violante Placido, Dino Abbrescia, Caterina Guzzanti, Christian Monaldi, Luca Vecchi, Veronica Logan', null, 'Diego is a successful entrepreneur. Rich and not caring for the good of others, no scruples to belittle the next. His attitude turns against him when he forgets in his airport bathroom his latest-generation mobile phone with social profiles, contacts and credit cards.', 'Diego is a successful entrepreneur. Rich and not caring for the good of others, no scruples to belittle the next. His attitude turns against him when he forgets in his airport bathroom his latest-generation mobile phone with social profiles, contacts and credit cards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VdOwEWEgayMwGqWewwDx1NRbDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575113'),
  ('371350934420223203', 'Model Behavior', 2000, 'Comedy, Family, Drama, TV Movie', 'Mark Rosman, Laszlo George', 'Matt Roshkow, David Kukoff', 'Maggie Lawson, Jim Abele, Daniel Clark, Karen Hines, Justin Timberlake, Jesse Nilsson, Kathie Lee Gifford, Vendela Kirsebom', 'G', 'An ordinary high school girl and a top teen model decide to switch places after meeting and discovering they bear an uncanny resemblance.', 'An ordinary high school girl and a top teen model decide to switch places after meeting and discovering they bear an uncanny resemblance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shCXg98qT4jtDwod0T8YCv1g0Zt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71884'),
  ('1074640219438057778', 'Model Shop', 1969, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Demy, Herbert Willis, Michel Hugo', 'Jacques Demy', 'Gary Lockwood, Anouk Aimée, Alexandra Hay, Carol Cole, Tom Holland, Severn Darden, Neil Elliot, Jacqueline Mille', 'PG-13', 'While trying to raise money to prevent his car from being repossessed, George is attracted to Lola, a Frenchwoman who works in a "model shop", an establishment that rents out beautiful pin-up models to photographers. George spends his last twelve dollars to photograph Lola, and discovers that she is as unhappy as he.', 'While trying to raise money to prevent his car from being repossessed, George is attracted to Lola, a Frenchwoman who works in a "model shop", an establishment that rents out beautiful pin-up models to photographers. George spends his last twelve dollars to photograph Lola, and discovers that she is as unhappy as he.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzwcXSS9vdmEiEr4vMsoc66PBzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85942'),
  ('1010611861429999190', 'Modeling', 1921, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Max Fleischer', null, 'The Clown causes trouble for the Cartoonist, and a sculptor using the studio, when he escapes from his backdrop and hides in the wet clay of a bust.', 'The Clown causes trouble for the Cartoonist, and a sculptor using the studio, when he escapes from his backdrop and hides in the wet clay of a bust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkY7pHMUT28HXPWxtxeZb7LUbKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175407'),
  ('464530708810609686', 'Models', 1999, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Ulrich Seidl, Jerzy Palacz, Hans Selikovsky', 'Ulrich Seidl', 'Vivian Bartsch, Tanja Petrovsky, Lisa Grossmann, Elvyra Geyer, Gernot Assinger, Peter Baumann, Michael Dürr, Alex Greinecker', null, 'A revealing and devastating portrait of a trio of aspiring real-life Viennese models. Vivian will stop at nothing to be a magazine cover girl. Lisa fills her time with routine plastic surgery and cocaine binges, while innocent Tanja focuses on the mystical through tarot cards, yoga, and raw animal energy.', 'A revealing and devastating portrait of a trio of aspiring real-life Viennese models. Vivian will stop at nothing to be a magazine cover girl. Lisa fills her time with routine plastic surgery and cocaine binges, while innocent Tanja focuses on the mystical through tarot cards, yoga, and raw animal energy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UQbrSTIBzRQZNeygcYY0jLqCzG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56358'),
  ('877978332466860680', 'Modern Cinderella', 1965, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Nestoras Pavelas, Takis Vougiouklakis', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Aliki Vougiouklaki, Dimitris Papamichael, Stavros Xenidis, Aris Malliagros, Christos Parlas, Despoina Nikolaidou, Athanasia Moustaka, Nikitas Platis', null, 'Katerina, a poor girl, finds a job as a secretary and falls in love with her boss on a trip to Rome.', 'Katerina, a poor girl, finds a job as a secretary and falls in love with her boss on a trip to Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAQrGDNH51RUDvGHuEzmt5isIDY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301496'),
  ('795830375707544197', 'Modern Girls', 1986, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jerry Kramer, Mary Ellen Woods, John Scherer', 'Laurie Craig', 'Cynthia Gibb, Virginia Madsen, Clayton Rohner, Daphne Zuniga, Stephen Shellen, Chris Nash, Rick Overton, Pamela Springsteen', 'PG-13', 'Margo, Kelly, and CeCe have three things in common: they''re roommates, they''re gorgeous, and they''re hooked on the glamour and excitement of L.A.''s rock and roll nightlife. When they get mixed up with a rock star, an arrogant ex-boyfriend, a pseudo-sadist, and the nicest nerd in the City of Angels, it''s a full night to say the least!', 'Margo, Kelly, and CeCe have three things in common: they''re roommates, they''re gorgeous, and they''re hooked on the glamour and excitement of L.A.''s rock and roll nightlife. When they get mixed up with a rock star, an arrogant ex-boyfriend, a pseudo-sadist, and the nicest nerd in the City of Angels, it''s a full night to say the least!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sv6npOvxRoNENgErAlSsyx7fHZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38916'),
  ('460251359872090034', 'Modern Inventions', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher, Cliff Edwards, Adriana Caselotti', 'NR', 'Donald Duck goes to a museum of modern inventions. After getting in without paying, he meets a robot butler who takes Donald''s hat every time he sees him. Donald is very annoyed by this and magically fixes himself a new hat every time this happens and strolls on. Ignoring the sign not to touch it, Donald starts playing with a wrapping machine and ends up being wrapped himself. He also encounters and tries out a robot nursemaid and a fully automatic barber chair. They both don''t do him much good.', 'Donald Duck goes to a museum of modern inventions. After getting in without paying, he meets a robot butler who takes Donald''s hat every time he sees him. Donald is very annoyed by this and magically fixes himself a new hat every time this happens and strolls on. Ignoring the sign not to touch it, Donald starts playing with a wrapping machine and ends up being wrapped himself. He also encounters and tries out a robot nursemaid and a fully automatic barber chair. They both don''t do him much good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nSISJd9UWzOOoxse47nYi4FO0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58149'),
  ('488287823197387636', 'Modern Life', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Raymond Depardon, Raymond Depardon', 'Raymond Depardon', 'Marcel Challaye, Germaine Challaye, Paul Argaud, Amandine Gagnaire, Michel Valla, Abel Jeanroy, Gilberte Jeanroy, Daniel Jeanroy', null, 'For ten years, Raymond Depardon has followed the lives of farmer living in the mountain ranges. He allows us to enter their farms with astounding naturalness. This moving film speaks, with great serenity, of our roots and of the future of the people who work on the land. This the last part of Depardon''s triptych "Profils paysans" about what it is like to be a farmer today in an isolated highland area in France. "La vie moderne" examines what has become of the persons he has followed for ten years, while featuring younger people who try to farm or raise cattle or poultry, come hell or high water.', 'For ten years, Raymond Depardon has followed the lives of farmer living in the mountain ranges. He allows us to enter their farms with astounding naturalness. This moving film speaks, with great serenity, of our roots and of the future of the people who work on the land. This the last part of Depardon''s triptych "Profils paysans" about what it is like to be a farmer today in an isolated highland area in France. "La vie moderne" examines what has become of the persons he has followed for ten years, while featuring younger people who try to farm or raise cattle or poultry, come hell or high water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8IWYCY8fA1VclmjZghVQ3sZwsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8930'),
  ('1112422772991304529', 'Modern Life Is Rubbish', 2018, 'Romance, Music', 'Daniel Jerome Gill, Tim Sidell', 'Philip Gawthorne', 'Freya Mavor, Josh Whitehouse, Ian Hart, Tom Riley, Jessie Cave, Will Merrick, Steven Mackintosh, Sorcha Cusack', null, 'Brought together by their shared love of music, ten years on Liam and Natalie are at breaking point. In their case opposites attract but don''t necessarily work long-term. Making the difficult decision to separate, they must split their prized music library. But the soundtrack that defined their relationship keeps pulling them back together.', 'Brought together by their shared love of music, ten years on Liam and Natalie are at breaking point. In their case opposites attract but don''t necessarily work long-term. Making the difficult decision to separate, they must split their prized music library. But the soundtrack that defined their relationship keeps pulling them back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyrfnxxynxyeaVrsdTvbX38fFaa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412003'),
  ('234258923447098581', 'Modern Love', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stéphane Kazandjian, Régis Blondeau', 'Stéphane Kazandjian', 'Alexandra Lamy, Stéphane Rousseau, Bérénice Bejo, Clotilde Courau, Mélanie Bernier, Valérie Karsenti, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Stéphane Debac', null, 'Several couples break up and get back together.', 'Several couples break up and get back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/813qB21JPr5iR6KkEdKyD46GFes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13737'),
  ('437791946500823945', 'Modern Loves', 2019, 'Drama', 'Mauro Pinheiro Jr., Matías Meyer', 'María Camila Arias, Matías Meyer, Edgar Chias', 'Leonardo Ortizgris, Ilse Salas, Andrés Almeida, María Evoli, Ludwika Paleta, Mónica del Carmen, Raúl Briones, Martha Claudia Moreno', null, 'A fateful day reunites an estranged family in Mexico City, where a chain of events shifts their romantic relationships and uncovers a monumental secret.', 'A fateful day reunites an estranged family in Mexico City, where a chain of events shifts their romantic relationships and uncovers a monumental secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i94y6TxwMYALvt3Qm1yc3bCWqMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639737'),
  ('184360356171006644', 'Modern Persuasion', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Benjamin Rutkowski, Alex Appel, Jonathan Lisecki', 'Barbara Radecki, Jonathan Lisecki', 'Alicia Witt, Bebe Neuwirth, Daniella Pineda, Shane McRae, Dominic Rains, Chris O''Shea, Jenn Harris, Mark Moses', null, 'A single woman focused on her career in New York is forced to deal with the aftermath of a failed relationship when an ex-boyfriend is hired by her company.', 'A single woman focused on her career in New York is forced to deal with the aftermath of a failed relationship when an ex-boyfriend is hired by her company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/131BvNu5w2zI9FtqoZTAMRFcuGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536725'),
  ('846805133957101806', 'Modern Problems', 1981, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Edmond L. Koons, Ken Shapiro', 'Ken Shapiro, Tom Sherohman, Arthur Sellers', 'Chevy Chase, Patti D''Arbanville, Dabney Coleman, Mary Kay Place, Nell Carter, Brian Doyle-Murray, Mitch Kreindel, Arthur Sellers', 'PG', 'Jealous, harried air traffic controller Max Fielder, recently dumped by his girlfriend, comes into contact with nuclear waste and is granted the power of telekinesis, which he uses to not only win her back, but to gain a little revenge.', 'Jealous, harried air traffic controller Max Fielder, recently dumped by his girlfriend, comes into contact with nuclear waste and is granted the power of telekinesis, which he uses to not only win her back, but to gain a little revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aH21h3sMMN3r6d9I8VSBw28fW7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16471'),
  ('184453123307258245', 'Modern Romance', 1981, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Albert Brooks, Steve Perry, Michael Looney', 'Albert Brooks, Monica Johnson', 'Albert Brooks, Kathryn Harrold, Bruno Kirby, James L. Brooks, Bob Einstein, Jane Hallaren, Albert Henderson, Meadowlark Lemon', 'R', 'A film editor breaks up with his girlfriend, unsure if he is in love.', 'A film editor breaks up with his girlfriend, unsure if he is in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDRBGabz2BqlqjidUOtTvYOaSli.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63443'),
  ('519518191534359396', 'Modern Vampires', 1998, 'Action, Horror, Comedy, Romance, Thriller', 'Richard Elfman, Robin Brown', 'Matthew Bright', 'Casper Van Dien, Natasha Gregson Wagner, Rod Steiger, Kim Cattrall, Natasha Lyonne, Craig Ferguson, Natalya Andreychenko, Robert Pastorelli', 'R', 'A vampire hunter in southern California discovers that his son has been murdered by a gang of the undead and thus goes on a quest for revenge.', 'A vampire hunter in southern California discovers that his son has been murdered by a gang of the undead and thus goes on a quest for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXqIlTNkODfkJzVK4Ws26pxaUP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31003'),
  ('1001934156535363466', 'Modest Heroes', 2018, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Drama', 'Koji Kasamatsu, Akihiko Yamashita, Yoshiyuki Momose', 'Akihiko Yamashita, Yoshiyuki Momose, Hiromasa Yonebayashi', 'Min Tanaka, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Joe Odagiri, Fumino Kimura, Rio Suzuki, Machiko Ono, Souta Shinohara, Yuko Sasaki', 'PG', 'Two tiny, aquatic humanoids search for their missing father, a boy battles a lethal allergy to eggs, and an invisible salaryman tries to become a hero.', 'Two tiny, aquatic humanoids search for their missing father, a boy battles a lethal allergy to eggs, and an invisible salaryman tries to become a hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jURYLaG6BX0klRHsiHc3pzOlOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514710'),
  ('45191233300794724', 'Modesty', 2007, 'Drama', 'Tristán Ulloa, David Ulloa, David Omedes', 'Tristán Ulloa', 'Nancho Novo, Elvira Mínguez, Natalia Rodríguez, Celso Bugallo, Carolina Román, Marcos Ruiz, Manolo Solo, Nuria González', null, 'Pudor is about intimacy, about the desires, obsessions, secrets and fears that we keep hidden, even from those we love most. The characters in this story are a man who is going to die, a woman who receives anonymous erotic notes, an older man who is offered a last chance at falling in love, a teenager struggling to handle the doubts generated by puberty and a small boy who sees ghosts. As is the case in many families, in spite of living together, all the characters in Pudor are alone.', 'Pudor is about intimacy, about the desires, obsessions, secrets and fears that we keep hidden, even from those we love most. The characters in this story are a man who is going to die, a woman who receives anonymous erotic notes, an older man who is offered a last chance at falling in love, a teenager struggling to handle the doubts generated by puberty and a small boy who sees ghosts. As is the case in many families, in spite of living together, all the characters in Pudor are alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvFhP17NlUKDEhRCzNSddAcK1AB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81930'),
  ('84248527087297007', 'Modesty Blaise', 1966, 'Comedy, Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Joseph Losey, Jack Hildyard, Claude Watson', 'Harold Pinter', 'Monica Vitti, Terence Stamp, Dirk Bogarde, Harry Andrews, Michael Craig, Clive Revill, Alexander Knox, Rossella Falk', 'NR', 'Modesty Blaise, a secret agent whose hair color, hair style, and mod clothing change at a snap of her fingers is being used by the British government as a decoy in an effort to thwart a diamond heist. She is being set up by the feds but is wise to the plot and calls in sidekick Willie Garvin and a few other friends to outsmart them. Meanwhile, at his island hideaway, Gabriel, the diamond thief has his own plans for Blaise and Garvin.', 'Modesty Blaise, a secret agent whose hair color, hair style, and mod clothing change at a snap of her fingers is being used by the British government as a decoy in an effort to thwart a diamond heist. She is being set up by the feds but is wise to the plot and calls in sidekick Willie Garvin and a few other friends to outsmart them. Meanwhile, at his island hideaway, Gabriel, the diamond thief has his own plans for Blaise and Garvin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpQRLEcQeWe2T8TbSJ0zJ0Avqij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36645'),
  ('25864952117210041', 'Modi, Three Days on the Wing of Madness', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'Sharon Howard-Field, Mónika Esztán, Jessica Anna Camacho', 'Jerzy Kromolowski, Mary Olson-Kromolowski', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Antonia Desplat, Al Pacino, Stephen Graham, Benjamin Lavernhe, Bruno Gouery, Ryan McParland, Sally Phillips', null, 'Through the streets of World War I Paris, Italian bohemian artist Modigliani attempts to outmaneuver bombs, policemen, girlfriends, and critics in a increasingly desperate search of a home for his art.', 'Through the streets of World War I Paris, Italian bohemian artist Modigliani attempts to outmaneuver bombs, policemen, girlfriends, and critics in a increasingly desperate search of a home for his art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/K5hGnee6HSq7YoJZPSY1TbsBMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013406'),
  ('581029631880715726', 'Modigliani', 2004, 'Drama', 'Mick Davis, Emmanuel Kadosh, Sallie Hard', 'Mick Davis', 'Andy Garcia, Elsa Zylberstein, Omid Djalili, Hippolyte Girardot, Eva Herzigová, Miriam Margolyes, Udo Kier, Susie Amy', null, 'Set in Paris in 1919, biopic centers on the life of late Italian artist Amedeo Modigliani, focusing on his last days as well as his rivalry with Pablo Picasso. Modigliani, a Jew, has fallen in love with Jeanne, a young and beautiful Catholic girl. The couple has an illegitimate child, and Jeanne''s bigoted parents send the baby to a faraway convent to be raised by nuns.', 'Set in Paris in 1919, biopic centers on the life of late Italian artist Amedeo Modigliani, focusing on his last days as well as his rivalry with Pablo Picasso. Modigliani, a Jew, has fallen in love with Jeanne, a young and beautiful Catholic girl. The couple has an illegitimate child, and Jeanne''s bigoted parents send the baby to a faraway convent to be raised by nuns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyvkjImdzdERJnRPwx5Tj39c8a0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34308'),
  ('762205748445974465', 'Modisto de Señoras', 1969, null, 'René Cardona Jr.', 'Fernando Galiana', 'Mauricio Garcés, Zulma Faiad, Irma Lozano, Claudia Islas, Enrique Rocha, Hugo Goodman, Carlos Nieto, Carlos López Moctezuma', null, 'Successful fashiondesigner D''Maurice seduces married women while he pretends to be gay in order to avoid arousing suspicion among his clientele''s husbands', 'Successful fashiondesigner D''Maurice seduces married women while he pretends to be gay in order to avoid arousing suspicion among his clientele''s husbands', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dL3SRALO9TmbVgZCcKurF18MY4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173758'),
  ('409622288678002460', 'Modori River', 1983, null, 'Tatsumi Kumashiro', 'Haruhiko Arai', 'Mariko Fuji, Kenichi Hagiwara, Mieko Harada, Kanako Higuchi, Mariko Kaga, Shino Ikenami, Yuki Ninagawa, Toshio Shiba', null, 'The story of Takeha, a free-spirited genius poet who lived through Taisho Romanticism, and the women who gave themselves over to his ambitions.', 'The story of Takeha, a free-spirited genius poet who lived through Taisho Romanticism, and the women who gave themselves over to his ambitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EHBFyeBWN2N1llrZqyddMK8rsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393392'),
  ('1099134863556487534', 'Modulations', 1998, 'Documentary, Music', 'Iara Lee, Marcus Burnett, Paul Sanchez IV', 'Peter Shapiro', 'Karlheinz Stockhausen, Moby, Afrika Bambaataa, Derrick May, Genesis P-Orridge, Liam Howlett, Giorgio Moroder, Terre Thaemlitz', null, 'Less a documentary than a primer on all electronic music. Featuring interviews with nearly every major player past and present, as well as a few energetic live clips, Modulations delves into one of electronica''s forgotten facets: the human element. Lee travels the globe from the American Midwest to Europe to Japan to try to express the appeal of music often dismissed as soulless. Modulations shows that behind even the most foreign or alien electronic composition lies a real human being, and Lee lets many of these Frankenstein-like creators express and expound upon their personal philosophies and tech-heavy theories. Lee understands that a cultural movement as massive and diverse as dance music can''t be contained.', 'Less a documentary than a primer on all electronic music. Featuring interviews with nearly every major player past and present, as well as a few energetic live clips, Modulations delves into one of electronica''s forgotten facets: the human element. Lee travels the globe from the American Midwest to Europe to Japan to try to express the appeal of music often dismissed as soulless. Modulations shows that behind even the most foreign or alien electronic composition lies a real human being, and Lee lets many of these Frankenstein-like creators express and expound upon their personal philosophies and tech-heavy theories. Lee understands that a cultural movement as massive and diverse as dance music can''t be contained.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qsMSdQdJFnuJG06gPWxfpgQwlq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59138'),
  ('1112373722365113192', 'Moebius', 1996, 'Science Fiction', 'Abel Peñalba, Gustavo Mosquera R., Natalia Urruty', 'Arturo Onatavia, Gabriel Lifschitz, Gustavo Mosquera R.', 'Guillermo Angelelli, Roberto Carnaghi, Annabella Levy, Jorge Petraglia, Miguel Ángel Paludi, Fernando Llosa, Martín Adjemián, Daniel Di Biase', null, 'Deep within Buenos Aires''s labyrinthine subway system, a train mysteriously disappears along with it''s 30 passengers. The subway officials are greatly troubled and call in topographer Daniel Pratt to help them find it. Unfortunately, the tunnels are so vast and complex, that Pratt needs his mentor Hugo Mistein to help him. Unfortunately, he too has vanished.', 'Deep within Buenos Aires''s labyrinthine subway system, a train mysteriously disappears along with it''s 30 passengers. The subway officials are greatly troubled and call in topographer Daniel Pratt to help them find it. Unfortunately, the tunnels are so vast and complex, that Pratt needs his mentor Hugo Mistein to help him. Unfortunately, he too has vanished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmZZNYULK60E0socp5mH9OOvpHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39335'),
  ('1118707588947140704', 'Moebius', 2013, 'Drama', 'Kim Ki-duk, Kim Ki-duk', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Cho Jae-hyun, Lee Na-ra, Seo Young-joo, Kim Jae-hong, Kim Min-seok, Kim Jae-rok, Ri Woo-jin, Jeong Soo-kyo', 'NR', 'A wife, overwhelmed with hatred for her husband, inflicts an unspeakable wound on their son, as the family heads towards horrific destruction.', 'A wife, overwhelmed with hatred for her husband, inflicts an unspeakable wound on their son, as the family heads towards horrific destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wREeBv5vVAHQkLiHF2PVQIPkBVo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215743'),
  ('644533426575892015', 'Moffie', 2020, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Jaci Cheiman, Danie van Rensburg, Oliver Hermanus', 'Oliver Hermanus, Jack Sidey', 'Kai Luke Brummer, Ryan de Villiers, Matthew Vey, Hilton Pelser, Wynand Ferreira, Jan Combrink, Stefan Vermaak, Hendrik Nieuwoudt', 'NR', 'A young man in 1981 South Africa must complete his brutal and racist two years of compulsory military service while desperately maintaining the secrecy of his homosexuality.', 'A young man in 1981 South Africa must complete his brutal and racist two years of compulsory military service while desperately maintaining the secrecy of his homosexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MmpFYN4DnQLK7J7cVe3tACnQcO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618228'),
  ('177984952859180865', 'Mogadischu', 2008, 'Thriller, History, TV Movie', 'Roland Suso Richter, Holly Fink', 'Maurice Philip Remy', 'Thomas Kretschmann, Nadja Uhl, Saïd Taghmaoui, Christian Berkel, Herbert Knaup, Judith Engel, Valerie Niehaus, Jürgen Tarrach', null, 'The incredible true story of Lufthansa Flight 181, which was hijacked by the Popular Front for the Liberation of Palestine in October of 1977, and the noble efforts of stewardess Gabriele Dillmann (Nadja Uhl) to ensure the safety of the terrified passengers throughout the harrowing ordeal. When terrorists sympathetic to the cause of the German Red Army Faction seize control of the flight, German chancellor Helmut Schmidt refuses to negotiate. Meanwhile, terrorist leader "Captain Martyr Mahmud" grows increasingly agitated, and the Yemeni government refuses to let the plane land on their soil. After Captain Schumann (Thomas Kretschmann) makes an emergency landing in the sand, he is brutally executed in front of the passengers by "Captain Martyr Mahmud" (Said Taghmaoui), who then forces the co-pilot to fly the plane to Somolia. Once there, counter terrorism measures quickly get underway as the passengers brace themselves for the worst.', 'The incredible true story of Lufthansa Flight 181, which was hijacked by the Popular Front for the Liberation of Palestine in October of 1977, and the noble efforts of stewardess Gabriele Dillmann (Nadja Uhl) to ensure the safety of the terrified passengers throughout the harrowing ordeal. When terrorists sympathetic to the cause of the German Red Army Faction seize control of the flight, German chancellor Helmut Schmidt refuses to negotiate. Meanwhile, terrorist leader "Captain Martyr Mahmud" grows increasingly agitated, and the Yemeni government refuses to let the plane land on their soil. After Captain Schumann (Thomas Kretschmann) makes an emergency landing in the sand, he is brutally executed in front of the passengers by "Captain Martyr Mahmud" (Said Taghmaoui), who then forces the co-pilot to fly the plane to Somolia. Once there, counter terrorism measures quickly get underway as the passengers brace themselves for the worst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MrHTQ6hI05BS6NsFi0m7CNoqzg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30775'),
  ('789846348987233682', 'Mogambo', 1953, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'John Ford, Robert Surtees, Freddie Young', 'John Lee Mahin', 'Clark Gable, Ava Gardner, Grace Kelly, Donald Sinden, Philip Stainton, Eric Pohlmann, Laurence Naismith, Denis O''Dea', 'NR', 'On a Kenyan safari, white hunter Victor Marswell has a love triangle with seductive American socialite Eloise Kelly and anthropologist Donald Nordley''s cheating wife Linda.', 'On a Kenyan safari, white hunter Victor Marswell has a love triangle with seductive American socialite Eloise Kelly and anthropologist Donald Nordley''s cheating wife Linda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKc2pZhmTz3xfItLAci44vCTrYx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25009'),
  ('1079756978593873605', 'Mogul Mowgli', 2020, 'Music, Drama', 'Jeroen Bogaert, Darren Baba, Bassam Tariq', 'Riz Ahmed, Bassam Tariq', 'Riz Ahmed, Aiysha Hart, Anjana Vasan, Nabhaan Rizwan, Alyy Khan, Sudha Bhuchar, Kiran Sonia Sawar, Hussain Manawer', null, 'Zed, a young British rapper, is about to start his first world tour, when a crippling illness strikes him down, forcing him to move back in with his family. He tries to find himself between an international music career and Pakistani family traditions.', 'Zed, a young British rapper, is about to start his first world tour, when a crippling illness strikes him down, forcing him to move back in with his family. He tries to find himself between an international music career and Pakistani family traditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n65YDWlWUoNFOYGdFIAs3TlyWo3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665764'),
  ('93251978279555448', 'Mohabbatein', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Manmohan Singh, Aditya Chopra, Taranjiet Sing Namdhari', 'Aditya Chopra', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Shah Rukh Khan, Uday Chopra, Jugal Hansraj, Jimmy Shergill, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Preeti Jhangiani, Shamita Shetty', 'PG', 'At a prestigious all-male university, three friends seek love outside of the school grounds; at the same time, a newly-hired music teacher seeks to befriend and loosen up the militantly strict headmaster.', 'At a prestigious all-male university, three friends seek love outside of the school grounds; at the same time, a newly-hired music teacher seeks to befriend and loosen up the militantly strict headmaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDsYaBazrYKg9bv8qgsEohZQMat.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11518'),
  ('493804622712294206', 'Mohamed Dubois', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Aleksander Kaufmann, Ernesto Oña', 'Éric Judor', 'Éric Judor, Sabrina Ouazani, Youssef Hajdi, Mhamed Arezki, Wahid Bouzidi, Marie Kremer, Farid Elouardi, Baya Belal', null, 'Arnaud Dubois may be the heir to a bank, but he prefers to call himself Mohamed. Having fallen out with his father, he turns his back on the family residence. On his travels, he meets Mustafa, who introduces him to his sister Sabrina. Having fallen in love with the attractive young woman, Arnaud decides to pass himself off as an ordinary street guy named...Mohamed.', 'Arnaud Dubois may be the heir to a bank, but he prefers to call himself Mohamed. Having fallen out with his father, he turns his back on the family residence. On his travels, he meets Mustafa, who introduces him to his sister Sabrina. Having fallen in love with the attractive young woman, Arnaud decides to pass himself off as an ordinary street guy named...Mohamed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpDSLHFapQ82bqquuZDuOByEF9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187672'),
  ('307512308785454567', 'Mohammed & Paul - Once Upon a Time in Tangier', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Nordin Lasfar', null, 'Latifa Alikkane, Carol Ardman, Paul Bowles', null, 'For filmmaker Nordin Lasfar, who grew up in the Netherlands as the child of Moroccan parents, author Paul Bowles opened the door to literature and stories from the land of his forebears. In the 1960s and 70s, Tangier was a base for Western artists and writers of the Beat Generation, among them Bowles.', 'For filmmaker Nordin Lasfar, who grew up in the Netherlands as the child of Moroccan parents, author Paul Bowles opened the door to literature and stories from the land of his forebears. In the 1960s and 70s, Tangier was a base for Western artists and writers of the Beat Generation, among them Bowles.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FuUMjLJ7F9yOzNVQA51Gl1bBk8h6.jpg', 'plex:movie:mohammed-and-paul-once-upon-a-time-in-tangier-2026'),
  ('145547454529120682', 'Mohawk', 1956, 'Action, Western', 'Kurt Neumann, Lee Lukather, Karl Struss', 'Maurice Geraghty, Milton Krims', 'Scott Brady, Rita Gam, Neville Brand, Lori Nelson, Allison Hayes, John Hoyt, Rhys Williams, Barbara Jo Allen', 'PG', 'An artist working in a remote army post is juggling the storekeeper''s daughter, his fiancée newly arrived from the east, and the Indian Chief''s daughter. But when a vengeful settler manages to get the army and the braves at each other''s throats his troubles really begin.', 'An artist working in a remote army post is juggling the storekeeper''s daughter, his fiancée newly arrived from the east, and the Indian Chief''s daughter. But when a vengeful settler manages to get the army and the braves at each other''s throats his troubles really begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/951iAlZG8NRNjLnRYkUDeDO8gbB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68097'),
  ('414643061835831186', 'Mohawk', 2018, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ted Geoghegan, Karim Hussain, Joshua Lou Friedman', 'Grady Hendrix, Ted Geoghegan', 'Kaniehtiio Horn, Ezra Buzzington, Eamon Farren, Justin Rain, Jon Huber, Robert Longstreet, Noah Segan, Ian Colletti', null, 'A young Mohawk woman and her two lovers battle a squad of American soldiers hell-bent on revenge.', 'A young Mohawk woman and her two lovers battle a squad of American soldiers hell-bent on revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGZE7BeHzTOarIbjSzlGbIc8sPr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366964'),
  ('967155147757721517', 'Mohenjo Daro', 2016, 'Adventure, Drama, History, Romance', 'Ashutosh Gowariker, C.K. Muraleedharan, Sisir Kumar Sahu', 'Ashutosh Gowariker', 'Hrithik Roshan, Pooja Hegde, Kabir Bedi, Arunoday Singh, Kishori Shahane, Casey Frank, Narendra Jha, Nitish Bharadwaj', null, 'During the Indus valley civilization, an Indigo farmer strives for the justice and protection of the city of Mohenjo-Daro and its civilians from an evil politician.', 'During the Indus valley civilization, an Indigo farmer strives for the justice and protection of the city of Mohenjo-Daro and its civilians from an evil politician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3k4ESzzPCQHwjPYJoI489Fk2jZc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402672'),
  ('151760687556842536', 'Mohra', 1994, 'Action, Thriller', 'Rajiv Rai, Viju Shah', 'Shabbir Boxwala', 'Akshay Kumar, Suniel Shetty, Raveena Tandon, Naseeruddin Shah, Raza Murad, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Priya Tendulkar, Paresh Rawal', null, 'Journalist Roma Singh is the daughter of a jailer. While taking a tour of the jail, she is molested by some of the inmates, and an inmate, Vishal Agnihotri comes to her assistance. She finds out that Vishal is in for four homicides, and decides to investigate further. She finds out, with the help of the owner of her publications, Jindal that Vishal was compelled to take the law in his own hands when the courts failed to punish the assailants of his sister and sweetheart. Soon, Vishal is released from prison, and begins to work for Jindal. It is then that he realizes that he has just walked from a walled prison, to an open prison, as the truth behind his release slowly but surely starts to dawn on him.', 'Journalist Roma Singh is the daughter of a jailer. While taking a tour of the jail, she is molested by some of the inmates, and an inmate, Vishal Agnihotri comes to her assistance. She finds out that Vishal is in for four homicides, and decides to investigate further. She finds out, with the help of the owner of her publications, Jindal that Vishal was compelled to take the law in his own hands when the courts failed to punish the assailants of his sister and sweetheart. Soon, Vishal is released from prison, and begins to work for Jindal. It is then that he realizes that he has just walked from a walled prison, to an open prison, as the truth behind his release slowly but surely starts to dawn on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWAptaCNiTIJtv9cYqfF5E7qm0I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109028'),
  ('1078213065672368047', 'Moi à ton âge', 2011, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Bruno Garcia', 'Laurent Mondy, Claude-Michel Rome', 'Michèle Laroque, Sophie de Fürst, Emmanuel Quatra, Olivier Claverie, Joséphine Jobert, Lou Chauvain', null, 'Caroline Gardel, a divorced woman, is the mother of Fanny Gardel, a 17 years old adolescent.Caroline is chief education adviser in the college where her daughter Fanny is studying.During their last holidays Caroline has met Hugo, and now Hugo has arrived at the college to investigate a case of drug dealing.Fanny is taking pictures of a handsome adolescent called Mathis.Fanny has arrived very late to the classes and the principal of the college is quite angry about it.At the end of the day Caroline and Fanny go back to their house by car.Caroline stops the car, there is a great lightning touching the car.After a moment of silence Caroline appears in the body of Fanny and Fanny appears in the body of Caroline.', 'Caroline Gardel, a divorced woman, is the mother of Fanny Gardel, a 17 years old adolescent.Caroline is chief education adviser in the college where her daughter Fanny is studying.During their last holidays Caroline has met Hugo, and now Hugo has arrived at the college to investigate a case of drug dealing.Fanny is taking pictures of a handsome adolescent called Mathis.Fanny has arrived very late to the classes and the principal of the college is quite angry about it.At the end of the day Caroline and Fanny go back to their house by car.Caroline stops the car, there is a great lightning touching the car.After a moment of silence Caroline appears in the body of Fanny and Fanny appears in the body of Caroline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avcPEl3LEMbE6eGcDFwJSKcGVB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226177'),
  ('886336813671525828', 'Moi y''en a vouloir des sous', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Jean Yanne, Jean Boffety', 'Gérard Sire, Jean Yanne', 'Jean Yanne, Bernard Blier, Nicole Calfan, Fernand Ledoux, Daniel Prévost, Ginette Garcin, Paul Préboist, Jacques François', null, 'Dismissed following an unfortunate initiative, financial advisor Benoît Lepape decides to work for his uncle, a union activist. His capitalist methods will surprise at first, but quickly bring in a lot of money.', 'Dismissed following an unfortunate initiative, financial advisor Benoît Lepape decides to work for his uncle, a union activist. His capitalist methods will surprise at first, but quickly bring in a lot of money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGDtsUqlk1gLWEZBwHgV0ZzB5G1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104499'),
  ('672403945507553474', 'Moi, Michel G., milliardaire, maître du monde', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Stéphane Kazandjian', 'Stéphane Kazandjian', 'Laurent Lafitte, Laurence Arné, Guy Bedos, Patrick Bouchitey, Alain Doutey, Xavier de Guillebon, François-Xavier Demaison, Christophe Lambert', null, 'As a successful businessman, an uninhibited symbol of modern capitalism, Michel Gani has everything: money, power, love. And he wants it known. As he prepares to make the "coup"of his career, he agrees to let cameras follow him by Joseph Klein, a sassy and committed journalist. This is supposed to become an ode to the genius of a great man. An astonishing and exhilarating journey into the corridors of business and life of the rich and powerful ensues.', 'As a successful businessman, an uninhibited symbol of modern capitalism, Michel Gani has everything: money, power, love. And he wants it known. As he prepares to make the "coup"of his career, he agrees to let cameras follow him by Joseph Klein, a sassy and committed journalist. This is supposed to become an ode to the genius of a great man. An astonishing and exhilarating journey into the corridors of business and life of the rich and powerful ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkoTGFiqrNjnypWbe4DwbtoqVoR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73552'),
  ('423291340226452356', 'Mojave', 2016, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'William Monahan, Don Davis', 'William Monahan', 'Garrett Hedlund, Oscar Isaac, Louise Bourgoin, Walton Goggins, Mark Wahlberg, Dania Ramirez, Fran Kranz, Matt Jones', 'R', 'A suicidal artist goes into the desert, where he finds his doppelgänger, a homicidal drifter.', 'A suicidal artist goes into the desert, where he finds his doppelgänger, a homicidal drifter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZLpBNG84wAI5c9XCQBa7w78ElX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237584'),
  ('254057047278709668', 'Mojave Moon', 1996, 'Thriller, Comedy, Romance', 'Kevin Dowling, James Glennon', 'Leonard Glasser', 'Danny Aiello, Anne Archer, Angelina Jolie, Michael Biehn, Alfred Molina, Peter MacNicol, Jack Noseworthy, Zack Norman', null, 'Al McCord is hanging out at his favourite restaurant when he meets an attractive young woman (Ellie) who is looking for a ride from the city out into the Mojave Desert, where her mother lives. Little does he know that while Ellie is falling in love with him, he is falling for her mother (Julie), despite the nearby presence of Julie''s boyfriend who seems likely to go berzerk at any moment. Even more strange, hilarious events follow and it''s up to Al to find some explanation. His life may never again be the same.', 'Al McCord is hanging out at his favourite restaurant when he meets an attractive young woman (Ellie) who is looking for a ride from the city out into the Mojave Desert, where her mother lives. Little does he know that while Ellie is falling in love with him, he is falling for her mother (Julie), despite the nearby presence of Julie''s boyfriend who seems likely to go berzerk at any moment. Even more strange, hilarious events follow and it''s up to Al to find some explanation. His life may never again be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUGMYmA11ZFnPqOJ4GdnZa2q6FU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24275'),
  ('1137339012658334875', 'Mojin: Mysterious Treasure', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Luo Le', 'Lin Jianfeng', 'Ken Chang Tzu-Yao, Hu Xue''er, Li Dianzun, He Qiwei, Zhou Xiaochuan, Li Xianshi, Li Honglei, Cao Xu', null, 'The movie takes partridge and Chen Yulous exploration of Pingshan as the background of western Hunan half a century later. It tells the story of Hu Bayi in order to save the poisonous big golden tooth after returning from the Longling Cave, leading the Golden Triangle into the iron triangle. In Pingshan, Xiangxi, the story of searching for the long-lost six-winged centipede in the legend of the rivers and lakes, and obtaining the life-saving inner alchemy.', 'The movie takes partridge and Chen Yulous exploration of Pingshan as the background of western Hunan half a century later. It tells the story of Hu Bayi in order to save the poisonous big golden tooth after returning from the Longling Cave, leading the Golden Triangle into the iron triangle. In Pingshan, Xiangxi, the story of searching for the long-lost six-winged centipede in the legend of the rivers and lakes, and obtaining the life-saving inner alchemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lo2A7A9khCzF6Vk2nh6eAQltv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:748359'),
  ('142477816993028833', 'Mojin: Return to the South China Sea', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Xiang Hesheng, Xiang Qiuliang', null, 'Wang Ziyi, Han Yezhou, Nita Hsia Jo-Yen, Ken Lok Tat-Wah', null, 'After washing his hands, Hu Bayi helped his friend Uncle Ming go to the South China Sea to salvage the pearls. Unexpectedly, he encountered a shipwreck and fell to the bottom of the sea, but accidentally found a thousand-year-old ruins of an ancient country that sank at the bottom of the sea. They went through many hardships and dangers at the bottom of the sea, and finally united to defeat the deep-sea beasts, and cleverly used the equipment in the ruins to escape.', 'After washing his hands, Hu Bayi helped his friend Uncle Ming go to the South China Sea to salvage the pearls. Unexpectedly, he encountered a shipwreck and fell to the bottom of the sea, but accidentally found a thousand-year-old ruins of an ancient country that sank at the bottom of the sea. They went through many hardships and dangers at the bottom of the sea, and finally united to defeat the deep-sea beasts, and cleverly used the equipment in the ruins to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEbqAz11yoX8f5zx09xEyfyjIdi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1067513'),
