  ('544403667847247401', 'Moka', 2016, 'Drama', 'Frédéric Mermoud, Irina Lubtchansky', 'Frédéric Mermoud, Antonin Martin-Hilbert', 'Emmanuelle Devos, Nathalie Baye, Diane Rouxel, Olivier Chantreau, David Clavel, Samuel Labarthe, Marion Reymond, Paulin Jaccoud', null, 'Diane Kramer is led by one obsession: to find the driver of the mocha color Mercedes which hit her son and devastated her life. With a few belongings, some money and a gun, she goes to Evian, where she''s learned the driver lives.', 'Diane Kramer is led by one obsession: to find the driver of the mocha color Mercedes which hit her son and devastated her life. With a few belongings, some money and a gun, she goes to Evian, where she''s learned the driver lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Ru4aUDCSexnLzz73s1PL40qZui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408024'),
