  ('73348111383605901', 'Mom + Mom', 2018, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Karole Di Tommaso, Sara Purgatorio', 'Karole Di Tommaso, Chiara Atalanta Ridolfi', 'Linda Caridi, Maria Roveran, Andrea Tagliaferri, Silvia Gallerano, Stefano Sabelli, Anna Bellato, Alessandra Mola, Fabio Giacobbe Doria', null, 'Karole and Ali love each other and dream of starting a family together. They soon realize it won''t be as simple as they''d hoped, and as their enthusiasm falters their love is challenged. In order to overcome the obstacles, they must believe in the power of their desire and support of their loved ones. If they can do that, miracles will happen…', 'Karole and Ali love each other and dream of starting a family together. They soon realize it won''t be as simple as they''d hoped, and as their enthusiasm falters their love is challenged. In order to overcome the obstacles, they must believe in the power of their desire and support of their loved ones. If they can do that, miracles will happen…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kW0VRO7qyqcWq0WfVMRc5jman0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582148'),
