  ('553393283449561397', 'Moments We Shared', 2024, 'Drama, Romance, Family', 'Zhang Jiajia, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Zhang Jiajia', 'Peng Yuchang, Zhou Ye, Ai Liya, Chen Xianen, Kong Lianshun, Zhang Yifan, Tian Yitong, Lin Jiachuan', null, 'Ordinary young man Liu Shisan, who has lost himself in the city, is brought back to his hometown, a small town by the clouds, by his grandmother. Accompanied by his childhood friend Cheng Shuang and his grandmother, Liu XIII spends a peaceful time. He follows the traces left by his ancestors, listens carefully to the breath of the town, and gradually comes out of his past confusion at the kiosk where he can reach out and touch the clouds, between the mountains and the sea, and under the osmanthus tree in the courtyard. Some people are engraved in their bones and forgotten within a few years. There are some people who will stay by your side no matter if they live or die.', 'Ordinary young man Liu Shisan, who has lost himself in the city, is brought back to his hometown, a small town by the clouds, by his grandmother. Accompanied by his childhood friend Cheng Shuang and his grandmother, Liu XIII spends a peaceful time. He follows the traces left by his ancestors, listens carefully to the breath of the town, and gradually comes out of his past confusion at the kiosk where he can reach out and touch the clouds, between the mountains and the sea, and under the osmanthus tree in the courtyard. Some people are engraved in their bones and forgotten within a few years. There are some people who will stay by your side no matter if they live or die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGghUkAjhtmHdYyjSQi9DgRPg43.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241905'),
  ('231931938923624990', 'Momentum', 2015, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Stephen S. Campanelli', 'Adam Marcus, Debra Sullivan', 'Olga Kurylenko, Morgan Freeman, James Purefoy, Jenna Saras, Lee-Anne Summers, Marian Frizelle, Dylan Edy, Sabine Palfi', 'NR', 'When Alex, an infiltration expert with a secret past, accidentally reveals her identity during what should have been a routine heist, she quickly finds herself mixed up in a government conspiracy and entangled in a deadly game of cat-and-mouse with a master assassin and his team of killers. Armed with her own set of lethal skills, Alex looks to exact revenge for her murdered friends while uncovering the truth.', 'When Alex, an infiltration expert with a secret past, accidentally reveals her identity during what should have been a routine heist, she quickly finds herself mixed up in a government conspiracy and entangled in a deadly game of cat-and-mouse with a master assassin and his team of killers. Armed with her own set of lethal skills, Alex looks to exact revenge for her murdered friends while uncovering the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49bPrxvgwUqEtvOfvTe3x92hEFV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346808'),
  ('964500215542774467', 'Momma Don''t Allow', 1956, 'Documentary, Music', 'Karel Reisz, Tony Richardson, Walter Lassally', 'Karel Reisz, Tony Richardson', 'Lonnie Donegan, Ottilie Patterson, Chris Barber, Pat Halcox, Monty Sunshine, Ron Bowden, Jim Bray', null, 'A Free Cinema short documenting a night at the Wood Green Jazz Club, observing youth culture, music, and social dynamics through an unobtrusive, non-narrated style.', 'A Free Cinema short documenting a night at the Wood Green Jazz Club, observing youth culture, music, and social dynamics through an unobtrusive, non-narrated style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NwNSD67oci3TJGl1N7LckD1eMe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117470'),
  ('830520832805676779', 'Mommie Dearest', 1981, 'Drama', 'Frank Perry, Paul Lohmann', 'Frank Yablans, Frank Perry, Tracy Hotchner', 'Faye Dunaway, Diana Scarwid, Steve Forrest, Howard Da Silva, Mara Hobel, Rutanya Alda, Harry Goz, Michael Edwards', 'PG', 'Renowned film star Joan Crawford''s abuse towards Christina, her adopted daughter, intensifies as her professional and romantic relationships turn sour.', 'Renowned film star Joan Crawford''s abuse towards Christina, her adopted daughter, intensifies as her professional and romantic relationships turn sour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Amv5uQfadEonn7SmYLfNnoeOSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15660'),
  ('1023490028408875344', 'Mommo: Kız Kardeşim', 2009, 'Drama, Family', 'Ali Özel, Nursel Doğan, Atalay Taşdiken', 'Atalay Taşdiken', 'Elif Bülbül, Mehmet Bülbül, Mete Dönmezer, Mustafa Uzunyılmaz, Mehmet Usta, Özcan Uçar, Kerem Petek, Ali Bakir', null, 'A brother and sister are split up after their mother dies, their father remarries, and their new stepmother rejects them.', 'A brother and sister are split up after their mother dies, their father remarries, and their new stepmother rejects them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaODc23oPdXpOPAWeqkWPrYcW9T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85409'),
  ('575773728529148076', 'Mommy', 1999, 'Drama', 'Denis Evstigneev, Grigoriy Rudakov, Pavel Lebeshev', 'Arif Aliev', 'Nonna Mordyukova, Oleg Menshikov, Vladimir Mashkov, Evgeny Mironov, Aleksei Kravchenko, Andrei Panin, Maksim Sukhanov, Nikolay Chindyaykin', null, 'After Polina, a mother of six, loses her husband, who went to jail for stealing charcoal and was killed when he tried to escape, she stays behind without any support. To be able to survive, Polina and her family start a folk group. But soon she understands that her children deserve a better fate, and she takes the desperate decision to steal a plane and go abroad... Fifteen years later, Polina is released from prison and finds out that fate has scattered her children all over the country: one is in the army, another is a miner in the Donbass, and the oldest, Lyonchik, who used to be in a mental institution, now pretends to be insane. Polina gathers all of her sons to free their older brother from the psychiatric hospital...', 'After Polina, a mother of six, loses her husband, who went to jail for stealing charcoal and was killed when he tried to escape, she stays behind without any support. To be able to survive, Polina and her family start a folk group. But soon she understands that her children deserve a better fate, and she takes the desperate decision to steal a plane and go abroad... Fifteen years later, Polina is released from prison and finds out that fate has scattered her children all over the country: one is in the army, another is a miner in the Donbass, and the oldest, Lyonchik, who used to be in a mental institution, now pretends to be insane. Polina gathers all of her sons to free their older brother from the psychiatric hospital...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnCNeBNmqwnwAr2znaU2CP4myk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87751'),
  ('622762067662239382', 'Mommy Dead and Dearest', 2017, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Erin Lee Carr, Bryan Sarkinen', null, 'Gypsy-Rose Blanchard, Dee Dee Blanchard, Rod Blanchard, Kristy Blanchard, Jim Arnott, David Blanchard, Michelle Dean, Marc Feldman', null, 'Child abuse, mental illness, and forbidden love converge in this mystery involving a mother and daughter who were thought to be living a fairy tale life that turned out to be a living nightmare.', 'Child abuse, mental illness, and forbidden love converge in this mystery involving a mother and daughter who were thought to be living a fairy tale life that turned out to be a living nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l77SGOaXhLfkBPdl3UqsVMg0w1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438446'),
  ('296840394936123617', 'Mommy Is at the Hairdresser''s', 2008, 'Drama', 'Léa Pool, Daniel Jobin', 'Isabelle Hébert', 'Céline Bonnier, Laurent Lucas, Marianne Fortier, Élie Dupuis, Aliocha Schneider, Maxime Allard, Maxime Desjardins-Tremblay, Gabriel Arcand', null, 'in the summer of 1966, in Beloeil, Québec, where a young girl named Élise is enjoying summer vacation. Summer 1966. It''s time to enjoy the summer holiday, total freedom. Suddenly her mother leaves her family to pursue her journalism career in London. Her urge to leave is triggered when she coincidentally listens in on a conversation between her husband and his male lover. Her brother Coco seeks solace in the garage, building a super racing car. Her youngest brother Benoît throws himself into his own inner world. The father seems absolutely knocked out by the situation. Élise decides to take control of her family, in an eloquent attempt to save them. With the assistance of flourishing nature around her, she stands on the threshold of an incomparable summer.', 'in the summer of 1966, in Beloeil, Québec, where a young girl named Élise is enjoying summer vacation. Summer 1966. It''s time to enjoy the summer holiday, total freedom. Suddenly her mother leaves her family to pursue her journalism career in London. Her urge to leave is triggered when she coincidentally listens in on a conversation between her husband and his male lover. Her brother Coco seeks solace in the garage, building a super racing car. Her youngest brother Benoît throws himself into his own inner world. The father seems absolutely knocked out by the situation. Élise decides to take control of her family, in an eloquent attempt to save them. With the assistance of flourishing nature around her, she stands on the threshold of an incomparable summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkT8iRlTJY11Wap8hFLtKuJEraI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58841'),
  ('913010182804527076', 'Mommy Mommy Where''s My Brain?', 1986, null, 'Jon Moritsugu', 'Jon Moritsugu', 'Robert Erskine, Afshin Gharib, Fernanda Moore, Lawrence James', null, 'Part AC/DC, part Jacques Derrida. An experimental film made as a response to the critical theory aspects of the filmmakers degree and academic film criticism.', 'Part AC/DC, part Jacques Derrida. An experimental film made as a response to the critical theory aspects of the filmmakers degree and academic film criticism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1DWVsKuPj69KMDXSQZvVuW6sWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178152'),
  ('969265084798868057', 'Mommy Would Never Hurt You', 2019, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Bryan Koss, Daniel Lusko, Cameron H. Price', 'Anna Rasmussen', 'Libby Munro, Kristen Vaganos, Micavrie Amaia, Zack Gold, Megatran Roy, Christian Omari', null, 'Riley wants to rebuild her relationship with her mother and little sister, who are shut-ins due to her sister''s illness. When Riley realizes her sister may not be sick, her mother will stop at nothing to keep her daughters with her forever.', 'Riley wants to rebuild her relationship with her mother and little sister, who are shut-ins due to her sister''s illness. When Riley realizes her sister may not be sick, her mother will stop at nothing to keep her daughters with her forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27cG7edsJRdi7STQSC5HsunxuvY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591889'),
  ('67157973059858003', 'Mommy, I''m Scared', 2006, 'Drama', 'Reha Erdem', 'Reha Erdem', 'Ali Düşenkalkar, Işıl Yücesoy, Köksal Engür, Şenay Gürler, Arzu Bazman, Turgay Aydın, Aydoğan Oflu, Bülent Emin Yarar', null, 'Reha Erdem’s innovative group portrait of the inhabitants of an apartment building in Istanbul serves as a comic exploration of what it means to be human. The drama revolves around hapless taxi driver Ali, who suffers from amnesia as a result of an accident the cause of which he does not remember. As he struggles to regain his memory, his neighbors—embodying a variety of physical, mental, and emotional states—wrestle with their own difficulties, helping one another along the way.', 'Reha Erdem’s innovative group portrait of the inhabitants of an apartment building in Istanbul serves as a comic exploration of what it means to be human. The drama revolves around hapless taxi driver Ali, who suffers from amnesia as a result of an accident the cause of which he does not remember. As he struggles to regain his memory, his neighbors—embodying a variety of physical, mental, and emotional states—wrestle with their own difficulties, helping one another along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLU70fX6Fwx0DDnNnReZrQ320ZC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37419'),
  ('238551284912249406', 'Momo', 1986, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family, Mystery', 'Johannes Schaaf, Xaver Schwarzenberger', 'Marcello Coscia, Rosemarie Fendel, Johannes Schaaf', 'Radost Bokel, Mario Adorf, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Leopoldo Trieste, Ninetto Davoli, Bruno Stori, Elide Melli, Francesco De Rosa', null, 'Momo is a young orphan girl who lives in the ruins of an old Roman amphitheater and becomes friends with everybody in the neighborhood. But when a powerful international corporation starts stealing everybody’s time, nobody has any time left for her, let alone their friends or families. Momo, together with Master Hora, the custodian of time, are the only ones who can go up against the time thieves before all is lost forever.', 'Momo is a young orphan girl who lives in the ruins of an old Roman amphitheater and becomes friends with everybody in the neighborhood. But when a powerful international corporation starts stealing everybody’s time, nobody has any time left for her, let alone their friends or families. Momo, together with Master Hora, the custodian of time, are the only ones who can go up against the time thieves before all is lost forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wth0MTgrfuekyrXxM0d6DjoTV7X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2265'),
