  ('114573784080169646', 'Mon Heroine', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Nathalie Durand, Marie Levent, Jean-Philippe Avenel', 'Noémie Lefort, Noémie Lefort, Fadette Drouard', 'Chloé Jouannet, Pascale Arbillot, Louise Coldefy, Brigitte Fossey, Firmine Richard, Stacey Marie Keba, Katie McGovern, Avant Strangel', null, 'A young girl from Rouen dreams about directing movies with Julia Roberts. Overprotected by her mother, she hopes to join a prestigeous cinema school in New York City, but nothing happens as expected, and her dreams are cruelly broken. Denying her fate, she leaves France to New York City, with her nutty-aunt''s help, dreaming to give her screenplay to Julia Roberts herself.', 'A young girl from Rouen dreams about directing movies with Julia Roberts. Overprotected by her mother, she hopes to join a prestigeous cinema school in New York City, but nothing happens as expected, and her dreams are cruelly broken. Denying her fate, she leaves France to New York City, with her nutty-aunt''s help, dreaming to give her screenplay to Julia Roberts herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5IsStJDj8YAjVFl9nsGFBMCNnO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:883870'),
  ('857379063444024581', 'Mon Laferte, I Love You', 2024, 'Documentary, Music', 'Rocío Castro, Sebastián Lara Skiba, Camila Grandi', 'Joanna Reposi', 'Mon Laferte', null, 'Artist and singer Mon Laferte recounts intimate moments of her life as she navigates a world tour, motherhood, and her deepest wounds.', 'Artist and singer Mon Laferte recounts intimate moments of her life as she navigates a world tour, motherhood, and her deepest wounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sildryP1raUQgULCVVZ2hRuZWZu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1310735'),
  ('263465257070461672', 'Mon maître d''école', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Emilie Thérond', null, null, null, 'A St Saint-just-et-Vacquières, Jean-Michel Burel, schoolmaster of a class at several levels, begins his last school year before retirement. The teacher teaches tolerance and wisdom in the same way as spelling and mathematics. It conducts its programme with determination. It endeavours to support students to give them confidence and raise them above. Through the eyes of a former student, now Director, emerges a timeless school where rigour is combined with good humour, a school where freedom begins with respect for others. A school that belongs to the universal field of childhood.', 'A St Saint-just-et-Vacquières, Jean-Michel Burel, schoolmaster of a class at several levels, begins his last school year before retirement. The teacher teaches tolerance and wisdom in the same way as spelling and mathematics. It conducts its programme with determination. It endeavours to support students to give them confidence and raise them above. Through the eyes of a former student, now Director, emerges a timeless school where rigour is combined with good humour, a school where freedom begins with respect for others. A school that belongs to the universal field of childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsmaIk9XmxOumIeTMbuifq5AxUq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369464'),
  ('14793950164781239', 'Mon Mon Mon Monsters', 2017, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Giddens Ko, Chou Yi-hsien, Jimmy Hung Tin-Cheung', 'Giddens Ko', 'Deng Yukai, Kent Tsai, James Lai Jun-Cheng, Tao Bo-Meng, Eugenie Liu, Lin Pei-Hsin, Carolyn Chen, Hsu Chen-Te', null, 'Shu-wei is an unpopular student who is a constant target for the school bullies, but he ends up joining forces with them when they encounter two demonic sisters who feast on human flesh in the middle of the night. The gang manage to capture one, but the other demon is angry and starts killing anyone wearing a school uniform.', 'Shu-wei is an unpopular student who is a constant target for the school bullies, but he ends up joining forces with them when they encounter two demonic sisters who feast on human flesh in the middle of the night. The gang manage to capture one, but the other demon is angry and starts killing anyone wearing a school uniform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HT4oVpOlBhTEsz3jfdkyzJ8YPA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454784'),
  ('541152827202444846', 'Mon Mon the Water Spider', 2006, 'Animation', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Atsushi Okui', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Akiko Yano', null, 'The short film''s main character is a diving bell spider who seems to have fallen in love with a water strider. Although she is scared of him at first, the water strider soon gets used to the presence of the spider.', 'The short film''s main character is a diving bell spider who seems to have fallen in love with a water strider. Although she is scared of him at first, the water strider soon gets used to the presence of the spider.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVliWPZgWL7ScQ0KnThgSNcVI21.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222664'),
  ('165365160116350607', 'Mon Oncle', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Tati, Jean Bourgoin, Pierre Étaix', 'Jacques Tati', 'Jacques Tati, Jean-Pierre Zola, Adrienne Servantie, Lucien Frégis, Betty Schneider, Jean-François Martial, Dominique Marie, Yvonne Arnaud', 'NR', 'Genial, bumbling Monsieur Hulot loves his top-floor apartment in a grimy corner of the city, and cannot fathom why his sister''s family has moved to the suburbs. Their house is an ultra-modern nightmare, which Hulot only visits for the sake of stealing away his rambunctious young nephew. Hulot''s sister, however, wants to win him over to her new way of life, and conspires to set him up with a wife and job.', 'Genial, bumbling Monsieur Hulot loves his top-floor apartment in a grimy corner of the city, and cannot fathom why his sister''s family has moved to the suburbs. Their house is an ultra-modern nightmare, which Hulot only visits for the sake of stealing away his rambunctious young nephew. Hulot''s sister, however, wants to win him over to her new way of life, and conspires to set him up with a wife and job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wH6RyPiXFy8INLbViVkchLVOmBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427'),
