  ('554999917248415365', 'Mon Poussin', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Paul Agostini, Frédéric Forestier', 'Frédéric Forestier, Romain Protat', 'Isabelle Nanty, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Thomas Solivérès, Manon Valentin, Leslie Medina, Gaël Cottat, Deivy Fernandes, Tom Leeb', null, 'Vincent, 18 years old, is dumped by Elina. It is his first love, it is the end of the world! His parents decide to take matters into their own hands and will try everything to make him forget this girl: he will have to follow them in a loving detoxification of which they will imagine the program ...', 'Vincent, 18 years old, is dumped by Elina. It is his first love, it is the end of the world! His parents decide to take matters into their own hands and will try everything to make him forget this girl: he will have to follow them in a loving detoxification of which they will imagine the program ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbTV5x1u17ZtfzZ6zeY06U8Z02.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398926'),
  ('1048229468969766390', 'Mon voisin du dessus', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Laurence Katrian', null, 'Michèle Laroque, Richard Berry, Pascale Arbillot, Jean-Yves Berteloot, Hande Kodja, Serge Kribus, Stéphane De Groodt, Lætitia Reva', null, 'Claire Letellier works as head of a pharmaceutical company. After dating André for a number of years, she has at long last accepted his marriage proposal. She decides this is a good time to reclaim the maid''s room she owns above her place and turn her apartment into a duplex. But her tenant, a slightly offbeat designer named Alain Gareda, categorically refuses to vacate the premises. The latent hostility between them gains momentum by the day, until Alain suggests a compromise.', 'Claire Letellier works as head of a pharmaceutical company. After dating André for a number of years, she has at long last accepted his marriage proposal. She decides this is a good time to reclaim the maid''s room she owns above her place and turn her apartment into a duplex. But her tenant, a slightly offbeat designer named Alain Gareda, categorically refuses to vacate the premises. The latent hostility between them gains momentum by the day, until Alain suggests a compromise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNxXawFmlLraePdt6qAWrwzJYll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344008'),
  ('421140499968258316', 'Mona Lisa', 1973, null, 'Toshio Matsumoto', null, null, null, 'An experimental short film from Toshio Matsumoto featuring Mona Lisa.', 'An experimental short film from Toshio Matsumoto featuring Mona Lisa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJUIkhf1MwxSzAHzg8eie4G486w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288026'),
  ('150756736492802446', 'Mona Lisa', 1986, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Neil Jordan, Roger Pratt', 'David Leland, Neil Jordan', 'Bob Hoskins, Cathy Tyson, Michael Caine, Robbie Coltrane, Clarke Peters, Kate Hardie, Zoë Nathenson, Sammi Davis', 'R', 'George is a small-time crook just out of prison who discovers his tough-guy image is out of date. Reduced to working as a minder/driver for high class call girl Simone, he has to agree when she asks him to find a young colleague from her King''s Cross days. That''s when George''s troubles just start.', 'George is a small-time crook just out of prison who discovers his tough-guy image is out of date. Reduced to working as a minder/driver for high class call girl Simone, he has to agree when she asks him to find a young colleague from her King''s Cross days. That''s when George''s troubles just start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geBGfbhkgKHld8rM9XuLfzPGZ6I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10002'),
  ('649687151715660290', 'Mona Lisa and the Blood Moon', 2022, 'Mystery, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Pawel Pogorzelski, Ana Lily Amirpour', 'Ana Lily Amirpour', 'Jeon Jong-seo, Kate Hudson, Ed Skrein, Evan Whitten, Craig Robinson, Lauren Bowles, Serene Lee, Cory Roberts', 'R', 'A young woman with psychokinetic powers breaks out of a Louisiana asylum and makes her way to New Orleans, where she falls into the city’s netherworld of misfits and miscreants.', 'A young woman with psychokinetic powers breaks out of a Louisiana asylum and makes her way to New Orleans, where she falls into the city’s netherworld of misfits and miscreants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTYdMdMeMxkPxzLtbkP44HThIAW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522526'),
