  ('919606262932552948', 'Money as Debt', 2006, 'Documentary, Animation', null, 'Paul Grignon', 'Bob Bossin', null, 'Paul Grignon''s 47-minute animated presentation of "Money as Debt" tells in very simple and effective graphic terms what money is and how it is being created', 'Paul Grignon''s 47-minute animated presentation of "Money as Debt" tells in very simple and effective graphic terms what money is and how it is being created', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OBDzEXFlVuuT8gIt2tY3UsR40I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21974'),
  ('749865141658709075', 'Money Crazy', 1977, 'Comedy', 'John Woo, Tsin Yu', 'John Woo', 'Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Ricky Hui Koon-Ying, Angie Chiu Nga-Chi, Lee Hoi-Sang, Cheung Ying, Cheng Suk-Ying, Yue Ming, Addy Sung Gam-Loi', null, 'Ducky is hired by Rich Chen to transport the "diamonds" he stole from Uncle Pai Mary. Uncles Tough Guy and Mary would like to get the diamond from Ducky, so they volunteer to relieve Ducky of his responsibility.', 'Ducky is hired by Rich Chen to transport the "diamonds" he stole from Uncle Pai Mary. Uncles Tough Guy and Mary would like to get the diamond from Ducky, so they volunteer to relieve Ducky of his responsibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqShn0s2PNQYFPdc4ZTV1Rybc9S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38100'),
  ('270141717160265965', 'Money Electric: The Bitcoin Mystery', 2024, 'Documentary, Mystery', 'Cullen Hoback', 'Cullen Hoback', 'Cullen Hoback, Roger Ver, Peter Todd, Adam Back, Ricardo Salinas Pliego', 'R', 'A deep dive into one of the most enduring and high-stakes mysteries in technology and finance: the origins of Bitcoin and the identity of its anonymous creator, Satoshi Nakamoto.', 'A deep dive into one of the most enduring and high-stakes mysteries in technology and finance: the origins of Bitcoin and the identity of its anonymous creator, Satoshi Nakamoto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAC1FOLjDXaWEgNBJXtWYGq9SRE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1365712'),
  ('1088742815198716895', 'Money for Nothing', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Babu Subramaniam, Jim McConkey, Cynthia A. Potthast', 'Carol Sobieski, Tom Musca, Ramón Menéndez', 'John Cusack, Debi Mazar, Michael Madsen, Benicio del Toro, Michael Rapaport, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Alice Drummond, Maury Chaykin', 'R', 'When unemployed dockworker Joey Coyle finds $1.2 million that fell off of an armored car, he decides to do the logical thing: take the money and run. After all, he says, finders keepers. He turns to his ex-girlfriend Monica, who works in an investment firm, for advice, before turning to the mob for help laundering the money. While Joey makes plans to leave the country, however, a detective is following his ever-warmer trail in order to recover the cash.', 'When unemployed dockworker Joey Coyle finds $1.2 million that fell off of an armored car, he decides to do the logical thing: take the money and run. After all, he says, finders keepers. He turns to his ex-girlfriend Monica, who works in an investment firm, for advice, before turning to the mob for help laundering the money. While Joey makes plans to leave the country, however, a detective is following his ever-warmer trail in order to recover the cash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkof6yO3w4aaLmpD9EHjw8Uk22w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55448'),
  ('819780197723988778', 'Money from Home', 1953, 'Comedy, Music', 'George Marshall, Daniel L. Fapp, Michael D. Moore', 'Hal Kanter', 'Dean Martin, Jerry Lewis, Marjie Millar, Pat Crowley, Richard Haydn, Robert Strauss, Gerald Mohr, Sheldon Leonard', null, 'Herman owes a lot of gambling debts. To pay them off, he promises the mob he''ll fix a horse, so that it does not run. He intends to trick his animal-loving cousin Virgil, an apprentice veterinarian, into helping him. Of course, he doesn''t tell Virgil what he is really up to. Mistaken identities are assumed, while along the way, Virgil meets a female vet and Herman falls for the owner of the horse.', 'Herman owes a lot of gambling debts. To pay them off, he promises the mob he''ll fix a horse, so that it does not run. He intends to trick his animal-loving cousin Virgil, an apprentice veterinarian, into helping him. Of course, he doesn''t tell Virgil what he is really up to. Mistaken identities are assumed, while along the way, Virgil meets a female vet and Herman falls for the owner of the horse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pokwiDJO8U2DjfNcDaQIA4QeRTG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53581'),
  ('1064334140554211043', 'Money Heist: The Phenomenon', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Luis Alfaro, Pablo Lejarreta', 'Pablo Lejarreta, Javier Gómez Santander', 'Úrsula Corberó, Álvaro Morte, Itziar Ituño, Pedro Alonso, Alba Flores, Miguel Herrán, Esther Acebo, Jaime Lorente', null, 'A documentary on why ''Money Heist'' sparked a wave of enthusiasm around the world for a lovable group of thieves and their professor.', 'A documentary on why ''Money Heist'' sparked a wave of enthusiasm around the world for a lovable group of thieves and their professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AboUXTrDWEi0PuZUqaft0iwBTm7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:689249'),
