  ('414183608870280662', 'Money Trap', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan, Kıvanç Tatlıtuğ, Ezgi Mola, Bensu Soral, Okan Çabalar, Rıza Kocaoğlu, Güven Kıraç, Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan', null, 'Asim Noyan swindles people with his lies and games. Asim Noyan and his gang, who no one else has been able to catch, get into a ruse again.', 'Asim Noyan swindles people with his lies and games. Asim Noyan and his gang, who no one else has been able to catch, get into a ruse again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHVRfj6x7Mr1d8Ew3lysD9SsIX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:577990'),
  ('845676468615171528', 'Money: A Tragicomic Saga', 1946, 'Comedy', 'Nils Poppe, Martin Bodin', 'Nils Poppe, Rolf Botvid', 'Nils Poppe, Sigge Fürst, Carl Reinholdz, Hilding Rolin, Birger Åsander, Gustaf Färingborg, Alexander von Baumgarten, Inga Landgré', null, 'Orvar is a vagabond, walking the country roads and living on sunshine and generosity. One day he decides to find work somewhere to get some money. He becomes a helping hand for seven lumberjack brothers. The big and strong brothers really enjoy themselves, joking with the small and meek Orvar. Orvar does not know that he has inherited a large fortune but the seven brothers do and they begin to treat him with the greatest courtesy. They convince him to write his last will, making them his heirs, and then begin to make plans on how to kill him.', 'Orvar is a vagabond, walking the country roads and living on sunshine and generosity. One day he decides to find work somewhere to get some money. He becomes a helping hand for seven lumberjack brothers. The big and strong brothers really enjoy themselves, joking with the small and meek Orvar. Orvar does not know that he has inherited a large fortune but the seven brothers do and they begin to treat him with the greatest courtesy. They convince him to write his last will, making them his heirs, and then begin to make plans on how to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yGLvtSY38uOyCtQzzcFsVdNJ7w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317057'),
  ('850405610326774508', 'Moneyball', 2011, 'Drama', 'Bennett Miller, Wally Pfister, Scott Robertson', 'Aaron Sorkin, Steven Zaillian', 'Brad Pitt, Jonah Hill, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Robin Wright, Chris Pratt, Stephen Bishop, Reed Diamond, Brent Jennings', 'PG-13', 'The story of Oakland Athletics general manager Billy Beane''s successful attempt to put together a baseball team on a budget, by employing computer-generated analysis to draft his players.', 'The story of Oakland Athletics general manager Billy Beane''s successful attempt to put together a baseball team on a budget, by employing computer-generated analysis to draft his players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yIQq1e6iOcaZ5rLDG3lZBP3j7a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60308'),
