  ('375085629592730717', 'Monga', 2010, 'Thriller', 'Doze Niu Cheng-Tse, Hao Fang-wei', null, 'Mark Chao You-Ting, Ethan Juan, Ma Ju-Lung, Ko Chia-Yen, Rhydian Vaughan, Doze Niu Cheng-Tse, Cheng Yu-chieh, Bamboo Chen', null, 'Set in the 1980s, “Monga” centers on five boys (Mosquito, Monk, Dragon, White Monkey and A-Lan) who join the "Gang of Princes" who are tired of being pushed around. As the "Gang of Princes" rise in stature, they come into conflict with other gangs jealous of their rising power.', 'Set in the 1980s, “Monga” centers on five boys (Mosquito, Monk, Dragon, White Monkey and A-Lan) who join the "Gang of Princes" who are tired of being pushed around. As the "Gang of Princes" rise in stature, they come into conflict with other gangs jealous of their rising power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZZfZHDQr4vj2Z5BdsGJIwbAWGF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40911'),
  ('594916655126722836', 'Mongol: The Rise of Genghis Khan', 2007, 'History, War, Action', 'Sergei Bodrov, Rogier Stoffers, Sergey Trofimov', 'Arif Aliev', 'Tadanobu Asano, Sun Honglei, Khulan Chuluun, Baasanjav Mijid, Amadu Mamadakov, He Qi, Ben Hon Sun, Ji Ri Mu Tu', 'R', 'The story recounts the early life of Genghis Khan, a slave who went on to conquer half the world in the 11th century.', 'The story recounts the early life of Genghis Khan, a slave who went on to conquer half the world in the 11th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hlyJVMKFJNJb8QRtdfjage2tGF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12246'),
  ('430135486326758776', 'Mongolian Death Worm', 2010, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Steven R. Monroe, Neil Lisk, Ken Blakey', 'Neil Elman, Kevin Leeson, Steven R. Monroe', 'Sean Patrick Flanery, Victoria Pratt, George Cheung, Drew Waters, Matthew Tompkins, Nate Rubin, Jon Mack, Tiger Sheu', null, 'When an American oil company sets up an experimental drilling plant out in the vast deserts of Mongolia, they awaken a nest. The deadly creatures begin to breed and spread, devouring everyone in their path. The only person who can stop them is treasure hunter and adventure seeker who spent his life searching for a legendary tomb, fabled to be protected by the Death Worms. He knows he must do what he can to kill the creatures, but stopping these monsters may mean destroying his life''s work forever!', 'When an American oil company sets up an experimental drilling plant out in the vast deserts of Mongolia, they awaken a nest. The deadly creatures begin to breed and spread, devouring everyone in their path. The only person who can stop them is treasure hunter and adventure seeker who spent his life searching for a legendary tomb, fabled to be protected by the Death Worms. He knows he must do what he can to kill the creatures, but stopping these monsters may mean destroying his life''s work forever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNMNmwfNsbEdBvJtE7UWfO5DsxV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44811'),
  ('352049775685661412', 'Mongolian Ping Pong', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Du Jie, Ning Hao', 'Ning Hao', 'Hurichabilike, Dawa, Geliban, Sharen Gaowa, Yidexinnaribu, Badema, Wurima, Dugema', null, 'Bilike has never seen a ping-pong ball before. He and his family live without electricity and running water in a solitary tent home among the vast steppe grasslands. The magnificent landscape here has changed little since the days of Genghis Kahn. But life in the middle of nowhere can be exciting for a young boy. The smallest of details become big events for curious Bilike and his best friends Erguotou and Dawa. The mystery of the small white ball floating in the creek leads to questions about the world around them, as well as innocent mischief.', 'Bilike has never seen a ping-pong ball before. He and his family live without electricity and running water in a solitary tent home among the vast steppe grasslands. The magnificent landscape here has changed little since the days of Genghis Kahn. But life in the middle of nowhere can be exciting for a young boy. The smallest of details become big events for curious Bilike and his best friends Erguotou and Dawa. The mystery of the small white ball floating in the creek leads to questions about the world around them, as well as innocent mischief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVzn3We2n1rNgYhQVKLWCqLnUNX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1488'),
  ('814038864496385272', 'Monica', 2023, 'Drama', 'Katelin Arizmendi, Roger Mendoza, Daniel Mulvaney', 'Andrea Pallaoro, Orlando Tirado', 'Trace Lysette, Patricia Clarkson, Emily Browning, Joshua Close, Adriana Barraza, Vladimir Perez, Ali Amine, Lucia Ramos', 'R', 'After years of estrangement, a trans woman returns home to help care for her dying mother.', 'After years of estrangement, a trans woman returns home to help care for her dying mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djaUOUGkHSHBMSBjDvvuiDoFBdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540549'),
  ('260829345018261314', 'Monica and Friends: Bonds', 2019, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Daniel Rezende, Fernando Fraiha, Renato Rondon', 'Thiago Dottori, Luiz Bolognesi', 'Giulia Benite, Kevin Vechiatto, Laura Rauseo, Gabriel Moreira, Rodrigo Santoro, Monica Iozzi, Luiz Pacini, Fafá Rennó', null, 'Fluffy, Jimmy Five''s pet dog, vanished. He develops an infallible plan to rescue the little dog, but, he will need help from his faithful friends: Monica, Maggy and Smudge. Together, they will face challengers and live incredible adventures to get Fluffy back home.', 'Fluffy, Jimmy Five''s pet dog, vanished. He develops an infallible plan to rescue the little dog, but, he will need help from his faithful friends: Monica, Maggy and Smudge. Together, they will face challengers and live incredible adventures to get Fluffy back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZ9BeuuvvurtCcZpUtwmxUtNK0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459670'),
  ('129125414610772321', 'Monica and Friends: Lessons', 2021, 'Family, Comedy, Drama, Adventure', 'Azul Serra, Renato Rondon, Daniel Rezende', 'Thiago Dottori, Mariana Zatz', 'Giulia Benite, Kevin Vechiatto, Laura Rauseo, Gabriel Moreira, Emilly Nayara, Laís Villela, Vinícius Higo, Lucas Infante', null, 'In the sequel to Turma da Mônica: Laços, we follow Mônica, Jimmy Five, Maggy and Smudge dealing with the consequences of a mistake made at school. At the same time, they face transformations from childhood to adolescence and are about to discover the value of friendship.', 'In the sequel to Turma da Mônica: Laços, we follow Mônica, Jimmy Five, Maggy and Smudge dealing with the consequences of a mistake made at school. At the same time, they face transformations from childhood to adolescence and are about to discover the value of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzaLnQ2CctXaHqatSlRbSVp8Bh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662745'),
