  ('58150626947939114', 'Monica, O My Darling', 2022, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Swapnil S. Sonawane, Vasan Bala', 'Yogesh Chandekar', 'Rajkummar Rao, Huma Qureshi, Radhika Apte, Sikandar Kher, Bagavathi Perumal, Akansha Ranjan Kapoor, Zayn Marie Khan, Sukant Goel', 'R', 'A slick robotics expert joins a murderous plot after a passionate affair takes a sudden turn, but nothing — not even death — is what it seems to be.', 'A slick robotics expert joins a murderous plot after a passionate affair takes a sudden turn, but nothing — not even death — is what it seems to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iX8wpLgkx83jCLNR03nW4lpaP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915831'),
  ('7374237502678067', 'Monica''s Gang in an Adventure in Time', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Mauricio de Sousa, Rodrigo Gava, Clewerson Saremba', 'Mauricio de Sousa, Dirceu Aparecido de Oliveira, Flávio de Souza', 'Marli Bortoletto, Angélica Santos, Paulo Cavalcante, Elza Gonçalves, Sibele Toledo, Mauricio de Sousa, Bianca Rinaldi', null, 'Our heroes need to take a trip in time, in a Time Machine, in order to recoup the essence of the four elements before the Earth gets frozen. The Gang will face the dangers of the Ancient History with Piteco, will help Papa-Capim to save the Forest, will fight with the Astronaut against the pirates and will even meet themselves as babies in the past!', 'Our heroes need to take a trip in time, in a Time Machine, in order to recoup the essence of the four elements before the Earth gets frozen. The Gang will face the dangers of the Ancient History with Piteco, will help Papa-Capim to save the Forest, will fight with the Astronaut against the pirates and will even meet themselves as babies in the past!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gtgUYAngSN6NlFX2ybJSDKCSVE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51137'),
  ('638096221171205629', 'Monika', 1974, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mario Imperoli, Giacomo Dell''Orso', 'Arpad De Riso, Giovanni Scolaro, Mario Imperoli', 'Gloria Guida, Colette Descombes, Andrés Resino, Gianluigi Chirizzi, Paolo Carlini, Lucia Catullo, Gianni Bortolotti, Piera Vidale', null, 'Monika is young, beautiful and a virgin. She is only 16 years old, and, beside getting the attention of all her classmates, she also attracts older men. She has a relationship with a boy, Leo, but she doesn''t know that he uses to pimp the girls he seduces to rich businessmen. One of Leo''s client befriends Monika and becomes so obsessed that he pays Leo to get her. But Monika turns her attention to her art professor, unknowing that he too has his secrets.', 'Monika is young, beautiful and a virgin. She is only 16 years old, and, beside getting the attention of all her classmates, she also attracts older men. She has a relationship with a boy, Leo, but she doesn''t know that he uses to pimp the girls he seduces to rich businessmen. One of Leo''s client befriends Monika and becomes so obsessed that he pays Leo to get her. But Monika turns her attention to her art professor, unknowing that he too has his secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8Byo8Mwd1a9JwISWLYR0zVxA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64641'),
  ('182805180163491386', 'Monique', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Valérie Guignabodet, Jean-Claude Larrieu', 'Valérie Guignabodet', 'Albert Dupontel, Marianne Denicourt, Philippe Uchan, Marina Tomé, Sophie Mounicot, Gilles Gaston-Dreyfus, Margot Abascal, Dominic Gould', null, 'Suffering from depression and marital problems, Alex mistakenly orders a life-size doll, whom he names "Monique". With the help of Monique, Alex turns his life around; however she soon becomes the envy of his friends and wife.', 'Suffering from depression and marital problems, Alex mistakenly orders a life-size doll, whom he names "Monique". With the help of Monique, Alex turns his life around; however she soon becomes the envy of his friends and wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXRFZ0iHvYxFVVJHdd4mlKEtNpd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35024'),
  ('498235604098283274', 'Monitor', 2015, 'Science Fiction', 'Alessio Lauria, Manuel Carlucci, Adriano Vivona', 'Alessio Lauria, Manuela Pinetti', 'Michele Alhaique, Valeria Bilello, Riccardo De Filippis, Claudio Gioè, Ettore Nicoletti, Caterina E. Capodilista', null, 'In an alternate present, Paolo''s job is to anonymously counsel the employees of his company. He''s the best in what he does, but an employee''s suicide attempt might call into question his life as he knows it.', 'In an alternate present, Paolo''s job is to anonymously counsel the employees of his company. He''s the best in what he does, but an employee''s suicide attempt might call into question his life as he knows it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSEOBC0FGm4kERjrujO4lDvkUBF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365728'),
  ('634509473198602488', 'Monk Comes Down the Mountain', 2015, 'Action', 'Chen Kaige, Geoffrey Simpson', 'Chen Kaige, Zhang Ting', 'Wang Baoqiang, Li Xuejian, Fan Wei, Lin Chi-ling, Vanness Wu, Danny Chan Kwok-Kwan, Wang Xueqi, Aaron Kwok', null, 'A monk leaves his monastery and ventures out into the real world for the first time in his life, and ends up in an adventure with a kung-fu master who is guarding a special artifact.', 'A monk leaves his monastery and ventures out into the real world for the first time in his life, and ends up in an adventure with a kung-fu master who is guarding a special artifact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eS2wMBnOCBUB3g58andUYIVkICF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345235'),
  ('259388960212950639', 'Monkey Business', 1931, 'Comedy', 'Norman Z. McLeod, Arthur L. Todd', 'Will B. Johnstone, S.J. Perelman', 'Groucho Marx, Harpo Marx, Chico Marx, Zeppo Marx, Rockliffe Fellowes, Harry Woods, Thelma Todd, Ruth Hall', 'NR', 'Four stowaways get mixed up with gangsters while running riot on an ocean liner.', 'Four stowaways get mixed up with gangsters while running riot on an ocean liner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArzqncdHxfoegpoglvlm9lC4czi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13911'),
  ('958620387618897308', 'Monkey Business', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Howard Hawks, Milton Krasner, Lionel Newman', 'Ben Hecht, Charles Lederer, I. A. L. Diamond', 'Cary Grant, Ginger Rogers, Charles Coburn, Marilyn Monroe, Hugh Marlowe, Henri Letondal, Robert Cornthwaite, Larry Keating', 'NR', 'Research chemist Barnaby Fulton works on a fountain of youth pill for a chemical company. One of the labs chimps gets loose in the laboratory and mixes chemicals, but then pours the mix into the water cooler. When trying one of his own samples, washed down with water from the cooler, Fulton begins to act just like a twenty-year-old and believes his potion is working. Soon his wife and boss are also behaving like children.', 'Research chemist Barnaby Fulton works on a fountain of youth pill for a chemical company. One of the labs chimps gets loose in the laboratory and mixes chemicals, but then pours the mix into the water cooler. When trying one of his own samples, washed down with water from the cooler, Fulton begins to act just like a twenty-year-old and believes his potion is working. Soon his wife and boss are also behaving like children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IVEO2NwhL6Qp5KPbzcXzK8Wh4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24008'),
  ('294770001325849923', 'Monkey Business', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel Guzmán', 'Daniel Guzmán', 'Joaquín González, Luis Tosar, Daniel Guzmán, Luis Zahera, Julián Villagrán, Miguel Herrán, Antonio Durán ''Morris'', María Jesús Hoyos', null, 'Joaquin, Brujo and Luismi, three neighbourhood scoundrels, meet again after twenty years. Brujo and Luismi are still unemployed while Joaquin swears he has become an important businessman. However, one day he receives a notification that his mother''s house has been repossessed for a loan. He will try to get the money he neds to avoid eviction, but the brilliant ideas of Brujo and Luismi will end up plunging Joaquin even deeper into misery', 'Joaquin, Brujo and Luismi, three neighbourhood scoundrels, meet again after twenty years. Brujo and Luismi are still unemployed while Joaquin swears he has become an important businessman. However, one day he receives a notification that his mother''s house has been repossessed for a loan. He will try to get the money he neds to avoid eviction, but the brilliant ideas of Brujo and Luismi will end up plunging Joaquin even deeper into misery', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rzojWamTHw84bC1DcBjz0vx57v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939892'),
  ('158043234154310611', 'Monkey Grip', 1982, 'Drama', 'David Gribble, Ken Cameron', 'Ken Cameron, Helen Garner', 'Noni Hazlehurst, Colin Friels, Alice Garner, Harold Hopkins, Candy Raymond, Michael Caton, Cathy Downes, Esben Storm', null, 'Nora is a single mother who wants to live the life of an artist, as do her friends -- a group of Melbourne writers, actors and musicians. But when she''s drawn into a passionate affair with a heroin addict, Nora struggles to maintain control of her life.', 'Nora is a single mother who wants to live the life of an artist, as do her friends -- a group of Melbourne writers, actors and musicians. But when she''s drawn into a passionate affair with a heroin addict, Nora struggles to maintain control of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YtVkCyrRLBWKQixMJgcqYLsOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78087'),
  ('276057432238309775', 'Monkey King', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Oliver Rihs, Martin Schlecht', 'Michael Sauter, Thomas Ritter, Thomas Hess', 'Hans-Jochen Wagner, Samuel Finzi, Oliver Korittke, Marc Hosemann, Jule Böwe, Jytte-Merle Böhrnsen, Elisabeth Ehrlich, Patrick Frey', null, 'Wolfi is in his mid-40s and wants to revisit the good old days with his three best buddies in the Provence, where life is good. Little does he realize that his old chums are in the middle of growing up for real, bringing their wives and kids and all their everyday family problems too.', 'Wolfi is in his mid-40s and wants to revisit the good old days with his three best buddies in the Provence, where life is good. Little does he realize that his old chums are in the middle of growing up for real, bringing their wives and kids and all their everyday family problems too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4hPhwfmxvXbNXQJx79lgU7kpQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402898'),
  ('232227842762481345', 'Monkey King: Hero Is Back', 2015, 'Fantasy, Animation, Comedy', 'Tian Xiaopeng, 邱家伟, 陈征', 'Tian Xiaopeng', 'Zhang Lei, Lin Zijie, Wu Wenlun, Tong Zirong, Liu Jiurong, Wu Di, Liu Beichen, Zhao Qianjing', 'PG', 'The all-powerful Monkey King once roamed freely between Heaven and Earth, but after angering the Gods, he was imprisoned within an ice cage deep within the mountains. 500 years later, monsters attack a small village and a child flees to the mountains. Unknowingly, the child releases the Monkey King from his curse. With the help and encouragement from this special child, Monkey King saves the village from the evil monsters.', 'The all-powerful Monkey King once roamed freely between Heaven and Earth, but after angering the Gods, he was imprisoned within an ice cage deep within the mountains. 500 years later, monsters attack a small village and a child flees to the mountains. Unknowingly, the child releases the Monkey King from his curse. With the help and encouragement from this special child, Monkey King saves the village from the evil monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHme10Y5jVdH8KeSGgStndjatF5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351694'),
  ('559648656355977376', 'Monkey Kingdom', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Mark Linfield, Alastair Fothergill, Martyn Colbeck', 'Mark Linfield', 'Tina Fey', 'G', 'A newborn monkey and its mother struggle to survive within the competitive social hierarchy of the Temple Troop, a dynamic group of monkeys who live in ancient ruins found deep in the storied jungles of South Asia.', 'A newborn monkey and its mother struggle to survive within the competitive social hierarchy of the Temple Troop, a dynamic group of monkeys who live in ancient ruins found deep in the storied jungles of South Asia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngf4XquNwVTm4OFuYcnQAkVyT1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295592'),
  ('885031292009594694', 'Monkey Kung Fu', 1979, 'Action', 'John Law Ma, Wan Fat, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan', 'John Law Ma, Szeto On', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Hau Chiu-Sing, Lam Fai-Wong, Fong Ping, Shum Lo, Wong Mei-Mei, Tony Leung Siu-Hung, Chiang Cheng', null, 'A small-time crook goes in search of the other half of a wooden keepsake which will lead him to the legendary kung fu technique of the Gibbon Clan Fist.', 'A small-time crook goes in search of the other half of a wooden keepsake which will lead him to the legendary kung fu technique of the Gibbon Clan Fist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdMVo4yKmYyQdplOKPJ077gLeYW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90562'),
  ('636533489986820164', 'Monkey Magic', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Kensaku Sawada, Kosuke Matsushima', 'Yuji Sakamoto', 'Shingo Katori, Eri Fukatsu, Atsushi Ito, Teruyoshi Uchimura, Koji Ohkura, Asami Mizukawa, Takeshi Kaga, Goro Kishitani', null, 'Journey to the West comes to the big screen like never before in the 2007 film Saiyuuki! Also known as Monkey Magic and Adventures of the Super Monkey, this is the latest in a long line of adaptations of the Wu Cheng''en tome.', 'Journey to the West comes to the big screen like never before in the 2007 film Saiyuuki! Also known as Monkey Magic and Adventures of the Super Monkey, this is the latest in a long line of adaptations of the Wu Cheng''en tome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nObvB67WksxGfCn7F42G1dANIVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44180'),
  ('1031669308150556584', 'Monkey Man', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Dondy Adrian, Mario Kartawinatta, Apoorva Tripathi', 'Dev Patel, Paul Angunawela, John Collee', 'Dev Patel, Sikandar Kher, Makrand Deshpande, Pitobash, Vipin Sharma, Ashwini Kalsekar, Sobhita Dhulipala, Adithi Kalkunte', 'R', 'Kid is an anonymous young man who ekes out a meager living in an underground fight club where, night after night, wearing a gorilla mask, he is beaten bloody by more popular fighters for cash. After years of suppressed rage, Kid discovers a way to infiltrate the enclave of the city’s sinister elite. As his childhood trauma boils over, his mysteriously scarred hands unleash an explosive campaign of retribution to settle the score with the men who took everything from him.', 'Kid is an anonymous young man who ekes out a meager living in an underground fight club where, night after night, wearing a gorilla mask, he is beaten bloody by more popular fighters for cash. After years of suppressed rage, Kid discovers a way to infiltrate the enclave of the city’s sinister elite. As his childhood trauma boils over, his mysteriously scarred hands unleash an explosive campaign of retribution to settle the score with the men who took everything from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lhR4L2vzzjl68P1zJyCH755Oz4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560016'),
  ('178840796481240222', 'Monkey Melodies', 1930, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, null, 'NR', 'The monkeys are swinging; their song and dance routine has other jungle creatures joining in. And two monkeys in love chase and kiss. But the hungry crocodiles lie in wait (and dance the soft shoe).', 'The monkeys are swinging; their song and dance routine has other jungle creatures joining in. And two monkeys in love chase and kiss. But the hungry crocodiles lie in wait (and dance the soft shoe).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VtW7QziRwo8v8M3AgBdq8UyA24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67123'),
  ('894477507071119937', 'Monkey Shines', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'George A. Romero, James A. Contner', 'George A. Romero', 'Jason Beghe, John Pankow, Kate McNeil, Joyce Van Patten, Christine Forrest, Stephen Root, Stanley Tucci, Tom Quinn', 'R', 'A quadriplegic man is given a trained monkey help him with every day activities, until the little monkey begins to develop feelings, and rage, against its new master and those who get too close to him.', 'A quadriplegic man is given a trained monkey help him with every day activities, until the little monkey begins to develop feelings, and rage, against its new master and those who get too close to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbxrAWN2Ss5RXK1uDvMW82xFh0n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29787'),
  ('1066212530012452749', 'Monkey Trouble', 1994, 'Comedy, Family', 'Franco Amurri, Luciano Tovoli', 'Stu Krieger, Franco Amurri', 'Finster, Thora Birch, Harvey Keitel, Mimi Rogers, Christopher McDonald, Adrian Johnson, Julian Johnson, Kevin Scannell', 'PG', 'Dodger, a criminal monkey, belongs to a crooked street performer but escapes his life of crime only to end up in the arms of Eva, an innocent little girl whose mother has no idea that her daughter is harboring a fugitive.', 'Dodger, a criminal monkey, belongs to a crooked street performer but escapes his life of crime only to end up in the arms of Eva, an innocent little girl whose mother has no idea that her daughter is harboring a fugitive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XnEXrR8SKWQmmvjtjRoAXROEj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41582'),
  ('286287279812284298', 'Monkey''s Teeth', 1961, 'Animation, Comedy', 'René Laloux, Julien Pappé', 'René Laloux, Félix Guattari', null, null, 'A slow and ugly fairy tale based on the drawings of inmates at a psychiatric clinic where LaLoux worked.', 'A slow and ugly fairy tale based on the drawings of inmates at a psychiatric clinic where LaLoux worked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OW6nBKmb5LGoQQeuDhUaDXtepW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116352'),
  ('78488278406997162', 'Monkeybone', 2001, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Henry Selick, Dan Bradley, Andrew Dunn', 'Sam Hamm', 'Brendan Fraser, Bridget Fonda, John Turturro, Chris Kattan, Giancarlo Esposito, Rose McGowan, Dave Foley, Megan Mullally', 'PG-13', 'After a car crash sends repressed cartoonist Stu into a coma, he and the mischievous Monkeybone, his hilarious alter-ego, wake up in a wacked-out waystation for lost souls. When Monkeybone takes over Stu''s body and escapes to wreak havoc on the real world, Stu has to find a way to stop him before his sister pulls the plug on reality forever!', 'After a car crash sends repressed cartoonist Stu into a coma, he and the mischievous Monkeybone, his hilarious alter-ego, wake up in a wacked-out waystation for lost souls. When Monkeybone takes over Stu''s body and escapes to wreak havoc on the real world, Stu has to find a way to stop him before his sister pulls the plug on reality forever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgH7Wej9922C1MQv0wciAfesKH8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23685'),
  ('162436272970559963', 'Monkeys, Go Home!', 1967, 'Comedy, Family', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, William E. Snyder', 'Maurice Tombragel', 'Maurice Chevalier, Dean Jones, Yvette Mimieux, Bernard Woringer, Clément Harari, Yvonne Constant, Marcel Hillaire, Jules Munshin', 'G', 'Henry Dussard, a young American, inherits a picturesque but badly neglected olive farm in southern France and is determined to make it operational again despite cautionary advice from the local priest and a pretty villager. Desperate for laborers, the inventive Dussard turns to the zaniest crew of olive pickers ever recruited - four mischievous monkeys! As former members of an Air Force space team, these intelligent chimps quickly pick up on their new responsibilities - but prove to have a turbulent effect on the local townspeople.', 'Henry Dussard, a young American, inherits a picturesque but badly neglected olive farm in southern France and is determined to make it operational again despite cautionary advice from the local priest and a pretty villager. Desperate for laborers, the inventive Dussard turns to the zaniest crew of olive pickers ever recruited - four mischievous monkeys! As former members of an Air Force space team, these intelligent chimps quickly pick up on their new responsibilities - but prove to have a turbulent effect on the local townspeople.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p76W3vGEjRfjmWReejVmIw0eibt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39526'),
  ('640032568215926458', 'Monkeyshines, No. 1', 1890, 'Documentary', 'William K.L. Dickson, William Heise, William Heise', null, 'Giuseppe Sacco Albanese', null, 'Experimental film made to test the original cylinder format of the Kinetoscope and believed to be the first film shot in the United States. It shows a blurry figure in white standing in one place making large gestures and is only a few seconds long.', 'Experimental film made to test the original cylinder format of the Kinetoscope and believed to be the first film shot in the United States. It shows a blurry figure in white standing in one place making large gestures and is only a few seconds long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtPXkwZZLlq3KFiDJisalti9Nvu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32571'),
