  ('614859755338184203', 'Monopol', 1996, 'Comedy, Music', 'Claes Eriksson, Dan Myhrman', 'Claes Eriksson', 'Peter Rangmar, Knut Agnred, Kerstin Granlund, Anders Eriksson, Per Fritzell, Jan Rippe, Claes Eriksson, Lisa Alvgrim', null, 'Egil (Knut Agnred) is just an ordinary painter. But one day, when he''s about to paint a fence, incredible stuff starts to happen!', 'Egil (Knut Agnred) is just an ordinary painter. But one day, when he''s about to paint a fence, incredible stuff starts to happen!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7w3AR9vLNjToWh054QX97lOYWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53689'),
  ('829250722605604306', 'Monos', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, War', 'Alejandro Landes Echavarría, Alex Ezpeleta, Jasper Wolf', 'Alejandro Landes Echavarría, Alexis Dos Santos', 'Moisés Arias, Julianne Nicholson, Sofia Buenaventura, Karen Quintero, Julian Giraldo, Laura Castrillón, Deibi Rueda, Paul Cubides', 'R', 'On a faraway mountaintop, eight kids with guns watch over a hostage and a conscripted milk cow.', 'On a faraway mountaintop, eight kids with guns watch over a hostage and a conscripted milk cow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMcvyEqzwWyaUhuUaJtiZuc7Ku5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417466'),
  ('336816059289932803', 'Monpti', 1957, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Helmut Käutner, Heinz Pehlke', 'Helmut Käutner, Gábor Vaszary, Willibald Eser', 'Romy Schneider, Horst Buchholz, Boy Gobert, Mara Lane, Bum Krüger, Joseph Offenbach, Helmut Käutner, Olive Moorefield', null, 'A poor Hungarian artist falls in love with a wealthy mysterious Parisian girl.', 'A poor Hungarian artist falls in love with a wealthy mysterious Parisian girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTMzKAsoOFaOxnAbRthefuq8Xle.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81306'),
  ('608313988089330039', 'Monpura', 2009, 'Romance, Music, Drama', 'Giasuddin Selim, Shahed Ali, Kamrul Hasan Khosru', 'Giasuddin Selim', 'Chanchal Chowdhury, Farhana Mili, Mamunur Rashid, Shirin Alam, Fazlur Rahman Babu, Monir Khan Shimul, Dilara Zaman, Tania', null, 'A heartbreaking tale of a poor yet honest young man as lies, conspiracies and a horrible betrayal by his rich and influential employer leads his life towards uncertainty.', 'A heartbreaking tale of a poor yet honest young man as lies, conspiracies and a horrible betrayal by his rich and influential employer leads his life towards uncertainty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4brqc4JBjXYy8thlKAoP5jFVH0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91777'),
  ('100910767961076070', 'Monsieur', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Paul Le Chanois, Philippe Monnier, Jean Mylonas', 'Claude Gével', 'Jean Gabin, Philippe Noiret, Mireille Darc, Liselotte Pulver, Gaby Morlay, Gabrielle Dorziat, Henri Crémieux, Andrex', null, 'Left heartbroken by the death of his beloved wife, a rich banker tries to commit suicide. When he learns from his former maid that his wife was unfaithful, he fakes his own death and comes back under a new identity.', 'Left heartbroken by the death of his beloved wife, a rich banker tries to commit suicide. When he learns from his former maid that his wife was unfaithful, he fakes his own death and comes back under a new identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmGuRC961DThGYzCfHTuZDq9GGc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33361'),
  ('240415664755982326', 'Monsieur Aznavour', 2024, 'History, Music, Drama', 'Grand Corps Malade, Mehdi Idir, Tamara Kozo', 'Grand Corps Malade, Mehdi Idir', 'Tahar Rahim, Bastien Bouillon, Marie-Julie Baup, Luc Antoni, Nicolas Chupin, Ella Pellegrini, Petra Silander, Camille Moutawakil', null, 'From his poor childhood to his rise to fame, from his triumphs to his failures, from Paris to New York, discover the exceptional journey of an artist. Intimate, intense, fragile and indestructible, devoted to his art until the very end, here is one of the most immortal singers of all time: MONSIEUR AZNAVOUR.', 'From his poor childhood to his rise to fame, from his triumphs to his failures, from Paris to New York, discover the exceptional journey of an artist. Intimate, intense, fragile and indestructible, devoted to his art until the very end, here is one of the most immortal singers of all time: MONSIEUR AZNAVOUR.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23FkaTaAosaTcTgyuJdTf7TvcJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002155'),
  ('448462675381590198', 'Monsieur Batignole', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gérard Jugnot, Gérard Simon, Hervé Ruet', 'Gérard Jugnot, Philippe Lopes-Curval', 'Gérard Jugnot, Jules Sitruk, Michèle Garcia, Jean-Paul Rouve, Alexia Portal, Violette Blanckaert, Daphné Baiwir, Götz Burger', null, 'In 1942, in an occupied Paris, the apolitical grocer Edmond Batignole lives with his wife and daughter in a small apartment in the building of his grocery. When his future son-in-law and collaborator of the German Pierre-Jean Lamour calls the Nazis to arrest the Jewish Bernstein family, they move to the confiscated apartment. Some days later, the young Simon Bernstein escapes from the Germans and comes to his former home. When Batignole finds him, he feels sorry for the boy and lodges him, hiding Simon from Pierre-Jean and also from his wife. Later, two cousins of Simon meet him in the cellar of the grocery. When Pierre-Jean finds the children, Batignole decides to travel with the children to Switzerland.', 'In 1942, in an occupied Paris, the apolitical grocer Edmond Batignole lives with his wife and daughter in a small apartment in the building of his grocery. When his future son-in-law and collaborator of the German Pierre-Jean Lamour calls the Nazis to arrest the Jewish Bernstein family, they move to the confiscated apartment. Some days later, the young Simon Bernstein escapes from the Germans and comes to his former home. When Batignole finds him, he feels sorry for the boy and lodges him, hiding Simon from Pierre-Jean and also from his wife. Later, two cousins of Simon meet him in the cellar of the grocery. When Pierre-Jean finds the children, Batignole decides to travel with the children to Switzerland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Cse4C8YXXOoXmxeymyGIg45TvD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2594'),
  ('499309716586754471', 'Monsieur Beaucaire', 1946, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Marshall, Lionel Lindon', 'Norman Panama, Melvin Frank', 'Bob Hope, Joan Caulfield, Patric Knowles, Marjorie Reynolds, Cecil Kellaway, Joseph Schildkraut, Reginald Owen, Constance Collier', 'NR', 'A bumbling barber in the court of King Louis XV becomes engaged in political intrigue when he masquerades as a dashing nobleman engaged to the princess of Spain.', 'A bumbling barber in the court of King Louis XV becomes engaged in political intrigue when he masquerades as a dashing nobleman engaged to the princess of Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4VzwXRkUJAdxgoLKSaCmISIsKt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43484'),
  ('1019479952650424269', 'Monsieur Hire', 1989, 'Crime, Drama', 'Patrice Leconte, Denis Lenoir, Marie-Claude Beauchaud', 'Patrice Leconte, Patrice Leconte, Patrick Dewolf', 'Michel Blanc, Sandrine Bonnaire, Luc Thuillier, André Wilms, Philippe Dormoy, Marie Gaydu, Michel Morano, Nora Noël', null, 'A French man spies on a lovely younger woman across the way. When he''s spotted by the woman shortly after being questioned by the police about a local murder, the man''s simple life becomes more complicated.', 'A French man spies on a lovely younger woman across the way. When he''s spotted by the woman shortly after being questioned by the police about a local murder, the man''s simple life becomes more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMsBEphWESeTs4uUAuPpjkIFSKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38695'),
  ('353169860634390355', 'Monsieur Hulot''s Holiday', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Tati, Jacques Mercanton, Jean Mousselle', 'Pierre Aubert, Jacques Lagrange', 'Jacques Tati, Nathalie Pascaud, Louis Pérault, Micheline Rolla, Valentine Camax, André Dubois, Lucien Frégis, Raymond Carl', 'NR', 'Monsieur Hulot, Jacques Tati’s endearing clown, takes a holiday at a seaside resort, where his presence provokes one catastrophe after another. Tati’s masterpiece of gentle slapstick is a series of effortlessly well-choreographed sight gags involving dogs, boats, and firecrackers; it was the first entry in the Hulot series and the film that launched its maker to international stardom.', 'Monsieur Hulot, Jacques Tati’s endearing clown, takes a holiday at a seaside resort, where his presence provokes one catastrophe after another. Tati’s masterpiece of gentle slapstick is a series of effortlessly well-choreographed sight gags involving dogs, boats, and firecrackers; it was the first entry in the Hulot series and the film that launched its maker to international stardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4F4tsU0Ajeh9ZYUkWOJSYmioj7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778'),
  ('222412026720221034', 'Monsieur Ibrahim', 2003, 'Drama', 'François Dupeyron, Rémy Chevrin, Francis Barrois', 'François Dupeyron', 'Omar Sharif, Pierre Boulanger, Gilbert Melki, Isabelle Renauld, Lola Naymark, Anne Suarez, Mata Gabin, Céline Samie', null, 'Paris, 1960s. Momo, a resolute and independent Jewish teenager who lives with his father, a sullen and depressed man, in a working-class neighborhood, develops a close friendship with Monsieur Ibrahim, an elderly Muslim who owns a small grocery store.', 'Paris, 1960s. Momo, a resolute and independent Jewish teenager who lives with his father, a sullen and depressed man, in a working-class neighborhood, develops a close friendship with Monsieur Ibrahim, an elderly Muslim who owns a small grocery store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lS4hx9X5v6cpoCzzQohZs7zD881.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337'),
  ('646255680013202983', 'Monsieur Lazhar', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Philippe Falardeau, Ronald Plante', 'Philippe Falardeau', 'Mohamed Fellag, Émilien Néron, Danielle Proulx, Sophie Nélisse, Marie-Ève Beauregard, Denise Lamontagne, Brigitte Poupart, Louis Champagne', null, 'During a harsh Montréal winter, an elementary-school class is left reeling after its teacher commits suicide. Bachir Lazhar, a charismatic Algerian immigrant, steps in as the substitute teacher for the classroom of traumatized children. All the while, he must keep his personal life tucked away: the fact that he is seeking political refuge in Québec – and that he, like the children, has suffered an appalling loss.', 'During a harsh Montréal winter, an elementary-school class is left reeling after its teacher commits suicide. Bachir Lazhar, a charismatic Algerian immigrant, steps in as the substitute teacher for the classroom of traumatized children. All the while, he must keep his personal life tucked away: the fact that he is seeking political refuge in Québec – and that he, like the children, has suffered an appalling loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcSXbOP1iv859kgQgqZ4Ib9yqKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78480'),
  ('1019413814053316947', 'Monsieur Léon', 2005, 'Drama, History, War, TV Movie', 'Pierre Boutron', 'Anne Valton', 'Michel Serrault, Florence Pernel, Clémentine Célarié, Georges Claisse, Annie Grégorio, Arthur Vaughan-Whitehead, Stefan Elbaum, Christian Loustau', null, 'During the Occupation, a kid is taken in by his old grandfather, wrongly considered a collaborator.', 'During the Occupation, a kid is taken in by his old grandfather, wrongly considered a collaborator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kU3R2SnL3Ok6TvLjLWWHz4u74el.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230528'),
  ('1078787990971789102', 'Monsieur N.', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Antoine de Caunes, Pierre Aïm', 'René Manzor', 'Philippe Torreton, Richard E. Grant, Jay Rodan, Elsa Zylberstein, Roschdy Zem, Bruno Putzulu, Stéphane Freiss, Frédéric Pierrot', null, 'This film covers the last years of the Emperor''s life, imprisoned by the British on St Helena, a remote island off the west coast of Africa. Napoleon retains a loyal entourage of officers who help him plot his escape and evade the attentions of the island''s overzealous governor, Sir Hudson Lowe.', 'This film covers the last years of the Emperor''s life, imprisoned by the British on St Helena, a remote island off the west coast of Africa. Napoleon retains a loyal entourage of officers who help him plot his escape and evade the attentions of the island''s overzealous governor, Sir Hudson Lowe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZhuwy9BYpiGKo45ljOnVvHTLjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47471'),
  ('412661361972818937', 'Monsieur Ripois', 1954, 'Drama, Comedy', 'René Clément, Oswald Morris', 'Hugh Mills, Louis Hémon, Raymond Queneau', 'Gérard Philipe, Valerie Hobson, Joan Greenwood, Margaret Johnston, Natasha Parry, Germaine Montero, Mona Washbourne, Percy Marmont', null, 'While his wife, Catherine, is finalizing their divorce, serial philanderer Andre invites his latest conquest, Catherine’s best friend, Patricia, over for dinner. Over the course of the evening, Andre shares his entire romantic history since first coming to London as a young man, including his liaisons with his former boss, a marriage-minded young girl and a kindhearted Frenchwoman.', 'While his wife, Catherine, is finalizing their divorce, serial philanderer Andre invites his latest conquest, Catherine’s best friend, Patricia, over for dinner. Over the course of the evening, Andre shares his entire romantic history since first coming to London as a young man, including his liaisons with his former boss, a marriage-minded young girl and a kindhearted Frenchwoman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFEdeNTWEkfLozwc9Nd6xEMwf27.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163333'),
  ('465326844569062997', 'Monsieur Tête', 1959, 'Animation', 'Jan Lenica, Henri Gruel, Teresa Lenica', 'Henri Gruel, Jan Lenica, Eugène Ionesco', 'Eugène Ionesco', null, 'Monsieur Tête, an ordinary bureaucrat, rebels against the world and the ideas of the people around him. Because of his marginal behavior, his head is broken, like everyone else.', 'Monsieur Tête, an ordinary bureaucrat, rebels against the world and the ideas of the people around him. Because of his marginal behavior, his head is broken, like everyone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnyFoIIL9NvXvBy34KK1bqUaElO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313051'),
  ('462211423486867658', 'Monsieur Vincent', 1947, 'Drama, History', 'Maurice Cloche, Claude Renoir, Guy Lefranc', 'Jean Anouilh, Jean Bernard-Luc', 'Pierre Fresnay, Pierre Dux, Michel Bouquet, Jean Carmet, Aimé Clariond, Jean Debucourt, Lise Delamare, Germaine Dermoz', null, 'The life of Vincent de Paul, the 17th-century author and priest who founded two religious orders.', 'The life of Vincent de Paul, the 17th-century author and priest who founded two religious orders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NpfFmqbDT0t6wIsju9X9KOMNW3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43460'),
  ('488380828127685795', 'Monsignor', 1982, 'Crime, Drama, War', 'Frank Perry, Billy Williams, Gianni Cozzo', 'Abraham Polonsky, Wendell Mayes', 'Christopher Reeve, Geneviève Bujold, Fernando Rey, Jason Miller, Adolfo Celi, Leonardo Cimino, Tomas Milian, Robert Prosky', 'R', 'The vows of an ambitious young American priest are tested during World War II. Not only does Father John Flaherty get involved with the black market to raise money for the Vatican, he also falls in love with a young French nun.', 'The vows of an ambitious young American priest are tested during World War II. Not only does Father John Flaherty get involved with the black market to raise money for the Vatican, he also falls in love with a young French nun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIXBDXxLK7Kl4Sb8mRyiUfIywzx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124963'),
  ('887767679512256801', 'Monsoon', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tony Aherne, Hong Khaou, Benjamin Kračun', 'Hong Khaou', 'Henry Golding, Parker Sawyers, David Tran, Molly Harris, Ho Nhi, Phan Bao Ngoc, Olivia Hearn, Edouard Leo', null, 'Kit can’t remember much of his native Vietnam. When he returns to the Land of the Golden Star for the first time in over thirty years, he takes in his local surroundings as any Western tourist would, and the environment is as exotic as the language is incomprehensible. The aim of Kit’s travels – to find a place to scatter his parents’ ashes – thus becomes part of a journey back to his roots and to the discovery of his identity, which external circumstances have rendered ambiguous and complex.', 'Kit can’t remember much of his native Vietnam. When he returns to the Land of the Golden Star for the first time in over thirty years, he takes in his local surroundings as any Western tourist would, and the environment is as exotic as the language is incomprehensible. The aim of Kit’s travels – to find a place to scatter his parents’ ashes – thus becomes part of a journey back to his roots and to the discovery of his identity, which external circumstances have rendered ambiguous and complex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIKVeH1iAKJOYYh9lvObD3hYIaf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605499'),
  ('350294513717250770', 'Monsoon Shootout', 2017, 'Thriller', 'Amit Kumar, Avani Batra, Antara Banerjee', 'Amit Kumar', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Vijay Varma, Tannishtha Chatterjee, Neeraj Kabi, Sreejita De, Jayant Gadekar, Omkar Das Manikpuri, Geetanjali Thapa', null, 'A rookie cop joins the crime branch of the Mumbai police department, and on his first assignment is faced with the dilemma of whether he should shoot a murder suspect who is attempting to escape or not.', 'A rookie cop joins the crime branch of the Mumbai police department, and on his first assignment is faced with the dilemma of whether he should shoot a murder suspect who is attempting to escape or not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXyYxhkc8hkUImSeqkfkDx0J0OY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194522'),
  ('275546921606200514', 'Monsoon Wedding', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mira Nair, Declan Quinn, Ayesha Sood', 'Sabrina Dhawan', 'Naseeruddin Shah, Lillete Dubey, Shefali Shah, Vasundhara Das, Parvin Dabas, Vijay Raaz, Tillotama Shome, Kulbhushan Kharbanda', 'R', 'A stressed father, a bride-to-be with a secret, a smitten event planner, and relatives from around the world create much ado about the preparations for an arranged marriage in India.', 'A stressed father, a bride-to-be with a secret, a smitten event planner, and relatives from around the world create much ado about the preparations for an arranged marriage in India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCwkv7tYFem0tQ9Duoq2MX7T7Zd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480'),
  ('1031291309437190767', 'Monster', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'Patty Jenkins, Steven Bernstein, Tony Taylor', 'Patty Jenkins', 'Charlize Theron, Christina Ricci, Bruce Dern, Lee Tergesen, Annie Corley, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Marco St. John, Marc Macaulay', 'R', 'In 1989, prostitute Aileen Wuornos befriends and enters a relationship with a young woman named Selby. Determined to straighten out her life, Aileen''s limited education lands her back on the corner. She''s raped by a trick, who she kills. A string of murder and robbery follows that ultimately leads Aileen to becoming America''s first female serial killer.', 'In 1989, prostitute Aileen Wuornos befriends and enters a relationship with a young woman named Selby. Determined to straighten out her life, Aileen''s limited education lands her back on the corner. She''s raped by a trick, who she kills. A string of murder and robbery follows that ultimately leads Aileen to becoming America''s first female serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b45yfHtLk4TSSDxOLgMLBpShner.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504'),
