  ('893627758293823549', 'Monster Brawl', 2011, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Jesse Thomas Cook, Brendan Uegama', 'Jesse Thomas Cook', 'Dave Foley, Art Hindle, Robert Maillet, Lance Henriksen, James Ray Hart, Kevin Nash, Herb Dean, Jason Deline', 'R', 'Eight of the world''s most legendary monsters, along with their diabolical managers, compete in a wrestling tournament deathmatch to determine the most powerful champion of all time. Interviews, pre-fight breakdowns, trash talking, and monster origin segments round out this ultimate fight of the living dead.', 'Eight of the world''s most legendary monsters, along with their diabolical managers, compete in a wrestling tournament deathmatch to determine the most powerful champion of all time. Interviews, pre-fight breakdowns, trash talking, and monster origin segments round out this ultimate fight of the living dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcGPdBEWIjTHvTBzuSN1NIvPOJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73933'),
  ('42550817631858756', 'Monster Dog', 1988, 'Horror', 'Claudio Fragasso, Michael Gutierez', 'Claudio Fragasso, Rossella Drudi', 'Alice Cooper, Victoria Vera, Carlos Santurio, Pepa Sarsa, Pepita James, Emilio Linder, Ricardo Palacios, Luis Maluenda', null, 'Victor Raven, a famous rock star, returns to his childhood home to shoot a music video. Believing his presence is responsible for the return of a monstrous hound that killed folks when he was kid, the locals decide to do something violent about it.', 'Victor Raven, a famous rock star, returns to his childhood home to shoot a music video. Believing his presence is responsible for the return of a monstrous hound that killed folks when he was kid, the locals decide to do something violent about it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGb8qRCgTU0cQlSwBrS1w9PG2ok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87148'),
  ('122554206669238799', 'Monster Family', 2017, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Holger Tappe', 'David Safier, Catharina Junk', 'Emily Watson, Nick Frost, Jessica Brown Findlay, Ethan Rouse, Jason Isaacs, Catherine Tate, Ewan Bailey, Celia Imrie', 'PG', 'The Wishbone family are far from happy. In an attempt to reconnect as a family, they plan a fun night out. However, the plan backfires when they are cursed and all turned into Monsters.', 'The Wishbone family are far from happy. In an attempt to reconnect as a family, they plan a fun night out. However, the plan backfires when they are cursed and all turned into Monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjDbd43e7o2Ssn7P1l50Bv0rtIl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454699'),
  ('186563348876615858', 'Monster Family 2', 2021, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Holger Tappe', 'David Safier, Abraham Katz', 'Emily Watson, Nick Frost, Jessica Brown Findlay, Ethan Rouse, Jason Isaacs, Catherine Tate, Emily Carey, Daniel Ben Zenou', 'PG', 'To free Baba Yaga and Renfield from the clutches of Monster Hunter Mila Starr, the Wishbone Family once more transforms into a Vampire, Frankenstein''s Monster, a Mummy and a Werewolf but when aided by their three pet bats, the Monster Family zooms around the world again to save their friends, make new monstrous acquaintances.', 'To free Baba Yaga and Renfield from the clutches of Monster Hunter Mila Starr, the Wishbone Family once more transforms into a Vampire, Frankenstein''s Monster, a Mummy and a Werewolf but when aided by their three pet bats, the Monster Family zooms around the world again to save their friends, make new monstrous acquaintances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fD3w59S1e3otqTMQDzxLq24khUf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823609'),
  ('31973164714995843', 'Monster from Green Hell', 1957, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Ray Flin, Kenneth G. Crane, John Greenwald', 'Louis Vittes, Endre Bohem', 'Jim Davis, Robert Griffin, Joel Fluellen, Barbara Turner, Eduardo Ciannelli, Vladimir Sokoloff', 'NR', 'A test rocket carrying wasps to outer space, to study the effects on them of weightlessness and radiations, crashes out of control back to Earth, into the jungles of Africa. The two astrobiologists in charge of the test mount an expedition to the Darkest Continent to retrieve their experiment, only to find the wasps have grown to giant size which are panicking all forms of life as they quest for food.', 'A test rocket carrying wasps to outer space, to study the effects on them of weightlessness and radiations, crashes out of control back to Earth, into the jungles of Africa. The two astrobiologists in charge of the test mount an expedition to the Darkest Continent to retrieve their experiment, only to find the wasps have grown to giant size which are panicking all forms of life as they quest for food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWWqlLzfOBYtfW2iHVHZTn1uhUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52455'),
  ('1070807459224261568', 'Monster from the Ocean Floor', 1954, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Wyott Ordung, Floyd Crosby, Jonathan Haze', 'Bill Danch', 'Anne Kimbell, Stuart Wade, Dick Pinner, Inez Palange, Jonathan Haze, Wyott Ordung, David Garcia, Roger Corman', null, 'Julie, an American on vacation in Mexico, spots a giant, one-eyed amoeba rising from the ocean, but when she tries to tell the authorities, no one believes her. She finally teams up with a marine biologist in an attempt to destroy it.', 'Julie, an American on vacation in Mexico, spots a giant, one-eyed amoeba rising from the ocean, but when she tries to tell the authorities, no one believes her. She finally teams up with a marine biologist in an attempt to destroy it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoVlZnCxzVaXcW8UBtaoQM6ETNn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29057'),
  ('1113668695042057109', 'Monster High', 1989, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Rudy Poe, Eric J. Goldstein', 'Roy Langsdon, John Platt', 'Dean Iandoli, Diana Frank, David Marriott, Robert Lind, Sean Haines, Doug Kerzner, Troy Fromin, Bob Cady', 'R', 'Two high school goofs steal an explosive device from another world that has been hidden on earth, and an alien named Mr. Armageddon is sent to retrieve it from them.', 'Two high school goofs steal an explosive device from another world that has been hidden on earth, and an alien named Mr. Armageddon is sent to retrieve it from them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syF3SMcAc6ku9y08QCSvyLFtYPU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90888'),
  ('336957589476343083', 'Monster High 2', 2023, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Todd Holland', null, 'Miia Harris, Nayah Damasen, Ceci Balagot, Case Walker, Justin Derickson, Salena Qureshi, Bonale Fambrini, Jy Prishkulnik', 'PG', 'As they enter sophomore year at Monster High, Clawdeen Wolf, Draculaura and Frankie Stein face new students, new powers, and an even bigger threat that could not only tear their friendship apart but could change the world forever.', 'As they enter sophomore year at Monster High, Clawdeen Wolf, Draculaura and Frankie Stein face new students, new powers, and an even bigger threat that could not only tear their friendship apart but could change the world forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RaCErx1ofEBiUsifGFaA6F6rKt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1039960'),
  ('556662245231783251', 'Monster High: 13 Wishes', 2013, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation', 'Steve Sacks, Audu Paden, Herrick Chiu', 'Mike Montesano, Ted Zizik', 'America Young, Jonquil Goode, Salli Saffioti, Kate Higgins, Debi Derryberry, Erin Fitzgerald, Audu Paden, Evan Smith', 'G', 'It’s a new school year at Monster High, and the little sister of Clawdeen Wolf, Howleen, is determined to be more fangtastic than ever. Her dream of popularity turns out to be easier than anyone imagined when she stumbles upon a genie named Gigi Grant who grants her not 3, but 13 Wishes! But the ghouls quickly learn to be s-careful what you wish for because each wish comes with a dark side, and soon the student disem-body of Monster High is turned upside-down! Join Frankie Stein, Clawdeen Wolf, Draculaura and the rest of their creeperiffic ghoulfriends as they journey deep inside the magic lantern to save the very soul of Monster High… while flashing their killer style every step of the way!', 'It’s a new school year at Monster High, and the little sister of Clawdeen Wolf, Howleen, is determined to be more fangtastic than ever. Her dream of popularity turns out to be easier than anyone imagined when she stumbles upon a genie named Gigi Grant who grants her not 3, but 13 Wishes! But the ghouls quickly learn to be s-careful what you wish for because each wish comes with a dark side, and soon the student disem-body of Monster High is turned upside-down! Join Frankie Stein, Clawdeen Wolf, Draculaura and the rest of their creeperiffic ghoulfriends as they journey deep inside the magic lantern to save the very soul of Monster High… while flashing their killer style every step of the way!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEZJMmzDNUNKoJw6jfmGVWeqqhJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212470'),
  ('1029234394989708402', 'Monster High: Boo York, Boo York', 2015, 'Animation, Family, Music', 'William Lau', 'Keith Wagner', 'Salli Saffioti, Missi Hale, TJ Smith, Evan Smith, Wendee Lee, Kate Higgins, Debi Derryberry, Laura Bailey', 'PG', 'It''s fright lights, big city when the Monster High ghouls head to Boo York! Cleo de Nile is invited to attend a gancy gala celebrating the return of the magical comet and, of course, she brings along her beast friends. But their trip isn''t all fun and frightseeing because Nefera, Cleo''s sister, uses the comet''s power for her own spooktacularly sneaky plans. Can the monsters unwrap the mystery of the comet in time to stop Nefera? Find out in Booy York, Boo York, the first-ever Monster High musical, featuring eight original songs.', 'It''s fright lights, big city when the Monster High ghouls head to Boo York! Cleo de Nile is invited to attend a gancy gala celebrating the return of the magical comet and, of course, she brings along her beast friends. But their trip isn''t all fun and frightseeing because Nefera, Cleo''s sister, uses the comet''s power for her own spooktacularly sneaky plans. Can the monsters unwrap the mystery of the comet in time to stop Nefera? Find out in Booy York, Boo York, the first-ever Monster High musical, featuring eight original songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56gFxmKw3LOAuoViSjeybutEVKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360404'),
  ('588882610898213738', 'Monster High: Electrified', 2017, 'Family, Animation', 'Jun Falkenstein, Jun Falkenstein, Avgousta Zourelidi', 'Keith Wagner', 'Debi Derryberry, Cassandra Lee Morris, Salli Saffioti, Larissa Gallagher, Cristina Milizia, Jonquil Goode, Travis Dresden, Evan Smith', 'PG', 'When Clawdeen dreams of opening a salon made for monsters and normies, Frankie has the perfect place - an abandoned power station outside town. But the idea sparks negative voltage when Moanica plots to ruin the whole thing, and replace the celebration with something a little more... shocking! Luckily the ghouls have a secret weapon on their side...Twyla, the daughter of the Boogey Man, and the perfect ghoul to unearth any mystery. Along with the most voltageous salon ever! So catch every twist, turn, zap and blast...because the Monster High ghouls are about to get ELECTRIC!', 'When Clawdeen dreams of opening a salon made for monsters and normies, Frankie has the perfect place - an abandoned power station outside town. But the idea sparks negative voltage when Moanica plots to ruin the whole thing, and replace the celebration with something a little more... shocking! Luckily the ghouls have a secret weapon on their side...Twyla, the daughter of the Boogey Man, and the perfect ghoul to unearth any mystery. Along with the most voltageous salon ever! So catch every twist, turn, zap and blast...because the Monster High ghouls are about to get ELECTRIC!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbduufD4QoNTErROdyVWa9XCyzx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447113'),
  ('494272106498038027', 'Monster High: Escape from Skull Shores', 2012, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Steve Ball', 'Mike Montesano, Ted Zizik', 'Kate Higgins, Laura Bailey, Salli Saffioti, Debi Derryberry, Evan Smith, Keith Silverstein, Malcolm Danare, Erin Fitzgerald', 'PG', 'It''s officially Spring Break at Monster High, and Lagoona takes her gilfriends across the sea to the Great Barrier Reef, but they are ship wrecked and end up on a mysterious skull shaped island. At Skull Shores, they enjoy the local hospitality until they realize that they are being used by a slippery showman named Farnum to lure the rarest, most mysterious monster of them all, "the Beast.”', 'It''s officially Spring Break at Monster High, and Lagoona takes her gilfriends across the sea to the Great Barrier Reef, but they are ship wrecked and end up on a mysterious skull shaped island. At Skull Shores, they enjoy the local hospitality until they realize that they are being used by a slippery showman named Farnum to lure the rarest, most mysterious monster of them all, "the Beast.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytR48gp7786CbOztf9hqgVpphQo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167666'),
  ('235646494495253663', 'Monster High: Freaky Fusion', 2014, 'Animation', 'William Lau, Sylvain Blais', 'Keith Wagner', 'Haviland Stillwell, Laura Bailey, Paula Rhodes, Kate Higgins, America Young, Erin Fitzgerald, Geeg Friedman, Salli Saffioti', 'PG', 'While attempting to help Frankie Stein learn more about her freakycool scaritage, the fashionably fierce ghoulfriends travel back in time to the first day ever of Monster High! There, they meet Sparky, a skullastic teen with an obsession for creating life. But when Sparky follows the ghouls through a killer time portal to modern-day Monster High, the event results in eight of them fusing together into four creeperiffic hybrid Monsters. Now, they''ll really have to work together to control their bodies in the big Bitecentennial Play and stop one of Sparky''s experiments from destroying imperfectly perfect Monster High!', 'While attempting to help Frankie Stein learn more about her freakycool scaritage, the fashionably fierce ghoulfriends travel back in time to the first day ever of Monster High! There, they meet Sparky, a skullastic teen with an obsession for creating life. But when Sparky follows the ghouls through a killer time portal to modern-day Monster High, the event results in eight of them fusing together into four creeperiffic hybrid Monsters. Now, they''ll really have to work together to control their bodies in the big Bitecentennial Play and stop one of Sparky''s experiments from destroying imperfectly perfect Monster High!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJN5LgT6GrnlvWvdCydLS0c4g8j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290727'),
  ('347931002782178515', 'Monster High: Friday Night Frights', 2012, 'Animation, Family', 'Dustin McKenzie', 'Mike Montesano, Ted Zizik', 'Kate Higgins, Debi Derryberry, Salli Saffioti, Laura Bailey, Erin Fitzgerald, Ogie Banks, Evan Smith, Audu Paden', 'G', 'After Monster High’s roller skating team is defeated at the Skulltimate Roller Maze tournament, the ghouls team up to face an all-boys league, with the hope of winning back the school crest and restoring school spirit.', 'After Monster High’s roller skating team is defeated at the Skulltimate Roller Maze tournament, the ghouls team up to face an all-boys league, with the hope of winning back the school crest and restoring school spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbgyy6NXnFdlWyGohaOFM4xVVu5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166747'),
  ('620405176429629918', 'Monster High: Fright On!', 2011, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'Victor Dal Chele, Alfred Gimeno', 'Mike Montesano, Ted Zizik', 'Kate Higgins, Salli Saffioti, Debi Derryberry, Laura Bailey, Audu Paden, Ogie Banks, Yuri Lowenthal, Cam Clarke', 'PG', 'See what happens when the student bodies of an all-vampire school and an all-werewolf school integrate with Monster High.', 'See what happens when the student bodies of an all-vampire school and an all-werewolf school integrate with Monster High.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1bcqE2993YFwZRCYkDAcGKdJXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227257'),
  ('1095986809497013782', 'Monster High: Frights, Camera, Action!', 2014, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'Sylvain Blais, Audu Paden, William Lau', 'Audu Paden, Dan Serafin', 'Debi Derryberry, Salli Saffioti, Julie Maddalena, James Horan, Cam Clarke, Karen Strassman, Kate Higgins, Laura Bailey', 'G', 'When Draculaura is led to believe she''s the rightful heir to the vampire throne, she and her best ghoulfriends are whisked away to Transylvania for a royal coronation to die for. But they soon discover the hunt for the queen is not over yet. The Ghouls must locate an ancient artifact known as the Vampire''s Heart in order to discover the identity of the true Vampire Queen. It''s a fangtastic adventure that will lead them from the Tower of Londoom, to a haunted river boat in New Goreleans and finally to the glamorous boo-vie lots of Hauntlywood. Could this be the moment when Draculara finally receives her vampire powers and discovers screams really can come true?', 'When Draculaura is led to believe she''s the rightful heir to the vampire throne, she and her best ghoulfriends are whisked away to Transylvania for a royal coronation to die for. But they soon discover the hunt for the queen is not over yet. The Ghouls must locate an ancient artifact known as the Vampire''s Heart in order to discover the identity of the true Vampire Queen. It''s a fangtastic adventure that will lead them from the Tower of Londoom, to a haunted river boat in New Goreleans and finally to the glamorous boo-vie lots of Hauntlywood. Could this be the moment when Draculara finally receives her vampire powers and discovers screams really can come true?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gTNnqidaAfTHlOIB7tiMkGh3hK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260234'),
  ('597402371563538860', 'Monster High: Ghouls Rule', 2012, 'Animation, Family', 'Mike Fetterly, Steve Sacks', 'Ted Zizik, Mike Montesano', 'Kate Higgins, Cindy Robinson, Salli Saffioti, Erin Fitzgerald, Laura Bailey, Debi Derryberry, Ogie Banks, Evan Smith', 'PG', 'Monster High: Ghouls Rule unearths an old conflict between "Normies" and monsters - and things are about to get scary! For years, students at Monster High were warned that Halloween was a night to stay inside and avoid conflict at all costs. But Frankie and her friends discover that ghouls and "Normies" once loved to spend the holiday together! The ghouls decide to turn back the clock and use the night to celebrate their individuality and show that it''s okay to "Be Yourself. Be Unique. Be a Monster!"', 'Monster High: Ghouls Rule unearths an old conflict between "Normies" and monsters - and things are about to get scary! For years, students at Monster High were warned that Halloween was a night to stay inside and avoid conflict at all costs. But Frankie and her friends discover that ghouls and "Normies" once loved to spend the holiday together! The ghouls decide to turn back the clock and use the night to celebrate their individuality and show that it''s okay to "Be Yourself. Be Unique. Be a Monster!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3anGCL2BM6IvTKLiud9pZLjlgji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134632'),
  ('273545933504090086', 'Monster High: Great Scarrier Reef', 2016, 'Family, Animation', 'William Lau', 'Nina G. Bargiel, Shane Amsterdam', 'Larissa Gallagher, Kate Higgins, Debi Derryberry, Salli Saffioti, America Young, Evan Smith, Lyndsy Kail, Rachel Staman', 'G', 'Join your favourite ghoulfriends in an all-new aquatic adventure! When the ghouls get pulled into the school pool, they''re transported to the gore-geous underwater world of the Great Scarrier Reef. Lagoon realizes she''s come home and, in a fintastic mission of the heart, decides to come to terms with her own freaky flaws. Of course she''ll need help from the most creeperific firends ever as she confronts a frenemy from her past, competes in a scaretastic dance extravaganze, and fights a terrible beast from the deep!', 'Join your favourite ghoulfriends in an all-new aquatic adventure! When the ghouls get pulled into the school pool, they''re transported to the gore-geous underwater world of the Great Scarrier Reef. Lagoon realizes she''s come home and, in a fintastic mission of the heart, decides to come to terms with her own freaky flaws. Of course she''ll need help from the most creeperific firends ever as she confronts a frenemy from her past, competes in a scaretastic dance extravaganze, and fights a terrible beast from the deep!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSyx6I8PVT91d6LgNReYLRyDt0e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382581'),
  ('685907937379088248', 'Monster High: Haunted', 2015, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Dan Fraga, William Lau', 'Keith Wagner', 'Haviland Stillwell, Karen Strassman, Laura Bailey, America Young, Cam Clarke, Erin Fitzgerald, Salli Saffioti, Jonquil Goode', 'PG', 'Lurk what''s waiting for the Monster High ghouls when they bring their killer fashion to the howlways of the spooktacular Haunted High! When the ghouls of Monster High follow Spectra Vondergeist one day, they discover a creeperiffic Ghost World with an all-spirit school. But their scary-cute student bodies are hardly welcome with the very strict Principal Revenant, and she punishes Spectra with frightful detention chains that prevent her from re-joining Monster High. Now, it''s up to the imperfectly perfect friends to take on ghostly forms in order to save one of their own from disappearing forever!', 'Lurk what''s waiting for the Monster High ghouls when they bring their killer fashion to the howlways of the spooktacular Haunted High! When the ghouls of Monster High follow Spectra Vondergeist one day, they discover a creeperiffic Ghost World with an all-spirit school. But their scary-cute student bodies are hardly welcome with the very strict Principal Revenant, and she punishes Spectra with frightful detention chains that prevent her from re-joining Monster High. Now, it''s up to the imperfectly perfect friends to take on ghostly forms in order to save one of their own from disappearing forever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvwpfW0xRt2pQGD5tJbqmkc9STb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324963'),
  ('798043428616394440', 'Monster High: New Ghoul at School', 2010, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'Eric Radomski, Audu Paden', null, 'Kate Higgins, Salli Saffioti, Debi Derryberry, Laura Bailey, Yuri Lowenthal, Audu Paden, Troy Baker', 'G', 'Being the new girl is totally terrifying. See what really happened during Frankie Stein''s first week at Monster High!', 'Being the new girl is totally terrifying. See what really happened during Frankie Stein''s first week at Monster High!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vE8hYVOwJSGxy1vQq36tRiw4iuv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183443'),
  ('1054419643704448508', 'Monster High: Scaris City of Frights', 2013, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Steve Ball, Andrew Duncan', 'Ted Zizik, Mike Montesano', 'Salli Saffioti, Kate Higgins, Erin Fitzgerald, Cindy Robinson, Debi Derryberry, Laura Bailey, Stephanie Sheh, Audu Paden', 'G', 'The Monstruitas of Monster High are obsessed with going to Scaris, The City of Frights for Fashion international competition where the winner will become the apprentice of the world famous Madame Ghostier designer.', 'The Monstruitas of Monster High are obsessed with going to Scaris, The City of Frights for Fashion international competition where the winner will become the apprentice of the world famous Madame Ghostier designer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ei56eTlkQpTEwfodzzjBxTY5I07.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192911'),
  ('242568110224414188', 'Monster High: The Movie', 2022, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Todd Holland, Tony Mirza, Sheryl Levine', null, 'Miia Harris, Ceci Balagot, Nayah Damasen, Jy Prishkulnik, Case Walker, Justin Derickson, Scotch Ellis Loring, Steve Valentine', 'G', 'Clawdeen Wolf, half human and half werewolf, has recently started attending Monster High, a school for monsters in all forms. After quickly befriending her classmates Frankie Stein and Draculaura, Clawdeen feels like she has finally found a place where she can truly be herself, or so she thinks. Soon, a devious plan to destroy Monster High threatens to reveal her real identity and Clawdeen must learn to embrace her true monster heart before it''s too late.', 'Clawdeen Wolf, half human and half werewolf, has recently started attending Monster High, a school for monsters in all forms. After quickly befriending her classmates Frankie Stein and Draculaura, Clawdeen feels like she has finally found a place where she can truly be herself, or so she thinks. Soon, a devious plan to destroy Monster High threatens to reveal her real identity and Clawdeen must learn to embrace her true monster heart before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/768OBP28OA4mjavOUAIRlVo14Xu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335795'),
  ('1019774133894757869', 'Monster High: Welcome to Monster High', 2016, 'Animation, Family', 'Stephen Donnelly, Jun Falkenstein, Olly Reid', 'Stephen Donnelly, Shane Amsterdam, Dana Starfield', 'Debi Derryberry, Cassandra Lee Morris, Salli Saffioti, Larissa Gallagher, Cristina Milizia, Michael Sorich, Jonquil Goode, Travis Dresden', 'PG', 'Monsters once lived in hiding—even from each other—because they were afraid they would be in danger if humans knew they existed. But Draculaura, the daughter of Dracula, along with her best ghoulfriends, dreamt of a school where everyone was welcome and accepted for who they are. Determined to make their dream come true, the ghouls travel the world on an epic adventure to recruit new students. But even in this amazing place, there''s drama: a villainess zombie is spreading trouble rather than friendship, and every student must live with the fear that their secret will be revealed. Now the ghouls must save their school so that every monster has a place where they belong and their uniqueness is celebrated!', 'Monsters once lived in hiding—even from each other—because they were afraid they would be in danger if humans knew they existed. But Draculaura, the daughter of Dracula, along with her best ghoulfriends, dreamt of a school where everyone was welcome and accepted for who they are. Determined to make their dream come true, the ghouls travel the world on an epic adventure to recruit new students. But even in this amazing place, there''s drama: a villainess zombie is spreading trouble rather than friendship, and every student must live with the fear that their secret will be revealed. Now the ghouls must save their school so that every monster has a place where they belong and their uniqueness is celebrated!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9u5Qi5aFCmxS55GKawpINNDt2o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413736'),
  ('737554989891225965', 'Monster High: Why Do Ghouls Fall in Love?', 2012, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Steve Sacks, Dustin McKenzie', 'Mike McKenzie, Ted Zizik', 'Debi Derryberry, Ogie Banks, Jonathan Lipow, Erin Fitzgerald, Kate Higgins, Salli Saffioti, Laura Bailey, America Young', 'PG', 'Draculaura’s Sweet 1600th birthday is an extra special occasion to party at Monster High! But her high expectations lead to deadly results when she’s faced with the choice between practical boyfriend Clawd, and new vampire heartthrob, Valentine, a romantic blast from her past.', 'Draculaura’s Sweet 1600th birthday is an extra special occasion to party at Monster High! But her high expectations lead to deadly results when she’s faced with the choice between practical boyfriend Clawd, and new vampire heartthrob, Valentine, a romantic blast from her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QunSg5fFWA5JersUlm7wcmfjP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167313'),
  ('26845942159472050', 'Monster House', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Gil Kenan, Xavier Grobet', 'Dan Harmon, Rob Schrab, Pamela Pettler', 'Mitchel Musso, Sam Lerner, Spencer Locke, Steve Buscemi, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Kevin James, Nick Cannon, Jon Heder', 'PG', 'Monsters under the bed are scary enough, but what happens when an entire house is out to get you? Three teens aim to find out when they go up against a decrepit neighboring home and unlock its frightening secrets.', 'Monsters under the bed are scary enough, but what happens when an entire house is out to get you? Three teens aim to find out when they go up against a decrepit neighboring home and unlock its frightening secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCRPr4bkO3ae0U1134vJ39xZnAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9297'),
  ('768648812824572571', 'Monster Hunt', 2015, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Raman Hui Shing-Ngai, Ho Yiu-Leung, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming', 'Alan Yuen Kam-Lun', 'Bai Baihe, Jing Boran, Jiang Wu, Elaine Jin Yan-Ling, Wallace Chung, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Tang Wei', 'PG', 'Young monster kids try to make peace between the world of humans and the world of the monsters.', 'Young monster kids try to make peace between the world of humans and the world of the monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csMASFudtPSyVEFl4qq2Sm5lflM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334298'),
  ('594334625322839505', 'Monster Hunt 2', 2018, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ho Yiu-Leung, Shadow Hung, Raman Hui Shing-Ngai', 'Jack Ng Wai-Lun, Sunny Chan Wing-Sun', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Bai Baihe, Jing Boran, Chris Lee Yuchun, Tony Yang, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Zhang Li, Jiang Chao', 'PG', 'The sequel to Monster Hunt. Set in a world where monsters and humans co-exist, the franchise tells the story of Wuba, a baby monster born to be king. Wuba becomes the central figure in stopping an all-out monster civil war.', 'The sequel to Monster Hunt. Set in a world where monsters and humans co-exist, the franchise tells the story of Wuba, a baby monster born to be king. Wuba becomes the central figure in stopping an all-out monster civil war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IxcMNvnDKDKFpLzMH73LwnbXAm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497984'),
  ('290288147450049820', 'Monster Hunter', 2020, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Paul W. S. Anderson, Glen MacPherson, Guy Potgieter', 'Paul W. S. Anderson', 'Milla Jovovich, Tony Jaa, Ron Perlman, T.I., Diego Boneta, Meagan Good, Josh Helman, Jin Au-Yeung', 'PG-13', 'A portal transports Cpt. Artemis and an elite unit of soldiers to a strange world where powerful monsters rule with deadly ferocity. Faced with relentless danger, the team encounters a mysterious hunter who may be their only hope to find a way home.', 'A portal transports Cpt. Artemis and an elite unit of soldiers to a strange world where powerful monsters rule with deadly ferocity. Faced with relentless danger, the team encounters a mysterious hunter who may be their only hope to find a way home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UCOF11QCw8kcqvce8LKOO6pimh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458576'),
  ('1040960306859153229', 'Monster Hunter: Legends of the Guild', 2021, 'Animation, Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Steve Yamamoto', 'Joshua Fine', 'Dante Basco, Brando Eaton, Erica Lindbeck, Ben Rausch, Stephen Kramer Glickman, Caroline Caliston, G.K. Bowes, Karen Strassman', 'PG-13', 'In a world where humans and fearsome monsters live in an uneasy balance, young hunter Aiden fights to save his village from destruction by a dragon.', 'In a world where humans and fearsome monsters live in an uneasy balance, young hunter Aiden fights to save his village from destruction by a dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQnsD1u1n2aFq8qfu4dQrhLzaUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:851281'),
  ('1006533978634098102', 'Monster Hunters', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Marcus Friedlander, James Mahoney, Nadine Flores', 'Jeremy M. Inman', 'Tom Sizemore, Connie Jo Sechrist, Anthony Jensen, Yaz Canli, Eric Delgado, Jonathan Nation, Sharon Desiree, Cherish Holland', null, 'When an alien prison ship crash lands and unleashes creature after creature in the California desert, they make quick work of the army that tries to stop them. Now, the only hope of stopping the aliens rests with a secret branch of the government specializing in alien weaponry. But with the team untested in actual combat, the battle for Earth will be brutal.', 'When an alien prison ship crash lands and unleashes creature after creature in the California desert, they make quick work of the army that tries to stop them. Now, the only hope of stopping the aliens rests with a secret branch of the government specializing in alien weaponry. But with the team untested in actual combat, the battle for Earth will be brutal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UrOHqUlzdeXz4SLaQIETaRd2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736485'),
  ('1019669508876487105', 'Monster in a Box', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Nick Broomfield, Michael Coulter', 'Spalding Gray', 'Spalding Gray', null, 'Monologuist Spalding Gray talks about the great difficulties he experienced while attempting to write his first novel, a nearly 2,000-page autobiographical tome concerning the death of his mother. Among his many asides, Gray discusses his problems in dealing with the Hollywood film industry, recounts the trips he took around the world in order to avoid dealing with his writer''s block and describes his ambivalence about acting as stage manager for a Broadway production of "Our Town."', 'Monologuist Spalding Gray talks about the great difficulties he experienced while attempting to write his first novel, a nearly 2,000-page autobiographical tome concerning the death of his mother. Among his many asides, Gray discusses his problems in dealing with the Hollywood film industry, recounts the trips he took around the world in order to avoid dealing with his writer''s block and describes his ambivalence about acting as stage manager for a Broadway production of "Our Town."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbF26J1sqfkZ5HaNhkRrrNbwjDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34328'),
  ('101865725871344703', 'Monster in the Closet', 1986, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Bob Dahlin, Ronald W. McLeish', 'Bob Dahlin', 'Donald Grant, Denise DuBarry, Henry Gibson, Paul Walker, Claude Akins, Howard Duff, Donald Moffat, Paul Dooley', 'PG', 'After several people and a dog are found dead in their closets a "mild-mannered" reporter, a college professor, her son and a befuddled professor band together to uncover the mystery but not without involving the U.S. Army and mass panic.', 'After several people and a dog are found dead in their closets a "mild-mannered" reporter, a college professor, her son and a befuddled professor band together to uncover the mystery but not without involving the U.S. Army and mass panic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWHhre5M8DZvvr5MNL653rKD051.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50382'),
  ('550912101044277299', 'Monster Inside: America''s Most Extreme Haunted House', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Andrew Renzi', null, 'Justin Yerace, Russ McKamey, Melissa Everly, Brandon Vance', 'R', 'Russ McKamey is the creator of the world''s "most extreme haunted house" - McKamey Manor. He is also a manipulative abuser, according to three people who realize the horror is never over once you decide to enter the Manor.', 'Russ McKamey is the creator of the world''s "most extreme haunted house" - McKamey Manor. He is also a manipulative abuser, according to three people who realize the horror is never over once you decide to enter the Manor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qXF43ZW6liSInXRXDdNpnxphAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1168842'),
  ('690938606509732279', 'Monster Island', 2004, 'Adventure, Comedy, Horror, TV Movie', 'Todd Elyzen, Jack Perez, Rachel Leiterman', null, 'Daniel Letterle, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Chelan Simmons, Cascy Beddow, Joe MacLeod, Carmen Electra, La La Anthony, Nick Carter', 'PG', 'Mutant radioactive bugs attack VJs, Carmen Electra and an island full of MTV contest winners in this tongue-in-cheek tribute to B-movies, monster flicks and even MTV. MTV Original Movies presents Monster Island, a flick with old school effects mixed with hot new celebrities. There’s action, romance and big bugs--now is that something you really want to miss?', 'Mutant radioactive bugs attack VJs, Carmen Electra and an island full of MTV contest winners in this tongue-in-cheek tribute to B-movies, monster flicks and even MTV. MTV Original Movies presents Monster Island, a flick with old school effects mixed with hot new celebrities. There’s action, romance and big bugs--now is that something you really want to miss?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkzLVg7jhsPLd5LJ8KBSz4fgBqE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88905'),
  ('595602369629719341', 'Monster Island', 2017, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Leopoldo Aguilar', 'Billy Frolick', 'Phillip Adrian Vasquez, Nancy Sullivan, Katie Leigh, Fiona Hardingham, Wally Wingert, Jenifer Kaplan, Roger L. Jackson, Joey Camen', 'PG', 'Young Lucas finds out he''s not really a human after he surprisingly transforms into a monster in front of the most popular kids at school. His search for Monster Island and his real roots takes him on a fabulously scary journey that puts him face to face with more tentacles, fangs and far-out situations than he can shake one of his new wings at.', 'Young Lucas finds out he''s not really a human after he surprisingly transforms into a monster in front of the most popular kids at school. His search for Monster Island and his real roots takes him on a fabulously scary journey that puts him face to face with more tentacles, fangs and far-out situations than he can shake one of his new wings at.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAwyhGDOdeqeWW9OGVQfRULiSzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420279'),
  ('1065689150765573288', 'Monster Island', 2025, 'Horror, Fantasy, Action, Thriller', 'Mike Wiluan, Asep Kalila, Ary Ibrahim', 'Mike Wiluan', 'Dean Fujioka, Callum Woodhouse, Alan Maxson, Kazushi Kato, Teruhiko Kameoka, Yorihiro Nagai, Naoki Kawano, James Edgar Langdong', null, 'In the Pacific, 1944, a Japanese soldier and a British prisoner of war are stranded on a deserted island, hunted by a deadly creature. Two mortal enemies must come together to survive the unknown.', 'In the Pacific, 1944, a Japanese soldier and a British prisoner of war are stranded on a deserted island, hunted by a deadly creature. Two mortal enemies must come together to survive the unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BCEYcclrfWWLcsTzhweSVFb8tO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214140'),
  ('1088672301965022041', 'Monster Man', 2003, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Michael Davis, Matthew Irving', 'Michael Davis', 'Eric Jungmann, Justin Urich, Aimee Brooks, Michael Bailey Smith, Joe Goodrich, Tim Sitarz, Robert R. Shafer, Steve DeRelian', null, 'Two guys and a female hitchhiker are terrorized by a monstrous looking man driving a giant monster truck.', 'Two guys and a female hitchhiker are terrorized by a monstrous looking man driving a giant monster truck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFCta7mFC7aVTPMA3opH8Vq62Pn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1693'),
  ('412928237419404485', 'Monster Mash', 2024, 'Horror, Action, Fantasy', 'Jose Prendes, Mark David, Lauren Elizabeth Hood', 'Jose Prendes', 'Michael Madsen, Michelle Bauer, Ethan Daniel Corbett, Emma Reinagel, Gabriel Pranter, Maddie Lane, Adam Slemon, Erik Celso Mann', null, 'Dracula, Werewolf, and the Invisible Man must work together to stop Dr. Frankenstein from creating an unstoppable monster.', 'Dracula, Werewolf, and the Invisible Man must work together to stop Dr. Frankenstein from creating an unstoppable monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkO5dkldULotBPjbgznzXlHjSFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1265647'),
  ('537560066131663061', 'Monster Mash: The Movie', 1995, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Alec Sokolow, Scott Andrew Ressler, Joel Cohen', 'Sheldon Allman, Bobby Pickett', 'Ian Bohen, Candace Cameron Bure, Sarah Douglas, John Kassir, Bobby Pickett, Adam Shankman, Mink Stole, Jimmie Walker', 'PG', 'Young couple Scott and Mary are on their way to a Halloween party when their car breaks down, and they encounter a creepy castle where Dr. Frankenstein seeks to put Scott''s brain in his monstrous creation. As for Mary, Count Dracula wants her for his mistress.', 'Young couple Scott and Mary are on their way to a Halloween party when their car breaks down, and they encounter a creepy castle where Dr. Frankenstein seeks to put Scott''s brain in his monstrous creation. As for Mary, Count Dracula wants her for his mistress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZASPeHvmMxV6WmvoOZURSLYo6E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3217'),
  ('34083684453996773', 'Monster of The Deep', 2023, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Wu Yingxiang', null, 'He Ziming, Zhang Boyu, Li Muyun, Fang Xushi, Tian Haoning, Frank Wong, Chen Xianmin, Zhu Haiyu', null, 'Since witnessing the death of his wife in a shipwreck, Zhang Yang, who has spent half of his life at sea, vowed never to set foot in the ocean again. However, on his daughter''s 12th birthday, Zhang Yang, who could not resist his best friend''s persuasion to fulfil his daughter''s wish, broke his vow and participated in a sea smuggling and embarked on an ocean liner that was no different from a steel prison. At the same time, a horrible accident happened, a deep sea monster that has never been seen before has escaped from the ship''s laboratory. With the genes of the natural predator, the human on board launched a merciless hunt, will all be put to the test of survival. (Source: iQiyi)', 'Since witnessing the death of his wife in a shipwreck, Zhang Yang, who has spent half of his life at sea, vowed never to set foot in the ocean again. However, on his daughter''s 12th birthday, Zhang Yang, who could not resist his best friend''s persuasion to fulfil his daughter''s wish, broke his vow and participated in a sea smuggling and embarked on an ocean liner that was no different from a steel prison. At the same time, a horrible accident happened, a deep sea monster that has never been seen before has escaped from the ship''s laboratory. With the genes of the natural predator, the human on board launched a merciless hunt, will all be put to the test of survival. (Source: iQiyi)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqo0hVifRmsSwHg6tAP1nF3f9eB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1083665'),
  ('1081896522590066772', 'Monster on a Plane', 2024, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Ezra Tsegaye', 'Ezra Tsegaye', 'Eva Habermann, Robin Czerny, Philippe Brenninkmeyer, Dieter Landuris, Fred Aaron Blake, Anthony Straeger, Nicolás Artajo, Steven Preisner', null, 'An exotic animal turns into a monster and becomes a deadly danger for all passengers.', 'An exotic animal turns into a monster and becomes a deadly danger for all passengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fBcq5WiH3z4YGjS2iVESRKxcW4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1270125'),
  ('21044629195660665', 'Monster on the Campus', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jack Arnold, Russell Metty', 'David Duncan', 'Arthur Franz, Joanna Moore, Judson Pratt, Troy Donahue, Nancy Walters, Helen Westcott, Ross Elliott, Alexander Lockwood', null, 'A college paleontology professor acquires a newly discovered specimen of a coelacanth, but while examining it, he is accidentally exposed to its blood, and finds himself periodically turning into a murderous Neanderthal man.', 'A college paleontology professor acquires a newly discovered specimen of a coelacanth, but while examining it, he is accidentally exposed to its blood, and finds himself periodically turning into a murderous Neanderthal man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHpJmCYZq5qnDP1MSeUAEBE44gU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34593'),
  ('131479952074021596', 'Monster Party', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Chris von Hoffmann, Tobias Deml', 'Chris von Hoffmann', 'Sam Strike, Erin Moriarty, Kian Lawley, Robin Tunney, Julian McMahon, Lance Reddick, Virginia Gardner, Brandon Micheal Hall', null, 'Three teenage thieves infiltrate a mansion dinner party, unaware that it is secretly being hosted by a serial killer cult for the social elite.', 'Three teenage thieves infiltrate a mansion dinner party, unaware that it is secretly being hosted by a serial killer cult for the social elite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fF650Hj5CvFyTOS6aDmPjjw7i4Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458969'),
