  ('973592214781533174', 'Monster Planet of Godzilla', 1994, 'Science Fiction', 'Koichi Kawakita, Kenichi Eguchi, Kenji Suzuki', 'Marimaru Teruma, Marie Terunuma', 'Megumi Odaka, Kenpachirō Satsuma, Megumi Hayashibara, Iemasa Kayumi, Tadashi Nakamura, Kaneto Shiozawa', null, 'A former 3D theme park attraction at Sanrio Puroland. A spaceship called Earth is dispatched to investigate the disappearance of its counterpart on a monster-filled planet beyond our Solar System. Once there, it quickly spots the downed craft, and is promptly attacked by Mothra and Rodan. It spots Godzilla and opens fire on him, giving the Planet enough time to escape.', 'A former 3D theme park attraction at Sanrio Puroland. A spaceship called Earth is dispatched to investigate the disappearance of its counterpart on a monster-filled planet beyond our Solar System. Once there, it quickly spots the downed craft, and is promptly attacked by Mothra and Rodan. It spots Godzilla and opens fire on him, giving the Planet enough time to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88QGxmYqozn7Y0ZrlzNhF97BEf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574986'),
  ('47315053977117931', 'Monster Portal', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Matthew B.C., Jack Peter Mundy', 'Matthew B.C.', 'Sian Altman, Sarah Alexandra Marks, Louis James, Judy Tcherniak, George Nettleton, Richard Harfst', null, 'A young woman inherits her estranged father''s estate after his mysterious death. Once she and her friends arrive at the mansion, they discover that the home is on an old cemetery, which has the power of opening a portal to another realm, which contains the creatures foretold to the world by writer H.P. Lovecraft.', 'A young woman inherits her estranged father''s estate after his mysterious death. Once she and her friends arrive at the mansion, they discover that the home is on an old cemetery, which has the power of opening a portal to another realm, which contains the creatures foretold to the world by writer H.P. Lovecraft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8R7LbNCvDMFq3dCGaVbH6tPHd69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:891931'),
  ('1016934347069935577', 'Monster Run', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Henri Wong, Ho Po-Wing, Charlie Lam Chi-Kin', 'A. Lee Martinez, Alex Zhang, Fan Wenwen', 'Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Jessie Li, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Qiao Shan, Tu Men, Wang Yutian, Yang Di, Wang Zhener', null, 'Ji Mo is an outcast, due to her ability to see monsters that no one else can. One day, she meets a monster hunter, Meng. She discovers that there really are monsters in the world, and she is involved in a new storm.', 'Ji Mo is an outcast, due to her ability to see monsters that no one else can. One day, she meets a monster hunter, Meng. She discovers that there really are monsters in the world, and she is involved in a new storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18mwyI7hSaXwqfJazyCbCEq4TLl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734355'),
  ('914349239189182564', 'Monster Summer', 2024, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Mystery, Horror', 'David Henrie, Jordan Roby, Larry Blanford', 'Cornelius Uliano, Bryan Schulz', 'Mel Gibson, Mason Thames, Julian Lerner, Abby James Witherspoon, Noah Cottrell, Nora Zehetner, Lorraine Bracco, Emma Fasano', 'PG-13', 'When a mysterious force begins to disrupt their big summer fun, Noah and his friends team up with a retired police detective to embark on a monstrous adventure to save their island.', 'When a mysterious force begins to disrupt their big summer fun, Noah and his friends team up with a retired police detective to embark on a monstrous adventure to save their island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zD2UZkh0DwbDEMuOKIR7jgwgulZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928480'),
  ('932100984170834232', 'Monster Truck Mater', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure, Action', 'John Lasseter, Rob Gibbs', 'Rob Gibbs, Kevin O''Brien, Derek Thompson', 'Larry the Cable Guy, Keith Ferguson, Jess Harnell, Jan Rabson, Simon Petrie, James Rankin, Danny Mann, Frank Welker', null, 'As a professional monster truck wrestler, Mater must work his way up through the ranks from an amateur tow truck to World Champion Monster Truck Wrestler. But rival wrestlers I-Screamer, Captain Collision, and The Rasta Carian aren''t about to give up without a fight.', 'As a professional monster truck wrestler, Mater must work his way up through the ranks from an amateur tow truck to World Champion Monster Truck Wrestler. But rival wrestlers I-Screamer, Captain Collision, and The Rasta Carian aren''t about to give up without a fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikdzBp4KIDazYgbJJLakZJmfnhn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148605'),
  ('1043749968659413890', 'Monster Trucks', 2016, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Chris Wedge, Spiro Razatos, Don Burgess', 'Derek Connolly', 'Lucas Till, Jane Levy, Amy Ryan, Rob Lowe, Danny Glover, Barry Pepper, Jedidiah Goodacre, Holt McCallany', 'PG', 'Tripp is a high school senior with a knack for building trucks who makes an incredible discovery - a gas-guzzling creature named Creech. To protect his mischievous new friend, Tripp hides Creech under the hood of his latest creation, turning it into a real-life super-powered Monster Truck. Together, this unlikely duo with a shared taste for speed team up on a wild and unforgettable journey to reunite Creech with his family.', 'Tripp is a high school senior with a knack for building trucks who makes an incredible discovery - a gas-guzzling creature named Creech. To protect his mischievous new friend, Tripp hides Creech under the hood of his latest creation, turning it into a real-life super-powered Monster Truck. Together, this unlikely duo with a shared taste for speed team up on a wild and unforgettable journey to reunite Creech with his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUzNybWqURfeg9BveLr4GOVCkti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262841'),
  ('1130519971004253393', 'Monster-in-Law', 2005, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Russell Carpenter, Robert Luketic, Maria Mantia', 'Anya Kochoff', 'Jennifer Lopez, Jane Fonda, Michael Vartan, Wanda Sykes, Adam Scott, Monet Mazur, Annie Parisse, Will Arnett', 'PG-13', 'Office temp Charlotte Cantilini thinks she''s found Mr. Right when she starts dating gorgeous surgeon Dr. Kevin Fields. But there''s a problem standing in the way of everlasting bliss: Kevin''s overbearing and controlling mother, Viola. Fearing she''ll lose her son''s affections forever, Viola decides to break up the happy couple by becoming the world''s worst mother-in-law.', 'Office temp Charlotte Cantilini thinks she''s found Mr. Right when she starts dating gorgeous surgeon Dr. Kevin Fields. But there''s a problem standing in the way of everlasting bliss: Kevin''s overbearing and controlling mother, Viola. Fearing she''ll lose her son''s affections forever, Viola decides to break up the happy couple by becoming the world''s worst mother-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRqcGkIPdRbEaW0xMEA5kgceUF8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4379'),
  ('977312381597462660', 'Monster: The Josef Fritzl Story', 2010, 'Crime, Documentary', 'David Notman-Watt', null, 'Hans-Heinz Lenze, Karl Dunkl, Friedrich Leimlehner, Christine Ranner, Maria Neubauer, Paul Höra, Elfriede Höra, Paul Ruhdorfer', null, 'Interviews with family members, doctors, and victims of 73-year-old Josef Fritzl, who held his daughter captive in a basement for 24 years and fathered seven children with her.', 'Interviews with family members, doctors, and victims of 73-year-old Josef Fritzl, who held his daughter captive in a basement for 24 years and fathered seven children with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHduqxMjZrfZ2wJofh9u4SZXANC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354870'),
  ('602431560607703507', 'Monster!', 1999, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'David Foreman, John Lafia', 'Ronnie Christensen', 'Tobias Mehler, Angela Keep, Brendan Cowell, David Ross Paterson, Jonathan Oldham, M. Emmet Walsh, Bianca Nacson, Ashley Gavin', null, 'Tragedy strikes a small town''s monster movie festival when the monster featured in the films comes to life.', 'Tragedy strikes a small town''s monster movie festival when the monster featured in the films comes to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKdlungyVQdH1h6aGdvSpJXPvoP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193166'),
  ('895330430531319592', 'Monster''s Ball', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roberto Schaefer, Marc Forster', 'Milo Addica, Will Rokos', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Heath Ledger, Halle Berry, Sean Combs, Yasiin Bey, Will Rokos, Milo Addica, Coronji Calhoun', 'R', 'A prison guard begins a tentative romance with the unsuspecting widow of a man whose execution he presided over.', 'A prison guard begins a tentative romance with the unsuspecting widow of a man whose execution he presided over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQeufx98gKH4CCeVw57KT1Fd0gr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1365'),
  ('242172253351181480', 'Monster''s Battlefield', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Xu Shixing', null, 'Zhang Meng, Li Ning, Gu Jing', null, 'The soldier king Qin Yang''s fiancée Ye Qin met with an unknown beast and died tragically. Gu Ping invites him to participate in Ye Qin''s scientific research before her death. But Gu Ping is using Ye Qin''s research results to combine the genes of unknown beasts to create the "Zero" dragon creature. The intelligent dragon creature, coupled with the extra-terrestrial beast evolved by devouring, an imminent city war is coming...', 'The soldier king Qin Yang''s fiancée Ye Qin met with an unknown beast and died tragically. Gu Ping invites him to participate in Ye Qin''s scientific research before her death. But Gu Ping is using Ye Qin''s research results to combine the genes of unknown beasts to create the "Zero" dragon creature. The intelligent dragon creature, coupled with the extra-terrestrial beast evolved by devouring, an imminent city war is coming...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBVYp2xxx2R02n21EGlDky8CgWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:920342'),
  ('791483624632098545', 'Monsternado', 2023, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ben J. Williams, Tyler-James, Vince Knight', 'Tyler-James', 'Derek Miller, May Kelly, Danielle Scott, Lila Lasso, Michael S. Siegel, Jase Rivers, Simon Ellis, Amanda Jane York', null, 'When a tornado full of creatures bursts through the city, a group are held at a hotel trying to figure out a way to survive!', 'When a tornado full of creatures bursts through the city, a group are held at a hotel trying to figure out a way to survive!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txA4srjcxa4HiWEaMyrNtWHbR5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1052158'),
  ('161848135495369537', 'Monsters', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Gareth Edwards, Gareth Edwards, George McKenzie', 'Gareth Edwards', 'Scoot McNairy, Whitney Able, Mario Zuniga Benavides, Annalee Jefferies, Justin Hall, Ricky Catter, Paul Archer, Kerry Valderrama', 'R', 'Six years ago NASA discovered the possibility of alien life within our solar system. A probe was launched to collect samples, but crashed upon re-entry over Central America. Soon after, new life forms began to appear and half of Mexico was quarantined as an infected zone. Today, the American and Mexican military still struggle to contain "the creatures," while a journalist agrees to escort a shaken tourist through the infected zone in Mexico to the safety of the U.S. border.', 'Six years ago NASA discovered the possibility of alien life within our solar system. A probe was launched to collect samples, but crashed upon re-entry over Central America. Soon after, new life forms began to appear and half of Mexico was quarantined as an infected zone. Today, the American and Mexican military still struggle to contain "the creatures," while a journalist agrees to escort a shaken tourist through the infected zone in Mexico to the safety of the U.S. border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpJyTxR33KG9qFmXoCD5AUTToPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43933'),
  ('47075251057301394', 'Monsters 103 Mercies Dragon Damnation', 2024, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Sunghoo Park, Jumi Lee, Akiko Fujita', 'Sunghoo Park', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya, Kana Hanazawa, Hiroki Touchi, Mitsuaki Madono, Katsuhito Nomura, Takahiro Sumi, Masashi Nogawa, Tsumugi Ariga', 'R', 'A samurai''s path leads him to a young waitress whose hometown was destroyed by a dragon. He doesn''t want any trouble — but it finds them anyway.', 'A samurai''s path leads him to a young waitress whose hometown was destroyed by a dragon. He doesn''t want any trouble — but it finds them anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yG8QKnaiz7JoIMh3oxdm0JJN6IG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1230393'),
  ('265060181693391609', 'Monsters and Men', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Kat Hess, Laura Klein, Reinaldo Marcus Green', 'Reinaldo Marcus Green', 'John David Washington, Anthony Ramos, Kelvin Harrison Jr., Chanté Adams, Nicole Beharie, Rob Morgan, Jasmine Cephas Jones, Cara Buono', 'R', 'After capturing an illegal act of police violence on his cellphone, a Brooklyn street hustler sets off a series of events that alter the lives of a local police officer and a star high-school athlete.', 'After capturing an illegal act of police violence on his cellphone, a Brooklyn street hustler sets off a series of events that alter the lives of a local police officer and a star high-school athlete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6FtNjPCVF3yRMFGvbzNj56i1Dj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489934'),
  ('234484293500985879', 'Monsters Club', 2011, 'Drama', 'Toshiaki Toyoda, Toyotarô Shigemori', 'Toshiaki Toyoda', 'Eita Nagayama, Ken Ken, Yosuke Kubozuka, Jun Kunimura, Mayuu Kusakari, Miyuki Matsuda, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Pyûpiru', null, 'Having abandoned modern civilization, Ryoichi lives an isolated, self-sufficient life on a snow-covered mountain and sends mail bombs to the CEOs of corporations and TV networks. One day, he encounters a mysterious creature in the forest. That night, his older brother, who had committed suicide, appears before him at his cabin. The apparition takes Ryoichi beyond a door, where Ryoichi learns the truth about his family.', 'Having abandoned modern civilization, Ryoichi lives an isolated, self-sufficient life on a snow-covered mountain and sends mail bombs to the CEOs of corporations and TV networks. One day, he encounters a mysterious creature in the forest. That night, his older brother, who had committed suicide, appears before him at his cabin. The apparition takes Ryoichi beyond a door, where Ryoichi learns the truth about his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2dZqIgfVGZ4tqz1XW35yjFgbw8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106432'),
  ('962378749535372649', 'Monsters of Man', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Mark Toia, Mark Toia, Shannon Makhanian', 'Mark Toia, Jeff Hand', 'Neal McDonough, Brett Tutor, Jose Rosete, David Haverty, Paul Haapaniemi, Ryan Hough, Ma Rynet, Kayli Tran', 'R', 'A robotics company vying to win a lucrative military contract team up with a corrupt CIA agent to conduct an illegal live field test. They deploy four weaponized prototype robots into a suspected drug manufacturing camp in the Golden Triangle, assuming they''d be killing drug runners that no one would miss. Six doctors on a humanitarian mission witness the brutal slaughter and become prime targets.', 'A robotics company vying to win a lucrative military contract team up with a corrupt CIA agent to conduct an illegal live field test. They deploy four weaponized prototype robots into a suspected drug manufacturing camp in the Golden Triangle, assuming they''d be killing drug runners that no one would miss. Six doctors on a humanitarian mission witness the brutal slaughter and become prime targets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sENLgxCVtZqCMQIeuLep8FmdInr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:733317'),
  ('3906791937594954', 'Monsters Run', 1987, 'Drama', 'Saeid Shimi, Ali Abdel-Khalek, Amr Bayoumi', 'Mahmoud Abu Zaid', 'Mahmoud Abdel Aziz, Nour El-Sherif, Hussein Fahmy, Hussein ElSherbiny, Noura, Fouad Khalil, Naima ElSoghier, Abd Allah Meshref', null, 'Said and Nabil are friends. Said can''t have children, and Dr. Nabil decides to help him by transplanting part of the brain of poor man Abdul Qawi to him, who suffers from severe fatigue after the operation, while Said is unable to have children despite the success of the operation.', 'Said and Nabil are friends. Said can''t have children, and Dr. Nabil decides to help him by transplanting part of the brain of poor man Abdul Qawi to him, who suffers from severe fatigue after the operation, while Said is unable to have children despite the success of the operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/665P7qLdHMIvkwYPfEDkaV84iyD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383922'),
  ('1027154047710620643', 'Monsters University', 2013, 'Animation, Family', 'Dan Scanlon, Sanjay Bakshi, Jean-Claude Kalache', 'Daniel Gerson, Robert L. Baird, Dan Scanlon', 'Billy Crystal, John Goodman, Steve Buscemi, Helen Mirren, Peter Sohn, Joel Murray, Sean Hayes, Dave Foley', 'G', 'A look at the relationship between Mike and Sulley during their days at Monsters University — when they weren''t necessarily the best of friends.', 'A look at the relationship between Mike and Sulley during their days at Monsters University — when they weren''t necessarily the best of friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7thwJ7z5Bplv6vwl6RI0yteaDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62211'),
  ('465123971239304257', 'Monsters vs Aliens', 2009, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Conrad Vernon, Rob Letterman', 'Jonathan Aibel, Rob Letterman, Maya Forbes', 'Reese Witherspoon, Seth Rogen, Hugh Laurie, Rainn Wilson, Will Arnett, Kiefer Sutherland, Paul Rudd, Stephen Colbert', 'PG', 'When Susan Murphy is unwittingly clobbered by a meteor full of outer space gunk on her wedding day, she mysteriously grows to 49-feet-11-inches. The military jumps into action and captures Susan, secreting her away to a covert government compound. She is renamed Ginormica and placed in confinement with a ragtag group of Monsters...', 'When Susan Murphy is unwittingly clobbered by a meteor full of outer space gunk on her wedding day, she mysteriously grows to 49-feet-11-inches. The military jumps into action and captures Susan, secreting her away to a covert government compound. She is renamed Ginormica and placed in confinement with a ragtag group of Monsters...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpHarddVj34j53T7NsoUGdKj4mP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15512'),
  ('310988584789160459', 'Monsters, Inc.', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Thomas Porter, Doug Sweetland, Scott Clark', 'Andrew Stanton, Daniel Gerson', 'John Goodman, Billy Crystal, Mary Gibbs, Steve Buscemi, James Coburn, Jennifer Tilly, Bob Peterson, John Ratzenberger', 'G', 'Lovable Sulley and his wisecracking sidekick Mike Wazowski are the top scare team at Monsters, Inc., the scream-processing factory in Monstropolis. When a little girl named Boo wanders into their world, it''s the monsters who are scared silly, and it''s up to Sulley and Mike to keep her out of sight and get her back home.', 'Lovable Sulley and his wisecracking sidekick Mike Wazowski are the top scare team at Monsters, Inc., the scream-processing factory in Monstropolis. When a little girl named Boo wanders into their world, it''s the monsters who are scared silly, and it''s up to Sulley and Mike to keep her out of sight and get her back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFSpyMsp7H0ttERbxY7Trlv8xry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585'),
  ('489196632068765866', 'Monsters: Dark Continent', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Tom Green, Christopher Ross', 'Jay Basu, Tom Green', 'Johnny Harris, Sam Keeley, Joe Dempsie, Kyle Soller, Nicholas Pinnock, Parker Sawyers, Sofia Boutella, Michaela Coel', 'R', 'Seven years on from the events of Monsters, and the ‘Infected Zones’ have spread worldwide. Humans have been knocked off the top of the food chain, with disparate communities struggling for survival. American soldiers are being sent abroad to protect US interests from the Monsters, but the war is far from being won.', 'Seven years on from the events of Monsters, and the ‘Infected Zones’ have spread worldwide. Humans have been knocked off the top of the food chain, with disparate communities struggling for survival. American soldiers are being sent abroad to protect US interests from the Monsters, but the war is far from being won.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQ3uSRb0wrgJf9sWc8LxYbnqltC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145221'),
  ('756910741699487498', 'Monsterz', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Hideo Nakata, Yuji Shimomura, Ryuichi Saeki', 'Kim Min-suk', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Takayuki Yamada, Satomi Ishihara, Tomorowo Taguchi, Motoki Ochiai, Taiga Nakano, Mina Fujii, Yutaka Matsushige', null, 'A somber paranormal thriller that offers an original, exciting variation of the tale of two men with supernatural abilities, locked in a duel to the death. A battle between a man who can control people with a stare, and the only man he cannot control. When their fate cross, the survival battle begins. The two men with inevitable fate, who will survive?', 'A somber paranormal thriller that offers an original, exciting variation of the tale of two men with supernatural abilities, locked in a duel to the death. A battle between a man who can control people with a stare, and the only man he cannot control. When their fate cross, the survival battle begins. The two men with inevitable fate, who will survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/segpN4WxESpyy5id0KksMUOvL7i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274804'),
  ('526954178715001698', 'Monstroid', 1980, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Herbert L. Strock, Kenneth Hartford, Art Fitzsimmons', 'Herbert L. Strock, Walter Roeber Schmidt, Kenneth Hartford', 'James Mitchum, John Carradine, Philip Carey, Anthony Eisley, Andrea Hartford, Glen Hartford, Coral Kassel, Hanna Landy', 'R', 'A rural Colombian village is attacked by a horrible sea serpent, aroused by industrial pollution of a nearby lake. Based on a real event that took place in June of 1971.', 'A rural Colombian village is attacked by a horrible sea serpent, aroused by industrial pollution of a nearby lake. Based on a real event that took place in June of 1971.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rG2KFIAgJ7IFuwHBgcf8PiZrVJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43717'),
  ('566689254662073188', 'Monstrosity', 1963, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Joseph V. Mascelli, Alfred Taylor', 'Sue Dwiggins, Dean Dillman Jr., Vy Russell', 'Marjorie Eaton, Frank Gerstle, Frank Fowler, Erika Peters, Judy Bamber, Lisa Lang, Margie Fisco, Kemp Niver', 'NR', 'A rich but unscrupulous old woman plots with a scientist to have her brain implanted in the skull of a sexy young woman.', 'A rich but unscrupulous old woman plots with a scientist to have her brain implanted in the skull of a sexy young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3bIRCcoSIRbqneTtnooDmK4n4V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37464'),
  ('1106568153774347311', 'Monstrous', 2020, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Bruce Wemple, Bruce Wemple', 'Anna Shields', 'Anna Shields, Rachel Finninger, Hannah McKechnie, Catharine Daddario, Kyrie Ellison-Keller, Dylan Grunn, Peter Stray, Rick Montgomery Jr.', 'NR', 'A young woman goes searching for answers after her friend mysteriously vanishes in Whitehall, NY, an Adirondack town known for its Bigfoot sightings. She quickly learns that hiding in the woods is an evil more sinister than she could ever imagine.', 'A young woman goes searching for answers after her friend mysteriously vanishes in Whitehall, NY, an Adirondack town known for its Bigfoot sightings. She quickly learns that hiding in the woods is an evil more sinister than she could ever imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJpCACcYsEfBVuiYWSC1sxWyWOd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724427'),
  ('416421130688959742', 'Monstrous', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Senda Bonnet, Chris Sivertson, Jamie Snow', 'Carol Chrest', 'Christina Ricci, Santino Barnard, Don Baldaramos, Colleen Camp, Lew Temple, Carol Anne Watts, Peter Hodge, Nick Vallelonga', 'PG-13', 'Laura, traumatized by an abusive relationship, runs away from her former husband with her seven-year-old son Cody. But in their new, idyllic and remote sanctuary, they find they have another, bigger and more terrifying monster to deal with…', 'Laura, traumatized by an abusive relationship, runs away from her former husband with her seven-year-old son Cody. But in their new, idyllic and remote sanctuary, they find they have another, bigger and more terrifying monster to deal with…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEOZlqNHRCM0ME7rRQ79Yc2apPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811656'),
  ('509680215077686213', 'Monstrum', 2018, 'Action, Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Kim Hyeong-yong, Huh Jong-ho, Kim Dong-young', 'Huh Jong-ho, Heo Dam', 'Kim Myung-min, Kim In-kwon, Lee Hye-ri, Choi Woo-shik, Lee Kyung-young, Park Hee-soon, Park Sung-woong, Lee Do-gyeong', null, 'Ancient Korea, 1506. The tyrannical King Yeonsan-gun of Joseon is overthrown by his half-brother Jung-jong, whose reign begins with a blood bath. Over the years, traitors plot against him, sinking the kingdom into chaos. In 1528, frightened rumors come to royal palace, regarding a mysterious creature, known as Monstrum by the peasants.', 'Ancient Korea, 1506. The tyrannical King Yeonsan-gun of Joseon is overthrown by his half-brother Jung-jong, whose reign begins with a blood bath. Over the years, traitors plot against him, sinking the kingdom into chaos. In 1528, frightened rumors come to royal palace, regarding a mysterious creature, known as Monstrum by the peasants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4O2xrVNRxu78Bs1CbBfFe3vnSQC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523593'),
  ('838670087333873067', 'Montage', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Jeong Geun-seop, Koh Jung-wook', 'Jeong Geun-seop', 'Uhm Jung-hwa, Kim Sang-kyung, Song Young-chang, Jo Hee-bong, Jung Hae-kyun, Yoo Seung-mok, Park Cheol-min, Ki Joo-bong', null, 'A woman''s child is kidnapped and killed after paying the ransom. 15 years later, a mysterious figure is seen visiting the site of killing and another kidnapping occurs using the same methods. The woman teams up with a detective to catch the killer once and for all.', 'A woman''s child is kidnapped and killed after paying the ransom. 15 years later, a mysterious figure is seen visiting the site of killing and another kidnapping occurs using the same methods. The woman teams up with a detective to catch the killer once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEgquyjTJXuhYpacJIivoOmDUcs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195276'),
  ('562492011377529868', 'Montana', 1950, 'Western, Action, Adventure, Romance', 'Ray Enright, Raoul Walsh, Karl Freund', 'Borden Chase, Charles O''Neal, James R. Webb', 'Errol Flynn, Alexis Smith, S.Z. Sakall, Douglas Kennedy, James Brown, Ian MacDonald, Charles Irwin, Paul E. Burns', 'NR', 'An Australian sheep man comes to Montana looking for grazing space, is opposed by local ranchers and a wealthy cattle-woman.', 'An Australian sheep man comes to Montana looking for grazing space, is opposed by local ranchers and a wealthy cattle-woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLEql6TNUiKPYtYrOaUqO95M9sP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121707'),
