  ('358603125924253269', 'Monte Cristo', 1922, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lucien N. Andriot, Emmett J. Flynn', 'Sandro Salvini, Charles Fechter, Bernard McConville', 'John Gilbert, Estelle Taylor, Robert McKim, William V. Mong, Virginia Brown Faire, George Siegmann, Spottiswoode Aitken, Ralph Cloninger', 'NR', 'A film adaptation of the classic Alexandre Dumas novel. Edmond Dantes is falsely accused by those jealous of his good fortune, and is sentenced to spend the rest of his life in the notorious island prison, Chateau d''If. While imprisoned, he meets the Abbe Faria, a fellow prisoner whom everyone believes to be mad. The Abbe tells Edmond of a fantastic treasure hidden away on a tiny island, that only he knows the location of...', 'A film adaptation of the classic Alexandre Dumas novel. Edmond Dantes is falsely accused by those jealous of his good fortune, and is sentenced to spend the rest of his life in the notorious island prison, Chateau d''If. While imprisoned, he meets the Abbe Faria, a fellow prisoner whom everyone believes to be mad. The Abbe tells Edmond of a fantastic treasure hidden away on a tiny island, that only he knows the location of...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOauHonanbzEwhtRd7bYz36E3Lc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175502'),
  ('681394792225813851', 'Monte Cristo', 1929, 'Adventure', 'Henri Fescourt, Julien Ringel, Enrique Barreyre', 'Henri Fescourt, Armand Salacrou, Armand Salacrou', 'Jean Angelo, Lil Dagover, Gaston Modot, Jean Toulout, Marie Glory, Michèle Verly, Pierre Batcheff, Tamara Stezenko', null, 'This epic adaptation of The Count of Monte Cristo was directed by Henri Fescourt, and stars Jean Angelo, Lil Dagover, Pierre Batcheff, the beautiful Marie Glory, and Bernhard Goetzke as the Abbé Faria.', 'This epic adaptation of The Count of Monte Cristo was directed by Henri Fescourt, and stars Jean Angelo, Lil Dagover, Pierre Batcheff, the beautiful Marie Glory, and Bernhard Goetzke as the Abbé Faria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJi7aT4xwA00AsX6z7XkdVcNJZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190236'),
  ('784781197240082903', 'Monte Verità', 2021, 'History, Drama', 'Daniela Knapp, Stephan Rother, Stefan Jäger', 'Kornelija Naraks', 'Max Hubacher, Julia Jentsch, Hannah Herzsprung, Joel Basman, Maresi Riegner, Philipp Hauß, Daniel Brasini, Sabine Herget', null, 'Hanna Leitner, wants to escape the bourgeois corset and her husband Anton, who sexually harasses her. She goes into therapy with Otto Gross and follows him to Monte Verità, where she discovers the fascination of photography.', 'Hanna Leitner, wants to escape the bourgeois corset and her husband Anton, who sexually harasses her. She goes into therapy with Otto Gross and follows him to Monte Verità, where she discovers the fascination of photography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFSlJHUhhzPSDe9M3rKQZJFM4DR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846862'),
  ('71458722083500026', 'Monte Walsh', 1970, 'Western', 'William A. Fraker, David M. Walsh', 'David Zelag Goodman, Lukas Heller', 'Lee Marvin, Jeanne Moreau, Jack Palance, Mitchell Ryan, Jim Davis, G.D. Spradlin, John Hudkins, Raymond Guth', 'PG-13', 'Monte Walsh is an aging cowboy facing the ending days of the Wild West era. As barbed wire and railways steadily eliminate the need for the cowboy, Monte and his friends are left with fewer and fewer options. New work opportunities are available to them, but the freedom of the open prarie is what they long for. Eventually, they all must say goodbye to the lives they knew, and try to make a new start.', 'Monte Walsh is an aging cowboy facing the ending days of the Wild West era. As barbed wire and railways steadily eliminate the need for the cowboy, Monte and his friends are left with fewer and fewer options. New work opportunities are available to them, but the freedom of the open prarie is what they long for. Eventually, they all must say goodbye to the lives they knew, and try to make a new start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oASAa5HE0J4lqfIsaSegzglU9ij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71244'),
  ('774250587481661920', 'Monte Walsh', 2003, 'Western', 'Simon Wincer, David Eggby, Walter Scott', null, 'Tom Selleck, Isabella Rossellini, Keith Carradine, George Eads, Robert Carradine, Barry Corbin, James Gammon, Rex Linn', null, 'Monte Walsh and Chet Rollins are long-time cowhands, working whatever ranch work comes their way, but "nothing they can''t do from a horse." Their lives are divided between months on the range and the occasional trip into town. Monte has a long-term relationship with prostitute Martine Bernard, while Chet has fallen under the spell of the widow who owns the hardware store. Camaraderie and competition with the other cowboys fill their days, until one of the hands, Shorty Austin, loses his job and gets involved in rustling and killing. Then Monte and Chet find that their lives on the range are inexorably redirected.', 'Monte Walsh and Chet Rollins are long-time cowhands, working whatever ranch work comes their way, but "nothing they can''t do from a horse." Their lives are divided between months on the range and the occasional trip into town. Monte has a long-term relationship with prostitute Martine Bernard, while Chet has fallen under the spell of the widow who owns the hardware store. Camaraderie and competition with the other cowboys fill their days, until one of the hands, Shorty Austin, loses his job and gets involved in rustling and killing. Then Monte and Chet find that their lives on the range are inexorably redirected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zQ4b28cAvV8sUNl40kBq6relH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37348'),
  ('249813176548217978', 'Montecarlo Gran Casinò', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Rinaldo Ricci, Barbara Straziota', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Boldi, Ezio Greggio, Paolo Rossi, Enrico Beruschi, Florence Guérin, Philippe Leroy, Antonello Fassari', null, 'The misadventures of different Italian rascals who came to the famous Montecarlo Gran Casinò to get lucky.', 'The misadventures of different Italian rascals who came to the famous Montecarlo Gran Casinò to get lucky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/feMGrBvd9qVbIRxt3YsPYNbgwwm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130490'),
  ('17353406686928510', 'Montenegro', 1981, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Bojana Marijan, Tomislav Pinter, Dušan Makavejev', 'Donald Arthur, Branko Vučićević, Dušan Makavejev', 'Susan Anspach, Erland Josephson, Marianna Jacobi, Jamie Marsh, John Zacharias, Per Oscarsson, Marina Lindahl, Borivoje Todorović', null, 'Marilyn Jordan, an American, lives in Stockholm with her Swedish husband and family. Her behavior is bizarre, perhaps mad: she poisons the dog''s milk and advises the dog not to drink it; she sets the sheets afire as her husband sleeps; she crawls under the dining table to sing. While detained at airport customs for carrying pruning shears, she meets a young Yugoslav woman and goes with her to a Gypsy enclave where she''s fought over, takes a lover, helps with the sordid entertainment at a bar, and returns home more dangerous than before. The film also tells parallel stories of Marilyn''s daughter becoming a junior homemaker as the young immigrant practices her striptease.', 'Marilyn Jordan, an American, lives in Stockholm with her Swedish husband and family. Her behavior is bizarre, perhaps mad: she poisons the dog''s milk and advises the dog not to drink it; she sets the sheets afire as her husband sleeps; she crawls under the dining table to sing. While detained at airport customs for carrying pruning shears, she meets a young Yugoslav woman and goes with her to a Gypsy enclave where she''s fought over, takes a lover, helps with the sordid entertainment at a bar, and returns home more dangerous than before. The film also tells parallel stories of Marilyn''s daughter becoming a junior homemaker as the young immigrant practices her striptease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqjTU2Tqpid0349OSBvSuz523bf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82523'),
  ('383851844506329802', 'Monterey Pop', 1968, 'Music, Documentary', 'D. A. Pennebaker', null, 'Scott McKenzie, Denny Doherty, Cass Elliot, John Phillips, Michelle Phillips, Frank Cook, Bob Hite, Larry Taylor', 'NR', 'Featuring performances by popular artists of the 1960s, this concert film highlights the music of the 1967 California festival. Although not all musicians who performed at the Monterey Pop Festival are on film, some of the notable acts include the Mamas and the Papas, Simon & Garfunkel, Jefferson Airplane, the Who, Otis Redding, and the Jimi Hendrix Experience. Hendrix''s post-performance antics -- lighting a guitar on fire, breaking it and tossing a part into the audience -- are captured.', 'Featuring performances by popular artists of the 1960s, this concert film highlights the music of the 1967 California festival. Although not all musicians who performed at the Monterey Pop Festival are on film, some of the notable acts include the Mamas and the Papas, Simon & Garfunkel, Jefferson Airplane, the Who, Otis Redding, and the Jimi Hendrix Experience. Hendrix''s post-performance antics -- lighting a guitar on fire, breaking it and tossing a part into the audience -- are captured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEB3c5Y5spAHOQaFWcsfFky3SWb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42632'),
  ('742494967965705155', 'Montevideo, God Bless You!', 2010, 'Adventure, History, Romance', 'Dragan Bjelogrlić, Goran Volarević', 'Ranko Božić, Srđan Dragojević', 'Miloš Biković, Petar Strugar, Viktor Savić, Nina Janković, Predrag Vasić, Vojin Ćetković, Nikola Đuričko, Slobodan ''Boda'' Ninković', null, 'A story about one team that decides to follow a dream that takes them on a journey to the First World Football Championship in Montevideo, Uruguay in 1930. A dream that allows them to become true stars and living legends.', 'A story about one team that decides to follow a dream that takes them on a journey to the First World Football Championship in Montevideo, Uruguay in 1930. A dream that allows them to become true stars and living legends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odJAlLJFfsGZcxracqeeqk1O7Hj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57419'),
  ('988933903032226062', 'Montparnasse', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Eugène Deslaw', null, 'Luis Buñuel, Fujita, Filippo Tommaso Marinetti, Enrico Prampolini, Luigi Russolo', null, 'Come take an avant-garde walk in the Montparnasse of the late 1920''s. This district of Paris, filmed in a most unusual way, shows how dedicated it is to art. Visit its art galleries and exhibitions, take a glimpse of famous painter Fujita, of Luis Buñuel eyeing the legs of beautiful Parisian passing the terrace of the café where he sits, of Italian futurists Marinetti, Prampolini and Russolo.', 'Come take an avant-garde walk in the Montparnasse of the late 1920''s. This district of Paris, filmed in a most unusual way, shows how dedicated it is to art. Visit its art galleries and exhibitions, take a glimpse of famous painter Fujita, of Luis Buñuel eyeing the legs of beautiful Parisian passing the terrace of the café where he sits, of Italian futurists Marinetti, Prampolini and Russolo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pu75TXBXlPE1AH5EYxvaVcXEMys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190312'),
  ('36516951589951459', 'Montreal Main', 1974, 'Drama', 'Frank Vitale', 'Frank Vitale', 'John Sutherland, Stephen Lack, Allan Moyle, Frank Vitale, Peter Brawley', null, 'An open and honest autobiographical account of male sexuality centered on Frank, an unemployed photographer, and his circle of mainly gay friends. He and his best friend, Bozo, attempt to have sex, although they consider themselves straight. But things begin to fall apart when Frank meets and falls in love with Johnny, a 13-year-old boy.', 'An open and honest autobiographical account of male sexuality centered on Frank, an unemployed photographer, and his circle of mainly gay friends. He and his best friend, Bozo, attempt to have sex, although they consider themselves straight. But things begin to fall apart when Frank meets and falls in love with Johnny, a 13-year-old boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urfdCi791q5dCGUY4FLdOkcXxab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78091'),
  ('593552964767082868', 'Montreal Stories', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michel Brault, Jacques Leduc, Léa Pool', 'Michel Brault, Paule Baillargeon, Atom Egoyan', 'Jacques Allard, Denys Arcand, Barbara Arsenault, Nancy Arsenault, Philippe Ayoub, Paule Baillargeon, Michael Barnard, Michel Barrette', null, 'Six stories about Montreal. 1: A young housewife from Toronto samples the nightlife using basic French. 2: The tale of a painting of Montreal''s first mayor, Jacques Viger. 3: During a hockey game, Madeleine tries to tell Roger she wants a divorce after forty years of marriage. 4: A visitor to a conference on pictographs arrives at the airport, where the female customs officer steals a momento from each person. 5: As she is being driven to the hospital in an ambulance after an auto accident, Sarah recalls her life. 6: At a diplomatic reception, an older woman reminisces about her grand love in Montreal.', 'Six stories about Montreal. 1: A young housewife from Toronto samples the nightlife using basic French. 2: The tale of a painting of Montreal''s first mayor, Jacques Viger. 3: During a hockey game, Madeleine tries to tell Roger she wants a divorce after forty years of marriage. 4: A visitor to a conference on pictographs arrives at the airport, where the female customs officer steals a momento from each person. 5: As she is being driven to the hospital in an ambulance after an auto accident, Sarah recalls her life. 6: At a diplomatic reception, an older woman reminisces about her grand love in Montreal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVYeReqYMZxFlZUc1PlAO8yfPpr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162832'),
  ('496485528663938822', 'Monty Python and the Holy Grail', 1975, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Terry Gilliam, Terry Jones, Terry Bedford', 'Graham Chapman, John Cleese, Eric Idle', 'Graham Chapman, John Cleese, Eric Idle, Terry Gilliam, Terry Jones, Michael Palin, Connie Booth, Carol Cleveland', 'PG', 'King Arthur, accompanied by his squire, recruits his Knights of the Round Table, including Sir Bedevere the Wise, Sir Lancelot the Brave, Sir Robin the Not-Quite-So-Brave-As-Sir-Lancelot and Sir Galahad the Pure. On the way, Arthur battles the Black Knight who, despite having had all his limbs chopped off, insists he can still fight. They reach Camelot, but Arthur decides not to enter, as "it is a silly place".', 'King Arthur, accompanied by his squire, recruits his Knights of the Round Table, including Sir Bedevere the Wise, Sir Lancelot the Brave, Sir Robin the Not-Quite-So-Brave-As-Sir-Lancelot and Sir Galahad the Pure. On the way, Arthur battles the Black Knight who, despite having had all his limbs chopped off, insists he can still fight. They reach Camelot, but Arthur decides not to enter, as "it is a silly place".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3rksLHevpCbHfSoaUXm85nt2CH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762'),
  ('341001090688081497', 'Monty Python Live (Mostly)', 2014, 'Comedy, Music, Documentary', 'Eric Idle, Aubrey Powell, Brett Turnbull', 'Terry Gilliam, Eric Idle, Terry Jones', 'John Cleese, Terry Gilliam, Eric Idle, Terry Jones, Michael Palin, Carol Cleveland, Eddie Izzard, Stephen Hawking', 'R', 'Celebrate the last night of the Pythons on the big screen! With John Cleese, Eric Idle, Terry Gilliam, Terry Jones and Michael Palin.', 'Celebrate the last night of the Pythons on the big screen! With John Cleese, Eric Idle, Terry Gilliam, Terry Jones and Michael Palin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1m6bwNJujUBFB0ZdAKXSJRD8OW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282268'),
  ('827276903379192640', 'Monty Python Live at the Hollywood Bowl', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Ian MacNaughton, Terry Hughes', 'John Cleese, Terry Gilliam, Eric Idle', 'Terry Gilliam, John Cleese, Graham Chapman, Eric Idle, Terry Jones, Michael Palin, Neil Innes, Carol Cleveland', 'R', 'Monty Python perform many of their greatest sketches at the Hollywood Bowl, including several from pre-Python days.', 'Monty Python perform many of their greatest sketches at the Hollywood Bowl, including several from pre-Python days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sQPWnIUVswWtIl35Lj3VKW3Pz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11949'),
  ('947493423446511020', 'Monty Python: Live at Aspen', 1998, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Paul Miller', null, 'Robert Klein, John Cleese, Terry Gilliam, Eric Idle, Terry Jones, Michael Palin, Eddie Izzard, Graham Chapman', null, 'In March 1998 in Aspen, Colorado, the surviving members of the Monty Python team – John Cleese, Terry Gilliam, Eric Idle, Terry Jones and Michael Palin – shared a stage together for the first time in 18 years. Even more remarkably, Graham Chapman was there too....in an urn! The occasion for this reunion was the US Comedy Arts Festival Tribute to Monty Python, hosted by Robert Klein in front of a live audience.', 'In March 1998 in Aspen, Colorado, the surviving members of the Monty Python team – John Cleese, Terry Gilliam, Eric Idle, Terry Jones and Michael Palin – shared a stage together for the first time in 18 years. Even more remarkably, Graham Chapman was there too....in an urn! The occasion for this reunion was the US Comedy Arts Festival Tribute to Monty Python, hosted by Robert Klein in front of a live audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unhivN22zUqRmejp5XesfPFZRal.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84067'),
  ('414103568260193252', 'Monty Python''s The Meaning of Life', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Terry Jones, Peter Hannan, Roger Pratt', 'Graham Chapman, Terry Gilliam, Michael Palin', 'Terry Gilliam, Graham Chapman, John Cleese, Eric Idle, Terry Jones, Michael Palin, Carol Cleveland, Simon Jones', 'R', 'Life''s questions are ''answered'' in a series of outrageous vignettes, beginning with a staid London insurance company which transforms before our eyes into a pirate ship. Then there''s the National Health doctors who try to claim a healthy liver from a still-living donor. The world''s most voracious glutton brings the art of vomiting to new heights before his spectacular demise.', 'Life''s questions are ''answered'' in a series of outrageous vignettes, beginning with a staid London insurance company which transforms before our eyes into a pirate ship. Then there''s the National Health doctors who try to claim a healthy liver from a still-living donor. The world''s most voracious glutton brings the art of vomiting to new heights before his spectacular demise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yavZ9WgEZIpWi2EbVW8At9RPdo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4543'),
  ('517154153281545853', 'Monument Ave.', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Ted Demme, Adam Kimmel', 'Mike Armstrong', 'Denis Leary, Ian Hart, Jason Barry, Lenny Clarke, Kevin Chapman, George MacDonald, John Diehl, Lyndon Byers', 'R', 'Bobby O''Grady is a low level member of a Boston Irish gang run by Jackie O''Hara. Jackie demands absolute, total loyalty to him. When Jackie kills one of Bobby''s buddies, Teddy, Bobby and others have to keep it an absolute secret, even from their and Teddy''s relatives.', 'Bobby O''Grady is a low level member of a Boston Irish gang run by Jackie O''Hara. Jackie demands absolute, total loyalty to him. When Jackie kills one of Bobby''s buddies, Teddy, Bobby and others have to keep it an absolute secret, even from their and Teddy''s relatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IpSjfTzEWlHGTHAWNMToqznYn1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21132'),
  ('1037550801317391619', 'Mooch Goes to Hollywood', 1971, 'Comedy, Family', 'Richard Erdman, Allen Daviau, Ray Gosnell Jr.', 'Jim Backus, Jerry Devine', 'Vincent Price, James Darren, Jill St. John, Jim Backus, John Harding, Kim Hamilton, Gino Conforti, Jerry Hausner', null, 'A dog tries to become a canine star with the help of Zsa Zsa Gabor.', 'A dog tries to become a canine star with the help of Zsa Zsa Gabor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bVTwN4xgSI5qHJ1esRisSdUcNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143361'),
  ('841925736048131983', 'Mood Indigo', 2013, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Michel Gondry, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Luc Bossi, Michel Gondry', 'Romain Duris, Audrey Tautou, Gad Elmaleh, Omar Sy, Aïssa Maïga, Charlotte Le Bon, Sacha Bourdo, Philippe Torreton', null, 'A woman suffers from an unusual illness caused by a flower growing in her lungs.', 'A woman suffers from an unusual illness caused by a flower growing in her lungs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y41mndWYov3oPSZdHUtyjEdALvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157820'),
  ('338673954519539582', 'Mood of the Day', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Cho Kyu-jang, Bae Il-hyuck', 'Min So-yeon', 'Moon Chae-won, Yoo Yeon-seok, Jo Jae-yun, Kim Seul-gi, Park Min-woo, Lee Yeon-doo, Kim Dae-ryung, Lee Ju-woo', null, 'A train ride brings two unlikely souls together as Bae, a committed partner of a serious 10-year relationship, sees her world turned upside down by the charming playboy Kim. Seated together on a business trip from Seoul to Busan, the two find themselves on an adventure to remember.', 'A train ride brings two unlikely souls together as Bae, a committed partner of a serious 10-year relationship, sees her world turned upside down by the charming playboy Kim. Seated together on a business trip from Seoul to Busan, the two find themselves on an adventure to remember.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhXriyuGIH0oaU6HLHNF7ySXBD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376252'),
  ('170778867274254429', 'Moods of the Sea', 1942, 'Documentary', 'Slavko Vorkapich, John Hoffman', null, null, null, 'A recently unearthed experimental documentary of the crashing sea set to Mendelssohn''s "Fingal''s Cave." An example of the filmmakers'' "new cinema" theory which held that film should be more like music than literature. This film is based solely on its arrangement of images.', 'A recently unearthed experimental documentary of the crashing sea set to Mendelssohn''s "Fingal''s Cave." An example of the filmmakers'' "new cinema" theory which held that film should be more like music than literature. This film is based solely on its arrangement of images.', null, 'tmdb:movie:191383'),
  ('257249736288103008', 'Mookie', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Hervé Palud', 'Jean-Marie Pallardy, Simon Michaël, Hervé Palud', 'Éric Cantona, Jacques Villeret, Emiliano Suarez, Carla Ortiz, Harry Porter, Valérie Bonneton, Magda Brueggemann, Michel Elias', null, 'A talking chimp, a jolly monk and a boxer on the run make an unlikely team in this French comedy for children. Brother Benoit, a French monk working with underprivileged youth in Mexico, one day finds a sick chimpanzee in need of water and medical attention. He brings the chimp back to his mission and nurses her back to health, naming her Mookie. A year later, Brother Benoit discovers Mookie can not only play basketball, but she can talk, the result of an exposure to radiation from a meteor crash. Primate experts from America are eager to get their hands on the little ape, but the Brother will allow no experiments to be performed on her. The Brother recruits Antoine, a boxer down on his luck, to help Mookie and the Brother flee to Mexico City, but when it turns out Antoine is wanted by the Mexican Mafia for not throwing a fight, all three must make tracks to insure their safety.', 'A talking chimp, a jolly monk and a boxer on the run make an unlikely team in this French comedy for children. Brother Benoit, a French monk working with underprivileged youth in Mexico, one day finds a sick chimpanzee in need of water and medical attention. He brings the chimp back to his mission and nurses her back to health, naming her Mookie. A year later, Brother Benoit discovers Mookie can not only play basketball, but she can talk, the result of an exposure to radiation from a meteor crash. Primate experts from America are eager to get their hands on the little ape, but the Brother will allow no experiments to be performed on her. The Brother recruits Antoine, a boxer down on his luck, to help Mookie and the Brother flee to Mexico City, but when it turns out Antoine is wanted by the Mexican Mafia for not throwing a fight, all three must make tracks to insure their safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avNQsXeDq7VsrROxuju9c8qscLS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60863'),
  ('329917474504568264', 'Mookuthi Amman', 2020, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'NJ Saravanan, RJ Balaji, Dinesh Krishnan B.', 'RJ Balaji', 'Nayanthara, RJ Balaji, Urvashi, Mouli, Ajay Ghosh, Smruthi Venkat, Mayilsamy, Indhuja Ravichandran', null, 'A TV reporter, who has been gathering evidence to expose a self-styled godman for years, gets help from Goddess Mookuthi Amman. How does he utilise the situation to bring down the godman before the public?', 'A TV reporter, who has been gathering evidence to expose a self-styled godman for years, gets help from Goddess Mookuthi Amman. How does he utilise the situation to bring down the godman before the public?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Dra3OG3hmezurQoX5UOI8Mholv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:757545'),
  ('1051154854907669193', 'Moolaadé', 2004, 'Drama', 'Ousmane Sembène, Dominique Gentil', 'Ousmane Sembène', 'Fatoumata Coulibaly, Maimouna Hélène Diarra, Salimata Traoré, Dominique Zeïda, Rasmané Ouédraogo, Joseph Traoré, Théophile Sowié, Balla Habib Dembélé', null, 'When a woman shelters a group of girls from suffering female genital mutilation, she starts a conflict that tears her village apart.', 'When a woman shelters a group of girls from suffering female genital mutilation, she starts a conflict that tears her village apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9S7lWdLExHw6LP3Vq7smiyGY5MR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39504'),
  ('390409740088331478', 'Moon', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Duncan Jones, Gary Shaw, Henry Forsyth', 'Nathan Parker', 'Sam Rockwell, Kevin Spacey, Dominique McElligott, Rosie Shaw, Adrienne Shaw, Kaya Scodelario, Benedict Wong, Matt Berry', 'R', 'With only three weeks left in his three-year contract, Sam Bell is eager to return to Earth. Stationed alone at a Moon-based facility with his computer assistant GERTY, an unexpected accident sets off a series of unsettling events that shake his isolation.', 'With only three weeks left in his three-year contract, Sam Bell is eager to return to Earth. Stationed alone at a Moon-based facility with his computer assistant GERTY, an unexpected accident sets off a series of unsettling events that shake his isolation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35IU0Mq0zFsN1mYwDGts5mKc77n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17431'),
  ('883354574146279267', 'Moon', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Klemens Hufnagl, Kurdwin Ayub', 'Kurdwin Ayub', 'Florentina Holzinger, Andria Tayeh, Celina Antwan, Nagham Abu Baker, Omar AlMajali, Zayd Shilbaya, Tanja Ivankovic, Ammar Odeh', null, 'Sarah, a former professional kickboxer from Vienna, accepts an offer to work as a personal trainer for a rich family in the Middle East. She finds herself in a foreign world, in a palace behind walls and cut off from the internet, where the sisters are under surveillance around the clock. They have no interest in learning to box. So why has Sarah been brought here?', 'Sarah, a former professional kickboxer from Vienna, accepts an offer to work as a personal trainer for a rich family in the Middle East. She finds herself in a foreign world, in a palace behind walls and cut off from the internet, where the sisters are under surveillance around the clock. They have no interest in learning to box. So why has Sarah been brought here?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lkU7he9G8YGQqs7jabsRy2rBbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1172244'),
  ('1007483982673521752', 'Moon & Cherry', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yuki Tanada, Toshihiro Mito, Kei Yasuda', 'Yuki Tanada', 'Tasuku Nagaoka, Noriko Eguchi, Misato Hirata, Akira Emoto, Yoshikazu Ebisu, Akifumi Miura, Shungicu Uchida, Chad Mullane', null, 'When an alluring young woman joins an erotic writing class, she begins a game of sexual cat and mouse with a naïve college student. As they venture into more and more unpredictable territory in the bedroom, he begins to think she might be using him as a test subject for her fiction more than anything else.', 'When an alluring young woman joins an erotic writing class, she begins a game of sexual cat and mouse with a naïve college student. As they venture into more and more unpredictable territory in the bedroom, he begins to think she might be using him as a test subject for her fiction more than anything else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gttCftJzeSQgXPiuQ6geuoRjya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86676'),
  ('763619608016845689', 'Moon 44', 1990, 'Science Fiction', 'Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Roland Emmerich', 'Oliver Eberle, Dean Heyde', 'Michael Paré, Lisa Eichhorn, Dean Devlin, Brian Thompson, Malcolm McDowell, Leon Rippy, Jochen Nickel, Mehmet Yilmaz', 'R', 'Year 2038: The mineral resources of the earth are drained, in space there are fights for the last deposits on other planets and satellites. This is the situation when one of the bigger mining corporations has lost all but one mineral moons and many of their fully automatic mining robots are disappearing on their flight home. Since nobody else wants the job, they send prisoners to defend the mining station. Among them undercover agent Stone, who shall clear the whereabouts of the expensive robots. In an atmosphere of corruption, fear and hatred he gets between the fronts of rivaling groups.', 'Year 2038: The mineral resources of the earth are drained, in space there are fights for the last deposits on other planets and satellites. This is the situation when one of the bigger mining corporations has lost all but one mineral moons and many of their fully automatic mining robots are disappearing on their flight home. Since nobody else wants the job, they send prisoners to defend the mining station. Among them undercover agent Stone, who shall clear the whereabouts of the expensive robots. In an atmosphere of corruption, fear and hatred he gets between the fronts of rivaling groups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ia7Ew8QXiN1Urh63xYFYZ7ZfF2t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2927'),
  ('464434377239036500', 'Moon Breath Beat', 1980, 'Animation', 'Lisze Bechtold', null, null, null, 'Moon Breath Beat is a hand-drawn experimental 2D film that depicts a woman and her two cats and how external forces such as birds and the moon impact their lives. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2016.', 'Moon Breath Beat is a hand-drawn experimental 2D film that depicts a woman and her two cats and how external forces such as birds and the moon impact their lives. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2016.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Us9Ggz2wBArJWUVvJY5ewu8Kou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312220'),
  ('259178327744674922', 'Moon Child', 1989, 'Fantasy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Agustí Villaronga, Jaume Peracaula', 'Agustí Villaronga', 'Maribel Martín, Lisa Gerrard, Lucia Bosè, Mary Carrillo, Günter Meisner, Enrique Saldana, David Sust, Heidi Ben Amar', null, 'Adopted by a treacherous semi-scientific cult where extraordinary mental powers are common, extraordinary 12-year-old David begins an archetypal journey across two continents to find his destiny as Child of the Moon.', 'Adopted by a treacherous semi-scientific cult where extraordinary mental powers are common, extraordinary 12-year-old David begins an archetypal journey across two continents to find his destiny as Child of the Moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwvZeNFAp2FfyzoqZzTtl9WYrsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120133'),
  ('578318781069115657', 'Moon Child', 2003, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Takahisa Zeze, Takahide Shibanushi', 'Takahisa Zeze, GACKT', 'GACKT, Hyde, Leehom Wang, Zeny Kwok Sin-Yu, Anne Suzuki, Taro Yamamoto, Susumu Terajima, Ryo Ishibashi', null, 'Moon Child follows a group of childhood friends as they advance in a futuristic criminal underworld. Sho feels he is doomed to walk in his idol Kei''s footsteps as a vampire with the gift of eternal life and the curse of blood thirst. Over time, their tight friendship becomes corrupted because of their rivalry and love for the same woman.', 'Moon Child follows a group of childhood friends as they advance in a futuristic criminal underworld. Sho feels he is doomed to walk in his idol Kei''s footsteps as a vampire with the gift of eternal life and the curse of blood thirst. Over time, their tight friendship becomes corrupted because of their rivalry and love for the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNw31trM3ZrdY4yYEv2hP4uEp8x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21513'),
  ('888650212337239491', 'Moon Conspiracy', 2011, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Thomas Frickel', 'Thomas Frickel', 'Dennis R.D. Mascarenas', null, 'During his work as chief reporter for DDC-TV, a German-speaking television station in the USA, Dennis Mascarenas has met some pretty strange people and gotten into quite a few hairy situations. But when he is asked to make a film about the Germans'' relationship to the moon, it is the beginning of the craziest and most unbelievable assignment of his career. ''The Moon Conspiracy'' is like a glimpse into Pandora''s Box: it takes Dennis and his audience on a surreal journey into hidden universes, only to end up at the frozen bottom of the German soul.', 'During his work as chief reporter for DDC-TV, a German-speaking television station in the USA, Dennis Mascarenas has met some pretty strange people and gotten into quite a few hairy situations. But when he is asked to make a film about the Germans'' relationship to the moon, it is the beginning of the craziest and most unbelievable assignment of his career. ''The Moon Conspiracy'' is like a glimpse into Pandora''s Box: it takes Dennis and his audience on a surreal journey into hidden universes, only to end up at the frozen bottom of the German soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3L7hFyZ0adg7Pthkd6ttIg1JEmG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132873'),
  ('1128348301848701147', 'Moon Crash', 2022, 'Science Fiction', 'Noah Luke, Noah Luke', 'Joe Roche, Lauren Pritchard', 'Jeremy London, Tyler Christopher, Pauline Egan, Jamison Jones, Jenny Tran, Alexa Marie Anderson, Marisha Shine, Ricardo Herranz', null, 'A global steelworks company partners with an aerospace firm to mine the Moon. But when a drilling accident causes a giant piece of the Moon to crack off and hurtle towards Earth, the surviving space team and the head of the firm must figure out how to destroy the meteoroid before it wipes out the entire planet.', 'A global steelworks company partners with an aerospace firm to mine the Moon. But when a drilling accident causes a giant piece of the Moon to crack off and hurtle towards Earth, the surviving space team and the head of the firm must figure out how to destroy the meteoroid before it wipes out the entire planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KFDOqVlH4754ZVCGOZpfhfPisR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931140'),
  ('256880107911552494', 'Moon Garden', 2023, 'Fantasy, Horror, Drama', 'Ryan Stevens Harris', 'Ryan Stevens Harris', 'Augie Duke, Brionne Davis, Haven Lee Harris, Morgana Ignis, Maria Olsen, Timothy Lee DePriest, Emily Meister, Angelica Ulloa', 'NR', 'A comatose five-year-old girl journeys through a dark industrial dreamscape, following her mother''s voice on a transistor radio to find her way back to consciousness.', 'A comatose five-year-old girl journeys through a dark industrial dreamscape, following her mother''s voice on a transistor radio to find her way back to consciousness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEwxATA59b3StO8WiNdX9YfRwwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977000'),
  ('931996401442132449', 'Moon in Scorpio', 1987, 'Horror', 'Gary Graver, Gary Graver, Scott Yagemann', 'Robert Aiken', 'Britt Ekland, John Phillip Law, William Smith, Lewis van Bergen, April Jayne, Jillian Kesner, Robert Quarry, James Booth', null, 'A Vietnam vet with PTSD and his new wife are invited for their honeymoon aboard his war buddy''s yacht along with a third war friend and their girlfriends. Soon, they are being slaughtered one-by-one by a mysterious gloved assailant with an unusual pronged murder weapon.', 'A Vietnam vet with PTSD and his new wife are invited for their honeymoon aboard his war buddy''s yacht along with a third war friend and their girlfriends. Soon, they are being slaughtered one-by-one by a mysterious gloved assailant with an unusual pronged murder weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJcvpkcdVqQf55kaUe7MH5JVmGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29603'),
  ('1036770502143700962', 'Moon Landing', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Antonio Padovan, Duccio Cimatti, Paola Bonsembiante', 'Antonio Padovan, Marco Pettenello', 'Giuseppe Battiston, Stefano Fresi, Camilla Filippi, Flavio Bucci, Roberto Citran, Luisa De Santis, Teco Celio, Vitaliano Trevisan', null, 'At six, Dario watched the first Moon landing on TV, sparking a lifelong dream to reach the stars. For the rest of his life, the ingenious curmudgeon built a homemade space rocket on his farm using scraps from the local hardware store. But, after a disastrous first launch burns down the neighbors'' cornfields, Dario lands in jail. Enter Mario, his estranged brother who left the dying countryside for the big city: despite the confusion, he agrees to help Italy''s ''secret space program'' finally take off.', 'At six, Dario watched the first Moon landing on TV, sparking a lifelong dream to reach the stars. For the rest of his life, the ingenious curmudgeon built a homemade space rocket on his farm using scraps from the local hardware store. But, after a disastrous first launch burns down the neighbors'' cornfields, Dario lands in jail. Enter Mario, his estranged brother who left the dying countryside for the big city: despite the confusion, he agrees to help Italy''s ''secret space program'' finally take off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exU8POhJJHrM5nL2zcmY8JWvltn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651135'),
  ('763990730377785906', 'Moon Man', 2012, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'Stephan Schesch', 'Tomi Ungerer, Stephan Schesch', 'Tomi Ungerer, Katharina Thalbach, Ulrich Tukur, Corinna Harfouch, Ulrich Noethen', null, 'One night, a shooting star appears, whizzing through outer space towards the moon. Moon Man seizes his chance, grabs the speeding comet by the tail and hitches a ride to earth. This ''attack from outer space'' sets the alarm bells ringing in the Presidential Headquarters. While escaping the President and his soldiers, Moon Man sets off on a long journey and marvels at the many wonders the earth has to offer – and he realizes how much children love and need him.', 'One night, a shooting star appears, whizzing through outer space towards the moon. Moon Man seizes his chance, grabs the speeding comet by the tail and hitches a ride to earth. This ''attack from outer space'' sets the alarm bells ringing in the Presidential Headquarters. While escaping the President and his soldiers, Moon Man sets off on a long journey and marvels at the many wonders the earth has to offer – and he realizes how much children love and need him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpDtDdUO3rbzLwi4AMS8TkpQWaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135832'),
  ('306057412998758090', 'Moon Man', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama', 'Zhao Nan, Zhang Chiyu', 'Yuyue Shen, Si''ao Dai, Chenguang Qian', 'Teng Shen, Ma Li, Chang Yuan, Li Chengru, Huang Cailun, Jackie Li, Hao Han, Huang Zitao', null, 'Working as a maintenance crew member on the moon, Duguyue is left behind after the evacuation mission forgets about him. A meteorite then destroys planet Earth, leaving him as the only man left alive in existence.', 'Working as a maintenance crew member on the moon, Duguyue is left behind after the evacuation mission forgets about him. A meteorite then destroys planet Earth, leaving him as the only man left alive in existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYdSaS1i84Pnx4cIgVCxJt00HDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801803'),
  ('1038553138971444991', 'Moon Mater', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Rob Gibbs', 'Daniel Chong, Valerie LaPointe, John Lasseter', 'Larry the Cable Guy, Keith Ferguson, Josh Cooley, Elissa Knight, Lindsey Collins, Jess Harnell, Torbin Xan Bullock, John Cygan', null, 'Mater is the first tow truck on the moon! When an auto-naut gets stranded on his lunar mission, it''s up to Mater to venture into space and tow him back to Earth (with a little help from his friend Lightning McQueen, of course).', 'Mater is the first tow truck on the moon! When an auto-naut gets stranded on his lunar mission, it''s up to Mater to venture into space and tow him back to Earth (with a little help from his friend Lightning McQueen, of course).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4du70hEkq5nBznMcW89BxDY2Zb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148608'),
  ('192702161622766975', 'Moon of Avellaneda', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Juan José Campanella, Daniel Shulman, Fernando Alcalde', 'Juan Pablo Domenech, Fernando Castets, Juan José Campanella', 'Ricardo Darín, Mercedes Morán, Eduardo Blanco, Valeria Bertuccelli, Silvia Kutika, Daniel Fanego, José Luis López Vázquez, Atilio Pozzobón', null, 'The story of a social and sports club in a Buenos Aires neighborhood and of those who try to save it from being closed.', 'The story of a social and sports club in a Buenos Aires neighborhood and of those who try to save it from being closed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyGtvy3TCMzULGznJwXUJ4tGxUT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57977'),
  ('56188317736467139', 'Moon of the Wolf', 1972, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Daniel Petrie, Richard Kobritz, Richard C. Glouner', null, 'David Janssen, Barbara Rush, Bradford Dillman, John Beradino, Geoffrey Lewis, Royal Dano, John Davis Chandler, Claudia McNeil', 'NR', 'After several locals are viciously murdered, a Louisiana sheriff starts to suspect he may be dealing with a werewolf.', 'After several locals are viciously murdered, a Louisiana sheriff starts to suspect he may be dealing with a werewolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lI5iLUP4L2ZCKH4QjVIf0zzR07U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49354'),
  ('1039087962223956973', 'Moon Over Miami', 1941, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Walter Lang, Leon Shamroy, J. Peverell Marley', 'Vincent Lawrence, Brown Holmes', 'Don Ameche, Betty Grable, Robert Cummings, Jack Haley, Carole Landis, Charlotte Greenwood, Cobina Wright, Lynne Roberts', 'NR', 'After losing nearly all of an inheritance to taxes, sisters Kay and Barbara Latimer, waitresses at a drive-in restaurant in Texas, scheme to find rich husbands. With the aid of their aunt Susan, the sisters take the last of their money and head to a well-known Miami resort where they soon meet two wealthy young men, Phil and Jeff, who begin a fierce rivalry for Kay, not realizing that Barbara has fallen in love with one of them.', 'After losing nearly all of an inheritance to taxes, sisters Kay and Barbara Latimer, waitresses at a drive-in restaurant in Texas, scheme to find rich husbands. With the aid of their aunt Susan, the sisters take the last of their money and head to a well-known Miami resort where they soon meet two wealthy young men, Phil and Jeff, who begin a fierce rivalry for Kay, not realizing that Barbara has fallen in love with one of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3zBaU3wwTJThzT4jK9Ehwp3ik5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43794'),
  ('197953512143080203', 'Moon Over Parador', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Mazursky, Donald McAlpine, Irby Smith', 'Leon Capetanos, Paul Mazursky', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Raúl Juliá, Sonia Braga, Jonathan Winters, Sammy Davis Jr., Michael Greene, Polly Holliday, Milton Gonçalves', 'PG-13', 'Little known actor, Jack Noah, is working on location in the dictatorship of Parador at the time the dictator dies. The dictator''s right hand man, Roberto, makes Jack an offer he cannot refuse.. to play the dictator. Jack''s acting skills fool the masses but not close friends and employees of the dictator.', 'Little known actor, Jack Noah, is working on location in the dictatorship of Parador at the time the dictator dies. The dictator''s right hand man, Roberto, makes Jack an offer he cannot refuse.. to play the dictator. Jack''s acting skills fool the masses but not close friends and employees of the dictator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qVL6RqJTr6uQxV4O72H0j9tv0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34014'),
  ('943767019636977985', 'Moon Pilot', 1962, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'James Neilson, William E. Snyder, Joseph L. McEveety', 'Maurice Tombragel', 'Tom Tryon, Brian Keith, Edmond O''Brien, Dany Saval, Bob Sweeney, Tommy Kirk, Kent Smith, Sarah Selby', 'G', 'An Air Force captain inadvertently volunteers to make the first manned flight around the moon. He immediately falls under the watchful protection of various security agencies, but despite all their precautions, a young woman who may be an enemy spy succeeds in making contact with the captain. The captain eventually discovers that this woman is not an enemy but rather a friend from a very unusual source.', 'An Air Force captain inadvertently volunteers to make the first manned flight around the moon. He immediately falls under the watchful protection of various security agencies, but despite all their precautions, a young woman who may be an enemy spy succeeds in making contact with the captain. The captain eventually discovers that this woman is not an enemy but rather a friend from a very unusual source.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dR84EmpreVavzGbB3V2JqeTJaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64870'),
  ('327861508339931837', 'Moon Rainbow', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Naum Ardashnikov, Andrei Yermash, Leonid Bulgakov', 'Valentin Ezhov, Andrei Yermash', 'Vladimir Gostyukhin, Igor Starygin, Vasiliy Livanov, Yuriy Solomin, Vladimir Kenigson, Georgi Taratorkin, Natalya Sayko, Gražina Baikštytė', null, 'After a strange incident, a group of russian space commandos starts developing supernatural powers. But how did they acquire such abilities and what is their intentions?', 'After a strange incident, a group of russian space commandos starts developing supernatural powers. But how did they acquire such abilities and what is their intentions?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8s2bbOVb3dirozKCuF9jhbHToSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53837'),
  ('929284316188643010', 'Moon Warriors', 1992, 'Action, Romance', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Corey Yuen, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo', 'Alex Law Kai-Yui', 'Andy Lau, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Maggie Cheung, Kenny Bee, Kelvin Wong Siu, Chang Yi, Chin Ka-Lok, Tam Wai', null, 'A kind-hearted fisherman, content with simple life, is reluctantly drawn into helping a noble emperor regain his throne from his evil brother.', 'A kind-hearted fisherman, content with simple life, is reluctantly drawn into helping a noble emperor regain his throne from his evil brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFirOYp9fY6MMXSYwTlkdf7Oxk5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50936'),
  ('1084529508443609196', 'Moon Young', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kim So-yeon, Oh Seong-ho', 'Kim So-yeon', 'Kim Tae-ri, Jung Hyun, Park Wan-kyu, Park Jeong-sik, Jang Hyang-sook, Heo Won-jeong, Nam Bo-ra, Lee Jin-kyeong', null, 'Mute Moon-young records people''s faces with her small camcorder on the subway. One day, she avoids her drunk father at home and films Hee-soo who is crying over saying goodbye to her boyfriend and gets caught. The two feel some sort of kinship and become closer.', 'Mute Moon-young records people''s faces with her small camcorder on the subway. One day, she avoids her drunk father at home and films Hee-soo who is crying over saying goodbye to her boyfriend and gets caught. The two feel some sort of kinship and become closer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gvSLdOVW7Xy3zbZbrYDT6x180.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423248'),
  ('1117328678023760695', 'Moon Zero Two', 1969, 'Science Fiction', 'Roy Ward Baker, Paul Beeson', 'Michael Carreras', 'James Olson, Catherine Schell, Warren Mitchell, Adrienne Corri, Ori Levy, Bernard Bresslaw, Dudley Foster, Neil McCallum', 'G', 'On the Moon in the year 2021, a former-astronaut-turned-salvager helps a millionaire space industrialist capture a 6000-ton sapphire asteroid, while also assisting a woman in finding her missing miner/prospector brother', 'On the Moon in the year 2021, a former-astronaut-turned-salvager helps a millionaire space industrialist capture a 6000-ton sapphire asteroid, while also assisting a woman in finding her missing miner/prospector brother', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IIIKlNZXj9vVBrQXZeWttzFoNm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26121'),
  ('278024887474530876', 'Moon''s Pool', 1973, null, 'Gunvor Nelson', null, null, null, 'The film that is mostly shot underwater, in a pool, begins with footage of water and a close-up of Nelson from which we move to her body immersed in water in a bath-tub from which yet another transition occurs to a pool with male and female naked bodies swimming underwater. The latter part of the film is almost totally liberated from speech, and has a dreamlike, complex soundtrack consisting of sounds of waves, voices, water and music woven together into a seamless web of sounds.', 'The film that is mostly shot underwater, in a pool, begins with footage of water and a close-up of Nelson from which we move to her body immersed in water in a bath-tub from which yet another transition occurs to a pool with male and female naked bodies swimming underwater. The latter part of the film is almost totally liberated from speech, and has a dreamlike, complex soundtrack consisting of sounds of waves, voices, water and music woven together into a seamless web of sounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JCC6ACR9cpvZCVsEJdYe3jtgGl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354508'),
  ('19202934304965372', 'Moonage Daydream', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'Brett Morgen', 'Brett Morgen', 'David Bowie, Lou Reed, Tina Turner, Russell Harty, Dick Cavett, Mick Ronson, Trevor Bolder, Mick Woodmansey', 'PG-13', 'A cinematic odyssey featuring never-before-seen footage exploring David Bowie''s creative and musical journey.', 'A cinematic odyssey featuring never-before-seen footage exploring David Bowie''s creative and musical journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJCZI1tO0sYIV0mGo0Awcr996vm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957457'),
  ('30475182108621695', 'Moonbird', 1959, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'John Hubley', null, 'Mark Hubley, Ray Hubley', null, 'Two boys go outside at night to capture a bird. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2003.', 'Two boys go outside at night to capture a bird. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2003.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b47WcPTRG4Qa6507jRzm2weXrUN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71255'),
  ('987838704852070794', 'Moonbound', 2021, 'Animation, Family', 'Ali Samadi Ahadi', 'Ali Samadi Ahadi, Arne Nolting', 'David Daria, Stefko Hanushevsky, Thyra Uhde, Laurens Walter, Stephan Benson, Proschat Madani, Caroline Schreiber, Elisabeth Kanettis', null, 'When Peter sets out on a magical journey to rescue his little sister Anne, he needs to travel to mysterious territory: the Moon! Anne was kidnapped by the evil Moon Man when she tried to help the beetle Mr. Zoomzeman in search for his wife. On his fantastic adventure, Peter lands on the Star Meadow where he meets the sleepy Mr. Sandman. He knows, only at the Night Fairy’s dinner in the castle in the clouds, they can find out where Anne is – but there aren’t enough seats for everyone. So they join the wild race along the Milky Way against the five Spirits of Nature: Storm Giant, Lightning Witch, Henry Hail, Rainy Robin and Mother Frost…', 'When Peter sets out on a magical journey to rescue his little sister Anne, he needs to travel to mysterious territory: the Moon! Anne was kidnapped by the evil Moon Man when she tried to help the beetle Mr. Zoomzeman in search for his wife. On his fantastic adventure, Peter lands on the Star Meadow where he meets the sleepy Mr. Sandman. He knows, only at the Night Fairy’s dinner in the castle in the clouds, they can find out where Anne is – but there aren’t enough seats for everyone. So they join the wild race along the Milky Way against the five Spirits of Nature: Storm Giant, Lightning Witch, Henry Hail, Rainy Robin and Mother Frost…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vSW1xRJD0MJPRXGQoAf9D3954W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809717'),
  ('875927553426392417', 'Moondance', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dagmar Hirtz, Steven Bernstein', 'Mark Watters, Burt Weinshanker', 'Rúaidhrí Conroy, Ian Shaw, Julia Brendler, Marianne Faithfull, Brendan Grace, Jasmine Russell, David Kelly, Tom Hickey', null, 'The close relationship between two fun-loving brothers comes under threat when a beautiful, sensitive girl arrives on the scene. As the younger brother comes of age, the inevitable jealousy, confusion, rivalry and lust place their brotherly love in jeopardy.', 'The close relationship between two fun-loving brothers comes under threat when a beautiful, sensitive girl arrives on the scene. As the younger brother comes of age, the inevitable jealousy, confusion, rivalry and lust place their brotherly love in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBnJDYOV2TS393fgwPnbzdFYU2R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120759'),
  ('695335632460364058', 'Moondance Alexander', 2007, 'Drama, Family', 'Michael Damian, Julien Eudes', 'Janeen Damian, Michael Damian', 'Kay Panabaker, Don Johnson, Lori Loughlin, James Best, Sasha Cohen, Joe Norman Shaw, Whitney Sloan, Julia Maxwell', 'G', 'Curiously named teen Moondance Alexander lives with her eccentric mother, and is faced with another uneventful summer until she discovers a lost pinto pony named Checkers. Although Moondance returns the horse to his rightful owner, the gruff and mysterious Dante Longpre, she is convinced that Checkers is a champion jumper in disguise and is determined to help him realize his full potential.', 'Curiously named teen Moondance Alexander lives with her eccentric mother, and is faced with another uneventful summer until she discovers a lost pinto pony named Checkers. Although Moondance returns the horse to his rightful owner, the gruff and mysterious Dante Longpre, she is convinced that Checkers is a champion jumper in disguise and is determined to help him realize his full potential.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jd1TXn1IMz257h0rMSvnbmfTCmi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41281'),
  ('1149967271232885795', 'Moondram Pirai', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Balu Mahendra, Balu Mahendra', 'Balu Mahendra', 'Kamal Haasan, Sridevi, Y. G. Mahendran, Silk Smitha, Poornam Viswanathan, Ganthimathi, J.V. Ramana Murthi, K. Natraj', null, 'A young woman suffers a major head injury in a car accident after which she begins behaving like a child. Trapped at a brothel, she finds hope in a lonely school teacher who decides to rescue her.', 'A young woman suffers a major head injury in a car accident after which she begins behaving like a child. Trapped at a brothel, she finds hope in a lonely school teacher who decides to rescue her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDimtjGArqeW93Aa5tjS6kPrupB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66389'),
  ('1067771747247698902', 'Mooned', 2023, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Jonathan del Val', 'Pierre Coffin', 'Jason Segel, Pierre Coffin, Claire Dodgson, Chris Renaud', 'PG', 'Villainous Vector must figure out how to get off the moon and return to Earth.', 'Villainous Vector must figure out how to get off the moon and return to Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJeGQ67XPRkr9lpUOIUYLOhPNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1207417'),
  ('1099914386263158039', 'Moonfall', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Robby Baumgartner, Frédéric Berthiaume, Roland Emmerich', 'Harald Kloser, Roland Emmerich, Spenser Cohen', 'Halle Berry, Patrick Wilson, John Bradley, Charlie Plummer, Kelly Yu, Michael Peña, Carolina Bartczak, Zayn Maloney', 'PG-13', 'A mysterious force knocks the moon from its orbit around Earth and sends it hurtling on a collision course with life as we know it.', 'A mysterious force knocks the moon from its orbit around Earth and sends it hurtling on a collision course with life as we know it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjTU4fmmGjAOOiOlE6WYDagoSsP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406759'),
  ('840045875772434710', 'Moonfleet', 1955, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Fritz Lang, Robert H. Planck', 'Jan Lustig, Margaret Fitts', 'Stewart Granger, George Sanders, Joan Greenwood, Viveca Lindfors, Jon Whiteley, Liliane Montevecchi, Melville Cooper, Sean McClory', null, 'Set in the eighteenth century, Moonfleet is about John Mohune, a young orphan who is sent to the Dorset village of Moonfleet to stay with an old friend of his mother''s, Jeremy Fox. Fox is a morally ambiguous character, an elegant gentleman involved with smugglers and pirates.', 'Set in the eighteenth century, Moonfleet is about John Mohune, a young orphan who is sent to the Dorset village of Moonfleet to stay with an old friend of his mother''s, Jeremy Fox. Fox is a morally ambiguous character, an elegant gentleman involved with smugglers and pirates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkbpCz2IqeQDg4eomCkezCH99Ff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29967'),
  ('646700894014798900', 'Moonlight', 2016, 'Drama', 'Barry Jenkins, James Laxton, Roger Mendoza', 'Barry Jenkins', 'Trevante Rhodes, André Holland, Janelle Monáe, Ashton Sanders, Jharrel Jerome, Alex R. Hibbert, Jaden Piner, Naomie Harris', 'R', 'The tender, heartbreaking story of a young man’s struggle to find himself, told across three defining chapters in his life as he experiences the ecstasy, pain, and beauty of falling in love, while grappling with his own sexuality.', 'The tender, heartbreaking story of a young man’s struggle to find himself, told across three defining chapters in his life as he experiences the ecstasy, pain, and beauty of falling in love, while grappling with his own sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLnfEmPrDjJfPyyddLJPkXmshkp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376867'),
  ('923579078861395599', 'Moonlight & Mistletoe', 2008, 'TV Movie, Drama, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Karen Arthur, Tom Neuwirth', null, 'Tom Arnold, Candace Cameron Bure, Christopher Wiehl, Barbara Niven, Matt Walton, Allan F. Nicholls, Kaily Smith Westbrook, Heather Remick', null, 'After three years, Nick''s estranged daughter Holly returns home to find the spirit of Christmas in Santaville has dwindled, taking the family business with it. What starts out as an attempt to bail out her dad, ends up rekindling Holly''s belief in Christmas all over again.', 'After three years, Nick''s estranged daughter Holly returns home to find the spirit of Christmas in Santaville has dwindled, taking the family business with it. What starts out as an attempt to bail out her dad, ends up rekindling Holly''s belief in Christmas all over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xnAwXSaQ0iMkhD5820Izmwt3Kg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51443'),
  ('551822826164563496', 'Moonlight and Valentino', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Anspaugh, David Webb, Tom Quinn', 'Ellen Simon', 'Elizabeth Perkins, Gwyneth Paltrow, Kathleen Turner, Whoopi Goldberg, Jon Bon Jovi, Shadia Simmons, Erica Luttrell, Josef Sommer', 'R', 'A young widow still grieving over the death of her husband finds herself being comforted by a local housepainter.', 'A young widow still grieving over the death of her husband finds herself being comforted by a local housepainter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKJ1DwaH8pM3qDNxKFxvsQEg6wE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68274'),
  ('859594236513671885', 'Moonlight Express', 1999, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Daniel Lee, Venus Keung, Donnie Yen', 'Susan Chan Suk-Yin, Yumiko Aoyagi, Yeung Sin-Ling', 'Leslie Cheung, Takako Tokiwa, Yuka Hoshino, Michelle Yeoh, Jack Kao, Austin Wai Tin-Chi, Liu Kai-Chi, Jimmy Wong Ga-Lok', null, 'On the eve of her wedding, Hitomi loses her fiance Tatsuya to a car accident. She travels to Hong Kong seeking solace and meets undercover cop Karbo — a dead ringer for Tatsuya. The duo is forced to take it on the lam when a corrupt colleague frames Karbo, and Hitomi soon finds herself torn between her love for Tatsuya and her blossoming feelings for her fellow fugitive.', 'On the eve of her wedding, Hitomi loses her fiance Tatsuya to a car accident. She travels to Hong Kong seeking solace and meets undercover cop Karbo — a dead ringer for Tatsuya. The duo is forced to take it on the lam when a corrupt colleague frames Karbo, and Hitomi soon finds herself torn between her love for Tatsuya and her blossoming feelings for her fellow fugitive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5u7TrfSdBlRA3emv3ufUidXT23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45505'),
  ('807321984322507335', 'Moonlight for Two', 1932, 'Music, Romance, Animation, Comedy', 'Rudolf Ising', null, null, null, 'Two courting hillbilly dogs, which is Goopy Geer and his girlfriend, go to the big barn dance. Then a villian comes over to try to shoot him with a gun, then fights, and the villian got on fire and escaped thanks to the walking stove.', 'Two courting hillbilly dogs, which is Goopy Geer and his girlfriend, go to the big barn dance. Then a villian comes over to try to shoot him with a gun, then fights, and the villian got on fire and escaped thanks to the walking stove.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4UmsiqoPgAHG1ht0ABLwIcJh35.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161654'),
  ('718871584366779086', 'Moonlight in Vermont', 2017, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Mel Damski, Troy Scott, Patrick Weir', 'Michael Nourse, Angela Ruhinda, Brian Sawyer', 'Lacey Chabert, Carlo Marks, Jesse Moss, Fiona Vroom, Elise Gatien, Jason Cermak, Rebecca Staab, Keith MacKechnie', 'G', 'After fast-paced New York City high-end real estate broker Fiona Rangely gets dumped by her boyfriend, she escapes to her family’s quaint Vermont Inn for a few days to slow down and evaluate her life. When her ex-boyfriend Nate shows up at the Inn with a brand new girlfriend, Fiona quickly devises a plan to win him back: pretend the handsome and very laid- back head chef Derek is her new boyfriend! Much to the surprise of Derek --and to Fiona herself-- in pretending to be in love, she realizes that she’s been thrown a curveball: sometimes the best things in life are worth the wait.', 'After fast-paced New York City high-end real estate broker Fiona Rangely gets dumped by her boyfriend, she escapes to her family’s quaint Vermont Inn for a few days to slow down and evaluate her life. When her ex-boyfriend Nate shows up at the Inn with a brand new girlfriend, Fiona quickly devises a plan to win him back: pretend the handsome and very laid- back head chef Derek is her new boyfriend! Much to the surprise of Derek --and to Fiona herself-- in pretending to be in love, she realizes that she’s been thrown a curveball: sometimes the best things in life are worth the wait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wITyFvOffnDi09fqBmORUhE6zS6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446493'),
  ('591752259193758530', 'Moonlight Mile', 2002, 'Romance, Drama', 'Brad Silberling, Phedon Papamichael, Chitra F. Mojtabai', 'Brad Silberling', 'Dustin Hoffman, Susan Sarandon, Jake Gyllenhaal, Alexia Landeau, Ellen Pompeo, Richard Messing, Lev Friedman, Bob Clendenin', 'PG-13', 'As he copes with the death of his fiancee along with her parents, a young man must figure out what he wants out of life.', 'As he copes with the death of his fiancee along with her parents, a young man must figure out what he wants out of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKDnCPUkL4QsgeqKCtyNMPL2XUU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31005'),
  ('499720401222697362', 'Moonlight Shadow', 2021, 'Drama', 'Hirohito Takino, Edmund Yeo, Kong Pahurak', 'Tomoyuki Takahashi', 'Nana Komatsu, Hio Miyazawa, Himi Sato, Nana Nakahara, Aoi Yoshikura, Seiya Nakano, Asami Usuda', null, 'Satsuki lost her boyfriend, Hitoshi, in a car accident. Unable to face up to his death, she spends her days unable to sleep properly. At some point, Satsuki began to jog at dawn as part of her daily routine, and on a bridge she always passes, she meets a mysterious woman named Urara.', 'Satsuki lost her boyfriend, Hitoshi, in a car accident. Unable to face up to his death, she spends her days unable to sleep properly. At some point, Satsuki began to jog at dawn as part of her daily routine, and on a bridge she always passes, she meets a mysterious woman named Urara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGazkLkCx83mmujoHhN6Gqnvca3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:847335'),
  ('497038285574860113', 'Moonlight Sonata II: The Street Sweepers', 1991, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Olli Soinio, Kari Sohlberg, Veikko Aaltonen', 'Olli Soinio', 'Soli Labbart, Kari Sorvali, Mikko Kivinen, Erkki Pajala, Matti Tuominen, Katariina Souri, Ilkka Koivula, Vesa Vierikko', null, 'A sequel to Soinio''s film Kuutamosonaatti (Moonlight Sonata) of 1988. A rural family clings to life until the resourceful Sulo uses the salvific powers of sauna, moonshine, and tar to resurrect his injured brother Arvo, their deceased mother, and even buried revolutionaries. When Arvo drifts to Helsinki and falls into illicit moonshining and wild pursuits of a celebrity, Sulo and their revived mother set out to retrieve him from his urban excesses.', 'A sequel to Soinio''s film Kuutamosonaatti (Moonlight Sonata) of 1988. A rural family clings to life until the resourceful Sulo uses the salvific powers of sauna, moonshine, and tar to resurrect his injured brother Arvo, their deceased mother, and even buried revolutionaries. When Arvo drifts to Helsinki and falls into illicit moonshining and wild pursuits of a celebrity, Sulo and their revived mother set out to retrieve him from his urban excesses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89UcqIZYeA8rxN5tbHoaXHC6wkh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197336'),
  ('568004741828108761', 'Moonlight Tariff', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Ralf Huettner, Thomas Wildner', 'Ralf Huettner, Silke Neumayer', 'Tim Bergmann, Jasmin Tabatabai, Bettina Zimmermann, Rüdiger Klink, Karina Fallenstein, Gruschenka Stevens', null, 'To call or not to call? For young Cora it''s not a question. In fact, after the first date you may never call the guy, even if it was the best sex of your life! It''s him who must beg for a meeting - and not later than 72 hours after. Otherwise - delete it from memory.', 'To call or not to call? For young Cora it''s not a question. In fact, after the first date you may never call the guy, even if it was the best sex of your life! It''s him who must beg for a meeting - and not later than 72 hours after. Otherwise - delete it from memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61nwkTfaVuuYT9pBUdbTM8wpEZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11070'),
  ('56080253924843229', 'Moonlight Whispers', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Akihiko Shiota, Tomohiro Kubo, Shigeru Komatsubara', 'Akihiko Shiota, Yōichi Nishiyama', 'Kenji Mizuhashi, Tsugumi, Kōta Kusano, Harumi Inoue, Chika Fujimura, Kei Marimura, Kiriko Shimizu, Yoshiki Sekino', null, 'Satsuki and Takuya are high school students who meet at kendo practice, where they bash one another with wooden swords. They begin an awkward romance, but Takuya soon reveals a masochistic side to his desires. He has been stealing Satsuki''s soiled clothing and secretly surveilling her while imagining her subjugation of him. Disgusted, Satsuki rejects him but he persists, and she discovers her own pleasure in manipulating and humiliating him.', 'Satsuki and Takuya are high school students who meet at kendo practice, where they bash one another with wooden swords. They begin an awkward romance, but Takuya soon reveals a masochistic side to his desires. He has been stealing Satsuki''s soiled clothing and secretly surveilling her while imagining her subjugation of him. Disgusted, Satsuki rejects him but he persists, and she discovers her own pleasure in manipulating and humiliating him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74yRsFwdcjI8SHFP2u3Cwg9bbM1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104465'),
  ('853763615809537702', 'Moonlighting', 1982, 'Drama', 'Jerzy Skolimowski, Tony Pierce-Roberts, Peter Cotton', 'Jerzy Skolimowski', 'Jeremy Irons, Eugene Lipinski, Jiří Stanislav, Eugeniusz Haczkiewicz, Denis Holmes, David Calder, Trevor Cooper, David Gant', 'PG', 'A Polish contractor, Nowak, leads a group of workmen to London so they can provide cheap labor for a government official based there. Nowak has to manage the project and the men as they encounter the tempations of the West and loneliness and separation from their families. Nowak is the only one of the group who speaks English, and he uses this as a tool over his team. When the unrest in Poland leads to a military takeover, Nowak is faced with a much more difficult situation than he expected.', 'A Polish contractor, Nowak, leads a group of workmen to London so they can provide cheap labor for a government official based there. Nowak has to manage the project and the men as they encounter the tempations of the West and loneliness and separation from their families. Nowak is the only one of the group who speaks English, and he uses this as a tool over his team. When the unrest in Poland leads to a military takeover, Nowak is faced with a much more difficult situation than he expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCYuIZAVCLVrjmTrSX6NETgIvUT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42134'),
  ('321626263108646474', 'Moonlit Winter', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Lim Dae-hyung, Moon Myoung-hwan, Moon Il-ho', 'Lim Dae-hyung', 'Kim Hee-ae, Yuko Nakamura, Kim So-hye, Sung Yoo-bin, Hana Kino, Kumi Takiuchi, Sho Yakumaru, Kim Hak-seon', null, 'The arrival of an intimate letter prompts a young woman to bring her mother on vacation to a small Japanese town, where someone special resides.', 'The arrival of an intimate letter prompts a young woman to bring her mother on vacation to a small Japanese town, where someone special resides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6968mZj0jlDp7gmcjLJSd42r9pU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:578209'),
  ('901324363667378383', 'Moonnam Mura', 1988, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'K. Madhu', 'S. N. Swamy', 'Mohanlal, Lalu Alex, Sukumaran, Suresh Gopi, Revathi, Sreenath, Ponnambalam, Mukesh', null, 'A group of high-ranking political officials are on a trip when their bus is hijacked by a group of terrorists headed by Charles (Lalu Alex). They demand the release of their old colleagues languishing in prison in exchange for safe release of the politicians. An ex-cop is hired to free the officials from the group of terrorists.', 'A group of high-ranking political officials are on a trip when their bus is hijacked by a group of terrorists headed by Charles (Lalu Alex). They demand the release of their old colleagues languishing in prison in exchange for safe release of the politicians. An ex-cop is hired to free the officials from the group of terrorists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RFxRXjSZuwnl46P2wQZCV3XgSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267248'),
  ('68347463856116901', 'Moonnam Pakkam', 1988, 'Drama, Family', 'Suresh Unnithan, P. Padmarajan, Blessy', 'P. Padmarajan', 'Thilakan, Jayaram, Jagathy Sreekumar, Kirti Singh, Rahman, Ashokan, Jayabharathi, Venu Nagavalli', null, 'Thampi, a retired old man, leads an isolated life in the village and is excited for his grandson Pachu''s return. He welcomes Pachu and his friends, but his happiness is short-lived.', 'Thampi, a retired old man, leads an isolated life in the village and is excited for his grandson Pachu''s return. He welcomes Pachu and his friends, but his happiness is short-lived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sVAiq04o4MbreuIcIX2KeY6yZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255468'),
  ('742642709587004479', 'Moonraker', 1979, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Lewis Gilbert, Jean Tournier, John Glen', 'Christopher Wood, Gerry Anderson', 'Roger Moore, Lois Chiles, Michael Lonsdale, Richard Kiel, Corinne Cléry, Bernard Lee, Geoffrey Keen, Desmond Llewelyn', 'PG', 'After Drax Industries'' Moonraker space shuttle is hijacked, secret agent James Bond is assigned to investigate, traveling to California to meet the company''s owner, the mysterious Hugo Drax. With the help of scientist Dr. Holly Goodhead, Bond soon uncovers Drax''s nefarious plans for humanity, all the while fending off an old nemesis, Jaws, and venturing to Venice, Rio, the Amazon...and even outer space.', 'After Drax Industries'' Moonraker space shuttle is hijacked, secret agent James Bond is assigned to investigate, traveling to California to meet the company''s owner, the mysterious Hugo Drax. With the help of scientist Dr. Holly Goodhead, Bond soon uncovers Drax''s nefarious plans for humanity, all the while fending off an old nemesis, Jaws, and venturing to Venice, Rio, the Amazon...and even outer space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LrJdXNmu5uHOVALZxVYd44Lva0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698'),
  ('891632073313102717', 'Moonraker: 007 in Rio', 1979, 'Documentary', 'Michel Parbot', null, 'Roger Moore, Albert R. Broccoli, Lois Chiles, Lewis Gilbert', null, 'Original 1979 short promotional production featurette for the James Bond movie Moonraker (1979) featuring interview and behind the scenes footage.', 'Original 1979 short promotional production featurette for the James Bond movie Moonraker (1979) featuring interview and behind the scenes footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNfqwcLYy3LxEtGcWSFej27Acyh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685332'),
  ('607928950638425877', 'Moonrise', 1948, 'Drama', 'Frank Borzage, John L. Russell', 'Charles F. Haas', 'Dane Clark, Gail Russell, Ethel Barrymore, Allyn Joslyn, Rex Ingram, Harry Morgan, David Street, Selena Royle', 'NR', 'Stigmatized from infancy by the fate of his criminal father, a man is bruised and bullied until one night, in a fit of rage, he kills his most persistent tormentor. As the police close in around him, he makes a desperate bid for the love of the dead man’s fiancée, a schoolteacher who sees the wounded soul behind his aggression.', 'Stigmatized from infancy by the fate of his criminal father, a man is bruised and bullied until one night, in a fit of rage, he kills his most persistent tormentor. As the police close in around him, he makes a desperate bid for the love of the dead man’s fiancée, a schoolteacher who sees the wounded soul behind his aggression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9U0WHjNGNDipkl11Qlcg4NA9aHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28392'),
  ('902731323059854012', 'Moonshine County Express', 1977, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Gus Trikonis, Gary Graver', 'Hubert Smith, Daniel Ansley', 'John Saxon, Susan Howard, William Conrad, Morgan Woodward, Claudia Jennings, Jeff Corey, Dub Taylor, Maureen McCormick', 'PG', 'The three surviving daughters of a murdered moonshiner band together with a racecar driver to run high-test shine behind the corpulent backs of the local crime syndicate.', 'The three surviving daughters of a murdered moonshiner band together with a racecar driver to run high-test shine behind the corpulent backs of the local crime syndicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQk3edOod67ggkxlpp26IiyeGUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99846'),
