  ('809001566521526248', 'Moonshot', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Christopher Winterbauer, Brendan Uegama', 'Max Taxe', 'Cole Sprouse, Lana Condor, Mason Gooding, Emily Rudd, Christine Adams, Michelle Buteau, Zach Braff, Cameron Esposito', 'PG-13', 'In a future where Mars is terraformed and colonized by the best humanity has to offer, two very different college students wind up joining forces and sneak onboard a space shuttle to the red planet in order to be united with their significant others.', 'In a future where Mars is terraformed and colonized by the best humanity has to offer, two very different college students wind up joining forces and sneak onboard a space shuttle to the red planet in order to be united with their significant others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thqgzBPEDYQX0taszVus5nYMtTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767825'),
  ('145779592014561698', 'Moonstalker', 1989, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael S. O''Rourke, Michael Goi, Neil Kinsella', 'Michael S. O''Rourke', 'Blake Gibbons, Ingrid Vold, John Marzilli, Tom Hamil, Jill Foor, Joe Balogh, Ann McFadden, Pamela Ross', null, 'During the winter season, a family camping in the woods, and a group of camp counselors training in the same forest both find themselves being killed one by one by an unhinged psycho.', 'During the winter season, a family camping in the woods, and a group of camp counselors training in the same forest both find themselves being killed one by one by an unhinged psycho.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZEjQlBU9OBAbk9Pw9rYBmJcxiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85176'),
  ('84985569666744512', 'Moonstruck', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Watkin, Norman Jewison, Andrew Shea', 'John Patrick Shanley', 'Cher, Nicolas Cage, Vincent Gardenia, Olympia Dukakis, Danny Aiello, Julie Bovasso, John Mahoney, Louis Guss', 'PG', '37-year-old Italian-American widow Loretta Castorini believes she is unlucky in love, and so accepts a marriage proposal from her boyfriend Johnny, even though she doesn''t love him. When she meets his estranged younger brother Ronny, an emotional and passionate man, she finds herself drawn to him. She tries to resist, but Ronny, who blames his brother for the loss of his hand, has no scruples about aggressively pursuing her while Johnny is out of the country. As Loretta falls for Ronny, she learns that she''s not the only one in her family with a secret romance.', '37-year-old Italian-American widow Loretta Castorini believes she is unlucky in love, and so accepts a marriage proposal from her boyfriend Johnny, even though she doesn''t love him. When she meets his estranged younger brother Ronny, an emotional and passionate man, she finds herself drawn to him. She tries to resist, but Ronny, who blames his brother for the loss of his hand, has no scruples about aggressively pursuing her while Johnny is out of the country. As Loretta falls for Ronny, she learns that she''s not the only one in her family with a secret romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mnVWpvsHEHHnfvLn1NXYVvBGl5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2039'),
  ('835304880709358934', 'Moonsund', 1987, 'War, Drama, History, Romance', 'Aleksandr Muratov, Konstantin Ryzhov', 'Eduard Volodarskiy, Galina Muratova', 'Oleg Menshikov, Lyudmila Nilskaya, Vladimir Gostyukhin, Nikolai Karachentsov, Vija Artmane, Aleksei Buldakov, Evgeniya Dobrovolskaya, Sergey Garmash', null, 'Captain of a Russian battleship "Novik" Artenyev is in love with a beautiful lady Klara who is a German spy. They cannot be together because of the war and their professions. But they are in such love that all the war battles and battleships do not stop them, only their duties do.', 'Captain of a Russian battleship "Novik" Artenyev is in love with a beautiful lady Klara who is a German spy. They cannot be together because of the war and their professions. But they are in such love that all the war battles and battleships do not stop them, only their duties do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vsPTjjgu6h2zPd36PyND9jeQQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74045'),
  ('17037790237011114', 'Moontide', 1942, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Archie Mayo, Charles G. Clarke, Fritz Lang', 'John O''Hara', 'Jean Gabin, Ida Lupino, Thomas Mitchell, Claude Rains, Jerome Cowan, Helene Reynolds, Ralph Byrd, William Halligan', 'NR', 'After a drunken night out, a longshoreman thinks he may have killed a man.', 'After a drunken night out, a longshoreman thinks he may have killed a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3T5PPmpHQd39BIsU4s9wTp5vCyC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42062'),
  ('825182028298082452', 'Moontrap', 1989, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Robert Dyke, Peter Klein', 'Tex Ragsdale', 'Walter Koenig, Bruce Campbell, Robert Kurcz, Leigh Lombardi, Tom Case, Judy Levitt, Reavis Graham, Reuben Yabuku', 'R', 'The Space Shuttle returns to earth, but some of the equipment brought back on it begins to behave strangely. Scientists are unsure what is happening, and decide to take all necessary precautions.', 'The Space Shuttle returns to earth, but some of the equipment brought back on it begins to behave strangely. Scientists are unsure what is happening, and decide to take all necessary precautions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FNWwOSBF7HjzXrKHamk3A3m0QC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14916'),
  ('776770604857169489', 'Moontrap: Target Earth', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Robert Dyke, Lon Stratton', 'Robert Dyke, Tex Ragsdale', 'Sarah Butler, Damon Dayoub, Charles Shaughnessy, Cara AnnMarie, Loretta Higgins, Niki Spiridakos, Chris Newman, Steven Dutton', null, 'A long forgotten ancient spacecraft discovered on Earth. Investigations carried out by Scout transport her to the moon whereupon she meets the impressive machines preserving the wisdom of that long lost civilization.', 'A long forgotten ancient spacecraft discovered on Earth. Investigations carried out by Scout transport her to the moon whereupon she meets the impressive machines preserving the wisdom of that long lost civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqMH1aIvOUjeF9S0fog0zdntHtH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443297'),
  ('382168770640525704', 'Moonwalk One', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Theo Kamecke', null, 'Buzz Aldrin, Neil Armstrong, Michael Collins, Robert H. Goddard, Richard Nixon, Laurence Luckinbill', null, 'This documentary by Theo Kamecke from 1970 gives an in-depth and profound look at the Apollo 11 mission to the moon. NASA footage is interspersed with reactions to the mission around the world as the film captures the intensity as well of the philosophical significance of the event. Won special award at Cannes.', 'This documentary by Theo Kamecke from 1970 gives an in-depth and profound look at the Apollo 11 mission to the moon. NASA footage is interspersed with reactions to the mission around the world as the film captures the intensity as well of the philosophical significance of the event. Won special award at Cannes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tb7Yid3QoHuZchMHsLegBxwXWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53227'),
  ('714369210671820085', 'Moonwalker', 1988, 'Fantasy, Music', 'Colin Chilvers, Will Vinton, Jerry Kramer', 'David Newman', 'Michael Jackson, Joe Pesci, Sean Ono Lennon, Kelley Parker, Brandon Quintin Adams, Ben Aaron, Bilal, Brent Kelly', 'PG', 'This fantastical movie inspired by the music of Michael Jackson features imaginative interpretations of hit tracks from the iconic 1987 album “Bad”.', 'This fantastical movie inspired by the music of Michael Jackson features imaginative interpretations of hit tracks from the iconic 1987 album “Bad”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GwTPQkAcgDeAirRpEuJG8HDdRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13192'),
  ('431492941661119178', 'Moonwalkers', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Antoine Bardou-Jacquet, Glynn Speeckaert', 'Dean Craig', 'Rupert Grint, Ron Perlman, Robert Sheehan, Stephen Campbell Moore, Eric Lampaert, Kevin Bishop, Tom Audenaert, Erika Sainte', 'R', 'What if Apollo 11 never actually made it? What if, in reality, Stanley Kubrick secretly shot the famous images of the moon landing in a studio, working for the US administration? This is the premise of a totally plausible conspiracy theory that takes us to swinging sixties London, where a stubborn CIA agent will never find Kubrick but is forced to team up with a lousy manager of a seedy rock band to develop the biggest con of all time.', 'What if Apollo 11 never actually made it? What if, in reality, Stanley Kubrick secretly shot the famous images of the moon landing in a studio, working for the US administration? This is the premise of a totally plausible conspiracy theory that takes us to swinging sixties London, where a stubborn CIA agent will never find Kubrick but is forced to team up with a lousy manager of a seedy rock band to develop the biggest con of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkeHSbyBslHOUBTTWkkPFTyVvQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272548'),
  ('841634482535248698', 'Moors and Christians', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Luis García Berlanga, Miguel Gil, Domingo Solano', 'Rafael Azcona, Luis García Berlanga', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Verónica Forqué, Agustín González, Chus Lampreave, José Luis López Vázquez, Andrés Pajares, María Luisa Ponte, Antonio Resines', null, 'A peculiar family, which owns a nougat factory, decides to set out on a trip to Madrid in order to advertise its products in a Food Fair. Besides the disapproval from the family head and company founder, events are not as expected.', 'A peculiar family, which owns a nougat factory, decides to set out on a trip to Madrid in order to advertise its products in a Food Fair. Besides the disapproval from the family head and company founder, events are not as expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9e0mzeeMJxp312StgYkqmCcrYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116314'),
  ('922797446939787675', 'Moose Hunters', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney, Clarence Nash, Stuart Buchanan, Lee Millar', 'NR', 'Goofy (front) and Donald (rear) are dressed in a moose suit, trying to lure moose for hunter Mickey. When they do find one, it turns out to be more than they can handle.', 'Goofy (front) and Donald (rear) are dressed in a moose suit, trying to lure moose for hunter Mickey. When they do find one, it turns out to be more than they can handle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uutfj4HFkYITTvyCu4xHeojy43i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67125'),
  ('77788992527811819', 'Moral Order', 2020, 'Drama', 'Mário Barroso, Mário Barroso, Pedro Ferro', 'Carlos Saboga', 'Maria de Medeiros, Albano Jerónimo, Júlia Palha, João Arrais, Miguel Borges, Sónia Balacó, Isabel Ruth, Ana Padrão', null, 'In 1918, Maria Adelaide Coelho da Cunha, heiress and owner of the Diário de Notícias, leaves the social, cultural and family luxury in which she lives to escape with a petty chauffeur, 26 years younger.', 'In 1918, Maria Adelaide Coelho da Cunha, heiress and owner of the Diário de Notícias, leaves the social, cultural and family luxury in which she lives to escape with a petty chauffeur, 26 years younger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vp886LMixwrM1o7BTHCfZGfZbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:692840'),
  ('1121197452515780692', 'Morangos com Açúcar - O Filme', 2012, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Hugo de Sousa, Denise Domingos', 'Diogo Tomás, Mafalda Ferreira', 'Sara Matos, Lourenço Ortigão, Lia Carvalho, Ricardo de Sá, Gabriela Barros, David Carreira, Mafalda Portela, Catarina Siqueira', null, 'Through the madness of summer and to the sound of music, the past and the present of ''Morangos com Açúcar'' cross paths in a unique adventure. Between the beach and the pool, the campsite and the holiday camp, long-time friends meet again and new friendships happen.', 'Through the madness of summer and to the sound of music, the past and the present of ''Morangos com Açúcar'' cross paths in a unique adventure. Between the beach and the pool, the campsite and the holiday camp, long-time friends meet again and new friendships happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xA7bfbbV13fgMF9SBplU3XYSDh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115875'),
  ('739328875359204375', 'Morat: Balas Perdidas', 2021, 'Music, Documentary', 'Carlos Sánchez', null, 'Juan Pablo Villamil, Juan Pablo Isaza, Simón Vargas Morales, Martín Vargas Morales', null, 'Morat, the band with the highest amount of tickets sold in LATAM and Spain in the past years offered an unforgettable concert on December 15th at Wizink Center in Madrid as a final clasp of its mythical "Balas Perdidas Tour". They went through the greatest hits that they have been harvesting year after year consolidating them as an icon on the Pop Scene.', 'Morat, the band with the highest amount of tickets sold in LATAM and Spain in the past years offered an unforgettable concert on December 15th at Wizink Center in Madrid as a final clasp of its mythical "Balas Perdidas Tour". They went through the greatest hits that they have been harvesting year after year consolidating them as an icon on the Pop Scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Thyu0UorpClFHHpLt2d0h6k6Wf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:806439'),
  ('379083901701710535', 'Morat: One Last Dream', 2024, 'Music', 'Iván Garcia, Yair Martínez, Julio Lopez', null, 'Juan Pablo Villamil, Juan Pablo Isaza, Simón Vargas Morales, Martín Vargas Morales, Camila Fernández', null, 'Morat, the pop band of the moment, closes its dream and historic stadium tour in Mexico City. 25 stadiums, 15 cities, 10 countries and 800 thousand people who bought tickets for their shows. An unforgettable night broadcast live on Disney+. The band wraps up their world tour, "Antes De Que Amanezca". The final concert, titled "Un Último Sueño", promises their fans an unforgettable experience.', 'Morat, the pop band of the moment, closes its dream and historic stadium tour in Mexico City. 25 stadiums, 15 cities, 10 countries and 800 thousand people who bought tickets for their shows. An unforgettable night broadcast live on Disney+. The band wraps up their world tour, "Antes De Que Amanezca". The final concert, titled "Un Último Sueño", promises their fans an unforgettable experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4yiJCPm3gX3vgcemO5jq6wmAh1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1402430'),
  ('468329131528214116', 'Morbius', 2022, 'Action, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Jane Harwood, Toby Ford, Gary Powell', 'Matt Sazama, Burk Sharpless', 'Jared Leto, Matt Smith, Adria Arjona, Jared Harris, Tyrese Gibson, Al Madrigal, Michael Keaton, Zaris-Angel Hator', 'PG-13', 'Dangerously ill with a rare blood disorder, and determined to save others suffering his same fate, Dr. Michael Morbius attempts a desperate gamble. What at first appears to be a radical success soon reveals itself to be a remedy potentially worse than the disease.', 'Dangerously ill with a rare blood disorder, and determined to save others suffering his same fate, Dr. Michael Morbius attempts a desperate gamble. What at first appears to be a radical success soon reveals itself to be a remedy potentially worse than the disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Av8Z2jZhEm1FLkFzMThzz9hndJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526896'),
  ('797612498072476479', 'Mord in Eberswalde', 2013, 'Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Stephan Wagner', 'Holger Karsten Schmidt', 'Florian Panzner, Ronald Zehrfeld, Ulrike C. Tscharre, Godehard Giese, Martin Brambach, Gerdy Zint, Arved Birnbaum, Sergius Buckmeier', null, 'Heinz Gödicke is the chief commissioner of the People''s Police in the small town of Eberswalde in Brandenburg. Gödicke is called when two bestial murdered children are found in the forest. The investigator tries to get involved in the perpetrators - a rarely used method at the People''s Police - and the perpetrator so on the track. The Stasi-Major Witt is no friend of this procedure and leaves the commissioner only reluctantly free hand in the investigation. The matter does not go to the authorities fast enough and is then simply put to the files. When another murder occurs, it becomes clear that Gödicke was much closer to the enlightenment of the act than everyone thought.', 'Heinz Gödicke is the chief commissioner of the People''s Police in the small town of Eberswalde in Brandenburg. Gödicke is called when two bestial murdered children are found in the forest. The investigator tries to get involved in the perpetrators - a rarely used method at the People''s Police - and the perpetrator so on the track. The Stasi-Major Witt is no friend of this procedure and leaves the commissioner only reluctantly free hand in the investigation. The matter does not go to the authorities fast enough and is then simply put to the files. When another murder occurs, it becomes clear that Gödicke was much closer to the enlightenment of the act than everyone thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iFf5meTmWOMchHmKa63lFGTWbw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167330'),
  ('369890842305084941', 'More', 1969, 'Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Barbet Schroeder, Néstor Almendros', 'Paul Gégauff, Barbet Schroeder', 'Mimsy Farmer, Klaus Grünberg, Heinz Engelmann, Michel Chanderli, Henry Wolf, Louise Wink, Georges Montant', null, 'A German student, Stefan, now finished with his studies, hitchhikes to Paris. There he meets a free-spirited American girl, Estelle, who he follows to Ibiza. The two begin a sad and dark path into heroin addiction.', 'A German student, Stefan, now finished with his studies, hitchhikes to Paris. There he meets a free-spirited American girl, Estelle, who he follows to Ibiza. The two begin a sad and dark path into heroin addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUwWvHuqJFWfYAREKQ52KNbHOxV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21323'),
  ('440355215678386183', 'More', 1998, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Mark Osborne', 'Mark Osborne', null, null, 'A factory worker in a dark, gray world assembles devices that promise happiness. In his spare time he tinkers to create something better, and finally succeeds in perfecting his invention, which allows people to see life through rose-colored glasses, but he has to pay a price for his success.', 'A factory worker in a dark, gray world assembles devices that promise happiness. In his spare time he tinkers to create something better, and finally succeeds in perfecting his invention, which allows people to see life through rose-colored glasses, but he has to pay a price for his success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/802hVxtGoC4uIYMhM6eeXKeK17l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36107'),
  ('690038363777413425', 'More', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'Feza Çaldıran, Onur Saylak, Ogulcan Ava', null, 'Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Hayat Van Eck, Turgut Tunçalp, Tankut Yıldız, Tuba Büyüküstün, Kağan Uluca, Uğur Aslan, Meli Bendeli', null, 'Gaza is a 14-year-old boy who lives on the Aegean coast of Turkey. Together with his domineering father, he helps smuggle refugees from war-torn countries to Europe, giving them temporary lodgings and scant food until they attempt the crossing. Gaza dreams of escaping this life, but can''t help being drawn into a dark world of immorality, exploitation and human suffering. Can you avoid becoming a monster when you''ve been raised by one? Onur Saylak''s debut feature, adapted from the award-winning novel of the same title by Hakan Günday, one of the first novels to document the refugee crisis in Europe, "More" is the gripping story of a boy that gets to grow up in a world where there''s no room for innocence.', 'Gaza is a 14-year-old boy who lives on the Aegean coast of Turkey. Together with his domineering father, he helps smuggle refugees from war-torn countries to Europe, giving them temporary lodgings and scant food until they attempt the crossing. Gaza dreams of escaping this life, but can''t help being drawn into a dark world of immorality, exploitation and human suffering. Can you avoid becoming a monster when you''ve been raised by one? Onur Saylak''s debut feature, adapted from the award-winning novel of the same title by Hakan Günday, one of the first novels to document the refugee crisis in Europe, "More" is the gripping story of a boy that gets to grow up in a world where there''s no room for innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1qpdCimDoqhjODNTk12x2SlYwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473768'),
  ('99341067397216641', 'More About the Children of Noisy Village', 1987, 'Family', 'Lasse Hallström, Jens Fischer', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Linda Bergström, Henrik Larsson, Ellen Demérus, Anna Sahlin, Harald Lönnbro, Tove Edfeldt, Crispin Dickson Wendenius, Sören Petersson', null, 'There are only a handful of children living in Bullarby. This film follows their story through the fall and winter, picking up at the moment "The Children of Noisy Village" finishes.', 'There are only a handful of children living in Bullarby. This film follows their story through the fall and winter, picking up at the moment "The Children of Noisy Village" finishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUOOU0Bh8OwA7dOwI4BjSIXWHoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26111'),
  ('750843493628714125', 'More American Graffiti', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Stephen Lofaro, Thomas Lofaro, Bill L. Norton', 'Bill L. Norton', 'Paul Le Mat, Cindy Williams, Candy Clark, Charles Martin Smith, Mackenzie Phillips, Bo Hopkins, Ron Howard, Will Seltzer', 'PG', 'College graduates deal with Vietnam and other issues of the late ''60s.', 'College graduates deal with Vietnam and other issues of the late ''60s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnHmQgxeHqgc1A78hE3AdzhlJsW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33258'),
  ('503151163594215814', 'More Beautiful', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Karoline Herfurth, Daniel Gottschalk, Manuel Kreuzpaintner', 'Karoline Herfurth, Monika Fäßler', 'Karoline Herfurth, Anneke Kim Sarnau, Emilia Schüle, Nora Tschirner, Dilara Aylin Ziem, Emilia Packard, Godehard Giese, Friedrich Mücke', null, 'The main thing is sexy - no matter whether thin, fat, what skin color, young, old, we can all be sexy in different ways. Almost every woman grows up having to work on herself in order to remain desirable. Why? What if we stopped pushing ourselves into a sexy pose with all our might? What if we no longer fought for the right to be sexy, but were truly free? What if we stopped investing all our time and energy in being heard and the world started to hear us? A modern movie about modern women and men - who might be able to find a common language.', 'The main thing is sexy - no matter whether thin, fat, what skin color, young, old, we can all be sexy in different ways. Almost every woman grows up having to work on herself in order to remain desirable. Why? What if we stopped pushing ourselves into a sexy pose with all our might? What if we no longer fought for the right to be sexy, but were truly free? What if we stopped investing all our time and energy in being heard and the world started to hear us? A modern movie about modern women and men - who might be able to find a common language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oTpuoJvqbsuf14GGSRdUn9bNP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219555'),
  ('571157789417803489', 'More Beautiful for Having Been Broken', 2020, 'Drama', 'Seth Wessel-Estes, Nicole Conn', 'Nicole Conn', 'Zoe Ventoura, Kayla Jenee Radomski, Harley Jane Kozak, Cale Ferrin, French Stewart, Kay Lenz, Bruce Davison, Brooke Elliott', 'PG', 'Three women’s lives intersect at a lakeside resort and are forever changed by the love of a special needs boy.', 'Three women’s lives intersect at a lakeside resort and are forever changed by the love of a special needs boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfxGRXKh80W9LLUVNKvrCL5uCEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566656'),
  ('479680737238017219', 'More Dead than Alive', 1969, 'Western, Action', 'Robert Sparr, Jacques R. Marquette', 'George Schenck', 'Clint Walker, Vincent Price, Anne Francis, Paul Hampton, Mike Henry, Clarke Gordon, Beverly Powers, William Woodson', 'R', 'When the multiple murderer Cain is released from prison after 18 years, he wants to settle down as a rancher and never touch a gun again. But his former life haunts him; not only that nobody wants to give him a job, some villains also want to pay him back. So he has to accept the offer of showman Ruffalo to perform as "Killer Cain" in his traveling shooting show. However after 18 years without practice even Ruffalo''s young assistant Billy shoots better than Cain.', 'When the multiple murderer Cain is released from prison after 18 years, he wants to settle down as a rancher and never touch a gun again. But his former life haunts him; not only that nobody wants to give him a job, some villains also want to pay him back. So he has to accept the offer of showman Ruffalo to perform as "Killer Cain" in his traveling shooting show. However after 18 years without practice even Ruffalo''s young assistant Billy shoots better than Cain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lht1m3XigzIZqgtMITcxCAv6vPH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122160'),
  ('242700354803190305', 'More Dead Than Living', 2026, 'Short, Comedy, Drama', 'JT Doran', 'JT Doran', 'Joe Chan, Emily Fan, Dominic Wong, Xiao Ping Wang, Mia Yu', null, 'A bitter, cranky widow is visited by Death, who lets him know that his time is up. He''s ready and happy to die but not without having one last "magic" adventure with his estranged daughter, whom he never got it right with.', 'A bitter, cranky widow is visited by Death, who lets him know that his time is up. He''s ready and happy to die but not without having one last "magic" adventure with his estranged daughter, whom he never got it right with.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FcfSzyTzwlu6oPO6qW2FvFA88fBA.jpg', 'plex:movie:more-dead-than-living'),
  ('175250240174452532', 'More Kittens', 1936, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'David Hand, Jack Cutting', null, 'Lillian Randolph, Elvia Allman, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Thrown out of the house into the backyard, the three kittens are sheltered by a giant Saint Bernard and are tormented by a turtle and a bluebird.', 'Thrown out of the house into the backyard, the three kittens are sheltered by a giant Saint Bernard and are tormented by a turtle and a bluebird.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xai2QCKfkC5MgnY4Huozct4bEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67126'),
  ('813439513192860922', 'More than a Game', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Kristopher Belman, Johnny Ching, Travis Cook', 'Kristopher Belman, Brad Hogan', 'LeBron James, Romeo Travis, Sian Cotton, Willie McGee, Dru Joyce, Connor Flynn', 'PG', 'This documentary follows NBA superstar LeBron James and four of his talented teammates through the trials and tribulations of high school basketball in Ohio and James'' journey to fame.', 'This documentary follows NBA superstar LeBron James and four of his talented teammates through the trials and tribulations of high school basketball in Ohio and James'' journey to fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sihrAH4uHhpjWwvmGbQVZnUHZaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33295'),
  ('226552845058584465', 'More Than a Miracle', 1967, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Francesco Rosi, Marco Guarnaschelli, Roberto Pariante', 'Raffaele La Capria, Giuseppe Patroni Griffi, Tonino Guerra', 'Sophia Loren, Omar Sharif, Georges Wilson, Leslie French, Dolores del Río, Marina Malfatti, Anna Nogara, Rosemary Martin', 'NR', 'A fairy tale of the misadventures of a beautiful but temperamental Neapolitan peasant, Isabella, when she meets the ill- tempered Spanish Prince Rodrigo Ferrante y Davalos. The King of Spain has ordered Rodrigo to choose a wife among seven Italian Princesses, but he is smitten by the lowly peasant.', 'A fairy tale of the misadventures of a beautiful but temperamental Neapolitan peasant, Isabella, when she meets the ill- tempered Spanish Prince Rodrigo Ferrante y Davalos. The King of Spain has ordered Rodrigo to choose a wife among seven Italian Princesses, but he is smitten by the lowly peasant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2PVZfQUIhmZSPTHulb0vO2Hefg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60543'),
  ('528342048428983277', 'More Than Blue', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Won Tae-yeon, Lee Mo-gae, Oh Seung-chul', 'Won Tae-yeon', 'Kwon Sang-woo, Lee Bo-young, Lee Beom-soo, Jung Ae-yeun, Lee Han-wi, Jong-hak Choi, Wung-hoe Gu, Im Cheol-hyung', null, 'A terminally ill man tries to find a suitable husband for the friend he has loved since childhood.', 'A terminally ill man tries to find a suitable husband for the friend he has loved since childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6KJB752HdXZhEiiXkoGwzVVV2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45098'),
  ('461851513206528311', 'More Than Blue', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Gavin Lin', 'Gavin Lin, Hermes Lu', 'Jasper Liu, Ivy Chen, Bryan Shu-Hao Chang, Annie Chen, Emma Wu, Bruce He, Heaven Hai, Phoebe Lin', null, 'A terminally ill man sets up his best friend, whom he has loved since high school, so that she will not be lonely after he passes away.', 'A terminally ill man sets up his best friend, whom he has loved since high school, so that she will not be lonely after he passes away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIaZMyV7F6cVulZZ16iEL3L1lOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554493'),
  ('459771590774920526', 'More Than Ever', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emily Atef, Yves Cape', 'Lars Hubrich, Emily Atef', 'Vicky Krieps, Gaspard Ulliel, Bjørn Floberg, Sophie Langevin, Valérie Bodson, Jérémy Barbier d''Hiver, Marion Cadeau, Yacine Sif El Islam', null, 'Hélène, a 33-year-old woman from Bordeaux, France, lives happily as a couple with Mathieu, her husband of many years. Her life turns upside down the day she learns she has a rare lung disease. Thanks to a blog, she discovers Norway and decides to follow her instinct. Despite all the love she has for her life partner Mathieu, who is very supportive through her illness, she leaves him behind in France and will cross all Europe to Norway alone in search of a new path and to meet a blogger named Mister that she found on the internet.', 'Hélène, a 33-year-old woman from Bordeaux, France, lives happily as a couple with Mathieu, her husband of many years. Her life turns upside down the day she learns she has a rare lung disease. Thanks to a blog, she discovers Norway and decides to follow her instinct. Despite all the love she has for her life partner Mathieu, who is very supportive through her illness, she leaves him behind in France and will cross all Europe to Norway alone in search of a new path and to meet a blogger named Mister that she found on the internet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d900vS2Xz9XOhYCTE50jwLFZDlo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843093'),
  ('906173165185205606', 'More Than Family', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Choi Ha-na, Kim Ji-hyun', 'Choi Ha-na', 'Krystal Jung, Jang Hye-jin, Choi Deok-moon, Shin Jae-whi, Lee Hae-yeong, Kang Mal-geum, Nam Moon-chul, Jang Hat-sal', null, 'To-il tutors high school student Ho-hoon, but she soon falls in love with him and gets pregnant. The film unfolds a series of playful happenings when To-il embarks on a journey to find her birth father for the wedding, though she is living with her step-father.', 'To-il tutors high school student Ho-hoon, but she soon falls in love with him and gets pregnant. The film unfolds a series of playful happenings when To-il embarks on a journey to find her birth father for the wedding, though she is living with her step-father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdVwijQguggjIV0eZS2l5pLYkMq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626415'),
  ('221486802767794100', 'More Than Honey', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Markus Imhoof, Jörg Jeshel', 'Kerstin Hoppenhaus', 'Fred Jaggi, Randolf Menzel, Liane Singer, Heidrun Singer, John Hurt, Charles Berling, Robert Hunger-Bühler, John Miller', 'NR', 'With dazzling nature photography, Academy Award®–nominated director Markus Imhoof (The Boat Is Full) takes a global examination of endangered honeybees — spanning California, Switzerland, China and Australia — more ambitious than any previous work on the topic.', 'With dazzling nature photography, Academy Award®–nominated director Markus Imhoof (The Boat Is Full) takes a global examination of endangered honeybees — spanning California, Switzerland, China and Australia — more ambitious than any previous work on the topic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEcuFRB2qFdbNKlnyXgSRL8UEG3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124075'),
  ('800369720159873107', 'More Than Miyagi: The Pat Morita Story', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Kayvon Derak Shanian', 'Oscar Alvarez, Kayvon Derak Shanian', 'Pat Morita, Ralph Macchio, Martin Kove, Esai Morales, William Zabka, Ron Thomas, James Hong, Julia Nickson', null, 'The Oscar nominated actor best known for his role of Mr. Miyagi, left behind a painfully revealing autobiographical record of his much-too-brief time here on earth. Tracing his journey from being bed bound as a boy to the bright lights and discrimination in Hollywood. Deep inside that sweet, generous, multi-talented performer seethed an army of demons, that even alcohol and drugs couldn''t mask.', 'The Oscar nominated actor best known for his role of Mr. Miyagi, left behind a painfully revealing autobiographical record of his much-too-brief time here on earth. Tracing his journey from being bed bound as a boy to the bright lights and discrimination in Hollywood. Deep inside that sweet, generous, multi-talented performer seethed an army of demons, that even alcohol and drugs couldn''t mask.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/redrsZOK1g4TIw9jg7iCGjugpjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439213'),
  ('626898265252307568', 'More the Merrier', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Paco Caballero, Alberto Álvarez, David Valldepérez', 'Paco Caballero, Eric Navarro, Eduard Sola', 'Ernesto Alterio, Raúl Arévalo, Luis Callejo, Anna Castillo, Pilar Castro, Álvaro Cervantes, Carlos Cuevas, Verónica Echegui', null, 'Multiple stories about the oscillating world of couple relationships and how difficult it can be to separate sex from love.', 'Multiple stories about the oscillating world of couple relationships and how difficult it can be to separate sex from love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uShw8wJ7K4ySrPtUWjGe8wwJ5fj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763152'),
