  ('379036758258311066', 'More Vampires in Havana', 2003, 'Animation', 'Juan Padrón', 'Juan Padrón, Senel Paz', 'Irela Bravo, Frank González, Mirella Guillot, Carlos González, Jorge Perugorría', null, 'In 1923 the scientist Von Dracula invented Vampisol, a drink that allowed vampires to live in the sun. La Capa Nostra and the European Vampire Group confront each other in Havana to control the Vampisol, but Pepe, Von Dracula''s nephew, sang the Vampisol formula for free on Radio Vampiro Internacional. Now Pepe must face the Nazi vampires, who use the most powerful Vampisol: El Vampiyaba.', 'In 1923 the scientist Von Dracula invented Vampisol, a drink that allowed vampires to live in the sun. La Capa Nostra and the European Vampire Group confront each other in Havana to control the Vampisol, but Pepe, Von Dracula''s nephew, sang the Vampisol formula for free on Radio Vampiro Internacional. Now Pepe must face the Nazi vampires, who use the most powerful Vampisol: El Vampiyaba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEpSWtXt4RRY8aBOHXdgYznA9Xz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113250'),
  ('120670493641556553', 'Morel''s Invention', 1974, 'Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Silvano Ippoliti, Emidio Greco', 'Andrea Barbata, Emidio Greco', 'Giulio Brogi, Anna Karina, John Steiner, Anna Maria Gherardi, Ezio Marano, Margareth Clémenti, Roberto Herlitzka, Claudio Trionfi', null, 'A castaway arrives on an island. He thinks it''s uninhabited, but he sees a palace with also a hidden room. Soon he sees some people walking, dressed with old-fashioned clothes. He is afraid because people don''t see him, like a ghost.', 'A castaway arrives on an island. He thinks it''s uninhabited, but he sees a palace with also a hidden room. Soon he sees some people walking, dressed with old-fashioned clothes. He is afraid because people don''t see him, like a ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5kL6i4yQkyethxmWCKbOSvjrfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60146'),
  ('1043686836756956406', 'Morgan', 2016, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'William Dodds, Tom Mulberge, Luke Scott', 'Seth W. Owen', 'Kate Mara, Anya Taylor-Joy, Toby Jones, Rose Leslie, Boyd Holbrook, Michelle Yeoh, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Paul Giamatti', 'R', 'A corporate risk-management consultant must determine whether or not to terminate an artificial being''s life that was made in a laboratory environment.', 'A corporate risk-management consultant must determine whether or not to terminate an artificial being''s life that was made in a laboratory environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqEFG5ldyeLIFPp7mMI7ZmS7Upm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377264'),
  ('819372812991333731', 'Morgan Ahmed Morgan', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ahmed Abdel Aziz, Ahmad Al-Sayed, Ali Idris', 'Youssef Maaty', 'Adel Emam, Mervat Amin, Sherif Salama, Basma, Mohamed Shoman, Ahmed Mekky, Ahmed Salah ElSaadany, Amr Abd Al Aziz', null, 'Morgan, who is an uneducated very rich man, is used to buy everything he wants. Now the one thing we wants is a college certificate which he seeks to buy.', 'Morgan, who is an uneducated very rich man, is used to buy everything he wants. Now the one thing we wants is a college certificate which he seeks to buy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jO4SRCoTryFWneJxul71iFYR9Qg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406878'),
  ('702343703668474112', 'Morgan Stewart''s Coming Home', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Paul Aaron, Terry Winsor, Alan Smithee', 'Ken Hixon, David N. Titcher', 'Jon Cryer, Viveka Davis, Paul Gleason, Nicholas Pryor, Savely Kramarov, Roger Bowen, Andrew Duncan, Leeza Vinnichenko', 'PG-13', 'Eccentric 17-year-old Morgan Stewart (Cryer) can''t seem to get his conservative parents to notice him - even though Morgan''s been thrown out of 10 prep schools in 7 years! But when a sleazy campaign manager threatens Morgan''s father''s senatorial bid, Morgan comes home to clean up the mess... and creates hilarious havoc! by the time Morgan is finished, Washington politics will never be the same.', 'Eccentric 17-year-old Morgan Stewart (Cryer) can''t seem to get his conservative parents to notice him - even though Morgan''s been thrown out of 10 prep schools in 7 years! But when a sleazy campaign manager threatens Morgan''s father''s senatorial bid, Morgan comes home to clean up the mess... and creates hilarious havoc! by the time Morgan is finished, Washington politics will never be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KVLVabr981GhipzpydITkVCb5P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30175'),
  ('396982398280936315', 'Morgan: A Suitable Case for Treatment', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Karel Reisz, Larry Pizer, Stephen Frears', 'David Mercer', 'David Warner, Vanessa Redgrave, Robert Stephens, Irene Handl, Bernard Bresslaw, Arthur Mullard, Newton Blick, Nan Munro', null, 'Morgan, an aggressive and self-admitted dreamer, a fantasist who uses his flights of fancy as refuge from external reality, where his unconventional behavior lands him in a divorce from his wife, Leonie, trouble with the police and, ultimately, incarceration in a lunatic asylum.', 'Morgan, an aggressive and self-admitted dreamer, a fantasist who uses his flights of fancy as refuge from external reality, where his unconventional behavior lands him in a divorce from his wife, Leonie, trouble with the police and, ultimately, incarceration in a lunatic asylum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xu4awPUFmrFUaX2qk12Lv4QhJSF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42724'),
  ('35565289504554260', 'Morgan: Killer Doll', 2025, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jose Prendes, Camilo Godoy', 'Jose Prendes', 'Bix Krieger, Shelby Wright, Michael Paré, Kylie Roseanne, Kayla Fields, Daniel Ballard, Sara Kamine, Adam Slemon', null, 'Things go awry when Astrid doesn''t share the same feelings for her longtime best friend, Darcy.', 'Things go awry when Astrid doesn''t share the same feelings for her longtime best friend, Darcy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZaITue9TqLzxILtiunBoQ448Pd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1493425'),
  ('362472696797642698', 'Morgana', 2012, 'Horror', 'Ramón Obón', null, 'Irán Castillo, Alejandra Adame, Lilia Aragón, Eugenio Becker, Siouzana Melikián, David Ostrosky, Alejandra Toussaint, Ana Julieta Récamier', null, 'A young girl is hunted by her nightmares', 'A young girl is hunted by her nightmares', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rPtZPYTRMmY4JvibaL7CyaWU0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132705'),
  ('425905890933586105', 'Morgen fällt die Schule aus', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Werner Jacobs, Peter Reimer', 'Franz Seitz Junior', 'Hansi Kraus, Heintje Simons, Theo Lingen, Rudolf Schündler, Ralf Wolter, Fritz Tillmann, Heinz Reincke, Hans Terofal', null, 'Pepe Nietnagel''s father has a valuable stamp collection stolen in Amsterdam. Street musician Pit recovers it. To show his gratitude, Pit is invited to Baden Baden and enters the Mommsen Gymnasium. There, he joins Pepe in his pranks.', 'Pepe Nietnagel''s father has a valuable stamp collection stolen in Amsterdam. Street musician Pit recovers it. To show his gratitude, Pit is invited to Baden Baden and enters the Mommsen Gymnasium. There, he joins Pepe in his pranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2bQsQf86VsxfDzd2flHOOYMibE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11116'),
  ('70472409818068566', 'Morgen, ihr Luschen! Der Ausbilder-Schmidt-Film', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Bernhard Jasper, Mike Eschmann', null, 'Holger Müller, Axel Stein, Collien Fernandes, Horst Krause, Bernhard Hoëcker, Rainer Hunold, Fahri Yardım, Ingo Appelt', null, 'World peace is under threat - it''s a good thing that instructor Schmidt exists. As a sharpshooter with a cigar, sunglasses and beret, he immediately suspects the terrorist conspiracy lurking behind the peace summit at Schwangau Castle. The aim is to unite the strife-torn Kallushistan. Princess Shirin and the pacifist recruit Rainer assist in the hunt for alleged assassins.', 'World peace is under threat - it''s a good thing that instructor Schmidt exists. As a sharpshooter with a cigar, sunglasses and beret, he immediately suspects the terrorist conspiracy lurking behind the peace summit at Schwangau Castle. The aim is to unite the strife-torn Kallushistan. Princess Shirin and the pacifist recruit Rainer assist in the hunt for alleged assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVBzqNQrchFgetn5souHXVkP7Vh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6162'),
  ('731703384370472724', 'Morgiana', 1972, 'Mystery, Horror, Drama', 'Juraj Herz, Jaroslav Kučera, Miloš Kohout', 'Vladimír Bor, Juraj Herz', 'Iva Janžurová, Josef Abrhám, Nina Divíšková, Petr Čepek, Josef Somr, Jiří Kodet, Jiří Lír, Ivan Palúch', null, 'Jealous of her vapidly "good" sister''s popularity, poisonous Viktoria doses pretty Klara''s tea with a slow-acting fatal substance. As the latter grows hysterically weak, the former finds success increasingly compromised by guilt, blackmail, and the pesky need to kill others lest she be exposed.', 'Jealous of her vapidly "good" sister''s popularity, poisonous Viktoria doses pretty Klara''s tea with a slow-acting fatal substance. As the latter grows hysterically weak, the former finds success increasingly compromised by guilt, blackmail, and the pesky need to kill others lest she be exposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bX8ZGlqREc3qwsO7blOPWX52HyG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53186'),
  ('743272642424907294', 'Morgue', 2019, 'Horror', 'Hugo Cardozo, Tito Álvarez', 'Hugo Cardozo', 'Pablo Martínez, María del Mar Fernández, Francisco Ayala, Willy Villalba, Abel Martínez, Raúl Rotela', 'NR', 'On his first day as a security guard, Diego Martinez is assigned to the night shift at the Hospital Regional. On his rounds, he notices the hallways can be unsettling at night until he accidentally notices he’s trapped inside the morgue.', 'On his first day as a security guard, Diego Martinez is assigned to the night shift at the Hospital Regional. On his rounds, he notices the hallways can be unsettling at night until he accidentally notices he’s trapped inside the morgue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0u2fBIPwAi9gM693QaXhV2aoHq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:625814'),
  ('955985750415529488', 'Mori, The Artist''s Habitat', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shuichi Okita, Yuta Tsukinaga, Kohei Adachi', 'Shuichi Okita', 'Tsutomu Yamazaki, Kirin Kiki, Ryo Kase, Kaito Yoshimura, Ken Mitsuishi, Munetaka Aoki, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Nobue Iketani', null, 'Vegetation thrives in painter Morikazu''s garden, which is home to creatures that serve as models for his paintings, including numerous bugs and cats. A sweet and heartwarming day begins for Morikazu, who gazed at these garden creatures on a daily basis for over three decades, and those who love him.', 'Vegetation thrives in painter Morikazu''s garden, which is home to creatures that serve as models for his paintings, including numerous bugs and cats. A sweet and heartwarming day begins for Morikazu, who gazed at these garden creatures on a daily basis for over three decades, and those who love him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkbeC49Kf4kDGUmPDAgeFZyB66Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512337'),
  ('765296090437827787', 'Moriah''s Lighthouse', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Stefan Scaini, Rudolf Blahacek', 'Terry Cunningham, Paul Campbell', 'Rachelle Lefevre, Luke Macfarlane, Valéria Cavalli, Serge Dupire, Duncan Talhouet, Caroline Marcos, Jerry Di Giacomo, Catherine Hubeau', 'G', 'Moriah is a woodworking artisan living in a French, seaside town, who dreams of restoring the local lighthouse. When Ben, an American architect, comes to town, it seems as though her dreams will never become reality after she learns he’s there to give the lighthouse a makeover… but for another buyer.', 'Moriah is a woodworking artisan living in a French, seaside town, who dreams of restoring the local lighthouse. When Ben, an American architect, comes to town, it seems as though her dreams will never become reality after she learns he’s there to give the lighthouse a makeover… but for another buyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p06fH9y1Y2sPVdJGJ7OCw3HHt28.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:970907'),
  ('783071618654000048', 'Morituri', 1965, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, War', 'Bernhard Wicki, David Silver, Conrad Hall', 'Daniel Taradash', 'Marlon Brando, Yul Brynner, Janet Margolin, Trevor Howard, Martin Benrath, Hans Christian Blech, Wally Cox, Max Haufler', null, 'A German living in India during World War II is blackmailed by the English to impersonate an SS officer on board a cargo ship leaving Japan for Germany carrying a large supply of rubber for tyres. His mission is to disable the scuttling charges so the captain cannot sink the ship if they are stopped by English warships.', 'A German living in India during World War II is blackmailed by the English to impersonate an SS officer on board a cargo ship leaving Japan for Germany carrying a large supply of rubber for tyres. His mission is to disable the scuttling charges so the captain cannot sink the ship if they are stopped by English warships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXhWg0m92zVGaei06FYw5lQFAoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42737'),
  ('254411552541844313', 'Morituris: Legions Of The Dead', 2012, 'Horror', 'Daniele Poli, Raffaele Picchio', 'Gianluigi Perrone, Raffaele Picchio, Tiziano Martella', 'Valentina D''Andrea, Andrea De Bruyn, Désirée Giorgetti, Francesco Malcom, Giuseppe Nitti, Simone Ripanti', null, 'Rome, in 73 B.C. Spartacus led the rebellion of 200 gladiators wich saw them opposed to the inhumanity which Rome had forced them into. During the riot they resisted for a long time against the roman soldiers. Few against a whole army. Some of them went crazy and started murders, rapes and violence. Spartacus punished them with dead. But in those lands, when blood gets shed, they come back ...', 'Rome, in 73 B.C. Spartacus led the rebellion of 200 gladiators wich saw them opposed to the inhumanity which Rome had forced them into. During the riot they resisted for a long time against the roman soldiers. Few against a whole army. Some of them went crazy and started murders, rapes and violence. Spartacus punished them with dead. But in those lands, when blood gets shed, they come back ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fIJcElCFiOO6Arr0JfJ5JzNE7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122382'),
