  ('986460589675742211', 'Morning Departure', 1950, 'Drama', 'Roy Ward Baker, Desmond Dickinson', 'W.E. Fairchild', 'John Mills, Richard Attenborough, Nigel Patrick, George Cole, Bernard Lee, Peter Hammond, Andrew Crawford, Michael Brennan', null, 'The crew of a submarine is trapped on the sea floor when it sinks. How can they be rescued before they run out of air?', 'The crew of a submarine is trapped on the sea floor when it sinks. How can they be rescued before they run out of air?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTZ64pYZBt14Du5YQ3A3v7237Tx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39288'),
  ('884062893662413351', 'Morning Glory', 1933, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lowell Sherman, Bert Glennon, James Hartnett', 'Howard J. Green', 'Katharine Hepburn, Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Adolphe Menjou, Mary Duncan, C. Aubrey Smith, Don Alvarado, Fred Santley, Richard Carle', 'NR', 'Wildly optimistic chatterbox Eva Lovelace is a would-be actress trying to crash the New York stage. She attracts the interest of a paternal actor, a philandering producer, and an earnest playwright. Is she destined for stardom, or will she fade like a morning glory after its brief blooming?', 'Wildly optimistic chatterbox Eva Lovelace is a would-be actress trying to crash the New York stage. She attracts the interest of a paternal actor, a philandering producer, and an earnest playwright. Is she destined for stardom, or will she fade like a morning glory after its brief blooming?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jp92gr0EWgYQxoGcY5GQaV3kmax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31777'),
  ('507219684786095992', 'Morning Glory', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Laszlo George, Steven Hilliard Stern', 'Deborah Raffin, Charles Jarrott', 'Christopher Reeve, Deborah Raffin, Lloyd Bochner, Nina Foch, Helen Shaver, J.T. Walsh, Susan Astley, Ian Black', 'PG-13', 'An ex-convict who is on parole is accused of murdering a loose woman in the town where he works.', 'An ex-convict who is on parole is accused of murdering a loose woman in the town where he works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHPKtFIAZF6rUcfF9FbMy1E9tks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127167'),
  ('554252425885972798', 'Morning Glory', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Roger Michell, Alwin H. Küchler', 'Aline Brosh McKenna', 'Rachel McAdams, Harrison Ford, Diane Keaton, Patrick Wilson, Jeff Goldblum, John Pankow, Matt Malloy, J. Elaine Marcos', 'PG-13', 'A young and devoted morning television producer is hired as an executive producer on a long-running morning show at a once-prominent but currently failing station in New York City. Eager to keep the show on air, she recruits a former news journalist and anchor who disapproves of co-hosting a show that does not deal with real news stories.', 'A young and devoted morning television producer is hired as an executive producer on a long-running morning show at a once-prominent but currently failing station in New York City. Eager to keep the show on air, she recruits a former news journalist and anchor who disapproves of co-hosting a show that does not deal with real news stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFRXEoB3QkeHNHYmVGC3uzFSol8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38357'),
  ('730895815782757860', 'Morning Patrol', 1987, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Nikos Nikolaidis, Dinos Katsouridis', 'Nikos Nikolaidis', 'Michele Valley, Takis Spyridakis, Panos Thanassoulis, Takis Loukatos, Nikos Hatzis, Vicky Kampouri, Liana Hatzi', null, 'A deserted city is the setting, where a woman walks alone trying to approach and enter the forbidden zone. Traps and the morning patrol lurk everywhere. Electronic voices summon the (non-existent) people to abandon the city. Can a love affair in this place survive?', 'A deserted city is the setting, where a woman walks alone trying to approach and enter the forbidden zone. Traps and the morning patrol lurk everywhere. Electronic voices summon the (non-existent) people to abandon the city. Can a love affair in this place survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mF6JIbnVizvUo7MMF5N4tONkv1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76825'),
  ('737560789363414443', 'Morocco', 1930, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lucien Ballard, Josef von Sternberg, Lee Garmes', 'Benno Vigny, Jules Furthman', 'Gary Cooper, Marlene Dietrich, Adolphe Menjou, Ullrich Haupt, Eve Southern, Francis McDonald, Paul Porcasi, Émile Chautard', 'NR', 'Mogador, Morocco. Late 1920s. A complex romance develops between a womanizing Legionnaire and a disillusioned Parisian cabaret singer.', 'Mogador, Morocco. Late 1920s. A complex romance develops between a womanizing Legionnaire and a disillusioned Parisian cabaret singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDqZsxyv35iyJWW0mANk1RhxhJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42641'),
  ('102793816441065688', 'Morons from Outer Space', 1985, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Mike Hodges, Phil Meheux, Russell Lodge', 'Griff Rhys Jones, Mel Smith', 'Mel Smith, Griff Rhys Jones, Joanne Pearce, Jimmy Nail, Paul Bown, James B. Sikking, Dinsdale Landen, André Maranne', null, 'The story begins on a small spaceship docking with a refueling station. On board are a group of four aliens, Bernard, Sandra, Desmond, and Julian. During a particularly tedious period of their stay at the station, the other three begin playing with the ship’s controls while Bernard is outside playing spaceball. They accidentally disconnect his part of the ship, leaving him stranded while they crash into a large blue planet close by...', 'The story begins on a small spaceship docking with a refueling station. On board are a group of four aliens, Bernard, Sandra, Desmond, and Julian. During a particularly tedious period of their stay at the station, the other three begin playing with the ship’s controls while Bernard is outside playing spaceball. They accidentally disconnect his part of the ship, leaving him stranded while they crash into a large blue planet close by...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2C7h2FMGBeMVZNO8IHXd2XjDAx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33525'),
  ('847356911061712946', 'Morphine', 2008, 'Drama', 'Aleksei Balabanov, Mikhail Nikolaev, Olga Kashirina', 'Sergei Bodrov Jr.', 'Leonid Bichevin, Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Andrei Panin, Svetlana Pismichenko, Katarina Radivojević, Aleksandr Mosin, Irina Rakshina, Sergey Garmash', null, 'The year is 1917. We are in the Russian countryside. It is the middle of freezing winter. A pale young, newly educated doctor arrives. Having to deal with one medical challenge after another he soon becomes the center of everyone''s attention. To soothe the impressions of human suffering he turns to morphine.', 'The year is 1917. We are in the Russian countryside. It is the middle of freezing winter. A pale young, newly educated doctor arrives. Having to deal with one medical challenge after another he soon becomes the center of everyone''s attention. To soothe the impressions of human suffering he turns to morphine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xj1qdtzJp1XDdobTSVULVYTSbDM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51284'),
  ('1121397251244206677', 'Morris from America', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chad Hartigan, Sean McElwee, Thorsten Wenning', 'Chad Hartigan', 'Markees Christmas, Craig Robinson, Lina Keller, Carla Juri, Jakub Gierszał, Levin Henning, Eva Löbau, Patrick Güldenberg', 'R', '13-year-old Morris Gentry has just relocated with his single father, Curtis to Heidelberg, Germany. Morris, who fancies himself the next Notorious B.I.G., is a complete fish-out-of-water—a budding hip-hop star in an EDM world. To complicate matters further, Morris quickly falls hard for his cool, rebellious, 15-year-old classmate Katrin. Morris sets out against all odds to take the hip-hop world by storm and win the girl of his dreams.', '13-year-old Morris Gentry has just relocated with his single father, Curtis to Heidelberg, Germany. Morris, who fancies himself the next Notorious B.I.G., is a complete fish-out-of-water—a budding hip-hop star in an EDM world. To complicate matters further, Morris quickly falls hard for his cool, rebellious, 15-year-old classmate Katrin. Morris sets out against all odds to take the hip-hop world by storm and win the girl of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3mFOlegdIaeZY8qHvZEtcYd8Te.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352890'),
  ('222057261540015647', 'Morris the Midget Moose', 1950, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Dink Trout', 'NR', 'A bootle beetle elder tells the story of Morris, the moose about the size of a rabbit. Thunderclap the moose is taking on all challengers, and Morris decides to try, much to the amusement of Thunderclap. As a result, he meets Balsam, a full-size moose with tiny antlers (Morris'' antlers are full size). The two team up, and with the help of a log that makes them very tall, defeat Thunderclap.', 'A bootle beetle elder tells the story of Morris, the moose about the size of a rabbit. Thunderclap the moose is taking on all challengers, and Morris decides to try, much to the amusement of Thunderclap. As a result, he meets Balsam, a full-size moose with tiny antlers (Morris'' antlers are full size). The two team up, and with the help of a log that makes them very tall, defeat Thunderclap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMtYmUdZTh7IGAjLVgLK3kcK804.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73684'),
  ('1093948508021629133', 'Morrison', 2021, 'Drama', 'Andrea Arnone, Giulio De Cola, Francesco Niccolai', 'Giacomo Gensini, Federico Zampaglione', 'Lorenzo Zurzolo, Giovanni Calcagno, Carlotta Antonelli, Giglia Marra, Riccardo De Filippis, Adamo Dionisi, Gabriele Sorrentino, Stefano Ambrogi', null, 'Lodo is twenty years old and lives the difficulties of his age, between a difficult relationship with his father and the attempt to conquer Giulia, his roommate with whom he is madly in love. He performs with the MOB, an indie band, in a legendary Roman club: the Morrison. One day, by chance, Lodo''s path crosses that of Libero Ferri, a former rock star with a stalemate career, who tries to find success but ends up withdrawing more and more in himself, neglecting his beautiful wife Luna and living isolated in his luxurious villa full of memories. Between dreams, failures, friendship, tormented loves and curious characters, their meeting will become a mutual stimulus to move forward, but at times also a difficult comparison between generations and very different ways of being.', 'Lodo is twenty years old and lives the difficulties of his age, between a difficult relationship with his father and the attempt to conquer Giulia, his roommate with whom he is madly in love. He performs with the MOB, an indie band, in a legendary Roman club: the Morrison. One day, by chance, Lodo''s path crosses that of Libero Ferri, a former rock star with a stalemate career, who tries to find success but ends up withdrawing more and more in himself, neglecting his beautiful wife Luna and living isolated in his luxurious villa full of memories. Between dreams, failures, friendship, tormented loves and curious characters, their meeting will become a mutual stimulus to move forward, but at times also a difficult comparison between generations and very different ways of being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnyWxCpFiAiDA2LGSRDjnhUGUzq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765490'),
  ('877528225371270242', 'Mort d''un berger', 2024, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Christian Bonnet', 'Catherine Ramberg', 'Anny Duperey, Guillaume Arnault, Daphné Girard, Édouard Montoute, Hélie-Rose Dalmay, Sören Prévost, Nadia Fossier, Pascal Gimenez', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3cfdKSEHVHdIU6WCb3MwzigmeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1149095'),
  ('221305284809893728', 'Mort sur la piste', 2023, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Philippe Dajoux, Bruno Rosanvallon, Jean-Roch Gouédard', 'Matthieu Savignac, Didier Neyrac', 'Jason Priestley, Éléonore Bernheim, Olivier Marchal, Roby Schinasi, Mathieu Delarive, Guillaume Faure, Louvia Bachelier, François Bureloup', null, 'As the first test drives begin for the 24 Hours of Le Mans, the body of a pilot is discovered on the track. It was carefully dragged there. Captain Sabrina Nedjard is in charge of the investigation, followed by an American observer from LAPD as part of an international exchange. Their inquiries will lead them to the paddocks and the workshops of a well-known amateur racing team where high stakes disrupt the relationships between an authoritarian father and his children.', 'As the first test drives begin for the 24 Hours of Le Mans, the body of a pilot is discovered on the track. It was carefully dragged there. Captain Sabrina Nedjard is in charge of the investigation, followed by an American observer from LAPD as part of an international exchange. Their inquiries will lead them to the paddocks and the workshops of a well-known amateur racing team where high stakes disrupt the relationships between an authoritarian father and his children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHbvAEhgf296ZCJJb5YoiBRXePX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1097234'),
  ('923461757884717922', 'Mortacci', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Citti, Cristiano Pogany, Ferzan Özpetek', 'David Grieco, Vincenzo Cerami, Ottavio Jemma', 'Vittorio Gassman, Carol Alt, Malcolm McDowell, Galeazzo Benti, Mariangela Melato, Sergio Rubini, Nino Frassica, Aldo Giuffrè', null, 'Before finally entering the afterlife, the dead spend a period in a limbo from which they depart only when, among the living, there is no one who remembers them. Under the care of the salacious Domenico the visitors of a small cemetery recount how they arrived at eternal peace.', 'Before finally entering the afterlife, the dead spend a period in a limbo from which they depart only when, among the living, there is no one who remembers them. Under the care of the salacious Domenico the visitors of a small cemetery recount how they arrived at eternal peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HgP7YSMLWTTgwueImirY2Lps8W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182843'),
  ('484634074813481503', 'Mortadelo & Filemon: Mission Implausible', 2014, 'Comedy, Animation, Adventure', 'Javier Fesser, Miguel Pablos, Javier Abad', 'Javier Fesser, Cristóbal Ruiz, Claro García', 'Karra Elejalde, Janfri Topera, Gabriel Chame Buendía, Ramón Langa, Mariano Venancio, Víctor Monigote, José Alias, Emilio Gavira', null, 'A criminal produces an uncontrollable laughter to the population and Mortadelo and Filemón will have to stop him.', 'A criminal produces an uncontrollable laughter to the population and Mortadelo and Filemón will have to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20msmZ6kEpA90euZOMIp2z0TmsK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227738'),
  ('833677795150611603', 'Mortadelo & Filemon: Mission: Save the Planet', 2008, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Miguel Bardem, Unax Mendia', 'Juan Vicente Pozuelo, Carlos Martín, Miguel Bardem', 'Edu Soto, Pepe Viyuela, Berta Ojea, Janfri Topera, Mariano Venancio, Carlos Santos, Emilio Gavira, Álex O''Dogherty', null, 'The planet is facing a great threat. During the worst drought ever known, a group of wrongdoers are in the process of finishing all the reserves of water that remain on Earth. The best secret agents in the world meet urgently, but they don''t even have a clue. To make things even worse, the evil Botijola plans to sabotage the meeting. His intention is to convert the water into a substitute. In order to do this, he also tries to kidnap mad Professor Bacterio and get him to work for him. However, there are two things Botijola wasn''t expecting. On the one hand, Bacterio, before being kidnapped, hid the parts of his invention in different historical moments, using a time machine. On the other hand, there are two international agents who haven''t turned up at the sabotaged meeting, two agents who become the world''s only hope: Mortadelo and Filemón.', 'The planet is facing a great threat. During the worst drought ever known, a group of wrongdoers are in the process of finishing all the reserves of water that remain on Earth. The best secret agents in the world meet urgently, but they don''t even have a clue. To make things even worse, the evil Botijola plans to sabotage the meeting. His intention is to convert the water into a substitute. In order to do this, he also tries to kidnap mad Professor Bacterio and get him to work for him. However, there are two things Botijola wasn''t expecting. On the one hand, Bacterio, before being kidnapped, hid the parts of his invention in different historical moments, using a time machine. On the other hand, there are two international agents who haven''t turned up at the sabotaged meeting, two agents who become the world''s only hope: Mortadelo and Filemón.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKtrg4JyfyYXIMiUH45wjloc9kg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80446'),
  ('562290132473967576', 'Mortadelo & Filemon: The Big Adventure', 2003, 'Action, Comedy', 'Javier Fesser, Xavi Giménez', 'Guillermo Fesser, Javier Fesser', 'Benito Pocino, Pepe Viyuela, Dominique Pinon, Paco Sagarzazu, Mariano Venancio, Janfri Topera, Berta Ojea, María Isbert', null, 'In the Headquarters of the T.I.A. (Terminal Intelligence Agency), someone has stolen Professor Bacterio''s most dangerous invention, the D.O.T. (Demoralizer of Troops), an artifact that ends up in the hands of a very short, wacky dictator who is ready to use it for criminal purposes. The T.I.A Chief, though, is firm in his resolve: if he wants to get the D.O.T. back, he must NOT count on his agents Mortadelo & Filemon. But when the crime fighting duo discover that the T.I.A. has engaged a cocky and slimy detective from outside the agency, they decide to act at their own risk, even if that risk involves all of Humanity.', 'In the Headquarters of the T.I.A. (Terminal Intelligence Agency), someone has stolen Professor Bacterio''s most dangerous invention, the D.O.T. (Demoralizer of Troops), an artifact that ends up in the hands of a very short, wacky dictator who is ready to use it for criminal purposes. The T.I.A Chief, though, is firm in his resolve: if he wants to get the D.O.T. back, he must NOT count on his agents Mortadelo & Filemon. But when the crime fighting duo discover that the T.I.A. has engaged a cocky and slimy detective from outside the agency, they decide to act at their own risk, even if that risk involves all of Humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiP17WpKYLotQwg4EUs0UfmQq24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8980'),
  ('327854836472305328', 'Mortal', 2020, 'Action, Fantasy, Thriller', 'André Øvredal, Roman Osin, Samuel Kirby', 'Geoff Bussetil, Norman Lesperance, André Øvredal', 'Nat Wolff, Iben Akerlie, Per Frisch, Priyanka Bose, Arthur Hakalahti, Kai Kolstad Rødseth, Niko Rusakov, Ravdeep Singh Bajwa', 'R', 'A young boy must discover the origins of his extraordinary powers before he is captured by authorities hell-bent on condemning him for an accidental murder.', 'A young boy must discover the origins of his extraordinary powers before he is captured by authorities hell-bent on condemning him for an accidental murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVbqhqYtlxwEGihTEhewZAgDOCX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489326'),
  ('539549772742386990', 'Mortal Engines', 2018, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Ant Davies, Simon English, Laurie Wright', 'Peter Jackson, Fran Walsh, Philippa Boyens', 'Hera Hilmar, Robert Sheehan, Hugo Weaving, Jihae, Ronan Raftery, Leila George, Patrick Malahide, Stephen Lang', 'PG-13', 'Many thousands of years in the future, Earth’s cities roam the globe on huge wheels, devouring each other in a struggle for ever diminishing resources. On one of these massive traction cities, the old London, Tom Natsworthy has an unexpected encounter with a mysterious young woman from the wastelands who will change the course of his life forever.', 'Many thousands of years in the future, Earth’s cities roam the globe on huge wheels, devouring each other in a struggle for ever diminishing resources. On one of these massive traction cities, the old London, Tom Natsworthy has an unexpected encounter with a mysterious young woman from the wastelands who will change the course of his life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLhYg9NIvIPKVRTtvzCWnp1qJWG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428078'),
  ('166302328821200011', 'Mortal Kombat', 1995, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Paul W. S. Anderson, John R. Leonetti, Jesse V. Johnson', 'Kevin Droney', 'Robin Shou, Linden Ashby, Bridgette Wilson-Sampras, Christopher Lambert, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Talisa Soto, Trevor Goddard, Chris Casamassa', 'PG-13', 'For nine generations an evil sorcerer has been victorious in hand-to-hand battle against his mortal enemies. If he wins a tenth Mortal Kombat tournament, desolation and evil will reign over the multiverse forever. To save Earth, three warriors must overcome seemingly insurmountable odds, their own inner demons, and superhuman foes.', 'For nine generations an evil sorcerer has been victorious in hand-to-hand battle against his mortal enemies. If he wins a tenth Mortal Kombat tournament, desolation and evil will reign over the multiverse forever. To save Earth, three warriors must overcome seemingly insurmountable odds, their own inner demons, and superhuman foes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcK7tzSSXMYiMN8E9KlZJL1BYyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9312'),
  ('342643132814227810', 'Mortal Kombat', 2021, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Chris Webb, P.J. Voeten, Danielle Blake', 'Greg Russo, David Callaham', 'Lewis Tan, Jessica McNamee, Mehcad Brooks, Josh Lawson, Ludi Lin, Max Huang, Tadanobu Asano, Chin Han', 'R', 'Washed-up MMA fighter Cole Young, unaware of his heritage, and hunted by Emperor Shang Tsung''s best warrior, Sub-Zero, seeks out and trains with Earth''s greatest champions as he prepares to stand against the enemies of Outworld in a high stakes battle for the universe.', 'Washed-up MMA fighter Cole Young, unaware of his heritage, and hunted by Emperor Shang Tsung''s best warrior, Sub-Zero, seeks out and trains with Earth''s greatest champions as he prepares to stand against the enemies of Outworld in a high stakes battle for the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybrX94xQm8lXYpZAPRmwD9iIbWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460465'),
  ('457341571846959803', 'Mortal Kombat II', 2026, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Simon McQuoid, Stephen F. Windon, Loretta Cosgrove', 'Jeremy Slater', 'Karl Urban, Adeline Rudolph, Jessica McNamee, Josh Lawson, Ludi Lin, Mehcad Brooks, Tati Gabrielle, Lewis Tan', 'R', 'The fan favorite champions—now joined by Johnny Cage himself—are pitted against one another in the ultimate, no-holds barred, gory battle to defeat the dark rule of Shao Kahn that threatens the very existence of the Earthrealm and its defenders.', 'The fan favorite champions—now joined by Johnny Cage himself—are pitted against one another in the ultimate, no-holds barred, gory battle to defeat the dark rule of Shao Kahn that threatens the very existence of the Earthrealm and its defenders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIsMeDbwntNXSUVHmWMMRXEZOVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931285'),
  ('26735318563252245', 'Mortal Kombat Legends: Battle of the Realms', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Ethan Spaulding', 'Jeremy Adams', 'Jordan Rodrigues, Jennifer Carpenter, Joel McHale, Patrick Seitz, Dave B. Mitchell, Bayardo De Murguia, Fred Tatasciore, Matthew Mercer', 'R', 'The Earthrealm heroes must journey to the Outworld and fight for the survival of their homeland, invaded by the forces of evil warlord Shao Kahn, in the tournament to end all tournaments: the final Mortal Kombat.', 'The Earthrealm heroes must journey to the Outworld and fight for the survival of their homeland, invaded by the forces of evil warlord Shao Kahn, in the tournament to end all tournaments: the final Mortal Kombat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ablrE8IbWcIrAxMmm4gnPn75AMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:841755'),
  ('180386019265976810', 'Mortal Kombat Legends: Cage Match', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Seo Jung-ha, Je-Ha Yu, Ethan Spaulding', 'Jeremy Adams', 'Joel McHale, Jennifer Grey, Dusan Brown, Grey DeLisle, Robin Atkin Downes, Zehra Fazal, Gilbert Gottfried, Kelly Hu', 'R', 'In 1980s Hollywood, action star Johnny Cage is looking to become an A-list actor. But when his costar, Jennifer, goes missing from set, Johnny finds himself thrust into a world filled with shadows, danger, and deceit. As he embarks on a bloody journey, Johnny quickly discovers the City of Angels has more than a few devils in its midst.', 'In 1980s Hollywood, action star Johnny Cage is looking to become an A-list actor. But when his costar, Jennifer, goes missing from set, Johnny finds himself thrust into a world filled with shadows, danger, and deceit. As he embarks on a bloody journey, Johnny quickly discovers the City of Angels has more than a few devils in its midst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eKWqTHp4OgKdx1QX1O9LxKHr1M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034062'),
  ('510732763500518370', 'Mortal Kombat Legends: Snow Blind', 2022, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Rick Morales, Gyungho Choi, Jinhyun Choi', 'Jeremy Adams', 'Manny Jacinto, David Wenham, Artt Butler, Yuri Lowenthal, Sumalee Montano, Patrick Seitz, Keith Silverstein, Courtenay Taylor', 'R', 'Hellbent on taking over Earthrealm, Kano viciously attacks town after town with the aid of three cold-blooded Black Dragon mercenaries. Those who don’t submit are annihilated but one young man won’t bend the knee to Kano: Kenshi.', 'Hellbent on taking over Earthrealm, Kano viciously attacks town after town with the aid of three cold-blooded Black Dragon mercenaries. Those who don’t submit are annihilated but one young man won’t bend the knee to Kano: Kenshi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wyOdQRVrpoUb2wMdGHykaD17GM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1007401'),
  ('147630697255727419', 'Mortal Kombat: Annihilation', 1997, 'Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'John R. Leonetti, Pat E. Johnson, Apichart Chusakul', 'Brent V. Friedman, Bryce Zabel', 'Robin Shou, Talisa Soto, James Remar, Sandra Hess, Lynn ''Red'' Williams, Brian Thompson, Musetta Vander, Irina Pantaeva', 'PG-13', 'A group of heroic warriors has only six days to save the planet in "Mortal Kombat Annihilation." To succeed they must survive the most spectacular series of challenges any human, or god, has ever encountered as they battle an evil warlord bent on taking control of Earth.', 'A group of heroic warriors has only six days to save the planet in "Mortal Kombat Annihilation." To succeed they must survive the most spectacular series of challenges any human, or god, has ever encountered as they battle an evil warlord bent on taking control of Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttryglcY2osWZE3sRYBf3ewTZsW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9823'),
  ('121657348165402373', 'Mortal Kombat: The Journey Begins', 1995, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Joseph Francis, Steven Wright, Jinko Gotoh', 'Kevin Droney', 'Jeff Bennett, Jim Cummings, Ron Feinberg, Jennifer Hale, Randy Hamilton', 'PG', 'As the three chosen defenders of Earth travel to Shang Tsung''s island, Rayden teaches them how to become the masters of their destinies, overcome their foes, and control their powers. Liu Kang, Sonya Blade and Johnny Cage must defeat Shang Tsung, Sub Zero, Scorpion and Goro in a tournament of Mortal Kombat if they are to survive and save the fate of the earth.', 'As the three chosen defenders of Earth travel to Shang Tsung''s island, Rayden teaches them how to become the masters of their destinies, overcome their foes, and control their powers. Liu Kang, Sonya Blade and Johnny Cage must defeat Shang Tsung, Sub Zero, Scorpion and Goro in a tournament of Mortal Kombat if they are to survive and save the fate of the earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11IzPcxoq22dqrftKgt5CZPHjhM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72886'),
  ('5520520702626510', 'Mortal Passions', 1989, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Andrew Lane, Christian Sebaldt', 'Alan Moskowitz', 'Zach Galligan, Michael Bowen, Krista Errickson, Luca Bercovici, Sheila Kelley, David Warner, Cassandra Gava', 'R', 'A scheming woman seeks to kill her husband to collect the insurance money, and is willing to seduce anyone she can to do it - including her husband''s brother.', 'A scheming woman seeks to kill her husband to collect the insurance money, and is willing to seduce anyone she can to do it - including her husband''s brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQbbQHgTUPwtOyI37yVlcyjbLJ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90869'),
  ('32042436974479417', 'Mortal Thoughts', 1991, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Alan Rudolph, Elliot Davis, Alec Hirschfeld', 'William Reilly, Claude Kerven', 'Demi Moore, Glenne Headly, Bruce Willis, John Pankow, Harvey Keitel, Billie Neal, Frank Vincent, Karen Shallo', 'R', 'A loathsome man ends up dead, but it''s not clear who''s to blame. If ever a person got what he deserved, it''s James Urbanksi, an abusive drunk who steals from his wife, Joyce, and promises her close friend Cynthia Kellogg that she''ll be the next target of his rage. At a group outing, James bleeds to death after someone cuts his throat. But because he''s such a terrible human being, police aren''t sure which of his acquaintances decided to kill him.', 'A loathsome man ends up dead, but it''s not clear who''s to blame. If ever a person got what he deserved, it''s James Urbanksi, an abusive drunk who steals from his wife, Joyce, and promises her close friend Cynthia Kellogg that she''ll be the next target of his rage. At a group outing, James bleeds to death after someone cuts his throat. But because he''s such a terrible human being, police aren''t sure which of his acquaintances decided to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Py7bFBsRjMVdOI5IlNSz6aa385.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30815'),
  ('685953269444903787', 'Mortal Transfer', 2001, 'Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Jean-Jacques Beineix, Benoît Delhomme', 'Jean-Jacques Beineix', 'Jean-Hugues Anglade, Hélène de Fougerolles, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Valentina Sauca, Robert Hirsch, Yves Rénier, Catherine Mouchet, Denis Podalydès', null, 'Michel, a psycho-analyst, falls asleep while listening to his patient Olga, a kleptomaniac and a sexual pervert, tell him how she likes her husband beating her. When he wakes up, he finds Olga having been choked to death. He now has to deal with a body, with Olga''s rich husband who thinks she stole money from him, and with all his patients'' insanity that haunts him.', 'Michel, a psycho-analyst, falls asleep while listening to his patient Olga, a kleptomaniac and a sexual pervert, tell him how she likes her husband beating her. When he wakes up, he finds Olga having been choked to death. He now has to deal with a body, with Olga''s rich husband who thinks she stole money from him, and with all his patients'' insanity that haunts him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFesNOzvn23DRlkUlC9br5aUX6c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49691'),
  ('349599415635862449', 'Mortal World', 2018, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Ali Atay', 'Ali Demirel, Ali Atay, Aziz Kedi', 'Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Alper Kul, Sarp Apak, İrem Sak, Doğu Demirkol, Feyyaz Yiğit, Meltem Kaptan, Mehmet Özgür', null, 'Mermer family, who has been managing a restaurant called “Anatolian flavors” in Haydarpasa train station for generations, consist of 8 members. Even though this family leads a quiet simple life, they will end up finding themselves in complicated situations. Moreover, this family has been keeping a secret for a long time and it just can’t come out at any cost..', 'Mermer family, who has been managing a restaurant called “Anatolian flavors” in Haydarpasa train station for generations, consist of 8 members. Even though this family leads a quiet simple life, they will end up finding themselves in complicated situations. Moreover, this family has been keeping a secret for a long time and it just can’t come out at any cost..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rciymOhVvvaL7JqVJGsG8KGC3tE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499461'),
  ('483787987679037839', 'Mortal World 2', 2023, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Ali Atay', 'Feyyaz Yiğit, Aziz Kedi, Ali Atay', 'Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Alper Kul, Doğu Demirkol, Feyyaz Yiğit, Giray Altınok, İrem Sak, Mehmet Özgür, Özgür Emre Yıldırım', null, 'Mortal World 2 tells the story of the Mermer family, who now continues their lives as outlaws, struggles with their own problems. Serhan has difficulty adjusting Begüm, who is pregnant, to their new life. While Serhat is now missing a woman in his life, Gazanfer struggles to keep his family together against the organization. However, Zafer''s fall into the hands of the organization turns everyone''s lives upside down. Looking for a way to reach Zafer, Gazanfer finds the solution by asking for help from an old friend. This time, the Mermer family will have to make one last heist to reunite with their children.', 'Mortal World 2 tells the story of the Mermer family, who now continues their lives as outlaws, struggles with their own problems. Serhan has difficulty adjusting Begüm, who is pregnant, to their new life. While Serhat is now missing a woman in his life, Gazanfer struggles to keep his family together against the organization. However, Zafer''s fall into the hands of the organization turns everyone''s lives upside down. Looking for a way to reach Zafer, Gazanfer finds the solution by asking for help from an old friend. This time, the Mermer family will have to make one last heist to reunite with their children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxdmeAKAjeoMIPBrhgULHAZct60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1137064'),
  ('711815767126952941', 'Mortdecai', 2015, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'David Koepp, G.A. Aguilar, Rebecca White', 'Eric Aronson, Kyril Bonfiglioli', 'Johnny Depp, Gwyneth Paltrow, Ewan McGregor, Paul Bettany, Jonny Pasvolsky, Olivia Munn, Jeff Goldblum, Michael Culkin', 'R', 'An art dealer, Charles Mortdecai, searches for a stolen painting rumored to contain a secret code that gains access to hidden Nazi gold.', 'An art dealer, Charles Mortdecai, searches for a stolen painting rumored to contain a secret code that gains access to hidden Nazi gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIRDhdAuMevOuY2vs3s1HNcqDq7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210860'),
  ('923389718617800529', 'Mortelle raclette', 2024, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Horror', 'François Descraques, Philippe Bourdais, Matthieu Misiraca', 'Bertrand Delaire, Arielle Saracco, François Condamin', 'Antoine Gouy, Faustine Koziel, Bérangère McNeese, Irina Muluile, León David Salazar, Esteban Vial, Jessé Rémond Lacroix, Dorcas Coppin', null, 'While filming in the mountains the first Eco-responsible porn under the guidance of an intimacy coordinator, a film crew finds itself stuck in a snowstorm.', 'While filming in the mountains the first Eco-responsible porn under the guidance of an intimacy coordinator, a film crew finds itself stuck in a snowstorm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/au3TMvL70ER7G37yHHo8DPXnh8M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1284789'),
