  ('810525671361787636', 'Mosaic', 1965, 'Animation', 'Norman McLaren, Evelyn Lambart', null, 'Norman McLaren', null, 'A man sets a ping-pong ball into motion and it becomes fruitful and multiplies.', 'A man sets a ping-pong ball into motion and it becomes fruitful and multiplies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDdTAfU9qjgFaXyZ0lVxLDT80H6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211017'),
  ('80107989399047912', 'Mosaic', 2007, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy', 'Roy Allen Smith', 'Scott Lobdell', 'Anna Paquin, Kirby Morrow, Cam Clarke, Garry Chalk, Nicole Oliver, Jim Ward, Kathleen Barr, Stan Lee', 'PG', 'A break-in and murder at a New York City museum sparks an investigation by Interpol Agent Nathan Nelson. When he finds an ancient artifact, Nelson takes it home to conduct more research. A lightning storm, a pet chameleon and the artifact gives his daughter, Maggie, mystical powers to shape-shift her appearance at will which includes the ability to mimic other people and animals.', 'A break-in and murder at a New York City museum sparks an investigation by Interpol Agent Nathan Nelson. When he finds an ancient artifact, Nelson takes it home to conduct more research. A lightning storm, a pet chameleon and the artifact gives his daughter, Maggie, mystical powers to shape-shift her appearance at will which includes the ability to mimic other people and animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bWLUjSYkrDcz0s7H4hHLkWhSix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22154'),
  ('203351142551034647', 'Mosaic in Trust', 1955, null, 'Ferry Radax, Peter Kubelka', 'Ferry Radax, Peter Kubelka', 'Frederick Putnik, Johann Bayer, Magda Denov, Leo Zwirchmeyer, Konrad Bayer, Ida Szigethy', null, 'In his first film work, Kubelka evokes episodes of flirtation, courtship, and break-ups, played out against a series of non-corresponding audio excerpts.', 'In his first film work, Kubelka evokes episodes of flirtation, courtship, and break-ups, played out against a series of non-corresponding audio excerpts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DeCwBA3TcM3a9lWnbxk8FD7iGc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188223'),
  ('472507459801582851', 'Moscow', 2000, 'Drama', 'Boris Zolin, Sergei Skripka, Aleksei Goribol', 'Vladimir Sorokin, Aleksandr Zeldovich', 'Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Tatyana Drubich, Natalya Kolyakanova, Aleksandr Baluev, Viktor Gvozditsky, Stanislav Pavlov, Nikolay Chindyaykin, Igor Zolotovitsky', null, 'Moscow, the 90s ... A city without a past and without a future. A city that doesn''t forgive mistakes. Showing Moscow bohemia, the criminal business: nightlife, easy money, excitement and confusion form the surface of this life. The main characters of the film are businessman Mike and his friend and partner in smuggling Lev, a psychiatrist Mark and his school friend Irina who became the mistress of a nightclub, her two daughters - a crazy Olga working in the same club as a singer, and Masha - the “Moscow Princess” on the threshold of her thirtieth birthday. Love stories smoothly flow into a crime drama.', 'Moscow, the 90s ... A city without a past and without a future. A city that doesn''t forgive mistakes. Showing Moscow bohemia, the criminal business: nightlife, easy money, excitement and confusion form the surface of this life. The main characters of the film are businessman Mike and his friend and partner in smuggling Lev, a psychiatrist Mark and his school friend Irina who became the mistress of a nightclub, her two daughters - a crazy Olga working in the same club as a singer, and Masha - the “Moscow Princess” on the threshold of her thirtieth birthday. Love stories smoothly flow into a crime drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJlJc6Sy1pwiDlSqbWtf9Q5mOVR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73534'),
  ('1070238041716469243', 'Moscow 1996, Vote or Lose!', 2021, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Madeleine Leroyer, Mathieu Courtois, Gabriel Abenhaim', 'Madeleine Leroyer, Tim Toidze', 'Boris Yeltsin, Tatyana Yumasheva, Sergei Pugachev, Anatoly Chubais, Gennady Zyuganov, Alexandr Korzhakov, Mikhail Fridman, Helmut Kohl', null, 'Moscow, January 1996. Boris Yeltsin gets ready to run for a second mandate of the presidency of the young Russian Federation. Polls are in the single digits. A painful economic transition, war in Chechnya, and the rise of criminal groups have left the majority of Russians dissatisfied with Yeltsin… and willing to vote for the communist leader Gennady Zyuganov. Yet six months later, Yeltsin won the election with nearly 54% of the vote. How did that happen?', 'Moscow, January 1996. Boris Yeltsin gets ready to run for a second mandate of the presidency of the young Russian Federation. Polls are in the single digits. A painful economic transition, war in Chechnya, and the rise of criminal groups have left the majority of Russians dissatisfied with Yeltsin… and willing to vote for the communist leader Gennady Zyuganov. Yet six months later, Yeltsin won the election with nearly 54% of the vote. How did that happen?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJsfj3I5TMsFcfqZ6DrNYAeBQsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:900955'),
  ('405094145719575470', 'Moscow Clad in Snow', 1909, 'Documentary', 'Joseph-Louis Mundwiller, Joseph-Louis Mundwiller', null, null, null, 'The film is in four parts. First, the camera pans the Kremlin and Marshal''s Bridge. Sleds are parked in rows. Horse-drawn sleighs run up and down a busy street. Next, we visit the mushroom and fish market where common people work and shop. In Petrovsky Park are the well-to-do. Men are in great coats. A file of six or seven women ski past on a narrow lane. Last, there''s a general view of Moscow. A slow pan takes us to a view above the riverfront where the film began.', 'The film is in four parts. First, the camera pans the Kremlin and Marshal''s Bridge. Sleds are parked in rows. Horse-drawn sleighs run up and down a busy street. Next, we visit the mushroom and fish market where common people work and shop. In Petrovsky Park are the well-to-do. Men are in great coats. A file of six or seven women ski past on a narrow lane. Last, there''s a general view of Moscow. A slow pan takes us to a view above the riverfront where the film began.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPKBPSYKAFUFXRHEBZsjz88s1sQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144454'),
  ('870915330037216740', 'Moscow Does Not Believe in Tears', 1980, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Vladimir Menshov, Igor Slabnevich, Vladimir Kuchinsky', 'Valentin Chernykh', 'Vera Alentova, Aleksey Batalov, Irina Muravyova, Aleksandr Fatyushin, Raisa Ryazanova, Boris Smorchkov, Yuri Vasilyev, Natalya Vavilova', null, 'Living together in a workers'' dorm, Katerina and her friends are determined to make it in Moscow. But when a boorish cameraman forces himself on her, Katerina finds herself pregnant and alone as her friends move on. Twenty years later, Katerina is a factory director, outpacing her old roommates career-wise, yet still alone but for her daughter. Love seems possible again when she meets a genial mechanic.', 'Living together in a workers'' dorm, Katerina and her friends are determined to make it in Moscow. But when a boorish cameraman forces himself on her, Katerina finds herself pregnant and alone as her friends move on. Twenty years later, Katerina is a factory director, outpacing her old roommates career-wise, yet still alone but for her daughter. Love seems possible again when she meets a genial mechanic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0VULHcfJ2njqOI0GuQHe4TNF5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21028'),
  ('503383679509990931', 'Moscow Elegy', 1987, 'Documentary', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Aleksandr Burov', 'Aleksandr Sokurov', 'Andrei Tarkovsky, Tonino Guerra, Aleksandr Sokurov, Sven Nykvist', null, 'A 1988 documentary film directed by Alexander Sokurov, about the later life and death of Soviet Russian filmmaker Andrei Tarkovsky. The film was originally intended to mark the 50th birthday of Tarkovsky in 1982, which would have been before his death. Controversy with Soviet authorities about the film''s style and content led to significant delays in the production.', 'A 1988 documentary film directed by Alexander Sokurov, about the later life and death of Soviet Russian filmmaker Andrei Tarkovsky. The film was originally intended to mark the 50th birthday of Tarkovsky in 1982, which would have been before his death. Controversy with Soviet authorities about the film''s style and content led to significant delays in the production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Ti5cy225jTRjGSJY8T3VaAUpEz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183219'),
  ('290827496775506528', 'Moscow Gold', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jesús Bonilla', 'Jesús Bonilla, Joaquín Andújar', 'Jesús Bonilla, Santiago Segura, Concha Velasco, Alfredo Landa, Antonio Resines, Alexis Valdés, María Barranco, Neus Asensi', null, 'In an odd destiny coincidence and hospital employee reiceives some important and confident information from a dying old man. He shares it with one friend and both start a crazy and extravangant adventure.', 'In an odd destiny coincidence and hospital employee reiceives some important and confident information from a dying old man. He shares it with one friend and both start a crazy and extravangant adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnyMtKiVtHsknPybpQC9Kpwsoo0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71792'),
  ('187678241602688499', 'Moscow Mission', 2023, 'Crime, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Nicky Li Chung-Chi, Herman Yau', 'Daming Chen', 'Zhang Hanyu, Huang Xuan, Andy Lau, Janice Man Wing-San, Jason Koo, Zhao Bingrui, Bai Narisu, Zhang Benyu', null, 'Tough Chinese detectives go on a mission to Moscow to hunt down ruthless robbers who have been plaguing the trans-Siberian railway with violence and chaos.', 'Tough Chinese detectives go on a mission to Moscow to hunt down ruthless robbers who have been plaguing the trans-Siberian railway with violence and chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Xnyp5sdlGtW6sNjOqNUlJO7CEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783121'),
  ('698085226917742519', 'Moscow on the Hudson', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Paul Mazursky, Donald McAlpine', 'Paul Mazursky, Leon Capetanos', 'Robin Williams, María Conchita Alonso, Cleavant Derricks, Alejandro Rey, Savely Kramarov, Elya Baskin, Oleg Rudnik, Aleksandr Beniaminov', 'R', 'A Russian circus visits the US. A clown wants to defect, but doesn''t have the nerve. His saxophone playing friend however comes to the decision to defect in the middle of Bloomingdales. He is befriended by the black security guard and falls in love with the Italian immigrant from behind the perfume counter. We follow his life as he works his way through the American dream and tries to find work as a musician.', 'A Russian circus visits the US. A clown wants to defect, but doesn''t have the nerve. His saxophone playing friend however comes to the decision to defect in the middle of Bloomingdales. He is befriended by the black security guard and falls in love with the Italian immigrant from behind the perfume counter. We follow his life as he works his way through the American dream and tries to find work as a musician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQtyCH6E2Xg5cqlsykwfdvbhB5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23111'),
  ('65030186500728030', 'Moscow Square', 2001, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Ferenc Török', 'Ferenc Török', 'Gábor Karalyos, Balla Eszter, Simon Szabó, Erzsi Pápai, Vilmos Csatlós, András Réthelyi, Bence Jávor, Zsolt Kovács', null, '1989 is an important year in the political history of Hungary. However, Petya and his friends couldn''t care less. They are about to graduate high school. The only important things to them are the parties, girls, making some easy cash. And of course, passing the upcoming exam with the leaked questions.', '1989 is an important year in the political history of Hungary. However, Petya and his friends couldn''t care less. They are about to graduate high school. The only important things to them are the parties, girls, making some easy cash. And of course, passing the upcoming exam with the leaked questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86rTWbQT83zlSHNu45S3tIbAMJ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41093'),
  ('261698253881127714', 'Moscow Strikes Back', 1942, 'Documentary, War', 'Leonid Varlamov, Ilya Kopalin, V. Chekulaeva', 'Pyotr Pavlenko', 'N. Dubravin, Edward G. Robinson', null, 'A Soviet documentary chronicling the Battle of Moscow (October 1941 – January 1942), when Red Army forces repelled the German advance on the capital. Shot by numerous frontline cameramen, it combines harrowing footage of combat and civilian suffering with scenes of Nazi atrocities, framed against themes of Russian heroism and cultural survival. Originally released under the title Defeat of the German Armies Near Moscow, the English-language version, narrated by Edward G. Robinson, was retitled Moscow Strikes Back. The film won the 1943 Academy Award for Best Documentary. Warning: contains graphic images.', 'A Soviet documentary chronicling the Battle of Moscow (October 1941 – January 1942), when Red Army forces repelled the German advance on the capital. Shot by numerous frontline cameramen, it combines harrowing footage of combat and civilian suffering with scenes of Nazi atrocities, framed against themes of Russian heroism and cultural survival. Originally released under the title Defeat of the German Armies Near Moscow, the English-language version, narrated by Edward G. Robinson, was retitled Moscow Strikes Back. The film won the 1943 Academy Award for Best Documentary. Warning: contains graphic images.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbA0HK1TwPPZWo9EeucaCVwtlLp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93333'),
  ('829704723345214946', 'Moscow Zero', 2006, 'Action, Horror, Drama', 'María Lidón, Ricardo Aronovich', 'Adela Ibañez', 'Vincent Gallo, Oksana Akinshina, Val Kilmer, Sage Stallone, Joss Ackland, Joaquim de Almeida, Julio Perillán, Álex O''Dogherty', 'R', 'In Moscow, the priest Owen hires a team to guide him in the underworld to find his friend Sergei that is missing while researching the legend about the existence of demons and an entrance to hell beneath the city.', 'In Moscow, the priest Owen hires a team to guide him in the underworld to find his friend Sergei that is missing while researching the legend about the existence of demons and an entrance to hell beneath the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkQHPAJ4iqC4BlnsQXzcigU0KO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25974'),
  ('795719234246882686', 'Moscow-Cassiopeia', 1974, 'Science Fiction, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Richard Viktorov, Andrei Kirillov, Valentin Khlobynin', 'Avenir Zak, Isai Kuznetsov', 'Misha Yershov, Aleksandr Grigoryev, Vladimir Savin, Vladimir Basov Ml., Olga Bityukova, Nadezhda Ovcharova, Irina Savina, Lev Durov', null, 'Several children go on a lifelong space mission to Cassiopeia because they don''t want to go to school.', 'Several children go on a lifelong space mission to Cassiopeia because they don''t want to go to school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBSJLtvozYGoyIXT3fGAe6g9bBA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20947'),
  ('999388797172255117', 'Moscow, Belgium', 2008, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Christophe Van Rompaey, Ruben Impens', 'Jean-Claude Van Rijckeghem', 'Barbara Sarafian, Jurgen Delnaet, Johan Heldenbergh, Anemone Valcke, Sofia Ferri, Julian Borsani, Bob De Moor, Jits Van Belle', null, '‘Moscou’ is a densely populated working class neighbourhood on the outskirts of Ghent, Belgium. Matty, mother of three, bumps her car into a truck on the parking lot of a supermarket. Johnny climbs down from the cabin. He is infuriated by the dent in his front bumper and yells at Matty. Although impressed by the accident, Matty fights back with sharp words. Their discussion turns into a row, and the police have to intervene. Matty goes home, the trunk of her car dancing up and down. Back in her apartment, Matty takes a hot bath to recover from the afternoon’s emotionswhen the phone rings. It’s Johnny, apologizing for his behaviour on the parking lot. Matty tells him to stay out of her life. A dramatic comedy begins about a woman whose soul is full of dents and bruises.', '‘Moscou’ is a densely populated working class neighbourhood on the outskirts of Ghent, Belgium. Matty, mother of three, bumps her car into a truck on the parking lot of a supermarket. Johnny climbs down from the cabin. He is infuriated by the dent in his front bumper and yells at Matty. Although impressed by the accident, Matty fights back with sharp words. Their discussion turns into a row, and the police have to intervene. Matty goes home, the trunk of her car dancing up and down. Back in her apartment, Matty takes a hot bath to recover from the afternoon’s emotionswhen the phone rings. It’s Johnny, apologizing for his behaviour on the parking lot. Matty tells him to stay out of her life. A dramatic comedy begins about a woman whose soul is full of dents and bruises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsD91vZB893Nc0vWkhUwbgRv1MI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13646'),
  ('132717874154179810', 'Moscow, My Love', 1974, 'Drama, Romance', 'Aleksandr Mitta, Kenji Yoshida, Vladimir Nakhabtsev', 'Tasiuki Kasikura, Edvard Radzinsky, Aleksandr Mitta', 'Komaki Kurihara, Oleg Vidov, Makoto Satō, Ivan Dykhovichnyy, Tatyana Golikova, Valentin Gaft, Aleksei Varlamov, Masami Shimojō', null, 'A young talented dancer from Japan is invited to study ballet art at a school at the Bolshoi Theater in Moscow. She achieves professional success, for the first time real love comes to her. However, the girl’s happiness was short-lived — a sudden illness of blood interferes in the fate of the dancer, like an echo of the atomic bomb in Hiroshima, where her parents lived.', 'A young talented dancer from Japan is invited to study ballet art at a school at the Bolshoi Theater in Moscow. She achieves professional success, for the first time real love comes to her. However, the girl’s happiness was short-lived — a sudden illness of blood interferes in the fate of the dancer, like an echo of the atomic bomb in Hiroshima, where her parents lived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p68SQznB3TsPw2ziyfcOBWR3UXl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270246'),
  ('135063005666412219', 'Moscow, Tverskaia Street', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Charles Moisson', null, null, null, 'Circulation of passers-by and cars in the paved street on the occasion of the Tsar''s coronation.', 'Circulation of passers-by and cars in the paved street on the occasion of the Tsar''s coronation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXbGv3j3hjP7uzpSUFk4KyKTXiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194175'),
  ('1089915215979576478', 'Moses and Aaron', 1975, 'Drama', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Danièle Huillet, Renato Berta', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Danièle Huillet', 'Günter Reich, Louis Devos, Eva Csapo, Roger Lucas, Richard Salter, Werner Mann, Ladislav Ilavsky, Elfriede Obrowsky', null, 'A familiar Biblical tale transformed into a cinematic opera of seemingly endless possibility. In expressive, melodic tones, the fraternal pair debate God’s true message and intent for His creations, a conflict that leads their followers towards chaos and sin. Set almost entirely within a Roman amphitheater whose history lends every precise line-reading and gesture, every startling camera move and cut, a totalizing force.', 'A familiar Biblical tale transformed into a cinematic opera of seemingly endless possibility. In expressive, melodic tones, the fraternal pair debate God’s true message and intent for His creations, a conflict that leads their followers towards chaos and sin. Set almost entirely within a Roman amphitheater whose history lends every precise line-reading and gesture, every startling camera move and cut, a totalizing force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ihSmzqa9J1lEz2aV4NdaotqFa2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208198'),
  ('254381524313545958', 'Moses the Black', 2026, 'Crime, Drama', 'Yelena Popovic, Panagiotis Vasilakis', 'Yelena Popovic', 'Chukwudi Iwuji, Skilla Baby, Corey Hendrix, Cliff Chamberlain, Quavo', 'Not Rated', 'The story of a gangster in modern day Chicago inspired by an incredible story of repentance of the 4th century saint of the same name.', 'The story of a gangster in modern day Chicago inspired by an incredible story of repentance of the 4th century saint of the same name.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fb%2Fgracenote%2Fb009c292cedd23d88c14c450387e8c64.jpg', 'plex:movie:moses-the-black-2026'),
  ('882098360595224567', 'Moses: Born of Water and Fire', 2026, 'Drama', 'David Hoffman', 'David Hoffman', 'Tiffany Chevonne, Melissa Lavigne, Cheryle Brown', null, 'Raised in the palace of an empire that enslaves his people, Moses is forced into exile before returning to confront Pharaoh and lead his people to freedom. A story of faith, courage, and divine intervention.', 'Raised in the palace of an empire that enslaves his people, Moses is forced into exile before returning to confront Pharaoh and lead his people to freedom. A story of faith, courage, and divine intervention.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FA9hLb2tB6nf5zEmri0vrKwTLBJH.jpg', 'plex:movie:moses-born-of-water-and-fire'),
  ('628913826746186751', 'Moskova''nın Şifresi: Temel', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Burhan Asaf Şafak, Adem Kılıç', 'Yılmaz Okumuş', 'Alper Kul, Aslıhan Güner, Ruhi Sarı, Salih Kalyon, Emin Albayrak, Necip Memili, Anastasiya Pavelyeva, Duygu Şen', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XXthsKDIDhQIb0lbcXJuXjskYG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202018'),
  ('275628481511361563', 'Mosquito', 1994, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Gary Jones, Tom Chaney', 'Gary Jones, Steve Hodge, Tom Chaney', 'Gunnar Hansen, Ron Asheton, Steve Dixon, Rachel Loiselle, Tim Lovelace, Mike Hard, Kenny Mugwump, Josh Becker', 'R', 'An alien starship crashes in a swamp in a U.S. National Park. Some mosquitos begin to feed from the alien''s corpses, causing them to grow to the size of a vulture. These mutant insects became very agressive, killing every human being they find. Will the few survivors fight successfully against this nightmare...?', 'An alien starship crashes in a swamp in a U.S. National Park. Some mosquitos begin to feed from the alien''s corpses, causing them to grow to the size of a vulture. These mutant insects became very agressive, killing every human being they find. Will the few survivors fight successfully against this nightmare...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YhIr9p5oeeNuD8ZHgQSKGavc44.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41574'),
  ('956460615518848050', 'Mosquito', 2020, 'Drama, War', 'João Nuno Pinto, Adolpho Veloso, António Pinhão Botelho', 'Fernanda Polacow, Gonçalo Waddington', 'João Nunes Monteiro, Sebastian Jehkul, Filipe Duarte, Josefina Massango, João Lagarto, Miguel Moreira, Miguel Borges, Alfredo Brito', null, 'Dreaming of great adventures and of standing up for his homeland, a young Portuguese man enlists in the army during World War I and is sent to the front line in Mozambique, Africa. Left behind by his platoon, he sets out on a grueling trek across the mystic Makua native land, walking for over a thousand kilometers, in search of his dream.', 'Dreaming of great adventures and of standing up for his homeland, a young Portuguese man enlists in the army during World War I and is sent to the front line in Mozambique, Africa. Left behind by his platoon, he sets out on a grueling trek across the mystic Makua native land, walking for over a thousand kilometers, in search of his dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7CV3w9NW5uAYSRBpYAMbu2Ti2s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423132'),
  ('330173725596359824', 'Mosquito Man', 2005, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Tibor Takács, Emil Topuzov, Franklin A. Vallette', 'Michael Hurst', 'Corin Nemec, Musetta Vander, Christa Campbell, Matthew Jordon, Patrick Dreikauss, Jay Benedict, Ivo Tonchev, Vladimir Nikolov', null, 'Police lieutenant detective Thomas ''Thom'' Randall''s steady girl-friend, Dr. Jennifer ''Jen'' Allen, is Dr. Aaron Michaels''s main assistant on his pharmaceutical firm Bellion''s research program to cure the highly contagious, fatal infection Guinin. A convicted murderer, whom Thom arrested, is one of their special drug test subjects, but escapes. The convict and Jen are affected by radioactively altered DNA from an experimental reactor used on mosquitoes which transfer quinine. The convict soon mutates into a mosquito-like monster, which sucks its victims dry. By the time Thom and his junior murder brigade partner Charlie Morrison figure out what happens, Jen starts mutating herself.', 'Police lieutenant detective Thomas ''Thom'' Randall''s steady girl-friend, Dr. Jennifer ''Jen'' Allen, is Dr. Aaron Michaels''s main assistant on his pharmaceutical firm Bellion''s research program to cure the highly contagious, fatal infection Guinin. A convicted murderer, whom Thom arrested, is one of their special drug test subjects, but escapes. The convict and Jen are affected by radioactively altered DNA from an experimental reactor used on mosquitoes which transfer quinine. The convict soon mutates into a mosquito-like monster, which sucks its victims dry. By the time Thom and his junior murder brigade partner Charlie Morrison figure out what happens, Jen starts mutating herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXdMGior3vIiK0UMCE3eWzGMCFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35891'),
  ('195357577844100871', 'Mosquito Squadron', 1969, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Boris Sagal, Paul Beeson, Anthony Waye', 'Donald S. Sanford, Joyce Perry', 'David McCallum, Suzanne Neve, Charles Gray, David Buck, David Dundas, Dinsdale Landen, Nicky Henson, Bryan Marshall', 'G', 'England, World War II. Quint Munroe, RAF officer and new leader of a Mosquito squadron, is tasked with destroying a secret Nazi base in France while trying to overcome the disappearance of a brother-in-arms.', 'England, World War II. Quint Munroe, RAF officer and new leader of a Mosquito squadron, is tasked with destroying a secret Nazi base in France while trying to overcome the disappearance of a brother-in-arms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yWIuaT6PvKAyI6WVsUrgqUYm84.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26316'),
  ('470833687085320847', 'Mosquito the Rapist', 1977, 'Horror', 'Marijan Vajda, Marijan David Vajda, David Khan', 'Mario d''Alcala', 'Werner Pochath, Ellen Umlauf, Birgit Zamulo, Gerhard Ruhnke, Peter Hamm, Charly Hiltl, Hary Olsbauer, Marion Messner', null, 'A deaf and dumb accountant suffers from a psychic trauma in his childhood. He is collecting puppets and mutilates female bodies in the mortuary. After his secret love died by an accident he starts to kill.', 'A deaf and dumb accountant suffers from a psychic trauma in his childhood. He is collecting puppets and mutilates female bodies in the mortuary. After his secret love died by an accident he starts to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xopoj26WRCmaIi7W2555riQNxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102877'),
  ('794839659021771081', 'Moss', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Kang Dae-hui, Kang Woo-suk, Kim Sung-bok', 'Jung Ji-woo', 'Park Hae-il, Jung Jae-young, Yu Jun-sang, Yu Seon, Kim Joon-bae, Yoo Hai-jin, Kim Sang-ho, Huh Joon-ho', null, 'A city boy visits a remote village to find out the reason behind his father''s strange death. The locals are watching his every move and are eager to see him leave. As he starts to investigate, the village''s sinister secrets begin to unravel.', 'A city boy visits a remote village to find out the reason behind his father''s strange death. The locals are watching his every move and are eager to see him leave. As he starts to investigate, the village''s sinister secrets begin to unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOqJWvNV4RagBNB0AM6IPXBNPy6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49087'),
  ('838528529892053812', 'Moss Rose', 1947, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Gregory Ratoff, Joseph MacDonald, Alfred Newman', 'Tom Reed, Jules Furthman', 'Peggy Cummins, Victor Mature, Ethel Barrymore, Vincent Price, Margo Woode, George Zucco, Patricia Medina, Rhys Williams', 'NR', 'When a music-hall dancer is murdered, a moss rose marks the page of a Bible next to her body. Luckily, another chorus girl saw a gentleman leaving the lodgings. She approaches him directly, saying she''ll go to the police if he doesn''t meet her demands, but he brushes her off contemptuously. When he learns she''s dead serious, he tries to buy her off with a thick wad of pound notes. But it''s not money she''s after; all she wants is two weeks at his country estate, living the life of a lady.', 'When a music-hall dancer is murdered, a moss rose marks the page of a Bible next to her body. Luckily, another chorus girl saw a gentleman leaving the lodgings. She approaches him directly, saying she''ll go to the police if he doesn''t meet her demands, but he brushes her off contemptuously. When he learns she''s dead serious, he tries to buy her off with a thick wad of pound notes. But it''s not money she''s after; all she wants is two weeks at his country estate, living the life of a lady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myBXzQFoavdolJmzMEUVrKGns6x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44868'),
  ('104221390606083288', 'Mossunguê – A Donnas do Novo Mundo', 2026, null, 'Lazare Jefroykin', null, null, null, 'The Mossunguê neighborhood was colonized by Italian immigrants from the city of Donnas in the Aosta Valley region at the end of the 19th century. Now that the neighborhood has become hyper-urbanized, there is nothing left associated with the agricultural past that kept alive for almost a century the traditions of the place of origin of the Juglair, Nicco, and Perretto families.', 'The Mossunguê neighborhood was colonized by Italian immigrants from the city of Donnas in the Aosta Valley region at the end of the 19th century. Now that the neighborhood has become hyper-urbanized, there is nothing left associated with the agricultural past that kept alive for almost a century the traditions of the place of origin of the Juglair, Nicco, and Perretto families.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1649509'),
  ('389957832096496154', 'Most', 2003, 'Drama', 'Bobby Garabedian', 'William Zabka', 'Vladimír Javorský, Ladislav Ondřej, Ester Geislerová, Brad Heller, Klára Issová, Linda Rybová, Helena Houdová, John Lavachielli', null, 'A poetic and powerful story of a father forced to choose between love and duty.', 'A poetic and powerful story of a father forced to choose between love and duty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2hYKeo9sLYlHohCrNDuxqNPcrr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82040'),
  ('859683720845051012', 'Most Beautiful Island', 2017, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Ana Asensio, Noah Greenberg', 'Ana Asensio', 'Ana Asensio, Natasha Romanova, David Little, Nicholas Tucci, Larry Fessenden, Caprice Benedetti, Anna Myrha, Ami Sheth', 'R', 'Chronicling one harrowing day in the life of Luciana, a young woman struggling to make ends meet while striving to escape her past. As Luciana’s day unfolds, she is whisked, physically and emotionally, through a series of troublesome, unforeseeable extremes.', 'Chronicling one harrowing day in the life of Luciana, a young woman struggling to make ends meet while striving to escape her past. As Luciana’s day unfolds, she is whisked, physically and emotionally, through a series of troublesome, unforeseeable extremes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRW4NGnfYHcV65QKnUC4Q5EyhVe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438436'),
  ('239654503869612059', 'Most Likely to Die', 2015, 'Horror', 'Anthony DiBlasi, Timothy A. Burton, Marguerite Henry', 'Laura Brennan', 'Heather Morris, Ryan Doom, Perez Hilton, Chad Addison, Tatum Miranda, Jake Busey, Marci Miller, Skyler Vallo', null, 'A group of former classmates gather for a pre-party at one of their homes the night before their 10-year high school reunion, and one by one, they are brutally slain in a manner befitting each''s senior yearbook superlative.', 'A group of former classmates gather for a pre-party at one of their homes the night before their 10-year high school reunion, and one by one, they are brutally slain in a manner befitting each''s senior yearbook superlative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lesaz8ReKloTAyhFzbZIiwYfbQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347762'),
  ('828788549854146862', 'Most Likely to Murder', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Dan Gregor, Charlie Gruet', 'Dan Gregor, Doug Mand', 'Adam Pally, Rachel Bloom, Vincent Kartheiser, John Reynolds, Didi Conn, Ethan Phillips, Doug Mand, Hasan Minhaj', 'R', 'Billy, once the coolest kid in high school, comes back to his hometown 15 years later to find he’s no longer cool and the girl he still has feelings for now dates the former class outcast. Billy becomes obsessed with proving the outcast is a murderer.', 'Billy, once the coolest kid in high school, comes back to his hometown 15 years later to find he’s no longer cool and the girl he still has feelings for now dates the former class outcast. Billy becomes obsessed with proving the outcast is a murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxiHGwZoO7qKyz25ZN9ghc4wKjc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503758'),
  ('1067398626323780470', 'Most Promising Young Actress', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Jugnot, Pascal Gennesseaux', 'Gérard Jugnot, Isabelle Mergault', 'Bérénice Bejo, Gérard Jugnot, Chantal Lauby, Antoine Duléry, Mohamed Hicham, Thierry Lhermitte, Daniela Lumbroso, Ticky Holgado', null, 'Yvon Rance, who runs a hair salon in Brittany, only wants his beloved teenaged daughter Laetita to be happy, something he believes she''ll be able to achieve by completing high school and then following in her father''s professional footsteps. When Laetita tells him that she has been cast in the latest movie by renowned director Stephane, he is initially unimpressed. He grudgingly relents when he learns that the money she will make for a couple months of work is twice what he makes in a year.', 'Yvon Rance, who runs a hair salon in Brittany, only wants his beloved teenaged daughter Laetita to be happy, something he believes she''ll be able to achieve by completing high school and then following in her father''s professional footsteps. When Laetita tells him that she has been cast in the latest movie by renowned director Stephane, he is initially unimpressed. He grudgingly relents when he learns that the money she will make for a couple months of work is twice what he makes in a year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zF7L5n9b9hyajaF4qGdcNy2yH0s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64357'),
  ('275612042839137824', 'Most Wanted', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'David Hogan, Chuck Picerni Jr., Brian Jewell', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans, Jon Voight, Jill Hennessy, Paul Sorvino, Eric Roberts, Robert Culp, Wolfgang Bodison, Eddie Velez', 'R', 'A Marine on death row is recruited by a shadowy U.S. military officer as part of a top-secret ops team, then gets framed for murder when the team and its officer set him up as the fall guy for the assassination of the First Lady.', 'A Marine on death row is recruited by a shadowy U.S. military officer as part of a top-secret ops team, then gets framed for murder when the team and its officer set him up as the fall guy for the assassination of the First Lady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vKh2AnzJaRM1eALkBKEU97NK1B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34309'),
  ('679020972248463493', 'Mostly Ghostly', 2008, 'Family, Fantasy, Horror', 'Rich Correll, Barry M. Wilson', 'Rich Correll, Pat Proft', 'Sabrina Bryan, Madison Pettis, Luke Benward, Sterling Beaumon, Brian Stepanek, David DeLuise, Kim Rhodes, Aliana Lohan', 'PG', 'Based on the successful book series by R.L. Stine, this spooky tale finds 11-year-old Max making a deal with the ghosts who haunt his home. If Max helps them find what was responsible for their parents'' disappearance, they''ll help him transform from a social nobody to the most popular kid in school.', 'Based on the successful book series by R.L. Stine, this spooky tale finds 11-year-old Max making a deal with the ghosts who haunt his home. If Max helps them find what was responsible for their parents'' disappearance, they''ll help him transform from a social nobody to the most popular kid in school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wLYv3u9Gg1iF2CAX79nkMBFM71.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58664'),
  ('845178705339808724', 'Mostly Ghostly 3: One Night in Doom House', 2016, 'Family, Fantasy, Horror', 'Ron Oliver, Thomas M. Harting', 'Ron Oliver', 'Corey Fogelmanis, Blake Michael, Sophie Reynolds, Jedidiah Goodacre, Vivian Full, Andrew Herr, Peter DeLuise, Jamie Kennedy', 'PG', 'Just one enchanted jewel stands between earth and an army of evil spirits led by the devious ghoul, Phears. With the help of his new girlfriend and ghost pals, Max Doyle races to find the crystal and save the world.', 'Just one enchanted jewel stands between earth and an army of evil spirits led by the devious ghoul, Phears. With the help of his new girlfriend and ghost pals, Max Doyle races to find the crystal and save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FuJBCigOtMDd5NsvcjYkaDKEWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406052'),
  ('885413992221182242', 'Mostly Ghostly: Have You Met My Ghoulfriend?', 2014, 'Family, Fantasy, Horror', 'Peter Hewitt, Randy Hart', 'Rich Correll', 'Ryan Ochoa, Roshon Fegan, Madison Pettis, Bella Thorne, Gigi Rice, Anastasia Baranova, Eric Allan Kramer, Calum Worthy', 'PG', 'Bella Thorne, Madison Pettis and Ryan Ochoa lead an ensemble cast in this spook-tacular adventure with new ghosts, new thrills, and the return of some old friends. Max (Ochoa) only has eyes for Cammy (Thorne), the smart, popular redhead at school. When Max finally scores a date with Cammy on Halloween, Phears, an evil ghost with plans on taking over the world, unleashes his ghouls and things go haywire. With the help of his ghostly pals, Tara and Nicky, can Max thwart Phears'' evil plot, help reunite his ghost friends with their long-lost parents and still make his date with Cammy on Halloween? R.L. Stine''s Mostly Ghostly: Have You Met My Ghoulfriend? is a frightful family delight!', 'Bella Thorne, Madison Pettis and Ryan Ochoa lead an ensemble cast in this spook-tacular adventure with new ghosts, new thrills, and the return of some old friends. Max (Ochoa) only has eyes for Cammy (Thorne), the smart, popular redhead at school. When Max finally scores a date with Cammy on Halloween, Phears, an evil ghost with plans on taking over the world, unleashes his ghouls and things go haywire. With the help of his ghostly pals, Tara and Nicky, can Max thwart Phears'' evil plot, help reunite his ghost friends with their long-lost parents and still make his date with Cammy on Halloween? R.L. Stine''s Mostly Ghostly: Have You Met My Ghoulfriend? is a frightful family delight!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eiVY4kKpbo1f7wyNubgJX5ILpxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289239'),
  ('421018286658332925', 'Mostly Martha', 2001, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Michael Bertl, Sandra Nettelbeck', 'Sandra Nettelbeck', 'Martina Gedeck, Maxime Foerste, Sergio Castellitto, August Zirner, Ulrich Thomsen, Sibylle Canonica, Katja Studt, İdil Üner', null, 'Martha is a single woman who lives for one passion: cooking. The head chef at a chic restaurant, Martha has no time for anything - or anyone - else. But Martha''s solitary life is shaken when a fateful accident brings her sister''s eight-year-old daughter, Lina, to her doorstep.', 'Martha is a single woman who lives for one passion: cooking. The head chef at a chic restaurant, Martha has no time for anything - or anyone - else. But Martha''s solitary life is shaken when a fateful accident brings her sister''s eight-year-old daughter, Lina, to her doorstep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnmIUzqZ8YW5i0QolN5P2dsiRT0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3640'),
  ('863494714893532100', 'Mostly Minimalistic', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Natja Brunckhorst, Niklas Lindschau', 'Natja Brunckhorst, Martin Rehbock', 'Corinna Harfouch, Daniel Sträßer, Joachim Król, Sophie Killer, Felix Vörtler, Thomas Krutmann, Peter Brachschoss, Sergio Salas', null, 'The contrasts between Marlen (Corinna Harfouch) and Fynn (newcomer Daniel Sträßer) couldn''t be any more extreme if they tried: Marlen''s apartment is packed to the rafters with objects too valuable or important to throw away, while Fynn plans to go through life with only 100 things in his possession. The fact that they can''t keep their hands off each other and end up falling in love holds true to the old adage that opposites really do attract...', 'The contrasts between Marlen (Corinna Harfouch) and Fynn (newcomer Daniel Sträßer) couldn''t be any more extreme if they tried: Marlen''s apartment is packed to the rafters with objects too valuable or important to throw away, while Fynn plans to go through life with only 100 things in his possession. The fact that they can''t keep their hands off each other and end up falling in love holds true to the old adage that opposites really do attract...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayLWtnKZ6Yyla7XLxXNo3K7JYqS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881687'),
  ('603549086112075659', 'Mostruosamente Villaggio', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Valeria Parisi', 'Paola Jacobbi, Valeria Parisi', 'Paolo Villaggio, Luca Bizzarri, Diego Abatantuono, Alessandro Gassmann, Ricky Tognazzi, Dori Ghezzi, Renzo Arbore, Adriano Panatta', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6HbgZspfSA7HFbFOBvf9TWXpqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1262098'),
  ('707929640175518822', 'Mosul', 2019, 'War, Drama, Action', 'Matthew Michael Carnahan, Mauro Fiore', 'Matthew Michael Carnahan', 'Suhail Dabbach, Adam Bessa, Is''haq Elias, Waleed Elgadi, Hayat Kamille, Mohimen Mahbuba, Thaer Al-Shayei, Ben Affan', null, 'When ISIS took their homes, families and city, one group of men fought to take it all back. Based on true events, this is the story of the Nineveh SWAT team, a renegade police unit who waged a guerrilla operation against ISIS in a desperate struggle to save their home city of Mosul.', 'When ISIS took their homes, families and city, one group of men fought to take it all back. Based on true events, this is the story of the Nineveh SWAT team, a renegade police unit who waged a guerrilla operation against ISIS in a desperate struggle to save their home city of Mosul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dW1UNgDkVNreqYJk1YKo4ACa705.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618219'),
  ('254220219502993781', 'Motel Cactus', 1997, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Park Ki-yong, Christopher Doyle, Bong Joon Ho', 'Park Ki-yong, Bong Joon Ho', 'Jin Hee-kyung, Park Shin-yang, Jung Woo-sung, Lee Mi-yeon, Woong-soo Han, Seung-Hyun Kim, Dong-hwan Shin', null, 'The film consists of four episodes, all of which take place in Room 407 of Motel Cactus, a love hotel in Seoul.', 'The film consists of four episodes, all of which take place in Room 407 of Motel Cactus, a love hotel in Seoul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knuee8l3zk5gpxU6089D9XLyNVX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153423'),
  ('1009385148027276340', 'Motel Destino', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Karim Aïnouz, Hélène Louvart, Pethrus Tiburcio', 'Wislan Esmeraldo, Mauricio Zacharias, Karim Aïnouz', 'Iago Xavier, Nataly Rocha, Fábio Assunção, Renan Capivara, Fabíola Líper, Isabela Catão, Yuri Yamamoto, David Santos', 'R', 'Motel Destino, a sex hotel in Northern Brazil, is run by the hot-headed Elias and his restless wife, Dayana. When a young gang member on the run named Heraldo stays at the motel, Dayana becomes intrigued with him. As the two navigate a dance of power and desire, a dangerous plan for freedom emerges.', 'Motel Destino, a sex hotel in Northern Brazil, is run by the hot-headed Elias and his restless wife, Dayana. When a young gang member on the run named Heraldo stays at the motel, Dayana becomes intrigued with him. As the two navigate a dance of power and desire, a dangerous plan for freedom emerges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohkx2Xf2pBz9glzJHGO5zee2wFm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1161879'),
  ('863582509794780413', 'Motel Hell', 1980, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Kevin Connor, Thomas Del Ruth', 'Robert Jaffe, Steven-Charles Jaffe', 'Rory Calhoun, Paul Linke, Nancy Parsons, Nina Axelrod, Wolfman Jack, Elaine Joyce, Monique St. Pierre, John Ratzenberger', 'R', 'Farmer Vincent Smith and his sister Ida run a motel attached to a farm where they capture unsuspecting travelers, bury them alive, fatten them up and then harvest their bodies as ingredients for his famous brand of "smoked meats."', 'Farmer Vincent Smith and his sister Ida run a motel attached to a farm where they capture unsuspecting travelers, bury them alive, fatten them up and then harvest their bodies as ingredients for his famous brand of "smoked meats."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sb63i9ZDqin0Mh37B5sLiZSQY6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30924'),
  ('796903204432815296', 'Motel Mist', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Prabda Yoon, Chananun Chotrungroj, Monkum Khukhuntin', 'Prabda Yoon', 'Prapamonton Eiamchan, Surapol Poonpiriya, Vasuphon Kriangprapakit, Katareeya Theapchatri, Wissanu Likitsathaporn, Nareerat Patchanee, Chindarat Kasuya, Natchaya Sanguansuk', null, 'Erotic fantasies can come to life in the rooms of Motel Mistress. But whether these will be pleasurable for those involved is another matter. A strange disappearance, revenge and aliens all turn up one typical afternoon in this love nest.', 'Erotic fantasies can come to life in the rooms of Motel Mistress. But whether these will be pleasurable for those involved is another matter. A strange disappearance, revenge and aliens all turn up one typical afternoon in this love nest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1iceomkN7jDXNAU05cZH9yVRPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376089'),
  ('235822322563766433', 'Motel Tlalpan', 2024, null, 'José Magaña', 'José Magaña', 'José Magaña, Guillermo Quintanilla, La Wanders Lover, Ana Paula Magaña, Luis Fernando Peña, Jerry Tena', null, 'Mercedes, an actress and singer from Argentina, is tricked into Mexico and used to smuggle diamonds. Escaping she meets an actor who is only looking for profit, but she doesn''t expect that he will fall in love with her.', 'Mercedes, an actress and singer from Argentina, is tricked into Mexico and used to smuggle diamonds. Escaping she meets an actor who is only looking for profit, but she doesn''t expect that he will fall in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3UWELJxgalitM1mDlQ2lU7Mo2T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1397372'),
  ('477907865884679254', 'Moth and the Flame', 1938, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett, David Hand, Dick Huemer', null, null, 'NR', 'A group of moths invades a costume shop through a badly plugged hole in a window and makes quick work of the contents. A male moth ignores his lady to chow down on a hat and she''s soon seduced by a candle flame, which rapidly spreads. He notices her trapped in a spider web with the fire attacking and makes some attempts to save her, but pours benzene on the fire by mistake. The rest of the moths are summoned, and they fight the fire with water-filled bagpipes, an air drop with a water-filled funnel, etc., while our hero works to free his lady from the spider web.', 'A group of moths invades a costume shop through a badly plugged hole in a window and makes quick work of the contents. A male moth ignores his lady to chow down on a hat and she''s soon seduced by a candle flame, which rapidly spreads. He notices her trapped in a spider web with the fire attacking and makes some attempts to save her, but pours benzene on the fire by mistake. The rest of the moths are summoned, and they fight the fire with water-filled bagpipes, an air drop with a water-filled funnel, etc., while our hero works to free his lady from the spider web.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3bvUViNilDB4HlxLRtnlXhcYqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54076'),
  ('273690033043926440', 'Mother', 1926, 'Drama', 'Vsevolod Pudovkin, Anatoli Golovnya', 'Nathan Zarkhi', 'Vera Baranovskaya, Nikolai Batalov, Aleksandr Chistyakov, Anna Zemtsova, Ivan Koval-Samborskyi, Vsevolod Pudovkin, Ivan Bobrov, Pavel Poltoratskiy', null, 'A Soviet woman is caught between her husband and son, who find themselves on opposing sides of the Russian Revolution.', 'A Soviet woman is caught between her husband and son, who find themselves on opposing sides of the Russian Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9u71FR74RVndbAbW3rlmts0QyS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98914'),
  ('522821298155070171', 'Mother', 1952, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Hiroshi Suzuki, Teruo Ishii', 'Yōko Mizuki', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Kyōko Kagawa, Eiji Okada, Akihiko Katayama, Daisuke Katō, Yōnosuke Toba, Masao Mishima, Chieko Nakakita', null, 'A teenaged girl witnesses her widowed mother''s attempt to sustain her family.', 'A teenaged girl witnesses her widowed mother''s attempt to sustain her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hF4iAtuUxDdp2QTA0eCzdPFP3u9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41173'),
  ('592280602686758852', 'Mother', 1990, 'Drama', 'Ali Hatami, Mahmoud Kalari', 'Ali Hatami', 'Rogheyeh Chehreh-Azad, Mohammadali Keshavarz, Farimah Farjami, Amin Tarokh, Akbar Abdi, Hamid Jebeli, Jamshid Hashempour, Hamide Kheyrabadi', null, 'The film progresses along two distinct but interwoven series of events. The first series involves young members of a family who have gathered round their old mother and revive their common childhood memories. the second line focuses on the old woman''s preparations for her last journey and her joyous cooperation in arranging for the ceremonies that are to be observed after her death.', 'The film progresses along two distinct but interwoven series of events. The first series involves young members of a family who have gathered round their old mother and revive their common childhood memories. the second line focuses on the old woman''s preparations for her last journey and her joyous cooperation in arranging for the ceremonies that are to be observed after her death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijHzM4emJSsGGo1VvTLfvKhGbYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253366'),
  ('756102127272407596', 'Mother', 1991, 'Drama', 'Henri Verneuil, Margot Capelier, Edmond Richard', 'Henri Verneuil', 'Claudia Cardinale, Omar Sharif, Nathalie Roussel, Isabelle Sadoyan, Jacky Nercessian, Richard Berry, Cédric Doucet, Tom Ponsin', null, 'Henri Verneuil was born Achod Malakian of Armenian parentage on October 15, 1920, in Rodosto, Turkey, and his family fled to France and settled in Marseilles when he was a young child. He later recounted his childhood experience in the novel Mayrig, which he dedicated to his mother and made into this 1991 film with the same name.', 'Henri Verneuil was born Achod Malakian of Armenian parentage on October 15, 1920, in Rodosto, Turkey, and his family fled to France and settled in Marseilles when he was a young child. He later recounted his childhood experience in the novel Mayrig, which he dedicated to his mother and made into this 1991 film with the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgkknyTJWWjwIYkmsGqmMER2iJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151227'),
  ('51108163668608794', 'Mother', 1995, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Frank LaLoggia, Gerry Lively', 'Michael Angelella', 'Diane Ladd, Olympia Dukakis, Morgan Weisser, Ele Keats, Matt Clark, Scott Wilson, Lucy Lee Flippin, Phyllis Applegate', 'R', 'Weisser is a young college bound man whose future is threatened when his mother interferes with his love life and a pending scholarship. He also discovers that his mother''s best friend wishes to get closer to him, even if it means murder.', 'Weisser is a young college bound man whose future is threatened when his mother interferes with his love life and a pending scholarship. He also discovers that his mother''s best friend wishes to get closer to him, even if it means murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5yTw9kOQ9eNmvnTxXhdwh9wz5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68874'),
  ('80283183908654185', 'Mother', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Albert Brooks, Lajos Koltai', 'Monica Johnson, Albert Brooks', 'Albert Brooks, Debbie Reynolds, Rob Morrow, Lisa Kudrow, John C. McGinley, Isabel Glasser, James Gleason, Vanessa Williams', 'PG-13', 'A neurotic, twice-divorced sci-fi writer moves back in with his mother to solve his personal problems.', 'A neurotic, twice-divorced sci-fi writer moves back in with his mother to solve his personal problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxJJ0IEOOdvMo5yO7rcJBqyZ11n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27265'),
  ('215122034809863142', 'Mother', 2016, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Aaron Burns, Antonio Quercia, Fernando Alé', 'Aaron Burns', 'Daniela Ramírez, Cristo Montt, Ignacia Allamand, Nicolás Durán, Elvira Cristi, Cristián Carvajal, Igal Furman, Gabriel Urzúa', null, 'A pregnant woman, who is taking care of her son with development problems, is at her breaking point when a caregiver from the Philippines steps into her life. Diana suspects that she’s using voodoo against her after the quick improvements of her son.', 'A pregnant woman, who is taking care of her son with development problems, is at her breaking point when a caregiver from the Philippines steps into her life. Diana suspects that she’s using voodoo against her after the quick improvements of her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A390HPs0P0nQ1XR54zLlSHQOUtt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438463'),
  ('9337434485321515', 'Mother', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alejandro de Pablo, Rodrigo Sorogoyen, Marta García Larriu', 'Rodrigo Sorogoyen', 'Marta Nieto, Álvaro Balas, Blanca Apilánez, Miriam Correa', null, 'An everyday conversation between Marta and her mother turns into a tragic race against the clock when Marta receives a phone call from Iván, her six-year-old son, who is on holiday in France with his father.', 'An everyday conversation between Marta and her mother turns into a tragic race against the clock when Marta receives a phone call from Iván, her six-year-old son, who is on holiday in France with his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGokZWQnHi69P2frwsIeyWwnvg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466874'),
  ('9818070439334744', 'Mother', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Rodrigo Sorogoyen, Alejandro de Pablo, Nacho Lavilla', 'Rodrigo Sorogoyen, Isabel Peña', 'Marta Nieto, Jules Porier, Àlex Brendemühl, Anne Consigny, Frédéric Pierrot, Guillaume Arnault, Raúl Prieto, Blanca Apilánez', null, 'Ten years have gone by since Elena''s six-year old son has disappeared. The last thing she heard of him was a phone call he gave her, saying that he was lost on a beach in France and couldn''t find his father. Nowadays, Elena lives on this same beach and manages a restaurant. She is finally beginning to emerge from this tragic episode when she meets a French teenager who strongly reminds her of her lost son. The two of them will embark on a relationship which will sow chaos and distrust around them.', 'Ten years have gone by since Elena''s six-year old son has disappeared. The last thing she heard of him was a phone call he gave her, saying that he was lost on a beach in France and couldn''t find his father. Nowadays, Elena lives on this same beach and manages a restaurant. She is finally beginning to emerge from this tragic episode when she meets a French teenager who strongly reminds her of her lost son. The two of them will embark on a relationship which will sow chaos and distrust around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eO5rhMM2SftbAUWDGclVuaBVL5W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594692'),
  ('421928213620600543', 'MOTHER', 2020, 'Drama', 'Mitsunobu Kawamura, Tomohiko Tsuji, Yuki Kondo', 'Tatsushi Ōmori, Takehiko Minato', 'Masami Nagasawa, Daiken Okudaira, Sadao Abe, Kaho, Sarutoki Minagawa, Taiga Nakano, Kaho Tsuchimura, Zenki Aramaki', null, 'Shuhei is leading a tough life. His alcoholic mother Akiko can only hook up with bad guys and order Shuhei to go get money from his disapproving grandparents instead of going to school. Except raising the little half-sister, his rock-bottom life seems to have no end.', 'Shuhei is leading a tough life. His alcoholic mother Akiko can only hook up with bad guys and order Shuhei to go get money from his disapproving grandparents instead of going to school. Except raising the little half-sister, his rock-bottom life seems to have no end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpjTywNoMJ4VpQb9a7VYQ7Jqdkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698860'),
  ('79470340397646134', 'Mother and a Guest', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shin Sang-ok, Lee Gye-chang, Choe Su-yeong', 'Ju Yo-seob', 'Choi Eun-hee, Jeon Young-sun, Kim Jin-kyu, Han Eun-jin, Do Kum-bong, Kim Hee-kap, Shin Young-kyun, Heo Chang-kang', null, 'Six-year-old Ok Hee is glad when Mr. Han comes to board at her house full of women. She plays messenger for Mr. Han and her widowed mother as they quietly fall in love, but is her support enough to guard their love?', 'Six-year-old Ok Hee is glad when Mr. Han comes to board at her house full of women. She plays messenger for Mr. Han and her widowed mother as they quietly fall in love, but is her support enough to guard their love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/992lC3nHFBi4gbFmQiJtjO8zk1K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121462'),
  ('180926742645052075', 'Mother and Child', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rodrigo García, Xavier Grobet', 'Rodrigo García', 'Naomi Watts, Annette Bening, Kerry Washington, Jimmy Smits, Samuel L. Jackson, S. Epatha Merkerson, Cherry Jones, Elpidia Carrillo', 'R', 'The lives of three women have a commonality: adoption. Karen is a physical therapist who regrets that, as a teenager, she gave up her daughter for adoption. Elizabeth was an adopted child and is now a successful lawyer, but her personal life lacks warmth. Lucy and her husband have failed to conceive and now hope to adopt a baby to make their family complete.', 'The lives of three women have a commonality: adoption. Karen is a physical therapist who regrets that, as a teenager, she gave up her daughter for adoption. Elizabeth was an adopted child and is now a successful lawyer, but her personal life lacks warmth. Lucy and her husband have failed to conceive and now hope to adopt a baby to make their family complete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5CjH4scjbBlGWLdZyUS7NEZf16.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37080'),
  ('263287899727492999', 'Mother And Daughter Car Center', 2021, 'Romance', null, null, 'Lee Eun-mi, Yeon Joo, Yoon Yool, Han Seok-bong, Gil Dong', null, 'Yeon Ja, a working mother, runs a car center after divorce and is raising her daughter all by herself. Her daughter, Ah Jung, started helping her when she became an adult, however, the customers don''t trust weak-looking women to touch machines and the business at the car center is slow. Thanks to Ah Jung''s punk boyfriend, Sung Hoon, they came up with an idea to turn the car center into a sexy car center.', 'Yeon Ja, a working mother, runs a car center after divorce and is raising her daughter all by herself. Her daughter, Ah Jung, started helping her when she became an adult, however, the customers don''t trust weak-looking women to touch machines and the business at the car center is slow. Thanks to Ah Jung''s punk boyfriend, Sung Hoon, they came up with an idea to turn the car center into a sexy car center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saca8CL9kk22AS5BfMbwSYgMvdp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:895954'),
  ('617648532068919391', 'Mother and Daughter: California Dream', 2016, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Marelli, Grégory Ohrel', 'Romuald Boulanger, Stéphane Marelli', 'Isabelle Desplentes, Lubna Gourion, Laura Marano, Lisa Linke, Annika Horne, Pearl Amanda Dickson, Kimberley Wong, Romuald Boulanger', null, 'Barbara was sellected for a fashion contest, the World Fashion Summer Dress, but the contest takes place in California and she lives in Paris. Barbara and Isabelle travels to Los Angeles where a great adventure waits for them.', 'Barbara was sellected for a fashion contest, the World Fashion Summer Dress, but the contest takes place in California and she lives in Paris. Barbara and Isabelle travels to Los Angeles where a great adventure waits for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbFL6ygpymRtbOhWL1BbFOIwoQB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377783'),
  ('1911213973216413', 'Mother and Son', 1997, 'Drama', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Marina Koreneva, Alexey Fedorov', 'Yuriy Arabov', 'Aleksei Ananishnov, Gudrun Geyer', null, 'A man goes for a walk through the countryside with his dying mother.', 'A man goes for a walk through the countryside with his dying mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOecN5ZKgNNhHhmpxrdvpzsWu8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44361'),
  ('979438474842332991', 'Mother and Son', 2022, 'Drama', 'Hélène Louvart, Léonor Serraille', 'Léonor Serraille', 'Annabelle Lengronne, Stéphane Bak, Kenzo Sambin, Ahmed Sylla, Sidy Fofana, Milan Doucansi, Jean-Christophe Folly, Majd Mastoura', null, 'In the late 1980s, Rose moves from the Ivory Coast to the Paris suburbs with her two young sons, Ernest and Jean. Spanning 20 years from their arrival in France to the present day, the film is the moving chronicle of the construction and deconstruction of a family.', 'In the late 1980s, Rose moves from the Ivory Coast to the Paris suburbs with her two young sons, Ernest and Jean. Spanning 20 years from their arrival in France to the present day, the film is the moving chronicle of the construction and deconstruction of a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3507IOfx0qBXHn0Yxoz1EHmQU8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926889'),
  ('401793793267376590', 'Mother at War', 2020, 'Drama, War', 'Heli Jürisson, Greta Varts, Jørgen Johansson', 'Henrik Ruben Genz, Bo Hr. Hansen', 'Trine Dyrholm, Ulrich Thomsen, Anders W. Berthelsen, Elias Munk, Ari Alexander, Sylvester Byder, Emil Aron Dorph, Mads Landelund', null, '1918. World War I rages in Europe while Erna Jensen tends to her ordinary life at home in Bramstrup, with her simple-minded son, Kalle. One day the village constable comes to enlist Kalle for military service for the German Empire – of which Southern Jutland is a part. If Erna is to save Kalle from certain death, she must follow him through thick and thin. Upon a chance meeting with a deserting solder she trades identities. Now disguised as Private Julius Rasmussen, Erna heads for the front. In her encounters with the other soldiers and in the presence of the war, unknown sides of Erna are awoken. This is the story of a woman who won’t let a war prevent her from fighting for what she loves.', '1918. World War I rages in Europe while Erna Jensen tends to her ordinary life at home in Bramstrup, with her simple-minded son, Kalle. One day the village constable comes to enlist Kalle for military service for the German Empire – of which Southern Jutland is a part. If Erna is to save Kalle from certain death, she must follow him through thick and thin. Upon a chance meeting with a deserting solder she trades identities. Now disguised as Private Julius Rasmussen, Erna heads for the front. In her encounters with the other soldiers and in the presence of the war, unknown sides of Erna are awoken. This is the story of a woman who won’t let a war prevent her from fighting for what she loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prrpF81RKedPlx6GIrVkZJ7xPR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659993'),
  ('1125663417672655251', 'Mother Dao, the Turtlelike', 1995, 'History, Documentary', 'Vincent Monnikendam', 'Vincent Monnikendam', null, null, 'In a span of ninety minutes the film aims to show how the Netherlands administered its colony as a colonial enterprise and what the relations were like at the time. The usual commentary has been omitted and in its place poems and songs in Bahasa Indonesia have been included in a digital sound composition. In Mother Dao the Turtlelike, the viewer sees how the colonial machinery in the 1920s was implanted in a world so different from Western Europe.', 'In a span of ninety minutes the film aims to show how the Netherlands administered its colony as a colonial enterprise and what the relations were like at the time. The usual commentary has been omitted and in its place poems and songs in Bahasa Indonesia have been included in a digital sound composition. In Mother Dao the Turtlelike, the viewer sees how the colonial machinery in the 1920s was implanted in a world so different from Western Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdqsKoE422dLzjWblhsegdu31kb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130272'),
  ('1100724140438555901', 'Mother For Baby Mammoth', 1981, 'Animation', 'Oleg Churkin, Igor Shkamarda, Vitaliy Azarovskiy', 'Dina Nepomnyashchaya', 'Klara Rumyanova, Zinoviy Gerdt, Rina Zelyonaya, Zinaida Naryshkina, Grigoriy Tolchinskiy', null, 'Baby Mammoth is looking for his Mom.', 'Baby Mammoth is looking for his Mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnWtmvi2q4zw9mleKEJVdbdWIJZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273202'),
  ('772249455440954946', 'Mother Goose Goes Hollywood', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Al Bernie, Thelma Boardman, Ann Lee, Dave Weber, Dave Barry, Sara Berner, Clarence Nash, Danny Webb', 'NR', 'Various Mother Goose rhymes are portrayed by Hollywood stars for example, Old King Cole''s fiddlers three are the Marx Brothers, and Humpty Dumpty is W.C. Fields, who falls while tormenting Charlie McCarthy; Simple Simon and the Pieman are Laurel and Hardy.', 'Various Mother Goose rhymes are portrayed by Hollywood stars for example, Old King Cole''s fiddlers three are the Marx Brothers, and Humpty Dumpty is W.C. Fields, who falls while tormenting Charlie McCarthy; Simple Simon and the Pieman are Laurel and Hardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PZaeU6pWSL9a6P0MHoXSQn7wbZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67128'),
  ('253345336863270202', 'Mother Goose Melodies', 1931, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Allan Watson, Walt Disney, Mae Questel, Marion Darlington, Purv Pullen', 'NR', 'A book of nursery rhymes plays for Old King Cole.', 'A book of nursery rhymes plays for Old King Cole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqGKINpqk0qgEdm7CFbsT3qmDvy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106100'),
  ('569165254895806176', 'Mother Goose Rock ''n'' Rhyme', 1990, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Jeff Stein, Tony Mitchell', 'Mark Curtiss, Rod Ash', 'Dan Gilroy, Shelley Duvall, Harry Anderson, Cyndi Lauper, Brian Bonsall, Art Garfunkel, Teri Garr, Woody Harrelson', 'G', 'Set in the mythical world of Rhymeland, Gordon Goose returns home to discover that his mom has mysteriously vanished. Now the characters of Rhymeland are in danger of disappearing unless Mother Goose returns.', 'Set in the mythical world of Rhymeland, Gordon Goose returns home to discover that his mom has mysteriously vanished. Now the characters of Rhymeland are in danger of disappearing unless Mother Goose returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLjkUM15qTIpKIbcS0ozKftC4d0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45265'),
  ('59106167127025989', 'Mother Holly', 1963, 'Family', 'Gottfried Kolditz', 'Gottfried Kolditz, Günter Kaltofen', 'Mathilde Danegger, Karin Ugowski, Katharina Lind, Elfriede Florin, Herbert Graedtke, Rudi Pfaff, Jürgen Pörschemann, Rolf Dietrich Zienau', null, 'The widow has an ugly and lazy daughter, Pechmarie, and a beautiful and hard-working step-daughter, Goldmarie. Because Pechmarie is her real daughter, the widow clearly favors her and makes Goldmarie do all the work. Poor Goldmarie must also sit and spin all day by the well until her fingers bleed. When she tries to rinse out the spindel, it drops into the cold water. Her unsympathetic step-mother tells her to jump in after it. Goldmarie does as she is told, and then wakes up in the middle of a beautiful field of flowers. This is the land of Frau Holle, who welcomes Goldmarie and invites her to stay, as long as she will help with the housework. Marie stays and serves Frau Holle gladly, until she suffers so terribly from homesickness that she asks to go home. Before bringing her back, Frau Holle rewards Marie with a shower of gold. Upon her return, Goldmarie and her gold are welcomed by her greedy step-sister and -mother. Hoping for the same kind of reward, the step-mother sends ...', 'The widow has an ugly and lazy daughter, Pechmarie, and a beautiful and hard-working step-daughter, Goldmarie. Because Pechmarie is her real daughter, the widow clearly favors her and makes Goldmarie do all the work. Poor Goldmarie must also sit and spin all day by the well until her fingers bleed. When she tries to rinse out the spindel, it drops into the cold water. Her unsympathetic step-mother tells her to jump in after it. Goldmarie does as she is told, and then wakes up in the middle of a beautiful field of flowers. This is the land of Frau Holle, who welcomes Goldmarie and invites her to stay, as long as she will help with the housework. Marie stays and serves Frau Holle gladly, until she suffers so terribly from homesickness that she asks to go home. Before bringing her back, Frau Holle rewards Marie with a shower of gold. Upon her return, Goldmarie and her gold are welcomed by her greedy step-sister and -mother. Hoping for the same kind of reward, the step-mother sends ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tNUt9I5tdge7pIzODSwyhz4xLQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13103'),
  ('288514627484169990', 'Mother India', 1957, 'Drama', 'Mehboob Khan, Faredoon A. Irani', null, 'Nargis, Sunil Dutt, Rajendra Kumar, Raaj Kumar, Kanhaiyalal Chaturvedi, Kumkum, Mukri, Sheela Naik', null, 'A poverty-stricken woman raises her sons through many trials and tribulations. But no matter the struggles, always sticks to her own moral code.', 'A poverty-stricken woman raises her sons through many trials and tribulations. But no matter the struggles, always sticks to her own moral code.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlfM9yLcK1rhv73iNbDiOU9vnnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:917'),
  ('664991978520337831', 'Mother Is a Whore', 2011, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Lee Sang-woo, Cho Young-jik', 'Lee Sang-woo', 'Lee Sang-woo, Lee Yong-nyeo, Kwon Beom-taek, Yoo Ae-Kyeong, Jeong Tae-won', null, 'Sang-Woo is a HIV positive 38-year-old man who lives in a small shed with his mother. His mother at the age of 60 began working as a prostitute to support herself and her son out of their small shed. Meanwhile, Sang-Woo works as her pimp - collecting payment and arranging appointments with his cellphone. Their clients include a paraplegic man and soldiers on holiday. Living through their difficult situation, Sang-Woo still carries a strong bond with his mother. Sang-Woo also harbors intense anger within. His father abandoned them and then remarried into a seemingly normal family. But actually, his father married a woman who is a religious fanatic and their son always locks himself away in his room. Sang- Woo often meets their daughter (his step-sister) for drinks outside of a Buddhist temple. Can Sang-Woo ever find a way out for himself and his mother?', 'Sang-Woo is a HIV positive 38-year-old man who lives in a small shed with his mother. His mother at the age of 60 began working as a prostitute to support herself and her son out of their small shed. Meanwhile, Sang-Woo works as her pimp - collecting payment and arranging appointments with his cellphone. Their clients include a paraplegic man and soldiers on holiday. Living through their difficult situation, Sang-Woo still carries a strong bond with his mother. Sang-Woo also harbors intense anger within. His father abandoned them and then remarried into a seemingly normal family. But actually, his father married a woman who is a religious fanatic and their son always locks himself away in his room. Sang- Woo often meets their daughter (his step-sister) for drinks outside of a Buddhist temple. Can Sang-Woo ever find a way out for himself and his mother?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGuYYLJIRGyp1wtIhwLFQcgUdij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73962'),
  ('193473926123011045', 'Mother Joan of the Angels', 1961, 'Drama, Horror', 'Maria Starzeńska, Marian Zietkiewicz, Urszula Orczykowska', 'Tadeusz Konwicki, Jerzy Kawalerowicz', 'Lucyna Winnicka, Mieczysław Voit, Anna Ciepielewska, Maria Chwalibóg, Kazimierz Fabisiak, Stanisław Jasiukiewicz, Zygmunt Zintel, Jerzy Kaczmarek', null, 'A Polish priest arrives at a convent hoping to save the Mother Superior who is supposedly possessed by eight demons.', 'A Polish priest arrives at a convent hoping to save the Mother Superior who is supposedly possessed by eight demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DRAaO2Yp9wd2lvgRSjWbyeN0Vs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113458'),
  ('16310955742698944', 'Mother Krause''s Journey to Happiness', 1929, 'Drama', 'Phil Jutzi', 'Willy Döll, Jan Fethke', 'Alexandra Schmitt, Holmes Zimmermann, Ilse Trautschold, Gerhard Bienert, Vera Sacharowa, Friedrich Gnaß, Fee Wachsmuth', null, 'Mutter Krause, her daughter Erna and her son Paul live in a tenement in the poorer section of Berlin''s Wedding district. Along with them lives "the Tenant", his soon-to-be bride Friede, who works as a prostitute, and her child whose name isn''t revealed in the film. Mutter Krause is a quiet, long-suffering old woman who earns what little she can delivering newspapers. However, Paul is an alcoholic and spends all her money on drink. Mutter Krause can''t pay back the money she owes the man whose newspapers she delivered and he accuses her of stealing and threatens her with arrest. Mutter Krause must then pawn her last valuable possession, a treasured memento of her late husband. Paul then breaks into the same pawn shop. He gets away but is later arrested. Meanwhile, Erna begins dating a young man with Communist views, who turns Erna to Communism and also helps her earn the money her mother needs by more honest means.', 'Mutter Krause, her daughter Erna and her son Paul live in a tenement in the poorer section of Berlin''s Wedding district. Along with them lives "the Tenant", his soon-to-be bride Friede, who works as a prostitute, and her child whose name isn''t revealed in the film. Mutter Krause is a quiet, long-suffering old woman who earns what little she can delivering newspapers. However, Paul is an alcoholic and spends all her money on drink. Mutter Krause can''t pay back the money she owes the man whose newspapers she delivered and he accuses her of stealing and threatens her with arrest. Mutter Krause must then pawn her last valuable possession, a treasured memento of her late husband. Paul then breaks into the same pawn shop. He gets away but is later arrested. Meanwhile, Erna begins dating a young man with Communist views, who turns Erna to Communism and also helps her earn the money her mother needs by more honest means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9k0qhR4RkqR6LPWXf0SwHCr1NWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150537'),
  ('102641076301296684', 'Mother Küsters Goes to Heaven', 1975, 'Drama', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Wolfgang Hoffmann, Michael Ballhaus', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Kurt Raab', 'Brigitte Mira, Ingrid Caven, Margit Carstensen, Karlheinz Böhm, Irm Hermann, Gottfried John, Kurt Raab, Peter Kern', null, 'Frau Emma Küsters prepares dinner late one seemingly-ordinary afternoon in her seemingly-ordinary Frankfurt kitchen. She wants to add canned sausages to the stew; her irritating daughter-in-law thinks otherwise. But the point is moot: Ernst Küsters has not only murdered the personnel director at the soap factory where he''s employed but succeeded that by committing suicide.', 'Frau Emma Küsters prepares dinner late one seemingly-ordinary afternoon in her seemingly-ordinary Frankfurt kitchen. She wants to add canned sausages to the stew; her irritating daughter-in-law thinks otherwise. But the point is moot: Ernst Küsters has not only murdered the personnel director at the soap factory where he''s employed but succeeded that by committing suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xnA40LULMD2VQb2hFql2vHEeje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42260'),
  ('309689039088128625', 'Mother Lode', 1982, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Charlton Heston, Richard Leiterman', 'Fraser Clarke Heston', 'Charlton Heston, Kim Basinger, Nick Mancuso, John Marley, Dale Wilson, Rocky Zantolas, Marie George', 'PG', 'A couple of young adventurers go into the wilderness of British Columbia in search of a lost colleague. Their plane crashes and they find themselves at the mercy of a crazed old Scottish miner, who has lived in isolation for many decades searching the mountain caves for a chamber of long lost gold. He is prepared to do anything - including murder - to keep his gold for himself.', 'A couple of young adventurers go into the wilderness of British Columbia in search of a lost colleague. Their plane crashes and they find themselves at the mercy of a crazed old Scottish miner, who has lived in isolation for many decades searching the mountain caves for a chamber of long lost gold. He is prepared to do anything - including murder - to keep his gold for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcaXFijDzD7bVSuliMZNylcLyhp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79257'),
  ('18626127823485013', 'Mother Mary', 2026, 'Drama, Music, Thriller, Musical', 'David Lowery, James M. Johnston, Andrew Droz Palermo, Daniel Foeldes, Rina Yang, Hélène Irdor, Scott Kirby, Kathrin Löbach, Rickie-Lee Roberts, Leoni Rützel', 'David Lowery', 'Anne Hathaway, Michaela Coel, Hunter Schafer, Atheena Frizzell, Jessica Brown Findlay', 'R', 'Long-buried wounds rise to the surface when iconic pop star Mother Mary reunites with her estranged best friend and former costume designer, Sam Anselm, on the eve of her comeback performance.', 'Long-buried wounds rise to the surface when iconic pop star Mother Mary reunites with her estranged best friend and former costume designer, Sam Anselm, on the eve of her comeback performance.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F1%2Fgracenote%2F17da8889e485e49c8d04ff26b7c209a3.jpg', 'plex:movie:mother-mary-2026'),
  ('895125417829470698', 'Mother Night', 1996, 'Drama, History', 'Keith Gordon, Tom Richmond', 'Robert B. Weide', 'Nick Nolte, Sheryl Lee, Alan Arkin, Bernard Behrens, Anna Berger, Arye Gross, Norman Rodway, Frankie Faison', null, 'An American spy behind the lines during WWII serves as a Nazi propagandist, a role he cannot escape in his future life as he can never reveal his real role in the war.', 'An American spy behind the lines during WWII serves as a Nazi propagandist, a role he cannot escape in his future life as he can never reveal his real role in the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJtOHLb96rcLjgLS4FM9fqEKcd6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20318'),
  ('552600793944023357', 'Mother of Flies', 2025, 'Horror', 'John Adams, Zelda Adams, Toby Poser', 'John Adams, Toby Poser, Zelda Adams', 'Zelda Adams, Toby Poser, John Adams, Lulu Adams, Trey Lindsay, Noble Wilson-Eiden, Jessica Beveridge, Sofia Macaluso', null, 'When a young woman faces a deadly diagnosis, she seeks dark magic from a witch in the woods... but every cure has costs.', 'When a young woman faces a deadly diagnosis, she seeks dark magic from a witch in the woods... but every cure has costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGsZCpd0UWnU0YP5iRMB3qtIm1G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1481608'),
  ('98759026975461026', 'Mother of Mine', 2005, 'Drama, War', 'Klaus Härö, Jarkko T. Laine, Marko Talli', 'Jimmy Karlsson, Kirsi Vikman', 'Topi Majaniemi, Marjaana Maijala, Maria Lundqvist, Michael Nyqvist, Esko Salminen, Aino-Maija Tikkanen, Leif Andrée, Marie Göranzon', null, '1943: Nine-year-old Eero whose father is killed during the war is brought to Sweden to foster parents to his protection like thousands of other Finnish children. Eero feels lost, particularly as his foster mother Signe behaves very unfriendly. She was expecting a little girl and still mourns for her daughter who drowned in the sea.', '1943: Nine-year-old Eero whose father is killed during the war is brought to Sweden to foster parents to his protection like thousands of other Finnish children. Eero feels lost, particularly as his foster mother Signe behaves very unfriendly. She was expecting a little girl and still mourns for her daughter who drowned in the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJhGq1H1EeptuB3YT0aZWj1CZ5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32990'),
  ('417851045626960242', 'Mother of the Bride', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mark Waters, Ed Wu, Christopher S. Bryson', 'Robin Bernheim Burger', 'Brooke Shields, Miranda Cosgrove, Benjamin Bratt, Sean Teale, Rachael Harris, Chad Michael Murray, Wilson Cruz, Michael McDonald', 'PG', 'Lana''s daughter Emma returns from abroad and drops a bombshell: she''s getting married. In Thailand. In a month! Things only get worse when Lana learns that the man who captured Emma''s heart is the son of the man who broke hers years ago.', 'Lana''s daughter Emma returns from abroad and drops a bombshell: she''s getting married. In Thailand. In a month! Things only get worse when Lana learns that the man who captured Emma''s heart is the son of the man who broke hers years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdTvwykMWvVgdaViBVRh8IFTku5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1093231'),
  ('229544369035161053', 'Mother Pluto', 1936, 'Animation', 'Louis Debney, Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Florence Gill', 'NR', 'Pluto accidentally hatches a bunch of chickens and looks after them until the hen returns.', 'Pluto accidentally hatches a bunch of chickens and looks after them until the hen returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMkc6iEPSkRuV8dc1HjVncHNea4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109325'),
  ('750250633656900690', 'Mother Riley Meets the Vampire', 1952, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Stanley Pavey, Denis O''Dell, John Gilling', 'Val Valentine', 'Bela Lugosi, Arthur Lucan, Dora Bryan, Philip Leaver, Richard Wattis, Hattie Jacques, Graham Moffatt, David Hurst', 'NR', 'The legendary Bela Lugosi as "the Vampire" teams up with Britain''s much-loved "Mother Riley" in this hilarious comedy adventure. The Vampire plans to control the world with the help of his robot, which accidentally gets shipped to Mother Riley. Through radar control, he contacts the robot and orders it to come to him, bringing along Mother Riley! But his life is turned upside down when he holds this most meddling of mothers captive.', 'The legendary Bela Lugosi as "the Vampire" teams up with Britain''s much-loved "Mother Riley" in this hilarious comedy adventure. The Vampire plans to control the world with the help of his robot, which accidentally gets shipped to Mother Riley. Through radar control, he contacts the robot and orders it to come to him, bringing along Mother Riley! But his life is turned upside down when he holds this most meddling of mothers captive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRaLE08UxZOlIPkpiDFAjtl4Vgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59270'),
  ('967388516635627036', 'Mother Valley', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Carlos Chahine, Euric Allaire, Charbel Kamel', 'Carlos Chahine, Tristan Benoit', 'Nathalie Baye, Marilyne Naaman, Pierre Rochefort, Antoine Merheb Tarb, Talal Jurdi, Ahmad Kaabour, Christine Choueiri, Joy Hallak', null, 'In 1958, while revolution is rumbling in Beirut, three sisters spend their holidays in an isolated village of Lebanese mountains: rebellious Nada, romantic Eva, and the eldest Layla, a good woman, beloved by everyone. But the war threatens and the sudden entrance of two French summer vacationers leads Layla to revolt against patriarchal society.', 'In 1958, while revolution is rumbling in Beirut, three sisters spend their holidays in an isolated village of Lebanese mountains: rebellious Nada, romantic Eva, and the eldest Layla, a good woman, beloved by everyone. But the war threatens and the sudden entrance of two French summer vacationers leads Layla to revolt against patriarchal society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8M4MimsldfdSyxNnys194CMDFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:967549'),
  ('352887651707025848', 'Mother-in-law in Love With Son-in-law 4', 2023, 'Romance', 'Choi Yoon-ji-I', null, 'Lee Chae-dam, Ji Won, Yoon Taek-seung, Im Tae-mok', null, 'Joon-yeon and So-hyeon are living together with Joon-yeon''s young and pretty mother-in-law for a while after his father-in-law remarries. One day, Joon-yeon is left home alone with his mother-in-law due to So-hyeon and her father-in-law''s sudden business trip. The mother-in-law seduces her handsome son-in-law on a hot night. Unable to forget the sex he had with his mother-in-law, Joon-yeon even plans to have a threesome with his wife and his mother-in-law.', 'Joon-yeon and So-hyeon are living together with Joon-yeon''s young and pretty mother-in-law for a while after his father-in-law remarries. One day, Joon-yeon is left home alone with his mother-in-law due to So-hyeon and her father-in-law''s sudden business trip. The mother-in-law seduces her handsome son-in-law on a hot night. Unable to forget the sex he had with his mother-in-law, Joon-yeon even plans to have a threesome with his wife and his mother-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3yMT5okmLA3x9rTe5tCrqke1oI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232221'),
  ('35529659392699659', 'Mother, Couch', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Niclas Larsson, Chayse Irvin, Spencer Taylor', 'Niclas Larsson', 'Ewan McGregor, Rhys Ifans, Taylor Russell, Lara Flynn Boyle, Lake Bell, F. Murray Abraham, Ellen Burstyn, Mar''Ques Woolford', null, 'The members of a dysfunctional family find themselves mysteriously trapped in an antiquated furniture store when their elderly matriarch suddenly refuses to get up from one of the display couches.', 'The members of a dysfunctional family find themselves mysteriously trapped in an antiquated furniture store when their elderly matriarch suddenly refuses to get up from one of the display couches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUJeMGImIFFmq5Ck7pxOC9D8dr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032642'),
  ('504532677757240631', 'Mother, Jugs & Speed', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Peter Yates, Ralph Woolsey, Art Levinson', 'Tom Mankiewicz', 'Raquel Welch, Bill Cosby, Harvey Keitel, Allen Garfield, L.Q. Jones, Bruce Davison, Dick Butkus, Larry Hagman', 'PG', 'To beat out competing ambulance services, an ace driver, an office secretary/paramedic and a suspended cop resort to some outrageous behavior to help people in distress. They''re a crew whose condition is even more critical than their clients!', 'To beat out competing ambulance services, an ace driver, an office secretary/paramedic and a suspended cop resort to some outrageous behavior to help people in distress. They''re a crew whose condition is even more critical than their clients!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozIPoDZhBJ7WQAczMLLiSrrcQjT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26176'),
  ('683369364540949778', 'Mother, May I Sleep with Danger?', 1996, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jorge Montesi, Kevin Parks, John Rainey', null, 'Tori Spelling, Ivan Sergei, Todd Caldecott, Gabrielle Miller, Lochlyn Munro, Kevin McNulty, Bryn Erin, Lisa Banes', null, 'Laurel has the boyfriend of her dreams, Kevin. He can and will do anything for her. He is totally devoted to her but the downside is that he won''t leave her alone. When she tries to get some distance he responds with aggressiveness. It finally dawns on Laurel that he is not good for her. Laurel''s mother Jessica has already started to suspect that something is wrong with his background.', 'Laurel has the boyfriend of her dreams, Kevin. He can and will do anything for her. He is totally devoted to her but the downside is that he won''t leave her alone. When she tries to get some distance he responds with aggressiveness. It finally dawns on Laurel that he is not good for her. Laurel''s mother Jessica has already started to suspect that something is wrong with his background.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pX0dedYfB66zUAFmS4zJ4VW35Np.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133494'),
  ('1065022687787420160', 'Mother, May I Sleep with Danger?', 2016, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'Melanie Aitkenhead, Christina Alexandra Voros', 'Amber Viera', 'Emily Meade, James Franco, Leila George, Tori Spelling, Ivan Sergei, Nick Eversman, Emma Rigby, Gabrielle Haugh', null, 'Theater major Leah brings her new love home to meet her mom, Julie, who is surprised when Pearl comes to the door. Julie tries to embrace the idea of Leah’s new love interest, but she can’t shake the feeling that something is very wrong. Julie’s suspicions lead to a startling discovery about Pearl that puts Leah in serious danger. Will Julie be able to save her daughter from an eternity of heartache before it’s too late?', 'Theater major Leah brings her new love home to meet her mom, Julie, who is surprised when Pearl comes to the door. Julie tries to embrace the idea of Leah’s new love interest, but she can’t shake the feeling that something is very wrong. Julie’s suspicions lead to a startling discovery about Pearl that puts Leah in serious danger. Will Julie be able to save her daughter from an eternity of heartache before it’s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4hJiuqtw6xA7IvXNvnTHhtiuYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399747'),
  ('53680844939746762', 'Mother, May I?', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Laurence Vannicelli, Craig Harmer', 'Laurence Vannicelli', 'Kyle Gallner, Holland Roden, Chris Mulkey, Daphne Gaines, Michael Giannone', null, 'Emmett enters into a nightmarish game of therapy with his wife Anya, who has inexplicably taken on the persona of his estranged and recently-deceased mother.', 'Emmett enters into a nightmarish game of therapy with his wife Anya, who has inexplicably taken on the persona of his estranged and recently-deceased mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBYEX7IxR9wocuhgzco7D3SG90F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1019961'),
  ('107790542718082832', 'Mother. Daughter. Killer.', 2017, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Bernard Déchet, Claude-Michel Rome', 'Claude-Michel Rome', 'Alexandra Vandernoot, Isabelle Vitari, Antoine Duléry, Gérard Dubouche, Alexis Loret, Jean-Jérôme Esposito, Avy Marciano, Coline D''Inca', null, 'The kidnapping and murder of a young woman on France’s Mediterranean coast reawakens horrors of the past. Three years ago, criminologist Ariane’s cousin was killed and her mother, homicide inspector Sandra, was suspected to be involved in the case. When Sandra’s former boss invites her to help out on the new case, mother and daughter, who had a visceral falling-out over Elodie’s murder, have to join forces.', 'The kidnapping and murder of a young woman on France’s Mediterranean coast reawakens horrors of the past. Three years ago, criminologist Ariane’s cousin was killed and her mother, homicide inspector Sandra, was suspected to be involved in the case. When Sandra’s former boss invites her to help out on the new case, mother and daughter, who had a visceral falling-out over Elodie’s murder, have to join forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUgt73FuFbzaITXH3uZhJdJykc9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445107'),
  ('614795985858182242', 'Mother''s Boys', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Yves Simoneau, Ronald M. Vargas Sr., Steve Danton', 'Richard Hawley, Barry Schneider', 'Jamie Lee Curtis, Peter Gallagher, Joanne Whalley, Vanessa Redgrave, Luke Edwards, Colin Ward, Joey Zimmerman, Joss Ackland', 'R', 'Sexy but unstable wife and mother Jude walked out on her family three years ago. Now, just as suddenly, she is back. But her husband, Robert, has fallen in love with Callie, an assistant principal at his sons'' school. He asks Jude for a divorce. She responds by trying to turn her three boys against Callie, then by slashing herself and blaming her rival and finally by drawing her 12-year-old, Kes, into a murderous plot.', 'Sexy but unstable wife and mother Jude walked out on her family three years ago. Now, just as suddenly, she is back. But her husband, Robert, has fallen in love with Callie, an assistant principal at his sons'' school. He asks Jude for a divorce. She responds by trying to turn her three boys against Callie, then by slashing herself and blaming her rival and finally by drawing her 12-year-old, Kes, into a murderous plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itHFRyqt5lVnjIdaHi1DNvaiT77.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41587'),
  ('541808269619066894', 'Mother''s Day', 1948, 'Drama', 'James Broughton, Kermit Sheets', 'James Broughton', 'Marion Cunningham, Donald Pidgeon, Hal Goldman, Donald Nelson, Betty Lee Balder, Elaine Mitchell, Marion Farquhar, Jack W. Stauffacher', null, 'Accepting the potentialities of the medium to manipulate both time and space, Broughton brings past and present head-on as he regards with adult feelings his childhood family and friends. Grown-ups romp like children, and by their magnified infantilism playfully underscore such basic traits as sadism, sensuality, arid egocentricity. (Melbourne International Film Festival)', 'Accepting the potentialities of the medium to manipulate both time and space, Broughton brings past and present head-on as he regards with adult feelings his childhood family and friends. Grown-ups romp like children, and by their magnified infantilism playfully underscore such basic traits as sadism, sensuality, arid egocentricity. (Melbourne International Film Festival)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vR3Q5vSIjZdmk6IU2utKT77wdVn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285346'),
  ('76686444174250413', 'Mother''s Day', 1980, 'Action, Horror, Comedy', 'Charles Kaufman', 'Charles Kaufman, Warren Leight', 'Nancy Hendrickson, Deborah Luce, Tiana Pierce, Frederick Coffin, Michael McCleery, Beatrice Pons, Peter Fox, Robert Collins', 'NR', 'Three girls discover that two men are willing to do anything to impress Mother and what impresses Mother is watching her sons commit acts of rape and murder. Now these women are prisoners and lowered to pawns in the game of checkers between two dim wits and their Maniac Mommy and the question becomes, can any of them escape, alive?', 'Three girls discover that two men are willing to do anything to impress Mother and what impresses Mother is watching her sons commit acts of rape and murder. Now these women are prisoners and lowered to pawns in the game of checkers between two dim wits and their Maniac Mommy and the question becomes, can any of them escape, alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qONbGJ5jMb57zThorE5ozHDztDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14929'),
  ('225240734524092423', 'Mother''s Day', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Harald Sicheritz, Helmut Pirnat', null, 'Alfred Dorfer, Eva Billisich, Reinhard Nowak, Andrea Händler, Roland Düringer, Willi Resetarits, I Stangl, Hanno Pöschl', null, '48 hours in the life of the Neugebauer family. The May weekend with a small family celebration, which was planned as peaceful and contemplative, turns out to be a kind of Rocky Horror Picture Show in Vienna''s municipal housing estate. Just like the other residents, the Neugebauers are preparing for the impending Mother''s Day.', '48 hours in the life of the Neugebauer family. The May weekend with a small family celebration, which was planned as peaceful and contemplative, turns out to be a kind of Rocky Horror Picture Show in Vienna''s municipal housing estate. Just like the other residents, the Neugebauers are preparing for the impending Mother''s Day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMAOKYc3MBm78IV7pnEpEceaKgM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15458'),
  ('559030501973526655', 'Mother''s Day', 2010, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Darren Lynn Bousman, Megan Basaraba, Reed Makayev', 'Warren Leight, Charles Kaufman', 'Rebecca De Mornay, Jaime King, Frank Grillo, Patrick John Flueger, Warren Kole, Deborah Ann Woll, Matt O''Leary, Briana Evigan', 'R', 'Crazed members of a sadistic family return to their childhood home to terrorize the new owners.', 'Crazed members of a sadistic family return to their childhood home to terrorize the new owners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjKmtce2WFoOyoiYGVx0nUSzGxT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101669'),
  ('772448144711930682', 'Mother''s Day', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Garry Marshall, Charles Minsky', 'Anya Kochoff, Tom Hines, Lily Hollander', 'Jennifer Aniston, Julia Roberts, Kate Hudson, Jason Sudeikis, Sarah Chalke, Britt Robertson, Timothy Olyphant, Shay Mitchell', 'PG-13', 'Sandy is a stressed-out, single mom who learns that her ex-husband is marrying a younger woman. Her friend Jesse''s parents don''t know that she has a family or that her sister, Gabi is married to a woman. Jesse''s friend, Kristin, is juggling motherhood of a toddler, a patient boyfriend who keeps proposing, and searching for her biological mother. Bradley is a widower who''s trying to raise two daughters on his own, while Miranda is too busy with her career to worry about children. When their respective problems intersect and start coming to a head, the Mother''s Day holiday takes on a special meaning for all.', 'Sandy is a stressed-out, single mom who learns that her ex-husband is marrying a younger woman. Her friend Jesse''s parents don''t know that she has a family or that her sister, Gabi is married to a woman. Jesse''s friend, Kristin, is juggling motherhood of a toddler, a patient boyfriend who keeps proposing, and searching for her biological mother. Bradley is a widower who''s trying to raise two daughters on his own, while Miranda is too busy with her career to worry about children. When their respective problems intersect and start coming to a head, the Mother''s Day holiday takes on a special meaning for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TGkhTsbkm2v1nMGJW0eTOFBjAd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353069'),
  ('264614605498223819', 'Mother''s Day', 2023, 'Thriller, Action', 'Tomasz Niemiec, Kacper Lisowski, Kacper Lisowski', 'Łukasz M. Maciejewski, Mateusz Rakowicz', 'Agnieszka Grochowska, Adrian Delikta, Dariusz Chojnacki, Paulina Chruściel, Paweł Koślik, Arkadiusz Brykalski, Sebastian Dela, Szymon Wróblewski', 'R', 'Nina, a former NATO special operations agent living in hiding, has to use all her deadly skills to rescue her son who has been kidnapped by ruthless gangsters. Finding Max is a double opportunity for her. A chance to feel the adrenaline rush again, and an opportunity to get back into the life of the son she had to abandon years ago.', 'Nina, a former NATO special operations agent living in hiding, has to use all her deadly skills to rescue her son who has been kidnapped by ruthless gangsters. Finding Max is a double opportunity for her. A chance to feel the adrenaline rush again, and an opportunity to get back into the life of the son she had to abandon years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wws9Z90DdZ7D0n3gdzFSZ6cntJi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1107872'),
  ('930501905156939136', 'Mother''s Day Is Cancelled', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Javier Colinas', 'Ricardo Avilés, Adriana Pelusi, El Huevo Charlie Barrientos', 'Gala Montes, Michel Duval, Leticia Huijara, Anette Michel, Alejandro Camacho, Geraldine Galvan, Giovanna Reynaud, Anahí Allue', null, 'Lidia and Manuel are a newlywed couple whose families have only met once. Now, they get together again to celebrate Mother’s Day. But there is a secret in the family that as soon as it explodes, will change it all. Esmeralda and Rosa must lean on each other to get through the day that seems to have something against them.', 'Lidia and Manuel are a newlywed couple whose families have only met once. Now, they get together again to celebrate Mother’s Day. But there is a secret in the family that as soon as it explodes, will change it all. Esmeralda and Rosa must lean on each other to get through the day that seems to have something against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j741ip55NOzabrllOXHJv2vpag7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1122493'),
  ('945373496407690009', 'Mother''s Elling', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eva Isaksen, Rolv Håan', 'Axel Hellstenius', 'Per Christian Ellefsen, Grete Nordrå, Helge Reiss, Christin Borge, Per Schaanning, Lena Meieran, Ane Dahl Torp, Erland Bakker', null, 'Elling has lived with his mother all his life. Mom is the practical one, while Elling ponders the more theoretical aspects of life. He spends his time in their apartment reading books and looking at the neighbours through the living room window. Elling doesn''t seem to need to be around others like most people. That''s why Elling is less than enthusiastic when his mother suddenly decides to take her son on a beach vacation to Spain. Reluctantly, Elling agrees. After all, a lady at her age needs a good man by her side. But what Elling refuses to realize is that Mom is not only old, but also sick. Very sick. On her last vacation she tries to get Elling to see that life is bigger than their living room.', 'Elling has lived with his mother all his life. Mom is the practical one, while Elling ponders the more theoretical aspects of life. He spends his time in their apartment reading books and looking at the neighbours through the living room window. Elling doesn''t seem to need to be around others like most people. That''s why Elling is less than enthusiastic when his mother suddenly decides to take her son on a beach vacation to Spain. Reluctantly, Elling agrees. After all, a lady at her age needs a good man by her side. But what Elling refuses to realize is that Mom is not only old, but also sick. Very sick. On her last vacation she tries to get Elling to see that life is bigger than their living room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4eHE3cy5JBjoGSobHxaUkOmv4a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11166'),
  ('1023864896297772840', 'Mother''s Friend 2', 2018, 'Romance', 'Lim Hyun-tae', null, 'Do Mo-se, Yoo Na, Lee Joon-hyun, Jin Joo', null, 'Do-won is a twenty-year-old who lives with his mom. However, he is secretly sleeping with his mother''s friend Eun-ji who lives next door. One day, his mother''s junior''s husband dies and she moves into the neighborhood. Since then, his mother and her friends see alot of each other and So-jung who misses having a man, starts seducing Do-won...', 'Do-won is a twenty-year-old who lives with his mom. However, he is secretly sleeping with his mother''s friend Eun-ji who lives next door. One day, his mother''s junior''s husband dies and she moves into the neighborhood. Since then, his mother and her friends see alot of each other and So-jung who misses having a man, starts seducing Do-won...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVsbOBfzkFrrdR4OuSC0covMoGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:701919'),
  ('721493164801208714', 'Mother''s Heart', 1969, 'Drama', 'Salvatore Samperi', 'Dacia Maraini', 'Carla Gravina, Beba Lončar, Philippe Leroy, Paolo Graziosi, Sara Di Nepi, Mauro Gravina, Monica Gravina, Massimiliano Ferendeles', null, 'A mute mother stands by idly as her young children radicalise as a result of a society that thrives on conflict and manipulation. As she is drawn to a group of political activists, her absence allows her children to become increasingly extreme in their behaviour and lethal games they play.', 'A mute mother stands by idly as her young children radicalise as a result of a society that thrives on conflict and manipulation. As she is drawn to a group of political activists, her absence allows her children to become increasingly extreme in their behaviour and lethal games they play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQ01WrrmjE9NT3yDdID2nUbkfdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131585'),
  ('566468212105625027', 'Mother''s Pride', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nick Moorcroft', 'Nick Moorcroft, Meg Leonard', 'Jonno Davies, James Buckley, Martin Clunes', null, 'A grieving family who own a failing pub have their lives changed by brewing real ale and entering the Great British Beer Awards.', 'A grieving family who own a failing pub have their lives changed by brewing real ale and entering the Great British Beer Awards.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fd%2Fgracenote%2Fd9e020d77f333ebcabe5daad1376aab3.jpg', 'plex:movie:mothers-pride-2026'),
  ('1016738995890989832', 'Mother''s Seduction', 2018, 'Romance', 'Yoo Hae-jong', null, 'Lee Eun-mi, Yoo Sul-young, Lee Kang-woo, Park Joo-bin', null, 'Jung-sik helps out a friend and finds himself attracted to his friend''s mother. After being caught steeling the mother''s underwear, he becomes the victim of the mother''s seduction.', 'Jung-sik helps out a friend and finds himself attracted to his friend''s mother. After being caught steeling the mother''s underwear, he becomes the victim of the mother''s seduction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dSNXqyXoFh8HbFkMnaKm2us06e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538335'),
  ('5667509908711830', 'Mother/Android', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Matthew Vose Campbell, Alyssa Boffoli, Mattson Tomlin', 'Mattson Tomlin', 'Chloë Grace Moretz, Algee Smith, Raúl Castillo, Kiara Pichardo, Oscar Wahlberg, Jared Reinfeldt, Stephen Thorne, Jon F. Merz', 'R', 'Georgia and her boyfriend Sam go on a treacherous journey to escape their country, which is caught in an unexpected war with artificial intelligence. Days away from the arrival of their first child, the couple must face No Man’s Land—a stronghold of the android uprising—in hopes of reaching safety before giving birth.', 'Georgia and her boyfriend Sam go on a treacherous journey to escape their country, which is caught in an unexpected war with artificial intelligence. Days away from the arrival of their first child, the couple must face No Man’s Land—a stronghold of the android uprising—in hopes of reaching safety before giving birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rO3nV9d1wzHEWsC7xgwxotjZQpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739413'),
  ('1027344323717703541', 'Motherhood', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Katherine Dieckmann, Nancy Schreiber, Justin Ritson', 'Katherine Dieckmann', 'Uma Thurman, Minnie Driver, Anthony Edwards, David Schallipp, Matthew Schallipp, Daisy Tahan, Alice Drummond, Stephanie Szostak', 'PG-13', 'In Manhattan, a mother of two preparing for her daughter''s sixth birthday party has no idea of the challenges she''s about to face in order to pull off the event.', 'In Manhattan, a mother of two preparing for her daughter''s sixth birthday party has no idea of the challenges she''s about to face in order to pull off the event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzQCsmvPJU0L4tnPtQHlVliw2zn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22805'),
  ('336154826202216675', 'Motherhood', 2022, 'Drama', 'Pilar Palomero, Julián Elizalde', 'Pilar Palomero', 'Carla Quílez, Ángela Cervantes, Jordan Cornejo, Clàudia Dalmau, Estel Collado, Claudia Medina, Sheila Baños, Jamila Bengharda', null, 'At the age of 14, Carla is a wild and rebellious teenager. Living in a modest restaurant on the outskirts of a town with her young single mother, she skips school and passes the time with her friend Efraín. When a social worker realizes that Carla is five months pregnant, she is taken to ‘La Maternal’, a center for teenage mothers, to live with other young women like herself. Together with their babies, they will learn to cope with this new adult life for which they had no time to prepare.', 'At the age of 14, Carla is a wild and rebellious teenager. Living in a modest restaurant on the outskirts of a town with her young single mother, she skips school and passes the time with her friend Efraín. When a social worker realizes that Carla is five months pregnant, she is taken to ‘La Maternal’, a center for teenage mothers, to live with other young women like herself. Together with their babies, they will learn to cope with this new adult life for which they had no time to prepare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MSSx8RAkBIUPlZa4DpiDq2mxyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884669'),
  ('396852603175688299', 'Mothering Sunday', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jamie D. Ramsay, Adam Marshall, Eva Husson', 'Alice Birch', 'Odessa Young, Josh O''Connor, Ṣọpẹ́ Dìrísù, Patsy Ferran, Emma D''Arcy, Glenda Jackson, Olivia Colman, Colin Firth', 'R', 'On a warm spring day in 1924, house maid and foundling Jane Fairchild finds herself alone on Mother''s Day. Her employers, Mr. and Mrs. Niven, are out and she has the rare chance to spend quality time with her secret lover. Paul is the boy from the manor house nearby, Jane''s long-term love despite the fact that he''s engaged to be married to another woman, a childhood friend and daughter of his parents'' friends. But events that neither can foresee will change the course of Jane''s life forever.', 'On a warm spring day in 1924, house maid and foundling Jane Fairchild finds herself alone on Mother''s Day. Her employers, Mr. and Mrs. Niven, are out and she has the rare chance to spend quality time with her secret lover. Paul is the boy from the manor house nearby, Jane''s long-term love despite the fact that he''s engaged to be married to another woman, a childhood friend and daughter of his parents'' friends. But events that neither can foresee will change the course of Jane''s life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unZ7vPgxMTxWrpPGIkAVSqgdryv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718838'),
  ('508150286274922020', 'Motherland', 2015, 'Drama', 'Senem Tüzen, Vedat Özdemir', 'Senem Tüzen', 'Esra Bezen Bilgin, Nihal Koldaş, Fatma Kısa, Semih Aydin, Habibe Doygun, Nuriye Durkan, Selvet Uysal, Hüseyin Özdere', null, 'Nesrin is an urban, middle-class woman recovering from a divorce. She’s quit her office job, abandoned her house in Istanbul, and come to the village house of her deceased grandmother to finish a novel and live out her childhood dream of being a writer. When her conservative and increasingly unhinged mother turns up uninvited and refuses to leave, Nesrin’s writing stalls and her fantasies of village life turn bitter as the two are forced to confront the darker corners of each other’s inner worlds.', 'Nesrin is an urban, middle-class woman recovering from a divorce. She’s quit her office job, abandoned her house in Istanbul, and come to the village house of her deceased grandmother to finish a novel and live out her childhood dream of being a writer. When her conservative and increasingly unhinged mother turns up uninvited and refuses to leave, Nesrin’s writing stalls and her fantasies of village life turn bitter as the two are forced to confront the darker corners of each other’s inner worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctQhHtH1uPTGRjjbQJf58gAy8Ff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362771'),
  ('909668672221779870', 'Motherland Hotel', 1987, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Ömer Kavur, Orhan Oğuz', 'Ömer Kavur', 'Macit Koper, Şahika Tekand, Orhan Çağman, Serra Yılmaz, Osman Alyanak, Yaşar Güner, Arslan Kaçar, Cengiz Sezici', null, 'Zebercet is an obsessive man living a monotonous life in a hotel with few customers. This monotonous life changes with the arrival of a woman who does not even give her name. She stays only one night in the room she has rented and leaves the hotel to come back a week later.', 'Zebercet is an obsessive man living a monotonous life in a hotel with few customers. This monotonous life changes with the arrival of a woman who does not even give her name. She stays only one night in the room she has rented and leaves the hotel to come back a week later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5GTHLyafufhjNjiH1AIunNwuu3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96051'),
  ('700859140689781895', 'Motherless Brooklyn', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Edward Norton, Dick Pope, Adam Escott', 'Edward Norton', 'Edward Norton, Bruce Willis, Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Alec Baldwin, Willem Dafoe, Bobby Cannavale, Cherry Jones, Michael Kenneth Williams', 'R', 'New York City, 1957. Lionel Essrog, a private detective living with Tourette syndrome, tries to solve the murder of his mentor and best friend, armed only with vague clues and the strength of his obsessive mind.', 'New York City, 1957. Lionel Essrog, a private detective living with Tourette syndrome, tries to solve the murder of his mentor and best friend, armed only with vague clues and the strength of his obsessive mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wm20cbkH1L8nA54Gtwfgz2hTqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504562'),
  ('1073940903532619847', 'Motherly', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Craig David Wallace', 'Ian Malone, Craig David Wallace', 'Lora Burke, Tessa Kozma, Kristen MacCulloch, Nick Smyth, Colin Paradine, Angel Gallego, Laura Tremblay, Christina Bryson', null, 'Kate and her daughter Beth live alone in an isolated farmhouse in the woods, but when Kate slowly begins to suspect that something sinister is happening, her motherly instincts are put to the test.', 'Kate and her daughter Beth live alone in an isolated farmhouse in the woods, but when Kate slowly begins to suspect that something sinister is happening, her motherly instincts are put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmh1likQEetSLIUs5MAvfWjEayY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768447'),
  ('779783751255081812', 'Mothernet', 2026, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Ho Wi-ding, Teck Siang Lim, Daphne, Rifky Esa Syahnarki, William Ezekiel Rasher, Ho Wi Ding', 'Gina S. Noer, Melarissa Sjarief', 'Ali Fikry, Ringgo Agus Rahman, Aisha Nurra Datau, Bima Sena, Dhea Seto', 'TV-14', 'The relationship between Rama, a boy going through a tumultuous adolescence, and an artificial intelligence. In the near future, in a happy family on the outskirts of a big city, Rama''s mother accidently falls into a coma. As she is Rama''s entire world of care and understanding, he joins forces with a hacker friend to create an AI that learns from his mother''s online footprint.', 'The relationship between Rama, a boy going through a tumultuous adolescence, and an artificial intelligence. In the near future, in a happy family on the outskirts of a big city, Rama''s mother accidently falls into a coma. As she is Rama''s entire world of care and understanding, he joins forces with a hacker friend to create an AI that learns from his mother''s online footprint.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fi0n7MDDpXInmk31Sbf4w1482ixf.jpg', 'plex:movie:mothernet'),
  ('37333077414751804', 'Mothers', 2018, 'Drama', 'Lee Dong-eun, Sung Seung-taek, Kim Han-ul', 'Lee Dong-eun', 'Lim Soo-jung, Yoon Chan-young, Lee Sang-hee, Oh Mi-yeon, Seo Shin-ae, Han Joo-wan, Kim Sun-young, Seo Jeong-yeon', null, 'The owner of a student study center gets an awkward request and suddenly faces the prospect of raising her dead husband''s teenage son by herself.', 'The owner of a student study center gets an awkward request and suddenly faces the prospect of raising her dead husband''s teenage son by herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBE1CzWIqid5G6Kf8psBG6gIvRi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475153'),
  ('93675650451331275', 'Mothers and Daughters', 2016, 'Drama', 'Nigel Levy, Paul Duddridge, Jon Carr', 'Paul Duddridge', 'Selma Blair, Christina Ricci, Courteney Cox, Susan Sarandon, Eva Amurri, Sharon Stone, Mira Sorvino, Paul Wesley', 'PG-13', 'Interwoven stories of what it is to be a mom seen through the lens of photographer Rigby Gray.', 'Interwoven stories of what it is to be a mom seen through the lens of photographer Rigby Gray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hC5ngzkPsvZfswojtc3WskO4SPm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109453'),
  ('740834511919704885', 'Mothers'' Instinct', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Olivier Masset-Depasse, Hichame Alaouié', 'Olivier Masset-Depasse, Giordano Gederlini', 'Veerle Baetens, Anne Coesens, Mehdi Nebbou, Arieh Worthalter, Jules Lefebvre, Luan Adam, Annick Blancheteau, Eveline Delfosse', null, 'When a sudden tragedy uproots the lives of two women and their families, they begin to question the relationships they once held so dear.', 'When a sudden tragedy uproots the lives of two women and their families, they begin to question the relationships they once held so dear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DQP8vQamep9MGCMfH3u7NlyREN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477072'),
  ('866646198512016831', 'Mothers'' Instinct', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Benoît Delhomme, Molly Bernitz, John Wayne Marshall', 'Sarah Conradt', 'Anne Hathaway, Jessica Chastain, Anders Danielsen Lie, Josh Charles, Caroline Lagerfelt, Alexander Blaise, Steve Routman, Joel Nagle', 'R', 'Housewives Alice and Celine are best friends and neighbours who seem to have it all. However, when a tragic accident shatters the harmony of their lives, guilt, suspicion and paranoia begin to unravel their sisterly bond.', 'Housewives Alice and Celine are best friends and neighbours who seem to have it all. However, when a tragic accident shatters the harmony of their lives, guilt, suspicion and paranoia begin to unravel their sisterly bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EtPToJlGpjyuIxkIoztnBXYFgJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758679'),
  ('54625190089080256', 'Mothlight', 1963, 'Animation', 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'Seemingly at random, the wings and other bits of moths and insects move rapidly across the screen. Most are brown or sepia; up close, we can see patterns within wings, similar to the veins in a leaf. Sometimes the images look like paper cutouts, like Matisse. Green objects occasionally appear. Most wings are translucent. The technique makes them appear to be stuck directly to the film.', 'Seemingly at random, the wings and other bits of moths and insects move rapidly across the screen. Most are brown or sepia; up close, we can see patterns within wings, similar to the veins in a leaf. Sometimes the images look like paper cutouts, like Matisse. Green objects occasionally appear. Most wings are translucent. The technique makes them appear to be stuck directly to the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6njz1aa3pkaPzoXjww9nwSHoX9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97514'),
  ('236303253230360885', 'Mothra', 1961, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Ishirō Honda, Hajime Koizumi, Teruyoshi Nakano', 'Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Frankie Sakai, Hiroshi Koizumi, Kyōko Kagawa, Jerry Itō, Ken Uehara, Emi Ito, Yumi Ito, Takashi Shimura', null, 'Shipwreck survivors found on the presumably uninhabited Infant Island leads to a scientific expedition that discovers a surviving native population along with the Shobijin, tiny twin fairy priestesses of the island''s mythical deity called Mothra. After the fairies are kidnapped by an exploitative businessman named Clark Nelson, Mothra sets out to rescue them.', 'Shipwreck survivors found on the presumably uninhabited Infant Island leads to a scientific expedition that discovers a surviving native population along with the Shobijin, tiny twin fairy priestesses of the island''s mythical deity called Mothra. After the fairies are kidnapped by an exploitative businessman named Clark Nelson, Mothra sets out to rescue them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6Xuovau8elLM6hGc5g1gMzjmWK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39410'),
  ('1110515327315523865', 'Mothra vs. Godzilla', 1964, 'Drama, Action, Science Fiction', 'Ishirō Honda, Hajime Koizumi, Teruyoshi Nakano', 'Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Akira Takarada, Yuriko Hoshi, Hiroshi Koizumi, Yū Fujiki, Kenji Sahara, Emi Ito, Yumi Ito, Jun Tazaki', 'NR', 'Journalists Ichiro Sakai and Junko cover the wreckage of a typhoon when an enormous egg is found and claimed by greedy entrepreneurs. Mothra''s fairies arrive and are aided by the journalists in a plea for its return. As their requests are denied, Godzilla arises near Nagoya and the people of Infant Island must decide if they are willing to answer Japan''s own pleas for help.', 'Journalists Ichiro Sakai and Junko cover the wreckage of a typhoon when an enormous egg is found and claimed by greedy entrepreneurs. Mothra''s fairies arrive and are aided by the journalists in a plea for its return. As their requests are denied, Godzilla arises near Nagoya and the people of Infant Island must decide if they are willing to answer Japan''s own pleas for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y49vvM03gpuyhpyMc1f55VrNkP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1682'),
  ('524811181242987908', 'Motichoor Chaknachoor', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Debamitra Biswal', 'Debamitra Biswal', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Athiya Shetty, Vibha Chibber, Abhishek Rawat, Devanshu Singh, Karuna Pandey, Navni Parihar, Vivek Mishra', null, 'A woman whose single purpose in life is to marry a foreign-settled groom decides to marry a 36-year-old Dubai-returned professional who is desperate for a bride.', 'A woman whose single purpose in life is to marry a foreign-settled groom decides to marry a 36-year-old Dubai-returned professional who is desperate for a bride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9viHDkVC1Xl08jmau6ikudz7eH8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643438'),
  ('89328551846333630', 'Motion Painting No. 1', 1947, 'Animation', 'Oskar Fischinger', null, null, null, 'Motion Painting No. 1 is a 1947 experimental short animated film in which film artist Oskar Fischinger put images in motion to the music of Johann Sebastian Bach’s Brandenburg Concerto no. 3, BWV 1048. It is a film of a painting (oil on acrylic glass); Fischinger filmed each brushstroke over the course of 9 months. In 1997, this film was selected for inclusion in the United States National Film Registry by the Library of Congress as being “culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant”. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2000.', 'Motion Painting No. 1 is a 1947 experimental short animated film in which film artist Oskar Fischinger put images in motion to the music of Johann Sebastian Bach’s Brandenburg Concerto no. 3, BWV 1048. It is a film of a painting (oil on acrylic glass); Fischinger filmed each brushstroke over the course of 9 months. In 1997, this film was selected for inclusion in the United States National Film Registry by the Library of Congress as being “culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant”. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YqpdMxsDDJygfVlzLPPq9FLt8d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144674'),
  ('890555331242631323', 'Motion Picture (Employees Leaving the Lumière Factory)', 1984, 'Documentary', 'Peter Tscherkassky, Peter Tscherkassky', 'Peter Tscherkassky', null, null, 'In the darkroom, 50 unexposed film strips were laid across a surface, upon which a frame of "La sortie des ouvrier de l''usine Lumière" was projected. The stringing together of the individual developed sections make up the new film, which reads the original frame like a page from a musical score: within the strips from top to bottom and sequentially from left to right.', 'In the darkroom, 50 unexposed film strips were laid across a surface, upon which a frame of "La sortie des ouvrier de l''usine Lumière" was projected. The stringing together of the individual developed sections make up the new film, which reads the original frame like a page from a musical score: within the strips from top to bottom and sequentially from left to right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiF5gZwA4yrD52I4GwKcCIADyaA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201633'),
  ('937108170749774764', 'Motivational Speaker', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cacala Carvana, Marcelo Brasil, Bianca Paranhos', 'Fábio Porchat, Cláudia Jouvin', 'Fábio Porchat, Dani Calabresa, Antonio Tabet, Otávio Müller, Paulo Vieira, Miá Mello, Maria Clara Gueiros, Rodrigo Pandolfo', null, 'A man who has no direction in life is mistaken for a famous motivational speaker. As he takes his place, he will try to find a reason to live.', 'A man who has no direction in life is mistaken for a famous motivational speaker. As he takes his place, he will try to find a reason to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMuCfqBlaHaxTD2eIK1IyhQlXUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760167'),
  ('343327031900137112', 'Moto Guzzi', 2011, 'Drama', 'Özgür Eken, Özcan Alper', 'Hasan Özkilic', 'Alican Tamet, Demet Tarım, Şebnem Köstem, Zarif Tamet, Yaşar Öztürk, Gülbanu Polat, Ali Uluoğlu, Faruk Demir', null, 'Yusuf, 12, lives in the Digor district of Kars and goes to school every day by bicycle. Although it takes a long time, this trip gives him the opportunity to see Leyla, a girl he particularly likes, for a brief moment each morning.', 'Yusuf, 12, lives in the Digor district of Kars and goes to school every day by bicycle. Although it takes a long time, this trip gives him the opportunity to see Leyla, a girl he particularly likes, for a brief moment each morning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mN03Dj4XzLCs4vlQs7lrQBlSTmA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681505'),
  ('8768458677035112', 'Motocrossed!', 2001, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Steve Boyum, Dennis Maguire, Nicole Burke', 'Douglas Sloan, Ann Austen', 'Alana Austin, Riley Smith, Timothy Carhart, Trever O''Brien, Scott Terra, Mark Curry, Mary-Margaret Humes, A.J. Buckley', 'G', 'Teenage Andrea Carson who loves motocross, despite her father finding her unsuited for the sport, being that she is "just a girl". When her twin brother Andrew breaks his leg just before a big race, their father is forced to go to Europe to find a replacement rider. In the meantime, Andrea secretly races in Andrew''s place with her mother''s help.', 'Teenage Andrea Carson who loves motocross, despite her father finding her unsuited for the sport, being that she is "just a girl". When her twin brother Andrew breaks his leg just before a big race, their father is forced to go to Europe to find a replacement rider. In the meantime, Andrea secretly races in Andrew''s place with her mother''s help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Us6BhiUfqfenFF7NjouXG81guK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71885'),
  ('17668503634001032', 'Motor Mania', 1950, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'John McLeish, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Mild-mannered average guy Mr. Walker (Goofy) turns into violent Mr. Wheeler when he starts driving. Back on his feet, Mr. Walker finds it nearly impossible to cross the street.', 'Mild-mannered average guy Mr. Walker (Goofy) turns into violent Mr. Wheeler when he starts driving. Back on his feet, Mr. Walker finds it nearly impossible to cross the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXBGAQ06ZH75Cg8DcyA8IIuykG7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67129'),
  ('52411957074042955', 'Motorama', 1991, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Barry Shils, Richard S. Lederer, Mark Parry', 'Joseph Minion', 'Jordan Christopher Michael, Martha Quinn, Michael Naegel, Susan Tyrrell, Harper Flaherty, John Laughlin, Kurt Bryant, John Diehl', 'R', 'A ten year old boy gets tired of life with abusive parents and cashes in his piggy bank and steals a Mustang. He rides off into a surreal America playing "Motorama," a game sponsored by Chimera Gas Company. He has various encounters with different people, and eventually reaches the Chimera Gas Company where he finds they are not playing by the rules of the game.', 'A ten year old boy gets tired of life with abusive parents and cashes in his piggy bank and steals a Mustang. He rides off into a surreal America playing "Motorama," a game sponsored by Chimera Gas Company. He has various encounters with different people, and eventually reaches the Chimera Gas Company where he finds they are not playing by the rules of the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/158yiojjP5YxoCkTLcznXeccxUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49410'),
  ('357358745450476605', 'Motorpsycho!', 1965, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Russ Meyer, Russ Meyer, George Costello', 'Ross Massbaum', 'Haji, Alex Rocco, Steve Oliver, Lane Carroll, Joseph Cellini, Timothy Scott, Coleman Francis, Sharon Lee', null, 'A vengeful veterinarian and a grieving widow join forces to track down violent bikers after they commit heinous acts against their loved ones.', 'A vengeful veterinarian and a grieving widow join forces to track down violent bikers after they commit heinous acts against their loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heY0wmKY4Qg6GtaCiWJ40HkIh69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5720'),
  ('614619079734133917', 'Motorrad', 2017, 'Thriller, Horror, Action', 'Marina Watson-Wood, Vicente Amorim', null, 'Guilherme Prates, Carla Salle, Emílio Dantas, Pablo Sanábio, Juliana Lohmann, Rodrigo Vidigal, Alex Nader, Jayme del Cueto', null, 'A gang of young dirt bikers on a ride across an isolated region of Brazil find themselves being hunted by a machete wielding band of motorcyclists intent on killing them all.', 'A gang of young dirt bikers on a ride across an isolated region of Brazil find themselves being hunted by a machete wielding band of motorcyclists intent on killing them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vynBfERmWQg7cheSdw5enGrOEYp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471445'),
  ('5432675950441349', 'Motorway', 2012, 'Action, Crime', 'Cheang Pou-Soi, Edmond Fung Yuen-Man, Chin Ka-Lok', 'Szeto Kam-Yuen, Joey O''Bryan', 'Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Barbie Hsu, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Michelle Ye Xuan, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Josie Ho, Guo Xiaodong, Li Guangjie', null, 'Two police pursuit drivers, a hothead rookie and his long-suffering, almost-retired mentor, face off against an escape car driver from the latter''s past.', 'Two police pursuit drivers, a hothead rookie and his long-suffering, almost-retired mentor, face off against an escape car driver from the latter''s past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOVVvQueSUkoV8tV2btxMeEAHmA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117506'),
  ('440790690146906462', 'Motown 25: Yesterday, Today, Forever', 1983, 'Music, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Don Mischer', 'Buz Kohan, Suzanne de Passe, Ruth Adkins Robinson', 'Richard Pryor, Adam Ant, Nick Ashford, Renaldo Benson, Cindy Birdsong, Dick Clark, Bunny DeBarge, El DeBarge', null, 'Television special taped before a live studio audience at the Pasadena Civic Auditorium in Pasadena, California on March 25, 1983, and broadcast on NBC on May 16. Highlights include Michael Jackson''s performance of "Billie Jean", a Temptations/Four Tops "battle of the bands", Marvin Gaye''s inspired speech about black music history and his memorable performance of "What''s Going On", and a Jackson 5 reunion. This performance is noted for Michael Jackson debuting his signature moonwalk.', 'Television special taped before a live studio audience at the Pasadena Civic Auditorium in Pasadena, California on March 25, 1983, and broadcast on NBC on May 16. Highlights include Michael Jackson''s performance of "Billie Jean", a Temptations/Four Tops "battle of the bands", Marvin Gaye''s inspired speech about black music history and his memorable performance of "What''s Going On", and a Jackson 5 reunion. This performance is noted for Michael Jackson debuting his signature moonwalk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ysAaNILIG0XTYu36QtvZYuUioM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68647'),
  ('297606371367753826', 'Mouchette', 1967, 'Drama', 'Robert Bresson, Ghislain Cloquet, Jacques Kébadian', 'Robert Bresson', 'Nadine Nortier, Jean-Claude Guilbert, Marie Cardinal, Paul Hébert, Jean Vimenet, Marie Susini, Marine Trichet, Liliane Princet', 'NR', 'A young girl living in the French countryside suffers constant indignities at the hand of alcoholism and her fellow man.', 'A young girl living in the French countryside suffers constant indignities at the hand of alcoholism and her fellow man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cITZsSQ7VG122xQ0xAN3NHZF0OH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1561'),
  ('999873309447375498', 'Moulin Rouge', 1928, 'Music, Drama', 'E.A. Dupont, Werner Brandes', 'E.A. Dupont', 'Olga Tschechowa, Eve Gray, Jean Bradin, Georges Tréville, Marcel Vibert, Blanche Bernis, Ellen Pollock, Ray Milland', null, 'An odd and tightly directed tale of a singer/dancer at the Moulin Rouge, who meets her daughter''s fiance, only to have him fall obsessively in love with her and she with him. Alienation, betrayal and near tragedy result.', 'An odd and tightly directed tale of a singer/dancer at the Moulin Rouge, who meets her daughter''s fiance, only to have him fall obsessively in love with her and she with him. Alienation, betrayal and near tragedy result.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43dyUPAudmio77g51em8tMMxsij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191461'),
  ('521126502740091128', 'Moulin Rouge', 1952, 'Drama', 'John Huston, Oswald Morris, Lambert Williamson', 'John Huston, Anthony Veiller', 'José Ferrer, Zsa Zsa Gabor, Colette Marchand, Suzanne Flon, Claude Nollier, Katherine Kath, Muriel Smith, Mary Clare', 'NR', 'In 1890 Paris, Moulin Rouge is a nightclub where crippled artist Toulouse-Lautrec feels like he fits in. In the following years, he meets two women who provide an opportunity for him to find true love.', 'In 1890 Paris, Moulin Rouge is a nightclub where crippled artist Toulouse-Lautrec feels like he fits in. In the following years, he meets two women who provide an opportunity for him to find true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTPcjDqJnimppXYwDcLScKCJTnI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10910'),
  ('36522943573770356', 'Moulin Rouge!', 2001, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Baz Luhrmann, Donald McAlpine, Deborah Antoniou', 'Baz Luhrmann, Craig Pearce', 'Ewan McGregor, Nicole Kidman, John Leguizamo, Jim Broadbent, Richard Roxburgh, Garry McDonald, Jacek Koman, Matthew Whittet', 'PG-13', 'A celebration of love and creative inspiration takes place in the infamous, gaudy and glamorous Parisian nightclub, at the cusp of the 20th century. A young poet, who is plunged into the heady world of Moulin Rouge, begins a passionate affair with the club''s most notorious and beautiful star.', 'A celebration of love and creative inspiration takes place in the infamous, gaudy and glamorous Parisian nightclub, at the cusp of the 20th century. A young poet, who is plunged into the heady world of Moulin Rouge, begins a passionate affair with the club''s most notorious and beautiful star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kjM5CUZRIU5yOANUowrbJcRL9L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:824'),
  ('843172911181409128', 'Mouna Raagam', 1986, 'Romance, Drama', 'P. C. Sreeram, Mani Ratnam', 'Mani Ratnam', 'Revathi, Mohan, Karthik Muthuraman, V. K. Ramasamy, Ra. Sankaran, Rani Patel, Kanchana, Vani', null, 'Divya, a college student, is forced to marry Chandrakumar due to family pressure. However, she asks for a divorce as a wedding gift, revealing her past.', 'Divya, a college student, is forced to marry Chandrakumar due to family pressure. However, she asks for a divorce as a wedding gift, revealing her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXy8bx56Fx53sxozHubeLLDItF7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82124'),
  ('396596216265825022', 'Mounam Pesiyadhe', 2002, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ameer, Ramji', 'Ameer', 'Suriya, Trisha Krishnan, Nandha, Neha Pendse, Laila, Vidharth', null, 'Gautham, who runs a restaurant, falls in love with his friend Kannan''s cousin, Sandhya. Problems arise when Gautham learns that Kannan''s parents want Kannan to marry Sandhya.', 'Gautham, who runs a restaurant, falls in love with his friend Kannan''s cousin, Sandhya. Problems arise when Gautham learns that Kannan''s parents want Kannan to marry Sandhya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvgnteJqmaxIyyaJrZuoRhYi5kb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111583'),
  ('544676758097555715', 'Mount Hakkoda', 1977, 'Drama, History', 'Shirō Moritani, Seijiro Koyama, Daisaku Kimura', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Ken Takakura, Hideji Ōtaki, Kinya Kitaoji, Tetsuro Tamba, Rentaro Mikuni, Komaki Kurihara, Akira Hamada, Mariko Kaga', null, 'Two infantry regiments of the Imperial Japanese Army—210 men overall—tackled Mt. Hakkoda in the winter of 1902 to prepare for war with Russia.', 'Two infantry regiments of the Imperial Japanese Army—210 men overall—tackled Mt. Hakkoda in the winter of 1902 to prepare for war with Russia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1solwae6RKtIL2eP8AOjTqSJOBk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129380'),
  ('996844336772887740', 'Mount Head', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Koji Yamamura', 'Shouji Yonemura', 'Takeharu Kunimoto', null, 'A miserly man eats the pits of some cherries he can''t stand throwing out. A tree starts growing from the top of his head. He cuts it off; it grows back. After a while, he gives up and lets it grow, but the crowds that gather on top of his head to enjoy the tree (and leave huge mounds of trash) eventually drive him to uproot the tree. This leaves a crater on top of his head, which fills with water, which becomes a popular lake.', 'A miserly man eats the pits of some cherries he can''t stand throwing out. A tree starts growing from the top of his head. He cuts it off; it grows back. After a while, he gives up and lets it grow, but the crowds that gather on top of his head to enjoy the tree (and leave huge mounds of trash) eventually drive him to uproot the tree. This leaves a crater on top of his head, which fills with water, which becomes a popular lake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBy8mvgjcuTiAri2FNcvNe4I5V7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36072'),
  ('319697447013922847', 'Mountain', 2015, 'Drama', 'João Salaviza, Vasco Viana, Renée Nader Messora', 'João Salaviza', 'David Mourato, Cheyenne Domingues, Ana Cris, Mia Tomé, Rodrigo Perdigão, Carloto Cotta, Maria João Pinho', null, 'Day breaks on the eighth floor in a suburban neighbourhood of Lisbon and 14-year-old David’s grandfather is still in hospital. Doctors give him only a few days to live. The imminence of death and the void that it will leave force David to become the man of the house, where he lives with his mother Mónica, who is in her 30s, and his three-year-old sister.', 'Day breaks on the eighth floor in a suburban neighbourhood of Lisbon and 14-year-old David’s grandfather is still in hospital. Doctors give him only a few days to live. The imminence of death and the void that it will leave force David to become the man of the house, where he lives with his mother Mónica, who is in her 30s, and his three-year-old sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dx4GXlVNXG6qG8Ih5UpjjU53Ogl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310630'),
  ('579103863039142344', 'Mountain', 2016, 'Drama', 'Amir Naderi, Roberto Cimatti', 'Amir Naderi', 'Andrea Sartoretti, Claudia Potenza, Zaccaria Zanghellini, Marco Boriero', null, 'Many years ago, in a nearly deserted town at the foot of a mountain, lives Agostino with his wife Nina and his son Giovanni. The mountain rises up like a wall blocking out the sun that never reaches their fields below, now reduced to just stones and underbrush. Agostino, even though everything suggests him to leave, decides that the destiny of his family is there, among the peaks. He is not only driven by stubbornness, but by the certainty that our roots cannot betray us and that with the help of our spirit we can bring the sun on every destiny.', 'Many years ago, in a nearly deserted town at the foot of a mountain, lives Agostino with his wife Nina and his son Giovanni. The mountain rises up like a wall blocking out the sun that never reaches their fields below, now reduced to just stones and underbrush. Agostino, even though everything suggests him to leave, decides that the destiny of his family is there, among the peaks. He is not only driven by stubbornness, but by the certainty that our roots cannot betray us and that with the help of our spirit we can bring the sun on every destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSkYfLN640wAFIA5aBnX3NbFy5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413040'),
  ('17301991897997804', 'Mountain', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Jennifer Peedom, Renan Öztürk', 'Jennifer Peedom, Robert Macfarlane', 'Willem Dafoe', 'PG', 'An epic cinematic and musical collaboration between SHERPA filmmaker Jennifer Peedom and the Australian Chamber Orchestra, that explores humankind''s fascination with high places.', 'An epic cinematic and musical collaboration between SHERPA filmmaker Jennifer Peedom and the Australian Chamber Orchestra, that explores humankind''s fascination with high places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngqSU3NpsVIGIHIqeqrPSZai2lC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462145'),
  ('1102755006755376010', 'Mountain Cry', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Larry Yang, Patrick Murguia', 'Larry Yang', 'Lang Yueting, Wang Ziyi, Yu Ailei, Cheng Taishen, Xu Caigen, Zhao Chendong, Guo Jin', null, 'The tight-knight community of a remote mountain village come to know and understand a strange, mute woman''s past in the wake of her husband''s death.', 'The tight-knight community of a remote mountain village come to know and understand a strange, mute woman''s past in the wake of her husband''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGxGDfzwdiUtuqRNCYX8zzNgYs2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385735'),
  ('437624220401040068', 'Mountain in Shadow', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Lois Patiño, Lois Patiño', null, null, null, 'A poetic view into the relationship of immensity between man and landscape. We contemplate, from the distance, the activity of the skiers on the snowy mountain. The pictorial image and the dark and dreamlike atmosphere transforms the space into something unreal, imprecise, converting it also in a spectral presence.', 'A poetic view into the relationship of immensity between man and landscape. We contemplate, from the distance, the activity of the skiers on the snowy mountain. The pictorial image and the dark and dreamlike atmosphere transforms the space into something unreal, imprecise, converting it also in a spectral presence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45se7tBfcUdZgROdZtKQz3uaLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226564'),
  ('579774581315498850', 'Mountain Men', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cameron Labine, Catherine Lutes', 'Cameron Labine', 'Chace Crawford, Tyler Labine, Christine Willes, Britt Irvin, Ben Cotton, Paralee Cook, Carrie Ruscheinsky, Rob Lamont', null, 'Two estranged brothers, Toph and Cooper, must journey to a remote family cabin in the mountains to evict a squatter. Buried resentment and bruised egos soon derail the plan and when the smoke clears they''ve destroyed their car and burned down the cabin, leaving them stranded in the cold Rocky Mountain winter. With their very survival at stake, they must learn to work together as brothers to get back to civilization.', 'Two estranged brothers, Toph and Cooper, must journey to a remote family cabin in the mountains to evict a squatter. Buried resentment and bruised egos soon derail the plan and when the smoke clears they''ve destroyed their car and burned down the cabin, leaving them stranded in the cold Rocky Mountain winter. With their very survival at stake, they must learn to work together as brothers to get back to civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBgzu6P52dk6WcCCNrn882nLcxl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309050'),
  ('789561042463993477', 'Mountain Miracle', 2017, 'Family, Adventure', 'Tobias Wiemann, Martin Schlecht', 'Natja Brunckhorst', 'Mia Kasalo, Samuel Girardi, Susanne Bormann, Denis Moschitto, Jasmin Tabatabai, Jerry Hoffmann, David Bredin, Christian Lerch', null, 'A girl struggling with asthma is taken to a clinic in South Tyrol to be cured. After some time she decides to get out of this hell (that''s how she feels about it) and soon she''ll meet a new friend. Together they try to reach the peak of a mountain where, according to an old custom, she can be healed.', 'A girl struggling with asthma is taken to a clinic in South Tyrol to be cured. After some time she decides to get out of this hell (that''s how she feels about it) and soon she''ll meet a new friend. Together they try to reach the peak of a mountain where, according to an old custom, she can be healed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f46ZJBN8RxdqKW6UqGIkJGT7hRB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433763'),
  ('62660496613272873', 'Mountain of Diamonds', 1991, 'Adventure, TV Movie', 'Jeannot Szwarc', null, 'Isabelle Gélinas, Derek de Lint, Jason Connery, John Savage, Valerie Perrine, Jennifer Youngs, Jenny Alpha, Marina Vlady', null, 'France, 1915. Young and radiantly beautiful Centaine de Thiry is the happiest woman in the world: in a few more hours she will be married to pilot Michael Courteney, the love of her life. But fate has it otherwise: Michael is shot down in a reconnaissance plane shortly before his wedding. Life has lost its meaning for Centaine. When the young woman realizes soon afterwards that she is expecting a baby, her zest for live is revived. She decides to give birth to the child in South Africa, the home country of her deceased fiancé.', 'France, 1915. Young and radiantly beautiful Centaine de Thiry is the happiest woman in the world: in a few more hours she will be married to pilot Michael Courteney, the love of her life. But fate has it otherwise: Michael is shot down in a reconnaissance plane shortly before his wedding. Life has lost its meaning for Centaine. When the young woman realizes soon afterwards that she is expecting a baby, her zest for live is revived. She decides to give birth to the child in South Africa, the home country of her deceased fiancé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujpT5y1K7jXYLnYmW6e1QAAZlPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201931'),
  ('754498125340705056', 'Mountain Pass', 1978, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-François Stévenin, Jean-Yves Escoffier, Lionel Legros', 'Michel Delahaye, Jean-François Stévenin', 'Jean-François Stévenin, Jacques Villeret, Yves Le Moign, André Riva, Texandre Barberat, Christine Pâris, Jean-François Balmer', null, 'Serge (Stevenin) is a dweller in the French provinces who happens upon Georges (Jacques Villeret), a Parisian motorist in distress. Serge arranges for the car to be taken to a nearby garage. Georges'' friends, who were with him in the car, have continued their journeys. Because of that, Serge takes Georges under his wings while he waits for his car to be repaired, and they tour the countryside and party with the local revelers. Nothing much is said between them, but it is clear that they have become friends', 'Serge (Stevenin) is a dweller in the French provinces who happens upon Georges (Jacques Villeret), a Parisian motorist in distress. Serge arranges for the car to be taken to a nearby garage. Georges'' friends, who were with him in the car, have continued their journeys. Because of that, Serge takes Georges under his wings while he waits for his car to be repaired, and they tour the countryside and party with the local revelers. Nothing much is said between them, but it is clear that they have become friends', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbnhxk3uZqqdEP0NsfMu5NTUzhj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134235'),
  ('723047651190677972', 'Mountain Patrol', 2004, 'Action, Drama', 'Lu Chuan, Cao Yu', 'Lu Chuan', 'Duobujie, Zhang Lei, Qi Dao, Zhao Xueying, Ma Zhanlin', 'PG-13', 'A moving true story about volunteers protecting antelope against poachers in the severe mountains of Tibet.', 'A moving true story about volunteers protecting antelope against poachers in the severe mountains of Tibet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPwpHuwvKthGXD0VXwCnPdUfpZn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16074'),
  ('204667698801151724', 'Mountain Queen: The Summits of Lhakpa Sherpa', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Devin Whetstone, Matthew Irving, Lucy Walker', null, 'Lhakpa Sherpa, Shiny Dijmarescu, Sunny Dijmarescu', 'R', 'A Nepali mountaineer risks everything on a record-breaking Mount Everest climb to secure a brighter future for her daughters.', 'A Nepali mountaineer risks everything on a record-breaking Mount Everest climb to secure a brighter future for her daughters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BK1B6JQRxnLEc4vZyrUojdIiCq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156649'),
  ('58230737564416948', 'Mountain Vigil', 1964, 'Documentary', 'Artavazd Peleshian', 'Gayane Arakelyan', null, null, 'Poetic film about the struggle of man''s will and muscles against nature, about the rock-climbers who prevent landslides and eliminate their consequences.', 'Poetic film about the struggle of man''s will and muscles against nature, about the rock-climbers who prevent landslides and eliminate their consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6FmNny5q52mfvQUWMDqcZ6EcfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183707'),
  ('838312615352489549', 'Mountainhead', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Jesse Armstrong, Marcel Zyskind, Christo Morse', 'Jesse Armstrong', 'Steve Carell, Jason Schwartzman, Cory Michael Smith, Ramy Youssef, Daniel Oreskes, Hadley Robinson, David Thompson, Ali Kinkade', 'R', 'A group of billionaire friends get together against the backdrop of a rolling international crisis.', 'A group of billionaire friends get together against the backdrop of a rolling international crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZKK5mFKWbquxhAGMkRJtNYwk0I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1417059'),
  ('636672034806274006', 'Mountains May Depart', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jia Zhangke, Nelson Yu Lik-wai, Wang Jing', 'Jia Zhangke', 'Zhao Tao, Zhang Yi, Liang Jingdong, Dong Zijian, Sylvia Chang, Rong Zishan, Liu Lu, Zhubin Li', null, 'The life of Tao, and those close to her, is explored in three different time periods: 1999, 2014, and 2025.', 'The life of Tao, and those close to her, is explored in three different time periods: 1999, 2014, and 2025.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMg4uP2Ev8lIZr1kOvHrPOM8teA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314388'),
  ('743018634481933808', 'Mountains of the Moon', 1990, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Bob Rafelson, Nick Laws, Patrick Clayton', 'William Harrison, Bob Rafelson', 'Patrick Bergin, Iain Glen, Richard E. Grant, Fiona Shaw, John Savident, James Villiers, Adrian Rawlins, Peter Vaughan', 'R', 'The story of Captain Richard Francis Burton''s and Lt. John Hanning Speke''s expedition to find the source of the Nile river in the name of Queen Victoria''s British Empire.', 'The story of Captain Richard Francis Burton''s and Lt. John Hanning Speke''s expedition to find the source of the Nile river in the name of Queen Victoria''s British Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWWrigxf4yU1WmaTkxg3qYNMezG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33796'),
  ('57779839413207396', 'Mountaintop Motel Massacre', 1983, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jim McCullough Sr., Joseph M. Wilcots', 'Jim McCullough Jr.', 'Anna Chappell, Bill Thurman, Will Mitchel, Virginia Loridans, Major Brock, James Bradford, Amy Hill, Maria Jones', 'R', 'After several years in an insane asylum, Evelyn, the keeper of the Mountaintop Motel, is released and resumes doing business. She kills her young charge out of anger, but convinces the police it was an accident - and pushed into insanity, she then proceeds to target her guests, first by releasing vermin into their rooms, but then by using her trusty sickle.', 'After several years in an insane asylum, Evelyn, the keeper of the Mountaintop Motel, is released and resumes doing business. She kills her young charge out of anger, but convinces the police it was an accident - and pushed into insanity, she then proceeds to target her guests, first by releasing vermin into their rooms, but then by using her trusty sickle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMVOZtHLfNcaTMNtU4EIs3ECszv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29600'),
  ('950437221536615709', 'Mournful Unconcern', 1987, 'Drama', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Sergey Yurizditskiy', 'George Bernard Shaw, Yuriy Arabov', 'Ramaz Chkhikvadze, Alla Osipenko, Dmitry Bryantsev, Tatiana Yegorova, Irina Sokolova, Vladimir Zamanskiy, Tatiana Yegorova, Vadim Zhuk', null, 'The action in this lavishly produced film takes place at an oddly ark-shaped mansion during World War I, and in spirit (although not in story) it reflects the play which inspired it, the ferociously antiwar Heartbreak House by George Bernard Shaw. A large group of family and friends have gathered at this country house to dance, drink, and converse. Their conversation, in particular, is adorned with erudite literary references and quotations. Despite their apparent refinement, their preoccupations are simple: sex and violence. Disquieting images break the tranquility of the vacationers'' inappropriate idyll: some of these include documentary footage of starving African children, images (both real and re-enacted) of George Bernard Shaw going about his daily life, and a corpse coming to life on an autopsy table, only to cheapen that miracle by scolding a group of women. The music used in the film ironically points to its disturbing message and is uniformly anachronistic.', 'The action in this lavishly produced film takes place at an oddly ark-shaped mansion during World War I, and in spirit (although not in story) it reflects the play which inspired it, the ferociously antiwar Heartbreak House by George Bernard Shaw. A large group of family and friends have gathered at this country house to dance, drink, and converse. Their conversation, in particular, is adorned with erudite literary references and quotations. Despite their apparent refinement, their preoccupations are simple: sex and violence. Disquieting images break the tranquility of the vacationers'' inappropriate idyll: some of these include documentary footage of starving African children, images (both real and re-enacted) of George Bernard Shaw going about his daily life, and a corpse coming to life on an autopsy table, only to cheapen that miracle by scolding a group of women. The music used in the film ironically points to its disturbing message and is uniformly anachronistic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7v5xSNMmiG9lZ0ruzqXkp77hxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157751'),
  ('411074246487630446', 'Mourning Becomes Electra', 1947, 'Drama', 'Dudley Nichols, George Barnes, Harry Mancke', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Rosalind Russell, Michael Redgrave, Raymond Massey, Katina Paxinou, Kirk Douglas, Leo Genn, Nancy Coleman, Henry Hull', 'NR', 'Near the end of the Civil War, the proud residents of Mannon Manor await the return of shipping tycoon Ezra Mannon and son Orin. Meanwhile Ezra’s conniving wife Christine and daughter Lavinia vie for the love of a handsome captain with a dark secret while well-meaning neighbor Peter sets his sights on Lavinia.', 'Near the end of the Civil War, the proud residents of Mannon Manor await the return of shipping tycoon Ezra Mannon and son Orin. Meanwhile Ezra’s conniving wife Christine and daughter Lavinia vie for the love of a handsome captain with a dark secret while well-meaning neighbor Peter sets his sights on Lavinia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xetaaQQDF84PQ7Hs57U31EuMPil.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82101'),
  ('531338548046945898', 'Mourning Grave', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Kang Dae-hui, Oh In-chun, Yoon Jung-jin', 'Lee Jong-ho', 'Kang Ha-neul, Kim So-eun, Kim Jung-tae, Park Doo-sik, Han Hye-rin, Kwak Jung-wook, Yoon Chan-young, Joo Ah-reum', null, 'A boy who can see ghosts moves to a small town, where he befriends a female ghost. The two work together to investigate a masked ghost who is murdering students one by one.', 'A boy who can see ghosts moves to a small town, where he befriends a female ghost. The two work together to investigate a masked ghost who is murdering students one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etX8PQrO0lak1WXhlBmiJh15CdY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284063'),
  ('5037924049663225', 'Mousa', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Peter Mimi, Ahmed Saoudi, Kareem Ismael', 'Peter Mimi', 'Karim Mahmoud Abdel Aziz, Eyad Nassar, Asmaa Aboul Yazeed, Sabry Fawaz, Mohammad Lotfi, Mahmoud Hafez, Sarah Elshamy, Ahmed Hatem', null, 'An engineering college student invents the first of its kind robot in the Middle East, in an attempt to avenge his father''s death and achieve justice, which gets him pursued by the authorities.', 'An engineering college student invents the first of its kind robot in the Middle East, in an attempt to avenge his father''s death and achieve justice, which gets him pursued by the authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MO3nkwF8dbsz7dC5rGZuP3m3RS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:775244'),
  ('1074772229549545960', 'Mouse', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alex Thompson, Kelly O''Sullivan', 'Kelly O''Sullivan', 'Katherine Mallen Kupferer, Chloe Coleman, Sophie Okonedo, Tara Mallen, Iman Vellani', null, 'Callie and Minnie’s relationship is suddenly upended at the start of the summer before their senior year of high school. Left rudderless without her charismatic best friend, Minnie starts to form a complicated friendship with Callie’s mother.', 'Callie and Minnie’s relationship is suddenly upended at the start of the summer before their senior year of high school. Left rudderless without her charismatic best friend, Minnie starts to form a complicated friendship with Callie’s mother.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F8kHEN92m0wSbj8gYpG42Tt7cQJJ.jpg', 'plex:movie:mouse-2026'),
  ('159529657030304816', 'Mouse and Garden', 1960, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Daws Butler', null, 'Sylvester Cat and his orange feline friend, Sam, are rummaging through trash cans for food in the evening on a waterfront when they spot a mouse. They agree to share the little rodent for breakfast the next morning, while during the night each tries to snag the mouse for himself.', 'Sylvester Cat and his orange feline friend, Sam, are rummaging through trash cans for food in the evening on a waterfront when they spot a mouse. They agree to share the little rodent for breakfast the next morning, while during the night each tries to snag the mouse for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJ4vc3kqtIhHAx9QYgHvyi93f72.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234760'),
  ('685741992865720363', 'Mouse Cleaning', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Lillian Randolph, William Hanna', 'NR', 'Mammy Two-Shoes threatens to throw Tom out of the house if he makes a mess. Jerry sees an opportunity to rid himself of his feline nemesis.', 'Mammy Two-Shoes threatens to throw Tom out of the house if he makes a mess. Jerry sees an opportunity to rid himself of his feline nemesis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXMoXr0gRsZAXfPqwmNUICYhWbZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40024'),
  ('205187060368290542', 'Mouse for Sale', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'June Foray', 'NR', 'Tom sells Jerry to a local pet store that''s buying white mice. Yes, Jerry''s brown, but a little paint fixes that.', 'Tom sells Jerry to a local pet store that''s buying white mice. Yes, Jerry''s brown, but a little paint fixes that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jhdVEIkCJ3Qy1G9pSeEm2XQCV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73689'),
