  ('165906817843631973', 'Mouse-Placed Kitten', 1959, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, June Foray', null, 'A kitten is dropped in a sack out of a car and rolls down a hill, to arrive at the door of Clyde and Matilda Mouse...', 'A kitten is dropped in a sack out of a car and rolls down a hill, to arrive at the door of Clyde and Matilda Mouse...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHJrRDRHneg7QdKJz3sS5rToqeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234814'),
  ('779710453983711533', 'Mouse-Taken Identity', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Sylvester Cat checks in to work at a museum with his son, Junior. He is bragging about his mouse-catching prowess when the baby kangaroo, Hippety Hopper, having escaped from the zoo, turns up in the museum. Sylvester and Junior, as usual, mistake Hippety for a giant mouse and chase him around the exhibits.', 'Sylvester Cat checks in to work at a museum with his son, Junior. He is bragging about his mouse-catching prowess when the baby kangaroo, Hippety Hopper, having escaped from the zoo, turns up in the museum. Sylvester and Junior, as usual, mistake Hippety for a giant mouse and chase him around the exhibits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dq1Bmrtkutz4DBwYoeFq3fhwEsG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235017'),
  ('721637871073007978', 'Mouse-Warming', 1952, 'Animation', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A teen-aged boy mouse falls in love with the girl mouse who lives in the hole across the room. But Claude Cat literally comes between them, and also tries to stir up a feud between their two families.', 'A teen-aged boy mouse falls in love with the girl mouse who lives in the hole across the room. But Claude Cat literally comes between them, and also tries to stir up a feud between their two families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daiycSv0q10iRIqiEHmMwJ0xMke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237373'),
  ('92400104859689318', 'Mouseboat Massacre', 2025, 'Horror', 'Andrea M. Catinella', 'Harrison Thomas Boxley', 'Natasha Tosini, Shayli Reagan, Keith Eyles, Lauren Leppard, Jay Robertson, Kathi deCouto, Atlanta Moreno, Victor Rios', null, 'The story follows a young woman battling a drug addiction who suddenly begins to see a mutated mouse human hybrid who infests her life. Those around her begin to drop like flies.', 'The story follows a young woman battling a drug addiction who suddenly begins to see a mutated mouse human hybrid who infests her life. Those around her begin to drop like flies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctKqevqOwbeVg5GLQLu5VvnCjan.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1353333'),
  ('535240861086916250', 'MouseHunt', 1997, 'Comedy, Family', 'Phedon Papamichael, Gore Verbinski, Sally Thornton', 'Adam Rifkin', 'Nathan Lane, Lee Evans, Vicki Lewis, Maury Chaykin, Eric Christmas, Michael Jeter, Debra Christofferson, Camilla Søeberg', 'PG', 'Down-on-their luck brothers, Lars and Ernie Smuntz, aren''t happy with the crumbling old mansion they inherit... until they discover the estate is worth millions. Before they can cash in, they have to rid the house of its single, stubborn occupant—a tiny and tenacious mouse.', 'Down-on-their luck brothers, Lars and Ernie Smuntz, aren''t happy with the crumbling old mansion they inherit... until they discover the estate is worth millions. Before they can cash in, they have to rid the house of its single, stubborn occupant—a tiny and tenacious mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqBPrWOzXEO3rWEk3DYTHBjXNZb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6283'),
  ('912738116029319393', 'Mousitsa', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Giorgos Petridis', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Aliki Vougiouklaki, Andreas Barkoulis, Giannis Gionakis, Koulis Stoligas, Thanasis Veggos, Stavros Iatridis, Aleka Stratigou, Takis Hristoforidis', null, 'Alice is a girl who can''t hold down a job. When she hears about a typist position at a newspaper, she hopes she''ll finally succeed. But things get complicated when her editor-in-chief assigns her to interview an important public figure.', 'Alice is a girl who can''t hold down a job. When she hears about a typist position at a newspaper, she hopes she''ll finally succeed. But things get complicated when her editor-in-chief assigns her to interview an important public figure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIjQD2LLZ0mVUbIWUInxRzdRAHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332018'),
  ('778788883315513424', 'Mouth of the Wolf: Amanda Knox Returns to Italy', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Christopher Robinson', 'Christopher Robinson', 'Amanda Knox', 'TV-14', 'Amanda Knox returns to Italy to confront Giuliano Mignini, the prosecutor who locked her up for a murder she did not commit.', 'Amanda Knox returns to Italy to confront Giuliano Mignini, the prosecutor who locked her up for a murder she did not commit.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FpSXcdS9hwBIO0YBqsdUCYrZYZKP.jpg', 'plex:movie:mouth-of-the-wolf-amanda-knox-returns-to-italy'),
  ('93133513572937375', 'Mouth to Mouth', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Manuel Gómez Pereira, Juan Amorós', 'Juan Luis Iborra, Joaquín Oristrell, Naomi Wise', 'Javier Bardem, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Josep Maria Flotats, María Barranco, Myriam Mézières, Kiti Mánver, Jordi Bosch, Tres Hanley', 'R', 'For financial reasons, an aspiring actor begins working for a phone-sex enterprise. Through his new line of work, he develops relationships with two regular clients: Bill, an elderly homosexual, and Amanda, a mysterious femme fatale.', 'For financial reasons, an aspiring actor begins working for a phone-sex enterprise. Through his new line of work, he develops relationships with two regular clients: Bill, an elderly homosexual, and Amanda, a mysterious femme fatale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0ovimfy5YFwWMOBO8jtkvOmtdf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62364'),
  ('253299044564524288', 'Mouth to Mouth', 2005, 'Drama', 'Alison Murray, Barry Stone', 'Alison Murray', 'Elliot Page, Natasha Wightman, Eric Thal, August Diehl, Diana Greenwood, Beatrice Brown, Maxwell McCabe-Lokos, Elliot McCabe-Lokos', null, 'An aimless adolescent joins several itinerant misfits who live on the fringe of society and welcome at-risk youths into their fold.', 'An aimless adolescent joins several itinerant misfits who live on the fringe of society and welcome at-risk youths into their fold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1b5nFWdaWRpjNP4axtmvfoVyKFe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8008'),
  ('427917029370259760', 'Move', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Dietrich Brüggemann, Alexander Sass', 'Anna Brüggemann, Dietrich Brüggemann', 'Anna Brüggemann, Robert Gwisdek, Alice Dwyer, Jacob Matschenz, Amelie Kiefer, Aylin Tezel, Katharina Spiering, Alexander Khuon', null, 'Eleven moving dates, eight friends: Philipp, Wiebke, Jessica, Maria, Swantje, Michael, Thomas, Dina – all in their twenties and mutually lonesome. And always searching: For a new city, a new job, an own apartment, a new, or even an old love. The search is never-ending, and so they repeatedly find themselves at a ritual gathering: someone moving. Boxes are shifted from one side of Berlin to the other, or the length and breadth of Germany, from one abode to the next as one life is exchanged for another. In 3 ZIMMER/KÜCHE/BAD, director Dietrich Brüggemann portrays existences in which relationships, social networks and backdrops are in a constant state of flux; where best friends are the only, and therefore the most valuable constant. Humorous sketches of the self-conception of a generation for whom moving has become the symbol of a life on the go.', 'Eleven moving dates, eight friends: Philipp, Wiebke, Jessica, Maria, Swantje, Michael, Thomas, Dina – all in their twenties and mutually lonesome. And always searching: For a new city, a new job, an own apartment, a new, or even an old love. The search is never-ending, and so they repeatedly find themselves at a ritual gathering: someone moving. Boxes are shifted from one side of Berlin to the other, or the length and breadth of Germany, from one abode to the next as one life is exchanged for another. In 3 ZIMMER/KÜCHE/BAD, director Dietrich Brüggemann portrays existences in which relationships, social networks and backdrops are in a constant state of flux; where best friends are the only, and therefore the most valuable constant. Humorous sketches of the self-conception of a generation for whom moving has become the symbol of a life on the go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uQNbpcK7AMaZif8wz6XEJamRU8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130736'),
  ('697190287540330721', 'Move Along, There Is Nothing to See!', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Patrice Leconte, Robert Fraisse', 'Martin Veyron, Patrice Leconte', 'Michel Blanc, Jane Birkin, Jacques Villeret, Gaëlle Legrand, Michel Robbe, Martin Lamotte, Dominique Faysse, Luis Rego', null, 'Inspector Leroux is investigating the owner of a contemporary art gallery Helen Duvernet who is suspected of being involved in trafficking of stolen paintings. He is both intrigued and attracted by the young woman, follows her everywhere and finally falls in love...', 'Inspector Leroux is investigating the owner of a contemporary art gallery Helen Duvernet who is suspected of being involved in trafficking of stolen paintings. He is both intrigued and attracted by the young woman, follows her everywhere and finally falls in love...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsDo3HrnADWlD8dmJhXAXqgTL2K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78409'),
  ('892473953366145769', 'Move Over, Darling', 1963, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Gordon, Daniel L. Fapp, Ad Schaumer', 'Hal Kanter, Jack Sher', 'Doris Day, James Garner, Polly Bergen, Thelma Ritter, Fred Clark, Don Knotts, Elliott Reid, Edgar Buchanan', 'NR', 'Three years into their loving marriage, with two infant daughters at home in Los Angeles, Nicholas Arden and Ellen Wagstaff Arden are on a plane that goes down in the South Pacific. Although most passengers manage to survive the incident, Ellen presumably perishes when swept off her lifeboat, her body never recovered. Fast forward five years. Nicholas, wanting to move on with his life, has Ellen declared legally dead. Part of that moving on includes getting remarried, this time to a young woman named Bianca Steele, who, for their honeymoon, he plans to take to the same Monterrey resort where he and Ellen spent their honeymoon. On that very same day, Ellen is dropped off in Los Angeles by the Navy, who rescued her from the South Pacific island where she was stranded for the past five years. She asks the Navy not to publicize her rescue nor notify Nicholas as she wants to do so herself.', 'Three years into their loving marriage, with two infant daughters at home in Los Angeles, Nicholas Arden and Ellen Wagstaff Arden are on a plane that goes down in the South Pacific. Although most passengers manage to survive the incident, Ellen presumably perishes when swept off her lifeboat, her body never recovered. Fast forward five years. Nicholas, wanting to move on with his life, has Ellen declared legally dead. Part of that moving on includes getting remarried, this time to a young woman named Bianca Steele, who, for their honeymoon, he plans to take to the same Monterrey resort where he and Ellen spent their honeymoon. On that very same day, Ellen is dropped off in Los Angeles by the Navy, who rescued her from the South Pacific island where she was stranded for the past five years. She asks the Navy not to publicize her rescue nor notify Nicholas as she wants to do so herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KrfjjGpOAXiMZyHlbSyklPa1eA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30204'),
  ('18249531158951025', 'Move Over, Mrs. Markham', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Trueba', 'Fernando Trueba', 'Ana Belén, Carmen Maura, Antonio Resines, Santiago Ramos, Verónica Forqué, Guillermo Montesinos, Chus Lampreave, José Luis Fernández ''Pirri''', null, 'Pablo and Fernando, owners of a children''s book publishing company about to go bankrupt, have managed through unorthodox means to contract the country''s best-selling author, Adela Mora. The evening of the official signing, Paco asks his friend to let him use his house for a love tryst while Fernando wines and dines Adela. At the same time, Paco''s wife, Carmen, will be taking her lover to Rosa''s house. From here on the rout begins, as Paco tries to get rid of Silvia, his secretary, and Carmen, her husband. Fernando thinks Rosa is cheating on him with Oscar, who thinks Fernando is gay and having an affair with his partner, while the soldier thinks his girlfriend is a professional...', 'Pablo and Fernando, owners of a children''s book publishing company about to go bankrupt, have managed through unorthodox means to contract the country''s best-selling author, Adela Mora. The evening of the official signing, Paco asks his friend to let him use his house for a love tryst while Fernando wines and dines Adela. At the same time, Paco''s wife, Carmen, will be taking her lover to Rosa''s house. From here on the rout begins, as Paco tries to get rid of Silvia, his secretary, and Carmen, her husband. Fernando thinks Rosa is cheating on him with Oscar, who thinks Fernando is gay and having an affair with his partner, while the soldier thinks his girlfriend is a professional...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mH70dIdILFOhWhh0t0wYjkNjT5H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102492'),
  ('233228399361488551', 'Movement Studies in Paris', 1928, 'Documentary', 'Joris Ivens', null, null, null, 'A study of traffic movement in Paris.', 'A study of traffic movement in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZBu0rKqV94UDcmJOo0THgBxMUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189943'),
  ('19888475709670369', 'Movers & Shakers', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Robbie Greenberg, William Asher', 'Charles Grodin', 'Walter Matthau, Charles Grodin, Vincent Gardenia, Tyne Daly, Bill Macy, Gilda Radner, Earl Boen, Michael Lerner', 'PG', 'Studio head Joe Mulholland promises his dying producer and mentor, Saul Gritz, to adapt a popular sex manual into a film, despite his better judgment. Unable to figure out how to turn the nonfiction book into a narrative movie, Mulholland enlists the services of Herb Dorman, a screenwriter of popular romantic films with a bad marriage, and volatile director Sid Spokane to help him create a movie.', 'Studio head Joe Mulholland promises his dying producer and mentor, Saul Gritz, to adapt a popular sex manual into a film, despite his better judgment. Unable to figure out how to turn the nonfiction book into a narrative movie, Mulholland enlists the services of Herb Dorman, a screenwriter of popular romantic films with a bad marriage, and volatile director Sid Spokane to help him create a movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhXxagUUQCaIQVHbsBlohX9O6tR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89743'),
  ('392667013312065073', 'Movida', 2020, null, 'Alessandro Padovani, Cristiano Di Nicola', null, null, null, 'Children play war between the abandoned houses of a mountain village. Tommaso and Riccardo with other guys build a motor tricycle, spending the summer between the parking lots and hangars. Lorenzo is the son of a transhumant shepherd, and he wouldn’t like to continue his father’s profession, but to spend a summer like other teenagers. Belluno is one of the many Italian provinces that is becoming depopulated. MOVIDA tells it through the eyes of children and young people who live there.', 'Children play war between the abandoned houses of a mountain village. Tommaso and Riccardo with other guys build a motor tricycle, spending the summer between the parking lots and hangars. Lorenzo is the son of a transhumant shepherd, and he wouldn’t like to continue his father’s profession, but to spend a summer like other teenagers. Belluno is one of the many Italian provinces that is becoming depopulated. MOVIDA tells it through the eyes of children and young people who live there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4NJ1B8oOrviD7kqQRWK2qmfwp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854804'),
  ('524694682240039690', 'Movie 43', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Steven Brill, Elizabeth Banks, Steve Carr', 'Will Carlough, Patrik Forsberg, Matt Portenoy', 'Dennis Quaid, Greg Kinnear, Hugh Jackman, Kate Winslet, Jeremy Allen White, Liev Schreiber, Naomi Watts, Anna Faris', 'R', 'A series of interconnected short films are the backdrop for a maniac screenwriter who pitches insane storylines featuring some of Hollywood''s biggest and brightest. In some countries, like the United Kingdom and the Netherlands, the structure differs. Instead of a pitch, the films are connected by a group of three teenagers searching for the most banned film in the world, Movie 43, which will ultimately lead to the destruction of civilization.', 'A series of interconnected short films are the backdrop for a maniac screenwriter who pitches insane storylines featuring some of Hollywood''s biggest and brightest. In some countries, like the United Kingdom and the Netherlands, the structure differs. Instead of a pitch, the films are connected by a group of three teenagers searching for the most banned film in the world, Movie 43, which will ultimately lead to the destruction of civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYa06GxHsCsELx9vOQ11vsT0Aa6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87818'),
  ('810899910908834504', 'Movie Crazy', 1932, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Clyde Bruckman, Walter Lundin, Gaylord Lloyd', null, 'Harold Lloyd, Constance Cummings, Kenneth Thomson, Louise Closser Hale, Spencer Charters, Robert McWade, Eddie Fetherston, Sydney Jarvis', 'NR', 'After a mix-up with his application photograph, an aspiring actor is invited to a screen test and goes off to Hollywood.', 'After a mix-up with his application photograph, an aspiring actor is invited to a screen test and goes off to Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iqQodSzndRx2MAnJ3xe6N1fjsh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53522'),
  ('435168361881000679', 'Movie Days', 1994, 'Drama', 'Ari Kristinsson, Fridrik Thor Fridriksson', 'Fridrik Thor Fridriksson, Einar Már Guðmundsson', 'Örvar Jens Arnarson, Rúrik Haraldsson, Sigrún Hjálmtýsdóttir, Orri Helgason, Jón Sigurbjörnsson, Guðrún Ásmundsdóttir, Asta Esper Hagen Andersen, Otto Sander', null, 'This Icelandic tale, loosely based on the real-life experiences of director Fridrik Fridriksson tells the saga of a boyhood spent in Iceland in the 1960s.', 'This Icelandic tale, loosely based on the real-life experiences of director Fridrik Fridriksson tells the saga of a boyhood spent in Iceland in the 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUSqckK4mN0pqsh1ZxYD43L2ooL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72596'),
  ('1151662025495383998', 'Movie Dementia', 1986, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Carlos Reichenbach, José Roberto Eliezer', 'Carlos Reichenbach, Inácio Araújo', 'Ênio Gonçalves, Emílio Di Biasi, Valeska Canoletti, Benjamin Cattan, Imara Reis, Rosa Maria Pestana, Alvamar Taddei, Vanessa Alves', null, 'Transposition of the myth of Faust to modern Brazil. The heir to a bankrupt cigarette factory, amidst a personal crisis, leaves everything behind and heads for a supposed paradise he has seen in a tourist agency, where he believes he could find self-knowledge. In his search, he is inspired by a Mephisto-like character.', 'Transposition of the myth of Faust to modern Brazil. The heir to a bankrupt cigarette factory, amidst a personal crisis, leaves everything behind and heads for a supposed paradise he has seen in a tourist agency, where he believes he could find self-knowledge. In his search, he is inspired by a Mephisto-like character.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWsuwKiIP7ciOGRMGGoMIRpuvXn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167468'),
  ('467883634338305544', 'Movie Maniacs', 1936, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Felix Adler', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Mildred Harris, Kenneth Harlan, Bud Jamison, Harry Semels, John Barrymore', 'NR', 'The boys are stowaways on a train box-car filled with furniture bound for Hollywood where they hope to break into movies and become stars. Arriving at the Carnation Pictures Studios. Fuller Rath, the studio general manager, receives a telegram from the home office telling him that a certain "Mr. Smith and his two assistants" will arrive to take over the supervision of the studios. He mistakes the Stooges as the executives and gives them free reign over the studios, where they proceed to disrupt and destroy the production of a romantic drama.', 'The boys are stowaways on a train box-car filled with furniture bound for Hollywood where they hope to break into movies and become stars. Arriving at the Carnation Pictures Studios. Fuller Rath, the studio general manager, receives a telegram from the home office telling him that a certain "Mr. Smith and his two assistants" will arrive to take over the supervision of the studios. He mistakes the Stooges as the executives and gives them free reign over the studios, where they proceed to disrupt and destroy the production of a romantic drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMTeem3raQLnIeja5oTacN04GuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115805'),
  ('458489618315228079', 'Movie Movie', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Stanley Donen, Charles Rosher Jr., Bruce Surtees', 'Larry Gelbart, Sheldon Keller', 'George C. Scott, Trish Van Devere, Red Buttons, Eli Wallach, Harry Hamlin, Ann Reinking, Jocelyn Brando, Michael Kidd', 'PG', 'Three movie genres of the 1930s, boxing films, WWI aviation dramas, and backstage Broadway musicals, are satirized using the same cast.', 'Three movie genres of the 1930s, boxing films, WWI aviation dramas, and backstage Broadway musicals, are satirized using the same cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibbixbVqqAcs2fot7dUcyOALFsD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85420'),
  ('1055346867389009582', 'MoviePass, MovieCrash', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Muta’Ali, Axel Baumann', null, 'Stacy Spikes, Hamet Watt, Ted Farnsworth, Mitch Lowe, Daymond John, John Fichthorn, Chris Kelly', 'PG-13', 'Exploring the company founding and the implosion of the business by outside investors who took over the company, left it bankrupt and under investigation.', 'Exploring the company founding and the implosion of the business by outside investors who took over the company, left it bankrupt and under investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWht9uFRrqmqnLDL5F9grwUiL62.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1229898'),
  ('548921657221006764', 'Moving', 1988, 'Comedy, Family', 'Alan Metter, Donald McAlpine', 'Andy Breckman', 'Richard Pryor, Beverly Todd, Dave Thomas, Dana Carvey, Randy Quaid, Stacey Dash, Morris Day, Ji-Tu Cumbuka', 'R', 'Arlo accepts what seems to him to be a dream promotion to Idaho. He soon discovers, however, that moving has its own share of problems.', 'Arlo accepts what seems to him to be a dream promotion to Idaho. He soon discovers, however, that moving has its own share of problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld7XINaFmrnyDe5Ugl9tQX9UWxa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29739'),
  ('798767402253710385', 'Moving', 1993, 'Drama', 'Shinji Sōmai, Toyomichi Kurita, Kuniko Sone', 'Satoshi Okonogi, Satoko Okudera', 'Tomoko Tabata, Junko Sakurada, Kiichi Nakai, Tsurube Shofukutei, Mariko Sudo, Shinobu Chihara, Taro Tanaka, Ippei Shigeyama', null, 'Physically separated from her father and at odds with her distraught mother, a girl must negotiate her own passage to maturity.', 'Physically separated from her father and at odds with her distraught mother, a girl must negotiate her own passage to maturity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20yLlHONxoc1shTuLJNjOqACcT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115784'),
  ('357223362809995729', 'Moving Day', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald and Mickey are overdue on their rent, so the sheriff is preparing to evict them and sell their belongings. Goofy the ice-man comes by and helps them move out before the sale, but their piano doesn''t want to stay on his truck. Meanwhile, Donald has a fight with a plunger and a fishbowl after removing a heater from the gas line.', 'Donald and Mickey are overdue on their rent, so the sheriff is preparing to evict them and sell their belongings. Goofy the ice-man comes by and helps them move out before the sale, but their piano doesn''t want to stay on his truck. Meanwhile, Donald has a fight with a plunger and a fishbowl after removing a heater from the gas line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUEUTs7EYg6h8q67QQvUwvTu73X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67130'),
