  ('395593103838076960', 'Mr. and Mrs. Iyer', 2002, 'Drama', 'Aparna Sen, Goutam Ghose', 'Aparna Sen', 'Rahul Bose, Konkona Sen Sharma, Bhisham Sahni, Surekha Sikri, Sunil Mukherjee, Anjan Dutt, Esha Chauhan, Kalyan Ray', null, 'Mrs. Iyer and her infant son are traveling to Kolkata with the help of photographer Rajah. When religious tensions flare up and the bus travelers become stranded under martial law, she makes a choice to save him that entwines their lives.', 'Mrs. Iyer and her infant son are traveling to Kolkata with the help of photographer Rajah. When religious tensions flare up and the bus travelers become stranded under martial law, she makes a choice to save him that entwines their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ge3B43rnPktTcFAHZ2wF7Dsonhj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41184'),
  ('260935850429430834', 'Mr. Arkadin', 1955, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Orson Welles, José María Ochoa, José Luis de la Serna', 'Orson Welles', 'Orson Welles, Akim Tamiroff, Grégoire Aslan, Patricia Medina, Jack Watling, Mischa Auer, Peter van Eyck, Michael Redgrave', null, 'Claiming that he doesn''t know his own past, a rich man enlists an ex-con with an odd bit of detective work. Gregory Arkadin says he can''t remember anything before the late 1920s, and convict Guy Van Stratten is happy to take the job of exploring his new acquaintance''s life story. Guy''s research turns up stunning details about his employer''s past, and as his work seems linked to untimely deaths, the mystery surrounding Mr. Arkadin deepens.', 'Claiming that he doesn''t know his own past, a rich man enlists an ex-con with an odd bit of detective work. Gregory Arkadin says he can''t remember anything before the late 1920s, and convict Guy Van Stratten is happy to take the job of exploring his new acquaintance''s life story. Guy''s research turns up stunning details about his employer''s past, and as his work seems linked to untimely deaths, the mystery surrounding Mr. Arkadin deepens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoBfh3jmA3XDDx9tGgMwdGd37GE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44026'),
  ('842881873993333259', 'Mr. Bachmann and His Class', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Reinhold Vorschneider, Maria Speth', 'Reinhold Vorschneider, Maria Speth', 'Dieter Bachmann, Aynur Bal, Önder Cavdar', null, 'Mr. Bachmann And His Class explores the close bond between an elementary school teacher and his students. His unconventional methods clash with the complex social and cultural realities of the provincial German industrial town they live in.', 'Mr. Bachmann And His Class explores the close bond between an elementary school teacher and his students. His unconventional methods clash with the complex social and cultural realities of the provincial German industrial town they live in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSAwo5X1eltjTVYWYcRj64vAxVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795812'),
  ('363646239593152222', 'Mr. Balls', 2005, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Martín Espina, Romina Peluffo, Federico Moreira', 'Fede Álvarez, Rodo Sayagues', 'Walter Reyno, Christian Zagia, Noelia Campo, Leandro Núñez, Zina Bzhostovskaia, Julio Icazuriaga', null, 'A young city couple find themselves stuck at a rural gas station after their car breaks down. An old man, disturbed by their disrespectful behavior, starts telling them a story about the importance of respect: the cautionary tale of El Cojonudo.', 'A young city couple find themselves stuck at a rural gas station after their car breaks down. An old man, disturbed by their disrespectful behavior, starts telling them a story about the importance of respect: the cautionary tale of El Cojonudo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCtUn9owOJEzAjanGdIUgJmquQY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485236'),
  ('321097196133425201', 'Mr. Baseball', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Ian Baker, Fred Schepisi, Bruce Moriarty', 'Jeffrey Price, Peter S. Seaman', 'Tom Selleck, Ken Takakura, Aya Takanashi, Toshi Shioya, Dennis Haysbert, Art LaFleur, Nicholas Cascone, Larry Pennell', 'PG-13', 'Jack Elliot, a one-time MVP for the New York Yankees is now on the down side of his baseball career. With a falling batting average, does he have one good year left and can the manager of the Chunichi Dragons, a Japanese Central baseball league find it in him?', 'Jack Elliot, a one-time MVP for the New York Yankees is now on the down side of his baseball career. With a falling batting average, does he have one good year left and can the manager of the Chunichi Dragons, a Japanese Central baseball league find it in him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5YDGiPGuhVyQOwG1E4tBiBkf6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18722'),
