  ('516264528781646612', 'Mr. Bean''s Holiday', 2007, 'Family, Comedy', 'Steve Bendelack, Baz Irvine, James Canal', 'Robin Driscoll, Hamish McColl', 'Rowan Atkinson, Willem Dafoe, Maxim Baldry, Karel Roden, Emma de Caunes, Steve Pemberton, Jean Rochefort, Michel Winogradoff', 'G', 'Mr. Bean wins a trip to Cannes where he unwittingly separates a young boy from his father and must help the two reunite. On the way he discovers France, bicycling and true love, among other things.', 'Mr. Bean wins a trip to Cannes where he unwittingly separates a young boy from his father and must help the two reunite. On the way he discovers France, bicycling and true love, among other things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSSx9Sq6irWwN9NTQmoT9KE8kXn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1268'),
