  ('64616823869959768', 'Mr. Blot in Space', 1988, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Krzysztof Gradowski, Włodzimierz Głodek', 'Krzysztof Gradowski', 'Piotr Fronczewski, Henryk Bista, Jan Jankowski, Emilian Kamiński, Maryla Rodowicz, Bohdan Smoleń, Ján Mildner, Mieczysław Gajda', null, 'It''s Christmas, and children at an orphanage in Maliszewo receive a computer that was given to them by another orphan who used to live there many years ago. During the night, the computer awakes itself and tells the children a story that will happen in 25 years...', 'It''s Christmas, and children at an orphanage in Maliszewo receive a computer that was given to them by another orphan who used to live there many years ago. During the night, the computer awakes itself and tells the children a story that will happen in 25 years...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7jSszsFLlEszoORv1juGA2bMd2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152912'),
