  ('140008926937152465', 'Mr. Bug Goes to Town', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Dave Fleischer', 'Izzy Sparber, Dan Gordon, Dave Fleischer', 'Kenny Gardner, Gwen Williams, Jack Mercer, Tedd Pierce, Carl Meyer, Stan Freed, Pauline Loth, Pinto Colvig', 'G', 'The happy tranquility of Bugville is shattered when the populace learns that a colossal skyscraper is to be built over their tiny town.', 'The happy tranquility of Bugville is shattered when the populace learns that a colossal skyscraper is to be built over their tiny town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bn31RqXDmU12Gh0EwJrRkgs1GfI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31309'),
  ('867920103668281610', 'Mr. Burton', 2025, 'Drama', 'Marc Evans, Stuart Biddlecombe', 'Tom Bullough, Josh Hyams', 'Toby Jones, Lesley Manville, Harry Lawtey, Aimee-Ffion Edwards, Aneurin Barnard, Steffan Rhodri, Mali O''Donnell, Alfie Llewellyn', null, 'In the Welsh town of Port Talbot, 1942, Richard Jenkins lives as a wayward schoolboy, caught between the pressures of his struggling family, a devastating war and his own ambitions. However, a new opportunity arises when Richard’s natural talent for drama catches the attention of his teacher, Philip Burton.', 'In the Welsh town of Port Talbot, 1942, Richard Jenkins lives as a wayward schoolboy, caught between the pressures of his struggling family, a devastating war and his own ambitions. However, a new opportunity arises when Richard’s natural talent for drama catches the attention of his teacher, Philip Burton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xJMwrYBge97v4v3W2K5gCotuG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242454'),
  ('755612968891508702', 'Mr. Car and the Knights Templar', 2023, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Antoni Nykowski, Kamil Płocki, Nadia Lebik', 'Bartosz Sztybor', 'Mateusz Janicki, Sandra Drzymalska, Maria Dębska, Jacek Beler, Anna Dymna, Olgierd Blecharz, Kalina Kowalczuk, Piotr Sega', 'PG-13', 'A well-known art historian, treasure hunter and owner of an unusual car stumbles upon a Templar treasure, which is the key to a great power that can upset the balance of good and evil in the world. Supported by friendly scouts, Mr. Car starts a big race against time and a hostile organization, the stake of which is the heritage of knightly orders.', 'A well-known art historian, treasure hunter and owner of an unusual car stumbles upon a Templar treasure, which is the key to a great power that can upset the balance of good and evil in the world. Supported by friendly scouts, Mr. Car starts a big race against time and a hostile organization, the stake of which is the heritage of knightly orders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEAXVe0BzW4K9Ky6eTo4CJwzJ8P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1059638'),
  ('624274010554109504', 'Mr. Church', 2016, 'Drama', 'Bruce Beresford, Sharone Meir', 'Susan McMartin', 'Eddie Murphy, Britt Robertson, Natascha McElhone, Xavier Samuel, Lucy Fry, Christian Madsen, Mckenna Grace, Natalie Coughlin', 'PG-13', 'A unique friendship develops when a little girl and her dying mother inherit a cook - Mr. Church. What begins as an arrangement that should only last six months, instead spans fifteen years.', 'A unique friendship develops when a little girl and her dying mother inherit a cook - Mr. Church. What begins as an arrangement that should only last six months, instead spans fifteen years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fCfZEQwcbuqVPyMu7pN5XNpK5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374461'),
  ('285180031551624239', 'Mr. Cinderella', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Fabrizio Lucci, Leonardo Pieraccioni, Simone Spada', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Domenico Costanzo, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Laura Chiatti, Davide Marotta, Sergio Friscia, Nicola Acunzo, Massimo Ceccherini, Flavio Insinna, Lorena Cesarini', null, 'Convict Umberto is allowed to work outside prison during daytime as a librarian. There he falls for a beautiful woman who mistakes him for a volunteer helping the inmates — however, like a modern-day Cinderella, every day he must leave and be back to his cell before midnight... will they manage to live happily ever after?', 'Convict Umberto is allowed to work outside prison during daytime as a librarian. There he falls for a beautiful woman who mistakes him for a volunteer helping the inmates — however, like a modern-day Cinderella, every day he must leave and be back to his cell before midnight... will they manage to live happily ever after?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5ilDFIvyd1yEXUgsWe1KN6me03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371307'),
  ('725608057062878237', 'Mr. Coconut', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Sander Lee, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing', 'Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Michael Hui Koon-Man', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Olivia Cheng Man-Nga, Ricky Hui Koon-Ying, Chan Cheuk-Yan, Wong Hiu-Lam, Joey Wong, Simon Yam', null, 'Lovable Mr. Coconut arrives in town from Hainan China where he lived with his coconuts. Here in the sophisticated urban jungles of Hong Kong. He has finally reunited with his family, as he endures Hong Kong Streets of the late 1980s, filled with stock and property gamblers, heavy mobile phones and others.', 'Lovable Mr. Coconut arrives in town from Hainan China where he lived with his coconuts. Here in the sophisticated urban jungles of Hong Kong. He has finally reunited with his family, as he endures Hong Kong Streets of the late 1980s, filled with stock and property gamblers, heavy mobile phones and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fTQPvcOMGaVp5ZtcQfZbfln5MD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64995'),
  ('328042426588906440', 'Mr. Crocket', 2024, 'Horror', 'Brandon Espy, Powell Robinson', 'Brandon Espy, Carl Reid', 'Elvis Nolasco, Jerrika Hinton, Ayden Gavin, Kristolyn Lloyd, Alex Alomar Akpobome, Akim Black, Jermaine Rivers, Riley Vinson', 'R', 'A single mother thinks she''s found the key to calming her child down – a VHS copy of a strange children''s program named Mr. Crocket''s World. However, a darker, bloodier secret waits to invade their home from inside the tape.', 'A single mother thinks she''s found the key to calming her child down – a VHS copy of a strange children''s program named Mr. Crocket''s World. However, a darker, bloodier secret waits to invade their home from inside the tape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5TV6Y8yKZXTtg8Abf4uBGVH9mD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1317218'),
  ('83804588821483069', 'Mr. Death: The Rise and Fall of Fred A. Leuchter, Jr.', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Errol Morris', null, 'Fred A. Leuchter Jr., Robert Jan van Pelt, David Irving, Caroline Leuchter, James Roth, Shelly Shapiro, Suzanne Tabasky, Ernst Zündel', null, 'A portrait of the life and career of the infamous American execution device designer Fred A. Leuchter, Jr. Mr. Leuchter was an engineer who became an expert on execution devices and was later hired by holocaust revisionist historian Ernst Zundel to "prove" that there were no gas chambers at Auschwitz. Leuchter published a controversial report confirming Zundel''s position, which ultimately ruined his own career. Most of the footage is of Leuchter, working in and around execution facilities or chipping away at the walls of Auschwitz, but Morris also interviews various historians, associates, and neighbors.', 'A portrait of the life and career of the infamous American execution device designer Fred A. Leuchter, Jr. Mr. Leuchter was an engineer who became an expert on execution devices and was later hired by holocaust revisionist historian Ernst Zundel to "prove" that there were no gas chambers at Auschwitz. Leuchter published a controversial report confirming Zundel''s position, which ultimately ruined his own career. Most of the footage is of Leuchter, working in and around execution facilities or chipping away at the walls of Auschwitz, but Morris also interviews various historians, associates, and neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buoMN4p95mvB2JgyglMb5gKxurV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28216'),
  ('552247957080074780', 'Mr. Deeds', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Lyons Collister, Steven Brill, Jon Mallard', 'Robert Riskin', 'Adam Sandler, Winona Ryder, John Turturro, Allen Covert, Peter Gallagher, Jared Harris, Erick Avari, Peter Dante', 'PG-13', 'When Longfellow Deeds, a small-town pizzeria owner and poet, inherits $40 billion from his deceased uncle, he quickly begins rolling in a different kind of dough. Moving to the big city, Deeds finds himself besieged by opportunists all gunning for their piece of the pie. Babe, a television tabloid reporter, poses as an innocent small-town girl to do an exposé on Deeds.', 'When Longfellow Deeds, a small-town pizzeria owner and poet, inherits $40 billion from his deceased uncle, he quickly begins rolling in a different kind of dough. Moving to the big city, Deeds finds himself besieged by opportunists all gunning for their piece of the pie. Babe, a television tabloid reporter, poses as an innocent small-town girl to do an exposé on Deeds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gGk3pkpRsNlJ4PrJgEfgY9PG43.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2022'),
  ('872397459681894000', 'Mr. Deeds Goes to Town', 1936, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Frank Capra, Joseph Walker, John P. Livadary', 'Robert Riskin', 'Gary Cooper, Jean Arthur, George Bancroft, Lionel Stander, Douglass Dumbrille, Raymond Walburn, H.B. Warner, Ruth Donnelly', 'NR', 'Longfellow Deeds lives in a small town, leading a small town kind of life. When a relative dies and leaves Deeds a fortune, Longfellow moves to the big city where he becomes an instant target for everyone. Deeds outwits them all until Babe Bennett comes along. When small-town boy meets big-city girl anything can, and does, happen.', 'Longfellow Deeds lives in a small town, leading a small town kind of life. When a relative dies and leaves Deeds a fortune, Longfellow moves to the big city where he becomes an instant target for everyone. Deeds outwits them all until Babe Bennett comes along. When small-town boy meets big-city girl anything can, and does, happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20p5Cxib8wX0AyGl5i1uwPm6UwC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24807'),
  ('299798958999752816', 'Mr. Dentonn', 2014, 'Mystery, Horror, Fantasy', 'David Meno, Raúl Cerezo, Ivan Villamel', 'Ivan Villamel', 'Irene Aguilar, Kaiet Rodríguez, Ander Pardo', null, 'On a cold winter night, Laura reads her brother David the story of a strange creature that attacks children. Suddenly, a shiver runs Laura''s body, feeling a strange presence in the house. It''s him.', 'On a cold winter night, Laura reads her brother David the story of a strange creature that attacks children. Suddenly, a shiver runs Laura''s body, feeling a strange presence in the house. It''s him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8INZCPUCxhvmMbuFkJt3oALvHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299740'),
  ('450300138120186184', 'Mr. Denver', 2026, 'Short, Drama, Romance', null, null, 'Max Tkachenko, Sergey Denga, Kateryna Fain, Nazar Grabar, Angelina Gushchyna', null, 'A stubborn young woman is purchased at a clandestine auction by a cold, ruthless billionaire. To pay off her debt, she is forced to serve as his personal assistant, only to discover that her employer is the head of a powerful mafia clan.', 'A stubborn young woman is purchased at a clandestine auction by a cold, ruthless billionaire. To pay off her debt, she is forced to serve as his personal assistant, only to discover that her employer is the head of a powerful mafia clan.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:mr-denver'),
  ('162251889959691528', 'Mr. Destiny', 1990, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Alex Thomson, James Orr, Melissa Matthies', 'Jim Cruickshank, James Orr', 'Jim Belushi, Linda Hamilton, Michael Caine, Jon Lovitz, Hart Bochner, Bill McCutcheon, Rene Russo, Jay O. Sanders', 'PG-13', 'Larry Burrows is unhappy and feels powerless over his life. He believes his entire life could have turned out differently had he not missed that shot in a baseball game when was a kid. One night he meets this mysterious man, who could change his fate by offering him that alternative life he always dreamed of. But as Burrows embarks on this journey of self discovery he realises that even this new life has its problems and drawbacks..', 'Larry Burrows is unhappy and feels powerless over his life. He believes his entire life could have turned out differently had he not missed that shot in a baseball game when was a kid. One night he meets this mysterious man, who could change his fate by offering him that alternative life he always dreamed of. But as Burrows embarks on this journey of self discovery he realises that even this new life has its problems and drawbacks..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlYxDFP9l1YcUnspNzuIa8KVo4N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2612'),
  ('1105583662551343673', 'Mr. Devil', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Cesare Bastelli, Armando Chianese, Carla Bernardin', 'Pupi Avati, Antonio Avati, Tommaso Avati', 'Gabriel Lo Giudice, Filippo Franchini, Riccardo Claut, Lorenzo Salvatori, Chiara Sani, Ludovica Pedetta, Ariel Serra, Fabio Ferrari', null, 'In 1950s Italy, a government official arrives in a rural town to investigate a grisly child murder. The culprit is a young boy who claims he acted in order to kill the Devil itself.', 'In 1950s Italy, a government official arrives in a rural town to investigate a grisly child murder. The culprit is a young boy who claims he acted in order to kill the Devil itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRmPaVH1wuKWk2A66xYORVr3Y7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602518'),
  ('126997066147712787', 'Mr. Donkey', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Liu Lu, Zhou Shen, Jong Lin', 'Liu Lu, Zhou Shen', 'Ren Suxi, Da Li, Liu Shuailiang, Bu Guanjin, Pei Kuishan, Han Yanbo, Alan Aruna, Gao Yang', null, 'In order to pay for the donkey that brings them water, a countryside village registers it as a teacher at its local school. But when the charity group that funds the school visits for an inspection, the village has to find ways to hide their secret.', 'In order to pay for the donkey that brings them water, a countryside village registers it as a teacher at its local school. But when the charity group that funds the school visits for an inspection, the village has to find ways to hide their secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCgyF4gHAwEcahodiJkpILNfCYa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421742'),
  ('697588792747927770', 'Mr. Dough and the Egg Princess', 2010, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Kitaro Kosaka, Atsushi Okui', 'Hayao Miyazaki', null, null, 'The story of a tiny Egg-girl who is forced to serve the evil Boar-like witch Baba Yaga. But after a blob of Dough comes to life, she befriends him and both escape from the witch''s home at a Water mill on a cliff and set off to see the world. The soundtrack is Joe Hisaishi''s arrangement of Vivaldi''s La Folia', 'The story of a tiny Egg-girl who is forced to serve the evil Boar-like witch Baba Yaga. But after a blob of Dough comes to life, she befriends him and both escape from the witch''s home at a Water mill on a cliff and set off to see the world. The soundtrack is Joe Hisaishi''s arrangement of Vivaldi''s La Folia', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZF5MFxbieqLvPhkBCnKvbtcz4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214676'),
  ('1033227798683599573', 'Mr. Duck Steps Out', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King, Bob Newman', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald visits the house of his new love interest for their first known date. At first Daisy acts shy and has her back turned to her visitor. But Donald soon notices her tailfeathers taking the form of a hand and signaling for him to come closer. But their time alone is soon interrupted by Huey, Dewey and Louie who have followed their uncle and clearly compete with him for the attention of Daisy. Uncle and nephews take turns dancing the jitterbug with her while trying to get rid of each other. In their final effort the three younger Ducks feed their uncle maize in the process of becoming popcorn. The process is completed within Donald himself who continues to move wildly around the house while maintaining the appearance of dancing. The short ends with an impressed Daisy showering her new lover with kisses', 'Donald visits the house of his new love interest for their first known date. At first Daisy acts shy and has her back turned to her visitor. But Donald soon notices her tailfeathers taking the form of a hand and signaling for him to come closer. But their time alone is soon interrupted by Huey, Dewey and Louie who have followed their uncle and clearly compete with him for the attention of Daisy. Uncle and nephews take turns dancing the jitterbug with her while trying to get rid of each other. In their final effort the three younger Ducks feed their uncle maize in the process of becoming popcorn. The process is completed within Donald himself who continues to move wildly around the house while maintaining the appearance of dancing. The short ends with an impressed Daisy showering her new lover with kisses', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VFqyFg6t81L8A7AT1eeJCQAWmj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73999'),
  ('262510847332912530', 'Mr. Emmett & The Canned Peaches', 2017, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Héctor Valdez, Juan Carlos Gómez', 'Felipe Jiménez Luna, José Ramón Alama, Hugh Sullivan', 'Peter Vives, Frank Perozo, Joaquín Ferreira, María Guinea, Ramón Langa, Lee Fulford', null, 'When Diego''s girlfriend decides to leave him after a disastrous anniversary getaway, he will find any means possible to amend or fix what happened. Even if it means competing with different versions of himself when traveling through time.', 'When Diego''s girlfriend decides to leave him after a disastrous anniversary getaway, he will find any means possible to amend or fix what happened. Even if it means competing with different versions of himself when traveling through time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVw8FKI0xhIC4Dj95uE272HSnch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420112'),
  ('1035129435549771205', 'Mr. Fifteen Balls', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Nuti, Danilo Desideri, Giacomo Lesina', 'Maria Luisa Di Lonardo, Mario Rellini, Francesco Nuti', 'Francesco Nuti, Sabrina Ferilli, Alberto Gimignani, Antonio Petrocelli, Novello Novelli, Evelina Gori, Gabriella Bartolini, Gianna Giachetti', null, 'Francesco is a Tuscan who is very good at playing American pool, so much so that he is nicknamed "Mr. Quindicipalle", for the time he performed the unlikely feat of pocketing fifteen (quindici) balls (palle) in one shot, using the wooden handle of a broom as his cue stick. Francesco is also an experienced womanizer, like his recently deceased father. Indeed, Francesco meets the woman of his dreams at his father''s funeral – a prostitute who calls herself Sissi. The two fall in love, and so Francesco thinks she might be a lucky charm for him, in his training for a big pool tournament. But Sissi frequently infuriates Francesco, compromising his skill and his training for the tournament.', 'Francesco is a Tuscan who is very good at playing American pool, so much so that he is nicknamed "Mr. Quindicipalle", for the time he performed the unlikely feat of pocketing fifteen (quindici) balls (palle) in one shot, using the wooden handle of a broom as his cue stick. Francesco is also an experienced womanizer, like his recently deceased father. Indeed, Francesco meets the woman of his dreams at his father''s funeral – a prostitute who calls herself Sissi. The two fall in love, and so Francesco thinks she might be a lucky charm for him, in his training for a big pool tournament. But Sissi frequently infuriates Francesco, compromising his skill and his training for the tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wko1xyWIhwrApm0Unuf2vap0dW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62703'),
  ('327392880473566765', 'Mr. Fix It', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Darin Ferriola, Irek Hartowicz', 'Darin Ferriola', 'David Boreanaz, Alana de la Garza, Scoot McNairy, Pat Healy, Paul Sorvino, Terrence Evans, Lee Weaver, Rodney Rowland', 'R', 'Lance Valenteen makes a living as "Mr. Fix It," a man who gets hired by men that have just recently been dumped by their girlfriend. Lance dates the guys'' ex-girlfriend and becomes the worst date possible, sending the girl back into her ex-boyfriends arms. But when Lance gets hired by Bill Smith to get Sophia Fiori back, Lance, for the first time, starts falling for one of his marks.', 'Lance Valenteen makes a living as "Mr. Fix It," a man who gets hired by men that have just recently been dumped by their girlfriend. Lance dates the guys'' ex-girlfriend and becomes the worst date possible, sending the girl back into her ex-boyfriends arms. But when Lance gets hired by Bill Smith to get Sophia Fiori back, Lance, for the first time, starts falling for one of his marks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBgEdBeMg4KDJaWGRUmPKppQg2I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18517'),
  ('311502839247349878', 'Mr. Forbush and the Penguins', 1971, 'Adventure', 'Arne Sucksdorff, Roy Boulting, Alfred Viola', 'Anthony Shaffer', 'John Hurt, Hayley Mills, Dudley Sutton, Tony Britton, Thorley Walters, Judy Campbell, Joss Ackland, Avril Angers', null, 'A self-absorbed young biologist takes on a six-month research post in Antarctica to study a penguin colony. Alone in Shackleton’s abandoned hut, with only radio contact and letters to his distant girlfriend, he endures the harsh winter and gradually forms a bond with the penguins—discovering resilience, humility, and a new sense of purpose.', 'A self-absorbed young biologist takes on a six-month research post in Antarctica to study a penguin colony. Alone in Shackleton’s abandoned hut, with only radio contact and letters to his distant girlfriend, he endures the harsh winter and gradually forms a bond with the penguins—discovering resilience, humility, and a new sense of purpose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lLGpolDp6NOB5BTSMm3HU0ZI0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210977'),
  ('635911062171741278', 'Mr. Freedom', 1969, 'Drama, Comedy', 'William Klein, Pierre Lhomme, Didier Baudet', 'William Klein', 'John Abbey, Delphine Seyrig, Philippe Noiret, Serge Gainsbourg, Catherine Rouvel, Jean-Claude Drouot, Yves Lefebvre, Rufus', null, 'Mr. Freedom, a bellowing good-ol''-boy superhero decked out in copious football padding, jets to France to cut off a Commie invasion from Switzerland. A destructive, arrogant patriot in tight pants, Freedom joins forces with Marie Madeleine to combat lefty freethinkers, as well as the insidious evildoers Moujik Man and inflatable Red China Man, culminating in a star-spangled showdown.', 'Mr. Freedom, a bellowing good-ol''-boy superhero decked out in copious football padding, jets to France to cut off a Commie invasion from Switzerland. A destructive, arrogant patriot in tight pants, Freedom joins forces with Marie Madeleine to combat lefty freethinkers, as well as the insidious evildoers Moujik Man and inflatable Red China Man, culminating in a star-spangled showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ae543dtPTLDBgDbNsVPkd0SDsOh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27146'),
  ('420679957233085999', 'Mr. Go', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Yong-hwa, Jeon Dae-seong, Park Hyeon-cheol', 'Kim Yong-hwa', 'Josie Xu Jiao, Sung Dong-il, Kim Kang-woo, Kim Jung-tae, Joe Odagiri, Kim Hie-won, Kim Eung-soo, Byun Hee-bong', null, 'A 15-year-old circus ringmaster Wei-wei is left all alone with gorilla Ling-ling after grandfather passes away. Thanks to her grandfather''s love for baseball, Ling-ling was trained to play baseball and has developed remarkable hitting skills.', 'A 15-year-old circus ringmaster Wei-wei is left all alone with gorilla Ling-ling after grandfather passes away. Thanks to her grandfather''s love for baseball, Ling-ling was trained to play baseball and has developed remarkable hitting skills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXv2X8CuQCaLrxUywkJE5pMLXMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207052'),
  ('93170709341230456', 'Mr. Greenberg''s Basement', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Andrey Payukov', 'Andrey Payukov', 'Agata Mutsenietse, Vlas Zubov, Daria Egerman, Vadim Koshmay, Serafim Dolbunov, Anastasia Baktimirova, Nikita Enkin', null, 'In a small provincial town, young girls began to disappear. The suspicion of the police was aroused by Arthur Greenberg, who was seen in a bar with the last missing girl. But is everything so simple and will the police be able to catch the criminal?', 'In a small provincial town, young girls began to disappear. The suspicion of the police was aroused by Arthur Greenberg, who was seen in a bar with the last missing girl. But is everything so simple and will the police be able to catch the criminal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7XwNLLaTVfUlr9Mysd2LQh94En.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1186067'),
  ('744074013053780569', 'Mr. Harrigan''s Phone', 2022, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'John Schwartzman, Anthony Raymond, Joseph P. Reidy', 'John Lee Hancock', 'Donald Sutherland, Jaeden Martell, Kirby Howell-Baptiste, Joe Tippett, Cyrus Arnold, Conor William Wright, Alexa Shae Niziak, Bennett Saltzman', 'PG-13', 'Craig, a young boy living in a small town befriends an older, reclusive billionaire, Mr. Harrigan. The two form a bond over books and an iPhone, but when the man passes away the boy discovers that not everything dead is gone.', 'Craig, a young boy living in a small town befriends an older, reclusive billionaire, Mr. Harrigan. The two form a bond over books and an iPhone, but when the man passes away the boy discovers that not everything dead is gone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPn9e8eP7TeKQU4IeWAMzOajR40.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:723419'),
  ('488851019478195244', 'Mr. Hayashi', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Bruce Baillie', null, null, null, 'Bruce Baillie''s Mr. Hayashi might be thought of as a putative East Coast story transformed by a West Coast sensibility. The narrative, slight as it is, mounts a social critique of sorts, involving the difficulty the title character, a Japanese gardener, has finding work that pays adequately. But the beauty of Baillie''s black-and-white photography, the misty lusciousness of the landscapes he chooses to photograph, and the powerful silence of Mr. Hayashi''s figure within them make the viewer forget all about economics and ethnicity. The shots remind us of Sung scrolls of fields and mountain peaks, where the human figure is dwarfed in the middle distance. Rather than a study of unemployment, the film becomes a study of nested layers of stillness and serenity.', 'Bruce Baillie''s Mr. Hayashi might be thought of as a putative East Coast story transformed by a West Coast sensibility. The narrative, slight as it is, mounts a social critique of sorts, involving the difficulty the title character, a Japanese gardener, has finding work that pays adequately. But the beauty of Baillie''s black-and-white photography, the misty lusciousness of the landscapes he chooses to photograph, and the powerful silence of Mr. Hayashi''s figure within them make the viewer forget all about economics and ethnicity. The shots remind us of Sung scrolls of fields and mountain peaks, where the human figure is dwarfed in the middle distance. Rather than a study of unemployment, the film becomes a study of nested layers of stillness and serenity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83tdZ4SGGqvXkjVjtVpYga8FC8k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302570'),
  ('991588003134619336', 'Mr. Hobbs Takes a Vacation', 1962, 'Family, Comedy', 'Henry Koster, William C. Mellor, Joseph E. Rickards', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'James Stewart, Maureen O''Hara, Fabian, Lauri Peters, Lili Gentle, John Saxon, Marie Wilson, John McGiver', 'NR', 'Banker Roger Hobbs wants to spend his vacation alone with his wife, Peggy, but she insists on a family vacation at a California beach house that turns out to be ugly and broken down. Daughter Katey, embarrassed by her braces, refuses to go to the beach, as does TV-addicted son Danny. When the family is joined by Hobbs'' two unhappily married daughters and their husbands, he must help everyone with their problems to get some peace.', 'Banker Roger Hobbs wants to spend his vacation alone with his wife, Peggy, but she insists on a family vacation at a California beach house that turns out to be ugly and broken down. Daughter Katey, embarrassed by her braces, refuses to go to the beach, as does TV-addicted son Danny. When the family is joined by Hobbs'' two unhappily married daughters and their husbands, he must help everyone with their problems to get some peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82JEB6tYkXwB1LshoT2mho9QH2p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41521'),
  ('223012888919082969', 'Mr. Holland''s Opus', 1995, 'Drama, Music', 'Oliver Wood, Stephen Herek, Jeffrey Wetzel', 'Patrick Sheane Duncan', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Glenne Headly, Jay Thomas, Olympia Dukakis, William H. Macy, Alicia Witt, Terrence Howard, Damon Whitaker', 'PG', 'In 1965, passionate musician Glenn Holland takes a day job as a high school music teacher, convinced it''s just a small obstacle on the road to his true calling: writing a historic opus. As the decades roll by with the composition unwritten but generations of students inspired through his teaching, Holland must redefine his life''s purpose.', 'In 1965, passionate musician Glenn Holland takes a day job as a high school music teacher, convinced it''s just a small obstacle on the road to his true calling: writing a historic opus. As the decades roll by with the composition unwritten but generations of students inspired through his teaching, Holland must redefine his life''s purpose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBmwWeSN3ajnYHZ3dSybEobxEPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2054'),
  ('477057524733581134', 'Mr. Holmes', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Bill Condon, Tobias A. Schliessler, Lance Roehrig', 'Jeffrey Hatcher', 'Ian McKellen, Laura Linney, Milo Parker, Hiroyuki Sanada, Roger Allam, Frances de la Tour, Hattie Morahan, Phil Davis', 'PG', 'In 1947, long-retired and near the end of his life, Sherlock Holmes grapples with an unreliable memory and must rely on his housekeeper''s son as he revisits the still-unsolved case that led to his retirement.', 'In 1947, long-retired and near the end of his life, Sherlock Holmes grapples with an unreliable memory and must rely on his housekeeper''s son as he revisits the still-unsolved case that led to his retirement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNHkoefLcdtaHyG08G8aDn1yFMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280996'),
  ('364089161418945545', 'Mr. Housewife: Quiz King', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Yoo Sun-dong', 'Yoo Sun-dong', 'Han Suk-kyu, Shin Eun-kyung, Kim Soo-mi, Gong Hyung-jin, Son Bum-soo, Lee Hwa-sun, Kim Tae-hun, Seo Shin-ae', null, 'To save his family from financial troubles, a house-husband takes part in the "Housewife Quiz Show" for the jackpot prize.', 'To save his family from financial troubles, a house-husband takes part in the "Housewife Quiz Show" for the jackpot prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7t8T1nsMEEfkTzqJ9R5ECxOqcor.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373848'),
  ('965239334219080908', 'Mr. Hurt', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pramett Chankrasse, Ittisak Eusunthornwattana', 'Ittisak Eusunthornwattana', 'Sunny Suwanmethanon, Mashannoad Suvalmas, Marie Broenner, Pongsatorn Jongwilas, Somlek Sakdikul, Natthachai Sirinanthachot, Passavorn Chatanantavach, Jiraporn Boonkitticharoen', null, 'Don Sri-Chang, a tennis professional and world champion, is left heartbroken when his girlfriend turns down his marriage proposal and dates a rockstar. Dew, his long-lost friend, turns up out of nowhere to help him with the heartbreak.', 'Don Sri-Chang, a tennis professional and world champion, is left heartbroken when his girlfriend turns down his marriage proposal and dates a rockstar. Dew, his long-lost friend, turns up out of nowhere to help him with the heartbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArBUgpRLgqJIPse0f9JA5chAVrU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466023'),
  ('748248703985212015', 'Mr. Idol', 2011, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Ra Hee-chan, Park Yong-su', 'Ra Hee-chan, Lee Gyu-bok', 'Ji Hyun-woo, Park Ye-jin, Kim Soo-ro, Im Won-hee, Jay Park, An Seo-hyun, Goo Seung-hyun, Ko Chang-seok', null, 'It''s hard being a Korean popstar! For every Gangnam Style, there are a hundred flameouts. K-Pop sensation Jay Park stars in this musical romp about a sassy music executive on her quest to resurrect a disgraced boy band against all odds.', 'It''s hard being a Korean popstar! For every Gangnam Style, there are a hundred flameouts. K-Pop sensation Jay Park stars in this musical romp about a sassy music executive on her quest to resurrect a disgraced boy band against all odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAW1j1uMvhfU1W6n3PEblA4WX07.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95179'),
  ('21358852840004537', 'Mr. Imperium', 1951, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Don Hartman, George J. Folsey, Johnny Green', 'Edwin H. Knopf, Don Hartman', 'Lana Turner, Ezio Pinza, Marjorie Main, Barry Sullivan, Cedric Hardwicke, Debbie Reynolds, Ann Codee', 'NR', 'An exiled king and a film star try to rekindle a romance from the past.', 'An exiled king and a film star try to rekindle a romance from the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohonjS1SgPqWJKUVlUeHkQS0q6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23245'),
  ('767484303742812935', 'Mr. Incredible and Pals', 2005, 'Animation, Family', 'Roger Gould', 'Roger Gould, Brad Bird', 'Craig T. Nelson, Samuel L. Jackson, Pete Docter, Michael Asberry, Celia Shuman, Roger L. Jackson', 'NR', 'An animated short film produced by Pixar included as a bonus on the DVD edition of the 2004 feature film "The Incredibles."', 'An animated short film produced by Pixar included as a bonus on the DVD edition of the 2004 feature film "The Incredibles."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxy5xsBKGIN4iNy6dFIsQlvDtvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55423'),
  ('331458207090130272', 'Mr. India', 1987, 'Action, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Shekhar Kapur, Baba Azmi', 'Javed Akhtar, Salim Khan', 'Anil Kapoor, Sridevi, Amrish Puri, Satish Kaushik, Annu Kapoor, Sharat Saxena, Ajit Vachani, Ashok Kumar', null, 'A poor but big-hearted man takes orphans into his home. After discovering his scientist father''s invisibility device, he rises to the occasion and fights to save his children and all of India from the clutches of a megalomaniac.', 'A poor but big-hearted man takes orphans into his home. After discovering his scientist father''s invisibility device, he rises to the occasion and fights to save his children and all of India from the clutches of a megalomaniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqDJ8vuVFYymUhOUKcGCZoHy4tu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41903'),
  ('893924871321706899', 'Mr. Jealousy', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Noah Baumbach, Michael A. Allowitz, Susie Balaban', 'Noah Baumbach', 'Eric Stoltz, Annabella Sciorra, Chris Eigeman, Carlos Jacott, Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Brian Kerwin, John Lehr, Peter Bogdanovich', 'R', 'After his first date at age 15 ended with the girl making out with another man at a party, aspiring writer Lester Grimm has treated all his girlfriends with jealousy and suspicion. While dating Ramona Ray, paranoia gets the best of him when he discovers that her most recent ex is successful novelist Dashiell Frank. Lester begins attending the same group therapy sessions as Dashiell to learn about Ramona''s past with him.', 'After his first date at age 15 ended with the girl making out with another man at a party, aspiring writer Lester Grimm has treated all his girlfriends with jealousy and suspicion. While dating Ramona Ray, paranoia gets the best of him when he discovers that her most recent ex is successful novelist Dashiell Frank. Lester begins attending the same group therapy sessions as Dashiell to learn about Ramona''s past with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHKAQTwZOIzUvqz4pZ3Tj6JX3K1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53765'),
  ('1113702275362048009', 'Mr. Jingles', 2006, 'Horror', 'Todd Brunswick, Tommy Brunswick', 'Todd Brunswick', 'Dr. Rudy Hatfield, Kelli Jensen, Karen Turner, Dave Cunningham, Chris Peters, Tom Reeser, Nicole Majdali, Jon Manthei', 'R', 'Determined to make the guilty parties pay for what they did, Mr. Jingles goes on a bloody killing spree, wreaking grisly havoc on the families of those who put him behind bars. But the homicidal clown had one witness who got away - and spent years in an institution trying to erase the gory memories. Now she is back and ready to join society again - but someone else is planning a very different homecoming!', 'Determined to make the guilty parties pay for what they did, Mr. Jingles goes on a bloody killing spree, wreaking grisly havoc on the families of those who put him behind bars. But the homicidal clown had one witness who got away - and spent years in an institution trying to erase the gory memories. Now she is back and ready to join society again - but someone else is planning a very different homecoming!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TqEwLQdDMyGv5V8I03iJTcKRzQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65255'),
  ('878148087542469438', 'Mr. Jones', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mike Figgis, Juan Ruiz Anchía, Ruth A. Redfern', 'Eric Roth, Michael Cristofer', 'Richard Gere, Lena Olin, Anne Bancroft, Tom Irwin, Delroy Lindo, Bruce Altman, Lauren Tom, Lisa Malkiewicz', 'R', 'The story about the relationship between a manic depressive man, Mr. Jones, and the female doctor who takes more than a professional interest in his treatment.', 'The story about the relationship between a manic depressive man, Mr. Jones, and the female doctor who takes more than a professional interest in his treatment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmAnfar51B0qSQ1Wkix0iKtUUnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2625'),
  ('423806122078605577', 'Mr. Jones', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Saul Herckis, Mathew Rudenberg, Jack Grimmett', 'Karl Mueller', 'Jon Foster, Rachel O''Meara, Mark Steger, Jessica Dowdeswell, Faran Tahir, Ethan Sawyer, Jordan Byrne, David Clennon', 'PG-13', 'Scott (Jon Foster) is a filmmaker in need of inspiration. He and his girlfriend Penny (Sarah Jones) move into a desolate house hoping to make a breakthrough. Then they discover their neighbor, the elusive Mr. Jones. Famous for his haunting sculptures, Mr. Jones has remained a mystery to the world. Scott and Penny, convinced that they have found the perfect film subject, sneak into his workshop and realize that their curiosity may have chilling consequences. Who is Mr. Jones?', 'Scott (Jon Foster) is a filmmaker in need of inspiration. He and his girlfriend Penny (Sarah Jones) move into a desolate house hoping to make a breakthrough. Then they discover their neighbor, the elusive Mr. Jones. Famous for his haunting sculptures, Mr. Jones has remained a mystery to the world. Scott and Penny, convinced that they have found the perfect film subject, sneak into his workshop and realize that their curiosity may have chilling consequences. Who is Mr. Jones?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoEmA1sRxIOTxoRHX257phXQPgu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174678'),
  ('229282634177402347', 'Mr. Jones', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama, History', 'Olga Chajdas, Anna Rzepka, Agnieszka Holland', 'Andrea Chalupa', 'James Norton, Vanessa Kirby, Peter Sarsgaard, Joseph Mawle, Kenneth Cranham, Celyn Jones, Krzysztof Pieczyński, Beata Pozniak', null, 'In 1933, Welsh journalist Gareth Jones travels to Ukraine, where he experiences the horrors of a famine. Everywhere he goes he meets henchmen of the Soviet secret service who are determined to prevent news about the catastrophe from getting out. Stalin’s forced collectivisation of agriculture has resulted in misery and ruin—the policy is tantamount to mass murder.', 'In 1933, Welsh journalist Gareth Jones travels to Ukraine, where he experiences the horrors of a famine. Everywhere he goes he meets henchmen of the Soviet secret service who are determined to prevent news about the catastrophe from getting out. Stalin’s forced collectivisation of agriculture has resulted in misery and ruin—the policy is tantamount to mass murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpCKOsAmKLD67mwugN6hrPvdPZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:509598'),
  ('117858073549183621', 'Mr. K', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Tallulah Hazekamp Schwab, Frank Griebe, Marcus Himbert', 'Tallulah Hazekamp Schwab', 'Crispin Glover, Sunnyi Melles, Fionnula Flanagan, Bjørn Sundquist, Dearbhla Molloy, Barbara Sarafian, Jan Gunnar Røise, Esmée van Kampen', null, 'Mr. K, a traveling magician, finds himself in a Kafkaesque nightmare when he can’t find the exit of his hotel. His attempts to get out only pull him deeper, entangling him further with the hotel and its curious inhabitants.', 'Mr. K, a traveling magician, finds himself in a Kafkaesque nightmare when he can’t find the exit of his hotel. His attempts to get out only pull him deeper, entangling him further with the hotel and its curious inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRpGcAYC7cm1QnInz8P3xHvm7cV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242669'),
  ('1054010494768075768', 'Mr. Kaplan', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Álvaro Brechner, Álvaro Gutiérrez, Sergio de León', 'Álvaro Brechner', 'Héctor Noguera, Néstor Guzzini, Rolf Becker, Nidia Telles, Nuria Fló, Leonor Svarcas, Gustavo Saffores, Hugo Piccinini', null, 'Jacob Kaplan lives an ordinary life in Uruguay. Like many of his other Jewish friends, Jacob fled Europe for South America because of World War II. But now turning 76, he is grumpy and in need of adventure. An unexpected opportunity to achieve greatness comes in the form of a quiet, elderly German, who Mr Kaplan believes to be a runaway Nazi. Determined to capture this Nazi, as Eichmann was captured before him, Mr Kaplan surprises everyone when he takes up this challenge.', 'Jacob Kaplan lives an ordinary life in Uruguay. Like many of his other Jewish friends, Jacob fled Europe for South America because of World War II. But now turning 76, he is grumpy and in need of adventure. An unexpected opportunity to achieve greatness comes in the form of a quiet, elderly German, who Mr Kaplan believes to be a runaway Nazi. Determined to capture this Nazi, as Eichmann was captured before him, Mr Kaplan surprises everyone when he takes up this challenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0ACKbI6bYZDpKBiBVdSA2XvtFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284050'),
  ('187915996682235005', 'Mr. Klein', 1976, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Joseph Losey, Gerry Fisher, Philippe Baronnet-Fruges', 'Fernando Morandi, Costa-Gavras', 'Alain Delon, Jeanne Moreau, Francine Bergé, Juliet Berto, Jean Bouise, Suzanne Flon, Massimo Girotti, Michael Lonsdale', 'PG', 'Paris, France, 1942, during the Nazi occupation. Robert Klein, a successful art dealer who benefits from the misfortunes of those who are ruthlessly persecuted, discovers by chance that there is another Robert Klein, apparently a Jewish man; someone with whom he could be mistakenly identified, something dangerous in such harsh times.', 'Paris, France, 1942, during the Nazi occupation. Robert Klein, a successful art dealer who benefits from the misfortunes of those who are ruthlessly persecuted, discovers by chance that there is another Robert Klein, apparently a Jewish man; someone with whom he could be mistakenly identified, something dangerous in such harsh times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FRa43WgyhIXzMYLO3yxDb0OY6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58925'),
  ('1127230727946151689', 'Mr. Know-It-All', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'François Prévôt-Leygonie, Stéphan Archinard, Pierre-Hugues Galien', 'François Prévôt-Leygonie, Stéphan Archinard, Alain Gillot', 'Arnaud Ducret, Alice David, Max Baissette de Malglaive, Jean-François Cayrey, Caroline Silhol, Féodor Atkine, Christophe Bourseiller, Marina Tomé', null, 'A football coach afraid of commitment has to take care of his nephew with Asperger''s Syndrome.', 'A football coach afraid of commitment has to take care of his nephew with Asperger''s Syndrome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lsyzjunLzVCmAPw9GvNlizQbbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512418'),
  ('1002157730815461683', 'Mr. Krueger''s Christmas', 1980, 'TV Movie, Drama, Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Kieth Merrill, Jeremy Lepard, Peter Johnson', null, 'James Stewart, Beverly Rowland, Kamee Aliessa, Tamara Fowler, Gordon Jump, Oscar Rowland, Tyson Lewis, Darro Glissmeyer', 'NR', 'Willy Krueger, a lonely and aging widower, lives in a basement apartment with only his cat George for company. Finishing his work for the day as the custodian for the building, he ventures out on Christmas Eve to buy a tree and on the way, he imagines he is a well-dressed gentleman while peering at some fine tailoring in a shop window along the snowy street. Returning home, he falls asleep listening to an LP by The Mormon Tabernacle Choir, dreaming that he is conducting them in carols of the season. Awakening to find some carollers outside his window, he beckons them to visit him offering hot chocolate, but they leave after only one song. In trimming the tree, he places upon it the mittens left behind by Clarissa, the youngest of the carolling group. Handling figures of the small nativity beneath his tree, Willy finds himself in the manger for the very first Christmas.', 'Willy Krueger, a lonely and aging widower, lives in a basement apartment with only his cat George for company. Finishing his work for the day as the custodian for the building, he ventures out on Christmas Eve to buy a tree and on the way, he imagines he is a well-dressed gentleman while peering at some fine tailoring in a shop window along the snowy street. Returning home, he falls asleep listening to an LP by The Mormon Tabernacle Choir, dreaming that he is conducting them in carols of the season. Awakening to find some carollers outside his window, he beckons them to visit him offering hot chocolate, but they leave after only one song. In trimming the tree, he places upon it the mittens left behind by Clarissa, the youngest of the carolling group. Handling figures of the small nativity beneath his tree, Willy finds himself in the manger for the very first Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shhvBsmCqWzbRoL3jwgprrgnlVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50941'),
  ('986269018374071270', 'Mr. Kuka''s Advice', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Dariusz Gajewski', 'Dariusz Gajewski, Roland Gugganig, Radek Knapp', 'Łukasz Garlicki, August Diehl, Andrzej Grabowski, Tomasz Karolak, Branko Samarovski, Anna Przybylska, Mirosław Zbrojewicz, Nadia Cameron-Blakey', null, 'Young Waldek wants to earn some money abroad and asks his experienced neighbour, Mr Kuka, for advice. When he finally gets to Vienna, he can confront the reality with what he has been told about.', 'Young Waldek wants to earn some money abroad and asks his experienced neighbour, Mr Kuka, for advice. When he finally gets to Vienna, he can confront the reality with what he has been told about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWRUj6zZZVczYv3bDcjnogRb7EN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36626'),
  ('1094383158236716270', 'Mr. Leather', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Larry Machado, Daniel Nolasco', 'Daniel Nolasco', 'Dom Barbudo, Dom PC, Kake, Deh Leather, Maoriguy, Leandro Rebello, Heitor Werneck, Francine Zaqui', null, 'Dom Barbudo, a pioneer in the São Paulo gay and BDSM community and elected first Mister Leather Brasil in 2017, prepares to pass on the mantle to one of the four contestants in the second edition of the contest.', 'Dom Barbudo, a pioneer in the São Paulo gay and BDSM community and elected first Mister Leather Brasil in 2017, prepares to pass on the mantle to one of the four contestants in the second edition of the contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ti7chh6EPQt1vNoOCLdzvoT7dhL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583140'),
  ('868634231904752500', 'Mr. Long', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'SABU, Kei Era, Kōichi Furuya', 'SABU', 'Chang Chen, Sho Aoyagi, Eleven Yao, Bai Run-yin, Masashi Arifuku, Tarō Suwa, Ritsuko Okusa, Shiiko Utagawa', null, 'Long is a Taiwanese killer known for his sword skills. After Long fails a Tokyo mission, he moves to a small town where no one knows about him.', 'Long is a Taiwanese killer known for his sword skills. After Long fails a Tokyo mission, he moves to a small town where no one knows about him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5w9ZkzPgtM7NRtua671nP1Fr2Br.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436350'),
  ('1032868392534502188', 'Mr. Lucky', 1943, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'H. C. Potter, George Barnes, Harry Scott', 'Milton Holmes, Adrian Scott', 'Cary Grant, Laraine Day, Charles Bickford, Gladys Cooper, Alan Carney, Henry Stephenson, Paul Stewart, Kay Johnson', 'NR', 'A conman poses as a war relief fundraiser, but when he falls for a charity worker, his conscience begins to trouble him.', 'A conman poses as a war relief fundraiser, but when he falls for a charity worker, his conscience begins to trouble him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNwlZCUuueYydkgVL5bcfrYKRNl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47352'),
