  ('223292260994597029', 'Mr. Magorium''s Wonder Emporium', 2007, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Zach Helm, Roman Osin, Eric S. Potechin', 'Zach Helm', 'Dustin Hoffman, Natalie Portman, Jason Bateman, Zach Mills, Jonathan Potts, Rebecca Northan, David Rendall, Jade Cohen', 'G', 'Molly Mahoney is the awkward and insecure manager of Mr. Magorium''s Wonder Emporium—the strangest, most fantastic and most wonderful toy store in the world. After Mr. Magorium bequeaths the store to her, a dark and ominous change begins to take over the once-remarkable Emporium.', 'Molly Mahoney is the awkward and insecure manager of Mr. Magorium''s Wonder Emporium—the strangest, most fantastic and most wonderful toy store in the world. After Mr. Magorium bequeaths the store to her, a dark and ominous change begins to take over the once-remarkable Emporium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdFgWATSVhhFtNYZUFsGcHzltcG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2284'),
  ('251485236132262898', 'Mr. Majestyk', 1974, 'Action, Crime', 'Richard Fleischer, Richard H. Kline, Paul Baxley', 'Elmore Leonard', 'Charles Bronson, Al Lettieri, Linda Cristal, Lee Purcell, Paul Koslo, Taylor Lacher, Frank Maxwell, Alejandro Rey', 'PG', 'A melon farmer battles organized crime and a hit man who wants to kill him.', 'A melon farmer battles organized crime and a hit man who wants to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJR239Fep2R75f8gGc9uxei0Buh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26173'),
  ('971736659602584375', 'Mr. Miao', 2020, 'Animation, Action, History, Fantasy, Drama', 'Li Lingxiao', 'Busifan', 'Baomu Zhongyang, Wang Xiaoqian, Xiao Liansha, Lin Qiang, Zhen Zhang', null, 'The feature introduces a fictional golden-colored flower, which possesses the magical ability to debauch humans who get too close to it. As the flower only chooses kindhearted people as hosts, a group of martial artists who want to eradicate the plants face a dilemma: should one kill good people for rescuing men from sin?', 'The feature introduces a fictional golden-colored flower, which possesses the magical ability to debauch humans who get too close to it. As the flower only chooses kindhearted people as hosts, a group of martial artists who want to eradicate the plants face a dilemma: should one kill good people for rescuing men from sin?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZ91Memjnc5XivmpaQiz3W1oeAD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:657893'),
  ('693288052856222083', 'Mr. Mike''s Mondo Video', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Michael O''Donoghue, Barry Rebo', 'Mitch Glazer, Michael O''Donoghue, Emily Prager', 'Michael O''Donoghue, Dan Aykroyd, Rhonda Coullet, Paul Shaffer, Bill Murray, Jane Curtin, Carrie Fisher, Teri Garr', 'R', 'Mike O''Donoghue''s parody of "Mondo Cane" showcases curious performers, strange musicians, celebrity mutations and unusual short films, including Thomas Alva Edison''s "Elephant Electrocution". In the tradition of films like Groove Tube (1974), The Kentucky Fried Movie (1977), and Saturday Night Live.', 'Mike O''Donoghue''s parody of "Mondo Cane" showcases curious performers, strange musicians, celebrity mutations and unusual short films, including Thomas Alva Edison''s "Elephant Electrocution". In the tradition of films like Groove Tube (1974), The Kentucky Fried Movie (1977), and Saturday Night Live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlIsdpYKPszPo7IcUuYPp9v5raA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49036'),
  ('771159160948895257', 'Mr. Moll and the Chocolate Factory', 2017, 'Family, Comedy', 'Manuel Flurin Hendry, Felix Novo de Oliveira', 'Manuel Flurin Hendry, Matthias Pacht, Jann Preuss', 'Stefan Kurt, Luna Paiano, Maxwell Mare, Yven Hess, Lou Vogel, Livius Müller Drossaart, Isabella Schmid, Erich Vock', null, 'A weekend alone at home with the children - and already breaks out of the mess with Papa minor. For while Moll pushes overtime in the chocolate factory, between his children and the offspring of his boss a merciless battle breaks out: for cotton candy, homework - and the most famous circus dog in the world.', 'A weekend alone at home with the children - and already breaks out of the mess with Papa minor. For while Moll pushes overtime in the chocolate factory, between his children and the offspring of his boss a merciless battle breaks out: for cotton candy, homework - and the most famous circus dog in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPRhCUIsedQcNQ5Z5TD2hasU9FR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496031'),
  ('682841891654863242', 'Mr. Mom', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stan Dragoti, James Dyer, Dustin Bernard', 'John Hughes', 'Michael Keaton, Teri Garr, Frederick Koehler, Taliesin Jaffe, Courtney-Jane White, Brittany White, Martin Mull, Ann Jillian', 'PG', 'Jack and Caroline are a couple making a decent living when Jack suddenly loses his job. They agree that he should stay at home and look after the house while Caroline works. It''s just that he''s never done it before, and really doesn''t have a clue...', 'Jack and Caroline are a couple making a decent living when Jack suddenly loses his job. They agree that he should stay at home and look after the house while Caroline works. It''s just that he''s never done it before, and really doesn''t have a clue...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QuTlgKKykL7j0PnZZd3LNFVhCX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13105'),
  ('333559604490648966', 'Mr. Monk''s Last Case: A Monk Movie', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Giorgio Scali, Randall Zisk', 'Andy Breckman', 'Tony Shalhoub, Traylor Howard, Jason Gray-Stanford, Melora Hardin, Héctor Elizondo, Ted Levine, James Purefoy, Caitlin McGee', 'PG', 'Monk steps out of retirement as his stepdaughter''s wedding turns tragic when her fiancé dies in a bungee jumping accident.', 'Monk steps out of retirement as his stepdaughter''s wedding turns tragic when her fiancé dies in a bungee jumping accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gj74sUGsPMg5qDQooh8GTs4MvbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1100795'),
  ('286351944170592878', 'Mr. Morgan''s Last Love', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sandra Nettelbeck, Michael Bertl', 'Sandra Nettelbeck', 'Michael Caine, Clémence Poésy, Gillian Anderson, Justin Kirk, Jane Alexander, Richard Hope, Anne Alvaro, Yannick Choirat', null, 'A widowed professor living in Paris develops a special relationship with a younger French woman.', 'A widowed professor living in Paris develops a special relationship with a younger French woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1bNPyhp5aBb6Bw8bc4ex87KVOC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201749'),
  ('1113316065624190639', 'Mr. Moto in Danger Island', 1939, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Action', 'Herbert I. Leeds, William Forsyth', 'Peter Milne', 'Peter Lorre, Warren Hymer, Amanda Duff, Robert Lowery, Leon Ames, Jean Hersholt, Douglass Dumbrille, Richard Lane', 'NR', 'In Puerto Rico to investigate a glut of contraband diamonds that are flooding the world''s jewel market, Mr. Moto and his sidekick, a wrestler, find themselves involved in murders by thrown daggers, the frame-up of an overstressed Army colonel, and a pirate gang led by an unknown boss who has inside knowledge of the ensuing investigation.', 'In Puerto Rico to investigate a glut of contraband diamonds that are flooding the world''s jewel market, Mr. Moto and his sidekick, a wrestler, find themselves involved in murders by thrown daggers, the frame-up of an overstressed Army colonel, and a pirate gang led by an unknown boss who has inside knowledge of the ensuing investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cZ2K7nehEt8SLGQDbSLpVpJB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59589'),
  ('694994199397145364', 'Mr. Moto Takes a Chance', 1938, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Norman Foster, Virgil Miller, Tom Dudley', 'Lou Breslow, John Patrick', 'Peter Lorre, Rochelle Hudson, Robert Kent, J. Edward Bromberg, Chick Chandler, George Regas, Frederick Vogeding, H.W. Gim', 'NR', 'In the jungle near Angkor Wat in Cambodia, Mr. Moto poses as an ineffectual archaeologist and a venerable holy man with mystical powers to help foil two insurgencies against the government.', 'In the jungle near Angkor Wat in Cambodia, Mr. Moto poses as an ineffectual archaeologist and a venerable holy man with mystical powers to help foil two insurgencies against the government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1463MEqmdO9t98CeKH20ZcS0Io.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38774'),
  ('121183742921542311', 'Mr. Moto Takes a Vacation', 1939, 'Action, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Norman Foster, Charles G. Clarke, Samuel Kaylin', 'Norman Foster, Philip MacDonald', 'Peter Lorre, Joseph Schildkraut, Lionel Atwill, Virginia Field, John ''Dusty'' King, Iva Stewart, G.P. Huntley, Victor Varconi', 'NR', 'Mr. Moto is in Egypt to thwart a criminal mastermind determined to steal the priceless crown of the Queen of Sheba. When the precious treasure is transported to America, Mr. Moto must race against time to unmask the cunning thief who will stop at nothing—not even murder—to get what he wants.', 'Mr. Moto is in Egypt to thwart a criminal mastermind determined to steal the priceless crown of the Queen of Sheba. When the precious treasure is transported to America, Mr. Moto must race against time to unmask the cunning thief who will stop at nothing—not even murder—to get what he wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9R69laIYK0reqBRcOMirespkDpe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59657'),
  ('624728198482079553', 'Mr. Moto''s Gamble', 1938, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime', 'James Tinling, Lucien N. Andriot', 'Charles S. Belden, Jerome Cady, John P. Marquand', 'Peter Lorre, Keye Luke, Dick Baldwin, Lynn Bari, Douglas Fowley, Jayne Regan, Harold Huber, Maxie Rosenbloom', 'NR', 'Celebrated as supersleuth, Mr. Moto comes out fighting when a brutal boxing match turns into cold-blooded murder! Assisted by detective-in-training Lee Chan, Moto sets out to track down the killer based on a single ominous clue: a poisoned boxing glove! But when Moto''s hunch points to a corrupt gambling syndicate, he''s forced to wager his very life to unmask the culprit—or go down for the count...permanently!', 'Celebrated as supersleuth, Mr. Moto comes out fighting when a brutal boxing match turns into cold-blooded murder! Assisted by detective-in-training Lee Chan, Moto sets out to track down the killer based on a single ominous clue: a poisoned boxing glove! But when Moto''s hunch points to a corrupt gambling syndicate, he''s forced to wager his very life to unmask the culprit—or go down for the count...permanently!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRjkRmGXIP5fcFoOrYXsCk7IBZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59584'),
  ('108153512043054160', 'Mr. Moto''s Last Warning', 1939, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Norman Foster, Virgil Miller, Samuel Kaylin', 'Philip MacDonald, Norman Foster', 'Peter Lorre, Ricardo Cortez, Virginia Field, John Carradine, George Sanders, Joan Carroll, Robert Coote, Margaret Irving', 'NR', 'A Japanese man claiming to be Mr. Moto, of the International Police, is abducted and murdered soon after disembarking from a ship at Port Said in Egypt. The real Mr. Moto is already in Port Said, investigating a conspiracy against the British and French governments.', 'A Japanese man claiming to be Mr. Moto, of the International Police, is abducted and murdered soon after disembarking from a ship at Port Said in Egypt. The real Mr. Moto is already in Port Said, investigating a conspiracy against the British and French governments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AboXVQh5iNEbxqbHxtWoAFRrvva.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18705'),
  ('675824626639866288', 'Mr. Mouse Takes a Trip', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Clyde Geronimi, Don A. Duckwall', null, 'Walt Disney, Lee Millar, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'Mickey is heading out on vacation from Burbank to Pomona, taking the train. The conductor, Pete, won''t let him on with Pluto, so he hides Pluto in his suitcase, and tries to hide him all throughout the trip without much luck. But Pete wins when Pluto is hooked by a mail hook. Or does he?', 'Mickey is heading out on vacation from Burbank to Pomona, taking the train. The conductor, Pete, won''t let him on with Pluto, so he hides Pluto in his suitcase, and tries to hide him all throughout the trip without much luck. But Pete wins when Pluto is hooked by a mail hook. Or does he?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHwYLRD0r4gB1zd5z5Cp2x14njw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67132'),
  ('740778520838980947', 'Mr. Muhsin', 1987, 'Drama', 'Yavuz Turgul, Attila Özdemiroglu, Aytekin Çakmakçı', 'Yavuz Turgul', 'Şener Şen, Uğur Yücel, Sermin Hürmeriç, Osman Cavcı, Erdoğan Sıcak, Doğu Erkan, Erdinç Üstün, Tayfun Çorağan', null, 'An ingenuous countryman Ali Nazik migrates to Istanbul and meets producer Mr. Muhsin to have his first album.', 'An ingenuous countryman Ali Nazik migrates to Istanbul and meets producer Mr. Muhsin to have his first album.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9tVXfM1ZQKUXOUMuF9dfznrEjP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31415'),
  ('900393814799894948', 'Mr. Murder', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Dick Lowry, Greg Gardiner', null, 'Stephen Baldwin, James Coburn, Julie Warner, Bill Smitrovich, Thomas Haden Church, Kaley Cuoco, Don McManus, Richard Riehle', null, 'A group of scientists are trying to produce the perfect soldier by cloning. The day the clone is born, Marty Stillwater, a mystery novel writer, feels that something strange is going on inside his body and mind. Seven years later, Marty discovers that his double has his same physical appearance but has the personality of a murderer.', 'A group of scientists are trying to produce the perfect soldier by cloning. The day the clone is born, Marty Stillwater, a mystery novel writer, feels that something strange is going on inside his body and mind. Seven years later, Marty discovers that his double has his same physical appearance but has the personality of a murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dImAy74gSExrCLdC95WuRQHbLCW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70114'),
  ('413246441353300663', 'Mr. Nanny', 1993, 'Family, Comedy', 'Michael Gottlieb, Peter Stein', 'Edward Rugoff, Michael Gottlieb', 'Hulk Hogan, David Johansen, Madeline Zima, Robert Hy Gorman, Sherman Hemsley, Peter Kent, Austin Pendleton, Mother Love', 'PG', 'A former pro-wrestler is hired to be the bodyguard/nanny for a couple of bratty kids whose inventor father is being stalked by a rival.', 'A former pro-wrestler is hired to be the bodyguard/nanny for a couple of bratty kids whose inventor father is being stalked by a rival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSRSvh9kSEgCOsPR7yrH0ueh4lC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19371'),
  ('966758778021369123', 'Mr. Nice', 2010, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Bernard Rose, Bernard Rose', 'Bernard Rose', 'Rhys Ifans, Chloë Sevigny, David Thewlis, Luis Tosar, Crispin Glover, Omid Djalili, Christian McKay, Elsa Pataky', 'R', 'Biopic about 1970s Welsh marijuana trafficker Howard Marks, whose inventive smuggling schemes made him a huge success in the drug trade, as well as leading to dealings with both the IRA and British Intelligence. Based on Marks'' biography with the same title.', 'Biopic about 1970s Welsh marijuana trafficker Howard Marks, whose inventive smuggling schemes made him a huge success in the drug trade, as well as leading to dealings with both the IRA and British Intelligence. Based on Marks'' biography with the same title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uag1ajVUMuHTXqkX0H52z0FveON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46934'),
  ('174236094047984904', 'Mr. Nice Guy', 1997, 'Crime, Action, Comedy', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Raymond Lam Fai-Tai, Lam Hak-Ming', 'Fibe Ma Mei-Ping, Edward Tang', 'Jackie Chan, Richard Norton, Miki Lee, Karen McLymont, Gabrielle Fitzpatrick, Vince Poletto, Barry Otto, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo', 'PG-13', 'A Chinese chef accidentally gets involved with a news reporter who filmed a drug bust that went awry and is now being chased by gangs who are trying to get the video tape.', 'A Chinese chef accidentally gets involved with a news reporter who filmed a drug bust that went awry and is now being chased by gangs who are trying to get the video tape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAAt2gvbkbeefzjd06GPfkdfUho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10622'),
  ('966205828152161404', 'Mr. No Legs', 1978, 'Drama, Action', 'Ricou Browning, Gayle DeCamp, Paul Rubinstein', 'Jack Cowden', 'Richard Jaeckel, Ron Slinker, Lloyd Bochner, John Agar, Ted Vollrath, Rance Howard, Luke Halpin, Jim Kelly', 'R', 'A double amputee known as Mr. No Legs oversees a drug syndicate while cavorting around in his double shotgun-equipped wheelchair. When one of the syndicate''s drug dealers accidentally kills his own girlfriend—whose brother is a cop—after she announces plans to leave him, the game is on to bury the evidence, protect the syndicate and evade the long arm of the law.', 'A double amputee known as Mr. No Legs oversees a drug syndicate while cavorting around in his double shotgun-equipped wheelchair. When one of the syndicate''s drug dealers accidentally kills his own girlfriend—whose brother is a cop—after she announces plans to leave him, the game is on to bury the evidence, protect the syndicate and evade the long arm of the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6hmpKJeDQnhN2W2wJgmKeQ1Azf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38760'),
  ('862078028895328052', 'Mr. No Problem', 2017, 'Drama', 'Mei Feng, Zhu Jinjing', 'Huang Shi, Mei Feng', 'Fan Wei, Yin Tao, Zhang Chao, Shi Yihong', null, 'Shot in stylish black-and-white, this three-act fable, set in wartime Chongqing, focuses on the indifferent rich, the head clerk on a farm, and some young intruders. Based on a 1943 short story, the film was directed by noted screenwriter Mei Feng.', 'Shot in stylish black-and-white, this three-act fable, set in wartime Chongqing, focuses on the indifferent rich, the head clerk on a farm, and some young intruders. Based on a 1943 short story, the film was directed by noted screenwriter Mei Feng.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p38K4vlUNpm2ITxETtoNRvsjghC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418383'),
  ('477493135646448542', 'Mr. Nobody Against Putin', 2025, 'Documentary', 'David Borenstein, Pavel Talankin, Katya Kize', 'David Borenstein', 'Pavel Talankin, Vladimir Putin, Roman Abalin, Lavrentiy Beria, Viktor Abakumov, Leon Trotsky, Dmitry Medvedev, Vladimir Kara-Murza', null, 'As Russia launches its full-scale invasion of Ukraine, primary schools across Russia’s hinterlands are transformed into recruitment stages for the war. Facing the ethical dilemma of working in a system defined by propaganda and violence, a brave teacher goes undercover to film what’s really happening in his own school.', 'As Russia launches its full-scale invasion of Ukraine, primary schools across Russia’s hinterlands are transformed into recruitment stages for the war. Facing the ethical dilemma of working in a system defined by propaganda and violence, a brave teacher goes undercover to film what’s really happening in his own school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ss4NEGmPxgm4D73iMFeyjbE1m9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1393151'),
  ('26491772670025857', 'Mr. North', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Danny Huston, Robin Vidgeon', 'Janet Roach, John Huston, James Costigan', 'Anthony Edwards, Robert Mitchum, Lauren Bacall, Harry Dean Stanton, Anjelica Huston, Mary Stuart Masterson, Virginia Madsen, Tammy Grimes', 'PG', 'Mr. North, a stranger to a small, but wealthy, Rhode Island town, quickly has rumors started about him that he has the power to heal people''s ailments...', 'Mr. North, a stranger to a small, but wealthy, Rhode Island town, quickly has rumors started about him that he has the power to heal people''s ailments...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5svk8saTxXGQ9WKE9MEIIbxcnwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77233'),
  ('272319227405957422', 'Mr. Orchid', 1946, 'Drama, War', 'René Clément', 'Noël-Noël', 'Noël-Noël, Nadine Alari, Paul Frankeur, Marcel Delaître, Charles Lemontier, Maurice Chevit, Alice Leitner, Georges Questau', null, 'This character study of a French patriot during the Nazi Occupation has comedian Noel as the chief of the underground who uses his hobby of growing orchids to hide his radio equipment.', 'This character study of a French patriot during the Nazi Occupation has comedian Noel as the chief of the underground who uses his hobby of growing orchids to hide his radio equipment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25PkhdaCecRoHIe3QvGTT5ZlXdz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44994'),
  ('409348026890248156', 'Mr. Osomatsu the Movie', 2019, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Takumi Doyama, Youichi Fujita', 'Shu Matsubara', 'Takahiro Sakurai, Yuichi Nakamura, Hiroshi Kamiya, Jun Fukuyama, Daisuke Ono, Miyu Irino, Kenichi Suzumura, Sachi Kokuryu', null, 'The sextuplets attend a high school class reunion. There, they see all their former classmates who have become "proper" adults with company jobs. The sextuplets sulk about this and go home and drink until they fall asleep. But when they wake up, a certain scene awaits them.', 'The sextuplets attend a high school class reunion. There, they see all their former classmates who have become "proper" adults with company jobs. The sextuplets sulk about this and go home and drink until they fall asleep. But when they wake up, a certain scene awaits them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soUBnuYDrPLmURRtMUiJ6tqvFrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559519'),
  ('179109113588935717', 'Mr. Peabody & Sherman', 2014, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Rob Minkoff, Morgan Evans, Evan Boucher', 'Jay Ward', 'Ty Burrell, Max Charles, Ariel Winter, Allison Janney, Stephen Colbert, Stephen Tobolowsky, Stanley Tucci, Karan Brar', 'PG', 'A young boy and his dog, who happens to have a genius-level IQ, spring into action when their time-machine is stolen and moments in history begin to be changed.', 'A young boy and his dog, who happens to have a genius-level IQ, spring into action when their time-machine is stolen and moments in history begin to be changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPcImYndWESKHzT2GHVCDsUxzYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82703'),
  ('447500047768399571', 'Mr. Peabody and the Mermaid', 1948, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Irving Pichel, Fred Frank, Russell Metty', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'William Powell, Ann Blyth, Irene Hervey, Andrea King, Clinton Sundberg, Art Smith, Hugh French, Beatrice Roberts', 'NR', 'As told to a psychiatrist: Mr. Peabody, a middle-aged Bostonian on vacation with his wife in the Caribbean, hears mysterious, wordless singing on an uninhabited rock in the bay. Fishing in the vicinity, he catches...a mermaid. He takes her home and, though she has no spoken language, falls in love with her. Of course, his wife won''t believe that the thing in the bathtub is anything but a large fish.', 'As told to a psychiatrist: Mr. Peabody, a middle-aged Bostonian on vacation with his wife in the Caribbean, hears mysterious, wordless singing on an uninhabited rock in the bay. Fishing in the vicinity, he catches...a mermaid. He takes her home and, though she has no spoken language, falls in love with her. Of course, his wife won''t believe that the thing in the bathtub is anything but a large fish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zi4MRJrM8oBrPheeRhnxSUEBia8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53834'),
  ('895657428380073101', 'Mr. Peek-a-Boo', 1951, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jean Boyer, Charles Suin', 'Jean Boyer, Michel Audiard', 'Bourvil, Joan Greenwood, Gérard Oury, Henri Crémieux, Roger Tréville, Jacques Erwin, Frédéric O''Brady, René Worms', null, 'Léon, a humble civil servant, has the unusual ability to walk through walls, however thick they are. One day, he falls madly in love with a charming hotel thief by the name of Suzan.', 'Léon, a humble civil servant, has the unusual ability to walk through walls, however thick they are. One day, he falls madly in love with a charming hotel thief by the name of Suzan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmeNt2IxrdGbRacMkJHpQNGlVgG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50444'),
  ('310491458656740227', 'Mr. Pig', 2016, 'Drama', 'Diego Luna, Damián García', 'Diego Luna, Augusto Mendoza', 'Danny Glover, Maya Rudolph, José María Yázpik, Joel Murray, Angélica Aragón, Gabriela Araujo, Paulino Partida, Johanna Murillo', null, 'On a mission to sell his last remaining prize hog and reunite with old friends, an aging farmer abandons his foreclosed farm and journeys to Mexico. After smuggling in the hog, his estranged daughter shows up, forcing them to face their past and embark on an adventurous road trip together.', 'On a mission to sell his last remaining prize hog and reunite with old friends, an aging farmer abandons his foreclosed farm and journeys to Mexico. After smuggling in the hog, his estranged daughter shows up, forcing them to face their past and embark on an adventurous road trip together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOOIl9keHUnfeHXPX9S7y3MZgX9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272820'),
  ('591117923525730745', 'Mr. Popper''s Penguins', 2011, 'Comedy, Family', 'Mark Waters, G.A. Aguilar, Lukasz Jogalla', 'Sean Anders, John Morris, Jared Stern', 'Jim Carrey, Carla Gugino, Angela Lansbury, Ophelia Lovibond, Madeline Carroll, Clark Gregg, Jeffrey Tambor, David Krumholtz', 'PG', 'Tom Popper is a successful businessman who’s clueless when it comes to the really important things in life...until he inherits six “adorable” penguins, each with its own unique personality. Soon Tom’s rambunctious roommates turn his swank New York apartment into a snowy winter wonderland — and the rest of his world upside-down.', 'Tom Popper is a successful businessman who’s clueless when it comes to the really important things in life...until he inherits six “adorable” penguins, each with its own unique personality. Soon Tom’s rambunctious roommates turn his swank New York apartment into a snowy winter wonderland — and the rest of his world upside-down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGwZ1QI5DaL7mHQ2ZsMV1p8xvPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58224'),
  ('151538872531494275', 'Mr. Pride VS Miss. Prejudice', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Yanwei Huang, Li Haishu', 'Li Haishu', 'Dilraba Dilmurat, Leon Zhang, Gao Weiguang, Jin Chen, Mike Angelo, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, Wang Xiao, Liu Wenhuan', null, 'Online writer Tang Nan Nan crosses path with Zhu Hou, a second-generation rich boy “sea turtle”, resulting in hilarious situations and face-offs.', 'Online writer Tang Nan Nan crosses path with Zhu Hou, a second-generation rich boy “sea turtle”, resulting in hilarious situations and face-offs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czQ9A0LkWzC4fex9F4sv3H8YWWJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452833'),
  ('344602744477213727', 'Mr. Prokouk: A Horseshoe for Luck', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Karel Zeman, Karel Zeman, Julius Kalaš', 'Karel Zeman', null, null, 'Mr. Prokouk finds a horseshoe and thinks it''s a good luck charm. So, he decides to take it with him home and find a suitable place for it. He soon discovers that the horseshoe brings him nothing but bad luck.', 'Mr. Prokouk finds a horseshoe and thinks it''s a good luck charm. So, he decides to take it with him home and find a suitable place for it. He soon discovers that the horseshoe brings him nothing but bad luck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwnbX5YqnsgzUAiIgaOddzE9OaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325209'),
  ('107276558315857322', 'Mr. Ricco', 1975, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Paul Bogart, Frank Stanley, Daniel McCauley', 'Robert Hoban', 'Dean Martin, Eugene Roche, Thalmus Rasulala, Denise Nicholas, Cindy Williams, Geraldine Brooks, Philip Michael Thomas, Dennis Lee Smith', 'PG', 'Accused murderer Frankie Steele walks free, thanks to the efforts of San Francisco defense lawyer Joe Ricco. Then a pair of cop killings strikes the city. All signs point to the newly released Steele as the perpetrator. Has Ricco sprung a killer? Dean Martin keeps his affable ease but abandons his hipster Matt Helm-series swagger to portray Ricco in his final leading-role film, a whodunit mystery set in the city that also was the gritty center of action for the era’s Bullitt and Dirty Harry. Convinced that Steele isn’t behind the murders, Ricco launches an inquiry and runs up against a police lieutenant assigned to birddog him, evidence planted by a racist cop and several assassination attempts on Ricco himself. As the mystery deepens, so does the danger. And behind it all is someone the attorney never suspected. The pre-Laverne & Shirley Cindy Williams plays Ricco’s office assistant.', 'Accused murderer Frankie Steele walks free, thanks to the efforts of San Francisco defense lawyer Joe Ricco. Then a pair of cop killings strikes the city. All signs point to the newly released Steele as the perpetrator. Has Ricco sprung a killer? Dean Martin keeps his affable ease but abandons his hipster Matt Helm-series swagger to portray Ricco in his final leading-role film, a whodunit mystery set in the city that also was the gritty center of action for the era’s Bullitt and Dirty Harry. Convinced that Steele isn’t behind the murders, Ricco launches an inquiry and runs up against a police lieutenant assigned to birddog him, evidence planted by a racist cop and several assassination attempts on Ricco himself. As the mystery deepens, so does the danger. And behind it all is someone the attorney never suspected. The pre-Laverne & Shirley Cindy Williams plays Ricco’s office assistant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diyjRryB7TlNudXuS2PaudehF9G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98117'),
  ('17529829753455136', 'Mr. Right', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Paco Cabezas, Daniel Aranyó', 'Max Landis', 'Sam Rockwell, Anna Kendrick, Tim Roth, James Ransone, Anson Mount, Michael Eklund, RZA, Douglas M. Griffin', 'R', 'A girl falls for the "perfect" guy, who happens to have a very fatal flaw: he''s a hitman on the run from the crime cartels who employ him.', 'A girl falls for the "perfect" guy, who happens to have a very fatal flaw: he''s a hitman on the run from the crime cartels who employ him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSx5YUCLcSUAR4nt93aeIpZYHF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333385'),
  ('531149514144352412', 'Mr. Robinson', 1976, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Sergio Corbucci, Marcello Gatti, Giovanni Manganelli', 'Paolo Villaggio', 'Paolo Villaggio, Zeudi Araya, Anna Nogara, Percy Hogan, Nat Bush', null, 'A shipwreck strands a modern Italian businessman on a desert island. Like Robinson Crusoe he must find a way to return to civilization; unlike him--he''s a 20th-century man, a totally different case.', 'A shipwreck strands a modern Italian businessman on a desert island. Like Robinson Crusoe he must find a way to return to civilization; unlike him--he''s a 20th-century man, a totally different case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5IvF1HC3LzuKCwTL1u2LFi9GPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63029'),
  ('595037998322008228', 'Mr. Robinson Crusoe', 1932, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'A. Edward Sutherland, Max Dupont', null, 'Douglas Fairbanks, William Farnum, Earle Browne, Maria Alba', null, 'Steve Drexel voluntarily strands himself on a deserted island on a bet. He intends to re-create civilization and carves a miniature city of 52nd Street and Park Avenue out of the jungle. Drexel is befriended by his dog, a native monkey, and a wild goat that is captured in one of his traps. He attempts to cultivate a native as his Man Friday from Robinson Crusoe, but fails as the native escape.', 'Steve Drexel voluntarily strands himself on a deserted island on a bet. He intends to re-create civilization and carves a miniature city of 52nd Street and Park Avenue out of the jungle. Drexel is befriended by his dog, a native monkey, and a wild goat that is captured in one of his traps. He attempts to cultivate a native as his Man Friday from Robinson Crusoe, but fails as the native escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9o0gtCiEfJaFjzbyDEnusezzES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23253'),
  ('607212050099207217', 'Mr. Roosevelt', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Noël Wells, Dagmar Weaver-Madsen', 'Noël Wells', 'Noël Wells, Nick Thune, Britt Lower, Daniella Pineda, Andre Hyland, Doug Benson, Armen Weitzman, Sergio Cilli', null, 'A young woman returns home and must confront her ex-boyfriend when an unexpected tragedy occurs.', 'A young woman returns home and must confront her ex-boyfriend when an unexpected tragedy occurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cm5glzIq5F3OiYw6SZbD0P8cllz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424510'),
  ('874950094071775869', 'Mr. Rossi Looks for Happiness', 1976, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Bruno Bozzetto', 'Bruno Bozzetto, Guido Manuli, Maurizio Nichetti', 'Carlo Romano, Gianfranco Mauri, Grazia Pivetti, Carlo Bonomi', null, 'Where? Far from home,from work and his boss, far from city traffic and his alarm clock, far from the monotony of his life... The farthest away possible. Travelling against time, visiting places of other centuries. How? Thanks to a magic whistle given him by "Fairy Sicura" the most nutty, thoughtless, happy fairy still to be seen around. A golden whistle which can catapult him back into prehistory, or in ancient Rome, in Medieval time, on a desert island, in Fairy tale land, in ancient Egypt, in the far West or in the future.With whom? He travels with Gastone, his boss''dog, tiny,naive and a little bit spoiled : after many adventures he will realize how much more valuable a friend is rather than a cream pie. Will he find it? Yes, but not in the past, not in other centuries, full of incredible and miserable adventures for him. Happiness was much closer,at hand''s reach. He only had to think about it... Isnt that right, Mr Rossi?', 'Where? Far from home,from work and his boss, far from city traffic and his alarm clock, far from the monotony of his life... The farthest away possible. Travelling against time, visiting places of other centuries. How? Thanks to a magic whistle given him by "Fairy Sicura" the most nutty, thoughtless, happy fairy still to be seen around. A golden whistle which can catapult him back into prehistory, or in ancient Rome, in Medieval time, on a desert island, in Fairy tale land, in ancient Egypt, in the far West or in the future.With whom? He travels with Gastone, his boss''dog, tiny,naive and a little bit spoiled : after many adventures he will realize how much more valuable a friend is rather than a cream pie. Will he find it? Yes, but not in the past, not in other centuries, full of incredible and miserable adventures for him. Happiness was much closer,at hand''s reach. He only had to think about it... Isnt that right, Mr Rossi?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RmvqPSHJ0G34vCK4NguVFx7uLK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36839'),
  ('402521680434283118', 'Mr. Rossi''s Vacation', 1981, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Bruno Bozzetto', 'Guido Manuli, Bruno Bozzetto, Maurizio Nichetti', 'Giuseppe Rinaldi, Gianfranco Mauri, Giampaolo Rossi, Carlo Bonomi', null, 'A story about Mr. Rossi and his dog who go on vacation and all the adventures they have, from leading an animal revolt to climbing the Andes, or heading to the beach and being serenaded by strange fish.', 'A story about Mr. Rossi and his dog who go on vacation and all the adventures they have, from leading an animal revolt to climbing the Andes, or heading to the beach and being serenaded by strange fish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aaSI4EB30bBWr2fYraKqJzyxMea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106838'),
  ('996588932433668382', 'Mr. Sardonicus', 1961, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Burnett Guffey, William Castle, R. Robert Rosenbaum', 'Ray Russell', 'Ronald Lewis, Audrey Dalton, Guy Rolfe, Oskar Homolka, Vladimir Sokoloff, Erika Peters, Lorna Hanson, Constance Cavendish', 'NR', 'In 1880, Sir Robert Cargrave, a London physician known for his experimental work in paralysis treatment, is summoned to Gorslava by the mysterious Baron Sardonicus—who is now married to Cargrave''s former wife, Maude—to treat his disfigurement. When Cargrave arrives, he finds the masked baron is a cruel sadist who has threatened to harm Maude if he is not successfully cured.', 'In 1880, Sir Robert Cargrave, a London physician known for his experimental work in paralysis treatment, is summoned to Gorslava by the mysterious Baron Sardonicus—who is now married to Cargrave''s former wife, Maude—to treat his disfigurement. When Cargrave arrives, he finds the masked baron is a cruel sadist who has threatened to harm Maude if he is not successfully cured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ez4rSZu4WemlZVtm8Ss09U2Udoo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29402'),
  ('1116598984340806585', 'Mr. Saturday Night', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Billy Crystal, Donald Peterman, David Cass Jr.', 'Billy Crystal, Babaloo Mandel, Lowell Ganz', 'Billy Crystal, David Paymer, Julie Warner, Helen Hunt, Mary Mara, Jerry Orbach, Ron Silver, Sage Allen', 'R', 'Buddy Young was the comic''s comic, beloved by everyone. Now, playing to miniscule crowds in nursing homes, it seems like everybody but Buddy realizes that he should retire. As Buddy looks for work in show business, he realizes that the rest of the world has forgotten the golden days of Buddy Young, and that there just may not be room in the business for an old comic like himself.', 'Buddy Young was the comic''s comic, beloved by everyone. Now, playing to miniscule crowds in nursing homes, it seems like everybody but Buddy realizes that he should retire. As Buddy looks for work in show business, he realizes that the rest of the world has forgotten the golden days of Buddy Young, and that there just may not be room in the business for an old comic like himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDAJzffAZyhpEsRiRCH3J9abTbZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54087'),
  ('1119765084291859635', 'Mr. Six', 2015, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Guan Hu, Fei Zhenxiang, Luo Pan', 'Guan Hu, Dong Runnian', 'Feng Xiaogang, Xu Qing, Zhang Hanyu, Kris Wu, Li Yifeng, Liu Hua, Liang Jing, Bai Jugang', 'PG-13', 'Many years ago Mr. Six was a notorious gangster. That was back when there was still such a thing as honour among thieves, when criminals earned respect and maintained principles. These days Mr. Six is all but forgotten, a living relic residing in a narrow alley. One day Six''s son, Xiaobo, is abducted by some spoiled punks after he scratches their precious Ferrari. Mr. Six realizes that he must do whatever it takes to get his son back — even if that means returning to the life he thought he had left behind.', 'Many years ago Mr. Six was a notorious gangster. That was back when there was still such a thing as honour among thieves, when criminals earned respect and maintained principles. These days Mr. Six is all but forgotten, a living relic residing in a narrow alley. One day Six''s son, Xiaobo, is abducted by some spoiled punks after he scratches their precious Ferrari. Mr. Six realizes that he must do whatever it takes to get his son back — even if that means returning to the life he thought he had left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVttIfMDjQwHdVpUYhxdBamkl02.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357940'),
  ('975080336427517371', 'Mr. Skeffington', 1944, 'Drama, Romance', 'Vincent Sherman, Ernest Haller, William Kissell', 'Julius J. Epstein, Philip G. Epstein', 'Bette Davis, Claude Rains, Walter Abel, George Coulouris, Richard Waring, Marjorie Riordan, Robert Shayne, John Alexander', 'NR', 'A beautiful but vain woman who rejects the love of her older husband must face the loss of her youth and beauty.', 'A beautiful but vain woman who rejects the love of her older husband must face the loss of her youth and beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qqEkoPqC9ImQzPoVdVhI6NFGti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43307'),
  ('1011325470909228021', 'Mr. Socrates', 2005, 'Action, Crime', 'Choi Jin-won, Kim Il-jun', 'Choi Jin-won', 'Kim Rae-won, Kang Shin-il, Lee Jong-hyuk, Yoon Tae-young, Park Sung-woong, Jeong Wook, Joo Myung-cheool, Heo Jung-min', null, 'A low-life scumbag gets kidnapped by a mysterious gang and put through inhumane training to become a mole inside the police force.', 'A low-life scumbag gets kidnapped by a mysterious gang and put through inhumane training to become a mole inside the police force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TefGdpJjSBgtQs2GVGdT3dV0lz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32163'),
