  ('668253778486308886', 'Mr. Tree', 2011, 'Drama', 'Han Jie', 'Han Jie', 'Wang Baoqiang, Tan Zhuo, He Jie, Li Jingyi, Bai Peijiang, Wang Dazhi, Liu Bo, Yabin Wang', null, 'Teased by hallucinations, Shu, a slacker living in a rural village, struggles with an ever-loosening grip on reality. Yet when one of his visions manifests as real, his fellow villagers come to regard him as a clairvoyant. Can Shu genuinely see into the future? Is he actually just a basket case? Or is he perhaps more lucid than he seems, and pulling a fast one on everyone?', 'Teased by hallucinations, Shu, a slacker living in a rural village, struggles with an ever-loosening grip on reality. Yet when one of his visions manifests as real, his fellow villagers come to regard him as a clairvoyant. Can Shu genuinely see into the future? Is he actually just a basket case? Or is he perhaps more lucid than he seems, and pulling a fast one on everyone?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6Xfa8pTTJpJY8DSk7IfwwhiaiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90283'),
