  ('405311152867044721', 'Mrs. Dalloway', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marleen Gorris, Sue Gibson, Susie Liggat', 'Eileen Atkins', 'Vanessa Redgrave, Natascha McElhone, Michael Kitchen, Alan Cox, Sarah Badel, Lena Headey, John Standing, Robert Portal', null, 'Clarissa Dalloway looks back on her youth as she readies for a gathering at her house. The wife of a legislator and a doyenne of London''s upper-crust party scene, Clarissa finds that the plight of ailing war veteran Septimus Warren Smith reminds her of a past romance with Peter Walsh. In flashbacks, young Clarissa explores her possibilities with Peter.', 'Clarissa Dalloway looks back on her youth as she readies for a gathering at her house. The wife of a legislator and a doyenne of London''s upper-crust party scene, Clarissa finds that the plight of ailing war veteran Septimus Warren Smith reminds her of a past romance with Peter Walsh. In flashbacks, young Clarissa explores her possibilities with Peter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJURxFCyfqjTss7vTVMuUobHcye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38904'),
  ('524837489159321798', 'Mrs. Doubtfire', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Chris Columbus, Donald McAlpine, Cherylanne Martin', 'Jeffrey Price, Peter S. Seaman', 'Robin Williams, Sally Field, Lisa Jakub, Matthew Lawrence, Mara Wilson, Pierce Brosnan, Robert Prosky, Anne Haney', 'PG-13', 'Loving but irresponsible dad Daniel Hillard, estranged from his exasperated spouse, is crushed by a court order allowing only weekly visits with his kids. When Daniel learns his ex needs a housekeeper, he gets the job -- disguised as a British nanny. Soon he becomes not only his children''s best pal but the kind of parent he should have been from the start.', 'Loving but irresponsible dad Daniel Hillard, estranged from his exasperated spouse, is crushed by a court order allowing only weekly visits with his kids. When Daniel learns his ex needs a housekeeper, he gets the job -- disguised as a British nanny. Soon he becomes not only his children''s best pal but the kind of parent he should have been from the start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shHrSmXS5140o6sQzgzXxn3KqSm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788'),
  ('121142013991735955', 'Mrs. Fang', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Wang Bing, Wang Bing', 'Wang Bing', 'Fang Xiuying', null, 'In a quiet village in southern China, Fang Xiuying is sixty-seven years old. Having suffered from Alzheimer''s for several years, with advanced symptoms and ineffective treatment, she was sent back home. Now, bedridden, she is surrounded by her relatives and neighbors, as they witness and accompany her through her last days.', 'In a quiet village in southern China, Fang Xiuying is sixty-seven years old. Having suffered from Alzheimer''s for several years, with advanced symptoms and ineffective treatment, she was sent back home. Now, bedridden, she is surrounded by her relatives and neighbors, as they witness and accompany her through her last days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cREpIVpkuIiNnlw2Xwq6cQzg6Es.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467256'),
  ('759967478469831564', 'Mrs. Harris Goes to Paris', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, History', 'Felix Wiedemann, Anthony Fabian', 'Carroll Cartwright, Anthony Fabian, Keith Thompson', 'Lesley Manville, Isabelle Huppert, Lambert Wilson, Alba Baptista, Lucas Bravo, Ellen Thomas, Rose Williams, Jason Isaacs', 'PG', 'A 1950s London cleaning lady falls in love with an haute couture dress by Christian Dior and decides to gamble everything for the sake of this folly.', 'A 1950s London cleaning lady falls in love with an haute couture dress by Christian Dior and decides to gamble everything for the sake of this folly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUg0HDLhTEDcXGBU2iK6QRBILv4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:754609'),
  ('772818721359420669', 'Mrs. Henderson Presents', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stephen Frears, Andrew Dunn', 'Martin Sherman', 'Judi Dench, Bob Hoskins, Will Young, Christopher Guest, Kelly Reilly, Thelma Barlow, Anna Brewster, Rosalind Halstead', 'R', 'Recently widowed well-to-do Laura Henderson purchases the Windmill Theatre in London as a post-widowhood hobby. After starting an innovative continuous variety review, which is copied by other theaters, they begin to lose money. Mrs Henderson suggests they add risqué burlesque acts similar to the Moulin Rouge in Paris.', 'Recently widowed well-to-do Laura Henderson purchases the Windmill Theatre in London as a post-widowhood hobby. After starting an innovative continuous variety review, which is copied by other theaters, they begin to lose money. Mrs Henderson suggests they add risqué burlesque acts similar to the Moulin Rouge in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFmx0ajncGacM8Ono9vpXiHt7Vy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10773'),
  ('821025456860211343', 'Mrs. Hyde', 2018, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Céline Bozon, Ingrid de Ribaucourt, Julie Gouet', 'Serge Bozon', 'Isabelle Huppert, Romain Duris, José Garcia, Adda Senani, Guillaume Verdier, Patricia Barzyk, Pierre Léon, Roxane Arnal', null, 'Mrs. Géquil is an eccentric teacher despised by her colleagues and students. On a stormy night, she is struck by lightning and faints. When she wakes up, she feels different. Will she now be able to keep the powerful and dangerous Mrs. Hyde contained?', 'Mrs. Géquil is an eccentric teacher despised by her colleagues and students. On a stormy night, she is struck by lightning and faints. When she wakes up, she feels different. Will she now be able to keep the powerful and dangerous Mrs. Hyde contained?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGolRZ4pwq42wY45pbErEtLc3oO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446171'),
