  ('738273495968934685', 'Mrs. Miniver', 1942, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'William Wyler, Joseph Ruttenberg, Urie McCleary', 'Arthur Wimperis, George Froeschel, Claudine West', 'Greer Garson, Walter Pidgeon, Teresa Wright, May Whitty, Reginald Owen, Henry Travers, Richard Ney, Henry Wilcoxon', 'NR', 'Middle-class housewife Kay Miniver deals with petty problems. She and her husband Clem watch her Oxford-educated son Vin court Carol Beldon, the charming granddaughter of the local nobility as represented by Lady Beldon. Then the war comes and Vin joins the RAF.', 'Middle-class housewife Kay Miniver deals with petty problems. She and her husband Clem watch her Oxford-educated son Vin court Carol Beldon, the charming granddaughter of the local nobility as represented by Lady Beldon. Then the war comes and Vin joins the RAF.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjPjx6FTaoTussbqoLj6OYTtUyi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27367'),
  ('444634724155602146', 'Mrs. Miracle', 2009, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Michael M. Scott, Adam Sliwinski, Quincy Wheeler-Hendren', 'David Golden', 'Erin Karpluk, James Van Der Beek, Doris Roberts, Michael Strusievici, Valin Shinyei, Chelah Horsdal, Johannah Newmarch, Rikki Gagne', 'PG', 'Overwhelmed widower Seth Webster is searching for a housekeeper to help him with his unruly six year old twin sons. "Mrs. Miracle" mysteriously appears and quickly becomes an irreplaceable nanny, chef, friend... and matchmaker.', 'Overwhelmed widower Seth Webster is searching for a housekeeper to help him with his unruly six year old twin sons. "Mrs. Miracle" mysteriously appears and quickly becomes an irreplaceable nanny, chef, friend... and matchmaker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4bgbJqRaiDC8wSPQNzVtn4iEsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50506'),
  ('312805706446795663', 'Mrs. Parker and the Vicious Circle', 1994, 'Drama', 'Alan Rudolph, Leslie Grierson, Allan F. Nicholls', 'Randy Sue Coburn, Alan Rudolph', 'Jennifer Jason Leigh, Campbell Scott, Matthew Broderick, Peter Gallagher, Jennifer Beals, Andrew McCarthy, Wallace Shawn, Martha Plimpton', 'R', 'Dorothy Parker remembers the heyday of the Algonquin Round Table, a circle of friends whose barbed wit, like hers, was fueled by alcohol and flirted with despair.', 'Dorothy Parker remembers the heyday of the Algonquin Round Table, a circle of friends whose barbed wit, like hers, was fueled by alcohol and flirted with despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avTHiIim0Jm0rs4ehFLck8u3NFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23333'),
  ('1035020109205793300', 'Mrs. Parkington', 1944, 'Drama, Romance', 'McLean Nisbet, Douglas Shearer, Tay Garnett', 'Robert Thoeren, Polly James', 'Greer Garson, Walter Pidgeon, Edward Arnold, Agnes Moorehead, Cecil Kellaway, Gladys Cooper, Frances Rafferty, Tom Drake', 'NR', 'In this family saga, Mrs. Parkington recounts the story of her life, beginning as a hotel maid in frontier Nevada where she is swept off her feet by mine owner and financier Augustus Parkington. He moves them to New York, tries to remake her into a society woman, and establishes their home among the wealthiest of New York''s high society. Family and social life is not always peaceful, however, and she guides us, in flashbacks, through the rises and falls of the Parkington family fortunes.', 'In this family saga, Mrs. Parkington recounts the story of her life, beginning as a hotel maid in frontier Nevada where she is swept off her feet by mine owner and financier Augustus Parkington. He moves them to New York, tries to remake her into a society woman, and establishes their home among the wealthiest of New York''s high society. Family and social life is not always peaceful, however, and she guides us, in flashbacks, through the rises and falls of the Parkington family fortunes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8n8GuNuSBrm8PNHDxtLpVxZREwk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50066'),
  ('483732713366907133', 'Mrs. Salkim''s Diamonds', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tomris Giritlioğlu, Yavuz Türkeri, Ercan Yılmaz', 'Yılmaz Karakoyunlu', 'Zuhal Olcay, Hülya Avşar, Zafer Algöz, Kamran Usluer, Uğur Polat, Derya Alabora, Güven Kıraç, Murat Daltaban', null, 'During the period of the Wealth Tax, where many non-Muslims in Turkey were forced to pay higher taxes, often in an arbitrary and unrealistic way. Nimet and Durmuş migrate from Niğde to Istanbul and take shelter with Durmuş''s friend Bekir, who finds Durmuş a job at the inn. However, making a living by serving as a porter is not in line with Durmuş''s ambitions. He wants everything Halit Bey has, the inn owner. Halit Bey begins to dispose of his property in order to pay the tax stipulated to his beloved wife Nora, who was treated in a nursing home. Wealth Tax has begun to affect everyone''s destiny.', 'During the period of the Wealth Tax, where many non-Muslims in Turkey were forced to pay higher taxes, often in an arbitrary and unrealistic way. Nimet and Durmuş migrate from Niğde to Istanbul and take shelter with Durmuş''s friend Bekir, who finds Durmuş a job at the inn. However, making a living by serving as a porter is not in line with Durmuş''s ambitions. He wants everything Halit Bey has, the inn owner. Halit Bey begins to dispose of his property in order to pay the tax stipulated to his beloved wife Nora, who was treated in a nursing home. Wealth Tax has begun to affect everyone''s destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weMVwqegSgDHPmkmMfl9qmpZ7Dr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154513'),
  ('1062287812759385481', 'Mrs. Santa Claus', 1996, 'Family, Fantasy, Music, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Stephen M. Katz, Terry Hughes, Kevin Corcoran', 'Mark Saltzman', 'Angela Lansbury, Michael Jeter, Terrence Mann, Lynsey Bartilson, Bryan Murray, David Norona, Debra Wiseman, Charles Durning', 'G', 'Neglected by her husband during the pre-Christmas rush, Mrs. Claus takes the reindeer and sleigh out for a drive, only to end up stranded in the neighborhood of Manhattan''s Lower East Side.', 'Neglected by her husband during the pre-Christmas rush, Mrs. Claus takes the reindeer and sleigh out for a drive, only to end up stranded in the neighborhood of Manhattan''s Lower East Side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEEHeB51XrPufbyUoa0W208zT2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110433'),
  ('925213121187164143', 'Mrs. Serial Killer', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Shirish Kunder, Kiran Deohans, Ravi K. Chandran', null, 'Jacqueline Fernandez, Manoj Bajpayee, Mohit Raina, Darshan Jariwala, Zayn Marie Khan, Chanda Joshi, Deepak Arora', null, 'When her husband is framed and imprisoned for serial murders, a doting wife must perform a copycat murder, to prove her husband''s innocence.', 'When her husband is framed and imprisoned for serial murders, a doting wife must perform a copycat murder, to prove her husband''s innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peoHH5lZRlrDDZPrOY18RxQlmZ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601807'),
  ('937504472002129386', 'Mrs. Soffel', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gillian Armstrong, Russell Boyd, Richard Flower', 'Ron Nyswaner', 'Diane Keaton, Mel Gibson, Matthew Modine, Edward Herrmann, Trini Alvarado, Jennifer Dundas, Danny Corkill, Harley Cross', 'PG-13', 'Kate Soffel is married to a prison warden in Pittsburgh, and is the mother of their four children. Ed Biddle is a convicted murderer awaiting execution on death row with his brother Jack. When Kate meets Eddie through her Bible readings to the prisoners, she is drawn to him, and they pursue a clandestine relationship. She agrees to help the brothers escape, and begins a treacherous journey with them to freedom in Canada.', 'Kate Soffel is married to a prison warden in Pittsburgh, and is the mother of their four children. Ed Biddle is a convicted murderer awaiting execution on death row with his brother Jack. When Kate meets Eddie through her Bible readings to the prisoners, she is drawn to him, and they pursue a clandestine relationship. She agrees to help the brothers escape, and begins a treacherous journey with them to freedom in Canada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fT1HUPb74lAnDWyK0v5cBdYk6Qa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31955'),
  ('1029504272204537715', 'Mrs. Undercover', 2023, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Anushree Mehta, Abhimanyu Sengupta', 'Anushree Mehta', 'Radhika Apte, Sumeet Vyas, Rajesh Sharma, Saheb Chatterjee, Roshni Bhattacharyya, Indrasish Roy, Angana Roy, Laboni Sarkar', null, 'An ace undercover agent living as a middle-class housewife is assigned a task after a decade. How will she take down a serial killer targeting ambitious women with her rusty skills?', 'An ace undercover agent living as a middle-class housewife is assigned a task after a decade. How will she take down a serial killer targeting ambitious women with her rusty skills?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEKwOfgo3IMGNNGkDF0WJQtrmIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915865'),
  ('645691285921688850', 'Mrs. Winterbourne', 1996, 'Romance, Drama', 'Richard Benjamin, Alex Nepomniaschy', 'Phoef Sutton, Lisa-Maria Radano', 'Shirley MacLaine, Ricki Lake, Brendan Fraser, Miguel Sandoval, Loren Dean, Peter Gerety, Jane Krakowski, Debra Monk', 'PG-13', 'Connie Doyle is eighteen, pregnant and alone. She accidentally ends up on a train where she meets Hugh Winterbourne and his wife pregnant Patricia. The train wrecks and she wakes up in the hospital to find out that it''s been assumed that she''s Patricia. Hugh''s mother takes her in and she falls in love with Hugh''s brother Bill. Just when she thinks everything is going her way, her ex-boyfriend shows up.', 'Connie Doyle is eighteen, pregnant and alone. She accidentally ends up on a train where she meets Hugh Winterbourne and his wife pregnant Patricia. The train wrecks and she wakes up in the hospital to find out that it''s been assumed that she''s Patricia. Hugh''s mother takes her in and she falls in love with Hugh''s brother Bill. Just when she thinks everything is going her way, her ex-boyfriend shows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppHqVo9uAFZYMvRm9x0XUtnyQPR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40001'),
  ('596845785813627155', 'Ms .45', 1981, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Abel Ferrara, James Lemmo', 'Nicholas St. John', 'Zoë Lund, Albert Sinkys, Darlene Stuto, Abel Ferrara, Helen McGara, Editta Sherman, Stephen Singer, Jayne Kennedy', 'R', 'After being attacked and raped twice in one day, a timid, mute seamstress becomes a violent agent of revenge for wronged women.', 'After being attacked and raped twice in one day, a timid, mute seamstress becomes a violent agent of revenge for wronged women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ulPP8hcBjIrWRqeXsZVjL0uX3E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22171'),
  ('966237912385965133', 'Ms. Matched', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Mark Jean, Blaine Ackerly, Michael J. Bowman', 'Rich Tabach, Jennifer Barrow, Monica Parker', 'Alexa PenaVega, Shawn Roberts, Leah Gibson, Elise Gatien, Andrew Francis, Chris Shields, Laura Soltis, Michael P. Northey', null, 'A successful wedding planner is trying to make dreams come true for brides by organizing fairy tale weddings. But when she is paired with a financial advisor at a wedding expo, she soon realizes that he is giving the exact opposite advice to their audience by telling them to save their money. When they are forced to spend a lot of time together, they find out that they have more in common than they think.', 'A successful wedding planner is trying to make dreams come true for brides by organizing fairy tale weddings. But when she is paired with a financial advisor at a wedding expo, she soon realizes that he is giving the exact opposite advice to their audience by telling them to save their money. When they are forced to spend a lot of time together, they find out that they have more in common than they think.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwHex77VTvabkOlZWjAn3zVs1jO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393659'),
  ('239304562461542563', 'Ms. Pat: Y''all Wanna Hear Something Crazy?', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Robert Townsend', null, 'Patricia Williams', 'R', 'Ms. Pat finds laughter in the absurdities of parenting, pet lovers and very unfortunate lip trends as she unpacks a painful past with humor and honesty.', 'Ms. Pat finds laughter in the absurdities of parenting, pet lovers and very unfortunate lip trends as she unpacks a painful past with humor and honesty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3OUJLQshuKRP7tCz4X7tc5352.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927968'),
  ('536054383665279909', 'Ms. Scrooge', 1997, 'Drama, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'John Korty, Elemér Ragályi', 'John McGreevey', 'Cicely Tyson, Katherine Helmond, Michael Beach, John Bourgeois, Rae''Ven Larrymore Kelly, Karen Glave, Ken James, Arsinée Khanjian', 'G', 'Television movie updating Charles Dickens'' story, "A Christmas Carol." Businesswoman Ebenita Scrooge treats her employees and customers poorly. She has no time for Christmas or the holiday spirit. On Christmas Eve, she is visited by the ghost of her dead partner Maude Marley and then by other spirits who remind her of her happy past and chronicle the bitterness and greed that have taken over her life. At last, she is shown her own death and funeral. No one is there to mourn her. This revelation shocks her into opening her heart and her checkbook.', 'Television movie updating Charles Dickens'' story, "A Christmas Carol." Businesswoman Ebenita Scrooge treats her employees and customers poorly. She has no time for Christmas or the holiday spirit. On Christmas Eve, she is visited by the ghost of her dead partner Maude Marley and then by other spirits who remind her of her happy past and chronicle the bitterness and greed that have taken over her life. At last, she is shown her own death and funeral. No one is there to mourn her. This revelation shocks her into opening her heart and her checkbook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rW3Qo9qvWwsrvGFsJJqBfTA3riv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149187'),
  ('733913050166154241', 'MTV Unplugged: Julieta Venegas', 2008, 'Music', null, null, 'Julieta Venegas, Gustavo Santaolalla, Natalia Lafourcade, Mala Rodríguez, Marisa Monte', null, 'MTV Unplugged is the first live album recorded by Mexican singer-songwriter Julieta Venegas. The album features a selection of her greatest hits, along with new tracks, including the singles "El Presente" and "Algún Día". A handful of guest artists was included: Gustavo Santaolalla, Natalia Lafourcade, Marisa Monte and La Mala Rodríguez.', 'MTV Unplugged is the first live album recorded by Mexican singer-songwriter Julieta Venegas. The album features a selection of her greatest hits, along with new tracks, including the singles "El Presente" and "Algún Día". A handful of guest artists was included: Gustavo Santaolalla, Natalia Lafourcade, Marisa Monte and La Mala Rodríguez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMV7fkL9Gz1LTByKAq2ya12cWuF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31103'),
  ('1060672435079057022', 'Muay Thai Chaiya', 2007, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Sayombhu Mukdeeprom, Pramoon Somanavat, Pasiri Panya', 'Kongkiat Khomsiri, Yossapong Phonsup', 'Akara Amarttayakul, Sonthaya Chitmanee, J. Don Ferguson, Sangthong Keduthong, Thawatchai Phanpakdee, Parita Kongpetch, Prawit Kittichantheera, Wongtawan Cheewin', 'R', 'In a small town, Piak, Pao and Samor train under Pao''s father who is a Muay Thai fighter. However, fate leads them to Bangkok where Piak and Samor join the underworld while Pao becomes a boxer.', 'In a small town, Piak, Pao and Samor train under Pao''s father who is a Muay Thai fighter. However, fate leads them to Bangkok where Piak and Samor join the underworld while Pao becomes a boxer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o79kPSGDhl755PLyrSFQ7nwvG0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16726'),
