  ('562682005004618944', 'Muay Thai Warrior', 2010, 'Action, Drama', 'Nopporn Watin', 'Nopporn Watin', 'Seigi Ozeki, Sorapong Chatree, Winai Kraibutr, Buakaw Banchamek, Thammaros Jaichuen, Thanawut Ketsaro, Mukuda Hann, Yonthida Nakong', null, 'Based on a true historic figure, Yamada Nagamasa, a Japanese adventurer who went to Ayothaya in the 16th century and became a soldier in King Naresuan''s army. After the war in Burma it''s restless in Ayothaya, because of a mysterious group of men that terrorizes and plunders the city. Yamada goes after them and discovers that the men are rebelious Japanese samurai. Now he has to fight his own countrymen.', 'Based on a true historic figure, Yamada Nagamasa, a Japanese adventurer who went to Ayothaya in the 16th century and became a soldier in King Naresuan''s army. After the war in Burma it''s restless in Ayothaya, because of a mysterious group of men that terrorizes and plunders the city. Yamada goes after them and discovers that the men are rebelious Japanese samurai. Now he has to fight his own countrymen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYE4FkYFA73f933aPmfEQwz2Pkt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67327'),
  ('115247443088805713', 'Mubarakan', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Anees Bazmee, Himman Dhamija', 'Rupinder Chahal, Rajesh Chawla', 'Arjun Kapoor, Anil Kapoor, Ileana D''Cruz, Athiya Shetty, Neha Sharma, Rahul Dev, Karan Kundra, Ratna Pathak Shah', null, 'Singleton Kartar Singh is left with the responsibility of raising his two orphaned nephews. He asks his brother in Punjab to raise Charan and his sister in London to raise Karan. When the twins cross continents, they leave behind a trail of confusion.', 'Singleton Kartar Singh is left with the responsibility of raising his two orphaned nephews. He asks his brother in Punjab to raise Charan and his sister in London to raise Karan. When the twins cross continents, they leave behind a trail of confusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSqLPtE4fkn2wrpxlw5xXraHDNH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463063'),
  ('265431362633945791', 'Much Ado About Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Viorel Sergovici, Michael Damian', 'Janeen Damian, Michael Damian', 'Torrance Coombs, Susie Abromeit, Jacinta Mulcahy, James Rottger, Jimmy Townsend, Sakura Sykes, Olivier Raynal', 'G', 'Haley is a wealthy heiress known for her acts of kindness. Haley meets hopeless romantic Claud, and she keeps her wealthy family a secret. When Claud pitches an ad campaign to Haley''s mom and Haley''s secrets are revealed, things get...complicated.', 'Haley is a wealthy heiress known for her acts of kindness. Haley meets hopeless romantic Claud, and she keeps her wealthy family a secret. When Claud pitches an ad campaign to Haley''s mom and Haley''s secrets are revealed, things get...complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xK8H6giNmGTKBR1xC6Mg2Lnns3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878410'),
  ('389065096229762734', 'Much Ado About Mousing', 1964, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'When a bulldog tells Jerry to "just whistle" any time that he needs him, Tom''s in for big trouble until he puts earmuffs on the mutt.', 'When a bulldog tells Jerry to "just whistle" any time that he needs him, Tom''s in for big trouble until he puts earmuffs on the mutt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZWBYuH66EY6Hgvmbq9CLNfpMqC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223034'),
  ('1050254229755027965', 'Much Ado About Nothing', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Justin Muller, Christopher Newman, Carl Oprey', 'Kenneth Branagh', 'Emma Thompson, Kenneth Branagh, Kate Beckinsale, Denzel Washington, Michael Keaton, Keanu Reeves, Robert Sean Leonard, Richard Briers', 'PG-13', 'In this Shakespearean farce, Hero and her groom-to-be, Claudio, team up with Claudio''s commanding officer, Don Pedro, the week before their wedding to hatch a matchmaking scheme. Their targets are sharp-witted duo Benedick and Beatrice -- a tough task indeed, considering their corresponding distaste for love and each other. Meanwhile, meddling Don John plots to ruin the wedding.', 'In this Shakespearean farce, Hero and her groom-to-be, Claudio, team up with Claudio''s commanding officer, Don Pedro, the week before their wedding to hatch a matchmaking scheme. Their targets are sharp-witted duo Benedick and Beatrice -- a tough task indeed, considering their corresponding distaste for love and each other. Meanwhile, meddling Don John plots to ruin the wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvltGP6vYOkHdURag0jPSjhPUAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11971'),
  ('59571659967745922', 'Much Ado About Nothing', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Joss Whedon, Maileen Williams Matheny, Rachel Jensen', 'Joss Whedon', 'Amy Acker, Alexis Denisof, Nathan Fillion, Clark Gregg, Reed Diamond, Fran Kranz, Jillian Morgese, Sean Maher', 'PG-13', 'A modern retelling of Shakespeare''s classic comedy about two pairs of lovers with different takes on romance and a way with words.', 'A modern retelling of Shakespeare''s classic comedy about two pairs of lovers with different takes on romance and a way with words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDUEegV4P8odhUTjHE2e2kWMZo3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91739'),
  ('428605503607102928', 'Much Ado About Nothing', 2016, 'Drama', 'Alejandro Fernández Almendras, Inti Briones', 'Alejandro Fernández Almendras, Jerónimo Rodríguez', 'Agustín Silva, Paulina García, Luis Gnecco, Alejandro Goic, Daniel Alcaíno, Dindi Jane, Augusto Schuster, Samuel Landea', null, 'After a night of partying, Vicente is involved in a hit-and-run that kills a man. Vicente claims his innocence, but he was drunk and high. A tangled web of lies buries the truth, making a social scandal disappear — exonerating the real culprit, the son of a powerful politician.', 'After a night of partying, Vicente is involved in a hit-and-run that kills a man. Vicente claims his innocence, but he was drunk and high. A tangled web of lies buries the truth, making a social scandal disappear — exonerating the real culprit, the son of a powerful politician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sltBvNQGWY3Jnpecy4kbRxJ17v5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371465'),
