  ('765003073456173621', 'Mucha Lucha: The Return of El Malefico', 2005, 'Adventure, Animation, Action, Comedy, Family', 'Ron Hughart', 'Benjamin Townsend, Michael Ryan', 'Carlos Alazraqui, Kimberly Brooks, Candi Milo, Tim Curry, Benito Martinez, Penn Jillette, Héctor Elizondo, Kathleen Barr', 'G', 'The hit TV series boldy goes bigger in an action-packed comedy/adventure starring everyone''s favorite luchadoras! When the greatest evil the world has ever knows -El Malefico -surfaces from the dark recesses of Earth, it''s up to Rikochet, Buena Girl & The Flea to mask-wrestle him back! Their challenge begins with a quest around the globe for the artifacts of bueno-ness & ends in Las Vegas', 'The hit TV series boldy goes bigger in an action-packed comedy/adventure starring everyone''s favorite luchadoras! When the greatest evil the world has ever knows -El Malefico -surfaces from the dark recesses of Earth, it''s up to Rikochet, Buena Girl & The Flea to mask-wrestle him back! Their challenge begins with a quest around the globe for the artifacts of bueno-ness & ends in Las Vegas', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rKLz9X8ZOT6CJtf4jNpWYSVNPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410547'),
  ('982601887897506796', 'Mucha Sangre', 2003, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'Pepe de las Heras, Pablo Hernández Smith', 'Ramón Heres, Pepe de las Heras', 'Paul Naschy, Rodolfo Sancho, Txema Sandoval, Isabel del Toro, Julio Campos, Xoan Pérez, Carlos Aguado, Tatiana de Sarabia', null, 'Two fugitives try to stop an alien invasion that reproduce by sodomizing men.', 'Two fugitives try to stop an alien invasion that reproduce by sodomizing men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6N8iVSGOhfvQedKSsRUTEIzXKI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146537'),
