  ('1019237966843307548', 'Mucho Mouse', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Daws Butler, June Foray', 'NR', 'A Spanish cat is more interested in playing flamenco guitar than trying to catch the mouse El Magnifico (Jerry). Tom arrives from the States with world champion mouse-catching credentials to have a go.', 'A Spanish cat is more interested in playing flamenco guitar than trying to catch the mouse El Magnifico (Jerry). Tom arrives from the States with world champion mouse-catching credentials to have a go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zleMV13rcgSEj8ZTUbZ6N3Z5VEq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74002'),
  ('430851425364559410', 'Mucho Mucho Amor: The Legend of Walter Mercado', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Cristina Costantini, Kareem Tabsch, Eduardo Mariota', null, 'Walter Mercado, Willy Acosta, Lin-Manuel Miranda, Raul de Molina, Eugenio Derbez, Nydia Caro', null, 'Once the world''s most famous astrologer, Walter Mercado seeks to resurrect a forgotten legacy. Raised in the sugar cane fields of Puerto Rico, Walter grew up to become a gender non-conforming, cape-wearing psychic whose televised horoscopes reached 120 million viewers a day for decades before he mysteriously disappeared.', 'Once the world''s most famous astrologer, Walter Mercado seeks to resurrect a forgotten legacy. Raised in the sugar cane fields of Puerto Rico, Walter grew up to become a gender non-conforming, cape-wearing psychic whose televised horoscopes reached 120 million viewers a day for decades before he mysteriously disappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKwNuRdEWqZ94VXMbXjZHAANbvO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653735'),
  ('1129951346875349953', 'Muck', 2015, 'Horror', 'Amanda Szot, Patrick Lawler, Austin Murray', 'Steve Wolsh', 'Lachlan Buchanan, Stephanie Danielson, Puja Mohindra, Bryce Draper, Laura Jacobs, Grant Alan Ouzts, Lauren Francesca, Jaclyn Swedberg', 'NR', 'A group of friends emerge from the darkness, bloody and lucky to be alive. Having already lost two friends in the marsh, they break into an empty vacation house to take shelter. Whatever was in the marsh is still after them, but it''s not the only thing that wants them dead. Something much worse and more savage lays in wait.', 'A group of friends emerge from the darkness, bloody and lucky to be alive. Having already lost two friends in the marsh, they break into an empty vacation house to take shelter. Whatever was in the marsh is still after them, but it''s not the only thing that wants them dead. Something much worse and more savage lays in wait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPYH46Qtc85jeeicjAg4hyL8uC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256030'),
  ('928832979480282697', 'Mud', 2013, 'Drama', 'Jeff Nichols, Adam Stone, Hope Garrison', 'Jeff Nichols', 'Matthew McConaughey, Reese Witherspoon, Tye Sheridan, Jacob Lofland, Sam Shepard, Ray McKinnon, Sarah Paulson, Michael Shannon', 'PG-13', 'Two teenage boys find a fugitive hiding out on an island in the Mississippi River and help him reunite with his lover and escape an avenging family and their armed posse.', 'Two teenage boys find a fugitive hiding out on an island in the Mississippi River and help him reunite with his lover and escape an avenging family and their armed posse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2jT5jQdKh1HAF0fMKuGwBOwOYB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103731'),
  ('1039984405380990263', 'Mud and Sand', 1922, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Gilbert Pratt, Scott Pembroke', 'Tom Miranda', 'Stan Laurel, Leona Anderson, Wheeler Dryden, Sam Kaufman, Mae Laurel, Julie Leonard', null, 'Rhubarb Vaselino lives in a small village, when he and his friend, Sapo, enter a bullfighting contest, Sapo dies, but Rhubarb kills three bulls and becomes a local hero earning money. Two years later, he is living in Madrid as a national hero , when he becomes involved with Filet de Sol, and his lover finds out, he must fight the most deadliest in Spain, in the last bull fight of the season.', 'Rhubarb Vaselino lives in a small village, when he and his friend, Sapo, enter a bullfighting contest, Sapo dies, but Rhubarb kills three bulls and becomes a local hero earning money. Two years later, he is living in Madrid as a national hero , when he becomes involved with Filet de Sol, and his lover finds out, he must fight the most deadliest in Spain, in the last bull fight of the season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6c4pVGDQ9Oyw1EgdYCQhC0AuJfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107298'),
  ('312685107901209564', 'Mud Zombies', 2008, 'Horror', 'Rodrigo Aragão', 'Rodrigo Aragão', 'Walderrama dos Santos, Kika de Oliveira, Markus Konká, Ricardo Araújo, Marcelo Castanheira, André Lobo, Antônio Lâmego, Maurício Ribeiro', null, 'In a polluted mangrove swamp, dead bodies raise during the night, attacking and biting the dwellers that transform into aggressive zombies. Local fisherman Luís fights against the monsters to survive and save the lives of those around him.', 'In a polluted mangrove swamp, dead bodies raise during the night, attacking and biting the dwellers that transform into aggressive zombies. Local fisherman Luís fights against the monsters to survive and save the lives of those around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDNHKglCTXfiwzYgagwKVVep06h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135561'),
  ('368239766602599804', 'Mudborn', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Shieh Meng-ju, Chen Chi-wen', 'Huang Yen-chiao', 'Tony Yang, Cecilia Choi, Derek Chang, Tracy Chou, Puff Kuo, Chen Wei-min, Li Kuan-yi, Mountain Kao', null, 'Xu Chuan, who works at a game company, accidentally brings home a broken clay doll from a haunted house while developing a new horror VR game. Unexpectedly, his pregnant wife, Mu Hua, a cultural relic restorer, develops an obsession with the doll and relentlessly tries to repair it. As strange things begin to happen in the house, Mu Hua''s condition deteriorates, and Xu Chuan, at his wits'' end, seeks help from a spiritual medium, A Sheng. Meanwhile, the horrifying secret hidden behind the clay doll begins to surface.', 'Xu Chuan, who works at a game company, accidentally brings home a broken clay doll from a haunted house while developing a new horror VR game. Unexpectedly, his pregnant wife, Mu Hua, a cultural relic restorer, develops an obsession with the doll and relentlessly tries to repair it. As strange things begin to happen in the house, Mu Hua''s condition deteriorates, and Xu Chuan, at his wits'' end, seeks help from a spiritual medium, A Sheng. Meanwhile, the horrifying secret hidden behind the clay doll begins to surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifYNeKwpyKUTtjkUExrqTc65L2p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1526650'),
  ('692571768273320647', 'Mudbound', 2017, 'Drama', 'Dee Rees, Rachel Morrison', 'Virgil Williams, Dee Rees', 'Carey Mulligan, Jason Clarke, Jason Mitchell, Mary J. Blige, Garrett Hedlund, Rob Morgan, Jonathan Banks, Kelvin Harrison Jr.', 'R', 'In the post–World War II South, two families are pitted against a barbaric social hierarchy and an unrelenting landscape as they simultaneously fight the battle at home and the battle abroad.', 'In the post–World War II South, two families are pitted against a barbaric social hierarchy and an unrelenting landscape as they simultaneously fight the battle at home and the battle abroad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tf21kSKepMOlnorszWaiFwksKU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414425'),
  ('47514410709069289', 'Muddy River', 1981, 'Drama', 'Kōhei Oguri, Shōhei Andō', 'Takako Shigemori', 'Takahiro Tamura, Mariko Kaga, Nobutaka Asahara, Makiko Shibata, Minoru Sakurai, Yumiko Fujita, Gannosuke Ashiya, Keizo Kanie', null, 'Two boys, whose parents ply their trade by the mouth of a muddy river in Osaka, become close friends.', 'Two boys, whose parents ply their trade by the mouth of a muddy river in Osaka, become close friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kphzFilVevDJjZgZM0mDEnH3vj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125257'),
  ('1028512601905359458', 'Mudhalvan', 1999, 'Thriller', 'Shankar, K. V. Anand, S. P. Hosimin', 'Sujatha Rangarajan', 'Arjun Sarja, Raghuvaran, Manisha Koirala, Manivannan, Vadivelu, Laila, Kalairani, Vijayakumar', null, 'A man accepts a challenge to act as the Chief Minister for one day only, and makes such a success of it that soon he is embroiled in political intrigue.', 'A man accepts a challenge to act as the Chief Minister for one day only, and makes such a success of it that soon he is embroiled in political intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k69lNVmDJcLLJb4LBCk3L2yv4Vw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66526'),
  ('127048797802844451', 'Mudhoney', 1965, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Walter Schenk, Russ Meyer', 'W.E. Sprague', 'Hal Hopper, Antoinette Cristiani, John Furlong, Rena Horten, Princess Livingston, Lorna Maitland, Sam Hanna, Stuart Lancaster', null, 'In this Depression-era tale, Calef is traveling from Michigan to California and stops in Spooner, Missouri, where Lute hires him for odd jobs. Calef gets involved with Lute''s niece, Hannah. But she is married to Sidney, a wife-beating drunk who hopes to inherit his uncle-in-law''s money. Sidney and an eccentric preacher plot against Calef, who finds it difficult to conceal his mysterious past and his growing affection for Sidney''s wife.', 'In this Depression-era tale, Calef is traveling from Michigan to California and stops in Spooner, Missouri, where Lute hires him for odd jobs. Calef gets involved with Lute''s niece, Hannah. But she is married to Sidney, a wife-beating drunk who hopes to inherit his uncle-in-law''s money. Sidney and an eccentric preacher plot against Calef, who finds it difficult to conceal his mysterious past and his growing affection for Sidney''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iHie5qpBGrYpoC8ypN2m4PkPDe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5719'),
  ('168552434800277306', 'Mudstained Flower', 2011, 'Drama', 'Hugo Espinosa, Guillermo Gonzalez', 'Guillermo Gonzalez', 'Odiseo Bichir, Claudia Ramírez, Javier Escobar, Claudia Zepeda, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Yolanda Liévana, Isabel Martínez ''La Tarabilla'', Iñaki Goci', null, 'A married, middle-aged well-known biochemist and university teacher Augusto, leaves his wife, his job and the comfort of his life to go after Marlene, a 14-year-old teenager with extraordinary beauty who burst into his life unexpectedly. One day, Marlene is taken from the custody of Augustus by Genaro, a psychotic sailor, who seduces and finally kidnaps her by taking to the ominous port of Tampico, where Augustus will seek her to try to free her, not without giving her life to pain and atonement, undergoing a deep personal transformation.', 'A married, middle-aged well-known biochemist and university teacher Augusto, leaves his wife, his job and the comfort of his life to go after Marlene, a 14-year-old teenager with extraordinary beauty who burst into his life unexpectedly. One day, Marlene is taken from the custody of Augustus by Genaro, a psychotic sailor, who seduces and finally kidnaps her by taking to the ominous port of Tampico, where Augustus will seek her to try to free her, not without giving her life to pain and atonement, undergoing a deep personal transformation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4P76k2ResETGGcC1BiVPYp2IwUm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145204'),
  ('566601707527001189', 'Mufasa: The Lion King', 2024, 'Adventure, Family, Animation', 'Barry Jenkins, James Laxton, Dan Webster', 'Jeff Nathanson', 'Aaron Pierre, Kelvin Harrison Jr., Tiffany Boone, Kagiso Lediga, Preston Nyman, Blue Ivy Carter, John Kani, Mads Mikkelsen', 'PG', 'Mufasa, a cub lost and alone, meets a sympathetic lion named Taka, the heir to a royal bloodline. The chance meeting sets in motion an expansive journey of a group of misfits searching for their destiny.', 'Mufasa, a cub lost and alone, meets a sympathetic lion named Taka, the heir to a royal bloodline. The chance meeting sets in motion an expansive journey of a group of misfits searching for their destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bXHaLlsFYpJUutg4E6WXAjaxDi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762509'),
  ('604930413728367519', 'Mug', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Małgorzata Szumowska, Hubert Koprowicz, Monika Lewicka', 'Michał Englert, Małgorzata Szumowska', 'Mateusz Kościukiewicz, Agnieszka Podsiadlik, Małgorzata Gorol, Anna Tomaszewska, Dariusz Chojnacki, Robert Talarczyk, Roman Gancarczyk, Iwona Bielska', null, 'After fun-loving metalhead Jacek is disfigured in an accident at work, he becomes the first person in Poland to receive a face transplant. This leads to his status as a media spectacle and martyr, all while battling ensuing identity issues as a consequence.', 'After fun-loving metalhead Jacek is disfigured in an accident at work, he becomes the first person in Poland to receive a face transplant. This leads to his status as a media spectacle and martyr, all while battling ensuing identity issues as a consequence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sW2rRiBILysssCl14MLEuUQiXwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444400'),
  ('636643158309881553', 'Muganga', 2025, 'History, Drama', 'Marie-Hélène Roux, Renaud Chassaing, Demba Dieye', 'Marie-Hélène Roux, Jean-René Lemoine', 'Isaach de Bankolé, Vincent Macaigne, Manon Bresch, Babetida Sadjo, Déborah Lukumuena, Joely Mbundu, Yves-Marina Gnahoua, Soliane Moisset', null, 'Denis Mukwege, a Congolese doctor, pastor and future Nobel Peace Prize laureate, meets Guy Cadière, a Belgian surgeon and atheist. Despite their differences, they unite for a common purpose: to restore the bodies and dignity of thousands of women who have been used as weapons of war in the eastern Democratic Republic of Congo.', 'Denis Mukwege, a Congolese doctor, pastor and future Nobel Peace Prize laureate, meets Guy Cadière, a Belgian surgeon and atheist. Despite their differences, they unite for a common purpose: to restore the bodies and dignity of thousands of women who have been used as weapons of war in the eastern Democratic Republic of Congo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVnjMOp0IrWgdvZfmkugIn5mQY7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000169'),
  ('977749682419897057', 'Mughal-e-Azam', 1960, 'Drama, Romance', 'K. Asif, R.D. Mathur', 'K. Asif', 'Dilip Kumar, Prithviraj Kapoor, Madhubala, Durga Khote, Nigar Sultana, Ajit Khan, Murad, Jillo', null, 'In the 16th century, when Prince Salim falls in love with a beautiful courtesan named Anarkali, Emperor Akbar''s disapproval leads to a battle between father and son.', 'In the 16th century, when Prince Salim falls in love with a beautiful courtesan named Anarkali, Emperor Akbar''s disapproval leads to a battle between father and son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKfNZUh9CRp1EHjxgNGtrbvm55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44519'),
  ('397302738181891509', 'Muhammad Ali, the Greatest', 1974, 'Documentary', 'William Klein, William Klein, Étienne Becker', null, 'Muhammad Ali, Sonny Liston, George Foreman, Malcolm X, John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison, Ringo Starr', null, 'Universally accepted as a true icon of the 20th century, Muhammad Ali’s phenomenal achievements spanned sport, politics and religion. One man – photographer William Klein had comprehensive access to the events that shaped Ali’s legend. In 1964, the young gregarious Cassius Clay successfully defeated the seemingly invincible Heavyweight Champion of the World Sonny Liston – the manner of Clay’s victory and his amazing persona made him an instant superstar. Through this incredible period, and Clay’s subsequent rematches with Liston, William Klein enjoyed unrivalled access top Clay’s camp – witnessing at first hand Cassius Clay becoming Muhammad Ali and angering the American people with his allegiance to Islam. Forward to Zaire 1974, and the return of Muhammad Ali to the world stage to face another invincible champion George Foreman. As Ali reclaimed the crown for a second time, Klein was ever present, capturing the full story at close quarter.', 'Universally accepted as a true icon of the 20th century, Muhammad Ali’s phenomenal achievements spanned sport, politics and religion. One man – photographer William Klein had comprehensive access to the events that shaped Ali’s legend. In 1964, the young gregarious Cassius Clay successfully defeated the seemingly invincible Heavyweight Champion of the World Sonny Liston – the manner of Clay’s victory and his amazing persona made him an instant superstar. Through this incredible period, and Clay’s subsequent rematches with Liston, William Klein enjoyed unrivalled access top Clay’s camp – witnessing at first hand Cassius Clay becoming Muhammad Ali and angering the American people with his allegiance to Islam. Forward to Zaire 1974, and the return of Muhammad Ali to the world stage to face another invincible champion George Foreman. As Ali reclaimed the crown for a second time, Klein was ever present, capturing the full story at close quarter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14I1cwt6Mbnr5oDUhwdfWyKUHmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29211'),
