  ('972014607362192810', 'Mujhe Kucch Kehna Hai', 2001, 'Romance', 'Satish Kaushik', 'Rumi Jaffery', 'Kareena Kapoor Khan, Tusshar Kapoor, Amrish Puri, Rinke Khanna, Dalip Tahil, Himani Shivpuri, Alok Nath, Vrajesh Hirjee', null, 'Karan who is weak in his studies but good at music and masti which always results in fighting with his father, but his life changes when he sees the girl of his dreams. Everywhere he sees her he follows her but one day he goes out of town to find her but couldn''t. Later his father sents him to another city but his car breaks down and takes lift and finds it''s the same girl whos name is Pooja.', 'Karan who is weak in his studies but good at music and masti which always results in fighting with his father, but his life changes when he sees the girl of his dreams. Everywhere he sees her he follows her but one day he goes out of town to find her but couldn''t. Later his father sents him to another city but his car breaks down and takes lift and finds it''s the same girl whos name is Pooja.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2YYZYm5NAKTI4cNfl3dgt3HBfo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210068'),
