  ('872048939751379914', 'Mulheres Alteradas', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Luis Pinheiro', 'Caco Galhardo', 'Deborah Secco, Alessandra Negrini, Monica Iozzi, Maria Casadevall, Sérgio Guizé, Daniel Boaventura, Augusto Madeira, Patrícya Travassos', null, 'Leandra is in her mid-30s: she wants to get married and have children, but she does not have a boyfriend. Her sister, Sonia, is married and has two children, but all she wants is a night of fun with her best friend, Marinati - a workaholic lawyer who went to fall in love just when her career is on the rise. Marinati is Keka''s boss, who is looking forward to the trip she''s scheduled to save her marriage.', 'Leandra is in her mid-30s: she wants to get married and have children, but she does not have a boyfriend. Her sister, Sonia, is married and has two children, but all she wants is a night of fun with her best friend, Marinati - a workaholic lawyer who went to fall in love just when her career is on the rise. Marinati is Keka''s boss, who is looking forward to the trip she''s scheduled to save her marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAr7nb3c0Ps9WmBgkgcHTsOScdy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522168'),
  ('829553996442218782', 'Mulholland Drive', 2001, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'David Lynch, Peter Deming, John T. Churchill', 'David Lynch', 'Naomi Watts, Laura Harring, Justin Theroux, Ann Miller, Mark Pellegrino, Robert Forster, Dan Hedaya, Angelo Badalamenti', 'R', 'Blonde Betty Elms has only just arrived in Hollywood to become a movie star when she meets an enigmatic brunette with amnesia. Meanwhile, as the two set off to solve the second woman''s identity, filmmaker Adam Kesher runs into ominous trouble while casting his latest project.', 'Blonde Betty Elms has only just arrived in Hollywood to become a movie star when she meets an enigmatic brunette with amnesia. Meanwhile, as the two set off to solve the second woman''s identity, filmmaker Adam Kesher runs into ominous trouble while casting his latest project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7A59t6ySylr1L7aubOQEA480vM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018'),
  ('452715530564255250', 'Mulholland Falls', 1996, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Lee Tamahori, Haskell Wexler', 'Peter Dexter', 'Nick Nolte, Melanie Griffith, Chazz Palminteri, Michael Madsen, Chris Penn, Treat Williams, Jennifer Connelly, Daniel Baldwin', 'R', 'In 1950s Los Angeles, a special crime squad of the LAPD investigates the murder of a young woman.', 'In 1950s Los Angeles, a special crime squad of the LAPD investigates the murder of a young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tT5rYDXloX5ZxISr8HdlRC9TBcP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10990'),
  ('770359430343514900', 'Mulk', 2018, 'Drama', 'Anubhav Sinha, Ewan Mulligan, Vikhyaat Sareen', 'Anubhav Sinha', 'Rishi Kapoor, Taapsee Pannu, Prateik Smita Patil, Rajat Kapoor, Ashutosh Rana, Manoj Pahwa, Neena Gupta, Kumud Mishra', null, 'The youngest son of a Muslim family settled in Benaras gets involved in terrorist activities, leading to a bomb blast massacre. His actions have an adverse effect on the family who are left to defend themselves as people who are innocent and not anti-nationals.', 'The youngest son of a Muslim family settled in Benaras gets involved in terrorist activities, leading to a bomb blast massacre. His actions have an adverse effect on the family who are left to defend themselves as people who are innocent and not anti-nationals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ylI1irPUIn0sz0f8I3Z2QtbJ24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526090'),
  ('925125597183382470', 'Müllers Büro', 1986, 'Comedy, Crime, Music', 'Niki List, Hans Selikovsky', 'Niki List', 'Christian Schmidt, Andreas Vitásek, Barbara Rudnik, Sue Tauber, Maxi Sukopp, Gaby Hift, Jochen Brockmann, I Stangl', null, 'Musical film-noir parody about Max Müller, an underemployed private detective who is asked by his beautiful but secretive client, Ingrid Bergmann to look for her disappeared fiancé. Together with his assistant Larry he combs the underworld and little by little it becomes clear that his mysterious client is not what she seems to be.', 'Musical film-noir parody about Max Müller, an underemployed private detective who is asked by his beautiful but secretive client, Ingrid Bergmann to look for her disappeared fiancé. Together with his assistant Larry he combs the underworld and little by little it becomes clear that his mysterious client is not what she seems to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sB9A8ztFsbvJeULr4v4I83V4zdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15480'),
  ('423668668448972627', 'Mulligans', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chip Hale, Alice Brooks', 'Charlie David', 'Dan Payne, Thea Gill, Charlie David, Derek Baynham, Grace Vukovic, Amy Matysio, Nhi Do, Anthony Joseph', null, 'When Tyler Davidson brings his college buddy Chase home for the summer holidays a secret is revealed that threatens to tear his perfect family apart.', 'When Tyler Davidson brings his college buddy Chase home for the summer holidays a secret is revealed that threatens to tear his perfect family apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSG9CXgY2FrM92AqdeX6BnphaFX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20033'),
  ('668917133635511199', 'Multi-Facial', 1995, 'Drama', 'Vin Diesel', 'Vin Diesel', 'Vin Diesel, Lewis Steidl, Cara Gaffen, Phillip Jones, Ivan Jordain, F. Valentino Morales, Erik Stephen, Ruth Otero', null, 'Through a series of auditions, a young actor in New York City struggles with his identity.', 'Through a series of auditions, a young actor in New York City struggles with his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1melBmMjFRCnnh8hiqn9aHyq4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15803'),
  ('918352968918198922', 'Multiple Maniacs', 1970, 'Crime, Comedy, Horror', 'John Waters, John Waters', 'John Waters', 'Divine, David Lochary, Mary Vivian Pearce, Mink Stole, Cookie Mueller, Edith Massey, Susan Lowe, Rick Morrow', null, 'The Cavalcade of Perversion, a traveling freak show, acts as a front for Divine, who is out for blood after discovering her lover''s affair.', 'The Cavalcade of Perversion, a traveling freak show, acts as a front for Divine, who is out for blood after discovering her lover''s affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pro4OiTibouFxb6O5GhddSUImI7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25625'),
  ('200418136498306750', 'Multiple SIDosis', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Sid Laverents', null, 'Sid Laverents, Adelaide Laverents', null, 'Short film utilizing quick cuts and multiple angles of a one-man-band musical performance by Sid Lavarents (who served as both film-maker and musician). Added to the National Film Registry, Library of Congress for 2000.', 'Short film utilizing quick cuts and multiple angles of a one-man-band musical performance by Sid Lavarents (who served as both film-maker and musician). Added to the National Film Registry, Library of Congress for 2000.', null, 'tmdb:movie:147307'),
  ('1076114821750786899', 'Multiplicity', 1996, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'László Kovács, Harold Ramis, Michael Haley', 'Lowell Ganz, Mary Hale, Chris Miller', 'Michael Keaton, Andie MacDowell, Harris Yulin, Eugene Levy, Zack Duhame, Katie Schlossberg, Richard Masur, Ann Cusack', 'PG-13', 'Construction worker Doug Kinney finds that the pressures of his working life, combined with his duties to his wife Laura and daughter Jennifer leaves him with little time for himself. However, he is approached by geneticist Dr. Owen Leeds, who offers Doug a rather unusual solution to his problems: cloning.', 'Construction worker Doug Kinney finds that the pressures of his working life, combined with his duties to his wife Laura and daughter Jennifer leaves him with little time for himself. However, he is approached by geneticist Dr. Owen Leeds, who offers Doug a rather unusual solution to his problems: cloning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlG2vi85uSEwWigVTtqDecVFTxR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9304'),
  ('621665488176015005', 'Multishow ao Vivo: Ivete no Maracanã', 2007, 'Music, TV Movie', 'Joana Mazzucchelli', null, 'Ivete Sangalo, Alejandro Sanz, Saulo Fernandes, Durval Lélys, Samuel Rosa, Buchecha', null, 'This Ivete Sangalo concert at Rio de Janeiro''s legendary Maracanã Stadium, and the subsequent DVD/CD releases, constituted the year''s main event in Brazilian pop music. Sangalo rose to fame with the axé band Banda Eva, and since 1999 has embarked on an unstoppable solo career, making her the undisputed queen of pop in Brazil in terms of sales and popularity, as well as gathering countless industry and society awards. Accordingly, Sangalo put on a show at the Maracanã that should leave no one envious of the megaconcerts offered in Rio by Madonna, Michael Jackson, and the Rolling Stones. Alternating some of her many hits with new songs or new versions of old material, Sangalo burns through the set with her characteristic enthusiasm and infectious star magnetism, incessantly cheered on by an adoring audience of 55,000. The album has sold over 800,000 copies in Brazil (being certified Diamond), and features the single "Deixo". Recorded on December 16, 2006.', 'This Ivete Sangalo concert at Rio de Janeiro''s legendary Maracanã Stadium, and the subsequent DVD/CD releases, constituted the year''s main event in Brazilian pop music. Sangalo rose to fame with the axé band Banda Eva, and since 1999 has embarked on an unstoppable solo career, making her the undisputed queen of pop in Brazil in terms of sales and popularity, as well as gathering countless industry and society awards. Accordingly, Sangalo put on a show at the Maracanã that should leave no one envious of the megaconcerts offered in Rio by Madonna, Michael Jackson, and the Rolling Stones. Alternating some of her many hits with new songs or new versions of old material, Sangalo burns through the set with her characteristic enthusiasm and infectious star magnetism, incessantly cheered on by an adoring audience of 55,000. The album has sold over 800,000 copies in Brazil (being certified Diamond), and features the single "Deixo". Recorded on December 16, 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Vbpdv6vYNsytQdFnip2yNBhujF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63445'),
  ('812600130561412048', 'Multiverse', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 'Gaurav Seth', 'Doug Taylor', 'Paloma Kwiatkowski, Munro Chambers, Marlee Matlin, Robert Naylor, Sandra Mae Frank, Shauna Black', 'R', 'Four brilliant university students are forced to confront themselves in terrifying ways when their Quantum Physics experiment leads to an entangled parallel existence that leaves them questioning who they are and what is real.', 'Four brilliant university students are forced to confront themselves in terrifying ways when their Quantum Physics experiment leads to an entangled parallel existence that leaves them questioning who they are and what is real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMhWb00KXwnYbneENxImQslRzUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660833'),
  ('807127962580988815', 'Mum & Dad', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Steven Sheil, Jonathan Bloom', 'Steven Sheil', 'Perry Benson, Dido Miles, Olga Fedori, Ainsley Howard, Toby Alexander, Chris Roebuck, Clare Dyer, Art Fox', 'NR', 'Mum and Dad, and their ''adopted'' children, Birdie & Elbie, work at the airport. The family live off whatever they scavenge from cargo holds, offices and hotels - including a steady stream of transient workers who populate the airport''s soulless hub. When Lena, a young Polish office cleaner, is befriended by Birdie, she gets drawn into a nightmarish world of torture, murder and perversity.', 'Mum and Dad, and their ''adopted'' children, Birdie & Elbie, work at the airport. The family live off whatever they scavenge from cargo holds, offices and hotels - including a steady stream of transient workers who populate the airport''s soulless hub. When Lena, a young Polish office cleaner, is befriended by Birdie, she gets drawn into a nightmarish world of torture, murder and perversity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sroY1g3UzeUnGMOQJysCoVpgNxB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19197'),
  ('505046183691237539', 'Mum Is Wrong', 2016, 'Drama', 'Laurent Brunet, Marc Fitoussi', 'Marc Fitoussi', 'Jeanne Jestin, Émilie Dequenne, Annie Grégorio, Camille Chamoux, Nelly Antignac, Jean-François Cayrey, Joshua Mazé, Louvia Bachelier', null, 'Do we really know our parents? Fourteen-year-old Anouk suddenly discovers another side to her mother during an observation workshop that she carries out in the insurance company where her mother works. An immersion week in the company''s adult world, with its little compromises and many cowardly acts, which soon put a seal on her young life. Between an initiation, rift, and assuming responsibility for the first time, the experience is a form of adieu to childhood.', 'Do we really know our parents? Fourteen-year-old Anouk suddenly discovers another side to her mother during an observation workshop that she carries out in the insurance company where her mother works. An immersion week in the company''s adult world, with its little compromises and many cowardly acts, which soon put a seal on her young life. Between an initiation, rift, and assuming responsibility for the first time, the experience is a form of adieu to childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cj44bgNxUx9YtJdpzuXyP8J47Pk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424505'),
  ('785750026786139408', 'Mumbai Meri Jaan', 2008, 'Drama', 'Nishikant Kamat', 'Yogesh Vinayak Joshi, Upendra Sidhaye', 'Paresh Rawal, Irrfan Khan, Kay Kay Menon, R. Madhavan, Soha Ali Khan, Santosh Juvekar, Kavin Dave, Rajesh Bhosle', null, 'Shortly after 1800 hours, 11 July 2006, Mumbai was shattered by seven bomb blasts on Western Railway stations: Matunga, Mahim, Khar, Bandra, Jogeshwari, Borivali, and Bhayandar. It took the Police and ambulance over an hour to attend at various sites. This incident changes lives of Thomas, originally from Chennai, who sells tea from his bike; Rupali Joshi, a TV News reporter, who has to deal with the death of her to-be spouse, Ajay Kumar Pradhan; Suresh, in debt, starts to suspect all Muslims, especially Yusuf; Inspector Tukaram Patil, about to retire, goes about collecting bribes as usual, much to the chagrin of his embittered, honest and soon to-be suspended subordinate, Sunil Kadam; while Nikhil Agarwal, a Nationalist and environmentalist, debates whether he should re-locate to the United States, along with his pregnant wife, Sejal.', 'Shortly after 1800 hours, 11 July 2006, Mumbai was shattered by seven bomb blasts on Western Railway stations: Matunga, Mahim, Khar, Bandra, Jogeshwari, Borivali, and Bhayandar. It took the Police and ambulance over an hour to attend at various sites. This incident changes lives of Thomas, originally from Chennai, who sells tea from his bike; Rupali Joshi, a TV News reporter, who has to deal with the death of her to-be spouse, Ajay Kumar Pradhan; Suresh, in debt, starts to suspect all Muslims, especially Yusuf; Inspector Tukaram Patil, about to retire, goes about collecting bribes as usual, much to the chagrin of his embittered, honest and soon to-be suspended subordinate, Sunil Kadam; while Nikhil Agarwal, a Nationalist and environmentalist, debates whether he should re-locate to the United States, along with his pregnant wife, Sejal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzxh642LtRJLpCksGjCdUk9aiIk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16537'),
  ('340157469129247698', 'Mumbai Police', 2013, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Rosshan Andrrews, R. Diwakaran', 'Sanjay, Bobby', 'Prithviraj Sukumaran, Jayasurya, Rahman, Aparna Nair, Hima Davis, Deepa Rahul Ishwar, Kunchan, Rohit Vijayan', null, 'ACP Antony Moses is on the verge of uncovering his friend’s murderer when an accident leaves him with partial memory loss. Reassigned to the same case, he must retrace his own forgotten steps to uncover a truth more shocking than he imagined.', 'ACP Antony Moses is on the verge of uncovering his friend’s murderer when an accident leaves him with partial memory loss. Reassigned to the same case, he must retrace his own forgotten steps to uncover a truth more shocking than he imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19hI3Qw95irArEoHh5gKTzuhtFV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190945'),
  ('1011648873976646506', 'Mumbai Saga', 2021, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Sanjay Gupta, Ayananka Bose, Arivumani', 'Sanjay Gupta', 'John Abraham, Emraan Hashmi, Suniel Shetty, Kajal Aggarwal, Prateik Smita Patil, Gulshan Grover, Amole Gupte, Rohit Roy', null, 'The film, set in the 1980s and 90s, chronicles the transformation of Bombay to Mumbai. The story is a cat and mouse game between a deadly don, Amartya Rao, who doesn’t think twice before killing, and there’s nobody who could stop him and a cop, who is dogging his every step.', 'The film, set in the 1980s and 90s, chronicles the transformation of Bombay to Mumbai. The story is a cat and mouse game between a deadly don, Amartya Rao, who doesn’t think twice before killing, and there’s nobody who could stop him and a cop, who is dogging his every step.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xTtLkGEmUD5Oqjsv3lrkeLr2NW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608746'),
  ('637576915251638095', 'Mumford', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Lawrence Kasdan, Ericson Core', 'Lawrence Kasdan', 'Loren Dean, Hope Davis, Jason Lee, Alfre Woodard, Zooey Deschanel, Mary McDonnell, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Martin Short', 'R', 'When a would-be psychologist, curiously named Dr. Mumford, comes to the idyllic town of the same name and offers his talent for listening and a disarming frankness, the town''s quirkiest citizens scramble for a seat on his couch. As he lightens hearts darkened by old secrets no one realizes he''s hiding a whopper of his own, or that he''s fallen head over heels for one of his patients!', 'When a would-be psychologist, curiously named Dr. Mumford, comes to the idyllic town of the same name and offers his talent for listening and a disarming frankness, the town''s quirkiest citizens scramble for a seat on his couch. As he lightens hearts darkened by old secrets no one realizes he''s hiding a whopper of his own, or that he''s fallen head over heels for one of his patients!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2uqenG3BZICDrcrr49IZwoHA8Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24071'),
  ('88077979010770543', 'Mummies', 2023, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Juan Jesús García Galocha', 'Javier López Barreira, Jordi Gasull', 'Óscar Barberán, Ana Esther Alborg, Luis Pérez Reina, María Luisa Solá, Jaume Solà, José Luis Mediavilla, José Javier Serrano Rodríguez, Aleix Estadella', 'PG', 'Through a series of unfortunate events, three mummies end up in present-day London and embark on a wacky and hilarious journey in search of an old ring belonging to the Royal Family, stolen by ambitious archaeologist Lord Carnaby.', 'Through a series of unfortunate events, three mummies end up in present-day London and embark on a wacky and hilarious journey in search of an old ring belonging to the Royal Family, stolen by ambitious archaeologist Lord Carnaby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18nabcSr5luPtdycpTZItffddbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816904'),
  ('469370685016932619', 'Mummy, I''m a Zombie', 2014, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Ricardo Ramón, Beñat Beitia', 'Daniel Torres', 'Paula Ribó, Núria Trifol, Roser Batalla, Ivan Labanda, Elisabeth Bergalló, Luis Posada, Albert Mieza, Clara Schwarze', 'PG', 'The fate of the planet is once again in Dixie''s hands as she must fight to end the battle that has erupted between the living and the walking dead while balancing her newfound popularity at school and a campaign for student council.', 'The fate of the planet is once again in Dixie''s hands as she must fight to end the battle that has erupted between the living and the walking dead while balancing her newfound popularity at school and a campaign for student council.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdaU2jx0IS4lPpQs0mDBlLMO2b8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292106'),
  ('907400244254618887', 'Mumon: The Land of Stealth', 2017, 'War, Action, History, Romance', 'Daisuke Soma, Yoshihiro Nakamura', 'Ryo Wada', 'Satoshi Ohno, Satomi Ishihara, Ryohei Suzuki, Yūsuke Iseya, Yuri Chinen, Yuna Taira, Makita Sports, Danshun Tatekawa', null, 'Raised suckling poison arrows among the sparring Iga ninja factions, Mumon is a carefree 16th-century mercenary. When the ninja council makes a power play to defeat the young Nobukatsu Oda struggling to step into his father’s warlord shoes as they expand rule across the country, Mumon jumps into the fray to satisfy his new bride Okuni’s demand that he make good on his promises of wealth. Yet Mumon soon finds what is worth fighting for beyond money or nation.', 'Raised suckling poison arrows among the sparring Iga ninja factions, Mumon is a carefree 16th-century mercenary. When the ninja council makes a power play to defeat the young Nobukatsu Oda struggling to step into his father’s warlord shoes as they expand rule across the country, Mumon jumps into the fray to satisfy his new bride Okuni’s demand that he make good on his promises of wealth. Yet Mumon soon finds what is worth fighting for beyond money or nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AaLPEGw6IxGO5phpE8a4ZKGHC9H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461211'),
  ('290171258316066624', 'Mumsy, Nanny, Sonny & Girly', 1970, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Freddie Francis, David Muir', 'Maisie Mosco', 'Michael Bryant, Ursula Howells, Pat Heywood, Vanessa Howard, Robert Swann, Imogen Hassall, Michael Ripper, Hugh Armstrong', 'R', 'A wealthy, fatherless British clan kidnap bums and hippies, forcing them to participate in an elaborate role-playing game in which they are the perfect family; those who refuse or attempt escape endure ritualistic murder.', 'A wealthy, fatherless British clan kidnap bums and hippies, forcing them to participate in an elaborate role-playing game in which they are the perfect family; those who refuse or attempt escape endure ritualistic murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A45LM2gVGv1pbh5BRrfSS2ccTKa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62108'),
  ('1094160471412024268', 'Mumu', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Joël Séria, Pascal Gennesseaux', 'Joël Séria', 'Sylvie Testud, Balthazar Dejean de la Bâtie, Michel Galabru, Bruno Lochet, Jean-François Balmer, Dominique Pinon, Valentin Ferey, Prune Lichtle', null, 'The story a rescue, the rescue of a bad brat''s life in the post-WWII period. In 1947, Roger reaches 11 years old. He''s a kid badly loved, mischievous and specializes in silly things to do. He is sent to a small boarding school in a small village. Mumu reigns over here. She''s not the bitchest school teacher of the area. Roger has already been expelled from several schools and this is his last chance to avoid the reformatory his father has been promising him for a long time. But this is will change with the vigilance of Mumu, who, despite her strict aspects, proves herself to have a big heart.', 'The story a rescue, the rescue of a bad brat''s life in the post-WWII period. In 1947, Roger reaches 11 years old. He''s a kid badly loved, mischievous and specializes in silly things to do. He is sent to a small boarding school in a small village. Mumu reigns over here. She''s not the bitchest school teacher of the area. Roger has already been expelled from several schools and this is his last chance to avoid the reformatory his father has been promising him for a long time. But this is will change with the vigilance of Mumu, who, despite her strict aspects, proves herself to have a big heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sb22SBuOeerUzrh1G1NQ7QJUryS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44961'),
  ('1115663111703730286', 'Mumu', 2025, 'Drama, Family', 'Mo Sha, Li Jianeng, 涂灏', 'Fu Dandi, Zizhao Wang', 'Zhang Yixing, Li Luo''an, Huang Yao, Vivienne Tien, Zhang Ruonan, Yuan Wenkang, Ai Liya', null, 'Deaf Xiao Ma and his daughter Mumu rely on each other for companionship. The little "big sister" Mumu serves as the family''s pillar—bridging communication between her father and the outside world, helping him secure work and earn a living. However, as Mumu grows older, she must integrate into the hearing world, and their inseparable life is about to be disrupted. Just then, a criminal syndicate that specifically preys on the deaf sets its sights on Xiao Ma. Desperate to protect his daughter, he is gradually lured step by step into the abyss of crime...', 'Deaf Xiao Ma and his daughter Mumu rely on each other for companionship. The little "big sister" Mumu serves as the family''s pillar—bridging communication between her father and the outside world, helping him secure work and earn a living. However, as Mumu grows older, she must integrate into the hearing world, and their inseparable life is about to be disrupted. Just then, a criminal syndicate that specifically preys on the deaf sets its sights on Xiao Ma. Desperate to protect his daughter, he is gradually lured step by step into the abyss of crime...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UA6UOgalTC0NX45J4xOssXx6T5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1404734'),
  ('1017934382900634680', 'Muna Moto', 1975, 'Drama, Romance', 'J.P. Delazay, J.L. Leon, Jean-Pierre Dikongué-Pipa', 'Jean-Pierre Dikongué-Pipa', 'Philippe Abia, Arlette Din Beli, Gisèle Dikongue-Pipa, David Endene', null, 'Ngando and Ndomé share an extremely perfect love. Yet, tradition demands a dowry for Ndomé’s hand that Ngando, an orphan, cannot afford. Forced to ask his uncle for assistance, Ngando finds himself at the mercy of his uncle’s lust and greed. How can Ngando and Ndomé find peace together? Their journey will be challenging and everyone will learn that not everything special can be saved.', 'Ngando and Ndomé share an extremely perfect love. Yet, tradition demands a dowry for Ndomé’s hand that Ngando, an orphan, cannot afford. Forced to ask his uncle for assistance, Ngando finds himself at the mercy of his uncle’s lust and greed. How can Ngando and Ndomé find peace together? Their journey will be challenging and everyone will learn that not everything special can be saved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKXgMZBRpDJMHbnPe6clQ7Pd8Mi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257803'),
  ('862152367307967095', 'Munch', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Henrik Martin Dahlsbakken, Oskar Dahlsbakken, Pål Ulvik Rokseth', 'Gine Cornelia Pedersen, Mattis Herman Nyquist, Fredrik Høyer', 'Alfred Ekker Strande, Mattis Herman Nyquist, Ola G. Furuseth, Anne Krigsvoll, Ida Elise Broch, Jesper Christensen, Gine Cornelia Pedersen, Dennis Storhøi', null, 'Edvard Munch was one of the most important artists in the period between the 19th and 20th centuries. His motif Skrik (The Scream), repeated in several techniques, became part of the 20th-century world subconsciousness – an image of fear and loneliness most people probably know, even if they have no idea who created it.', 'Edvard Munch was one of the most important artists in the period between the 19th and 20th centuries. His motif Skrik (The Scream), repeated in several techniques, became part of the 20th-century world subconsciousness – an image of fear and loneliness most people probably know, even if they have no idea who created it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5yypQ94MDn4Y2LOqTvQxiC3Fqr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:998845'),
  ('376413199130912505', 'Munchausen', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy, Horror', 'Enrique Latapí Silva, Brett Myer, Jeff Keith', 'Ari Aster', 'Liam Aiken, Bonnie Bedelia, Rachel Brosnahan, Richard Riehle, David Purdham, Seth Owens, Miles Cooper, John Wilhovsky', null, 'A mother, unable to confront the heartbreak of her son leaving for college, delays his departure by making him sick. Unfortunately, she goes too far.', 'A mother, unable to confront the heartbreak of her son leaving for college, delays his departure by making him sick. Unfortunately, she goes too far.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/560dinuPqIGkjETqS8hp9KeI6c3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502025'),
  ('1023067497150509951', 'München ''72 - Das Attentat', 2012, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'Dror Zahavi', 'Martin Rauhaus', 'Bernadette Heerwagen, Felix Klare, Heino Ferch, Rainer Bock, Benjamin Sadler, Pasquale Aleardi, Shredi Jabarin, Stephan Grossmann', null, 'Munich 1972: The Olympic Games are supposed to show the world a new, different Germany: the spirit of Munich - cosmopolitan, relaxed and free. But then the unthinkable happens: in the early hours of September 5, Palestinian terrorists enter the Olympic Village and storm the Israeli team''s quarters. Shortly afterwards, security forces find a dead Israeli. The rest of the team is in the hands of men who clearly have nothing to lose. When the leader of the terror squad asks for a negotiating partner, the young policewoman Anna Gerbers, who originally came to Munich as a steward for the games, volunteers.', 'Munich 1972: The Olympic Games are supposed to show the world a new, different Germany: the spirit of Munich - cosmopolitan, relaxed and free. But then the unthinkable happens: in the early hours of September 5, Palestinian terrorists enter the Olympic Village and storm the Israeli team''s quarters. Shortly afterwards, security forces find a dead Israeli. The rest of the team is in the hands of men who clearly have nothing to lose. When the leader of the terror squad asks for a negotiating partner, the young policewoman Anna Gerbers, who originally came to Munich as a steward for the games, volunteers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Xfcsn7gjJF4nAiy5lh0mohIr7U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138982'),
  ('611619817586798379', 'München 1945', 1945, 'Documentary', 'Willi Cronauer', 'Willi Cronauer', null, null, 'Shot in Munich just a few weeks after it was taken by the American troops on April 30, 1945.', 'Shot in Munich just a few weeks after it was taken by the American troops on April 30, 1945.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdWQPc3cXSP0VhFX8IsYDVG576i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419830'),
  ('1129220645143655983', 'Münchhausen', 1943, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Josef von Báky, Werner Krien, Konstantin Irmen-Tschet', 'Erich Kästner', 'Hans Albers, Wilhelm Bendow, Ferdinand Marian, Käthe Haack, Hans Brausewetter, Marina von Ditmar, Brigitte Horney, Hubert von Meyerinck', null, 'Legendary, immortal nobleman Baron Munchausen regales a lovestruck woman with tales of his amazing adventures.', 'Legendary, immortal nobleman Baron Munchausen regales a lovestruck woman with tales of his amazing adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74Ua1d5l7X3HdaBPsq1MYjfiMI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11627'),
  ('440786687227701217', 'Munchie', 1992, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Jim Wynorski, Don E. FauntLeRoy, Chris Mosio', 'R.J. Robertson, Jim Wynorski', 'Loni Anderson, Andrew Stevens, Jamie McEnnan, Arte Johnson, Dom DeLuise, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Toni Naples, Mike Simmrin', 'PG', 'No friends. The new school sucks. And Mom is in love with a sleazy research doctor. Pretty bleak. That’s how life looks to ten-year-old Gage when suddenly, into his world pops the magical Munchie. Munchie is the ever-hungry and hilarious mysterious creature from another world who delivers flying pizzas and brings on the parties! With the help of Munchie and loony Professor Cruikshank, Gage evens the score on his school’s bullies as well as his mom’s boyfriend and has the greatest summer ever!', 'No friends. The new school sucks. And Mom is in love with a sleazy research doctor. Pretty bleak. That’s how life looks to ten-year-old Gage when suddenly, into his world pops the magical Munchie. Munchie is the ever-hungry and hilarious mysterious creature from another world who delivers flying pizzas and brings on the parties! With the help of Munchie and loony Professor Cruikshank, Gage evens the score on his school’s bullies as well as his mom’s boyfriend and has the greatest summer ever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5B0JIheq8jpXjuZfzirgqzhIb5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116158'),
  ('701063859724955892', 'Munchies', 1987, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jonathan West, Tina Hirsch', 'Lance Smith', 'Harvey Korman, Charlie Stratton, Nadine Van der Velde, Alix Elias, Charlie Phillips, Hardy Rawls, Jon Stafford, Robert Picardo', 'PG', 'Simon Watterman, a space archaeologist, discovers the "Munchies" in a cave in Peru. Cecil Watterman, Simon''s evil twin brother and snack food entrepreneur, kidnaps the creature. What Cecil does not know is that the creature, when chopped up, regenerates into many new creatures and are they mean!', 'Simon Watterman, a space archaeologist, discovers the "Munchies" in a cave in Peru. Cecil Watterman, Simon''s evil twin brother and snack food entrepreneur, kidnaps the creature. What Cecil does not know is that the creature, when chopped up, regenerates into many new creatures and are they mean!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51eGxEkyGMcHSGDLRjnf1oOKx2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4365'),
  ('771840415685356799', 'Mundane History', 2009, 'Drama', 'Maenum Chagasik, Wichanon Somumjarn, Tulapop Saenjaroen', 'Anocha Suwichakornpong', 'Phakpoom Surapongsanuruk, Arkaney Cherkham, Paramej Noiam, Anchana Ponpitakthepkij, Karuna Looktumthong, Nattapong Swangsang, Anchalee Saisoontorn, Intanont Puengpeancharoen', 'R', 'A friendship develops between a young paralysed man from a wealthy Bangkok family and his male nurse from Isan in the North of Thailand.', 'A friendship develops between a young paralysed man from a wealthy Bangkok family and his male nurse from Isan in the North of Thailand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iryjPhdyyNHJQCQYsuvwq2fenOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139388'),
  ('813479708066169492', 'Mune: Guardian of the Moon', 2015, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Benoît Philippon, Alexandre Heboyan, Sebastien Bruneau', 'Benoît Philippon', 'Michaël Grégorio, Omar Sy, Izïa Higelin, Féodor Atkine, Éric Herson-Macarel, Michel Mella, Fabrice Josso, Patrick Poivey', 'PG', 'When a faun named Mune becomes the Guardian of the Moon, little did he had unprepared experience with the Moon and an accident that could put both the Moon and the Sun in danger, including a corrupt titan named Necross who wants the Sun for himself and placing the balance of night and day in great peril. Now with the help of a wax-child named Glim and the warrior, Sohone who also became the Sun Guardian, they go out on an exciting journey to get the Sun back and restore the Moon to their rightful place in the sky.', 'When a faun named Mune becomes the Guardian of the Moon, little did he had unprepared experience with the Moon and an accident that could put both the Moon and the Sun in danger, including a corrupt titan named Necross who wants the Sun for himself and placing the balance of night and day in great peril. Now with the help of a wax-child named Glim and the warrior, Sohone who also became the Sun Guardian, they go out on an exciting journey to get the Sun back and restore the Moon to their rightful place in the sky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWjm8AH9YqkRUR2yf4y1mDIvj0O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323661'),
  ('214220874507902203', 'Munich', 2005, 'Drama, Action, History, Thriller', 'Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński, Robert Cowper', 'Tony Kushner, Eric Roth', 'Eric Bana, Daniel Craig, Ciarán Hinds, Mathieu Kassovitz, Hanns Zischler, Ayelet Zurer, Geoffrey Rush, Gila Almagor', 'R', 'During the 1972 Olympic Games in Munich, eleven Israeli athletes are taken hostage and murdered by a Palestinian terrorist group known as Black September. In retaliation, the Israeli government recruits a group of Mossad agents to track down and execute those responsible for the attack.', 'During the 1972 Olympic Games in Munich, eleven Israeli athletes are taken hostage and murdered by a Palestinian terrorist group known as Black September. In retaliation, the Israeli government recruits a group of Mossad agents to track down and execute those responsible for the attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUekaw96QLInZpsNwRTlRKrZgwm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612'),
  ('292257580348124203', 'Munich – The Edge of War', 2021, 'Drama, History', 'Christian Schwochow, Frank Lamm', 'Ben Power', 'George MacKay, Jannis Niewöhner, Jeremy Irons, Robert Bathurst, Jessica Brown Findlay, August Diehl, Sandra Hüller, Alex Jennings', 'PG-13', 'At the tense 1938 Munich Conference, former friends who now work for opposing governments become reluctant spies racing to expose a Nazi secret.', 'At the tense 1938 Munich Conference, former friends who now work for opposing governments become reluctant spies racing to expose a Nazi secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SOiUTDnwW9gU4GzSIsOCQUlHJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760336'),
  ('657672786558921454', 'Munjya', 2024, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Aditya Sarpotdar, Saurabh Goswami', 'Yogesh Chandekar, Niren Bhatt', 'Abhay Verma, Sharvari, Ayush Ulagadde, Mona Singh, Suhas Joshi, Taran Singh, Bhagyashree Limaye, Sathyaraj', null, 'A young man''s visit to his native village unveils a family secret and a vengeful spirit, Munjya, who wants to get married. Now the young man must fight to protect himself and his love from Munjya''s clutches leading to a humorously chaotic and terrifying adventure.', 'A young man''s visit to his native village unveils a family secret and a vengeful spirit, Munjya, who wants to get married. Now the young man must fight to protect himself and his love from Munjya''s clutches leading to a humorously chaotic and terrifying adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31zAzJs8O7dXcE0laUcBoaaNvwu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1187058'),
  ('212619113435914548', 'Munna Bhai M.B.B.S.', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rajkumar Hirani, Binod Pradhan', 'Rajkumar Hirani', 'Sanjay Dutt, Arshad Warsi, Boman Irani, Gracy Singh, Sunil Dutt, Rohini Hattangadi, Jimmy Shergill, Kurush Deboo', null, 'A gangster sets out to fulfill his father''s dream of becoming a doctor.', 'A gangster sets out to fulfill his father''s dream of becoming a doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZNUTxGsSB4nLEC9Bpa2xfu81qV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19625'),
  ('341556149760733293', 'Munna Michael', 2017, 'Music, Action', 'Sabbir Khan, Aashish Porwal, Hari K. Vedantam', null, 'Tiger Shroff, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Ronit Roy, Nidhhi Agerwal, Sudesh Lehri, Sameer Kochhar, Pankaj Tripathi, Farah Khan', null, 'An expert dancer Munna who idolizes the king of pop, reluctantly tutors a gangster until their developing bond gets disrupted by their common romantic interest towards the same woman.', 'An expert dancer Munna who idolizes the king of pop, reluctantly tutors a gangster until their developing bond gets disrupted by their common romantic interest towards the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1tdHXmGGLc8o8kTImZi5iPXcu3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460508'),
  ('131427326439502623', 'Munro', 1961, 'Animation, Comedy, War, Family', 'Gene Deitch, Václav Bedřich', 'Jules Feiffer', 'Howard Morris, Seth Deitch, Jules Feiffer, Marie Deitch', null, 'A four-year-old boy is drafted into the army. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2004.', 'A four-year-old boy is drafted into the army. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2004.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCXRvyZGEsnSJCiGH0JKbDBKKFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220905'),
  ('873103583789550004', 'Munster, Go Home!', 1966, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Earl Bellamy, Benjamin H. Kline', 'George Tibbles, Joe Connelly, Bob Mosher', 'Fred Gwynne, Yvonne De Carlo, Al Lewis, Butch Patrick, Debbie Watson, Terry-Thomas, Hermione Gingold, Robert Pine', 'NR', 'Herman discovers he''s the new lord of Munster Hall in England. The family sails to Britain, where they receive a tepid welcome from Lady Effigy and Freddie Munster, who throws tantrums because he wasn''t named Lord Munster. An on-board romance had blossomed between Marilyn and Roger, but on land Marilyn discovers Roger''s family holds a longstanding grudge against the Munsters.', 'Herman discovers he''s the new lord of Munster Hall in England. The family sails to Britain, where they receive a tepid welcome from Lady Effigy and Freddie Munster, who throws tantrums because he wasn''t named Lord Munster. An on-board romance had blossomed between Marilyn and Roger, but on land Marilyn discovers Roger''s family holds a longstanding grudge against the Munsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22Yn9deUj4S0Lyykv214JYdp9YH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35992'),
  ('645852635977148238', 'Muoi: The Legend of a Portrait', 2007, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kim Tae-kyung, Nam Jin-a', 'Kim Tae-kyung, Zizak', 'Jo An, Cha Ye-ryun, Lee In, Hong So-hee, Anh Thư, Bình Minh, Hồng Ánh, Thanh Luy', null, 'A Korean writer travels to Vietnam to do research for her story about a cursed portrait of a Vietnamese girl named Muoi.', 'A Korean writer travels to Vietnam to do research for her story about a cursed portrait of a Vietnamese girl named Muoi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUzvclJrG2BUeqoc0wjmtfOFp3V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43565'),
  ('628699651928658485', 'Muppet Classic Theater', 1994, 'Music, Comedy, Family', 'David Grossman, Gregg Gelfand', 'Bill Prady, Jim Lewis', 'Dave Goelz, Jerry Nelson, Steve Whitmire, Frank Oz, Bill Barretta, Julianne Buescher, Brian Henson, Bruce Lanoil', null, 'Gonzo and Rizzo host a presentation in the Muppet Theater of six fairy tales performed by the Muppets. Kermit the Frog, Miss Piggy, Fozzie Bear, Robin the Frog, Gonzo and Rizzo star in the various stories. The production also marked the first appearance of Andy and Randy Pig and the Elvises, who later appeared on Muppets Tonight. Written by Jim Lewis and Bill Prady, each story also features an original song.', 'Gonzo and Rizzo host a presentation in the Muppet Theater of six fairy tales performed by the Muppets. Kermit the Frog, Miss Piggy, Fozzie Bear, Robin the Frog, Gonzo and Rizzo star in the various stories. The production also marked the first appearance of Andy and Randy Pig and the Elvises, who later appeared on Muppets Tonight. Written by Jim Lewis and Bill Prady, each story also features an original song.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sx265Zy5p0DaxzWfmznK93gSiuC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115994'),
  ('740514450838214867', 'Muppet Treasure Island', 1996, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Brian Henson, John Fenner, David Lane', 'Jerry Juhl, Kirk R. Thatcher, James V. Hart', 'Tim Curry, Billy Connolly, Jennifer Saunders, Kevin Bishop, Dave Goelz, Steve Whitmire, Jerry Nelson, Kevin Clash', 'G', 'After telling the story of Flint''s last journey to young Jim Hawkins, Billy Bones has a heart attack and dies just as Jim and his friends are attacked by pirates. The gang escapes into the town where they hire out a boat and crew to find the hidden treasure, which was revealed by Bones before he died. On their voyage across the seas, they soon find out that not everyone on board can be trusted.', 'After telling the story of Flint''s last journey to young Jim Hawkins, Billy Bones has a heart attack and dies just as Jim and his friends are attacked by pirates. The gang escapes into the town where they hire out a boat and crew to find the hidden treasure, which was revealed by Bones before he died. On their voyage across the seas, they soon find out that not everyone on board can be trusted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4KW2CUkzDKaCy4H4cS02cO8gvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10874'),
  ('1011138991082759809', 'Muppets from Space', 1999, 'Family, Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Alan Caso, Tim Hill, Alan Cassie', 'Jerry Juhl, Joey Mazzarino, Ken Kaufman', 'Dave Goelz, Steve Whitmire, Bill Barretta, Jerry Nelson, Brian Henson, Kevin Clash, Frank Oz, Jeffrey Tambor', 'G', 'When Gonzo''s breakfast cereal tells him that he''s the descendant of aliens from another planet, his attempts at extraterrestrial communication get him kidnapped by a secret government agency, prompting the Muppets to spring into action to rescue their friend.', 'When Gonzo''s breakfast cereal tells him that he''s the descendant of aliens from another planet, his attempts at extraterrestrial communication get him kidnapped by a secret government agency, prompting the Muppets to spring into action to rescue their friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aww9cF4uMsbald9ddhCYFoP4gBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10208'),
  ('15883941440407774', 'Muppets Haunted Mansion', 2021, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Kirk R. Thatcher, Craig Kief', null, 'Dave Goelz, Bill Barretta, Eric Jacobson, Matt Vogel, Peter Linz, David Rudman, Alice Dinnean, Bruce Lanoil', 'PG', 'Gonzo is challenged to spend one night in The Haunted Mansion on Halloween night.', 'Gonzo is challenged to spend one night in The Haunted Mansion on Halloween night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeVMV8cMvNhn6aKozAH3pysvftm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826914'),
  ('140932546596106790', 'Muppets Most Wanted', 2014, 'Comedy, Adventure, Crime, Family', 'James Bobin, Don Burgess, Harriet Worth', 'James Bobin, Nicholas Stoller', 'Ricky Gervais, Ty Burrell, Tina Fey, Steve Whitmire, Eric Jacobson, Dave Goelz, Bill Barretta, David Rudman', 'PG', 'While on a grand world tour, The Muppets find themselves wrapped into an European jewel-heist caper headed by a Kermit the Frog look-alike and his dastardly sidekick.', 'While on a grand world tour, The Muppets find themselves wrapped into an European jewel-heist caper headed by a Kermit the Frog look-alike and his dastardly sidekick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CU1WSLAaQjLmRbEmyhfDoOJCyh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145220'),
  ('441855000916831277', 'Muqaddar Ka Sikandar', 1978, 'Romance, Drama, Action', 'Prakash Mehra', 'Vijay Kaul', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Vinod Khanna, Rakhee Gulzar, Rekha, Goga Kapoor, Shreeram Lagoo, Ranjeet Bedi, Nirupa Roy', null, 'Sikandar, an orphan, makes many friends and foes as he works his way up to become rich, but his heart only yearns for his unfulfilled childhood love, Kaamna. Though he finds temporary comfort in an enchanting prostitute named Zohra, all hell breaks loose when Kaamna falls for Sikandar''s best friend.', 'Sikandar, an orphan, makes many friends and foes as he works his way up to become rich, but his heart only yearns for his unfulfilled childhood love, Kaamna. Though he finds temporary comfort in an enchanting prostitute named Zohra, all hell breaks loose when Kaamna falls for Sikandar''s best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lm4Zlk53kuByV7eK2Y0PKTqvrU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71298'),
  ('926764504329358568', 'Mur Mure', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Julien Condemine, Jérémie Lippmann', 'Lilou Fogli, Clovis Cornillac', 'Clovis Cornillac, Lilou Fogli, Laurence Arné', null, 'Machin, a zany inventor and self-confessed misanthrope, needs only one thing: absolute silence. Thanks to his inventions, which are as ingenious as they are bizarre, he has always managed to scare away his neighbors. Until the day a pianist, Machine, moves in for the first time in her life... into the apartment next door! Recorded at the Théâtre de la Michodière in Paris''s 2nd arrondissement.', 'Machin, a zany inventor and self-confessed misanthrope, needs only one thing: absolute silence. Thanks to his inventions, which are as ingenious as they are bizarre, he has always managed to scare away his neighbors. Until the day a pianist, Machine, moves in for the first time in her life... into the apartment next door! Recorded at the Théâtre de la Michodière in Paris''s 2nd arrondissement.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4HevJ3d3rzfTjgaZRx1fiYIRri8.jpg', 'plex:movie:mur-mure'),
  ('773176852466171914', 'Mur Murs', 1982, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, Bernard Auroux, James A. Dennett', 'Agnès Varda', 'Juliet Berto, Agnès Varda, Judy Baca, Terry Schoonhoven, Cristiano Rimassa, Richard Bennett, Betty Brandelli, Lynn Carey', null, 'Venturing from Venice Beach to Watts, Varda looks at the murals of LA as backdrop to and mirror of the city’s many cultures. She casts a curious eye on graffiti and photorealism, roller disco & gang violence, evangelical Christians, Hare Krishnas, artists, angels and ordinary Angelenos.', 'Venturing from Venice Beach to Watts, Varda looks at the murals of LA as backdrop to and mirror of the city’s many cultures. She casts a curious eye on graffiti and photorealism, roller disco & gang violence, evangelical Christians, Hare Krishnas, artists, angels and ordinary Angelenos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFU0gAIUeSS0k96it0LhCNN8v9R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230048'),
  ('903815333761737677', 'Mural', 2011, 'Fantasy', 'Mark Lee Ping-Bing, Zhang Yang, Danny Ko Lam-Pau', 'Lau Ho-Leung', 'Deng Chao, Sun Li, Zheng Shuang, Monica Mok Siu-Kei, Liu Yan, Bao Bei''er, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Bao Wenjing', null, 'Mural tells the story of Zhu Xiaolian, a poor scholar who travels to the capital to take an examination. During this trip, Zhu becomes distracted by a mural and enters into the fantasy land depicted therein. There he meets the fairies who inhabit this fantasy land and encounters love and hate.', 'Mural tells the story of Zhu Xiaolian, a poor scholar who travels to the capital to take an examination. During this trip, Zhu becomes distracted by a mural and enters into the fantasy land depicted therein. There he meets the fairies who inhabit this fantasy land and encounters love and hate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74FSvMEyLAcFyDXdtjRtkySargl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75812'),
  ('968514523317079503', 'Muramasa', 1987, 'Animation, Horror', 'Osamu Tezuka', null, null, null, 'A wandering samurai finds a straw dummy with a magical sword, which makes him overwhelmingly powerful but begins to drive him mad.', 'A wandering samurai finds a straw dummy with a magical sword, which makes him overwhelmingly powerful but begins to drive him mad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbY7ZU4kH2V3WSxl90YYhvEitNw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72702'),
  ('872599343128565373', 'Murder', 1957, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Roman Polanski, Nikola Todorow', 'Roman Polanski', null, null, 'The camera shows us a door handle and the door''s striker plate; from this angle, they form a cross. The door opens and in steps someone in a dark trench coat. He approaches a bed in the room, where a shirtless man sleeps.', 'The camera shows us a door handle and the door''s striker plate; from this angle, they form a cross. The door opens and in steps someone in a dark trench coat. He approaches a bed in the room, where a shirtless man sleeps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrjckuk5apnmJt0CLxQj2b86NgX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104144'),
  ('565491524611595625', 'Murder', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Anurag Basu, Fuwad Khan', 'Anurag Basu', 'Mallika Sherawat, Emraan Hashmi, Ashmit Patel, Surabhi Vanzara, Raj Zutshi, Sheeba Chaddha, Indira Roy, Krish Chawla', 'R', 'To escape a secure but stifling life with her workaholic husband Sudhir, bored housewife Simran begins an affair with Sunny, an ex-boyfriend from her college days. However, when Sudhir grows suspicious and hires a private detective, the infidelity soon comes to light.', 'To escape a secure but stifling life with her workaholic husband Sudhir, bored housewife Simran begins an affair with Sunny, an ex-boyfriend from her college days. However, when Sudhir grows suspicious and hires a private detective, the infidelity soon comes to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j14NjDFy7QQWHDSzfO9EkZvc9ZF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20534'),
  ('532504226933504758', 'Murder 101', 1991, 'Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Bill Condon', 'Roy Johansen, Bill Condon', 'Pierce Brosnan, Dey Young, Antoni Corone, Raphael Sbarge, Kim Thomson, Jack Thibeau, J. Kenneth Campbell, Todd Merrill', null, 'Charles Lattimore, an author of a book about a famous murder trial, arranges to meet with one of his students one night. When the student is found murdered and Lattimore has no alibi, he suspects he is being framed by the subject of his book.', 'Charles Lattimore, an author of a book about a famous murder trial, arranges to meet with one of his students one night. When the student is found murdered and Lattimore has no alibi, he suspects he is being framed by the subject of his book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkimtYPutlDe4y3rKpER2NFBD1p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27494'),
  ('1011266637226148084', 'Murder 2', 2011, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Mohit Suri, Rammy C Pandey, Ravi Walia', 'Mahesh Bhatt', 'Emraan Hashmi, Jacqueline Fernandez, Prashant Narayanan, Sudhanshu Pandey, Sulagna Panigrahi, Sanjay Batra, Bikramjeet Kanwarpal, Shweta Kawatra', null, 'A former police officer gets hired by a pimp to trace missing call girls who work for him.', 'A former police officer gets hired by a pimp to trace missing call girls who work for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0Nb0eN5ybRX3j4uMyk5NN96ugl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69775'),
  ('532885269122468551', 'Murder 3', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Vishesh Bhatt', 'Mahesh Bhatt, Hatem Khraiche', 'Randeep Hooda, Aditi Rao Hydari, Sara Loren, Rajesh Shringapure, Shekhar Shukla, Tonishaa Pawar, Karla Singh, Shraddha Jaiswal', 'PG-13', 'A hot-shot fashion and wildlife photographer Vikram gets into a relationship with Nisha. She moves in with him in his palatial house outside of the city. The old world house, made decades ago is as beautiful as it is scary. It holds many secrets which Nisha is soon to unearth; of the life of the man who made it and of Vikram, who is dealing with the mysterious disappearance of his former girlfriend Roshni', 'A hot-shot fashion and wildlife photographer Vikram gets into a relationship with Nisha. She moves in with him in his palatial house outside of the city. The old world house, made decades ago is as beautiful as it is scary. It holds many secrets which Nisha is soon to unearth; of the life of the man who made it and of Vikram, who is dealing with the mysterious disappearance of his former girlfriend Roshni', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ls8RgPMuBW5aCYmAMH8gBXOC2Hc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168114'),
  ('1114768769473883071', 'Murder à la Mod', 1968, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Brian De Palma, Bruce Torbet', 'Brian De Palma', 'Andra Akers, William Finley, Margo Norton, Jared Martin, Ken Burrows, Lorenzo Catlett, Jack Harrell, Laura Stevenson', null, 'Naive young Karen wants to help her struggling amateur filmmaker boyfriend Christopher raise enough money so he can divorce his wife. Meanwhile, jolly psycho-prankster Otto stalks the building where Christopher is shooting a low-grade adult movie in order to keep himself afloat.', 'Naive young Karen wants to help her struggling amateur filmmaker boyfriend Christopher raise enough money so he can divorce his wife. Meanwhile, jolly psycho-prankster Otto stalks the building where Christopher is shooting a low-grade adult movie in order to keep himself afloat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rywNtpPmIlS5uIL85gk2gOAuEuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64936'),
  ('1075421049330796935', 'Murder Ahoy', 1964, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Comedy', 'Desmond Dickinson, George Pollock, David Tomblin', 'David Pursall, Jack Seddon', 'Margaret Rutherford, Lionel Jeffries, Stringer Davis, Charles Tingwell, William Mervyn, Henry Oscar, Joan Benham, Nicholas Parsons', 'NR', 'During an annual board of trustees meeting, one of the trustees dies. Miss Marple thinks he’s been poisoned after finding a chemical on him. She sets off to investigate at the ship where he had just come from. The fourth and final film from the Miss Marple series starring Margaret Rutherford as the quirky amateur detective.', 'During an annual board of trustees meeting, one of the trustees dies. Miss Marple thinks he’s been poisoned after finding a chemical on him. She sets off to investigate at the ship where he had just come from. The fourth and final film from the Miss Marple series starring Margaret Rutherford as the quirky amateur detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfWqXgr0yVz8Ml4JdUEBOmN6KrW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758'),
  ('747808995986476845', 'Murder at 1600', 1997, 'Action, Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Dwight H. Little, Steven Bernstein, Michael Zenon', 'David Hodgin, Wayne Beach', 'Wesley Snipes, Diane Lane, Daniel Benzali, Dennis Miller, Alan Alda, Ronny Cox, Tate Donovan, Tom Wright', 'R', 'A secretary is found dead in a White House bathroom during an international crisis, and Detective Harlan Regis is in charge of the investigation. Despite resistance from the Secret Service, Regis partners with agent Nina Chance. As political tensions rise, they learn that the crime could be part of an elaborate cover-up. Framed as traitors, the pair, plus Regis'' partner, break into the White House in order to expose the true culprit.', 'A secretary is found dead in a White House bathroom during an international crisis, and Detective Harlan Regis is in charge of the investigation. Despite resistance from the Secret Service, Regis partners with agent Nina Chance. As political tensions rise, they learn that the crime could be part of an elaborate cover-up. Framed as traitors, the pair, plus Regis'' partner, break into the White House in order to expose the true culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WPR0m8zuzFAcRJAHcGs1AxkkpB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9415'),
  ('922466305911386549', 'Murder at Midnight', 1931, 'Mystery', 'Frank R. Strayer, William Rees', 'Scott Darling', 'Aileen Pringle, Alice White, Hale Hamilton, Robert Elliott, Clara Blandick, Brandon Hurst, Leslie Fenton, William Humphrey', null, 'Wealthy Mr. Kennedy shoots his secretary, Channing, during a parlor game, but it turns out the gun was loaded with real bullets. Luckily, criminologist Phillip Montrose is on hand to help the police. When Kennedy quickly ends up dead as well, the police think it''s a tidy murder-suicide, but the family lawyer knows of a letter that voiced Kennedy''s suspicions about someone who was out to get him. Soon, the cops are on the trail of a ruthless and clever killer who is one step ahead of even Montrose.', 'Wealthy Mr. Kennedy shoots his secretary, Channing, during a parlor game, but it turns out the gun was loaded with real bullets. Luckily, criminologist Phillip Montrose is on hand to help the police. When Kennedy quickly ends up dead as well, the police think it''s a tidy murder-suicide, but the family lawyer knows of a letter that voiced Kennedy''s suspicions about someone who was out to get him. Soon, the cops are on the trail of a ruthless and clever killer who is one step ahead of even Montrose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IIaWIOWNsXfFyS8Jv9Ah6Ez9pq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156331'),
  ('735607742069921880', 'Murder at the Embassy', 2025, 'Mystery, Thriller, Action', 'Stephen Shimek', 'Mark Brennan', 'Mischa Barton, Richard Dillane, Mido Hamada, Antonia Bernath, Kojo Attah, Raha Rahbari, Kathryn McGarr, Nick Harris', 'R', '1934. Private detective Miranda Green investigates a murder perpetrated in the British Embassy in Cairo, where a top secret document was stolen, risking to jeopardize both Buckingham Palace and the peace of the world. All those present in this closed place are suspected: the American photographer, the English student, the American actress, the Egyptian security guard, the ambassador interpreter, the Egyptian gardener and - why not? — the Ambassador himself. But who would have expected that a small group of Nazis would be behind a plot, risking to jeopardize both Buckingham Palace and the peace of the world?', '1934. Private detective Miranda Green investigates a murder perpetrated in the British Embassy in Cairo, where a top secret document was stolen, risking to jeopardize both Buckingham Palace and the peace of the world. All those present in this closed place are suspected: the American photographer, the English student, the American actress, the Egyptian security guard, the ambassador interpreter, the Egyptian gardener and - why not? — the Ambassador himself. But who would have expected that a small group of Nazis would be behind a plot, risking to jeopardize both Buckingham Palace and the peace of the world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DBmBItPdy0A2ol59jgHhS54Lua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1310568'),
  ('488648342299181599', 'Murder at the Gallop', 1963, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Arthur Ibbetson, George Pollock, Basil Rayburn', 'James P. Cavanagh', 'Margaret Rutherford, Stringer Davis, Robert Morley, Flora Robson, Charles Tingwell, Gordon Harris, Robert Urquhart, Katya Douglas', 'NR', 'Miss Marple and Mr. Stringer are witnesses to the death by heart attack of elderly, rich Mr. Enderby. Yet they have their doubts about what happened. The police don''t believe them, thus leading Miss Marple to yet again investigate by herself.', 'Miss Marple and Mr. Stringer are witnesses to the death by heart attack of elderly, rich Mr. Enderby. Yet they have their doubts about what happened. The police don''t believe them, thus leading Miss Marple to yet again investigate by herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCLJ6yutSJc8PkiazcEh8dB6Juh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:751'),
  ('682023407531196788', 'Murder at the Savoy', 1993, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Per Berglund, Tony Forsberg, Henrik Widman', 'Per Berglund, Jonas Cornell', 'Gösta Ekman, Kjell Bergqvist, Rolf Lassgård, Niklas Hjulström, Ingvar Andersson, Arthur Brauss, Andrea Heuer, Lena Nilsson', null, 'A famous industrialist is murdered at a restaurant in Malmoe. Police inspector Martin Beck in Stockholm gets the case. The suspects lead to people involved in illegal arms deals. But who was the biggest criminal, the murderer or the industrialist?', 'A famous industrialist is murdered at a restaurant in Malmoe. Police inspector Martin Beck in Stockholm gets the case. The suspects lead to people involved in illegal arms deals. But who was the biggest criminal, the murderer or the industrialist?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/up3RXPXuyQGzUwOGKZp2KAElFXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34527'),
  ('163556338897101794', 'Murder at the Vanities', 1934, 'Music, Mystery, Comedy', 'Mitchell Leisen, Leo Tover', 'Joseph Gollomb, Carey Wilson', 'Carl Brisson, Victor McLaglen, Jack Oakie, Kitty Carlisle, Dorothy Stickney, Gertrude Michael, Jessie Ralph, Charles Middleton', 'NR', 'Shortly before the curtain goes up the first time at the latest performance of Earl Carroll''s Vanities, someone is attempting to injure the leading lady Ann Ware, who wants to marry leading man Eric Lander. Stage manager Jack Ellery calls in his friend, policeman Bill Murdock, to help him investigate. Bill thinks Jack is offering to let him see the show from an unusual viewpoint after he forgot to get him tickets for the performance, but then they find the corpse of a murdered woman and Bill immediately suspects Eric of the crime.', 'Shortly before the curtain goes up the first time at the latest performance of Earl Carroll''s Vanities, someone is attempting to injure the leading lady Ann Ware, who wants to marry leading man Eric Lander. Stage manager Jack Ellery calls in his friend, policeman Bill Murdock, to help him investigate. Bill thinks Jack is offering to let him see the show from an unusual viewpoint after he forgot to get him tickets for the performance, but then they find the corpse of a murdered woman and Bill immediately suspects Eric of the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cS752HhPnUqM4XS06iflMko4Ekj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82180'),
  ('300528762518255320', 'Murder at Yellowstone City', 2022, 'Western, Mystery', 'Richard Gray', 'Eric Belgau', 'Gabriel Byrne, Thomas Jane, Isaiah Mustafa, Anna Camp, Nat Wolff, Richard Dreyfuss, Aimee Garcia, Zach McGowan', null, 'A former slave who arrives in Yellowstone City, Montana, a desolate former boomtown now on the decline, looking for a place to call home. On that same day, a local prospector discovers gold - and is murdered.', 'A former slave who arrives in Yellowstone City, Montana, a desolate former boomtown now on the decline, looking for a place to call home. On that same day, a local prospector discovers gold - and is murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58UKdNFfSSvx8TuecGAzqja3NTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974961'),
  ('93017267072445277', 'Murder Backstage', 1960, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Dinos Katsouridis, Aristeidis Karydis-Fuchs', 'Yannis Maris', 'Alekos Alexandrakis, Titos Vandis, Maro Kodou, Aliki Georgouli, Zorz Sarri, Hristos Tsaganeas, Effie Mela, Thanasis Mylonas', null, 'A journalist helps, famed policeman Becca, to solve the murder of a theater actress.', 'A journalist helps, famed policeman Becca, to solve the murder of a theater actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pUsWzjWwDmeDnA2R8oQKcTkWzV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159496'),
