  ('533003938329855241', 'Murder by Death', 1976, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Robert Moore, David M. Walsh, Fred T. Gallo', 'Neil Simon', 'Truman Capote, Alec Guinness, Peter Sellers, David Niven, Maggie Smith, James Coco, Peter Falk, Eileen Brennan', 'PG', 'Lionel Twain invites the world''s five greatest detectives to a ''dinner and murder''. Included are a blind butler, a deaf-mute maid, screams, spinning rooms, secret passages, false identities and more plot turns and twists than are decently allowed.', 'Lionel Twain invites the world''s five greatest detectives to a ''dinner and murder''. Included are a blind butler, a deaf-mute maid, screams, spinning rooms, secret passages, false identities and more plot turns and twists than are decently allowed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YGYam05qzHy0ZSzfjBSDkVvvU7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6037'),
  ('750150956203207955', 'Murder by Decree', 1979, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Bob Clark, Guy Travers, Ken Goch', 'John Hopkins', 'Christopher Plummer, James Mason, David Hemmings, Susan Clark, Anthony Quayle, John Gielgud, Frank Finlay, Donald Sutherland', 'PG', 'Sherlock Holmes is drawn into the case of Jack the Ripper, who is killing prostitutes in London''s East End. Assisted by Dr. Watson, and using information provided by a renowned psychic, Robert Lees, Holmes finds that the murders may have their roots in a Royal indiscretion and that a cover-up is being managed by politicians at the highest level, all of whom happen to be Masons.', 'Sherlock Holmes is drawn into the case of Jack the Ripper, who is killing prostitutes in London''s East End. Assisted by Dr. Watson, and using information provided by a renowned psychic, Robert Lees, Holmes finds that the murders may have their roots in a Royal indiscretion and that a cover-up is being managed by politicians at the highest level, all of whom happen to be Masons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjuO0XKak8v3uUdNjWr5sNIlJ4b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34374'),
  ('599880499329799766', 'Murder by Invitation', 1941, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Phil Rosen, Marcel Le Picard, Mack V. Wright', 'George Bricker', 'Wallace Ford, Marian Marsh, Sarah Padden, Gavin Gordon, George Guhl, Wallis Clark, Minerva Urecal, J. Arthur Young', 'NR', 'The relatives of a rich old woman unsuccessfully try to have her declared insane, so they can divide up her money. To show them that there are no hard feelings, she invites them to her estate for the weekend so she can decide to whom she actually will leave her money when she dies. Soon, however, family members begin turning up dead.', 'The relatives of a rich old woman unsuccessfully try to have her declared insane, so they can divide up her money. To show them that there are no hard feelings, she invites them to her estate for the weekend so she can decide to whom she actually will leave her money when she dies. Soon, however, family members begin turning up dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cZ8JZMRgdTX1KfSt4vryofyXq2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252463'),
  ('685889551637486249', 'Murder by Natural Causes', 1979, 'Mystery, Crime, TV Movie, Thriller', 'Robert Day, Jack Swain', 'William Link, Richard Levinson', 'Hal Holbrook, Katharine Ross, Richard Anderson, Barry Bostwick, Bill Fiore, Phil Leeds, Eve McVeagh, Jeff Donnell', 'NR', 'An elaborate mystery involving a famous mentalist, his unfaithful wife who is trying to literally scare him to death, the best friend of the family, and the wife''s ham-actor lover -- not only an intriguing who- (or whether) dunit, but also a literate, adult dramatic puzzle with an endless series of twists.', 'An elaborate mystery involving a famous mentalist, his unfaithful wife who is trying to literally scare him to death, the best friend of the family, and the wife''s ham-actor lover -- not only an intriguing who- (or whether) dunit, but also a literate, adult dramatic puzzle with an endless series of twists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcAQciKCn4DpOdeSlWLqkjW6y6k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256166'),
  ('636710932642677337', 'Murder by Numbers', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Luciano Tovoli, Barbet Schroeder, John Berger', 'Tony Gayton', 'Sandra Bullock, Ben Chaplin, Ryan Gosling, Michael Pitt, Agnes Bruckner, Chris Penn, R. D. Call, Tom Verica', 'R', 'Tenacious homicide detective Cassie Mayweather and her still-green partner are working a murder case, attempting to profile two malevolently brilliant young men: cold, calculating killers whose dark secrets might explain their crimes.', 'Tenacious homicide detective Cassie Mayweather and her still-green partner are working a murder case, attempting to profile two malevolently brilliant young men: cold, calculating killers whose dark secrets might explain their crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBM5byKWtcHg8NvyTA7NVyIIqEj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11892'),
  ('278261820211400087', 'Murder by Phone', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Michael Anderson, Reginald H. Morris', 'Michael Butler, Dennis Shryack, John Kent Harrison', 'Richard Chamberlain, John Houseman, Sara Botsford, Robin Gammell, Gary Reineke, Barry Morse, Alan Scarfe, James B. Douglas', 'R', 'A disgruntled phone company employee develops a device whereby those answering a phone can be murdered, and it''s up to Nat Bridger to stop the killer.', 'A disgruntled phone company employee develops a device whereby those answering a phone can be murdered, and it''s up to Nat Bridger to stop the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwXPrXuvrtzME3zJjA4Y2RbOKrw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81887'),
  ('791850519516337980', 'Murder by Television', 1935, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Arthur Reed, James S. Brown Jr., Clifford Sanforth', 'Joseph O''Donnell', 'Bela Lugosi, June Collyer, Huntley Gordon, George Meeker, Charles Hill Mailes, Claire McDowell, Hattie McDaniel, Allen Jung', null, 'James Houghland, inventor of a new method by which television signals can be instantaneously sent anywhere in the world, refuses to sell the process to television companies, who then send agents to acquire the invention any way they can. On the night of his initial broadcast Houghland is mysteriously murdered in the middle of his demonstration and it falls to Police Chief Nelson to determine who the murderer is from the many suspects present.', 'James Houghland, inventor of a new method by which television signals can be instantaneously sent anywhere in the world, refuses to sell the process to television companies, who then send agents to acquire the invention any way they can. On the night of his initial broadcast Houghland is mysteriously murdered in the middle of his demonstration and it falls to Police Chief Nelson to determine who the murderer is from the many suspects present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g09q6eX3Yfw3A4OUGVvv2JHjOUJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28439'),
  ('292202254196214054', 'Murder by the Clock', 1931, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Edward Sloman', 'Charles Beahan', 'William ''Stage'' Boyd, Lilyan Tashman, Irving Pichel, Regis Toomey, Sally O''Neil, Blanche Friderici, Walter McGrail, Lester Vail', 'NR', 'A policeman investigates a woman''s link to murders that are preceded by a shrilling horn inside a family mausoleum.', 'A policeman investigates a woman''s link to murders that are preceded by a shrilling horn inside a family mausoleum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPusrYVPpnMBjD9H4OzPXvIxKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29499'),
  ('921362985570715805', 'Murder by the Coast', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime, History, Mystery', 'Tània Balló', 'Tània Balló', null, 'PG-13', 'In 1999, teen Rocío Wanninkhof is murdered. Her mother''s ex-partner, Dolores Vázquez, is suspected. Did she do it? A second victim reveals the truth.', 'In 1999, teen Rocío Wanninkhof is murdered. Her mother''s ex-partner, Dolores Vázquez, is suspected. Did she do it? A second victim reveals the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5P9aiu9zOIC8YAx9Tj3YKZbwtmT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:830645'),
  ('712837960428265055', 'Murder Company', 2024, 'War, Action', 'Shane Dax Taylor', 'Jesse Mittelstadt', 'Kelsey Grammer, William Moseley, Joe Anderson, Gilles Marini, Pooch Hall', null, 'In the midst of the D-Day invasion, a group of US soldiers are given orders to smuggle a member of the French Resistance behind enemy lines to assassinate a high-value Nazi target.', 'In the midst of the D-Day invasion, a group of US soldiers are given orders to smuggle a member of the French Resistance behind enemy lines to assassinate a high-value Nazi target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUjzUUFm1dEUR6U4r0C6s9L2FEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1285247'),
  ('999473056202717549', 'Murder in 405', 1980, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Zhao Junhong, Guifu Zhang, Shen Yaoting', 'Yu Benzheng, Shen Yaoting', 'Xinghuo Zhong, Xu Min, Yan Xiang, Shi Jiufeng, Wu Xiqian, Zhang Yan, Niu Ben, Shen Yaoting', null, 'A murder investigation in Donghai City uncovers a larger conspiracy.', 'A murder investigation in Donghai City uncovers a larger conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4CGKPCzBUShEo0ggk931gQYMe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524498'),
  ('316982980903320811', 'Murder in a Blue World', 1973, 'Thriller, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, Pierre Spengler', 'Antonio Artero, Antonio Fos, José Luis Garci', 'Sue Lyon, Christopher Mitchum, Jean Sorel, Ramón Pons, Charly Bravo, Alfredo Alba, Antonio del Real, David Carpenter', null, 'Set in the future, the story follows a nurse who tries to bring her own style of relief to people condemned to die. Her identity is a mystery and she may not be quite what she seems.', 'Set in the future, the story follows a nurse who tries to bring her own style of relief to people condemned to die. Her identity is a mystery and she may not be quite what she seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cA0d725L3ld5xQDoSgYZtAF8rGo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29333'),
  ('322616249954874903', 'Murder in Aigues-Mortes', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Bernard Déchet, Claude-Michel Rome', 'Jean Falculète', 'Vincent Winterhalter, Florence Pernel, Samuel Labarthe, Jicey Carina, Ludovic Berthillot, Pierre Perrier, Xavier Robic, Jean-Marie Juan', null, 'A young lawyer''s murder rocks Aigues-Mortes and triggers the re-opening of a cold case.', 'A young lawyer''s murder rocks Aigues-Mortes and triggers the re-opening of a cold case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIL4pOnkBv6lPhpTo6M8QIaqSCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383868'),
  ('289900753227897189', 'Murder in Aquitaine', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Marie Spencer, David Morley', 'Martin Guyot, Céline Guyot', 'Pierre-Yves Bon, Lucie Lucas, Marianne Basler, Cyrielle Debreuil', null, 'While setting up an exhibition of "The Mummies of St. Michael" an archeologist discovers a real skeleton in a red robe.', 'While setting up an exhibition of "The Mummies of St. Michael" an archeologist discovers a real skeleton in a red robe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voUNXgEJns4GG9W3SuqYOF3vJOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569769'),
  ('963091562106126765', 'Murder In Aveyron', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Bernard Déchet, Claude-Michel Rome', 'Éric Heumann, Jean Falculète', 'Florence Pernel, Vincent Winterhalter, Hélène Seuzaret, François Feroleto, Jean-Pierre Bouvier, Yves Collignon, Michel Voïta, Jean-Pierre Becker', null, 'A man is murdered in Laguiole, Aveyron, Aubrac country. The young Elisabeth Richard, deputy prosecutor of Rodez, is handling the case. She has to deal with the hostility of a police officer, promoted on his own strength and not keen on the idea of being subjected to a young woman. Elisabeth especially has to unravel the tangles of ancestral antagonism and family secrets in order to unmask the culprit. The film is both a criminal investigation and a social painting.', 'A man is murdered in Laguiole, Aveyron, Aubrac country. The young Elisabeth Richard, deputy prosecutor of Rodez, is handling the case. She has to deal with the hostility of a police officer, promoted on his own strength and not keen on the idea of being subjected to a young woman. Elisabeth especially has to unravel the tangles of ancestral antagonism and family secrets in order to unmask the culprit. The film is both a criminal investigation and a social painting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mV3CzjT4VdzyNAuqtgPjiAX5f1Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319351'),
  ('593113631500280127', 'Murder in Basque Country', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'René Manzor', 'Véronique Lecharpy, Pascal Fontanille', 'Cristiana Réali, Arnaud Binard, Lorie Pester, Annie Grégorio, Gary Guénaire, Daniel Njo Lobé, Robert Causse, François Feroleto', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vV8oqdSdnXIQn0QyawDX9VEliIc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661908'),
  ('446649486397109085', 'Murder in Batz', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, TV Movie', 'Edwin Baily', 'Stéphane Kaminka, Brigitte Laude', 'Stéphane Freiss, Flore Bonaventura, François Marthouret, Sophie Le Tellier, Marie-José Nat, Eddy Frogeais', null, 'The murder of a woman in an abandoned house is the first murder this rural French island has had in 100 years. Or is it? A cop who left the island 20 years earlier and a young intern who moved away when she was six years old - but doesn''t remember those first six years of her life - team up to solve the murder and some other mysteries that develop during the course of their investigation.', 'The murder of a woman in an abandoned house is the first murder this rural French island has had in 100 years. Or is it? A cop who left the island 20 years earlier and a young intern who moved away when she was six years old - but doesn''t remember those first six years of her life - team up to solve the murder and some other mysteries that develop during the course of their investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8btLHoziH00QM81i3gVmgs654L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364416'),
  ('1062950187491858008', 'Murder in Brocéliande', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Vincent Giovanni', 'Yann Le Gal, Virginie Brami', 'Claire Keim, François Vincentelli, Carole Bianic, Yanis Richard, Féodor Atkine, Nadia Fossier, Francis Renaud, Michaël Erpelding', null, 'A charred body is found in Brocéliande Forest with a shocked and speechless 13-year-old boy next to it. What is he doing there? How is he involved? Two gendarmes and an unconventional child psychiatrist try to clear up the mystery.', 'A charred body is found in Brocéliande Forest with a shocked and speechless 13-year-old boy next to it. What is he doing there? How is he involved? Two gendarmes and an unconventional child psychiatrist try to clear up the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t95XaIulR0x2objwNf70Khl7RTv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448158'),
  ('96129822608611360', 'Murder in Chartreuse', 2021, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Jean-Marc Rudnicki, Jérôme Olivier, Serge Dell''Amico', 'Olivier Berclaz', 'Blandine Bellavoir, Samir Boitard, Stéphan Wojtowicz, Camille Moutawakil, François Praud, Romane Libert, François Morel', null, 'Forest of the Chartreuse massif. A group of lumberjacks working on a job come across the body of a man suspended in the air by a rope system, as if it were a sort of disarticulated puppet. In charge of the investigation, Justine Verard is forced to collaborate with Mehdi Djaoud, whom she holds responsible for the death of her husband, himself a detective, during a mission that went wrong five years earlier. Despite this tragic past, the two agents will have to join forces to solve this first murder together in the face of a mystery that will get thicker as the investigation proceeds. Between a complicated personal life and her investigation, Justine will be caught in a vice-like grip until the final countdown under high tension.', 'Forest of the Chartreuse massif. A group of lumberjacks working on a job come across the body of a man suspended in the air by a rope system, as if it were a sort of disarticulated puppet. In charge of the investigation, Justine Verard is forced to collaborate with Mehdi Djaoud, whom she holds responsible for the death of her husband, himself a detective, during a mission that went wrong five years earlier. Despite this tragic past, the two agents will have to join forces to solve this first murder together in the face of a mystery that will get thicker as the investigation proceeds. Between a complicated personal life and her investigation, Justine will be caught in a vice-like grip until the final countdown under high tension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZb1YdORUf7zyFkWBJjl3oywUhO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:825580'),
  ('487628587805951919', 'Murder in Coweta County', 1983, 'Drama, TV Movie, Crime', 'Gary Nelson, Larry Pizer', 'Dennis Nemec', 'Johnny Cash, Andy Griffith, Earl Hindman, Ed Van Nuys, Robert Schenkkan, Jo Henderson, Daniel Keyes, Danny Nelson', 'NR', 'Wallace a wealthy landowner in Meriwether County, Georgia, has virtually unlimited power in the county, including having the sheriff under his control. When he murders a share cropper he thinks that he is powerful enough to get away with it. Because the act of murder took place in Coweta County, it is under the jurisdiction of the Coweta County sheriff who hunts the murderer without trepidation.', 'Wallace a wealthy landowner in Meriwether County, Georgia, has virtually unlimited power in the county, including having the sheriff under his control. When he murders a share cropper he thinks that he is powerful enough to get away with it. Because the act of murder took place in Coweta County, it is under the jurisdiction of the Coweta County sheriff who hunts the murderer without trepidation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEEtBSRpq7xIXBI08p8v3jM1zlw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19434'),
  ('67812290219045203', 'Murder in Hérault', 2019, 'TV Movie, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Éric Duret', 'Jean Falculète, Frédéric Faurt', 'Florence Pernel, Guillaume Cramoisan, Lola Dewaere, Catherine Demaiffe, Bonnafet Tarbouriech, Audrey Looten, Lolita Chammah, Manuel Gélin', null, 'Elisabeth and Charles search for a link between three very different murders.', 'Elisabeth and Charles search for a link between three very different murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GP8tbrJsX9by6R8tEJZ5LDZCKY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670122'),
  ('205485471493188454', 'Murder In La Rochefoucauld', 2019, 'Crime, TV Movie, Thriller', 'Alain Ducousset, Claire de la Rochefoucauld', 'Laurent Mondy', 'Anny Duperey, Hélène Seuzaret, Myriam Bourguignon, Jean-Claude Dauphin, Nadia Fossier, Stéphan Wojtowicz, Dominique Frot, Jean-Charles Chagachbanian', null, 'During the annual party in the château of a wealthy French family, a murder is committed. The small neighboring town is thrown into disorder, suddenly plunged back into the old relationship of master and serfs.', 'During the annual party in the château of a wealthy French family, a murder is committed. The small neighboring town is thrown into disorder, suddenly plunged back into the old relationship of master and serfs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUbi70Sc8YSWilSRjp1XoQLTcGZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:770924'),
  ('678689925710916177', 'Murder in Le Havre', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Christophe Paturange, Thierry Binisti', 'Sylvain Saada, Mélina Jochum', 'Barbara Cabrita, Frédéric Diefenthal, Nicolas Marié, Gilles Cohen, Antoine Duléry, Alexis Loret, Sarah-Jane Sauvegrain, Anne Loiret', null, 'A mummified corpse has been found by workers who were knocking down a wall. Ariane Sallès and Gaspard Lesage are in charge of the investigation.', 'A mummified corpse has been found by workers who were knocking down a wall. Ariane Sallès and Gaspard Lesage are in charge of the investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncl5LPdlUqxQCNVvqlB434h417M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559829'),
