  ('422683107838286044', 'Murder In Luberon', 2018, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Éric Duret', 'Jean Falculète, Frédéric Faurt', 'Florence Pernel, Guillaume Cramoisan, Lola Dewaere, François Caron, Alexis Moncorgé, Carolina Jurczak, Bernard Verley, Sophie Duez', null, 'Prosecutor Elisabeth Richard teams up with Captain Charles Jouanic to investigate the death of a hunter.', 'Prosecutor Elisabeth Richard teams up with Captain Charles Jouanic to investigate the death of a hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0OIO9u7bJYX1UpNTSCPUPfRZj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551141'),
  ('124194281467729041', 'Murder in Martigues', 2016, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Bernard Déchet, Claude-Michel Rome', 'Jean Falculète', 'Vincent Winterhalter, Florence Pernel, Florence Coste, Bernard Crombey, Laurent Bateau, Charlotte Kady, Jean-François Malet, Jean-Jérôme Esposito', null, 'Elisabeth Richard, a district attorney, and Paul Jansac, a police officer are in charge of the investigation of the death of Pierre Saint-Florent whose corpse was found in a beach near Martigues.', 'Elisabeth Richard, a district attorney, and Paul Jansac, a police officer are in charge of the investigation of the death of Pierre Saint-Florent whose corpse was found in a beach near Martigues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkQ3ozo452n2Q4N7rxcqJ7fU0oa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448164'),
  ('397357391744304052', 'Murder in Maussane', 2017, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Éric Duret', 'Jean Falculète', 'Vincent Winterhalter, Florence Pernel, Isabel Otero, Garance Thénault, Victor Pontecorvo, Jean-Claude Adelin, Éric Viellard, Jean-Yves Chatelais', null, 'Maussane, at the very heart of Provence, with its olive trees and its charming squares. Deputy prosecutor Elisabeth Richard and local police commander Paul Jansac are investigating the murder of Caroline Autiero, wife of an old mill-owner.', 'Maussane, at the very heart of Provence, with its olive trees and its charming squares. Deputy prosecutor Elisabeth Richard and local police commander Paul Jansac are investigating the murder of Caroline Autiero, wife of an old mill-owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPnCHX6wiPj0rvpNIt6RGwdajTi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492678'),
  ('204541192546713327', 'Murder in Mind', 1997, 'Thriller', 'Andrew Morahan, John B. Aronson, Michael Cedar', 'Michael Cooney', 'Nigel Hawthorne, Mary-Louise Parker, Jimmy Smits, Jason Scott Lee, Gailard Sartain, Jon Cedar, Ingo Neuhaus, Art Metrano', null, 'The L.A. police find two bodies in a fancy house and suspect the wife of one victim. Dr. Ellis, a hypnotherapist, takes her back in time; with the police listening, a pattern of spousal abuse emerges. When each trance ends, however, the woman, Carolyn Walker, wonders if those repressed memories are true. Dr. Ellis guides her through her trial, testifies himself, and continues treatment after the verdict is in. Carolyn''s memory and well-being get worse after the trial, not better. She misses some therapy sessions, and Dr. Ellis comes to see her at home. Snatches of memory come and go. Can he help her remember what really happened? Are the cops satisfied justice has been done?', 'The L.A. police find two bodies in a fancy house and suspect the wife of one victim. Dr. Ellis, a hypnotherapist, takes her back in time; with the police listening, a pattern of spousal abuse emerges. When each trance ends, however, the woman, Carolyn Walker, wonders if those repressed memories are true. Dr. Ellis guides her through her trial, testifies himself, and continues treatment after the verdict is in. Carolyn''s memory and well-being get worse after the trial, not better. She misses some therapy sessions, and Dr. Ellis comes to see her at home. Snatches of memory come and go. Can he help her remember what really happened? Are the cops satisfied justice has been done?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpspvucMHmnh8GkWs8HdHrm0Xbm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49727'),
  ('577618742177473091', 'Murder in Monaco', 2025, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Hodges Usry, Tim Cragg', 'Sam Hobkinson', 'Edmond Safra, Lily Safra, Ted Maher, Isabel Vincent, Lady Colin Campbell, Bill Browder, Michael Griffith, Sandrine Setton', 'R', 'Monaco, 1999. One of the world''s richest men dies in his penthouse. This documentary unpacks the mysterious murder of billionaire banker, Edmond Safra.', 'Monaco, 1999. One of the world''s richest men dies in his penthouse. This documentary unpacks the mysterious murder of billionaire banker, Edmond Safra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hW93OYJnnHwGaGa4S2mNxlEhgsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1584619'),
  ('1109731795510777958', 'Murder in Music City', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Dave Thomas, Robert Vardaros', 'Bryan Dick, Ken Sanders', 'Deena Dill, Madison Crawford, Brigdon York, Elizabeth Houston, John Castle', 'TV-14', 'When a rising young musician is found murdered at the estate of country music legend Abilene Tucker, all evidence points to the scandal-plagued diva. But as her estranged daughter Caroline digs for the truth, she uncovers a web of obsession, betrayal, and fame-fueled lies that could destroy them both.', 'When a rising young musician is found murdered at the estate of country music legend Abilene Tucker, all evidence points to the scandal-plagued diva. But as her estranged daughter Caroline digs for the truth, she uncovers a web of obsession, betrayal, and fame-fueled lies that could destroy them both.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fa%2Fgracenote%2Faf8d91a86b3920428ee608220316bef3.jpg', 'plex:movie:murder-in-music-city'),
  ('998945328936639', 'Murder in New Hampshire: The Pamela Wojas Smart Story', 1991, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Joyce Chopra, James Glennon, Jodi Ehrlich', 'William Wood', 'Helen Hunt, Chad Allen, Larry Drake, Hank Stratton, Howard Hesseman, Ken Howard', null, 'Pamela Smart knows exactly what she wants and is willing to do anything to get it. She is fed up with teaching, and her marriage offers little excitement. Looking for a way out she applies for a job at a local TV station. When her dreams of fame are dashed by rejection, she seduces 15-year-old Billy, one of her students. Pam challenges Billy to prove his love for her by getting rid of her husband. The stakes heat up with a huge insurance policy on her husband''s life.', 'Pamela Smart knows exactly what she wants and is willing to do anything to get it. She is fed up with teaching, and her marriage offers little excitement. Looking for a way out she applies for a job at a local TV station. When her dreams of fame are dashed by rejection, she seduces 15-year-old Billy, one of her students. Pam challenges Billy to prove his love for her by getting rid of her husband. The stakes heat up with a huge insurance policy on her husband''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMnAVP1Ulgd8Ma7RnnyhUMH4Qu0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168361'),
  ('1014394158605947399', 'Murder in Provins', 2019, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama, TV Movie', 'Olivier Doran, Benjamin Louet', 'Lorène Delannoy', 'Anne Caillon, Thierry Neuvic, Gil Alma, Stéphan Guérin-Tillié, Julie-Anne Roth, Grégoire Oestermann, Miglen Mirtchev, Lya Oussadit-Lessert', null, 'Renan Thomas, stage director and actor is stabbed when he is playing in The Legend of Knights, a medieval spectacle in Provins.Karin Demarle and her son are witnesses of this intent of murder committed by a disguised person. By chance the help comes soon and the life of Renan is safe. Patrick Robin and his ex-wife Karine Demarle will be in charge of this case of criminal investigation.', 'Renan Thomas, stage director and actor is stabbed when he is playing in The Legend of Knights, a medieval spectacle in Provins.Karin Demarle and her son are witnesses of this intent of murder committed by a disguised person. By chance the help comes soon and the life of Renan is safe. Patrick Robin and his ex-wife Karine Demarle will be in charge of this case of criminal investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/432tBYqpGqBL1pp8dvHvrpf34zC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623298'),
  ('1129768845889405272', 'Murder In Rochefort', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Lorenzo Gabriele', 'Philippe Le Dem', 'Sara Mortensen, Olivier Sitruk, Élisabeth Bourgine, Arielle Sémenoff, Frédéric van den Driessche, Jean-Michel Noirey, Hélène de Saint-Père, Sophie Staub', null, 'Police captains Emma and Adrien look for a killer who would use a silver bullet… on multiple victims.', 'Police captains Emma and Adrien look for a killer who would use a silver bullet… on multiple victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lG8CLPNTymtraRPDO3OFVZoas7E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547202'),
