  ('1126399063328715357', 'Murder In Saint Paul de Vence', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie, Thriller', 'Emmanuel Rigaut', 'Laurent Mondy', 'Mimie Mathy, Mathieu Delarive, Philippe Caroit, Selma Kouchy, Charles Clément, Cécile Pallas, Catherine Zavlav, Louna Espinosa', null, 'National and regional police team up to solve the case of a young woman found dead in a hotel swimming pool.', 'National and regional police team up to solve the case of a young woman found dead in a hotel swimming pool.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vDJGe8yVmGsoPcTBdxZx8ZLfZg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603127'),
  ('605675968652631916', 'Murder In The Auvergne Mountains', 2017, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Marc Tévanian, Bruno Bontzolakis', 'Philippe Donzelot', 'Julie de Bona, Marthe Keller, Joakim Latzko, Jacques Bonnaffé, Agathe Bonitzer, Alexandre Carrière, Geneviève Mnich, Marie-Pierre Nouveau', null, 'In a French thermal town, a man is found poisoned. His ex-girlfriend is arrested for the murder but her estranged cop daughter tries to prove her innocence which leads her much further than she could have ever imagined.', 'In a French thermal town, a man is found poisoned. His ex-girlfriend is arrested for the murder but her estranged cop daughter tries to prove her innocence which leads her much further than she could have ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1Qapmc15fPptbapkvTzBTp1Hhx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461034'),
  ('205434942479752358', 'Murder in the Building', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Rémi Bezançon, Pierre Cottereau, Emmanuel Gomes de Araujo', 'Rémi Bezançon', 'Gilles Lellouche, Laetitia Casta, Guillaume Gallienne, Isabel Aimé González Sola, Jenna Knafo, Katayoon Latif, Matthias Jacquin, Bénédicte Choisnet', null, 'Misanthropic novelist François writes gripping crime stories – “Agatha Christie meets The Scarlet Pimpernel” – but outside of the swashbuckling imaginary world of his Marquis la Rose-novels, life is far from thrilling. His partner Colette, a professor at the Sorbonne and world-renowned expert on Alfred Hitchcock, is tired of watching François sit around their apartment in his pyjamas and yearns for the excitement of the classic films she watches with her students. When Colette begins to suspect their flamboyant actor neighbour of murdering his wife, the couple’s mundane lives are turned upside down – and their stale relationship is jolted back to life.', 'Misanthropic novelist François writes gripping crime stories – “Agatha Christie meets The Scarlet Pimpernel” – but outside of the swashbuckling imaginary world of his Marquis la Rose-novels, life is far from thrilling. His partner Colette, a professor at the Sorbonne and world-renowned expert on Alfred Hitchcock, is tired of watching François sit around their apartment in his pyjamas and yearns for the excitement of the classic films she watches with her students. When Colette begins to suspect their flamboyant actor neighbour of murdering his wife, the couple’s mundane lives are turned upside down – and their stale relationship is jolted back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FHAlQPHFyJEIN1UOxsADog1KUy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1471224'),
  ('447333593509904262', 'Murder in the First', 1995, 'Crime, Drama', 'Marc Rocco, Fred Murphy, Mary Jo Slater', 'Dan Gordon', 'Christian Slater, Kevin Bacon, Gary Oldman, Embeth Davidtz, William H. Macy, Stephen Tobolowsky, Brad Dourif, Kyra Sedgwick', 'R', 'A young, inexperienced public defender is assigned to defend an inmate accused of committing murder while behind bars.', 'A young, inexperienced public defender is assigned to defend an inmate accused of committing murder while behind bars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duUpJUmuz82OKMwGnKc8sCV7emS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8438'),
  ('1100474643357794333', 'Murder in the Highland Manor', 2026, 'Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Ryan Dewar', 'Rachel Flynn', 'Brooke Burfitt, Megan Lockhurst, Paul Luebke, Anja Cilia, Mariah Baillie', 'TV-14', 'American teacher, Kate, takes a job at a remote Scottish estate, but soon becomes entangled in a dark family mystery involving the previous tutor, a guarded teen, and a tragic death that may not be what it seems. Inspired by true events.', 'American teacher, Kate, takes a job at a remote Scottish estate, but soon becomes entangled in a dark family mystery involving the previous tutor, a guarded teen, and a tragic death that may not be what it seems. Inspired by true events.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FrsZpzA7Ssu9m3X3fCcEDxjPXFet.jpg', 'plex:movie:murder-in-the-highland-manor'),
  ('750027060792710387', 'Murder In The Maures Mountains', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Belmudes, Christian Guérinel, Olivier Guarguir', 'Christian Guérinel, Richard Roulet, Lionel Pasquier', 'Laurent Ournac, Hélène Degy, Christian Rauth, Frédéric Maranber, Laurent Spielvogel, Estelle Vincent, Cédric Chevalme, Théo Bertrand', null, 'Soldiers discover a body riddled with arrows during military training in the forest.', 'Soldiers discover a body riddled with arrows during military training in the forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2FHy6C9i1bOQQUnIBsKYEgpO3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:625463'),
  ('14016573351538505', 'Murder in the Private Car', 1934, 'Mystery, Romance, Comedy', 'Harry Beaumont, Harry Sharrock, Earl Taggert', 'Edgar Allan Woolf, Ralph Spence, Al Boasberg', 'Charles Ruggles, Una Merkel, Mary Carlisle, Russell Hardie, Porter Hall, Willard Robertson, Berton Churchill, Clifford Thompson', null, 'Ruth Raymond works on the telephone switchboard of a large NYC office building. One day, a private detective informs her that she is actually the daughter of railroad tycoon Luke Carson, and that she had been kidnapped as a baby 14 years ago by Luke''s vindictive brother Elwood, and placed with strangers.', 'Ruth Raymond works on the telephone switchboard of a large NYC office building. One day, a private detective informs her that she is actually the daughter of railroad tycoon Luke Carson, and that she had been kidnapped as a baby 14 years ago by Luke''s vindictive brother Elwood, and placed with strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpRqT5rSrtngkqb0nq6HUONIj6i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84912'),
  ('1097224514507676419', 'Murder In The Tarentaise Valley', 2018, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Laurent Dussaux', 'Véronique Lecharpy, Nicolas Tackian', 'Grégori Derangère, Flore Bonaventura, Jérôme Anger, Charlie Dupont, Carole Richert, Guillaume Arnault, Jonathan Genet', null, 'While she was jogging Lisa Campion , the daughter of the retired police officer Fabio Campion , discovered the frozen corpse of Julien , a child who disappeared 20 years ago.The police officer Simon Beauregard is then sent to Roches Noires , a village of the Tarentaise Valley, for the criminal investigation.', 'While she was jogging Lisa Campion , the daughter of the retired police officer Fabio Campion , discovered the frozen corpse of Julien , a child who disappeared 20 years ago.The police officer Simon Beauregard is then sent to Roches Noires , a village of the Tarentaise Valley, for the criminal investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eE7WYKg4s54A5H4AL5YB4siqc6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515673'),
  ('542335009906537418', 'Murder in Three Acts', 1986, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Neil Roach, Gary Nelson, Jorge Bustos', 'Scott Swanton', 'Peter Ustinov, Tony Curtis, Emma Samms, Jonathan Cecil, Fernando Allende, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Lisa Eichhorn, Dana Elcar', null, 'In Acapulco, Hercule Poirot attends a dinner party in which one of the guests clutches his throat and suddenly dies. The causes seem to be natural until another party with most of the same guests produces another corpse.', 'In Acapulco, Hercule Poirot attends a dinner party in which one of the guests clutches his throat and suddenly dies. The causes seem to be natural until another party with most of the same guests produces another corpse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qEaWC5N5q2VcAsphXkljZlfvFH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6107'),
  ('279074531328628932', 'Murder in Tours', 2018, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, TV Movie', 'Dominique De Wever, François Guérin', 'David D''Aquaro', 'Isabel Otero, Marwan Berreni, Laurent Olmedo, Sara Mortensen, Adèle Simphal, Nathalie Besançon, Jean-Michel Noirey, Moussa Sylla', null, 'Police Commander Louise Chaland is investigating the murder of a controversial sculptor with the help of her son Sylvain, who has become a priest. The body was discovered alongside one of his works, which has been daubed with Latin inscriptions. They soon establish a link with the disappearance of a relic of Saint Martin, the patron saint of the city of Tours. Their investigation leads them to a shelter for the needy, run by François Delcourt and his daughter, who was in love with the murdered artist. Clues start to reveal the disturbing fascination some inhabitants of Tours have with the missing relic. Louise and Sylvain will discover the rich historical and religious heritage of the city as the secular mother and pious son come to some sort of a reconciliation.', 'Police Commander Louise Chaland is investigating the murder of a controversial sculptor with the help of her son Sylvain, who has become a priest. The body was discovered alongside one of his works, which has been daubed with Latin inscriptions. They soon establish a link with the disappearance of a relic of Saint Martin, the patron saint of the city of Tours. Their investigation leads them to a shelter for the needy, run by François Delcourt and his daughter, who was in love with the murdered artist. Clues start to reveal the disturbing fascination some inhabitants of Tours have with the missing relic. Louise and Sylvain will discover the rich historical and religious heritage of the city as the secular mother and pious son come to some sort of a reconciliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJ51dn3PrNl2yH6IhWJB1Ol2OC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515669'),
  ('479165018168397665', 'Murder Is Easy', 1982, 'Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Claude Whatham, Brian Tufano', null, 'Bill Bixby, Helen Hayes, Lesley-Anne Down, Olivia de Havilland, Patrick Allen, Shane Briant, Freddie Jones, Leigh Lawson', null, 'American computer whiz Luke Williams meets elderly Lavinia Fullerton on a London-bound train. She reveals she''s discovered the identity of a serial killer in her village and is going to report it to Scotland Yard. When she is murdered after disembarking the train, Williams vows to pursue the case himself.', 'American computer whiz Luke Williams meets elderly Lavinia Fullerton on a London-bound train. She reveals she''s discovered the identity of a serial killer in her village and is going to report it to Scotland Yard. When she is murdered after disembarking the train, Williams vows to pursue the case himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylFfhLWNO6Na38AeI0q69H3v9IX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21125'),
  ('51945980687391228', 'Murder Is My Beat', 1955, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Harold E. Wellman, Edgar G. Ulmer, Raoul Pagel', 'Aubrey Wisberg', 'Paul Langton, Barbara Payton, Robert Shayne, Selena Royle, Roy Gordon, Tracey Roberts, Kate MacKenna, Harry Harvey', null, 'Mr. Dean''s body is found face down in the fireplace, burned beyond recognition. Nightclub-singer Eden Lane is convicted of the crime. She is escorted to prison by one of the arresting detectives when she convinces him that she just spotted the murderer outside their train.', 'Mr. Dean''s body is found face down in the fireplace, burned beyond recognition. Nightclub-singer Eden Lane is convicted of the crime. She is escorted to prison by one of the arresting detectives when she convinces him that she just spotted the murderer outside their train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKnP4XNZ32VcpaqDFT4TasccNMz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29284'),
