  ('237413427767353797', 'Murder Mubarak', 2024, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Homi Adajania, Linesh Desai, Panchami Ghavri', 'Suprotim Sengupta, Gazal Dhaliwal', 'Pankaj Tripathi, Sara Ali Khan, Vijay Varma, Tisca Chopra, Sanjay Kapoor, Karisma Kapoor, Dimple Kapadia, Suhail Nayyar', null, 'When a gym trainer is murdered at an elite Delhi club, a wily investigator unravels the sordid secrets of its ultrarich members to find the killer.', 'When a gym trainer is murdered at an elite Delhi club, a wily investigator unravels the sordid secrets of its ultrarich members to find the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joU5VihgUvkhyPnhzxfjmWk32rd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1051023'),
  ('701575997412515503', 'Murder Mystery', 2019, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Kyle Newacheck, Gary Powell, Michele Laliberte', 'James Vanderbilt', 'Adam Sandler, Jennifer Aniston, Luke Evans, Terence Stamp, Gemma Arterton, David Walliams, Dany Boon, John Kani', 'PG-13', 'On a long-awaited trip to Europe, a New York City cop and his hairdresser wife scramble to solve a baffling murder aboard a billionaire''s yacht.', 'On a long-awaited trip to Europe, a New York City cop and his hairdresser wife scramble to solve a baffling murder aboard a billionaire''s yacht.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSMSO9xupd4R4vwTPqigHn2quLN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514999'),
  ('809710657626836887', 'Murder Mystery 2', 2023, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime', 'Bojan Bazelli, Jeremy Garelick, Simon Witte', 'James Vanderbilt', 'Adam Sandler, Jennifer Aniston, Mark Strong, Mélanie Laurent, Jodie Turner-Smith, John Kani, Kuhoo Verma, Dany Boon', 'PG-13', 'After starting their own detective agency, Nick and Audrey Spitz land a career-making case when their billionaire pal is kidnapped from his wedding.', 'After starting their own detective agency, Nick and Audrey Spitz land a career-making case when their billionaire pal is kidnapped from his wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1VzVhXlqsevi8zeCMG9A16nEUf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638974'),
  ('229875061062107349', 'Murder Obsession', 1981, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Riccardo Freda, Cristiano Pogany', 'Antonio Cesare Corti, Fabio Piccioni, Riccardo Freda', 'Stefano Patrizi, Martine Brochard, Henri Garcin, Laura Gemser, John Richardson, Anita Strindberg, Silvia Dionisio, Fabrizio Moroni', 'NR', 'Michael is a successful actor, but he has a scandal in his past: at a tender age he knifed his father to death. He and his girlfriend Deborah go to his mother''s for the weekend, and are joined by the director and others from a recent film project, who are given a rather cool reception by the superstitious housekeeper Oliver. Soon rude things begin happening to some of the guests, and Michael fears a repeat of his nightmare past is in progress.', 'Michael is a successful actor, but he has a scandal in his past: at a tender age he knifed his father to death. He and his girlfriend Deborah go to his mother''s for the weekend, and are joined by the director and others from a recent film project, who are given a rather cool reception by the superstitious housekeeper Oliver. Soon rude things begin happening to some of the guests, and Michael fears a repeat of his nightmare past is in progress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHjkcGVds5tsBVYx4n8YqDZTbgw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50425'),
  ('730491598444648586', 'Murder of a Cat', 2014, 'Thriller, Comedy, Mystery', 'Gillian Greene, Christophe Lanzenberg', 'Christian Magalhaes, Robert Snow', 'Fran Kranz, Nikki Reed, J.K. Simmons, Leonardo Nam, Dileep Rao, Aidan Andrews, Brian Turk, Blythe Danner', null, 'When someone murders his beloved cat, Clinton, an adult child, demands justice. Taking it upon himself to solve the case, he teams up with an unlikely ally, Greta, and the two set out to find the culprit lurking in their small suburban town. But as Clinton searches for the truth, he begins to uncover a conspiracy that goes far deeper than he anticipated.', 'When someone murders his beloved cat, Clinton, an adult child, demands justice. Taking it upon himself to solve the case, he teams up with an unlikely ally, Greta, and the two set out to find the culprit lurking in their small suburban town. But as Clinton searches for the truth, he begins to uncover a conspiracy that goes far deeper than he anticipated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EvO8g1Mx2qOHkNpW27lSBKujH9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266718'),
  ('49424089544203281', 'Murder of Innocence', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Tom McLoughlin, Shelly Johnson, Nancy King', null, 'Valerie Bertinelli, Stephen Caffrey, Graham Beckel, Jerry Hardin, Millie Perkins, Justin Whalin, Anne Ramsay, Steven Banks', 'PG-13', 'In this shocking account based on a true story, newlywed Laurie Wade finds her marriage, and eventually the rest of her life, shattered by her deep-rooted psychotic behavior. The young woman soon begins a terrifying descent into insanity and brings danger to all those around her as she goes from brief "short-circuits" to overtly murderous behavior.', 'In this shocking account based on a true story, newlywed Laurie Wade finds her marriage, and eventually the rest of her life, shattered by her deep-rooted psychotic behavior. The young woman soon begins a terrifying descent into insanity and brings danger to all those around her as she goes from brief "short-circuits" to overtly murderous behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BZ8Woa5wECs6WRGYsy5ARr19MS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132109'),
  ('180397603395807863', 'Murder of the Inugami Clan', 2006, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Kon Ichikawa, Toshimasa Miyamura, Yukio Isohata', 'Kon Ichikawa, Shinya Hidaka', 'Koji Ishizaka, Nanako Matsushima, Kikunosuke Onoe V, Sumiko Fuji, Keiko Matsuzaka, Hisako Manda, Shingo Katsurayama, Mansaku Ikeuchi', null, 'Inugami Sahei, who built up the wealth of the Inugami Clan, passes away, leaving a will with Furudate, his legal adviser, for his daughters Matsuko, Takeko and Umeko, all of whom have different mothers, and for their sons, as well as for Nonomiya Tamayo, the granddaughter of a person to whom Sahei feels heavily indebted. The will states that all his assets are inherited by Tamayo alone, on the condition that she marries one of the sons of the daughters. Furudate''s assistant learns the content of the will, and seeks advice from Kindaichi Kosuke, a private detective, as he senses the air of unease. Shortly afterwards, murders start to occur one after another in the clan.', 'Inugami Sahei, who built up the wealth of the Inugami Clan, passes away, leaving a will with Furudate, his legal adviser, for his daughters Matsuko, Takeko and Umeko, all of whom have different mothers, and for their sons, as well as for Nonomiya Tamayo, the granddaughter of a person to whom Sahei feels heavily indebted. The will states that all his assets are inherited by Tamayo alone, on the condition that she marries one of the sons of the daughters. Furudate''s assistant learns the content of the will, and seeks advice from Kindaichi Kosuke, a private detective, as he senses the air of unease. Shortly afterwards, murders start to occur one after another in the clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlXIHaVK7bsCzr7h92SgVNanCO5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76759'),
  ('348650741961468950', 'Murder on a Bridle Path', 1936, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'William Hamilton, Edward Killy, Nicholas Musuraca', 'Dorothy Yost, Thomas Lennon, Edmund H. North', 'James Gleason, Helen Broderick, Louise Latimer, Owen Davis Jr., John Arledge, John Carroll, Leslie Fenton, Christian Rub', 'NR', 'When the body of Violet Feverel is discovered on the Central Park bridle path, Inspector Oscar Piper is about to declare her death accidental from a thrown horse, until his friend and amateur detective Hildegarde Withers locates the horse and discovers blood on the horse.', 'When the body of Violet Feverel is discovered on the Central Park bridle path, Inspector Oscar Piper is about to declare her death accidental from a thrown horse, until his friend and amateur detective Hildegarde Withers locates the horse and discovers blood on the horse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMUdyT2cqvxPjYyyUYgOvq59EIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65462'),
  ('255631350468110285', 'Murder on a Honeymoon', 1935, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Lloyd Corrigan, Nicholas Musuraca, Alberto Colombo', 'John Twist', 'Edna May Oliver, James Gleason, Lola Lane, George Meeker, Dorothy Libaire, Harry Ellerbe, Chick Chandler, Willie Best', 'NR', 'An amateur sleuth suspects foul play when a fellow passenger on a seaplane suddenly dies. The third and final film with Edna May Oliver and James Gleason as the astute schoolteacher Hildegarde Withers and the New York Police Inspector Oscar Piper busy solving crimes.', 'An amateur sleuth suspects foul play when a fellow passenger on a seaplane suddenly dies. The third and final film with Edna May Oliver and James Gleason as the astute schoolteacher Hildegarde Withers and the New York Police Inspector Oscar Piper busy solving crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmeR2WKMwMRDJNeVH24kBnNOsPm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76483'),
