  ('932982857440366908', 'Murder on Aix Island', 2017, 'Mystery, Crime, TV Movie', 'Dominique De Wever, François Guérin', 'David D''Aquaro', 'Julie Ferrier, François Vincentelli, Vincent Winterhalter, Annick Blancheteau, Isabel Otero, Marwan Berreni, Guillaume Arnault, Marie Petiot', null, 'A body is found in a boat adrift somewhere between Fort Boyard and Aix Island. Solène Brach from the mainland police is sent to investigate.', 'A body is found in a boat adrift somewhere between Fort Boyard and Aix Island. Solène Brach from the mainland police is sent to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GxRpMuivYF5ZkWy1FyWhARZd5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443987'),
  ('539223288761893552', 'Murder on D Street', 2015, 'Mystery', 'Shoji Kubota', 'Shoji Kubota', 'Shoko, Ryunosuke Kawai, Kōta Kusano, Houka Kinoshita, Yoshimasa Kondo, Takashi Nishina, Eiko Ohtani', null, 'A soba restaurant owner dies mysteriously on D. Street. The police rule it as a suicide, but detective Akechi Kogoro and his wife Fumiyo think otherwise and launch their own investigation. As they delve deeper, they discover relationships twisted by perverted desire and hideous affection and hatred.', 'A soba restaurant owner dies mysteriously on D. Street. The police rule it as a suicide, but detective Akechi Kogoro and his wife Fumiyo think otherwise and launch their own investigation. As they delve deeper, they discover relationships twisted by perverted desire and hideous affection and hatred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hCtpxgGEg21NvlinjmgP83OvKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342434'),
