  ('450318191509422614', 'Murder on Omaha Beach', 2018, 'Mystery, Drama, TV Movie', 'Jean-Pierre Ramsay-Levi, Alain Ducousset, Claude-Michel Rome', 'Claude-Michel Rome', 'Claire Borotra, Claire Chazal, Jean-François Balmer, Michel Jonasz, Pierre Deny, Frédéric Amico, Élizabeth Macocco, Damien Leconte', null, 'Captain Eloïse Gentil, of Caen police, hasn''t been on speaking terms with her father Robert, an expert on WWII, for twenty years. But the two are brought together to investigate the death of James Crawley, a 91 year-old former GI, found tied to a pole and in his uniform, apparently executed "as an example".', 'Captain Eloïse Gentil, of Caen police, hasn''t been on speaking terms with her father Robert, an expert on WWII, for twenty years. But the two are brought together to investigate the death of James Crawley, a 91 year-old former GI, found tied to a pole and in his uniform, apparently executed "as an example".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lGUc8GprTghkVps1KO13t9llQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555319'),
