  ('1131945263968869590', 'Murder with Mirrors', 1985, 'Mystery, Crime, TV Movie', 'Dick Lowry, Brian West', null, 'Helen Hayes, Bette Davis, John Mills, Leo McKern, Liane Langland, John Laughlin, Dorothy Tutin, Anton Rodgers', 'NR', 'When Miss Jane Marple arrives at palatial Stonygates, one thing is certain. Before there''s time to lather a warm scone with marmalade and place a tea cozy, murder most foul is bound to occur.', 'When Miss Jane Marple arrives at palatial Stonygates, one thing is certain. Before there''s time to lather a warm scone with marmalade and place a tea cozy, murder most foul is bound to occur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVRzRsYYuSuMpf5ZwlNI0ENUp1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6032'),
  ('663078769346355544', 'Murder-Rock: Dancing Death', 1984, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Lucio Fulci, Giuseppe Pinori, Roberto Giandalia', 'Gianfranco Clerici, Vincenzo Mannino, Roberto Gianviti', 'Olga Karlatos, Ray Lovelock, Cosimo Cinieri, Giuseppe Mannajuolo, Claudio Cassinelli, Berna Maria do Carmo, Belinda Busato, Maria Vittoria Tolazzi', null, 'The world of dance can be brutal. The rehearsals are grueling. The competition is fierce. At the Arts for Living Centre in New York City, the best of the best are dying for a part in a major production. But only a select few will be chosen. The selection process seems to be at the hands of mysterious killer who pierces women''s bare breasts with a hatpin, puncturing their hearts. Ambition and jealousy appear to be the motive, which makes everybody a suspect!', 'The world of dance can be brutal. The rehearsals are grueling. The competition is fierce. At the Arts for Living Centre in New York City, the best of the best are dying for a part in a major production. But only a select few will be chosen. The selection process seems to be at the hands of mysterious killer who pierces women''s bare breasts with a hatpin, puncturing their hearts. Ambition and jealousy appear to be the motive, which makes everybody a suspect!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8pH1u0P8t2FIkBgiXZS9oJ20yj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40145'),
  ('66292019988412194', 'Murder, He Says', 1945, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime, Horror', 'George Marshall, Theodor Sparkuhl, Arthur S. Black Jr.', 'Lou Breslow', 'Fred MacMurray, Helen Walker, Marjorie Main, Jean Heather, Porter Hall, Peter Whitney, Mabel Paige, Barbara Pepper', null, 'Pete Marshall is sent as a replacement to the mountain district town of Plainville when a public opinion surveyor who went there goes missing. Visiting the hillbilly family of Mamie Fleagle, Pete begins to suspect that she and her two sons have murdered the surveyor. Pete then believes that Mamie is slowly poisoning wealthy Grandma Fleagle, who has put a vital clue to her fortune in a nonsensical embroidered sampler.', 'Pete Marshall is sent as a replacement to the mountain district town of Plainville when a public opinion surveyor who went there goes missing. Visiting the hillbilly family of Mamie Fleagle, Pete begins to suspect that she and her two sons have murdered the surveyor. Pete then believes that Mamie is slowly poisoning wealthy Grandma Fleagle, who has put a vital clue to her fortune in a nonsensical embroidered sampler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVvZNwBYPwVNv1KQKi34N0re5N0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110790'),
  ('278048090685219939', 'Murder, Inc.', 1960, 'Crime, Drama', 'Stuart Rosenberg, Burt Balaban, Gayne Rescher', 'Mel Barr, Irve Tunick', 'Stuart Whitman, May Britt, Peter Falk, Henry Morgan, Simon Oakland, David J. Stewart, Sarah Vaughan, Morey Amsterdam', null, 'Chronicles the rise and fall of the organised crime syndicate known as Murder, Incorporated, focusing on powerful boss Lepke and violent hit man Reles.', 'Chronicles the rise and fall of the organised crime syndicate known as Murder, Incorporated, focusing on powerful boss Lepke and violent hit man Reles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXfClepcsBNNbiBvZ5IDt329Pbq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15375'),
