  ('1116157621683331551', 'Murder, She Baked: A Chocolate Chip Cookie Mystery', 2015, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Drama', 'Mark Jean, Adam Sliwinski, Tim Sereda', 'Donald Martin', 'Alison Sweeney, Cameron Mathison, Barbara Niven, Gabriel Hogan, Lisa Durupt, Toby Levins, Juliana Wimbles, Meredith McGeachie', 'G', 'Based on the New York Times bestselling book, Chocolate Chip Cookie Murder by Joanne Fluke, the film will take viewers on a mouthwatering mystery that centers on Hannah Swensen, shop owner of the Cookie Jar where much of the town''s gossip percolates along with the strong coffee. But when a mysterious murder occurs, Hannah turns into a culinary detective and finds herself trying to solve the crime while getting caught in an unexpected romantic mystery of her own.', 'Based on the New York Times bestselling book, Chocolate Chip Cookie Murder by Joanne Fluke, the film will take viewers on a mouthwatering mystery that centers on Hannah Swensen, shop owner of the Cookie Jar where much of the town''s gossip percolates along with the strong coffee. But when a mysterious murder occurs, Hannah turns into a culinary detective and finds herself trying to solve the crime while getting caught in an unexpected romantic mystery of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxUNSe2hQMaOAX4cUTxqkYSgaQu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328848'),
  ('1091037242339656693', 'Murder, She Baked: A Deadly Recipe', 2016, 'Mystery, TV Movie', 'Adam Sliwinski, Arlene L. Arnold, Jennifer Nelson', 'Teena Booth', 'Alison Sweeney, Cameron Mathison, Barbara Niven, Gabriel Hogan, Toby Levins, Lisa Durupt, Aaron Pearl, Hugo Steele', null, 'Bakery owner Hannah Swensen just can''t keep her hands out of the batter when murder stirs things up in Lake Eden, Minnesota, leaving the sheriff dead, a deputy accused, and a killer on the loose.', 'Bakery owner Hannah Swensen just can''t keep her hands out of the batter when murder stirs things up in Lake Eden, Minnesota, leaving the sheriff dead, a deputy accused, and a killer on the loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DC9LYpEKu3nj7tRkahOKwB8Lp5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392629'),
  ('384495086320531616', 'Murder, She Baked: A Peach Cobbler Mystery', 2016, 'Mystery, TV Movie', 'Kristoffer Tabori, Dave Pelletier', 'Teena Booth', 'Alison Sweeney, Cameron Mathison, Barbara Niven, Gabriel Hogan, Lisa Durupt, Michelle Harrison, Roark Critchlow, Garry Chalk', 'G', 'With The Cookie Jar, Hannah Swensen has a mouthwatering monopoly on the bakery business of Lake Eden, Minnesota. But when a rival store opens, and one of the owners is found shot to death in the store, Hannah is determined to prove that she wasn''t the only one who had an axe to grind with the Quinn sisters. Somebody wasn''t fooled by the Georgia Peaches and their sweet-as-pie act--and now it''s up to Hannah to track down whoever had the right ingredients to whip up a murder.', 'With The Cookie Jar, Hannah Swensen has a mouthwatering monopoly on the bakery business of Lake Eden, Minnesota. But when a rival store opens, and one of the owners is found shot to death in the store, Hannah is determined to prove that she wasn''t the only one who had an axe to grind with the Quinn sisters. Somebody wasn''t fooled by the Georgia Peaches and their sweet-as-pie act--and now it''s up to Hannah to track down whoever had the right ingredients to whip up a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j01HSBHf7EhYXdlI4vbdRrqX7Tf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371181'),
  ('1050396582417488089', 'Murder, She Baked: A Plum Pudding Mystery', 2015, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Drama', 'Kristoffer Tabori, Todd Williams', 'Nancey Silvers', 'Alison Sweeney, Cameron Mathison, Barbara Niven, Gabriel Hogan, Lisa Durupt, Johannah Newmarch, Toby Levins, Kyla Wise', null, 'A young bakeshop owner’s holiday season takes a surprising turn when she finds a body at a local Christmas tree lot and winds up involved in a dangerous murder investigation. With colorful characters popping up as suspects, shady business practices uncovered at the tree lot and holiday romance in the air, the young baker-turned-sleuth must race against time to track down the killer and save the Christmas season.', 'A young bakeshop owner’s holiday season takes a surprising turn when she finds a body at a local Christmas tree lot and winds up involved in a dangerous murder investigation. With colorful characters popping up as suspects, shady business practices uncovered at the tree lot and holiday romance in the air, the young baker-turned-sleuth must race against time to track down the killer and save the Christmas season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcT1xa0rKzsBj6IBLgd8KJNKVsX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361751'),
  ('54774884244287644', 'Murder, She Baked: Just Desserts', 2017, 'Mystery, TV Movie', 'Thomas Ma, Kristoffer Tabori, Rosalee Yagihara', 'Melissa Salmons', 'Alison Sweeney, Cameron Mathison, Barbara Niven, Gabriel Hogan, Lisa Durupt, Toby Levins, David James Lewis, Tammy Gillis', 'G', 'Hannah Swensen is thrilled when she is chosen as a guest for the first Eden Lake Dessert Bake-Off, but when fellow judge, Coach Bishop is found murdered, Hannah once again takes it upon herself to find the killer.', 'Hannah Swensen is thrilled when she is chosen as a guest for the first Eden Lake Dessert Bake-Off, but when fellow judge, Coach Bishop is found murdered, Hannah once again takes it upon herself to find the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9B67nXWHR7fwv9tZwEeriSn2II.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436401'),
