  ('1066274333553676537', 'Murderous Children', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Ulyses Contreras, Ricardo Tavera', 'Ricardo Tavera, Armando Tavera', 'Uriel Reymund, Kay Ciani, Israel Jiménez, Adrián Escalona, Jaime Her Alvídrez, Andrea Jimalva, Itzel Mondragón, Octavio Vargas', 'R', '4 stories about 4 criminal children. Two teenagers trapped in a world full of drugs and human trafficking, another two kids bring their loved ones to the limit, other two resentful kids want to fulfill their most evil desires, and one kid who has to decide between killing or loving.', '4 stories about 4 criminal children. Two teenagers trapped in a world full of drugs and human trafficking, another two kids bring their loved ones to the limit, other two resentful kids want to fulfill their most evil desires, and one kid who has to decide between killing or loving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xO9wQO4B90BvqdbFKjOQsR9o9eL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522554'),
  ('737398909305625435', 'Murderous Maids', 2000, 'Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Denis, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Jean-Pierre Denis, Michèle Pétin', 'Julie-Marie Parmentier, Sylvie Testud, Isabelle Renauld, François Levantal, Dominique Labourier, Jean-Gabriel Nordmann, Marie Donnio, Lily Boulogne', null, 'Based on the true story of two chambermaids of 1930s France who murdered their employer and her daughter.', 'Based on the true story of two chambermaids of 1930s France who murdered their employer and her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZHVyEF1e5KTBiVwY04XVcypN0n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62124'),
  ('1076525473035809691', 'Murders at the House of Death', 2019, 'Mystery, Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Hisashi Kimura, Takahito Kasai', 'Mitsuharu Makita', 'Ryunosuke Kamiki, Minami Hamabe, Yuki Furukawa, Tokio Emoto, Riko Fukumoto, Eri Fuse, Shono Hayama, Tetsuhiro Ikeda', null, 'Yuzuru Hamura is a university student and a fan of mystery novels. Against his will, he was forced to join the school''s mystery club. The club is led by Kyosuke Akechi. Meanwhile, Hiruko Kenzaki appears in front of them. She attends the same university and she is also a private detective. These 3 people attend a summer camp and stay at Shijinso pension in the mountains. On their first day there, they must barricade themselves in the pension. The next morning, they discover a murder has taken place in the pension.', 'Yuzuru Hamura is a university student and a fan of mystery novels. Against his will, he was forced to join the school''s mystery club. The club is led by Kyosuke Akechi. Meanwhile, Hiruko Kenzaki appears in front of them. She attends the same university and she is also a private detective. These 3 people attend a summer camp and stay at Shijinso pension in the mountains. On their first day there, they must barricade themselves in the pension. The next morning, they discover a murder has taken place in the pension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNEZC380RCCAmHFVTDPkqUxSGOy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651879'),
  ('936523863464910145', 'Murders in Savoie', 2017, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Dominique De Wever, Alain Berliner', 'Fabienne Lesieur, Thomas Perrier, Aurélie Belko', 'Christophe Malavoy, Armelle Deutsch, Guillaume Cramoisan, Fatou N''Diaye, Frédéric Andrau, Manoëlle Gaillard, Yann Pradal, Élisabeth Commelin', null, 'The peaceful resort of Meribel is about to open for the ski season when a man''s body is discovered at the top of a chairlift, covered in wolf skin. Clara and George Kessler, the father-and-daughter detective team leading the inquiry, are certain the crime is connected to the war being waged between livestock farmers and environmentalists ever since wolves were reintroduced into the valley. Among locals, far-fetched theories are stirring panic-could a werewolf be terrorizing the valley? For the Kesslers, the murder will uncover a secret that may not be supernatural, but is just as shocking.', 'The peaceful resort of Meribel is about to open for the ski season when a man''s body is discovered at the top of a chairlift, covered in wolf skin. Clara and George Kessler, the father-and-daughter detective team leading the inquiry, are certain the crime is connected to the war being waged between livestock farmers and environmentalists ever since wolves were reintroduced into the valley. Among locals, far-fetched theories are stirring panic-could a werewolf be terrorizing the valley? For the Kesslers, the murder will uncover a secret that may not be supernatural, but is just as shocking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phvCG0diHECsrdRwh1HItwxIn7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499135'),
  ('874464416683531130', 'Murders in the Rue Morgue', 1932, 'Horror, Mystery, Crime', 'Robert Florey, Karl Freund, Charles S. Gould', 'Richard Schayer, Ethel M. Kelly', 'Sidney Fox, Bela Lugosi, Leon Ames, Bert Roach, Betty Ross Clarke, Brandon Hurst, D''Arcy Corrigan, Noble Johnson', null, 'In 19th century Paris, a maniac abducts young women and injects them with ape blood in an attempt to prove ape-human kinship but constantly meets failure as the abducted women die.', 'In 19th century Paris, a maniac abducts young women and injects them with ape blood in an attempt to prove ape-human kinship but constantly meets failure as the abducted women die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vd7APCDkYTL0ZpNc88XB1uEYCQx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28435'),
  ('700593994549927922', 'Murders in the Rue Morgue', 1971, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Gordon Hessler, Manuel Berenguer, Kuki López Rodero', 'Henry Slesar, Christopher Wicking', 'Jason Robards, Herbert Lom, Christine Kaufmann, Adolfo Celi, Maria Perschy, Michael Dunn, Lilli Palmer, Peter Arne', 'PG-13', 'In Paris, in the beginning of the Twentieth Century, Cesar Charron owns a theater at the Rue Morgue where he performs the play "Murders in the Rue Morgue" with his wife Madeleine Charron, who has dreadful nightmares. When there are several murders by acid of people connected to Cesar, the prime suspect of Inspector Vidocq would be Cesar''s former partner Rene Marot. But Marot murdered Madeleine''s mother many years ago and committed suicide immediately after.', 'In Paris, in the beginning of the Twentieth Century, Cesar Charron owns a theater at the Rue Morgue where he performs the play "Murders in the Rue Morgue" with his wife Madeleine Charron, who has dreadful nightmares. When there are several murders by acid of people connected to Cesar, the prime suspect of Inspector Vidocq would be Cesar''s former partner Rene Marot. But Marot murdered Madeleine''s mother many years ago and committed suicide immediately after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsOsvrO0Xd1Ir79C2cHDl6X17xU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63512'),
  ('782211513523716016', 'Murders in the Zoo', 1933, 'Crime, Horror', 'A. Edward Sutherland, Ernest Haller', 'Seton I. Miller, Philip Wylie', 'Charles Ruggles, Lionel Atwill, Gail Patrick, Randolph Scott, John Lodge, Kathleen Burke, Harry Beresford, Jane Darwell', null, 'Dr. Gorman is a millionaire adventurer, traveling the world in search of dangerous game. His bored, beautiful, much younger wife entertains herself in the arms of other men. In turn, Gorman uses his animals to kill these men. When a New York City zoo suggests a fundraising gala, Gorman sees a prime opportunity to dispatch the dashing Roger and anyone else who might cross him.', 'Dr. Gorman is a millionaire adventurer, traveling the world in search of dangerous game. His bored, beautiful, much younger wife entertains herself in the arms of other men. In turn, Gorman uses his animals to kill these men. When a New York City zoo suggests a fundraising gala, Gorman sees a prime opportunity to dispatch the dashing Roger and anyone else who might cross him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GL0POYXHakLfgWSi0iwehLdhcY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39311'),
  ('8333846923105084', 'Murer: Anatomy of a Trial', 2018, 'Drama', 'Christian Frosch, Frank Amann', 'Christian Frosch', 'Karl Fischer, Alexander E. Fennon, Karl Markovics, Franz Buchrieser, Inge Maux, Susi Stach, Gerhard Liebmann, Doval''e Glickman', null, 'Franz Murer, the Butcher of Vilnius, a former Austrian SS officer, established, organized, and ruled the Vilnius ghetto in Lithuania during the World War II. Different survivors of the Shoah testify when he is judged in 1963, hoping to do justice, but, although the evidence is overwhelming, the desire to close this obscure chapter of history seems to surpass the desire for justice.', 'Franz Murer, the Butcher of Vilnius, a former Austrian SS officer, established, organized, and ruled the Vilnius ghetto in Lithuania during the World War II. Different survivors of the Shoah testify when he is judged in 1963, hoping to do justice, but, although the evidence is overwhelming, the desire to close this obscure chapter of history seems to surpass the desire for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQiYD5G2jts0C5SDFbvEtOJGk4N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482303'),
  ('793185070857338196', 'Muriel, or the Time of Return', 1963, 'Drama', 'Alain Resnais, Sacha Vierny, Pierre Grunstein', 'Jean Cayrol, Jean Cayrol', 'Delphine Seyrig, Jean-Pierre Kérien, Jean-Baptiste Thiérrée, Nita Klein, Claude Sainval, Laurence Badie, Martine Vatel, Philippe Laudenbach', null, 'In the seaside town of Boulogne, no one seems to be able to cope with their past, least of all Hélène, an antique furniture saleswoman, her stepson Bernard, and her former lover Alphonse.', 'In the seaside town of Boulogne, no one seems to be able to cope with their past, least of all Hélène, an antique furniture saleswoman, her stepson Bernard, and her former lover Alphonse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81tm32XqS9efV9bFV9qbThHD3yJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54563'),
  ('684690785453560199', 'Muriel''s Wedding', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'P.J. Hogan, Martin McGrath, Tony Mahood', 'P.J. Hogan', 'Toni Collette, Bill Hunter, Rachel Griffiths, Sophie Lee, Jeanie Drynan, Gennie Nevinson, Daniel Lapaine, Matt Day', 'R', 'Socially awkward Muriel Heslop wants nothing more than to get married. Unfortunately, due to her oppressive politician father, Muriel has never even been on a date. Ostracized by her more socially adept friends, Muriel runs into fellow outcast Rhonda Epinstalk, and the two move from their small Australian town to the big city of Sydney, where Muriel changes her name and begins the arduous task of redesigning her life to match her fantasies.', 'Socially awkward Muriel Heslop wants nothing more than to get married. Unfortunately, due to her oppressive politician father, Muriel has never even been on a date. Ostracized by her more socially adept friends, Muriel runs into fellow outcast Rhonda Epinstalk, and the two move from their small Australian town to the big city of Sydney, where Muriel changes her name and begins the arduous task of redesigning her life to match her fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJyTr8Fo412a2OIfJGXTRAm4IwX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236'),
  ('844325085761667673', 'Murina', 2022, 'Drama', 'Antoneta Alamat Kusijanović, Hélène Louvart', 'Frank Graziano, Antoneta Alamat Kusijanović', 'Gracija Filipović, Danica Ćurčić, Leon Lučev, Cliff Curtis, Jonas Smulders, Nikša Butijer, Mislav Čavajda, Klara Mucci', null, 'A teenage girl decides to replace her controlling father with his wealthy foreign friend during a weekend trip to the Adriatic Sea.', 'A teenage girl decides to replace her controlling father with his wealthy foreign friend during a weekend trip to the Adriatic Sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gK51yeJpaSFjQhBZdljYYiBXBTS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838148'),
  ('171841345833681437', 'Murió hace quince años', 1954, 'Drama', 'Rafael Gil', 'Vicente Escrivá, Ramón D. Faraldo, José Antonio Giménez-Arnau', 'Rafael Rivelles, Francisco Rabal, Lyla Rocco, Gérard Tichy, Maria Piazzai, Fernando Sancho, Carmen Rodríguez, Félix de Pomés', null, 'Diego Acuña was one of the five thousand children taken to Russia during the Spanish Civil War. He was educated in the communist pedagogy and prepared for a career as an agitator that developed in France and Italy under the command of Goeritz, one of the party officials. One day he was commissioned a delicate mission: assisting in the murder of his father, because he turns out to be a major obstacle to the illegal actions of communism. To do so he moves to Spain, pretending he is bored of Soviet doctrine', 'Diego Acuña was one of the five thousand children taken to Russia during the Spanish Civil War. He was educated in the communist pedagogy and prepared for a career as an agitator that developed in France and Italy under the command of Goeritz, one of the party officials. One day he was commissioned a delicate mission: assisting in the murder of his father, because he turns out to be a major obstacle to the illegal actions of communism. To do so he moves to Spain, pretending he is bored of Soviet doctrine', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYG6LXnaYQfOjjqjinkwmDuQUYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107614'),
  ('486134724247452877', 'Murk', 2005, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jannik Johansen, Rasmus Videbæk, Emil Sparre-Ulrich', 'Anders Thomas Jensen, Jannik Johansen', 'Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Laura Drasbæk, Nicolas Bro, Lisbet Lundquist, Lærke Winther, Lotte Bergstrøm, Anne Sofie Espersen, Morten Lützhøft', null, 'The psychological thriller "Murk" tells the story of Jacob, who is investigating into the circumstances surrounding his sister''s death on her wedding night.', 'The psychological thriller "Murk" tells the story of Jacob, who is investigating into the circumstances surrounding his sister''s death on her wedding night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odeXz2KHl3rLUhPWE8tMEHosopS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15962'),
  ('1036279687722545682', 'Murmur of the Heart', 1971, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Louis Malle, Ricardo Aronovich, Rida Draïs', 'Louis Malle', 'Lea Massari, Benoît Ferreux, Marc Winocourt, Fabien Ferreux, Daniel Gélin, Michael Lonsdale, Ave Ninchi, Annie Savarin', null, 'This loosely plotted coming-of-age tale follows the life of 15-year-old Laurent Chevalier as he stumbles his way over the burgeoning swell of adolescence in 1950s France. After having his first sexual experience with a prostitute and dodging the lips of a priest, Chevalier contracts a case of scarlet fever. When the fever leaves him with a heart murmur, Chevalier is placed in a sanatorium, along with his over-attentive and adulterous mother.', 'This loosely plotted coming-of-age tale follows the life of 15-year-old Laurent Chevalier as he stumbles his way over the burgeoning swell of adolescence in 1950s France. After having his first sexual experience with a prostitute and dodging the lips of a priest, Chevalier contracts a case of scarlet fever. When the fever leaves him with a heart murmur, Chevalier is placed in a sanatorium, along with his over-attentive and adulterous mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJt4ojBYsaUDGnKqnIqGvQOLpjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42501'),
  ('1024592682542301424', 'Murmur of the Hearts', 2015, 'Drama', 'Yu Jing-pin, Sylvia Chang, Leung Ming-kai', 'Yukihiko Kageyama, Sylvia Chang', 'Isabella Leong Lok-Sze, Joseph Chang, Lawrence Ko Yu-Luen, Angelica Lee Sin-Jie, Wang Shih-sian, Alec Chia, Qu You-ning, Julian Chen', null, 'Mei falls for an underachieving boxer, and begins years of soul searching in the city, where she reunites with her estranged brother under unexpected circumstances. What was remembered and forgotten are lessons that have profound consequences.', 'Mei falls for an underachieving boxer, and begins years of soul searching in the city, where she reunites with her estranged brother under unexpected circumstances. What was remembered and forgotten are lessons that have profound consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hd8yN8FjcUDBhUNapg2JdMCxhR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332116'),
  ('686888220256692442', 'Murmur of Youth', 1997, 'Drama', 'Lin Cheng-sheng, Cheng-hui Tsai', 'So-ching Ko', 'René Liu, Jing Tseng, Chen Chao-jung, Lien Pi-tung, Vicky Wei, Li Hsiu, Grandma Pi', null, 'A rather dejected Mei-li Chen lives with her extended family in the suburbs. She drops out of college when the boy she has a crush on finds a girlfriend. Mei-li eventually ends up selling tickets in a movie theatre. A great camaraderie then builds up between the two cashiers in the small ticket booth.', 'A rather dejected Mei-li Chen lives with her extended family in the suburbs. She drops out of college when the boy she has a crush on finds a girlfriend. Mei-li eventually ends up selling tickets in a movie theatre. A great camaraderie then builds up between the two cashiers in the small ticket booth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuhDWkzgnKJW94kOY4QEGTpH0lK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125085'),
  ('237207047175569276', 'Muro: Nalet Olsun İçimdeki İnsan Sevgisine', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Zübeyr Şaşmaz, Selahattin Sancakli', 'Cüneyt Aysan, Raci Şaşmaz, Bahadır Özdener', 'Mustafa Üstündağ, Şefik Onatoğlu, Selim Erdoğan, Eray Türk, Nataliya Bondarenko, Daria Litvinova, Evrim Alasya, Demir Karahan', null, 'Muro spent years in prison for "organizing crime". After getting out of prison, Muro and Ceto return to their hometown to start the revolution from the village. Their first plan is get married, build a home, to be a model revolutionary…', 'Muro spent years in prison for "organizing crime". After getting out of prison, Muro and Ceto return to their hometown to start the revolution from the village. Their first plan is get married, build a home, to be a model revolutionary…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yb8i9Lx95ucog82JS5Nk4RK1Tz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52138'),
  ('574103343649195798', 'Murphy''s Law', 1986, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'J. Lee Thompson, Álex Phillips Jr., Steve Lazarus', 'Gail Morgan Hickman', 'Charles Bronson, Kathleen Wilhoite, Carrie Snodgress, Robert F. Lyons, Richard Romanus, Angel Tompkins, Bill Henderson, James Luisi', 'R', 'A tough police detective escapes from custody after being framed and arrested for the murder of his ex-wife, and must now find the real killer and prove his innocence.', 'A tough police detective escapes from custody after being framed and arrested for the murder of his ex-wife, and must now find the real killer and prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YqnhhLlv3ISBeIvN0zVO8cUWZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33055'),
  ('27810379315374660', 'Murphy''s Law', 2009, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Christophe Campos, Bruno Romiguière', 'Christophe Campos, Mabrouk El Mechri', 'Pio Marmaï, Omar Sy, Karim Belkhadra, Fanny Valette, Guy Lecluyse, Bruno Ricci, Jean-Michel Noirey, Dominique Pinon', null, 'After four years in jail, Elias is doing his rehabilitation in an hospital as stretcher bearer. In five hours, his parole will be completed. He will make a fresh start and forget about his past. But that would be forgetting about Murphy''s law and its string of problems.', 'After four years in jail, Elias is doing his rehabilitation in an hospital as stretcher bearer. In five hours, his parole will be completed. He will make a fresh start and forget about his past. But that would be forgetting about Murphy''s law and its string of problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBsRtiMNxI96nw3KYWSN935kQtu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52613'),
  ('452486714352862340', 'Murphy''s Romance', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Martin Ritt, Eric W. Orbom, Aldric La''Auli Porter', 'Harriet Frank Jr., Irving Ravetch', 'Sally Field, James Garner, Brian Kerwin, Corey Haim, Dennis Burkley, Georgann Johnson, Dortha Duckworth, Michael Prokopuk', 'PG-13', 'Emma, a divorced single mother seeking to start her life over, moves to a small town in Arizona. She befriends Murphy, the older local pharmacist, but things turn complicated when her ex-husband shows up.', 'Emma, a divorced single mother seeking to start her life over, moves to a small town in Arizona. She befriends Murphy, the older local pharmacist, but things turn complicated when her ex-husband shows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCl1X4Fh8LTQV283AJ5sKUanxV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34322'),
  ('1067197943824255844', 'Murphy''s War', 1971, 'Drama, War', 'Peter Yates, Douglas Slocombe, Luis Armando Roche', 'Stirling Silliphant', 'Peter O''Toole, Siân Phillips, Philippe Noiret, Horst Janson, John Hallam, Ingo Mogendorf, John Clifford, Harry Fielder', 'PG', 'Murphy is the sole survivor of his crew, that has been massacred by a German U-Boat in the closing days of World War II. He is rescued, and ends up at a forgotten mission station near the mouth of the Orinoco, and begins to plot his vengeance. He wishes to sink the U-Boat by means of any method imaginable to him, and sets about to make the courageous attempt, assisted by Louis, the administrator of the local oil company.', 'Murphy is the sole survivor of his crew, that has been massacred by a German U-Boat in the closing days of World War II. He is rescued, and ends up at a forgotten mission station near the mouth of the Orinoco, and begins to plot his vengeance. He wishes to sink the U-Boat by means of any method imaginable to him, and sets about to make the courageous attempt, assisted by Louis, the administrator of the local oil company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5m6Hq530R6uVx35GiiDqmUR70rr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35068'),
  ('867213842475537779', 'Musa', 2012, 'Drama', 'Serhat Karaaslan', 'Serhat Karaaslan', 'Aram Dildar, Serdar Orçin, Musa Karagöz', null, 'One day, director Zeki Demirkubuz stumbles upon the counter of Musa, a pirate film seller, and sees that his own films are also being sold. Demirkubuz will make an offer to Musa that can change his life.', 'One day, director Zeki Demirkubuz stumbles upon the counter of Musa, a pirate film seller, and sees that his own films are also being sold. Demirkubuz will make an offer to Musa that can change his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOts0LVgWjtOhr1Mh4X2w68P8Wp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519277'),
  ('526765990796804615', 'Musafir', 2004, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Sanjay Gupta, P. S. Vinod', 'Sanjay Gupta', 'Anil Kapoor, Sanjay Dutt, Sameera Reddy, Mahesh Manjrekar, Aditya Pancholi, Koena Mitra, Shakti Kapoor, Manoj Pahwa', null, 'Betrayed in love and debt-ridden, Lucky, a small-time criminal, is on his way to Goa for a drug deal. But his life takes a turn when he falls for a dancer, who hires him to kill her abusive husband.', 'Betrayed in love and debt-ridden, Lucky, a small-time criminal, is on his way to Goa for a drug deal. But his life takes a turn when he falls for a dancer, who hires him to kill her abusive husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51v4PPF9H2kSf3gVGDvOQSk5cZV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117356'),
  ('1049276665717176086', 'Musallat', 2007, 'Horror', 'Alper Mestçi', 'Alper Mestçi', 'Burak Özçivit, Biğkem Karavus, Kurtuluş Şakirağaoğlu, Sedat Kalkavan, Selma Kutluğ, Meral Koro, Serap Üstün, Ecem Cansu Aktay', null, 'New Turkish horror picture Musallat looks the technical end looks stronger than most. Musallat the story of a young couple haunted by mysterious forces and there looks to be a heavy possession element as well. The calm life of Suat and Nurcan is broken when they begin to be scared by terroríficas supernatural creatures. The official website is now live and includes a lengthy teaser. It does include a childbirth sequence that could leave you squirming.', 'New Turkish horror picture Musallat looks the technical end looks stronger than most. Musallat the story of a young couple haunted by mysterious forces and there looks to be a heavy possession element as well. The calm life of Suat and Nurcan is broken when they begin to be scared by terroríficas supernatural creatures. The official website is now live and includes a lengthy teaser. It does include a childbirth sequence that could leave you squirming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vswySUyQns74QCVcwcLaGNjJ27I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43640'),
  ('860511578697440961', 'Musallat 2: Lanet', 2011, 'Horror', 'Gülden Avşaroğlu, Türksoy Gölebeyi, Alper Mestçi', 'Alper Mestçi', 'Türkü Turan, Tülay Bursa, Başay Okay, Selim Gürata, Koray Şahinbaş, Zeliha Güney, Nurcan Aktas, Veysi Alışkan', null, 'Elif is a pretty young woman who grew up in a wealthy family. Everything in her life works according to plan – until she starts hearing voices, followed by strange nightmares and asthma attacks. She becomes convinced that she has fallen under some evil spell. In order to conquer the demon behind it all, she has to dig deep into her past and uncover her true origin. While doing this, she is confronted by the horrific circumstances of her birth.', 'Elif is a pretty young woman who grew up in a wealthy family. Everything in her life works according to plan – until she starts hearing voices, followed by strange nightmares and asthma attacks. She becomes convinced that she has fallen under some evil spell. In order to conquer the demon behind it all, she has to dig deep into her past and uncover her true origin. While doing this, she is confronted by the horrific circumstances of her birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kw98XvsuZOOSmrN0BQsNVqUOrVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98335'),
  ('813084229532290186', 'Muscle', 1989, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Hisayasu Satō, Kōichi Saitō, Tadami Ohara', 'Shirō Yumeno', 'Takeshi Itō, Simon Kumai, Kiyomi Itō, You Suzuki, June, Mabze, Reiki Koyama, Makoto Hirose', null, 'Ryuzaki, an editor of Muscle Magazine, which features photographs of men with sculpted bodies, becomes involved with a man named Kitami; their affair soon becomes dominated by sadomasochistic games, with a horrid result. Jump ahead one year, Ryuzaki is released from jail and goes in search of Kitami, perhaps to make amends.', 'Ryuzaki, an editor of Muscle Magazine, which features photographs of men with sculpted bodies, becomes involved with a man named Kitami; their affair soon becomes dominated by sadomasochistic games, with a horrid result. Jump ahead one year, Ryuzaki is released from jail and goes in search of Kitami, perhaps to make amends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGsIptsuk6US30W5k5W91JG6k2i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49593'),
  ('800017002400724474', 'Muscle Beach Party', 1964, 'Comedy, Music', 'William Asher, Anthony Carras, Clark L. Paylow', 'Robert Dillon', 'Frankie Avalon, Annette Funicello, Luciana Paluzzi, John Ashley, Don Rickles, Peter Turgeon, Jody McCrea, Dick Dale', 'NR', 'Local beach-goers find that their beach has been taken over by a businessman training a stable of body builders.', 'Local beach-goers find that their beach has been taken over by a businessman training a stable of body builders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loKZcf1zVMNQYvziaKBZFvTSueE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27376'),
  ('644385632287034744', 'Muscle Beach Tom', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, null, 'NR', 'Tom settles in for a day at the beach with his sweety, accidentally ruining Jerry''s day. Meanwhile, Tom''s girl is paying more attention to the bodybuilders than to Tom.', 'Tom settles in for a day at the beach with his sweety, accidentally ruining Jerry''s day. Meanwhile, Tom''s girl is paying more attention to the bodybuilders than to Tom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMR6piGodXlmPAT3fjZWXiRooIN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74098'),
  ('78313065215577144', 'Muscle Shoals', 2013, 'Documentary, History, Music', 'Greg ''Freddy'' Camalier', null, 'Gregg Allman, Bono, Clarence Carter, Jimmy Cliff, Aretha Franklin, Jesse Boyce, Donna Godchaux, Edward King', 'PG', 'In a tiny Alabama town with the curious name of Muscle Shoals, something miraculous sprang from the mud of the Tennessee River. A group of unassuming, yet incredibly talented, locals came together and spawned some of the greatest music of all time: “Mustang Sally,” “I Never Loved a Man,” “Wild Horses,” and many more. During the most incendiary periods of racial hostility, white folks and black folks came together to create music that would last for generations and gave birth to the incomparable “Muscle Shoals sound.”', 'In a tiny Alabama town with the curious name of Muscle Shoals, something miraculous sprang from the mud of the Tennessee River. A group of unassuming, yet incredibly talented, locals came together and spawned some of the greatest music of all time: “Mustang Sally,” “I Never Loved a Man,” “Wild Horses,” and many more. During the most incendiary periods of racial hostility, white folks and black folks came together to create music that would last for generations and gave birth to the incomparable “Muscle Shoals sound.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyNlrzlBvRl2ErItmiOBc8nf8sm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159151'),
  ('928451857475023103', 'Muscle Tussle', 1953, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Gladys Holland', null, 'Daffy Duck takes his girl to a beach, where a muscle-bound duck attracts the attentions of Daffy''s fickle chick. She leaves Daffy and walks off with the hunky duck. A salesman sells Daffy a bogus strength-building tonic, and Daffy takes some, thinking it has made him into a virile power-house! He challenges the muscular duck to a series of contests involving bar-bending, chain-chewing, and weight-lifting.', 'Daffy Duck takes his girl to a beach, where a muscle-bound duck attracts the attentions of Daffy''s fickle chick. She leaves Daffy and walks off with the hunky duck. A salesman sells Daffy a bogus strength-building tonic, and Daffy takes some, thinking it has made him into a virile power-house! He challenges the muscular duck to a series of contests involving bar-bending, chain-chewing, and weight-lifting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzogfaQLXTTzB8eZi9AnFHO47yU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204677'),
  ('1018152642267209671', 'Muse', 2017, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Jaume Balagueró, Fernando Sánchez-Izquierdo, Pablo Rosso', 'Jaume Balagueró, Fernando Navarro', 'Elliot Cowan, Franka Potente, Ana Ularu, Leonor Watling, Manuela Vellés, Joanne Whalley, Christopher Lloyd, Cally O''Connell', null, 'Samuel Salomon, a literature professor, has been off work for almost a year after the tragic death of his girlfriend. Samuel has been suffering from a recurring nightmare in which a woman is brutally murdered in a strange ritual. Suddenly, the same woman who appears every night in his dreams is found dead in exactly the same circumstances. Samuel sneaks into the crime scene and there he meets Rachel who has also dreamed about the murder. Together, they will do whatever they can to discover the identity of the mystery woman, entering a terrifying world controlled by the figures who have inspired artists throughout time: the Muses.', 'Samuel Salomon, a literature professor, has been off work for almost a year after the tragic death of his girlfriend. Samuel has been suffering from a recurring nightmare in which a woman is brutally murdered in a strange ritual. Suddenly, the same woman who appears every night in his dreams is found dead in exactly the same circumstances. Samuel sneaks into the crime scene and there he meets Rachel who has also dreamed about the murder. Together, they will do whatever they can to discover the identity of the mystery woman, entering a terrifying world controlled by the figures who have inspired artists throughout time: the Muses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlDFEhlBon98itV43QOPCk7r0I7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429460'),
  ('321834659913150760', 'Muse: HAARP - Live from Wembley Stadium', 2008, 'Music, Documentary', 'Tom Kirk', 'Dominic Howard, Christopher Wolstenholme, Matthew Bellamy', 'Matthew Bellamy, Chris Wolstenholme, Dominic Howard, Morgan Nicholls', null, 'Muse''s live act at Wembley Stadium, 17 June 2007.', 'Muse''s live act at Wembley Stadium, 17 June 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wEf9UnQWjoicYaodUlaILRy9Fe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25352'),
  ('120000191199966618', 'Muse: Simulation Theory', 2020, 'Music', 'Lance Drake', null, 'Matthew Bellamy, Dominic Howard, Chris Wolstenholme', null, 'Conceived and filmed at London''s O2 Arena in September 2019 the film follows a team of scientists as they investigate the source of a paranormal anomaly appearing around the world. Blurring the lines between narrative and concert film, virtual and reality, Muse''s most theatrical tour to date launches the viewer through a supernatural spectacle, questioning the world around us.', 'Conceived and filmed at London''s O2 Arena in September 2019 the film follows a team of scientists as they investigate the source of a paranormal anomaly appearing around the world. Blurring the lines between narrative and concert film, virtual and reality, Muse''s most theatrical tour to date launches the viewer through a supernatural spectacle, questioning the world around us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfvGnE8pqUrZ1rvUA5wWjDOGWMY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:731971'),
  ('112927522666070091', 'Museo', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Damián García, Alonso Ruizpalacios', 'Manuel Alcalá, Alonso Ruizpalacios', 'Gael García Bernal, Leonardo Ortizgris, Alfredo Castro, Bernardo Velasco, Leticia Brédice, Ilse Salas, Lisa Owen, Simon Russell Beale', null, 'Mexico, 1985. Juan and Wilson, two perennial Veterinary students, perpetrate an audacious heist in the National Museum of Anthropology, running away with a loot of more than hundred invaluable pieces of Mayan art, unaware of the consequences of their outrageous act.', 'Mexico, 1985. Juan and Wilson, two perennial Veterinary students, perpetrate an audacious heist in the National Museum of Anthropology, running away with a loot of more than hundred invaluable pieces of Mayan art, unaware of the consequences of their outrageous act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZ10lucxQH5ixwOoh8iYypFmwJ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477654'),
  ('741008227429490484', 'Museum', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Keishi Otomo, Hideo Yamamoto, Hirofumi Inaba', 'Izumi Takahashi, Keishi Otomo, Kiyomi Fujii', 'Shun Oguri, Machiko Ono, Shuhei Nomura, Tomomi Maruyama, Tomoko Tabata, Mikako Ichikawa, Masatô Ibu, Nao Omori', 'R', 'In Tokyo, Japan, several grotesque murders take place on rainy days. Detective Sawamura, who is in charge of the case, soon discovers that his own family is connected to the crimes.', 'In Tokyo, Japan, several grotesque murders take place on rainy days. Detective Sawamura, who is in charge of the case, soon discovers that his own family is connected to the crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eU4EJcA4w0Mo7GwA2W9GC236157.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392681'),
  ('678948939396608823', 'Museum Of Horror', 1964, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Rafael Baledón, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'José María Fernández Unsáin', 'Julio Alemán, Patricia Conde, Joaquín Cordero, Olivia Michel, Carlos López Moctezuma, David Reynoso, Emma Roldán, Sonia Infante', null, 'A mysterious killer abducts girls off the street and covers them in wax.', 'A mysterious killer abducts girls off the street and covers them in wax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrZ2fvBNr0Us2vEaux6A0oWPZ6y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140129'),
  ('708633017555473107', 'Mushi-Shi: The Movie', 2007, 'Fantasy', 'Katsuhiro Otomo, Takahide Shibanushi, Hideaki Satô', 'Sadayuki Murai, Katsuhiro Otomo', 'Joe Odagiri, Nao Omori, Yu Aoi, Makiko Esumi, Reia Moriyama, Makiko Kuno, Rô Naruse, Baku Numata', null, 'Mushi are beings in touch with the essence of life, far more basic and pure than normal living things. Most humans are incapable of perceiving Mushi and are oblivious to their existence, but there are a few who possess the ability to see and interact with Mushi. One such person is Ginko who travels from place to place to research Mushi and aid people suffering from problems caused by them.', 'Mushi are beings in touch with the essence of life, far more basic and pure than normal living things. Most humans are incapable of perceiving Mushi and are oblivious to their existence, but there are a few who possess the ability to see and interact with Mushi. One such person is Ginko who travels from place to place to research Mushi and aid people suffering from problems caused by them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydEKy39NhjgVHF4hEcEEVo7FqXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21959'),
  ('702600228875598522', 'Mushi-Shi: The Next Chapter - Drops of Bells', 2015, 'Animation, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Hiroshi Nagahama, Yoshihiko Umakoshi', 'Hiroshi Nagahama, Yuki Urushibara', 'Yuto Nakano, Tomomi Saito, Mika Doi, Gen Ogawa', null, 'On a warm summer day, a boy heard the sound of bells ringing, as if in celebration, in the mountain near his home. Several years later in that same mountain, the mushishi Ginko stumbles upon a young girl in a mountain with branches and leaves growing out of her body. He later realises that she is the lord of that mountain but finds it strange that a human like her was chosen as the lord. He meets her older brother who has continued to search for her ever since she disappeared while accompanying him on a stormy day. The story is about Ginko’s peculiar journey amidst the occult to unravel the mystery behind the enigmatic girl called Kaya and the mountain that has become her home.', 'On a warm summer day, a boy heard the sound of bells ringing, as if in celebration, in the mountain near his home. Several years later in that same mountain, the mushishi Ginko stumbles upon a young girl in a mountain with branches and leaves growing out of her body. He later realises that she is the lord of that mountain but finds it strange that a human like her was chosen as the lord. He meets her older brother who has continued to search for her ever since she disappeared while accompanying him on a stormy day. The story is about Ginko’s peculiar journey amidst the occult to unravel the mystery behind the enigmatic girl called Kaya and the mountain that has become her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Kso7vjj88y73rPFRaXB4seZxxv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312966'),
  ('332296337279051556', 'Music', 2021, 'Music, Drama', 'Jonas Spaccarotelli, Sebastian Winterø, Sia', 'Dallas Clayton, Sia', 'Kate Hudson, Leslie Odom Jr., Maddie Ziegler, Mary Kay Place, Beto Calvillo, Juliette Lewis, Kathy Najimy, Tig Notaro', 'PG-13', 'Zu, a free spirit estranged from her family, suddenly finds herself the sole guardian of her half-sister, Music, a teenager on the autism spectrum whose whole world order has been beautifully crafted by her late grandmother. The film soon challenges whether it is Zu or Music who has a better view of the world, and that love, trust, and being able to be there for each other is everything.', 'Zu, a free spirit estranged from her family, suddenly finds herself the sole guardian of her half-sister, Music, a teenager on the autism spectrum whose whole world order has been beautifully crafted by her late grandmother. The film soon challenges whether it is Zu or Music who has a better view of the world, and that love, trust, and being able to be there for each other is everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzDXq7ofNkvIovB6Vb8KZpjqkK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586101'),
  ('286918368086598329', 'Music', 2023, 'Drama', 'Yorgos Korakianitis, Dimitris Apostolou, Bohdan Graczyk', 'Angela Schanelec', 'Aliocha Schneider, Agathe Bonitzer, Marissa Triantafyllidou, Argyris Xafis, Frida Tarana, Ninel Geiger, Miriam Jakob, Wolfgang Michael', null, 'Abandoned at birth in the Greek mountains on a stormy night, Jon is taken in and adopted, without having known his father or mother. As a young man, he meets Iro, a warden in the prison where he is incarcerated after a deadly tragic accident. She seems to seek out his presence, takes care of him, records music for him. Jon’s eyesight begins to fail... From then on, for every loss he suffers, he will gain something in return. Thus, in spite of going blind, he will live his life more fully than ever.', 'Abandoned at birth in the Greek mountains on a stormy night, Jon is taken in and adopted, without having known his father or mother. As a young man, he meets Iro, a warden in the prison where he is incarcerated after a deadly tragic accident. She seems to seek out his presence, takes care of him, records music for him. Jon’s eyesight begins to fail... From then on, for every loss he suffers, he will gain something in return. Thus, in spite of going blind, he will live his life more fully than ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1umDdnIslIJZOxZ5WSbEt7aTVCF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:666942'),
  ('575002054697799556', 'Music and Lyrics', 2007, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Xavier Grobet, Marc Lawrence, H.H. Cooper', 'Marc Lawrence', 'Drew Barrymore, Hugh Grant, Brad Garrett, Haley Bennett, Brooke Tansley, Aasif Mandvi, Zak Orth, Scott Porter', 'PG-13', 'A washed-up ''80s pop star gets a chance at a comeback when reigning pop diva Cora Corman invites him to write & record a duet with her, but there''s a problem--Alex hasn''t written a song in years; he''s never written lyrics and he has to come up with a hit in a matter of days.', 'A washed-up ''80s pop star gets a chance at a comeback when reigning pop diva Cora Corman invites him to write & record a duet with her, but there''s a problem--Alex hasn''t written a song in years; he''s never written lyrics and he has to come up with a hit in a matter of days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WXVpnovC0EETbqcjVhy3hwIITK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11172'),
  ('575342470082409263', 'Music Box', 1989, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Costa-Gavras, Patrick Blossier, Jeanne Caliendo', 'Joe Eszterhas', 'Jessica Lange, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Donald Moffat, Lukas Haas, Cheryl Lynn Bruce, Mari Törőcsik, Frederic Forrest, J.S. Block', 'PG-13', 'A lawyer defends her father accused of war crimes, but there is more to the case than she suspects.', 'A lawyer defends her father accused of war crimes, but there is more to the case than she suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHumUQOIJWWx6x77fOcB2PVBu53.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2263'),
  ('733420323504001350', 'Music Box: Yacht Rock: A DOCKumentary', 2024, 'Documentary, Music', 'Garret Price', null, 'Kenny Loggins, Christopher Cross, Michael McDonald, Steve Porcaro, Steve Lukather, David Paich, Prince Paul, Brian Robert Jones', null, 'This documentary chronicles the rise, fall, and rise again of the soft rock epitomized by artists such as Christopher Cross, Michael McDonald, Kenny Loggins, Steely Dan, and Toto in the late 1970s and early 1980s. Retroactively dubbed "Yacht Rock," the easy-listening genre came to be gently mocked and even dismissed by rock lovers and critics. However, it has since reclaimed its place in music history and is celebrated in this groove-infused film.', 'This documentary chronicles the rise, fall, and rise again of the soft rock epitomized by artists such as Christopher Cross, Michael McDonald, Kenny Loggins, Steely Dan, and Toto in the late 1970s and early 1980s. Retroactively dubbed "Yacht Rock," the easy-listening genre came to be gently mocked and even dismissed by rock lovers and critics. However, it has since reclaimed its place in music history and is celebrated in this groove-infused film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijERUgUNG1SGa3nOdUjthpmn31x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1370580'),
  ('964335349567547332', 'Music by John Williams', 2024, 'Documentary, Music', 'Laurent Bouzereau, Toby Thiermann, Will Brunker', null, 'John Williams, Steven Spielberg, J.J. Abrams, Emanuel Ax, Kate Capshaw, Chris Columbus, Gustavo Dudamel, Ethan Gruska', 'PG', 'His unforgettable scores are an essential part of some of the most beloved movies of our time, over a career that spans decades. See and hear maestro John Williams'' own story, with insights from filmmakers, musicians, and others he has inspired, complete with rare behind-the-scenes looks at the making of movie history.', 'His unforgettable scores are an essential part of some of the most beloved movies of our time, over a career that spans decades. See and hear maestro John Williams'' own story, with insights from filmmakers, musicians, and others he has inspired, complete with rare behind-the-scenes looks at the making of movie history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIZ3SzuT3YuAWX1fjdxDevbwQBX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1076708'),
  ('430783891760858763', 'Music for One Apartment and Six Drummers', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Johannes Stjärne Nilsson, Ola Simonsson, Robert Blom', null, 'Johannes Björk, Anders Vestergård, Sanna Persson, Fredrik Myhr, Marcus Haraldsson Boij, Magnus Börjesson', null, 'A gang in a Volvo have staked out a flat; when its occupants leave to walk their dog, the six break into the place.', 'A gang in a Volvo have staked out a flat; when its occupants leave to walk their dog, the six break into the place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omYhO4nzC5UdwBKTSVboRA8Hpp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78274'),
  ('132470421823096112', 'Music from Another Room', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Charlie Peters, Richard Crudo', 'Charlie Peters', 'Jude Law, Jennifer Tilly, Gretchen Mol, Martha Plimpton, Brenda Blethyn, Jon Tenney, Jeremy Piven, Vincent Laresca', 'PG-13', 'Music From Another Room is a romantic comedy that follows the exploits of Danny, a young man who grew up believing he was destined to marry the girl he helped deliver as a five year old boy when his neighbor went into emergency labor. Twenty-five years later, Danny returns to his hometown and finds the irresistible Anna Swann but she finds it easy to resist him since she is already engaged to dreamboat Eric, a very practical match. In pursuit of Anna, Danny finds himself entangled with each of the eccentric Swanns including blind, sheltered Nina, cynical sister Karen, big brother Bill and dramatic mother Grace as he fights to prove that fate should never be messed with and passion should never be practical.', 'Music From Another Room is a romantic comedy that follows the exploits of Danny, a young man who grew up believing he was destined to marry the girl he helped deliver as a five year old boy when his neighbor went into emergency labor. Twenty-five years later, Danny returns to his hometown and finds the irresistible Anna Swann but she finds it easy to resist him since she is already engaged to dreamboat Eric, a very practical match. In pursuit of Anna, Danny finds himself entangled with each of the eccentric Swanns including blind, sheltered Nina, cynical sister Karen, big brother Bill and dramatic mother Grace as he fights to prove that fate should never be messed with and passion should never be practical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zamhRB4bKVeRUW568lVSFeEbqVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39424'),
  ('884951836915321927', 'Music Hole', 2021, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Bruno Degrave, Gaëtan Lekens, David Mutzenmacher', null, 'Wim Willaert, Vanessa Guide, Tom Audenaert, Mourade Zeguendi, Marijke Pinoy, Hande Kodja, Mounir Ait Hamou, Sacha Bourdo', null, 'Francis, a little accountant officiating in a shady cabaret has marital concerns with his wife. After a violent argument, he wakes up to discover a surprise. It''s the macabre and zany starting point of a burlesque thriller.', 'Francis, a little accountant officiating in a shady cabaret has marital concerns with his wife. After a violent argument, he wakes up to discover a surprise. It''s the macabre and zany starting point of a burlesque thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46WPb7gSTENhVaGg4YEVMGtwUXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:740076'),
  ('350267003325148229', 'Music in Darkness', 1948, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ingmar Bergman, Göran Strindberg', null, 'Mai Zetterling, Birger Malmsten, Olof Winnerstrand, Naima Wifstrand, Bibi Lindqvist, Hilda Borgström, Douglas Håge, Gunnar Björnstrand', null, 'A blind, upper-class pianist falls in love with a young servant.', 'A blind, upper-class pianist falls in love with a young servant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bNKxmlGVDAQYVxc2Sw0Pcdh0R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68291'),
  ('547650372324998698', 'Music in My Heart', 1940, 'Music, Romance, Comedy', 'Joseph Santley, Gene Anderson, John Stumar', 'James Edward Grant', 'Tony Martin, Rita Hayworth, Edith Fellows, Alan Mowbray, Eric Blore, George Tobias, Joseph Crehan, George Humbert', 'NR', 'A young woman engaged to a millionaire falls for the understudy in a Broadway musical.', 'A young woman engaged to a millionaire falls for the understudy in a Broadway musical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTMJIy4RgrN10xipKlPZB5CWa6B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130365'),
  ('429619034325109620', 'Music in the Air', 1934, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Joe May, Ernest Palmer, Louis De Francesco', 'Howard Irving Young, Billy Wilder', 'Gloria Swanson, John Boles, Douglass Montgomery, June Lang, Al Shean, Reginald Owen, Joseph Cawthorn, Hobart Bosworth', 'NR', 'A songwriter''s young daughter (June Lang) begins to dream of stardom when she''s offered the lead role in a new operetta.', 'A songwriter''s young daughter (June Lang) begins to dream of stardom when she''s offered the lead role in a new operetta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pB1jhghQMItqJOeE4oyF9vRzmb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96525'),
  ('606249687789494750', 'Music Land', 1935, 'Animation, Music, Romance', 'Wilfred Jackson, Graham Heid', null, null, 'NR', 'Musical instruments are the stars of a romantic fable set in the Land of Symphony and the Isle of Jazz, two islands separated by the Sea of Discord. The violin princess and the saxophone prince fall in love, but must meet secretly in order to avoid the wrath of their parents, the Symphony queen and the Jazz king. The queen finds the boy saxophone on her island, attempting to woo her daughter. She has him locked in the metronome, but the young lover manages to send a note - in fact, several musical notes on sheet music - that conveys the message that he has been imprisoned. The Isle of Jazz declares war by blasting musical notes across the sea. The only thing that can bring peace and harmony to the Sea of Discord is love.', 'Musical instruments are the stars of a romantic fable set in the Land of Symphony and the Isle of Jazz, two islands separated by the Sea of Discord. The violin princess and the saxophone prince fall in love, but must meet secretly in order to avoid the wrath of their parents, the Symphony queen and the Jazz king. The queen finds the boy saxophone on her island, attempting to woo her daughter. She has him locked in the metronome, but the young lover manages to send a note - in fact, several musical notes on sheet music - that conveys the message that he has been imprisoned. The Isle of Jazz declares war by blasting musical notes across the sea. The only thing that can bring peace and harmony to the Sea of Discord is love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7T0qb6BBpcOtg4MOuuaUrUisFP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109301'),
  ('68949108859299818', 'Music of the Heart', 1999, 'Drama, Music', 'Wes Craven, Peter Deming', 'Pamela Gray', 'Meryl Streep, Aidan Quinn, Angela Bassett, Gloria Estefan, Cloris Leachman, Josh Pais, Jane Leeves, Kieran Culkin', 'PG', 'After Roberta Guaspari separates from her husband, she receives encouragement from her mother to take up a job of a music teacher at the Central Park East School in East Harlem.', 'After Roberta Guaspari separates from her husband, she receives encouragement from her mother to take up a job of a music teacher at the Central Park East School in East Harlem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKbzT8q9b65hc1eIZxuRsLxopi7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26149'),
  ('847761205456630801', 'Music on Hold', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Hernán Goldfrid', 'Julieta Steinberg, Patricio Vega', 'Natalia Oreiro, Diego Peretti, Norma Aleandro, Carlos Bermejo, Rafael Spregelburd, Pilar Gamboa, Atilio Pozzobón, María Ucedo', null, 'Ezequiel is a film music composer that can''t find the inspiration he needs to compose a new score and Paula is a pregnant woman recently abandoned by her boyfriend whose mother has just came from Spain to meet her husband. Together they will try to solve their problems.', 'Ezequiel is a film music composer that can''t find the inspiration he needs to compose a new score and Paula is a pregnant woman recently abandoned by her boyfriend whose mother has just came from Spain to meet her husband. Together they will try to solve their problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3vdqyOMsxt9GX4DLgQuEH1f2dg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90658'),
