  ('100787399192612864', 'Music Teacher', 2018, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Sarthak Dasgupta', 'Sarthak Dasgupta', 'Manav Kaul, Divya Dutta, Neena Gupta, Amrita Bagchi, Jaspal Sharma, Niharika Lyra Dutt', null, 'Despite his ambitions to make it big, Beni is still stuck in the hills, bitter and hurt, struggling to make ends meet by teaching music and singing in clubs. Jyotsna, his estranged student and now a Bollywood singer, left the hills 8 years ago. The town is abuzz with the news of Jyotsna''s return to perform at a music concert. Beni has to come to terms with the pains of the past and the delusions of the present to deal with both, Jyotsna''s presence in the hills and in his life.', 'Despite his ambitions to make it big, Beni is still stuck in the hills, bitter and hurt, struggling to make ends meet by teaching music and singing in clubs. Jyotsna, his estranged student and now a Bollywood singer, left the hills 8 years ago. The town is abuzz with the news of Jyotsna''s return to perform at a music concert. Beni has to come to terms with the pains of the past and the delusions of the present to deal with both, Jyotsna''s presence in the hills and in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFOQP52iqVzRqEbc1kuHPjRCYBA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596178'),
  ('555039323035962091', 'Music When The Lights Go Out', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Pedro Gossler, Ismael Caneppele', 'Ismael Caneppele, Germano de Oliveira', 'Emelyn Fischer, Júlia Lemmertz', null, 'A documentary floating on this thin border between fiction and reality. An author comes to a small city in Brazil’s countryside, to turn Emelyn’s life into a fictional narrative. The more the author teases Emelyn with cameras, the more she becomes Bernard, a teenager boy divided between living the desire and continuing desiring.', 'A documentary floating on this thin border between fiction and reality. An author comes to a small city in Brazil’s countryside, to turn Emelyn’s life into a fictional narrative. The more the author teases Emelyn with cameras, the more she becomes Bernard, a teenager boy divided between living the desire and continuing desiring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJA1Nj9aSxJaH7vFQ9U6SV8RxEG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469950'),
  ('711499903031246254', 'Music Within', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Steven Sawalich, Irek Hartowicz', 'Kelly Kennemer, Bret McKinney, Mark Andrew Olsen', 'Ron Livingston, Melissa George, Michael Sheen, Marion Ross, Clint Jung, Ridge Canipe, Rebecca De Mornay, Janssen Van De Yacht', 'R', 'After a confrontation with one of his idols dashes his dreams of studying public speaking in college, Richard Pimentel joins the Army and ships off to Vietnam. During his service, Richard loses nearly all of his hearing. Joining a new circle of friends, including a man with cerebral palsy and an alcoholic war veteran, Richard discovers his gift for motivational speaking and becomes an advocate for people with disabilities.', 'After a confrontation with one of his idols dashes his dreams of studying public speaking in college, Richard Pimentel joins the Army and ships off to Vietnam. During his service, Richard loses nearly all of his hearing. Joining a new circle of friends, including a man with cerebral palsy and an alcoholic war veteran, Richard discovers his gift for motivational speaking and becomes an advocate for people with disabilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KwG84rESQbWjnY3nuQ7vVleC6Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14820'),
  ('667800607428897459', 'Música', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Rudy Mancuso, Shane Hurlbut', 'Dan Lagana, Rudy Mancuso', 'Rudy Mancuso, Camila Mendes, Francesca Reale, Maria Mancuso, JB Smoove, Andy Grotelueschen, Camila Senna, Regina Schneider', 'PG-13', 'A young man, plagued by the music in his head, has to come to terms with an uncertain future while balancing love, family and Brazilian culture in Newark, New Jersey.', 'A young man, plagued by the music in his head, has to come to terms with an uncertain future while balancing love, family and Brazilian culture in Newark, New Jersey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUX5ourGUJDG0yvEeS3uooZS0dS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:968441'),
  ('653970803862958675', 'Música de Viento', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Gómez Bolaños', 'Roberto Gómez Bolaños', 'Roberto Gómez Bolaños, Florinda Meza García, Juan Peláez, Arturo Alegro, Patricio Castillo, Bruno Rey, Miguel Suárez, Ramiro Orci', null, 'Mr. Quevedo is a public relationist in a real estate company managed by Mr. Cepeda. Mr. Cepeda has become rich through fraudulent practices. Mr. Martinez is a client who was victimized by Mr. Cepeda; thus he appears one day at the real estate office looking for Mr. Cepeda but instead he found Mr. Quevedo and appoints him with a gun, Mr. Quevedo farts unintentionally due to the menacing situation. Mr. Quevedo teaches the audience to bravely act according to the own values. —Elizabeth Kahl', 'Mr. Quevedo is a public relationist in a real estate company managed by Mr. Cepeda. Mr. Cepeda has become rich through fraudulent practices. Mr. Martinez is a client who was victimized by Mr. Cepeda; thus he appears one day at the real estate office looking for Mr. Cepeda but instead he found Mr. Quevedo and appoints him with a gun, Mr. Quevedo farts unintentionally due to the menacing situation. Mr. Quevedo teaches the audience to bravely act according to the own values. —Elizabeth Kahl', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6DkwWr8UJOCDBpEZjwe17KKqby.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306942'),
  ('953215152659326130', 'Musical Chairs', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marie Belhomme, Jennifer Peyrot, François Drouot', 'Michel Leclerc, Marie Belhomme', 'Isabelle Carré, Carmen Maura, Philippe Rebbot, Nina Meurisse, Laurent Quere, Camille Loubens, Arnaud Duléry, Antoine Linguinou', null, 'Perrine, a single, slightly awkward musician, loves birthday parties. One day she accidentally causes a man to fall into a skip at the waste disposal centre. When she learns that he´s in a coma, the young woman tries everything to awaken himand starts to meddle in his life.', 'Perrine, a single, slightly awkward musician, loves birthday parties. One day she accidentally causes a man to fall into a skip at the waste disposal centre. When she learns that he´s in a coma, the young woman tries everything to awaken himand starts to meddle in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MniJ9MUbJxN9l8YgySH1H7JPtr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345259'),
