  ('704939081540504747', 'Muslum', 2018, 'Drama, Music', 'Martin Szecsanov, Doğuş Özel, Ketche', 'Gürhan Özçiftçi, Hakan Günday', 'Timuçin Esen, Zerrin Tekindor, Ayça Bingöl, Erkan Can, Taner Ölmez, Erkan Avcı, Şahin Kendirci, Turgut Tunçalp', null, 'A biopic about the Turkish vocal artist Müslüm Gürses. Born into a poor household, Muslum found his redemption in music from the initial trauma that lingered over his musical and personal life as internalizing the grief. He rose through his ashes of shattered dreams like a phoenix. He walked in darkness, sang songs filled with sorrow which stirred people''s souls and created a cult following. They were calling him "Baba" (The Father).', 'A biopic about the Turkish vocal artist Müslüm Gürses. Born into a poor household, Muslum found his redemption in music from the initial trauma that lingered over his musical and personal life as internalizing the grief. He rose through his ashes of shattered dreams like a phoenix. He walked in darkness, sang songs filled with sorrow which stirred people''s souls and created a cult following. They were calling him "Baba" (The Father).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbY2IlnNk85MqaPWgPZyJUD4vnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528372'),
  ('713013465980651117', 'Mussum, o Filmis', 2023, 'Drama, History, Comedy', 'Nonato Estrela, Sílvio Guindane', 'Paulo Cursino', 'Aílton Graça, Cacau Protásio, Thawan Lucas, Yuri Marçal, Neusa Borges, Gero Camilo, Késia Estácio, Jeniffer Dias', null, 'The trajectory of Antônio Carlos Bernardes Gomes, known as Mussum, from Trapalhões. His poor childhood, his military career, his relationship with Mangueira and his success with the group Originais do Samba, as well as behind the scenes as a member of Trapalhões.', 'The trajectory of Antônio Carlos Bernardes Gomes, known as Mussum, from Trapalhões. His poor childhood, his military career, his relationship with Mangueira and his success with the group Originais do Samba, as well as behind the scenes as a member of Trapalhões.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olETegpIsLwrApT1ldOKIwFE8lY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937949'),
  ('909576735305502459', 'Mussum: Um Filme do Cacildis', 2019, 'Documentary, Music', 'Susanna Lira', 'Bruno Passeri', 'Lázaro Ramos, Mussum, Dedé Santana, Renato Aragão, Zacarias, Joel Zito Araújo, Milton Gonçalves, Jorge Coutinho', null, 'The trajectory of musician and comedian Mussum as vocalist of the group "Os Originais do Samba" and later in cinema and TV as a member of "Os Trapalhões", a group that revolutionized the way of making humor on Brazilian television.', 'The trajectory of musician and comedian Mussum as vocalist of the group "Os Originais do Samba" and later in cinema and TV as a member of "Os Trapalhões", a group that revolutionized the way of making humor on Brazilian television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSRHkac1lXWQeuMewvaZEhgEzWw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565955'),
