  ('29711010247524039', 'Must Love Dogs', 2005, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Gary David Goldberg, John Bailey', 'Gary David Goldberg', 'Diane Lane, John Cusack, Elizabeth Perkins, Christopher Plummer, Dermot Mulroney, Stockard Channing, Ali Hillis, Brad William Henke', 'PG-13', 'Sarah Nolan is a newly divorced woman cautiously rediscovering romance with the enthusiastic but often misguided help of her well-meaning family. As she braves a series of hilarious disastrous mismatches and first dates, Sarah begins to trust her own instincts again and learns that, no matter what, it''s never a good idea to give up on love.', 'Sarah Nolan is a newly divorced woman cautiously rediscovering romance with the enthusiastic but often misguided help of her well-meaning family. As she braves a series of hilarious disastrous mismatches and first dates, Sarah begins to trust her own instincts again and learns that, no matter what, it''s never a good idea to give up on love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/252PdRj3y2S05DC4oSf2qk2vva3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11648'),
